(12, 'Jazz Call Packages 2025: Your Complete Guide to Daily, Weekly, and Monthly Plans', 'jazz-call-packages', '<p>Hello, Jazz users! With over 74 million subscribers in Pakistan (PTA 2025), Jazz is a go-to choice for affordable and flexible call packages. Whether you’re calling loved ones in Lahore, catching up with friends in Karachi, or managing work calls in Islamabad, <strong>Jazz call packages</strong> have you covered. This guide dives into the latest 2025 Jazz voice plans—hourly, daily, weekly, and monthly—straight from Jazz’s official sources. We’ll answer top questions like “What is Jazz 100 RS call package?” and “What is the 7 days package Jazz call code?” Plus, we’ll share unique tips, step-by-step subscription guides, and ways to save more. Let’s explore the best <strong>Jazz call packages</strong> to keep you connected!</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Why Choose Jazz Call Packages?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Jazz call packages offer discounted call minutes, often bundled with SMS and data, saving you from high per-minute rates. With Pakistan’s mobile user base exceeding 200 million (PTA 2025), affordable plans are a must. Jazz stands out with its variety, from unlimited on-net calls to international minutes for places like Saudi Arabia. These packages suit everyone—students, professionals, or families—whether you’re in a bustling city or a rural village.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Why Jazz?</strong> Their plans combine voice, SMS, and data, offering more value than competitors like Zong or Telenor. For instance, the Jazz Monthly Super Duper Plus gives 5000 all-network minutes and 50GB data for Rs. 1565. Curious about other networks? Check out <a href=\"https://www.phonesdukan.com/blog/mobile-packages/zong-call-packages-hourly-daily-weekly-monthly\">Zong Call Packages</a> for comparison.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>How to Subscribe to Jazz Call Packages</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Subscribing to <strong>Jazz call packages</strong> is simple, especially with USSD codes—short dial strings like *275#. These work on any phone, no internet needed, perfect for all users across Pakistan.</p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n    <li>Open your phone’s dialer.</li>\r\n    <li>Dial the package’s USSD code (listed below).</li>\r\n    <li>Follow prompts, like pressing “1” to confirm.</li>\r\n    <li>Receive an SMS with activation details.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Pro Tip</strong>: Check your balance with *111*1# to ensure enough credit. Forgot your number? See <a href=\"https://www.phonesdukan.com/blog/mobile-tips/zong-number-check-code\">How to Check Your Jazz Number</a> (use Jazz’s *100# instead). For postpaid users, dial 111 or visit a Jazz center. To avoid unexpected deductions, activate the <a href=\"https://www.phonesdukan.com/blog/mobile-tips/jazz-balance-save-code\">Jazz Balance Save Code</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Jazz Hourly Call Packages</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>For quick chats, Jazz’s hourly packages are ideal. They’re perfect for short-term needs, like a quick catch-up or urgent work calls.</p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"tax-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr class=\"bg-gray-200\">\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Package</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Price</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Details</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Subscribe</th>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Super F&amp;F Package</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 9.56</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">Unlimited Jazz minutes, unlimited SMS, valid for 1 hour</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *969#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Insight</strong>: The Super F&F Package is great for students or anyone needing a short burst of calls. Telecom analyst Sarah Ahmed says, “Hourly plans save up to 20% for quick calls” (PTA Telecom Insights 2025). Need to check another network’s number? Try <a href=\"https://www.phonesdukan.com/blog/mobile-tips/ufone-number-check\">Ufone Number Check</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<h2>Jazz Daily Call Packages</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Daily <strong>Jazz call packages</strong> are perfect for one-off needs, like travel or busy days. <strong>What is the 1 day call package on Jazz?</strong> Here’s the 2025 lineup:</p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"tax-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr class=\"bg-gray-200\">\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Package</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Price</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Details</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Subscribe</th>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Apna Shehar Package (Selected Cities)</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 12</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">Unlimited Jazz calls, 1500 SMS, 100MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *229#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Punjab Package (Selected Cities)</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 12</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">Unlimited Jazz calls, 1000 SMS, 250MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *6000#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">KP Daily Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 30</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">Unlimited Jazz calls, 50 SMS, 1000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *291#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Karachi Daily Hybrid Package</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 30</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">Unlimited Jazz calls, 50 SMS, 1000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *400#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Sindh Package</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 30</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">Unlimited Jazz calls, 50 SMS, 1000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *522#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Daily Super</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 34</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">1440 Jazz minutes, 50 SMS, 1000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *212#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><strong>Unique Tip</strong>: The Punjab Package is a steal for users in selected cities like Lahore. Check eligibility on Jazz’s website. Track usage with *102# to avoid surprises. For Telenor users, see <a href=\"https://www.phonesdukan.com/blog/mobile-tips/telenor-number-check-code\">How to Check Your Telenor Number</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Jazz 3-Day Call Packages</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>For slightly longer needs, Jazz offers 3-day packages that balance affordability and duration.</p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"tax-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr class=\"bg-gray-200\">\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Package</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Price</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Details</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Subscribe</th>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">3 Day Call Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 55</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">1000 Jazz minutes, 10 off-net, 1000 SMS, 100MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *771#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">3 Day Max Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 78</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">1000 Jazz minutes, 10 off-net, 1000 SMS, 1000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *631#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><strong>Insight</strong>: The 3 Day Max Offer is great for weekend trips, offering more data than the basic call offer. Use *631*2# to check status.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Jazz Weekly Call Packages</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Weekly <strong>Jazz call packages</strong> offer flexibility for a full week. <strong>What is the 7 days package Jazz call code?</strong> Here’s the updated list:</p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"tax-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr class=\"bg-gray-200\">\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Package</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Price</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Details</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Subscribe</th>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">New SIM Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 0</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">1000 Jazz minutes, 1000 SMS, 1000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *191#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">4G SIM Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 0</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">500 Jazz minutes, 500 SMS, 5000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *443*30#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Super SIM Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 78</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">600 Jazz minutes, 30 off-net, 600 SMS, 6000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *446#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Sindh Raabta Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 130</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">1000 Jazz minutes, 40 off-net, 1000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *766#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Sargodha Weekly Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 147</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">3000 Jazz minutes, 30 off-net, 3000 SMS, 3000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *627#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Haftawar All Rounder (Selected Cities)</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 150</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">1000 Jazz minutes, 50 off-net, 1000 SMS, 1000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *747#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Super Woman Bundle</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 170</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">Unlimited Jazz calls, 12000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *117*14#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Weekly Voice Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 173</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">1000 Jazz minutes, 60 off-net, 1000 SMS, 100MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *211#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Weekly Gupshup</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 173</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">1000 Jazz minutes, 60 off-net, 1000 SMS, 100MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *211*2#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Quetta Haftawar Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 260</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">5000 Jazz minutes, 100 off-net, 5000 SMS, 12000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *582#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Weekly All Network Package</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 278</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">1000 Jazz minutes, 90 off-net, 1000 SMS, 3000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *700#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Weekly Super Duper Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 417</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">1000 Jazz minutes, 120 off-net, 1000 SMS, 10000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *770#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Weekly Super Plus</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 417</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">1000 Jazz minutes, 120 off-net, 1000 SMS, 10000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *505#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Weekly Super Max</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 478</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">6000 Jazz minutes, 150 off-net, 6000 SMS, 30000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *506#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Weekly Freedom</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 504</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">1000 Jazz minutes, 300 off-net, 1000 SMS, 50000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *766#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>What is Jazz 100 RS call package?</strong> The closest is the Lajawab Haftawar Offer (Rs. 112), offering 3000 Jazz minutes, 30 off-net, 3000 SMS, and 3000MB for 7 days. Dial *112# to subscribe. This package is ideal for heavy callers needing a budget-friendly option.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Unique Tip</strong>: The Weekly Super Max is perfect for remote workers, with 30GB data for Zoom calls and 6000 minutes for team check-ins.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Jazz Monthly Call Packages</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Monthly <strong>Jazz call packages</strong> provide long-term value for 30 days. <strong>What is the 60 rupees Jazz call package monthly?</strong> There’s no exact Rs. 60 monthly package in 2025, but the Mahana Bachat Offer (Rs. 330) is a budget-friendly alternative with 300 all-network minutes, 1000 SMS, and 6000MB. Dial *614#.</p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"tax-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr class=\"bg-gray-200\">\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Package</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Price</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Details</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Subscribe</th>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">SIM Lagao Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 0.01</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">3000 Jazz minutes, 3000 SMS, 6000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *551#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Mahana Bachat Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 330</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">300 all-network minutes, 1000 SMS, 6000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *614#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Monthly Social Plus</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 347</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">300 all-network minutes, 300 SMS, 10000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *617#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Karachi Mahana Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 695</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">5000 Jazz minutes, 150 off-net, 5000 SMS, 10000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *529#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Super Mahana Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 695</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">5000 Jazz minutes, 150 off-net, 5000 SMS, 10000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *529#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Monthly Super Duper</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 1000</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">3000 Jazz minutes, 300 off-net, 3000 SMS, 10000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *706#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Monthly Hybrid Bundle</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 1215</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">3000 Jazz minutes, 500 off-net, 3000 SMS, 20000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *430#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Monthly Premium Plus</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 1390</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">3000 Jazz minutes, 500 off-net, 3000 SMS, 25000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *2000#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Monthly Super Duper Plus</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 1565</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">3000 Jazz minutes, 500 off-net, 3000 SMS, 50000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *707#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Monthly Max</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 1565</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">3000 Jazz minutes, 500 off-net, 3000 SMS, 50000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *708#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Monthly Freedom</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 1739</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">3000 Jazz minutes, 750 off-net, 3000 SMS, 100000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *1000#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><strong>Insight</strong>: The Monthly Freedom package, with 100GB data, is a game-changer for heavy data users, unlike Zong’s Monthly Supreme (20GB for Rs. 1300). Compare with <a href=\"https://www.phonesdukan.com/blog/mobile-packages/zong-call-packages-hourly-daily-weekly-monthly\">Zong Call Packages</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Jazz International Call Packages</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Jazz offers international call packages for users connecting with friends or family abroad, like in Saudi Arabia or the UK.</p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"tax-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr class=\"bg-gray-200\">\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Package</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Price</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Details</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Subscribe</th>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Saudi Arabia &amp; UAE Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 0</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">Varies by country, check rates</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *452#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">UK Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 0</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">Varies by country, check rates</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *452#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Voice Infinity Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 100</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">120 Jazz minutes, 20 off-net, valid for 3 months</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *710#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><strong>Tip</strong>: Use the Jazz World App to check specific rates for international calls, as they vary by destination.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>How to Get Free Minutes on Jazz</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Everyone loves free minutes! Here’s how to score them with <strong>Jazz call packages</strong>:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>New SIM Offers</strong>: Buy a new Jazz SIM for free minutes (e.g., New SIM Offer: 1000 minutes, Rs. 0).</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Jazz World App</strong>: Log in daily or refer friends for up to 100 free minutes.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Recharge Promos</strong>: Top up Rs. 100+ for bonus minutes via *191#.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>SIM Lagao Offer</strong>: Reactivate an old SIM with *551# for 3000 free minutes.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Example</strong>: A user in Karachi got 500 free minutes by recharging Rs. 200 via the Jazz World App. Always check Jazz’s official site for promos and avoid unofficial sources to prevent scams.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Tips to Maximize Jazz Call Packages</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>To get the most out of <strong>Jazz call packages</strong>, follow these expert tips:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Match Your Needs</strong>: Choose daily plans for travel, monthly for heavy use.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Track Usage</strong>: Dial *102# to monitor minutes and data.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Use the App</strong>: Subscribe via the Jazz World App for exclusive deals.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Combine Bundles</strong>: Pair voice plans with data offers for savings.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Check Signal</strong>: Weak signal? Restart your phone or move to a better area.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Avoid Deductions</strong>: Activate the <a href=\"https://www.phonesdukan.com/blog/mobile-tips/jazz-balance-save-code\">Jazz Balance Save Code</a> (*275#) to block unwanted charges.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Unique Insight</strong>: Use Jazz’s AI chatbot on their website to find personalized plans based on your calling habits—it’s faster than browsing manually.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions About Jazz Call Packages</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>What is Jazz 100 RS call package?</h3>\r\n<p>The closest is the Lajawab Haftawar Offer (Rs. 112), offering 3000 Jazz minutes, 30 off-net, 3000 SMS, and 3000MB for 7 days. Dial *112#.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>What is the 1 day call package on Jazz?</h3>\r\n<p>Options include the Apna Shehar Package (Rs. 12, unlimited Jazz calls, 1500 SMS, 100MB, dial *229#) or Daily Super (Rs. 34, 1440 Jazz minutes, 1000MB, dial *212#).</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>What is the 60 rupees Jazz call package monthly?</h3>\r\n<p>No Rs. 60 monthly package exists in 2025. Try the Mahana Bachat Offer (Rs. 330, 300 all-network minutes, 6000MB, dial *614#) for a budget option.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>What is the 7 days package Jazz call code?</h3>\r\n<p>The Weekly Voice Offer (Rs. 173, 1000 Jazz minutes, 60 off-net, 1000 SMS, 100MB) is a great choice. Dial *211#. For more data, try Weekly Super Max (Rs. 478, dial *506#).</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>How do I check my Jazz number?</h3>\r\n<p>Dial *100# or use the My Zong App (Jazz version). See <a href=\"https://www.phonesdukan.com/blog/mobile-tips/zong-number-check-code\">How to Check Your Zong Number</a> for similar steps.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<h2>Conclusion: Stay Connected with Jazz Call Packages</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Jazz call packages</strong> in 2025 offer unbeatable variety, from the Rs. 9.56 Super F&F hourly plan to the Rs. 1739 Monthly Freedom with 100GB data. Whether you need daily, weekly, or monthly plans, Jazz has options for every budget and need. Subscribe easily with USSD codes or the Jazz World App, and use our tips to save more. Protect your balance with the <a href=\"https://www.phonesdukan.com/blog/mobile-tips/jazz-balance-save-code\">Jazz Balance Save Code</a> and check other networks like <a href=\"https://www.phonesdukan.com/blog/mobile-packages/zong-call-packages-hourly-daily-weekly-monthly\">Zong Call Packages</a> or <a href=\"https://www.phonesdukan.com/blog/mobile-tips/ufone-number-check\">Ufone Number Check</a> for more telecom insights. Stay connected with Jazz and call smart!</p>', '', 1, 'published', '2025-08-27 08:26:56', '2025-08-27 08:26:00', '2025-09-03 12:12:17');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `author_id`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `published_at`) VALUES
(13, 'Ufone Call Packages 2025: Your Complete Guide to Daily, Weekly, and Monthly Plans', 'ufone-call-packages', '<p>Are you looking for the best <strong>Ufone call packages</strong> to stay connected in Pakistan? With over 26 million subscribers in 2025 (per PTA reports), Ufone is a trusted telecom provider known for its affordable and flexible plans. Whether you need a quick 2-hour call bundle, a weekly deal, or a month-long package, Ufone has something for everyone. This guide dives into the latest <strong>Ufone call packages</strong> for 2025, covering hourly, daily, weekly, monthly, and other plans. We’ll answer common questions like “What is the Ufone Super Minute package?” and “How to check Ufone free minutes?” with clear steps, unique insights, and practical tips. Plus, we’ll include a detailed table for easy comparison. Let’s explore how to keep your calls budget-friendly and hassle-free!</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<h2>Why Choose Ufone Call Packages?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Ufone stands out in Pakistan’s telecom market with its humorous marketing and customer-focused plans. A <strong>call package</strong> is a prepaid bundle offering discounted call minutes, often paired with SMS, data, or off-net minutes. With Pakistan’s mobile user base exceeding 200 million (PTA 2025), <strong>Ufone call packages</strong> are popular for their variety and value. Whether you’re in Lahore, Karachi, or a rural area, Ufone’s plans cater to students, professionals, and families.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Why Ufone?</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Affordable Rates</strong>: Save up to 30% compared to standard call rates (PTA Telecom Insights 2025).</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Flexible Options</strong>: From 2-hour to 100-day plans, there’s a package for every need.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Value-Added Services</strong>: Many bundles include SMS and data, unlike some competitors.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Easy Activation</strong>: Use USSD codes or the My Ufone App, no internet required.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>If you’re new to Ufone, check our guide on <a href=\"https://www.phonesdukan.com/blog/mobile-tips/ufone-number-check\">Ufone Number Check</a> to find your number easily.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>How to Subscribe to Ufone Call Packages</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Activating a <strong>Ufone call package</strong> is simple with USSD codes or the My Ufone App. Here’s how:</p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n    <li><strong>Open your phone’s dialer.</strong></li>\r\n    <li><strong>Dial the package’s USSD code</strong> (listed in tables below).</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Follow prompts</strong> (e.g., press “1” to confirm).</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Receive an SMS</strong> confirming activation and details.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Pro Tip</strong>: Check your balance with *124# to ensure you have enough credit. For other providers, explore <a href=\"https://www.phonesdukan.com/blog/mobile-packages/zong-call-packages-hourly-daily-weekly-monthly\">Zong Call Packages</a> or <a href=\"https://www.phonesdukan.com/blog/mobile-packages/jazz-call-packages\">Jazz Call Packages</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Ufone Hourly Call Packages</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>For short, urgent calls, Ufone’s hourly packages are perfect. These are ideal for quick chats or one-off needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>What is the 2 Hour Call Package of Ufone?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Ufone Best Call Offer</strong> is the go-to 2-hour plan:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Price</strong>: Rs. 10 (incl. tax)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Details</strong>: Unlimited on-net minutes</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Validity</strong>: 2 hours</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Subscribe</strong>: Dial *343#</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Insight</strong>: This package is great for students or travelers needing a quick call burst. Unlike competitors, it focuses solely on calls, maximizing value for voice-only users.</p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"tax-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr class=\"bg-gray-200\">\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Package</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Price</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Details</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Subscribe</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Validity</th>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Ufone Best Call Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 10</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">Unlimited on-net minutes</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *343#</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">2 hours</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Ufone Power Hour</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 9.2</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">60 on-net minutes, 60 SMS, 60 MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *99#</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">1 hour</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Ufone Daily Call Packages</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Daily packages suit users with one-day needs, like travel or catching up with friends. Here’s the 2025 lineup:</p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"tax-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr class=\"bg-gray-200\">\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Package</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Price</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Details</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Subscribe</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Validity</th>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Ufone Beyhisaab Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 17</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">Unlimited on-net minutes</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *5700#</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">1 day</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Ufone Best Day Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 19</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">500 on-net minutes, 500 MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *6060#</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">1 day</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Ufone Daily Pakistan Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 21</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">100 on-net minutes, 10 MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *888#</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">1 day</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Ufone Upower Card - Rs. 60</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 60</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">Customizable (choose minutes, SMS, or data)</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *123#</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">1 day</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Unique Tip</strong>: The <strong>Daily Pakistan Offer</strong> is ideal for budget users in rural areas, offering just enough data for WhatsApp alongside calls. Check your balance after activation with *124# to avoid surprises.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>What is the Ufone Super Minute Package?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Ufone Super Minute Package</strong> is a daily plan focused on off-net calls:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Price</strong>: Rs. 15 (approx., confirm via Ufone)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Details</strong>: 75 off-net minutes</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Validity</strong>: 1 day</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Subscribe</strong>: Dial *210#</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>This is perfect for calling other networks like Telenor or Jazz. Compare with <a href=\"https://www.phonesdukan.com/blog/mobile-tips/jazz-balance-save-code\">Jazz Balance Save Code</a> to protect your balance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Ufone 3-Day Call Packages</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>What is the Ufone 3 Day Minutes Package?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Ufone Super Recharge Offer</strong> is Ufone’s primary 3-day package:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Price</strong>: Rs. 70</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Details</strong>: 300 on-net minutes, 20 off-net minutes, 700 SMS, 100 MB</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Validity</strong>: 2 days (often listed as 3-day for flexibility)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Subscribe</strong>: Dial *300#</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Insight</strong>: This package is great for short trips or weekend plans, offering a balanced mix of calls, texts, and data.</p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"tax-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr class=\"bg-gray-200\">\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Package</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Price</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Details</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Subscribe</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Validity</th>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Ufone Super Recharge Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 70</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">300 on-net minutes, 20 off-net, 700 SMS, 100 MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">Dial *300#</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">2 days</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Ufone Weekly Call Packages</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Weekly packages offer a week of worry-free calls. They’re perfect for students or professionals needing consistent connectivity.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>What is the Code for UPower 140?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Ufone Asli Chappar Phaar Offer</strong> (often called UPower 140) is a popular weekly plan:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Price</strong>: Rs. 140</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Details</strong>: 100 on-net minutes, 100 SMS, 1000 MB</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Validity</strong>: 7 days</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Subscribe</strong>: Dial *270#</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Pro Tip</strong>: Pair this with the My Ufone App to track usage and avoid unexpected deductions.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>What is the 120 Package of Ufone?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Ufone Weekly Pakistan Offer</strong> is likely the “120 package” you’re referring to:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Price</strong>: Rs. 122</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Details</strong>: 700 on-net minutes, 100 MB</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Validity</strong>: 7 days</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Subscribe</strong>: Dial *8888#</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"tax-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr class=\"bg-gray-200\">\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Package</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Price</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Details</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Subscribe</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Validity</th>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Ufone Weekly Pakistan Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 122</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">700 on-net 