al</strong>: Weak signal? Restart your phone or move to a better area.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Expert Quote</strong>: “Ufone’s call packages save users up to 25% on communication costs compared to standard rates,” says telecom analyst Sarah Ahmed (PTA Telecom Report 2025).</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Comprehensive Ufone Call Packages Table</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Here’s a detailed table summarizing all <strong>Ufone call packages</strong> for 2025:</p>\r\n<table class=\"tax-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr class=\"bg-gray-200\">\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Package</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Price</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">On-Net Minutes</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Off-Net Minutes</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">SMS</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">MBs</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Validity</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Subscribe</th>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Ufone Best Call Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 10</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"On-Net Minutes\">Unlimited</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Off-Net Minutes\">--</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"SMS\">--</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"MBs\">--</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">2 hours</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">*343#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Ufone Power Hour</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 9.2</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"On-Net Minutes\">60</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border p