data-label=\"On-Net Minutes\">100</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Off-Net Minutes\">--</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"SMS\">--</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"MBs\">10</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">1 day</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">*888#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <!-- Continue the same structure for the rest of your rows -->\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n\r\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions About Ufone Call Packages</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>What is the call package of Ufone?</h3>\r\n<p>Ufone offers a range of call packages, from the <strong>Best Call Offer</strong> (Rs. 10, 2 hours) to the <strong>Super Card Gold</strong> (Rs. 1500, 30 days). See the table above for details.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>What is the 2 hour call package of Ufone?</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Ufone Best Call Offer</strong> provides unlimited on-net minutes for Rs. 10, valid for 2 hours. Dial *343# to subscribe.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>What is the Ufone Super Minute package?</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Super Minute Package</strong> offers 75 off-net minutes for Rs. 15 (approx.), valid for 1 day. Dial *210# to activate.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>What is the 100 days offer of Ufone?</h3>\r\n<p>Ufone doesn’t have a specific 100-day offer. The <strong>Super Card Grand</strong> (Rs. 1050, 30 days) is the closest long-term plan with 6000 on-net minutes and more.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>What is the 120 package of Ufone?</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Weekly Pakistan Offer</strong> (Rs. 122) offers 700 on-net minutes and 100 MB for 7 days. Dial *8888#.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>What is the code for UPower 140?</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Asli Chappar Phaar Offer</strong> (UPower 140) costs Rs. 140 and includes 100 on-net minutes, 100 SMS, and 1000 MB for 7 days. Dial *270#.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>How to check Ufone free minutes?</h3>\r\n<p>Dial *707# or use the My Ufone App to check remaining minutes, SMS, and data.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>What is the Ufone 3 day minutes package?</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Super Recharge Offer</strong> (Rs. 70) provides 300 on-net minutes, 20 off-net, 700 SMS, and 100 MB for 2 days. Dial *300#.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Conclusion: Stay Connected with Ufone Call Packages</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Ufone call packages in 2025 offer unbeatable variety, from the <strong>Best Call Offer</strong> for quick chats to the <strong>Super Card Gold</strong> for heavy users. With easy activation via USSD codes or the My Ufone App, you can stay connected across Pakistan without breaking the bank. Use our tips to track usage and save more. Need your number? Check <a href=\"https://www.phonesdukan.com/blog/mobile-tips/ufone-number-check\">Ufone Number Check</a>. For other networks, explore <a href=\"https://www.phonesdukan.com/blog/mobile-packages/jazz-call-packages\">Jazz Call Packages</a> or <a href=\"https://www.phonesdukan.com/blog/mobile-packages/zong-call-packages-hourly-daily-weekly-monthly\">Zong Call Packages</a>. Stay smart and connected with Ufone!</p>', '', 1, 'published', '2025-08-27 14:29:57', '2025-08-27 14:29:00', '2025-09-03 12:13:11');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `author_id`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `published_at`) VALUES
(14, 'Telenor Call Packages 2025: Your Ultimate Guide to Daily, Weekly, Monthly, and More', 'telenor-call-packages', '<p>Hello, Telenor users! With over 46 million subscribers in Pakistan (PTA 2025), Telenor is a trusted name for affordable and flexible call packages. Whether you’re chatting with friends in Karachi, managing work calls in Islamabad, or connecting with family in rural areas, Telenor call packages offer something for everyone. This guide dives into the latest 2025 Telenor call packages—hourly, daily, weekly, monthly, and beyond. We’ll answer burning questions like “What is the Telenor *345*20 package?” and “What is the Telenor 25 rupees package?” with clear steps, unique tips, and a comprehensive table. Plus, we’ll go beyond competitors by adding practical examples, expert insights, and savings hacks to help you stay connected smartly. Let’s get started!</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Why Choose Telenor Call Packages?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Telenor call packages are prepaid bundles that give you discounted call minutes, often with bonuses like SMS and data. With Pakistan’s mobile user base exceeding 200 million (PTA 2025), these packages save you from high per-minute rates. Whether you’re a student needing quick calls, a professional managing work, or a family staying connected, Telenor’s variety stands out.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Why Telenor?</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Affordable Rates</strong>: Save up to 25% compared to standard rates (PTA Telecom Insights 2025).</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Flexible Plans</strong>: From 1-hour bursts to 30-day bundles, there’s a fit for every need.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Value-Added Perks</strong>: Many plans include SMS and data, unlike some competitors.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Nationwide Reach</strong>: Works seamlessly in cities like Lahore or remote areas like Skardu.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Curious about other networks? Check out <a href=\"https://www.phonesdukan.com/blog/mobile-packages/ufone-call-packages\">Ufone Call Packages</a> or <a href=\"https://www.phonesdukan.com/blog/mobile-packages/jazz-call-packages\">Jazz Call Packages</a> for comparisons. Need your Telenor number? Learn how with <a href=\"https://www.phonesdukan.com/blog/mobile-tips/telenor-number-check-code\">How to Check Your Telenor Number</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>How to Subscribe to Telenor Call Packages</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Subscribing to Telenor call packages is a breeze with USSD codes or the My Telenor App. Here’s the step-by-step process:</p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n    <li>Open your phone’s dialer.</li>\r\n    <li>Dial the package’s USSD code (listed in tables below).</li>\r\n    <li>Follow prompts (e.g., press “1” to confirm).</li>\r\n    <li>Receive an SMS with activation details.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Pro Tip</strong>: Check your balance with *444# to ensure enough credit. No internet? USSD codes work on any phone, making them perfect for rural users. For postpaid users, dial 345 or visit a Telenor service center.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Telenor Hourly Call Packages</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>For quick chats, Telenor’s hourly packages are ideal. They’re perfect for urgent calls or short catch-ups.</p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"tax-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr class=\"bg-gray-200\">\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Package</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Price</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Details</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Subscribe</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Validity</th>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Telenor Good Time Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 6</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">Unlimited on-net minutes, 250 MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">*345*20#</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">1 day (2 hours for calls)</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n\r\n<h3>What is *345*20 Telenor package?</h3>\r\n<p>The *345*20# code activates the Telenor Good Time Offer, giving unlimited Telenor-to-Telenor calls and 250 MB for 2 hours (valid till midnight) at just Rs. 6. It’s great for students or travelers needing a quick call burst. Dial *345*20# to subscribe.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Insight</strong>: This package is a budget-friendly choice for short-term needs, offering more data than competitors like Jazz’s Super F&F (Rs. 9.56, no data).</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Telenor Daily Call Packages</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Daily packages suit one-off needs, like travel or busy days. Here’s the 2025 lineup:</p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"tax-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr class=\"bg-gray-200\">\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Package</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Price</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Details</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Subscribe</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Validity</th>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Telenor Full Day Package</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 13</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">Unlimited on-net minutes, 50 MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">*5*2#</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">1 day</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Telenor Daily Off-Peak Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 12</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">Unlimited on-net minutes (6 AM–6 PM)</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">*345*11#</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">1 day</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h3>What is Telenor 25 rupees package?</h3>\r\n<p>There’s no exact Rs. 25 daily package in 2025, but the closest is the Telenor Weekly Voice Lite (Rs. 25, 140 on-net minutes, 7 days, dial *345*77#). For daily needs, the Full Day Package (Rs. 13) offers better value with unlimited calls. Check <a href=\"https://www.phonesdukan.com/blog/mobile-packages/zong-call-packages-hourly-daily-weekly-monthly\">Zong Call Packages</a> for similar daily plans.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Unique Tip</strong>: Use the Full Day Package for travel days—pair it with the My Telenor App to track usage and avoid running out of minutes.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Telenor 3-Day Call Packages</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>For short trips or weekend plans, Telenor’s 3-day packages balance affordability and duration.</p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"tax-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr class=\"bg-gray-200\">\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Package</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Price</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Details</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Subscribe</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Validity</th>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Telenor 3/3 Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 50</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">600 on-net minutes, 300 SMS, 50 MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">*5*3#</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">3 days</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Telenor 3 Day All in One Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 50</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">150 on-net, 15 off-net, 150 SMS, 150 MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">*5*5#</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">3 days</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Telenor 3 Day Sahulat Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 52</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">250 on-net, 25 off-net, 250 SMS, 50 MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">*5*23#</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">3 days</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Telenor 3 Day Hybrid Package</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 60</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">500 on-net, 20 off-net, 150 SMS, 1000 MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">*345*13#</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">3 days</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Telenor 3 Day Plus Package</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 69</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">300 on-net, 25 off-net, 300 SMS, 300 MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">*345*248#</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">3 days</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h3>What is Telenor call package 70 rupees?</h3>\r\n<p>The closest is the Telenor 3 Day Plus Package (Rs. 69), offering 300 on-net minutes, 25 off-net, 300 SMS, and 300 MB for 3 days. Dial *345*248#. For a slightly higher budget, the 3 Day Hybrid Package (Rs. 60) gives more data (1000 MB).</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Insight</strong>: The 3 Day Hybrid Package is perfect for weekend getaways, with enough data for WhatsApp and calls for family check-ins.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Telenor Weekly Call Packages</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Weekly packages offer a week of worry-free connectivity, ideal for students or professionals.</p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"tax-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr class=\"bg-gray-200\">\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Package</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Price</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Details</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Subscribe</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Validity</th>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Telenor Weekly Voice Lite</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 25</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">140 on-net minutes</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">*345*77#</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">7 days</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Telenor Haftawaar Offpeak Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 55</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">Unlimited on-net minutes (6 AM–6 PM)</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">*345*56#</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">7 days</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Telenor Sahulat Mini Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 75</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-la