azz minutes, 50 off-net, 1000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">*747#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Weekly Gupshup</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 173</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">1000 SMS, 1000 Jazz minutes, 60 off-net, 100MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">*211#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Gujrat & Jhelum Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 173</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">1000 SMS, 100 off-net, 10000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">*211*2#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Quetta Haftawar Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 260</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">5000 SMS, 5000 Jazz minutes, 100 off-net, 12000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">*582#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Weekly All Network Package</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 278</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Details\">1000 SMS, 1000 Jazz minutes, 90 off-net, 3000MB</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">*700#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Weekly Super Duper Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 417</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border