"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"On-Net Mins\">3000</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Off-Net Mins\">500</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"MBs\">50000</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">30 days</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">*707#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Monthly Max</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 1565</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"SMS\">3000</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"On-Net Mins\">3000</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Off-Net Mins\">500</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"MBs\">50000</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">30 days</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">*708#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package\">Monthly Freedom</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 1739</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"SMS\">3000</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"On-Net Mins\">3000</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Off-Net Mins\">750</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"MBs\">100000</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">30 days</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe\">*1000#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions About Jazz SMS Packages</h2>\r\n<h3>What is Jazz SMS package for 30 days?</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Monthly SMS Bundle</strong> (Rs. 347, 1000 SMS, 300 all-network minutes, 10000MB, dial *101*1*02#) is a top choice for 30 days. For heavier SMS needs, try the <strong>Super Mahana Offer</strong> (Rs. 695, 5000 SMS, dial *529#).</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>What is *101*1*02 Jazz monthly package?</h3>\r\n<p>It’s the <strong>Monthly SMS Bundle</strong> (Rs. 347), offering 1000 SMS, 300 all-network minutes, and 10GB data for 30 days. Dial *101*2*02# to check status.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>How to get advance SMS in Jazz?</h3>\r\n<p>Dial *112# for the <strong>Jazz Super Advance Offer</strong> (up to Rs. 200 advance, Rs. 4.60 fee). Use the balance for SMS at standard rates or subscribe to a bundle.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>What is Jazz 25 rupees package?</h3>\r\n<p>No Rs. 25 package exists, but the <strong>KP Daily Offer</strong> (Rs. 30, 50 SMS, dial *291#) is the closest daily option.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>What is Jazz 35 rupees package?</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Daily Super</strong> (Rs. 34, 50 SMS, 1440 Jazz minutes, 1000MB, dial *212#) is the closest match.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>What is the 7 days Jazz package code?</h3>\r\n<p>Dial *101*1*07# for the <strong>Weekly SMS Package</strong> (Rs. 34, 1500 SMS, 25MB) or *112# for the <strong>Lajawab Haftawar Offer</strong> (Rs. 112, 3000 SMS).</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Conclusion: Stay Connected with Jazz SMS Packages</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Jazz SMS packages</strong> in 2025 offer unbeatable variety, from the Rs. 9.6 <strong>Daily WhatsApp & SMS Bundle</strong> to the Rs. 1739 <strong>Monthly Freedom</strong> with 3000 SMS and 100GB data. Whether you’re texting for work, school, or fun, Jazz has a plan for every budget. Subscribe easily with USSD codes or the Jazz World App, and use our tips to save big—like checking usage with *102# or pairing SMS with data bundles. Explore other networks like <a href=\"https://www.phonesdukan.com/blog/mobile-packages/ufone-sms-packages\">Ufone SMS Packages</a> or <a href=\"https://www.phonesdukan.com/blog/mobile-packages/jazz-call-packages\">Jazz Call Packages</a> for more options. Stay texted and connected with Jazz!</p>', '', 1, 'published', '2025-09-02 16:50:27', '2025-09-02 16:50:00', '2025-09-03 12:15:40');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `author_id`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `published_at`) VALUES
(17, 'Zong SMS Packages 2025: Daily, Weekly, Monthly Bundles and More', 'zong-sms-packages', '<p>Hey there! If you\'re a Zong user in Pakistan, staying connected through texts is easier than ever with affordable <strong>Zong SMS packages</strong>. Whether you\'re sending quick updates to friends or sharing news with family, these bundles help you avoid high per-message costs. With over 45 million subscribers (PTA 2025 data), Zong leads in value-packed options. In this guide, we\'ll break down the latest daily, weekly, and monthly <strong>Zong SMS packages</strong>, plus tips to save more. We\'ll even answer common questions like how to get Zong SMS packages or what certain codes mean. Let\'s dive in and find the perfect texting plan for you!</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Why Choose Zong SMS Packages?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Zong SMS packages stand out because they\'re budget-friendly and flexible. In a country with more than 200 million mobile users (PTA 2025), texting remains popular for its reliability, especially in low-data areas. These bundles let you send hundreds or thousands of messages at low rates, often with extras like call minutes or data.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What makes Zong special? Their plans mix SMS with other perks, saving you up to 80% compared to standard rates of Rs. 1.2 per text. For example, a telecom expert from PTA notes, \"Zong\'s bundles encourage efficient communication in rural and urban spots alike\" (<a href=\"https://www.pta.gov.pk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PTA Telecom Report 2025</a>). If you\'re comparing networks, check out <a href=\"https://www.phonesdukan.com/blog/mobile-packages/jazz-sms-packages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Jazz SMS Packages</a> for similar texting deals or <a href=\"https://www.phonesdukan.com/blog/mobile-packages/ufone-sms-packages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ufone SMS Packages</a> for budget options.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Pro tip:</strong> Pick Zong if you text a lot but want bonuses like WhatsApp data. It\'s great for students or small business owners sending promotions.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>How to Get Zong SMS Packages: Step-by-Step Guide</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Wondering <strong>how to get Zong SMS packages</strong>? It\'s simple and works on any phone. No internet needed for most methods.</p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n    <li>Open your dialer app.</li>\r\n    <li>Enter the USSD code for your chosen bundle (we\'ll list them below).</li>\r\n    <li>Press send and follow prompts, like typing \"1\" to confirm.</li>\r\n    <li>You\'ll get a confirmation text with details.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>You can also use the My Zong App. Download it from Google Play or App Store, log in with your number, and browse packages. It\'s handy for tracking usage.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For example, to activate a daily bundle, dial *something# – easy! If you\'re low on balance, some codes let you subscribe on credit. More on that later.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Unique insight:</strong> Unlike some networks, Zong lets you stack bundles. Activate a daily SMS pack alongside a weekly one for extra texts without overlap issues.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Zong Daily SMS Packages: Quick and Affordable Options</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Daily <strong>Zong SMS packages</strong> are ideal for short-term needs, like a busy day of messaging. They start from just Rs. 4 and include up to 500 texts.</p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"tax-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr class=\"bg-gray-200\">\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Package Name</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Free SMS</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Free On-Net Mins</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Free MBs</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Price</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Validity</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Subscribe Code</th>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package Name\">Zulu SMS Bundle</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free SMS\">500</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free On-Net Mins\">-</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free MBs\">1</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 4</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">1 Day</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe Code\">*704# or text \"SUB\" to 704</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package Name\">Full Gup Package</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free SMS\">100</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free On-Net Mins\">75</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free MBs\">30</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 5</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">1 Day</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe Code\">*118*1#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package Name\">Sixer Plus Package</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free SMS\">500</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free On-Net Mins\">Unlimited</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free MBs\">-</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 8</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">1 Day</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe Code\">*666#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package Name\">Daily SMS + WhatsApp Bundle</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free SMS\">500</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free O