(18, 'Telenor SMS Packages 2025: Daily, Weekly, Monthly Bundles and More', 'telenor-sms-packages', '<p>Hey there! If you\'re a Telenor user in Pakistan, staying in touch via text messages doesn\'t have to cost a fortune. With over 46 million subscribers as per PTA 2025 data, Telenor makes it easy to send quick updates, share news, or chat with friends without worrying about per-SMS charges. In this guide, we\'ll explore the best <strong>Telenor SMS packages</strong> for 2025, including daily, weekly, and monthly options. We\'ll cover subscription codes, prices, and tips to save more. Whether you\'re a student sending group texts or a professional coordinating plans, these bundles offer great value. Let\'s find the right one for you and keep those conversations going!</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Why Pick Telenor SMS Packages?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Telenor SMS packages</strong> are all about flexibility and savings. In a country with more than 200 million mobile users (PTA 2025), texting is still king for reliable communication, especially in spots with spotty data. These bundles let you send hundreds or thousands of messages at low rates, often bundled with extras like call minutes or internet data. What sets Telenor apart? Their plans cater to different needs, from budget options under Rs. 10 to all-in-one deals with voice and data perks.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>According to telecom expert Ayesha Khan from <a href=\"https://www.pta.gov.pk\">PTA Telecom Insights 2025</a>, \"Telenor bundles can cut texting costs by up to 80% compared to standard rates of Rs. 1.5 per SMS.\" If you\'re comparing networks, you might also like <a href=\"https://www.phonesdukan.com/blog/mobile-packages/zong-sms-packages\">Zong SMS Packages</a> for similar value or <a href=\"https://www.phonesdukan.com/blog/mobile-packages/jazz-sms-packages\">Jazz SMS Packages</a> for city-specific offers. For voice-focused plans, check out <a href=\"https://www.phonesdukan.com/blog/mobile-packages/telenor-call-packages\">Telenor Call Packages</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Pro tip:</strong> Choose Telenor if you text a lot but want bonuses like free social media data. It\'s ideal for young users or small businesses sending alerts.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>How to Get Telenor SMS Packages: Easy Steps</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Wondering <strong>how to get Telenor SMS packages</strong>? It\'s straightforward and works on any phone. No app or internet required for most methods.</p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n    <li>Open your dialer.</li>\r\n    <li>Enter the USSD code for your bundle (we\'ll list them soon).</li>\r\n    <li>Press send and confirm by typing \"1\" or following prompts.</li>\r\n    <li>You\'ll get a confirmation SMS with details.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>You can also use the My Telenor App. Download it from Google Play or App Store, log in with your number, and browse options. It\'s great for checking usage too.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For example, to grab a quick daily bundle, dial *something# – super simple! If you\'re low on balance, some plans allow subscription on credit. A unique insight: Telenor lets you stack some bundles, like adding a daily SMS pack to a weekly one for extra texts without conflicts.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you\'re asking <strong>how to get SMS bundles</strong> in general, start with your needs – daily for short bursts or monthly for heavy use. Always check remaining SMS with *101#.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Telenor Daily SMS Packages: Affordable Short-Term Options</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Daily <strong>Telenor SMS packages</strong> are perfect for busy days when you need a quick texting boost. They start from just Rs. 2 and go up to Rs. 18, offering up to 300 SMS.</p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"tax-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr class=\"bg-gray-200\">\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Package Name</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Free SMS</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Free On-Net Mins</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Free MBs</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Price</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Validity</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Subscribe Code</th>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package Name\">Telenor DJuice Daily Messaging Bundle</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free SMS\">300</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free On-Net Mins\">-</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free MBs\">-</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 2</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">1 Day</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe Code\">*2*2*10#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package Name\">Daily SMS Bundle</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free SMS\">240</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free On-Net Mins\">-</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free MBs\">-</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 4.78</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">1 Day</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe Code\">*345*116#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package Name\">Telenor DJuice Karachi Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free SMS\">1000</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free On-Net Mins\">Unlimited</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free MBs\">-</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 10</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">1 Day</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe Code\">*345*1#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package Name\">Telenor Djuice 3 Ka Scene Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free SMS\">200</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free On-Net Mins\">Unlimited FNF</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free MBs\">5</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 10</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">1 Day</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe Code\">*345*139#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package Name\">50 Minutes Mini Budget Package</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free SMS\">300</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free On-Net Mins\">50</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free MBs\">4</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 15</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">1 Day</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe Code\">*345*169#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package Name\">100 Minutes Mini Budget Package</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free SMS\">300</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free On-Net Mins\">100</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free MBs\">-</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 18</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">1 Day</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe Code\">*345*105#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\