/td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free On-Net Mins\">500</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free MBs\">1000</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 60</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">3 Days</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe Code\">*345*13#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package Name\">Telenor 3 Day Plus Package</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free SMS\">300</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free On-Net Mins\">300</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free MBs\">300</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 69</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">3 Days</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe Code\">*345*248#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package Name\">Telenor 15 Days Max</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free SMS\">5000</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free On-Net Mins\">5000</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free MBs\">30000</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 650</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">15 Days</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe Code\">*345*650#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package Name\">Telenor 15 Days Extreme</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free SMS\">7500</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free On-Net Mins\">7500</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free MBs\">130000</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 820</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">15 Days</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe Code\">*345*820#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package Name\">Telenor Sim Lagao Offer</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free SMS\">3000</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free On-Net Mins\">3000</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free MBs\">10000</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Free</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">30 Days</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe Code\">*345*10#</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>What is Telenor *345*1 package?</strong> It\'s likely the Telenor Good Time Offer (*345*20# actually, but close) – check for updates as codes evolve.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>What is *503 Telenor code?</strong> This might be outdated; current ones like *503# could be for checking offers. Dial *345# for a menu.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Special tip:</strong> Use Sim Lagao for free SMS on old SIMs. For calls, try <a href=\"https://www.phonesdukan.com/blog/mobile-packages/zong-call-packages-hourly-daily-weekly-monthly\">Zong Call Packages</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Tips to Get the Most from Telenor SMS Packages</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Track Usage:</strong> Dial *101# daily to see remaining SMS.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Stack Smartly:</strong> Add data if needed, like in hybrid bundles.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>App Bonuses:</strong> Refer friends in My Telenor App for free SMS.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Off-Peak Texts:</strong> Send during low times to extend value.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Unsubscribe Easily:</strong> Dial *unsub code# to switch plans.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Unique hack:</strong> Use SMS for polls in group chats – cheaper than apps in low-data areas.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Wrapping Up: Choose Your Telenor SMS Package Today</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Telenor SMS packages</strong> in 2025 keep texting simple and cheap, from Rs. 2 daily deals to unlimited monthly options. Subscribe via codes or app, track with *101#, and use tips for savings. Whether daily or monthly, there\'s a fit. For more, check other networks like <a href=\"https://www.phonesdukan.com/blog/mobile-packages/zong-sms-packages\">Zong SMS Packages</a>. Stay connected!</p>\r\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions About Telenor SMS Packages</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>How to Get Telenor SMS Package?</h3>\r\n<p>Dial the code or use My Telenor App. Start with *345# for options.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>How to Activate Telenor 15 Days SMS Package?</h3>\r\n<p>Dial *345*015# for 800 SMS at Rs. 17.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>What is Telenor *345*1 Package?</h3>\r\n<p>It might refer to offers; try *345*20# for Good Time.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>What is *503 Telenor Code?</h3>\r\n<p>Possibly for checks; use *345# for current bundles.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>What is Telenor SMS Package in 10 Rupees?</h3>\r\n<p>DJuice Karachi Offer (*345*1#) or Weekly Messaging (*101*2*07#).</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>How to Get SMS Bundles?</h3>\r\n<p>Assess needs, dial codes, or app – easy as that!</p>', '', 1, 'published', '2025-09-04 15:54:21', '2025-09-04 15:54:00', '2025-09-04 15:54:57');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `author_id`, `status`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `published_at`) VALUES
(19, 'Zong Internet Packages 2025: Daily, Weekly, Monthly Bundles and More', 'zong-internet-packages', '<p>Hey there! If you\'re in Pakistan and love staying online without breaking the bank, Zong internet packages are a smart pick. With over 45 million users as per PTA 2025 stats, Zong offers fast 4G speeds and bundles that fit every need. Whether you\'re streaming videos, chatting on social media, or working from home, these packages keep you connected. In this guide, we\'ll break down the latest Zong internet packages for daily, weekly, and monthly use. We\'ll include subscription codes, tips to save money, and answers to popular questions like how to get 30 GB on Zong monthly. Let\'s find the right one for you!</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Why Choose Zong Internet Packages?</h2>\r\n<p>Zong stands out because their plans mix data with extras like free minutes or SMS. In a country with 200 million mobile users (PTA 2025), reliable internet is key, especially in rural areas. Zong\'s bundles can save you up to 80% compared to pay-as-you-go rates, says telecom expert Ayesha Khan from PTA Telecom Insights 2025.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For example, if you\'re a student downloading notes, a weekly bundle might work best. Or if you\'re a freelancer video calling clients, go for monthly options. Compare with other networks? Check out <a href=\"https://www.jazz.com.pk\" target=\"_blank\">Jazz Call Packages</a> for hybrid deals or <a href=\"https://www.telenor.com.pk\" target=\"_blank\">Telenor SMS Packages</a> if texting is your thing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Unique tip: Use Zong\'s My Zong App to track data usage in real time. It sends alerts when you\'re low, helping avoid extra charges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>How to Subscribe to Zong Internet Packages</h2>\r\n<p>Getting started is easy—no fancy phone needed. Follow these steps:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n    <li>Open your dialer.</li>\r\n    <li>Dial the USSD code for your package (listed below).</li>\r\n    <li>Press \"1\" to confirm.</li>\r\n    <li>Get a text with details.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>You can also use the My Zong App: Download from Google Play, log in, and pick a bundle. Low on balance? Some plans let you subscribe on credit with <strong>*911#</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Pro hack: Dial <strong>*102#</strong> to check remaining data anytime. This saves surprises during a Netflix binge.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Zong Daily Internet Packages: Quick Data Boosts</h3>\r\n<p>Daily Zong internet packages are great for short needs, like a day trip or quick downloads. Prices start at Rs. 2, with up to 2.5 GB.</p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"tax-table\">\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr class=\"bg-gray-200\">\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Package Name</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Free SMS</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Free On-Net Mins</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Free MBs</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Price</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Validity</th>\r\n            <th class=\"px-4 py-2\">Subscribe Code</th>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package Name\">Zong Free Facebook Package</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free SMS\">-</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free On-Net Mins\">-</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free MBs\">Unlimited MB for Facebook</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Price\">Rs. 0</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Validity\">1 Day</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Subscribe Code\">Auto-activated</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Package Name\">Zong Twitter Package</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free SMS\">-</td>\r\n            <td class=\"border px-4 py-2\" data-label=\"Free On-Net Mins\">-</td>\r