INSERT INTO `products` (`product_id`, `product_name`, `product_slug`, `category_id`, `brand_id`, `product_description`, `short_description`, `product_status`, `stock_quantity`, `regular_price`, `sale_price`, `product_sku`, `weight_kg`, `length_cm`, `width_cm`, `height_cm`, `tax_class`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `product_tag`, `b2b_regular_price`, `is_b2b_available`) VALUES
(1, 'Audionic Airbud 590 Wireless Earbuds', 'audionic-airbud-590-wireless-earbuds', 13, 43, '<h2>Audionic Airbud 590 Wireless Earbuds Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Audionic Airbud 590 Wireless Earbuds are designed to enhance your everyday listening experience with superior sound quality and cutting-edge features. Built for users who demand convenience and performance, these earbuds offer a perfect blend of style, comfort, and advanced technology. Whether you\'re commuting, working out, or simply enjoying your favorite music, the Audionic Airbud 590 Wireless Earbuds deliver high-quality sound and comfort.</p>\r\n<p>One of the standout features of the Audionic Airbud 590 is its advanced <strong>Noise Cancellation (ENC)</strong> technology. This ensures that background noise is significantly reduced, providing you with a clearer and more immersive audio experience. Whether you\'re in a noisy environment like a busy street or working in a quiet office, the noise cancellation feature allows you to focus on your music, podcasts, or calls without distractions. This makes the Audionic Airbud 590 Wireless Earbuds ideal for users who need to stay connected and focused, even in noisy environments.</p>\r\n<p>The earbuds also come with an <strong>IPX4 water resistance rating</strong>, which means they can handle sweat and light splashes of water, making them perfect for outdoor activities and workouts. Whether you\'re jogging, exercising at the gym, or caught in the rain, the Audionic Airbud 590 can withstand the elements, ensuring uninterrupted music playback.</p>\r\n<p>When it comes to compatibility, the Audionic Airbud 590 Wireless Earbuds work seamlessly with <strong>Android, iOS, and Windows devices</strong>, providing a versatile solution for users across different platforms. Pairing the earbuds with your device is incredibly simple, thanks to the <strong>Auto Pairing</strong> feature. Once you\'ve connected the earbuds for the first time, they will automatically connect to your device whenever they are taken out of the charging case. This makes using the Audionic Airbud 590 hassle-free and convenient, saving you time and effort.</p>\r\n<p>The Audionic Airbud 590 features the latest <strong>Bluetooth v5.3 technology</strong>, offering a stable and reliable wireless connection. With a Bluetooth range of up to <strong>10 meters</strong>, you can enjoy wireless freedom without worrying about interruptions. Whether you\'re moving around your house or working out in the gym, the earbuds will stay connected to your device, providing smooth audio playback.</p>\r\n<p>Audio quality is another area where the Audionic Airbud 590 excels. The earbuds are equipped with <strong>8mm drivers</strong>, which deliver rich sound with crisp highs, clear mids, and deep bass. Whether you\'re listening to your favorite playlist or taking calls, you can expect a well-balanced audio performance that brings out the best in your music. The built-in <strong>microphone</strong> further enhances call quality, making it easy to engage in clear conversations even in noisy environments.</p>\r\n<p>Battery life is essential for wireless earbuds, and the Audionic Airbud 590 Wireless Earbuds do not disappoint. The earbuds themselves offer up to <strong>6 hours of playtime</strong> on a single charge, ensuring that you can enjoy your music or podcasts throughout the day. The <strong>charging case</strong> has a capacity of <strong>480mAh</strong>, which provides additional charges, extending the total battery life and keeping your earbuds powered up when you\'re on the go. The earbuds take approximately <strong>45 minutes</strong> to fully charge, while the case takes about <strong>2 hours</strong>. This fast charging time ensures that you spend more time listening and less time waiting for your devices to charge.</p>\r\n<p>The <strong>Type-C charging interface</strong> further simplifies the charging process. The USB Type-C connection is not only more efficient but also more common, making it easy to find compatible charging cables.</p>\r\n<p>The sleek and ergonomic design of the Audionic Airbud 590 Wireless Earbuds ensures that they stay comfortable, even during long listening sessions. The lightweight build and secure fit make them perfect for workouts, commutes, or casual use. With intuitive controls on the earbuds, you can easily manage your music, answer calls, and activate voice assistants without having to reach for your device.</p>\r\n<p>In summary, the Audionic Airbud 590 Wireless Earbuds are the perfect blend of convenience, performance, and style. With features like noise cancellation, water resistance, fast auto-pairing, and long-lasting battery life, these earbuds are designed to meet the needs of active users. The high-quality sound, stable Bluetooth connectivity, and comfortable design make the Audionic Airbud 590 a great choice for those seeking a reliable pair of wireless earbuds for everyday use.</p>', '<ul>\r\n         <li><strong>Noise Cancellation (ENC)</strong>: Reduces background noise for clearer audio</li>\r\n         <li><strong>Water Resistance (IPX4)</strong>: Sweat and splash-proof, ideal for workouts</li>\r\n         <li><strong>Auto Pairing</strong>: Connects instantly to your device for hassle-free use</li>\r\n         <li><strong>Bluetooth v5.3</strong>: Stable wireless connection with up to 10m range</li>\r\n         <li><strong>8mm Drivers</strong>: Delivers rich sound with clear highs, mids, and bass</li>\r\n         <li><strong>Battery Life</strong>: Up to 6 hours of playtime, with 480mAh charging case</li>\r\n         <li><strong>Type-C Charging</strong>: Fast and convenient charging solution</li>\r\n         <li><strong>Compatible with Android, iOS, and Windows</strong></li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 9499, 4699, 'AAB590PK', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 11:11:56', '2025-06-24 13:52:17', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(2, 'Audionic Wireless Airbuds 425', 'audionic-wireless-airbuds-425', 13, 43, '<h2>Audionic Wireless Airbuds 425 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Audionic Wireless Airbuds 425 are a top-tier choice for anyone seeking premium sound quality and comfort in wireless earbuds. Whether you’re using them for daily commuting, workouts, or calls, these earbuds come packed with features that ensure a seamless experience across all environments.</p>\r\n<p>Starting with the <strong>Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC)</strong> feature, the Audionic Wireless Airbuds 425 effectively filters out background noise, allowing you to focus on what you’re listening to, whether it\'s music or phone calls. The noise cancellation system enhances clarity, making it easier to enjoy media without external distractions. This makes these earbuds particularly useful in noisy environments, whether you’re traveling, working out, or in the office.</p>\r\n<p>In terms of durability, these earbuds come with an <strong>IPX4 water resistance</strong> rating, providing protection against sweat and minor splashes of water. This makes the Audionic Wireless Airbuds 425 ideal for those who lead active lifestyles, ensuring they can withstand intense gym sessions or outdoor runs without the risk of damage. You can rest assured that your earbuds will stay safe from moisture.</p>\r\n<p>The <strong>Bluetooth version 5.3</strong> connectivity in the Audionic Wireless Airbuds 425 ensures a stable and strong connection with your device. This technology offers low-latency audio transmission, making it perfect for tasks such as watching videos or gaming. The <strong>Bluetooth range</strong> of 10 meters gives you the flexibility to move around without worrying about disconnections. These earbuds are compatible with both Android and iOS devices, ensuring universal functionality regardless of your smartphone.</p>\r\n<p>When it comes to convenience, the <strong>USB-C charging interface</strong> offers faster and more reliable charging than older technologies. A full charge of the <strong>earbuds takes approximately 75 minutes</strong>, while the <strong>charging case</strong> requires around <strong>2 hours</strong> for a full charge. The <strong>charging case</strong> houses a <strong>300mAh battery</strong>, while each earbud holds a <strong>40mAh</strong> battery, ensuring that you get ample playtime on the go. Once charged, the Audionic Wireless Airbuds 425 offer <strong>4 to 5 hours of continuous playtime</strong>, giving you the freedom to enjoy your music and calls without frequent recharging.</p>\r\n<p>Despite their compact design, the Audionic Wireless Airbuds 425 deliver powerful sound through their <strong>10mm drivers</strong>. The high-fidelity audio offers crisp highs, clear mids, and deep bass, providing a well-rounded listening experience. These earbuds are ideal for music lovers who demand superior sound quality without the bulk of traditional headphones.</p>\r\n<p>One of the standout features of the Audionic Wireless Airbuds 425 is the built-in <strong>microphone</strong>. With the combination of ENC and a high-quality mic, these earbuds ensure clear and uninterrupted voice communication. Whether you\'re making important business calls or chatting with friends, you can count on these earbuds to deliver top-notch audio quality.</p>\r\n<p>The <strong>design</strong> of the Audionic Wireless Airbuds 425 is sleek and ergonomic, ensuring a comfortable fit even during extended wear. Their lightweight construction allows you to wear them for long periods without discomfort, making them ideal for daily use. The earbuds also come with an easy-to-carry charging case, which makes it simple to store and transport your earbuds wherever you go.</p>\r\n<p>In conclusion, the Audionic Wireless Airbuds 425 are the perfect wireless earbuds for users who prioritize sound quality, comfort, and convenience. With features like <strong>ENC noise cancellation</strong>, <strong>IPX4 water resistance</strong>, <strong>Bluetooth 5.3</strong>, and a <strong>USB-C charging interface</strong>, these earbuds offer a complete package for everyday use. Whether you\'re at the gym, in the office, or on the go, the Audionic Wireless Airbuds 425 will deliver a premium wireless audio experience.</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Model</strong>: Audionic Wireless Airbuds 425</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Noise Cancellation</strong>: ENC for clear audio and calls</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Water Resistance</strong>: IPX4 rating for sweat and splash protection</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth</strong>: Version 5.3 with a range of 10 meters</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Charging Interface</strong>: USB-C for faster charging</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Playtime</strong>: 4 to 5 hours on a single charge</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Battery Capacity</strong>: 40mAh earbuds, 300mAh charging case</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Charging Time</strong>: 75 minutes for earbuds, 2 hours for the case</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Driver Size</strong>: 10mm for immersive sound</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Compatibility</strong>: Works with Android and iOS</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 7999, 3999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:46:09', '2025-06-24 14:13:50', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(3, 'Sigma SBH-12 Neckband', 'sigma-sbh-12-neckband', 13, 70, '<h2>Sigma SBH-12 Neckband Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Sigma SBH-12 Neckband Bluetooth earphones offer a perfect balance of style, comfort, and superior audio performance. Designed for individuals with active lifestyles, these wireless earphones deliver high-quality sound while providing all-day comfort and convenience. Whether you\'re working out, commuting, or simply enjoying your favorite playlist at home, the Sigma SBH-12 Neckband is an ideal companion.</p>\r\n<p>One of the main highlights of the Sigma SBH-12 is its ergonomic neckband design. This unique design ensures a comfortable, secure fit around your neck, making it perfect for extended wear during long days or intense workout sessions. The lightweight and flexible material ensures that the neckband sits comfortably, while the earbuds remain securely in your ears, even during vigorous activity. The comfort of this design makes the Sigma SBH-12 an excellent choice for anyone who prioritizes ease of use and stability.</p>\r\n<p>When it comes to audio quality, the Sigma SBH-12 Neckband excels with its balanced sound profile. These Bluetooth earphones deliver rich bass, clear mids, and crisp treble, ensuring an immersive audio experience whether you\'re listening to music, podcasts, or watching videos. The deep bass enhances the low-end frequencies, while the clear treble ensures that vocals and instruments stand out. This makes the Sigma SBH-12 Neckband ideal for a variety of music genres, from electronic to classical.</p>\r\n<p>One of the standout features of the Sigma SBH-12 is its advanced <strong>Bluetooth technology</strong>. With this, you can enjoy seamless wireless connectivity with your smartphone, tablet, or other Bluetooth-enabled devices. The wireless functionality not only frees you from tangled wires but also provides a stable and reliable connection within a <strong>10-meter range</strong>. This gives you the freedom to move around while staying connected to your audio source, making it perfect for gym sessions or outdoor activities.</p>\r\n<p>The Sigma SBH-12 Neckband is also equipped with a <strong>built-in microphone</strong>, allowing for crystal-clear voice calls. Whether you\'re taking calls on the go or chatting with friends during your workout, the microphone\'s noise-reduction technology ensures that your voice is heard clearly without interference from background noise. This makes the Sigma SBH-12 a great option for professional use or personal conversations, providing smooth communication wherever you are.</p>\r\n<p>Managing your music and calls is made simple with the <strong>intuitive controls</strong> on the Sigma SBH-12 Neckband. The buttons on the neckband allow you to play, pause, skip tracks, and answer calls without needing to reach for your device. This hands-free functionality ensures that you can stay focused on your workout or tasks without interruption.</p>\r\n<p>Battery life is another area where the Sigma SBH-12 Neckband shines. These earphones offer <strong>extended playtime</strong> on a single charge, allowing you to enjoy your music or podcasts throughout the day. The long battery life makes the Sigma SBH-12 perfect for long commutes, travel, or back-to-back gym sessions. When it does need to recharge, the earphones power up quickly, so you\'re never without your music for long.</p>\r\n<p>The Sigma SBH-12 is designed to cater to individuals who live active lives. Whether you\'re an avid runner, a gym-goer, or someone who enjoys long walks, these neckband earphones are built to withstand the demands of physical activity. Their durable construction ensures they can handle sweat and movement without compromising performance.</p>\r\n<p>In summary, the Sigma SBH-12 Neckband Bluetooth earphones offer a versatile and reliable solution for anyone seeking wireless convenience, excellent sound quality, and comfort in their audio experience. With features like rich bass, a comfortable ergonomic design, Bluetooth connectivity, and clear call quality, these earphones are a great choice for music lovers and active individuals alike. The intuitive controls, extended battery life, and sleek design make the Sigma SBH-12 a must-have for those looking for high-performance Bluetooth earphones at an affordable price.</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Ergonomic Neckband Design</strong>: Comfortable and secure fit for all-day wear</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Audio Performance</strong>: Rich bass, clear treble, and balanced sound</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth Connectivity</strong>: Wireless freedom with a range of 10 meters</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Built-in Microphone</strong>: Crystal-clear voice calls with noise reduction</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Extended Playtime</strong>: Long-lasting battery for continuous audio</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Intuitive Controls</strong>: Easy music and call management</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Perfect for Active Lifestyles</strong>: Ideal for workouts, commuting, and outdoor activities</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 4699, 2650, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:46:09', '2025-06-24 14:07:26', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(4, 'Ronin R-520 Wireless Earbuds', 'ronin-r-520-wireless-earbuds', 13, 54, '<h2>Ronin R-520 Wireless Earbuds Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Ronin R-520 Wireless Earbuds offer a premium listening experience with advanced features designed to enhance convenience and audio quality. These earbuds are the ideal choice for those seeking a wireless solution that blends comfort, performance, and durability. Whether you’re using them for music, calls, or fitness, the Ronin R-520 Wireless Earbuds deliver reliable performance in every situation.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Noise cancellation</strong> is one of the standout features of the Ronin R-520 Wireless Earbuds. Equipped with <strong>Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC)</strong>, these earbuds actively reduce background noise, ensuring clearer sound during phone calls or while listening to music. This makes them an excellent choice for commuting, working out, or working in noisy environments. You can enjoy your media or engage in calls without any distractions from the surroundings.</p>\r\n<p>Another great feature is the <strong>IPX4 water resistance</strong>. This rating ensures that the Ronin R-520 Wireless Earbuds can withstand splashes of water or sweat, making them perfect for workouts or outdoor activities. Whether you\'re hitting the gym or going for a run, you can be confident that your earbuds are protected from moisture.</p>\r\n<p>When it comes to connectivity, the Ronin R-520 Wireless Earbuds are equipped with <strong>Bluetooth version 5.3</strong>. This ensures a stable and efficient wireless connection with your devices, offering smooth audio streaming with minimal lag. The <strong>Bluetooth range of 10 meters</strong> gives you the flexibility to move freely without worrying about disconnecting. Whether you’re using Android or iOS, these earbuds are compatible with both platforms, ensuring universal usability.</p>\r\n<p>The <strong>auto-pairing</strong> functionality adds to the convenience of the Ronin R-520 Wireless Earbuds. Once you take the earbuds out of the case, they automatically pair with your device, saving you the hassle of manually connecting them each time. This feature enhances the user experience, making these earbuds truly plug-and-play.</p>\r\n<p>In terms of battery life, the Ronin R-520 Wireless Earbuds provide an impressive playtime. On a single charge, they offer <strong>4 to 5 hours of continuous playback</strong>. Combined with the charging case that holds a <strong>400mAh</strong> capacity, you can enjoy extended usage without frequent recharging. The charging case itself is equipped with a <strong>Type-C charging interface</strong>, which allows for faster charging and ensures compatibility with modern charging solutions. A full charge takes only <strong>1.5 hours</strong>, so you can get back to enjoying your media quickly.</p>\r\n<p>The <strong>design</strong> of the Ronin R-520 Wireless Earbuds is ergonomic, ensuring a comfortable fit for extended wear. The earbuds are lightweight, and their in-ear design ensures a secure fit, even during intense physical activities. The compact design of the case also makes it easy to carry in your pocket or bag, allowing you to take your music on the go.</p>\r\n<p>For users who prioritize call quality, the Ronin R-520 Wireless Earbuds come with an integrated <strong>microphone</strong> that ensures clear communication. The combination of ENC and a high-quality microphone ensures that your voice comes through loud and clear, even in noisy environments.</p>\r\n<p>In summary, the Ronin R-520 Wireless Earbuds are a complete package for anyone seeking high-quality wireless earbuds with advanced features. With <strong>ENC noise cancellation</strong>, <strong>IPX4 water resistance</strong>, <strong>Bluetooth 5.3</strong>, and a <strong>Type-C charging</strong> interface, these earbuds are perfect for daily use, fitness enthusiasts, and professionals alike. Whether you\'re listening to music, taking calls, or working out, the Ronin R-520 Wireless Earbuds provide a seamless and enjoyable experience.</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Model</strong>: Ronin R-520 Wireless Earbuds</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Noise Cancellation</strong>: ENC for clear audio and calls</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Water Resistance</strong>: IPX4 rating for protection against sweat and splashes</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth</strong>: Version 5.3 with 10m range</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Auto Pairing</strong>: Automatically connects to your device</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Playtime</strong>: 4 to 5 hours on a single charge</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Charging</strong>: Type-C interface, 1.5 hours for full charge</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Battery Capacity</strong>: 400mAh charging case for extended usage</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Compatibility</strong>: Works with Android 5.0, iOS 9.0, and above</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 7999, 5595, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:46:09', '2025-06-24 14:06:09', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(5, 'Audionic Supreme X20 Wireless Neckband', 'audionic-supreme-x20-wireless-neckband', 13, 43, '<h2>Audionic Supreme X20 Wireless Neckband Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Audionic Supreme X20 Wireless Neckband is designed for those who seek both comfort and superior sound quality. With advanced features like noise cancellation, IPX5 water resistance, and extended playtime, this neckband ensures an immersive listening experience without interruptions. Whether you’re working, traveling, or exercising, the Audionic Supreme X20 provides a reliable audio solution with great sound clarity and lasting battery performance.</p>\r\n<p>One of the key highlights of the Audionic Supreme X20 Wireless Neckband is its <strong>Noise Cancellation</strong> feature. This functionality actively reduces background noise, allowing you to focus on your music, podcasts, or calls without distractions. The noise cancellation feature ensures that you can enjoy your content in noisy environments, such as while commuting or working in bustling surroundings.</p>\r\n<p>For those who are always on the go, the <strong>IPX5 water resistance rating</strong> ensures that the Audionic Supreme X20 can withstand sweat and light splashes of water. Whether you’re using them for a workout or simply listening in humid conditions, you can rely on this neckband to keep performing optimally without being affected by moisture. The IPX5 rating adds a layer of durability to the device, making it an excellent choice for fitness enthusiasts.</p>\r\n<p>Another important feature is the <strong>Bluetooth v5.2 connectivity</strong>, which provides stable and fast wireless pairing with both Android and iOS devices. With a <strong>Bluetooth range of 10 meters</strong>, you can easily move around without losing connection or experiencing interruptions in sound quality. The <strong>Audionic Supreme X20</strong> neckband supports smooth audio transmission, ensuring that your calls and media are clear and uninterrupted, even if your device is a few meters away.</p>\r\n<p>Comfort is a top priority with the Audionic Supreme X20. Designed with a lightweight neckband, these earbuds are easy to wear for extended periods. The ergonomic fit ensures that they stay secure, whether you’re commuting or engaging in physical activity. This makes them ideal for people who want a comfortable, all-day audio solution.</p>\r\n<p>In terms of battery life, the Audionic Supreme X20 stands out with its <strong>30-hour playtime</strong> on a single charge. This extended battery life ensures that you can listen to your favorite content all day without worrying about recharging. Whether you’re traveling or using them throughout a workday, the <strong>Audionic Supreme X20</strong> keeps up with your schedule. Additionally, it takes only <strong>1 hour to fully charge</strong>, so even when the battery is low, you’ll be back to using them in no time. The <strong>USB-C charging interface</strong> adds another layer of convenience, as this widely used port allows for faster charging and universal compatibility with various devices.</p>\r\n<p>Sound quality is another area where the Audionic Supreme X20 Wireless Neckband excels. Equipped with <strong>10mm drivers</strong>, these earbuds deliver crisp highs, rich mids, and deep bass, offering a balanced sound profile for all types of audio content. Whether you’re listening to music, watching videos, or taking calls, the sound is clear and immersive, providing an enjoyable experience.</p>\r\n<p>For those who take calls frequently, the <strong>built-in microphone</strong> ensures clear voice transmission. The microphone allows for hands-free communication, making it convenient to take calls on the go. Whether you’re in the middle of a busy street or working from home, the Audionic Supreme X20 ensures that your voice is heard clearly without interference from background noise.</p>\r\n<p>While the neckband doesn’t feature auto-pairing, the manual pairing process is straightforward and quick. Once paired, the neckband maintains a stable connection with your device, so you won’t have to worry about frequently reconnecting.</p>\r\n<p>In conclusion, the Audionic Supreme X20 Wireless Neckband offers a combination of <strong>long battery life</strong>, <strong>noise cancellation</strong>, <strong>water resistance</strong>, and <strong>high-quality sound</strong>. It’s perfect for anyone looking for an all-in-one solution for work, leisure, or fitness. With its sleek design and durable features, the <strong>Audionic Supreme X20</strong> is a reliable choice for anyone in need of a wireless neckband that delivers on both performance and comfort. Available for purchase in Pakistan, the Audionic Supreme X20 Wireless Neckband ensures you stay connected and entertained no matter where you are.</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Model</strong>: Audionic Supreme X20 Wireless Neckband</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Noise Cancellation</strong>: Yes, for reducing ambient noise</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Water Resistance</strong>: IPX5 rating, sweat and splash resistant</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Charging Interface</strong>: USB-C for fast charging</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth Version</strong>: v5.2 for stable and fast connectivity</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth Range</strong>: 10 meters</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Driver Size</strong>: 10mm drivers for rich sound quality</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Playtime</strong>: Up to 30 hours of battery life on a single charge</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Charging Time</strong>: 1 hour</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Compatibility</strong>: Android and iOS devices</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Microphone</strong>: Yes, for hands-free calls</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 0, 6999, 5001, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:46:09', '2025-06-24 14:04:37', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(6, 'Ronin R-007 Handsfree', 'ronin-r-007-handsfree', 13, 54, '<h2>Ronin R-007 Handsfree Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Ronin R-007 handsfree is the perfect companion for avid gamers, especially those who play multiplayer games like PUBG. Engineered to provide superior sound quality and clear communication, this handsfree set is built to enhance your gaming experience. With a focus on comfort, precise audio transmission, and durable design, the Ronin R-007 ensures that you stay fully immersed in the game without any interruptions or discomfort.</p>\r\n<p>One of the standout features of the Ronin R-007 handsfree is its <strong>plug-in microphone</strong>. This specially designed microphone headset allows for real-time audio transmission, making communication in team-based games smoother and more efficient. Whether you\'re strategizing with teammates or calling out crucial moves during gameplay, the Ronin R-007 ensures your voice is heard clearly, helping you stay ahead in the game.</p>\r\n<p>For those who value high-quality audio, the <strong>8D audio</strong> feature in the Ronin R-007 handsfree takes sound immersion to the next level. The 8D stereo sound provides a more dynamic listening experience, letting you identify the direction of in-game sounds. Whether it\'s footsteps, gunfire, or distant explosions, you\'ll be able to pinpoint the source, giving you a competitive edge. This immersive sound experience is designed to bring you closer to the action, making every game feel more realistic and exciting.</p>\r\n<p>The <strong>enhanced hearing experience</strong> is another key feature of the Ronin R-007 handsfree. It offers high-sensitivity transmission that allows you to pick up even the slightest sounds in your gaming environment. From subtle audio cues to high-energy action sequences, the Ronin R-007 delivers sound with clarity and precision. The handsfree is specially designed to help you stay aware of your surroundings in multiplayer games, ensuring you can react quickly and decisively.</p>\r\n<p>When it comes to comfort, the Ronin R-007 handsfree excels. Its design incorporates a <strong>135-degree horned ear cap</strong> that fits snugly into the ear without causing discomfort, even during long gaming sessions. The ergonomic design ensures that the handsfree stays securely in place, reducing the need for adjustments while you\'re gaming. This is especially important for gamers who play for extended periods, as the comfortable fit helps prevent ear fatigue and irritation. The Ronin R-007 is made for all-day wear, so you can focus entirely on your game.</p>\r\n<p>Beyond gaming, the Ronin R-007 handsfree is also an excellent choice for everyday use, including listening to music, making phone calls, or watching videos. Its high-quality sound and built-in microphone make it a versatile option for both gaming and non-gaming activities. The <strong>Hi-Fi stereo sound effects</strong> ensure a rich and balanced audio experience, no matter what you\'re listening to.</p>\r\n<p>In addition to its functional design, the Ronin R-007 handsfree is built for durability. The robust materials used in its construction ensure that the handsfree can withstand the rigors of daily use. Whether you\'re gaming intensely or using the handsfree for other purposes, you can rely on the Ronin R-007 to provide consistent performance over time.</p>\r\n<p>In summary, the Ronin R-007 handsfree is a must-have for gamers looking to elevate their experience. With its <strong>plug-in microphone</strong>, <strong>8D audio</strong>, and <strong>comfortable ergonomic design</strong>, it offers everything you need to stay immersed and competitive during gameplay. Whether you\'re battling in the virtual world of PUBG or simply enjoying your favorite music, the Ronin R-007 delivers high-quality sound and all-day comfort.</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Model</strong>: Ronin R-007 Handsfree</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Plug-in Microphone</strong>: Real-time audio transmission for clear communication</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>8D Audio</strong>: Immersive sound for better positional awareness in games</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Comfortable Design</strong>: 135-degree ergonomic ear cap for long-lasting comfort</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Enhanced Hearing</strong>: High-sensitivity audio transmission for precise sound detection</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Compatibility</strong>: Ideal for PUBG and other multiplayer games</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Durability</strong>: Built to withstand regular use</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 1999, 1799, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:46:09', '2025-09-22 19:43:03', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(7, 'Monster Gaming Headphone', 'monster-gaming-headphone', 16, 50, '<h2>Monster Gaming Headphone Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Introducing the Monster Gaming Headphone, a must-have accessory for gamers who demand top-tier audio quality and immersive experiences. Designed to elevate your gaming sessions, these headphones come packed with features that cater to the needs of avid gamers. From dynamic RGB lighting to superior sound performance, the Monster Gaming Headphone is engineered for excellence.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Dynamic RGB Lighting</h3>\r\n<p>One of the standout features of the Monster Gaming Headphone is its <strong>dynamic RGB lighting</strong>. This feature not only enhances the aesthetics of your gaming setup but also allows you to customize your gaming environment. With <strong>2 Pin and USB connectivity</strong>, you can easily connect the headphones to your device and enjoy a vibrant light show that syncs with your gameplay. Whether you’re in a competitive match or enjoying a casual gaming session, the customizable lighting effects can create an immersive atmosphere that enhances your overall gaming experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Superior Audio Quality</h3>\r\n<p>In addition to its stunning visual features, the Monster Gaming Headphone boasts <strong>superior audio quality</strong>. Equipped with high-fidelity drivers, these headphones deliver rich soundscapes that make you feel like you\'re part of the action. From the faintest footsteps of an approaching enemy to the explosive sounds of in-game events, the clarity and depth of the audio will enhance your gaming experience. The headphones are designed to reproduce sound with precision, allowing you to hear every detail, which can give you a competitive edge in multiplayer games.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Noise Isolation Technology</h3>\r\n<p>The Monster Gaming Headphone also features <strong>noise isolation technology</strong>, which is essential for maintaining focus during intense gaming sessions. This technology blocks out ambient noise, ensuring that you remain fully immersed in your game without distractions from your surroundings. Whether you’re in a bustling home environment or a noisy gaming café, the noise isolation feature allows you to concentrate on your gameplay, making every second count.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Comfortable Design</h3>\r\n<p>Comfort is another key aspect of the Monster Gaming Headphone. Designed for long gaming sessions, these headphones feature soft, cushioned ear pads that conform to your ears for a snug fit. The over-the-ear design ensures that you can wear them comfortably for hours on end without discomfort or fatigue. Additionally, the adjustable headband allows you to customize the fit to suit your head size, ensuring optimal comfort while gaming.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>High-Quality Microphone</h3>\r\n<p>Communication is vital in multiplayer gaming, and the Monster Gaming Headphone comes equipped with a high-quality built-in microphone. The microphone is designed to capture your voice clearly while minimizing background noise, ensuring that your teammates can hear you without any interruptions. This feature is particularly beneficial during strategic gameplay, where clear communication can make all the difference between victory and defeat.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Device Compatibility</h3>\r\n<p>For gamers who enjoy a versatile setup, the Monster Gaming Headphone is compatible with various devices, including PCs, consoles, and mobile devices. This versatility allows you to use the headphones across multiple platforms, making them a great addition to your gaming arsenal. Whether you\'re playing on a gaming PC, Xbox, PlayStation, or even your smartphone, the Monster Gaming Headphone delivers an exceptional audio experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion</h3>\r\n<p>In summary, the Monster Gaming Headphone combines aesthetic appeal with high-performance features. Its dynamic RGB lighting and customizable effects enhance your gaming setup, while the superior audio quality and noise isolation ensure that you can fully immerse yourself in your games. The comfortable design and built-in microphone further enhance the overall experience, making these headphones a perfect choice for both casual and competitive gamers alike.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With the Monster Gaming Headphone, you’re not just playing a game; you’re entering a world where every sound matters and every detail counts. Upgrade your gaming experience today with the exceptional quality and performance that these headphones provide.</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Dynamic RGB Lighting</strong>: Customize your gaming setup with vibrant lighting effects.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Superior Audio Quality</strong>: Enjoy immersive sound for a fully engaging gaming experience.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Noise Isolation</strong>: Focus on your gameplay without distractions from the environment.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Over-the-Ear Design</strong>: Comfortable cushioned ear pads for long gaming sessions.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Built-in Microphone</strong>: Clear communication with teammates during multiplayer gameplay.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Versatile Compatibility</strong>: Works with PCs, consoles, and mobile devices.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Customizable Lighting Effects</strong>: Elevate your gaming atmosphere with personalized lighting.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 4399, 3499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:46:09', '2025-08-06 14:02:27', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(8, 'Mibro Watch Lite 2', 'mibro-watch-lite2', 11, 58, '<h2>Mibro Watch Lite2 Price in Pakistan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Mibro Watch Lite2 stands out as a versatile smartwatch packed with features that cater to both tech enthusiasts and fitness lovers. With its sleek design, practical functionalities, and affordability, this smartwatch is perfect for users who want a balance between style, functionality, and durability.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Design and Display</h3>\r\n<p>Starting with its <strong>design</strong>, the Mibro Watch Lite2 features a <strong>silicon strap</strong> that provides comfort for all-day wear. Whether you’re hitting the gym or attending meetings, the watch maintains its modern look while being highly durable. Its <strong>33mm AMOLED HD color screen</strong> enhances the visual experience, giving you crisp and vibrant display quality with a <strong>360 x 360 resolution</strong>. The high-definition display ensures that all notifications, alerts, and fitness data are easy to read, even in bright daylight.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Bluetooth Calling and Voice Assistant</h3>\r\n<p>One of the standout features of the Mibro Watch Lite2 is its <strong>Bluetooth calling</strong> capability. You can stay connected even when your phone is out of reach. Whether you\'re in a meeting, driving, or working out, this feature brings extra convenience to your life. The inclusion of a built-in <strong>speaker</strong> allows you to talk clearly without needing your phone, and the <strong>voice assistant</strong> function provides hands-free control.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Fitness and Sports Modes</h3>\r\n<p>For fitness enthusiasts, the Mibro Watch Lite2 offers an impressive range of <strong>60 sports modes</strong>. Whether you’re into running, cycling, swimming, or yoga, this watch has the tracking capability to keep up with your lifestyle. It’s also water-resistant up to <strong>2ATM</strong>, making it suitable for light swimming and other water-based activities, though it\'s recommended to avoid deep diving.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Health Monitoring Features</h3>\r\n<p>The watch is also equipped with <strong>health monitoring features</strong>. The <strong>heart rate monitor</strong> keeps track of your cardiovascular health, while the <strong>oxygen level monitor</strong> ensures you’re aware of your blood oxygen levels. You can also monitor your <strong>sleep quality</strong>, helping you improve your sleep patterns over time. Although it lacks some other specific fitness metrics like calories burned or step tracking, it covers the essentials for those focused on overall health and wellness.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Device Compatibility</h3>\r\n<p>In terms of <strong>compatibility</strong>, the Mibro Watch Lite2 works seamlessly with both <strong>Android and iOS</strong> devices. This makes it highly versatile for users who switch between platforms or use different operating systems for various devices.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Battery Life</h3>\r\n<p>When it comes to <strong>battery life</strong>, the Mibro Watch Lite2 excels with its <strong>350mAh battery</strong>, offering up to <strong>12 days of battery life</strong> on a single charge. This means you can use the watch for nearly two weeks without worrying about constant charging, making it ideal for those with busy lifestyles.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Connectivity and Limitations</h3>\r\n<p>Although the Mibro Watch Lite2 lacks <strong>SIM support</strong> and <strong>GPS</strong>, its <strong>Bluetooth 5.0</strong> connectivity makes up for it, ensuring fast, stable connections with your phone. While the absence of GPS might be a downside for users looking for advanced location tracking, the variety of other features makes the watch a well-rounded option for everyday use.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Why Choose the Mibro Watch Lite2?</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Bluetooth Calling:</strong> Stay connected without needing your phone.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Voice Assistant:</strong> Hands-free control for added convenience.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>AMOLED HD Display:</strong> Clear, vibrant visuals for all your notifications and data.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Health Monitoring:</strong> Keep track of your heart rate, oxygen levels, and sleep quality.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>60 Sports Modes:</strong> Perfect for fitness enthusiasts.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>12-Day Battery Life:</strong> Long-lasting power for on-the-go lifestyles.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>The Mibro Watch Lite2 is an excellent choice for anyone who wants a smartwatch that covers all the basic functionalities and more, without breaking the bank. Whether you’re buying it for fitness tracking, staying connected, or just as a stylish accessory, this watch delivers excellent value for money.</p>', '<ul class=\"details-section-list\">\r\n 	<li class=\"details-section-item\"><picture class=\"details-section-item-dot\"> </picture>Type: Smart Watch</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"details-section-item\"><picture class=\"details-section-item-dot\"> </picture>Material: Body material Metal (PA GF) Strap material Silica gel/Leather</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"details-section-item\"><picture class=\"details-section-item-dot\"> </picture>Weight: 54.2g (Leather strap), 53.8g (Silicone strap)</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"details-section-item\"><picture class=\"details-section-item-dot\"> </picture>Size: Φ44.7mm，T=11.5mm(without heart rate base)</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"details-section-item\"><picture class=\"details-section-item-dot\"> </picture>Battery capacity: 350mAh</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"details-section-item\"><picture class=\"details-section-item-dot\"> </picture>Battery life: Daily mode: 12 days Basic mode: 60 days</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"details-section-item\"><picture class=\"details-section-item-dot\"> </picture>Resolution: 360*360</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"details-section-item\"><picture class=\"details-section-item-dot\"> </picture>Product no: XPAW011</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"details-section-item\"><picture class=\"details-section-item-dot\"> </picture>Display: Amoled HD Display</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 16999, 13999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:46:09', '2025-07-25 16:38:41', 'NULL', NULL, 0);
