(10, 'Infinix Smart 7', 'infinix-smart-7', 2, 45, '<h2>Infinix Smart 7 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Introducing the Infinix Smart 7, a remarkable smartphone that balances performance, style, and affordability. Launched on <strong>February 9, 2023</strong>, this device is designed for individuals seeking a reliable smartphone experience without breaking the bank. With its impressive specifications, the Infinix Smart 7 is perfect for everyday tasks, social media browsing, and light gaming, making it an ideal choice for a wide range of users.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Impressive Display:</h3>\r\n<p>The Infinix Smart 7 features a <strong>6.6-inch IPS LCD display</strong>, delivering vibrant colors and sharp visuals with a resolution of <strong>720 x 1612 pixels</strong>. This screen size is perfect for watching videos, playing games, and scrolling through social media feeds. The display also has a brightness of <strong>500 nits</strong>, ensuring visibility even in direct sunlight. The dimensions of <strong>163.8 x 75.6 x 8.7 mm</strong> and a weight of just <strong>188 g</strong> make it comfortable to hold and use, whether you are texting friends or enjoying your favorite movies.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Dual SIM Capability:</h3>\r\n<p>This smartphone supports <strong>dual SIM functionality</strong>, allowing users to manage both personal and work numbers seamlessly. This feature is especially beneficial for those who travel frequently or need to separate their work and personal communications.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Versatile Memory Options:</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Infinix Smart 7</strong> is equipped with <strong>64 GB of internal storage</strong> and options for <strong>3 GB or 4 GB of RAM</strong>, making it suitable for users who need extra multitasking capabilities. Additionally, the <strong>dedicated microSDXC card slot</strong> allows for memory expansion, giving you the flexibility to store more photos, videos, and applications as your needs grow.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Efficient Performance:</h3>\r\n<p>Powered by the <strong>Helio A22 processor</strong>, the Infinix Smart 7 offers smooth performance for daily tasks. Whether you\'re browsing the internet, watching videos, or using social media apps, the device responds promptly to user commands. The <strong>PowerVR GE8300 GPU</strong> enhances graphics performance, making light gaming enjoyable and visually appealing.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Outstanding Camera Features:</h3>\r\n<p>For photography enthusiasts, the Infinix Smart 7 offers a versatile camera system. The rear camera features a <strong>13 MP primary sensor</strong> alongside a <strong>0.3 MP secondary sensor</strong>, allowing users to capture detailed photos in various conditions. The inclusion of a <strong>back flash light</strong> improves low-light photography, ensuring you get quality shots even in dim environments. Users can also record videos in <strong>1080p at 30fps</strong>, making it suitable for creating quality content on-the-go.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The front camera, equipped with a <strong>5 MP sensor</strong>, is perfect for selfies and video calls. It also features a <strong>front flash light</strong>, enhancing your ability to take clear pictures in low light. The front video recording capability at <strong>720p at 30fps</strong> adds further versatility for those who enjoy vlogging or making video calls.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Long-lasting Battery Life:</h3>\r\n<p>Battery performance is crucial for any smartphone user, and the Infinix Smart 7 excels in this area. With a <strong>5000 mAh Li-Po battery</strong>, this device ensures you stay connected throughout the day without the constant worry of recharging. Whether you\'re streaming videos, playing games, or making calls, the robust battery life provides reliable performance that keeps up with your busy lifestyle.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Connectivity Options:</h3>\r\n<p>The Infinix Smart 7 offers a variety of connectivity options, including <strong>4G/LTE</strong>, <strong>3G</strong>, and Bluetooth. This ensures that you can stay connected wherever you go. The inclusion of FM radio provides additional entertainment options for users who enjoy listening to their favorite stations.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Modern Operating System:</h3>\r\n<p>Operating on <strong>Android 12</strong>, the Infinix Smart 7 provides a smooth user experience. The user interface is intuitive and easy to navigate, making it simple for users to customize their devices to fit their preferences. With various apps available on the platform, you can easily personalize your smartphone according to your needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion:</h3>\r\n<p>In summary, the Infinix Smart 7 is a well-rounded smartphone that meets the demands of modern users. Its combination of a vibrant display, efficient performance, and impressive camera features make it an excellent choice for individuals seeking value and functionality in a smartphone. Whether you’re a student, a professional, or someone who enjoys casual gaming and social media, the Infinix Smart 7 is designed to enhance your smartphone experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With its affordability and range of features, the Infinix Smart 7 stands out in the competitive smartphone market, providing users with an excellent option that balances performance and price.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 12 OS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Helio A22 SoC</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5 MP</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual 13 MP 0.3 MP, <span id=\"IL_AD7\" class=\"IL_AD\">Dual LED</span> Flash</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.6 Inches</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh ,10 watt wired</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">64GB Built-in, 4GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 27500, 21999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:46:09', '2025-07-25 16:37:32', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(11, 'Infinix Hot 30', 'infinix-hot-30', 2, 45, '<h2>Infinix Hot 30 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Infinix Hot 30, launched on <strong>August 29, 2023</strong>, is a remarkable addition to the mid-range smartphone market. Designed to cater to the needs of tech-savvy individuals, this device combines style, performance, and functionality in an attractive package. With its impressive features, the Infinix Hot 30 is well-suited for everyday tasks, gaming, and media consumption, making it an ideal choice for various users.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Striking Display:</h3>\r\n<p>One of the standout attributes of the Infinix Hot 30 is its generous <strong>6.78-inch IPS LCD display</strong>. Boasting a resolution of <strong>1080 x 2460 pixels</strong>, this screen offers sharp visuals and vibrant colors, ensuring an immersive viewing experience whether you\'re watching videos, playing games, or browsing social media. The display is designed for comfort, making it easy to hold and use throughout the day with dimensions of <strong>168.7 x 76.6 x 8.4 mm</strong>. At a weight of <strong>196 g</strong>, it strikes the perfect balance between sturdiness and portability.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Dual SIM and Memory Expansion:</h3>\r\n<p>The Infinix Hot 30 supports <strong>dual SIM functionality</strong>, allowing users to manage two different numbers effortlessly. With <strong>128 GB of internal storage</strong> and <strong>8 GB of RAM</strong>, this smartphone provides ample space for apps, photos, and videos. Additionally, the dedicated <strong>microSDXC card slot</strong> allows for memory expansion, enabling users to enhance their storage capacity based on their needs. This feature is particularly valuable for those who enjoy capturing moments or downloading content.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Performance That Impresses:</h3>\r\n<p>Equipped with the <strong>MediaTek Helio G88 processor</strong>, built on a <strong>12nm architecture</strong>, the Infinix Hot 30 ensures a smooth and responsive experience. Whether you’re multitasking between apps, gaming, or streaming videos, the performance is optimized for efficiency. The <strong>Mali-G52 MC2 GPU</strong> complements the processor, delivering an engaging gaming experience with enhanced graphics performance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Exceptional Camera System:</h3>\r\n<p>Photography enthusiasts will appreciate the versatile camera capabilities of the Infinix Hot 30. The rear camera setup features a <strong>50 MP primary camera</strong> along with a <strong>0.08 MP secondary sensor</strong>, allowing users to capture high-quality images with stunning detail. The presence of a <strong>back flash light</strong> ensures that low-light photography is also well catered to, enabling users to take great shots in dimly lit environments. Additionally, video recording is impressive, with options for <strong>1440p at 30fps</strong> and <strong>1080p at 30fps</strong>, providing flexibility for various content creation needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The front camera, with an <strong>8 MP sensor</strong>, is perfect for selfies and video calls. Featuring a front flash light, it enhances your ability to take bright, clear selfies, even in low-light situations. Front video recording at <strong>1080p at 30fps</strong> ensures that your video calls and vlogs look great.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Long-lasting Battery Life:</h3>\r\n<p>Battery performance is a significant consideration for smartphone users, and the Infinix Hot 30 does not disappoint. With a <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong>, this device is designed to keep up with your busy lifestyle, providing reliable performance throughout the day. Users can enjoy extended usage without the constant need to recharge, making it ideal for long trips, gaming sessions, or binge-watching your favorite shows.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Connectivity and Additional Features:</h3>\r\n<p>The Infinix Hot 30 comes with a variety of connectivity options, including support for <strong>4G/LTE</strong>, <strong>3G</strong>, and essential features like <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, <strong>Wi-Fi</strong>, and <strong>NFC</strong>. This ensures that users stay connected wherever they go. The device also includes FM radio, allowing users to tune into their favorite stations for entertainment.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Operating on <strong>Android 13</strong> with the <strong>XOS 12.6</strong> interface, the Infinix Hot 30 provides a user-friendly experience filled with customization options. Users can tailor their device to fit their preferences, making it a personal companion in everyday life.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion:</h3>\r\n<p>In summary, the Infinix Hot 30 is a well-rounded smartphone that excels in display quality, performance, and camera features. Its elegant design, combined with a long-lasting battery, makes it suitable for various users looking for a dependable device in the mid-range segment. Whether you are a student, a professional, or someone who enjoys gaming and multimedia, the Infinix Hot 30 offers an array of features to enhance your smartphone experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This smartphone is not just a device; it’s a valuable companion that meets modern users\' demands. With its impressive specifications and attractive design, the Infinix Hot 30 stands out as a strong contender in the competitive smartphone market, providing excellent value for its price.</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>6.78-inch IPS LCD display with 1080 x 2460 pixels resolution</li>\r\n 	<li>MediaTek Helio G88 processor for optimal performance</li>\r\n 	<li>Dual SIM support with 128 GB internal storage and 8 GB RAM</li>\r\n 	<li>Dedicated microSDXC card slot for expandable storage</li>\r\n 	<li>Rear camera: 50 MP + 0.08 MP; Front camera: 8 MP with flash</li>\r\n 	<li>5000 mAh battery for extended usage</li>\r\n 	<li>Connectivity options: 4G/LTE, Bluetooth, Wi-Fi, and NFC (availability may vary)</li>\r\n 	<li>Android 13 with XOS 12.6 for a modern user interface</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 0, 30000, 27999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:46:09', '2025-07-25 16:36:47', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(12, 'Tecno Spark 10 Pro', 'tecno-spark-10-pro', 2, 57, '<h2>Tecno Spark 10 Pro Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Tecno Spark 10 Pro has made a significant impact since its launch on <strong>August 22, 2023</strong>. This smartphone stands out in the competitive mid-range market, designed for users who seek performance, a vibrant display, and impressive camera capabilities. Whether you are a student, a professional, or a casual user, the Tecno Spark 10 Pro delivers a feature-rich experience that can meet a variety of needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Impressive Display:</h3>\r\n<p>One of the standout features of the Tecno Spark 10 Pro is its large <strong>6.78-inch FHD+ display</strong>. With a resolution of <strong>1080 x 2460 pixels</strong>, this screen provides sharp and vivid visuals that enhance your viewing experience. Whether you\'re watching videos, browsing social media, or playing games, the display ensures that every detail is clear and crisp. The device\'s design is not just about size; it also offers a sleek profile with dimensions of <strong>164.6 x 76.2 x 8.4 mm</strong>, making it comfortable to hold and use.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Dual SIM and Expandable Memory:</h3>\r\n<p>The Tecno Spark 10 Pro supports <strong>dual SIM functionality</strong>, allowing you to manage both personal and professional contacts seamlessly. With internal storage options of <strong>128 GB and 256 GB</strong>, users can choose the model that best fits their storage needs. Additionally, the phone supports microSD cards, providing the flexibility to expand storage up to <strong>256 GB</strong>. This is particularly beneficial for users who enjoy capturing photos and videos, as it offers ample space for all your media.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Exceptional Performance:</h3>\r\n<p>At the heart of the Tecno Spark 10 Pro is the <strong>MediaTek Helio G88 processor</strong>, built on a <strong>12 nm architecture</strong>. This powerful processor ensures that the device can handle multiple tasks efficiently, whether you\'re gaming or multitasking with various apps. Paired with <strong>8 GB or 16 GB of RAM</strong>, this smartphone offers a smooth and responsive performance, making it an excellent choice for users who need reliability and speed.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Outstanding Camera Features:</h3>\r\n<p>Photography enthusiasts will appreciate the Tecno Spark 10 Pro\'s impressive camera setup. The rear features a <strong>50 MP primary camera</strong>, complemented by a <strong>QVGA sensor</strong>, enabling users to take high-quality photos with stunning clarity and detail. The inclusion of a <strong>back flash light</strong> enhances low-light photography, ensuring you capture great shots even in challenging conditions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The front-facing camera is equally impressive, boasting a <strong>32 MP sensor</strong>. This makes it ideal for selfies and video calls, allowing you to capture sharp images that highlight your best features. While the front camera does not have a flash, it is designed to perform well in various lighting conditions, ensuring that your selfies always look good.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Long-lasting Battery Life:</h3>\r\n<p>The Tecno Spark 10 Pro is equipped with a <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong>, designed to support your busy lifestyle. This substantial battery capacity allows for extended use, whether you\'re streaming videos, playing games, or engaging in social media. Users can expect a full day of usage on a single charge, making it perfect for those who are always on the go.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Connectivity and Additional Features:</h3>\r\n<p>Connectivity is a vital aspect of any modern smartphone, and the Tecno Spark 10 Pro does not disappoint. It supports <strong>4G/LTE</strong>, <strong>3G</strong>, and includes features like <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, <strong>Wi-Fi</strong>, and <strong>NFC</strong>, making it versatile for all your connectivity needs. The device also comes with FM radio, adding another layer of entertainment options for users.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Running on <strong>Android 13</strong> paired with <strong>HiOS 12.6</strong>, the Tecno Spark 10 Pro offers a user-friendly interface filled with features that enhance usability. The operating system provides customization options, ensuring that users can tailor their device to their preferences.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion:</h3>\r\n<p>In summary, the Tecno Spark 10 Pro is a robust smartphone that combines an impressive display, powerful performance, and an exceptional camera system. Its sleek design and long-lasting battery make it a perfect companion for anyone looking for a reliable device. Whether you’re a photography enthusiast, a gamer, or someone who enjoys media consumption, the Tecno Spark 10 Pro is designed to meet your expectations and more.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This smartphone is an excellent investment for those seeking quality features and performance in a mid-range device. The Tecno Spark 10 Pro truly stands out in its category, making it a noteworthy option for users in Pakistan and beyond.</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>6.78-inch FHD+ display with 1080 x 2460 pixels resolution</li>\r\n 	<li>MediaTek Helio G88 processor for efficient performance</li>\r\n 	<li>Dual SIM support with internal storage options of 128 GB and 256 GB</li>\r\n 	<li>Expandable memory via microSD card (up to 256 GB)</li>\r\n 	<li>Rear camera: 50 MP + QVGA; Front camera: 32 MP</li>\r\n 	<li>5000 mAh battery for long-lasting use</li>\r\n 	<li>Connectivity options: 4G/LTE, Bluetooth, Wi-Fi, and NFC (availability may vary)</li>\r\n 	<li>Android 13 with HiOS 12.6 for a modern user experience</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<!-- HTML Structure for Styled Product Table -->', 1, 0, 28999, 26999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:46:09', '2025-07-25 16:35:45', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(13, 'Infinix Zero 30 4G', 'infinix-zero-30-4g', 2, 45, '<h2>Infinix Zero 30 4G Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Infinix Zero 30 4G is a standout smartphone designed to meet the needs of modern users who value performance, aesthetics, and innovative features. Officially launched on <strong>October 26, 2023</strong>, this device is poised to make waves in the smartphone market, offering a range of specifications that cater to both casual users and tech enthusiasts alike.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Exceptional Display:</h3>\r\n<p>One of the highlights of the Infinix Zero 30 4G is its impressive <strong>6.78-inch AMOLED display</strong>. This screen delivers a resolution of <strong>1080 x 2400 pixels</strong>, ensuring that every image, video, and app looks vibrant and clear. The <strong>AMOLED technology</strong> enhances contrast and provides deep blacks, making it perfect for media consumption. Whether you are watching your favorite shows or playing games, the display\'s <strong>Corning Gorilla Glass 5</strong> protection keeps it safe from scratches and accidental drops.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Sleek Design:</h3>\r\n<p>With dimensions of <strong>164.5 x 75 x 7.9 mm</strong> and a lightweight design at <strong>182 grams</strong>, the <strong>Infinix Zero 30 4G</strong> is both stylish and portable. Its sleek profile makes it easy to hold and use, while the aesthetic design is sure to turn heads. This phone is perfect for anyone who appreciates a modern look combined with functionality.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Powerful Performance:</h3>\r\n<p>The Infinix Zero 30 4G is powered by the <strong>MediaTek Helio G99 processor</strong>, a robust chip that ensures smooth performance for various tasks. Coupled with <strong>8 GB of RAM</strong>, this device can handle multitasking and gaming without lag. Whether you\'re browsing the web, streaming content, or playing graphics-intensive games, the Infinix Zero 30 4G delivers a fluid user experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For storage, it offers a generous <strong>256 GB internal memory</strong>, allowing you to store all your favorite apps, photos, and videos without the need for external storage. However, it is worth noting that the device does not support a microSD card slot.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Impressive Camera System:</h3>\r\n<p>Photography enthusiasts will be thrilled with the Infinix Zero 30 4G\'s advanced camera system. The rear features a triple-camera setup, highlighted by a <strong>108 MP main camera</strong> that captures stunning detail and vibrant colors in every shot. Accompanied by two additional <strong>2 MP cameras</strong>, this setup allows for various photography styles, including macro and portrait modes. The <strong>back flash light</strong> enhances low-light photography, ensuring that your photos look great even in challenging lighting conditions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The front-facing camera is equally impressive, featuring a <strong>50 MP sensor</strong> that allows for high-resolution selfies. It also supports video recording at <strong>1440p@30fps</strong> and <strong>1080p@30/60fps</strong>, making it perfect for capturing memorable moments with clarity.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Long-lasting Battery Life:</h3>\r\n<p>Equipped with a <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong>, the Infinix Zero 30 4G is built to last. Whether you\'re using it for social media, streaming, or gaming, this powerful battery ensures that you can go all day without needing to recharge. Additionally, its efficient power management features mean you can enjoy prolonged usage, giving you the freedom to stay connected without interruptions.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Connectivity Features:</h3>\r\n<p>The Infinix Zero 30 4G includes a range of connectivity options to keep you connected. It supports <strong>4G/LTE</strong>, <strong>3G</strong>, and comes with <strong>Bluetooth</strong> and <strong>Wi-Fi</strong> capabilities. This ensures fast internet browsing and smooth file transfers. The device also features <strong>NFC</strong> for quick payments and transfers (availability may vary by market). Additionally, it has an FM radio, adding to its versatility for entertainment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Operating System:</h3>\r\n<p>Running on <strong>XOS 13</strong>, which is based on <strong>Android 13</strong>, the Infinix Zero 30 4G offers a user-friendly interface packed with features designed to enhance the user experience. The operating system is tailored for customization and functionality, making it easy for users to personalize their devices to fit their preferences.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion:</h3>\r\n<p>In summary, the Infinix Zero 30 4G is an exceptional smartphone that combines a stunning display, powerful performance, and an impressive camera system. Its sleek design and robust battery life make it a perfect companion for anyone seeking a reliable and feature-rich device. Whether you’re a gamer, a photography enthusiast, or someone who enjoys media consumption, the Infinix Zero 30 4G is designed to meet and exceed your expectations.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For those considering a purchase, the Infinix Zero 30 4G represents a great investment in mobile technology, providing cutting-edge features and a stylish design that stands out in today’s competitive smartphone market.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13 OS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Mediatek MT8781 Helio G99 (6nm)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">50 MP, f/2.5, (wide), 1/2.76\", PDAF, Dual LED Flash, Video (1440p@30fps, 1080p@30/60fps)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Triple Camera: 108 MP, f/1.7, (wide), 1/1.67\", PDAF  2 MP, f/2.4  2 MP, f/2.4, Quad LED Flash</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.78 Inches, 3D Curved AMOLED Touchscreen, 1B Colors, Multitouch</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh ,Fast charging 45W wired, PD3.0, 75% in 30 min</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">256GB Built-in, 8GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 53999, 38599, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:46:09', '2025-07-25 16:35:01', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(14, 'Infinix Note 30', 'infinix-note-30', 2, 45, '<h2>Infinix Note 30 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Infinix Note 30 is a remarkable smartphone that aims to deliver a well-rounded experience for users who value performance, style, and cutting-edge features. Released on <strong>May 22, 2023</strong>, this device combines innovative technology with a sleek design, making it an appealing option for anyone in search of a new smartphone.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Stunning Display and Design:</h3>\r\n<p>At the forefront of the Infinix Note 30 is its expansive <strong>6.78-inch IPS LCD display</strong>, which boasts a resolution of <strong>1080 x 2460 pixels</strong>. This high-definition display provides vibrant colors and sharp details, enhancing your viewing experience whether you\'re streaming videos, playing games, or browsing through social media. The <strong>120Hz refresh rate</strong> ensures smooth animations and responsiveness, making it ideal for gamers and content creators alike.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The smartphone features dimensions of <strong>168.6 x 76.6 x 8.58 mm</strong> and weighs <strong>219 grams</strong>, striking a balance between a robust build and a comfortable grip. This design ensures that it fits snugly in your hand while also providing a premium look that stands out in any crowd.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Powerful Performance:</h3>\r\n<p>Under the hood, the Infinix Note 30 is powered by the <strong>Mediatek Helio G99 processor</strong>, which is designed for superior performance across a variety of applications. Whether you\'re multitasking between apps or enjoying graphics-intensive games, this processor ensures a smooth experience. Paired with <strong>8 GB of RAM</strong>, it handles demanding tasks with ease, allowing you to switch between applications seamlessly.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For storage, the device offers options of <strong>128 GB or 256 GB</strong>, providing ample space for your photos, videos, and apps. Moreover, it supports a dedicated microSD card slot, allowing you to expand your storage capacity up to an impressive <strong>2 TB</strong>. This means you can carry your entire media library without worrying about running out of space.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Impressive Camera System:</h3>\r\n<p>Photography enthusiasts will appreciate the Infinix Note 30\'s robust camera system. The back features a <strong>64 MP main camera</strong> accompanied by a <strong>2 MP depth sensor</strong> and an AI camera that enhances your photography skills. The inclusion of a <strong>back flash light</strong> ensures that you can capture stunning images even in low-light conditions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For video recording, the device supports resolutions of <strong>1440p at 30fps</strong> and <strong>1080p at 30/60fps</strong>, enabling you to capture high-quality videos with great detail. On the front, the <strong>16 MP camera</strong> ensures your selfies look fantastic, complete with a front flash light for well-lit shots.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Long-lasting Battery Life:</h3>\r\n<p>One of the standout features of the Infinix Note 30 is its robust <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong>, designed to keep you connected throughout the day. Whether you\'re streaming videos, browsing social media, or gaming, you can rely on this powerful battery to deliver uninterrupted performance. Additionally, the phone’s efficient power management ensures that you get the most out of every charge, allowing you to focus on what matters most.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Connectivity Features:</h3>\r\n<p>In terms of connectivity, the Infinix Note 30 is equipped with a comprehensive suite of options. It supports <strong>4G/LTE</strong>, <strong>3G</strong>, and includes <strong>Bluetooth</strong> for seamless connections with wireless devices. The phone also offers <strong>Wi-Fi</strong> capabilities for fast internet access. Although it does not support <strong>5G</strong>, it does come with <strong>NFC</strong> functionality, depending on the market and region, enhancing its versatility for mobile payments and other features.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Operating System:</h3>\r\n<p>Running on <strong>Android 13</strong>, the Infinix Note 30 provides a modern user experience, with access to the latest apps and features. The operating system is designed to be user-friendly, making it easy to navigate and customize your device to suit your preferences.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion:</h3>\r\n<p>In summary, the Infinix Note 30 stands out as a versatile smartphone that caters to a variety of user needs. With its impressive display, powerful performance, and robust camera system, it is an excellent choice for anyone looking to enhance their mobile experience. Whether you\'re a student, a professional, or someone who enjoys technology, the Infinix Note 30 is designed to keep you connected, entertained, and productive.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For those interested in purchasing the Infinix Note 30, this smartphone combines cutting-edge features with a stylish design, making it a smart investment for anyone in need of a reliable and feature-rich device.</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>6.78-inch IPS LCD display with 1080 x 2460 pixels resolution</li>\r\n 	<li>Mediatek Helio G99 processor for powerful performance</li>\r\n 	<li>8 GB RAM and options for 128/256 GB storage, expandable up to 2 TB</li>\r\n 	<li>Dual rear camera: 64 MP + 2 MP + AI camera; Front camera: 16 MP</li>\r\n 	<li>5000 mAh battery for extended usage</li>\r\n 	<li>Supports 4G/LTE, Bluetooth, Wi-Fi, and NFC (market-dependent)</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 0, 44999, 33999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:46:09', '2025-07-25 16:33:13', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(15, 'Vivo Y27', 'vivo-y27', 2, 60, '<h2>Vivo Y27 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Introducing the Vivo Y27, a smartphone designed to meet the demands of modern users who seek performance, style, and functionality. Launched on <strong>August 24, 2023</strong>, the Vivo Y27 is poised to be a strong contender in the competitive mid-range market. With its striking design and powerful features, this device is perfect for those looking to enhance their mobile experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Elegant Design and Display:</h3>\r\n<p>The Vivo Y27 features a stunning <strong>6.64-inch LCD display</strong> with a resolution of <strong>1080 x 2388 pixels</strong>. This large screen provides vibrant visuals and sharp details, making it an excellent choice for watching videos, browsing the web, or gaming. The device\'s dimensions of <strong>164.1 x 76.2 x 8.1 mm</strong> and a weight of <strong>190 grams</strong> give it a sleek profile that is easy to hold and carry, ensuring it fits comfortably in your hand or pocket.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Performance and Software:</h3>\r\n<p>Powered by the <strong>Mediatek MT6769 Helio G85 processor</strong> with a clock speed of up to <strong>2.0 GHz</strong>, the <strong>Vivo Y27</strong> delivers impressive performance across a range of tasks. Whether you\'re multitasking between apps or enjoying graphics-intensive games, the <strong>Mali-G52 MC2 GPU</strong> ensures smooth graphics rendering and fluid animations. The smartphone operates on <strong>Funtouch OS 13</strong>, based on <strong>Android 13</strong>, offering a user-friendly interface and access to the latest features and applications.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Equipped with <strong>6 GB of RAM</strong>, the Vivo Y27 ensures smooth performance and efficient multitasking, allowing users to switch between applications seamlessly. Additionally, the device includes <strong>128 GB of internal storage</strong>, which can be expanded using a dedicated microSD card slot, providing ample space for all your photos, videos, and apps.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Captivating Camera System:</h3>\r\n<p>The Vivo Y27 comes with an impressive camera setup that is perfect for photography enthusiasts. On the back, you’ll find a <strong>50 MP main camera</strong> paired with a <strong>2 MP depth sensor</strong>, allowing users to capture stunning images with great detail and clarity. The inclusion of a <strong>back flash light</strong> ensures that low-light conditions don’t hinder your ability to take great photos.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For selfies, the <strong>8 MP front camera</strong> provides excellent quality for video calls and social media posts. While it does not come with a front flash, the camera is capable of producing clear and vibrant selfies under good lighting conditions. Both the front and rear cameras support video recording, providing versatility for capturing moments on the go.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Battery Life:</h3>\r\n<p>A standout feature of the Vivo Y27 is its <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong>, designed to keep you powered throughout the day. Whether you\'re streaming videos, browsing social media, or gaming, this large battery capacity ensures that you can enjoy your device without constantly worrying about charging.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Connectivity Options:</h3>\r\n<p>The Vivo Y27 is equipped with various connectivity options to keep you connected at all times. It supports <strong>4G/LTE</strong> and <strong>3G</strong>, enabling fast internet access for all your online activities. <strong>Bluetooth</strong> connectivity allows for seamless pairing with headphones, speakers, and other devices. The phone also includes <strong>Wi-Fi</strong> capabilities for browsing the internet at high speeds, making it easy to stay connected wherever you go.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>However, it’s important to note that the Vivo Y27 does not support <strong>5G</strong> or <strong>NFC</strong>, and it does not include an FM radio. These considerations may be relevant for some users, but the phone’s core features more than compensate for these limitations.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion:</h3>\r\n<p>In conclusion, the <strong>Vivo Y27</strong> is a well-rounded smartphone that caters to the needs of today’s mobile users. With its elegant design, impressive display, powerful camera, and long-lasting battery, it stands out in the crowded mid-range market. Whether you’re a student, professional, or just someone who enjoys technology, the Vivo Y27 is an ideal choice that delivers performance without compromising on style.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For those looking to buy the Vivo Y27 in Pakistan, this smartphone offers everything you need to stay connected, capture memories, and enjoy entertainment on the go. Its combination of powerful features and modern design makes it a compelling option for anyone seeking a reliable smartphone.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13 OS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Mediatek MT6769 Helio G85 (12nm)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">8 MP, f/2.0, (wide), Video (1080p@30fps)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Camera: 50 MP, f/1.8, (wide), PDAF 2 MP, f/2.4, (macro)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.64 Inches</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh , Fast battery 44W wired</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">128GB Built-in, 6GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 39999, 38999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:46:09', '2025-07-25 16:32:24', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(16, 'Vivo Y36', 'vivo-y36', 2, 60, '<h2>Vivo Y36 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Introducing the Vivo Y36, a smartphone that brings together modern design and powerful features, tailored for users seeking a reliable and stylish device. Officially launched on <strong>May 27, 2023</strong>, this model offers a fantastic blend of technology and functionality, making it a strong competitor in the mid-range smartphone market.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Display and Design:</h3>\r\n<p>The Vivo Y36 boasts a striking <strong>6.64-inch IPS LCD display</strong> with a resolution of <strong>1080 x 2388 pixels</strong>, delivering vibrant colors and clear visuals. The <strong>90Hz refresh rate</strong> enhances the smoothness of scrolling and transitions, creating a more enjoyable user experience, especially while gaming or watching videos. With a peak brightness of <strong>650 nits</strong>, the display remains clear and visible even in direct sunlight.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Weighing in at <strong>202 grams</strong> and with dimensions of <strong>164.06 x 76.17 x 8.07 mm</strong>, the Vivo Y36 offers a comfortable grip and stylish appearance, making it easy to carry around. The design is sleek, ensuring it catches the eye while still being practical for everyday use.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Performance:</h3>\r\n<p>Under the hood, the Vivo Y36 is powered by a robust <strong>2.4 GHz octa-core processor</strong> paired with the <strong>Adreno 610 GPU</strong>, providing excellent performance for multitasking, gaming, and streaming. With <strong>8 GB of RAM</strong>, users can easily switch between applications without lag, ensuring a seamless experience throughout the day.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The device comes with <strong>128 GB of internal storage</strong>, which is ample space for apps, photos, and videos. Moreover, the inclusion of a <strong>dedicated microSDXC card slot</strong> allows users to expand storage as needed, accommodating their growing digital libraries.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Impressive Camera System:</h3>\r\n<p>Photography lovers will appreciate the Vivo Y36 camera capabilities. The rear camera setup includes a <strong>50 MP primary sensor</strong>, complemented by <strong>2 MP macro and depth sensors</strong>. This configuration allows for stunning photographs with detailed clarity, suitable for various lighting conditions. The device also supports <strong>1080p video recording</strong> at 30 frames per second, enabling users to capture memorable moments with ease.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For selfies, the <strong>16 MP front camera</strong> offers great performance, ensuring clear and vibrant images for social media sharing. Although it lacks a front flash, users can still capture excellent shots in good lighting.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Battery Life:</h3>\r\n<p>The Vivo Y36 features a long-lasting <strong>5000 mAh Li-Po battery</strong>, designed to keep you connected throughout the day. This non-removable battery ensures extended usage without the need for constant recharging. Whether you’re browsing, streaming, or gaming, the Vivo Y36 stands ready to keep pace with your activities.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Connectivity Options:</h3>\r\n<p>In terms of connectivity, the Vivo Y36 has you covered with its extensive features. Supporting <strong>4G/LTE</strong>, <strong>3G</strong>, and <strong>Wi-Fi</strong>, this smartphone enables fast internet access for all your online needs. The device also includes Bluetooth capabilities for easy connection to accessories and other devices.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Additionally, the Vivo Y36 comes equipped with FM radio for music lovers, and although it does not support <strong>5G</strong>, it does offer <strong>NFC</strong> capabilities, depending on the market and region, allowing for quick and easy contactless transactions.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Operating System:</h3>\r\n<p>Running on <strong>Android 13 with Funtouch OS 13</strong>, the Vivo Y36 provides a user-friendly interface with enhanced features and improved security. Users can access a wide range of applications from the Google Play Store, allowing for customization and personalization according to their preferences.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion:</h3>\r\n<p>In summary, the Vivo Y36 is an impressive smartphone that effectively combines performance, design, and features to meet the needs of a wide range of users. Whether you are looking for a device for work, entertainment, or social media, the Vivo Y36 is an excellent choice.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For those interested in purchasing the Vivo Y36 in Pakistan, this smartphone offers everything you need to stay connected, capture moments, and enjoy entertainment on the go. Its strong performance and stylish design make it a worthy addition to your tech collection.</p>', '<!-- HTML Structure for Styled Product Table -->\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>6.64-inch IPS LCD display with 1080 x 2388 pixels resolution</li>\r\n 	<li>90Hz refresh rate for smooth scrolling and transitions</li>\r\n 	<li>8 GB RAM and 128 GB internal storage, expandable via microSDXC</li>\r\n 	<li>Triple rear camera: 50 MP + 2 MP + 2 MP; Front camera: 16 MP</li>\r\n 	<li>5000 mAh battery for all-day usage</li>\r\n 	<li>Supports 4G/LTE, Bluetooth, Wi-Fi, and FM radio</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 0, 46999, 43999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:46:09', '2025-07-25 16:31:36', 'NULL', NULL, 0);
