(17, 'Vivo Y17s', 'vivo-y17s', 2, 60, '<h2>Vivo Y17s Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Meet the Vivo Y17s, an innovative smartphone designed to enhance your mobile experience without breaking the bank. Officially released on <strong>September 18, 2023</strong>, this device combines sleek design, robust performance, and practical features, making it an ideal choice for everyday users.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Display and Design:</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Vivo Y17s</strong> features a generous <strong>6.56-inch IPS LCD display</strong> that offers a resolution of <strong>720 x 1612 pixels</strong>. This screen delivers vibrant colors and decent clarity, providing an enjoyable viewing experience for streaming videos or browsing through images. With a peak brightness of <strong>700 nits</strong>, visibility remains excellent even in bright sunlight.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The phone\'s dimensions of <strong>163.7 x 75.4 x 8.1 mm</strong> and a lightweight design at just <strong>186 g</strong> ensure that it is comfortable to hold and use for extended periods. The sleek profile makes it easy to slip into your pocket or bag, making it a practical choice for those on the go.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Performance:</h3>\r\n<p>Powering the Vivo Y17s is the capable <strong>MediaTek MT6769 Helio G85 processor</strong>, known for its efficiency and performance. Paired with <strong>6 GB of RAM</strong>, this smartphone is designed to handle multitasking with ease. Whether you\'re switching between applications, enjoying mobile games, or streaming content, the Vivo Y17s ensures a smooth user experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In terms of storage, the device comes with <strong>128 GB of internal memory</strong>, which is ample space for your apps, photos, and videos. Plus, with a <strong>dedicated microSDXC card slot</strong>, users have the flexibility to expand their storage as needed, ensuring that you never run out of space for your important files.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Impressive Camera Capabilities:</h3>\r\n<p>Photography enthusiasts will appreciate the <strong>Vivo Y17s</strong> camera system. The rear features a <strong>50 MP main camera</strong> alongside a <strong>2 MP secondary camera</strong>, allowing for versatile photography options. This combination captures stunning images with impressive detail and clarity, making it suitable for various shooting conditions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The back camera also supports <strong>1080p video recording</strong> at 30 frames per second, ensuring your videos are just as vibrant as your photos. The <strong>8 MP front camera</strong> is perfect for selfies and video calls, enabling you to connect with friends and family effortlessly. Although it lacks a dedicated flash, the camera quality shines in well-lit environments.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Battery Life:</h3>\r\n<p>One of the standout features of the Vivo Y17s is its robust <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong>, designed to last throughout the day. Whether you’re working, browsing social media, or watching videos, you can rely on this device to keep up with your daily activities. The non-removable battery ensures that you stay connected without the hassle of frequent recharging.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Connectivity Options:</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Vivo Y17s</strong> supports a wide range of connectivity options, making it versatile for everyday use. It features <strong>4G/LTE</strong> capabilities for fast mobile internet access, along with support for <strong>3G</strong>. For added convenience, this smartphone includes Bluetooth and Wi-Fi connectivity, allowing users to easily connect to wireless networks and devices.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>While it does not support <strong>5G</strong> or <strong>NFC</strong>, it does come with an <strong>FM radio</strong>, providing entertainment options for music lovers.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Operating System:</h3>\r\n<p>Running on <strong>Android 13 with Funtouch OS 13</strong>, the Vivo Y17s offers a user-friendly interface filled with customization options. The latest Android features ensure that users benefit from improved security and functionality. With access to the Google Play Store, you can download a variety of apps tailored to your lifestyle, enhancing your smartphone experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion:</h3>\r\n<p>In summary, the Vivo Y17s is a well-rounded smartphone that caters to a broad audience. With its impressive display, capable processor, and powerful camera system, it stands out as a strong contender in the budget smartphone market.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you are looking to buy Vivo Y17s in Pakistan, this device offers a remarkable blend of features and performance that makes it a reliable choice for anyone seeking a new smartphone. Whether for work or play, the Vivo Y17s is equipped to meet your needs.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13 OS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Mediatek MT6769 Helio G85 (12nm)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">8 MP, f/2.0, (wide), Video (1080p@30fps)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Camera: 50 MP, f/1.8, (wide), PDAF 2 MP, f/2.4, (depth), LED Flash</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.56 Inches</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh , Fast battery 15W wired</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">128GB Built-in, 6GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 41999, 37999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:46:09', '2025-07-25 16:30:51', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(18, 'Realme C51', 'realme-c51', 2, 53, '<h2>Realme C51 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Realme C51 is an impressive smartphone that combines modern design with practical functionality, making it a suitable choice for various users. Officially launched on <strong>24 July 2023</strong>, this device is tailored for those who appreciate quality without breaking the bank.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Design and Display:</h4>\r\n<p>The Realme C51 features a sleek and stylish design, measuring <strong>167.2 x 76.7 x 8 mm</strong> and weighing only <strong>186 grams</strong>. Its lightweight nature makes it comfortable to hold and carry. The phone supports <strong>dual SIM (Nano-SIM, dual stand-by)</strong> functionality, allowing users to manage personal and work calls efficiently.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>One of the highlights of the Realme C51 is its stunning <strong>6.74-inch IPS LCD display</strong>. With a resolution of <strong>720 x 1600 pixels</strong>, the screen provides vibrant colors and sharp details. The <strong>90Hz refresh rate</strong> enhances the user experience by delivering smooth scrolling and transitions, whether you\'re browsing the web or playing games. Additionally, the display reaches a peak brightness of <strong>560 nits</strong>, ensuring visibility even in bright outdoor conditions.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Performance and Hardware:</h4>\r\n<p>Under the hood, the Realme C51 is powered by the <strong>Unisoc Tiger T612 processor</strong>, which delivers reliable performance for everyday tasks and multitasking. The device comes with <strong>4GB of RAM</strong>, ensuring a smooth experience when switching between apps or running multiple applications simultaneously. With <strong>64GB of internal storage</strong>, there is ample space for apps, photos, and videos. For users needing additional storage, the phone includes a <strong>dedicated card slot</strong> for microSD expansion.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Camera Capabilities:</h4>\r\n<p>The camera system of the Realme C51 is designed to capture stunning moments with ease. The rear camera features a <strong>50 MP main sensor</strong> accompanied by a <strong>0.08 MP secondary camera</strong>, enabling users to take high-quality photos in various settings. The device also supports <strong>1080p video recording at 30fps</strong>, allowing you to document your experiences in clear detail.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For selfies and video calls, the Realme C51 is equipped with a <strong>5 MP front camera</strong>. While it does not include a front flash, it still captures decent images, particularly in well-lit environments. The front camera can record videos in <strong>720p at 30fps</strong>, making it suitable for social media and video chatting.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Battery Life:</h4>\r\n<p>One of the standout features of the Realme C51 is its <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong>, designed to last all day without frequent recharges. This impressive battery capacity allows users to engage in various activities, including gaming, streaming, and browsing, without the anxiety of running out of power. With efficient power management, the Realme C51 ensures that your daily activities are uninterrupted.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Software and Connectivity:</h4>\r\n<p>The Realme C51 runs on <strong>Android 13</strong>, customized with <strong>Realme UI T</strong> for a smooth and user-friendly experience. This interface includes various customization options, allowing users to tailor their smartphones to their preferences.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Connectivity options are robust, featuring <strong>Bluetooth</strong> for wireless connections, along with <strong>3G</strong> and <strong>4G/LTE</strong> support for fast internet access. While the device does not support <strong>5G</strong>, the 4G capabilities are sufficient for most users. Other connectivity features include <strong>WiFi</strong>, ensuring you can stay connected at home or in public spaces.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Additional Features:</h4>\r\n<p>The Realme C51 is not just about performance; it also offers a variety of features that cater to user needs. With a combination of an attractive design, impressive specifications, and affordability, the Realme C51 stands out in the crowded smartphone market. Whether you are a student, a professional, or someone who enjoys staying connected, the Realme C51 is crafted to meet your demands.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In conclusion, the Realme C51 presents a compelling smartphone option that effectively balances performance and price. Its modern design, vibrant display, capable camera system, and long-lasting battery life make it a strong contender for those in search of a reliable device. The Realme C51 is designed to enhance your daily routine and keep you connected with what matters most.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13 OS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Unisoc Tiger T612 (12 nm)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5 MP, f/2.2, 28mm (wide), 1/5\", HDR, Video (720p@30fps)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Camera: 50 MP, f/1.8, 27mm (wide), 1/2.76\", PDAF 0.08 MP, f/3.0, (depth), LED Flash</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.74 Inches</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh ,Fast charging 33W wired, 0-50% in 28 min</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">128GB Built-in, 4GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 28999, 27999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:46:09', '2025-07-25 16:30:04', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(19, 'Realme C53', 'realme-c53', 2, 53, '<h2>Realme C53 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Realme C53 is a dynamic smartphone that perfectly balances style, functionality, and affordability, making it an ideal choice for users seeking a reliable device. Officially launched on <strong>31 May 2023</strong>, this smartphone is designed to meet the evolving demands of modern consumers, showcasing impressive features that cater to diverse needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Design and Display:</h4>\r\n<p>The Realme C53 features a stunning <strong>6.74-inch IPS LCD display</strong> with a resolution of <strong>1080 x 2400 pixels</strong>, delivering vivid colors and sharp images. With a peak brightness of <strong>560 nits</strong>, the screen ensures excellent visibility even under bright sunlight. The <strong>90Hz refresh rate</strong> offers a smooth scrolling experience, making it perfect for gaming and browsing. The display is protected by <strong>Panda Glass</strong>, adding an extra layer of durability to withstand daily wear and tear.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Measuring <strong>167.3 x 76.7 x 7.5 mm</strong> and weighing <strong>182 grams</strong>, the Realme C53 is designed for comfort and portability. Its sleek profile and modern aesthetics make it a stylish accessory, whether at work or play. The device also supports <strong>dual SIM (Nano-SIM, dual stand-by)</strong>, allowing you to manage both personal and business calls seamlessly.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Performance and Hardware:</h4>\r\n<p>At the core of the Realme C53 is the <strong>Unisoc Tiger T612 processor</strong>, which ensures smooth performance for daily tasks and multitasking. With <strong>6GB of RAM</strong>, this device can efficiently handle multiple applications running simultaneously without any lag. The <strong>128GB internal memory</strong> provides ample storage for apps, photos, and videos, and if more space is needed, the <strong>microSDXC card slot</strong> allows for expandable storage, catering to users who need extra room for their files.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Camera Features:</h4>\r\n<p>The camera capabilities of the Realme C53 make it an attractive option for photography enthusiasts. The rear camera setup includes a <strong>50 MP main camera</strong> alongside a <strong>0.3 MP secondary camera</strong>, enabling users to capture stunning photos with impressive detail. The device supports <strong>1080p video recording at 30fps</strong>, allowing you to create high-quality videos for sharing with friends or social media.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For selfies and video calls, the <strong>8 MP front camera</strong> offers decent image quality. Although it lacks a front flash, it still performs well in well-lit conditions. The ability to record in <strong>720p at 30fps</strong> ensures that your video calls are clear and enjoyable.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Battery Life:</h4>\r\n<p>One of the standout features of the Realme C53 is its <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong>, designed to last throughout the day. This capacity ensures that users can engage in various activities such as gaming, streaming, and browsing without worrying about frequent recharges. The efficient power management system further enhances battery longevity, making the Realme C53 a reliable companion for all-day use.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Software and Connectivity:</h4>\r\n<p>The Realme C53 operates on <strong>Android 13</strong>, integrated with the <strong>Realme UI T</strong> for a user-friendly interface. This latest software version not only provides a smooth experience but also includes various customization options that allow users to tailor their smartphone experience to their preferences.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Connectivity options are robust, featuring <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, <strong>3G</strong>, and <strong>4G/LTE</strong> capabilities. While it does not support <strong>5G</strong>, the 4G performance is sufficient for most users. Additional connectivity features include <strong>WiFi</strong> for internet access and an <strong>FM radio</strong> function, allowing you to enjoy your favorite radio stations on the go.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Additional Features:</h4>\r\n<p>With its combination of impressive specifications and affordability, the Realme C53 stands out in the competitive smartphone market. The modern design, powerful performance, and feature-rich camera system cater to a wide range of users. Whether you are a student, a professional, or someone who enjoys staying connected, the Realme C53 is crafted to meet your needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In summary, the Realme C53 offers a compelling package that balances performance, design, and affordability. Its stylish look, impressive display, robust camera capabilities, and long-lasting battery life make it a strong contender for anyone looking for a dependable smartphone. The Realme C53 is set to enhance your daily life and keep you connected with what matters most.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13 OS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Octa-core (2 x 1.8 GHz Cortex-A75 + 6 x 1.8 GHz Cortex-A55)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">8 MP, f/2.0, (wide), HDR, Video (720p@30fps)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Camera: 50 MP, f/1.8, (wide), PDAF + 0.3 MP, (depth), LED Flash</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.74 Inches, 720 x 1600 Pixels (~260 PPI)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">(Li-Po Non removable), 5000 mAh</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">128GB Built-in, 6GB RAM (+6GB Extended RAM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 31999, 27999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:46:09', '2025-07-25 16:29:18', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(20, 'Xiaomi Redmi Note 12', 'xiaomi-redmi-note-12', 2, 61, '<h2>Xiaomi Redmi Note 12 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Xiaomi Redmi Note 12 is a smartphone that encapsulates performance, aesthetics, and advanced technology in a sleek package. Released on <strong>May 10, 2023</strong>, this device has quickly gained popularity in Pakistan, appealing to users who seek high-quality features without breaking the bank.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Exceptional Display Quality:</h3>\r\n<p>At the forefront of the Xiaomi Redmi Note 12 is its brilliant <strong>6.67-inch AMOLED display</strong>. With a resolution of <strong>1080 x 2400 pixels</strong>, this screen delivers vivid colors and crisp details, enhancing everything from video streaming to gaming. The <strong>Corning Gorilla Glass 3</strong> protection adds durability, making it resistant to scratches and minor impacts. The multitouch functionality ensures that users enjoy smooth navigation, whether scrolling through social media or navigating apps.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Performance That Stands Out:</h3>\r\n<p>Under the hood, the Xiaomi Redmi Note 12 is powered by the <strong>Qualcomm Snapdragon 685</strong> processor, built on a <strong>6nm process</strong> technology. This advanced chipset ensures that the device can handle multiple tasks seamlessly, whether you\'re browsing the web, playing games, or using demanding applications. Coupled with the <strong>Adreno 610 GPU</strong>, users can expect exceptional graphics performance, making this phone ideal for mobile gaming enthusiasts.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With <strong>8 GB of RAM</strong> and <strong>128 GB of internal storage</strong>, this device offers ample space for all your applications, photos, and videos. The <strong>microSDXC card slot</strong>, which uses a shared SIM slot, allows for further storage expansion, giving users flexibility in managing their digital content.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Impressive Camera Capabilities:</h3>\r\n<p>For photography lovers, the Xiaomi Redmi Note 12 features an advanced camera system that ensures high-quality shots. The rear camera setup includes a <strong>50 MP main camera</strong>, complemented by an <strong>8 MP ultra-wide</strong> and a <strong>2 MP macro sensor</strong>. This configuration allows users to capture stunning photographs with rich details and vibrant colors. The <strong>back flash light</strong> enhances low-light photography, ensuring your photos remain clear and bright, even in challenging lighting conditions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>On the front, the <strong>13 MP selfie camera</strong> captures beautiful selfies and supports video recording at <strong>1080p at 30fps</strong>. While there is no front flash, the camera performs well in well-lit conditions, making it suitable for casual and social photography.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Long-Lasting Battery Life:</h3>\r\n<p>The Xiaomi Redmi Note 12 is equipped with a powerful <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong> that provides ample power for day-to-day usage. Users can enjoy streaming videos, playing games, and using various applications without constantly worrying about recharging. The non-removable battery is designed to last, ensuring that the device keeps up with your active lifestyle.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Connectivity and Additional Features:</h3>\r\n<p>When it comes to connectivity, the Xiaomi Redmi Note 12 supports <strong>4G/LTE</strong>, ensuring users can enjoy fast internet speeds for browsing and streaming. The device includes Bluetooth and Wi-Fi options, making it easy to connect to other devices and networks. However, it is important to note that this model does not support <strong>5G</strong> or <strong>NFC</strong>, which might be a consideration for users looking for the latest technology.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The smartphone also features <strong>Hybrid Dual SIM support</strong>, allowing users to manage personal and work numbers conveniently. With dimensions of <strong>165.66 x 75.96 x 7.85 mm</strong> and a weight of <strong>183.5g</strong>, the phone feels comfortable to hold and is easy to carry.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion:</h3>\r\n<p>In conclusion, the Xiaomi Redmi Note 12 is a well-rounded smartphone that offers an impressive blend of performance, features, and style. From its stunning AMOLED display to the powerful Snapdragon 685 processor and versatile camera system, this device caters to a wide range of users.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you’re looking to buy Xiaomi Redmi Note 12 in Pakistan, you will be pleased with its capabilities and performance. This smartphone is perfect for anyone seeking a reliable, stylish, and feature-rich mobile device that meets everyday needs.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 12 OS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Mediatek MT6781 Helio G96 (12 <span id=\"IL_AD8\" class=\"IL_AD\">nm</span>)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">16 MP, Video (1080p@30fps)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Triple Camera: 50 MP, f/1.6, (wide), PDAF 2 MP, f/2.4, (depth) QVGA</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.7 Inches , AMOLED Capacitive Touchscreen, Multitouch</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh , Fast Charging 33W</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">128GB Built-in, 8GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 44999, 24999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:47:32', '2025-06-24 14:50:16', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(21, 'Apple iPhone USB-C Power Adapter (20W)', 'apple-type-c-power-adapter-20w', 14, 42, '<h2>Apple USB-C Power Adapter (20W) Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Apple USB-C Power Adapter (20W) is a must-have accessory for anyone looking to charge their Apple devices quickly and efficiently. Whether you\'re at home, in the office, or on the go, this compact and powerful adapter delivers fast charging for a wide range of devices. Its 20W output ensures that your devices are charged in the shortest time possible, making it perfect for users who need quick and reliable power.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Designed to work seamlessly with <strong>iPhone 8</strong> or later models, the Apple USB-C Power Adapter (20W) enables fast charging, allowing you to charge up to 50% battery in just 30 minutes. This is especially useful for users who are always on the move and need their devices powered up quickly. In addition to iPhones, this adapter also works optimally with the <strong>iPad Pro</strong> and <strong>iPad Air</strong>, delivering efficient charging for larger devices as well.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Apple USB-C Power Adapter (20W) is not limited to Apple products alone. It is compatible with any device that supports <strong>USB-C</strong> charging, making it a versatile accessory for users with multiple gadgets. Whether you\'re charging your smartphone, tablet, or other USB-C enabled devices, this adapter provides a reliable and consistent charge every time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In terms of design, the Apple USB-C Power Adapter (20W) is sleek and compact, making it easy to carry in your bag or pocket. Its lightweight construction ensures that it doesn’t add any unnecessary bulk to your travel kit, making it the perfect companion for frequent travelers. Whether you\'re heading to work, school, or a vacation, this adapter will ensure your devices stay powered up and ready to go.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>One of the key selling points of the Apple USB-C Power Adapter (20W) is its ability to deliver fast charging without compromising on safety. The adapter is designed with Apple’s stringent safety standards in mind, ensuring protection against overcharging, overheating, and short circuits. This means you can charge your devices with peace of mind, knowing that your phone or tablet is safe during the charging process.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For users in Pakistan, the Apple USB-C Power Adapter (20W) is available across various online platforms, making it easy to purchase and add to your collection of charging accessories. Its compatibility with <strong>Apple devices</strong> like the iPhone and iPad, combined with its ability to work with other USB-C devices, makes it one of the most versatile and reliable charging solutions on the market.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Pairing the Apple USB-C Power Adapter (20W) with the right charging cable is essential for optimal performance. While the adapter does not come with a cable, it is recommended to use an Apple-certified <strong>USB-C to Lightning cable</strong> for iPhones or a <strong>USB-C to USB-C cable</strong> for iPads and other devices. This ensures that you get the best charging speeds and maintain the longevity of your device’s battery.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In conclusion, the Apple USB-C Power Adapter (20W) is a high-quality, fast-charging solution that offers efficiency, portability, and safety. It is perfect for users who want to charge their devices quickly without compromising on quality. Whether you need a reliable charger for your iPhone, iPad, or any USB-C enabled device, this adapter delivers outstanding performance. Available for users in Pakistan, it is a great investment for anyone looking for a durable and efficient charging accessory.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With its wide compatibility, fast charging capabilities, and trusted Apple quality, the Apple USB-C Power Adapter (20W) is a top-tier choice for users who want the best in charging technology.</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>20W fast charging</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for iPhone and iPad models</li>\r\n 	<li>Charges 50% battery in 30 minutes (with iPhone 8 or later)</li>\r\n 	<li>Compact, lightweight design</li>\r\n 	<li>USB-C charging compatibility</li>\r\n 	<li>Perfect for home, office, or travel use</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 7999, 5999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:47:32', '2025-09-22 08:54:20', 'NULL', 2550.00, 0),
(22, 'Xiaomi Redmi 13C', 'xiaomi-redmi-13c', 2, 61, '<h2>Xiaomi Redmi 13C Price in Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Xiaomi Redmi 13C is a striking addition to the popular Redmi series, designed for users who seek a balance between performance and affordability. Officially launched on <strong>10 November 2023</strong>, this smartphone is built to meet the diverse needs of today’s tech-savvy consumers, offering impressive features that enhance daily usability.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Display and Design:</h4>\r\n<p>Sporting a <strong>6.74-inch IPS LCD display</strong>, the Xiaomi Redmi 13C provides a resolution of <strong>720 x 1600 pixels</strong>, ensuring vibrant and sharp visuals. The display is not only sizeable but also supports a refresh rate of <strong>90Hz</strong>, making scrolling and animations smoother, ideal for gaming and multimedia consumption. With a typical brightness of <strong>450 nits</strong> and a peak brightness of <strong>600 nits</strong>, the screen remains visible even in bright sunlight, enhancing the overall user experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Designed with user comfort in mind, the Xiaomi Redmi 13C measures <strong>168 x 78 x 8.1 mm</strong> and weighs <strong>192 grams</strong>, making it a convenient fit for your hand and pocket. The dual SIM support allows you to manage two phone numbers seamlessly, catering to both personal and professional needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Performance and Hardware:</h4>\r\n<p>At the heart of the Xiaomi Redmi 13C is the <strong>MediaTek Helio G85 processor</strong>, which delivers reliable performance for multitasking and gaming. The device comes with options of <strong>4GB or 6GB of RAM</strong>, providing flexibility based on your usage patterns. The <strong>128GB internal storage</strong> offers ample space for apps, photos, and videos, while the <strong>microSDXC card slot</strong> allows for expandable storage, ensuring you never run out of space.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Camera Capabilities:</h4>\r\n<p>Photography is one of the standout features of the Xiaomi Redmi 13C. It boasts a triple rear camera system comprising a <strong>50 MP primary camera</strong>, accompanied by a <strong>2 MP macro lens</strong> and a <strong>0.08 MP depth sensor</strong>. This powerful combination allows you to capture stunning images in various conditions, whether it\'s a landscape or a close-up shot. The back camera supports <strong>1080p video recording at 30fps</strong>, providing the ability to create high-quality videos for your social media or personal archives.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>On the front, the Xiaomi Redmi 13C features an <strong>8 MP camera</strong>, which is perfect for selfies and video calls. While it does not come with a front flash, the camera\'s capabilities still allow for clear images in well-lit environments. The <strong>1080p video recording</strong> capability also ensures that your video calls are crisp and clear.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Battery Life:</h4>\r\n<p>Equipped with a robust <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong>, the Xiaomi Redmi 13C is designed to last through your busy day without needing frequent recharges. This powerful battery capacity allows you to enjoy various activities such as streaming videos, playing games, or browsing the web without the worry of running out of power. Its efficient power management features ensure that you get the most out of every charge.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Software and Connectivity:</h4>\r\n<p>The Xiaomi Redmi 13C runs on <strong>Android 13</strong>, coupled with <strong>MIUI 14</strong>, offering a smooth and user-friendly interface. The latest software ensures that you have access to the newest features and security updates, enhancing your overall smartphone experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Connectivity options on the Xiaomi Redmi 13C include <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, <strong>3G</strong>, and <strong>4G/LTE</strong> support, ensuring that you remain connected wherever you go. While it does not feature <strong>5G</strong>, the solid 4G performance is more than sufficient for most users\' needs. Additionally, the device includes <strong>WiFi</strong> connectivity and <strong>FM radio</strong>, allowing you to stay entertained and connected.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The inclusion of <strong>NFC</strong> in certain market regions adds an extra layer of convenience for users who enjoy contactless payments and quick data transfers.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Additional Features:</h4>\r\n<p>With its impressive combination of features, the Xiaomi Redmi 13C offers an excellent value proposition for consumers looking for a reliable smartphone without breaking the bank. From its stunning display and powerful cameras to its long-lasting battery, this device is designed to enhance your digital lifestyle.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In conclusion, the Xiaomi Redmi 13C is an exceptional smartphone that caters to a wide range of users. Its modern design, robust performance, and feature-rich specifications make it a compelling choice for anyone looking to invest in a new device. Whether you\'re a student, a professional, or simply someone who enjoys technology, the Xiaomi Redmi 13C is poised to meet and exceed your expectations.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13 OS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Mediatek MT6769Z Helio G85 (12nm)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">8 MP, f/2.0, HDR, Video (1080p@30fps)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Triple camera: 50 MP, f/1.8, 28mm (wide), PDAF  2 MP, f/2.4, (macro) 0.08 MP (auxiliary lens), LED Flash</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.74 Inches</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh ,  Fast battery 18W wired, PD</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">128GB Built-in, 6GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 31999, 28999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:47:32', '2025-06-24 14:48:23', 'NULL', NULL, 0);
