(23, 'Infinix Smart 8', 'infinix-smart-8', 2, 45, '<h2>Infinix Smart 8 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Infinix Smart 8 is a smartphone designed to cater to users who are looking for a reliable and feature-rich device without the hefty price tag. Released on <strong>09 November 2023</strong>, this smartphone comes packed with essential features that make it a great choice for everyday use, whether for communication, entertainment, or productivity.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Display and Design:</h4>\r\n<p>The Infinix Smart 8 boasts a vibrant <strong>6.6-inch IPS LCD display</strong> that offers a resolution of <strong>720 x 1612 pixels</strong>. With a peak brightness of <strong>500 nits</strong> and a <strong>90Hz refresh rate</strong>, the screen provides smooth scrolling and vibrant visuals. This makes it ideal for streaming videos, playing games, or simply browsing social media. The increased refresh rate enhances the overall experience, ensuring fluidity in animations and transitions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Designed for functionality, the Infinix Smart 8 supports <strong>dual SIM (Nano-SIM)</strong> functionality, allowing users to manage personal and professional contacts efficiently. Although specific dimensions and weight are not available, the phone is crafted to be user-friendly and comfortable to hold.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Performance and Hardware:</h4>\r\n<p>Under the hood, the Infinix Smart 8 is powered by the <strong>Unisoc T606</strong> processor. This chipset is engineered to deliver a balance of performance and efficiency, ensuring that users can navigate through applications and multitask without any lag. Coupled with <strong>3GB of RAM</strong>, the device provides a seamless experience for everyday tasks, from texting to gaming.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The smartphone also features <strong>64GB of internal memory</strong>, which offers ample space for apps, photos, and videos. Users who require more storage can take advantage of the <strong>microSDXC card slot</strong>, enabling them to expand storage as needed.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Camera Capabilities:</h4>\r\n<p>The Infinix Smart 8 is equipped with a dual rear camera setup featuring a <strong>13MP primary camera</strong> alongside an additional sensor. This combination allows users to capture high-quality photos and videos with ease. The back camera supports <strong>1080p video recording at 30fps</strong>, making it suitable for creating shareable content on social media.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>On the front, the smartphone features an <strong>8MP camera</strong> for selfies and video calls. With an integrated front flash, users can take clearer selfies even in low-light conditions. This is particularly beneficial for those who enjoy capturing moments on the go.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Battery Life:</h4>\r\n<p>Battery performance is crucial for modern smartphones, and the <strong>Infinix Smart 8</strong> excels with its <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong>. Designed to last throughout the day, this battery allows users to engage in a variety of activities, such as streaming videos, gaming, and browsing the internet, without frequent charging interruptions. The device’s efficient power management ensures it can keep up with the demands of daily use.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Software and Connectivity:</h4>\r\n<p>Running on <strong>Android 13</strong>, the Infinix Smart 8 offers a user-friendly interface that is both intuitive and customizable. This operating system allows users to access a wide range of applications from the Google Play Store, enhancing the overall smartphone experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Connectivity options for the <strong>Infinix Smart 8</strong> include <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, <strong>3G</strong>, and <strong>4G/LTE</strong>, ensuring that users can stay connected wherever they are. While it does not support <strong>5G</strong>, the robust 4G capabilities are more than sufficient for most everyday tasks, such as video calls, social media updates, and web browsing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The device also features <strong>WiFi</strong> connectivity for high-speed internet access and includes an <strong>FM radio</strong>, allowing users to tune in to their favorite stations. However, the smartphone lacks NFC support, which is worth noting for those who rely on contactless payments.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Additional Features:</h4>\r\n<p>The <strong>Infinix Smart 8</strong> is designed to meet the everyday needs of users. With a focus on delivering essential features without compromising quality, it is an ideal choice for anyone seeking an affordable smartphone that performs well across various tasks.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In conclusion, the Infinix Smart 8 is a versatile smartphone that offers an impressive combination of performance, design, and features. Whether you are a casual user or someone who enjoys multimedia content, this device is equipped to handle your needs efficiently. With its vibrant display, reliable processor, and solid camera capabilities, the Infinix Smart 8 stands out as a strong contender in its price range.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13 OS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Unisoc T606 (12 <span id=\"IL_AD12\" class=\"IL_AD\">nm</span>)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">8 MP, f/2.0, (wide), Video (1080p@30fps)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Camera: 13 MP, f/1.9, 27mm (wide), AF 0.08 MP, (<span id=\"IL_AD3\" class=\"IL_AD\">auxiliary</span> lens), Ring-LED flash</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.6 Inches</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh , 10 watt wired</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">64GB Built-in, 4GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 26000, 24799, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:47:32', '2025-06-24 14:47:30', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(24, 'Tecno Spark Go', 'tecno-spark-go', 2, 57, '<h2>Tecno Spark Go Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Tecno Spark Go is an exciting entry into the smartphone market, designed for users who seek a budget-friendly device that doesn’t compromise on essential features. Launched on <strong>21 November 2023</strong>, the Tecno Spark Go caters to a variety of needs, from communication to entertainment, making it a perfect choice for everyday use.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Display and Design:</h4>\r\n<p>Featuring a <strong>6.6-inch HD+ Dynamic Dot display</strong>, the Tecno Spark Go provides a resolution of <strong>720 x 1612 pixels</strong>. This display ensures bright and vivid visuals, perfect for streaming videos, gaming, or browsing social media. The notch design allows for an immersive viewing experience, making it appealing for users who enjoy multimedia content. The dimensions of <strong>163.69 x 75.6 x 8.75 mm</strong> make it easy to handle and use with one hand, ensuring convenience on the go.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The device supports <strong>dual SIM functionality</strong>, which allows users to manage two different lines seamlessly. This feature is especially beneficial for individuals who balance personal and professional communications.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Performance and Hardware:</h4>\r\n<p>Under the hood, the Tecno Spark Go is powered by the <strong>Unisoc T606 processor</strong>, which delivers a balanced performance for various tasks. With <strong>4GB of RAM</strong>, the device ensures that users can multitask efficiently without experiencing slowdowns. The smartphone is equipped with <strong>64GB of internal storage</strong>, allowing ample space for apps, photos, and videos. Additionally, the <strong>microSDXC card slot</strong> provides users the option to expand storage as needed.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Camera Capabilities:</h4>\r\n<p>Photography enthusiasts will appreciate the camera capabilities of the Tecno Spark Go. It features a <strong>13MP dual rear camera</strong> setup alongside a <strong>0.08MP sensor</strong>, enabling users to capture high-quality images and videos with ease. The back camera supports <strong>1080p video recording at 30fps</strong>, which is ideal for creating memorable moments in video form.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>On the front, the smartphone is equipped with an <strong>8MP camera</strong> and an integrated front flash, allowing users to take clear selfies even in low-light conditions. The ability to record videos from the front camera enhances its usability for video calls and social media content creation.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Battery Life:</h4>\r\n<p>Battery longevity is crucial for any smartphone, and the Tecno Spark Go excels in this area with its <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong>. Designed to last throughout the day, this powerful battery ensures that users can engage in various activities—whether it\'s watching videos, gaming, or browsing the internet—without frequent charging interruptions. The device’s efficient power management system contributes to its extended battery life.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Software and Connectivity:</h4>\r\n<p>The Tecno Spark Go runs on <strong>Android 13 (Go edition)</strong>, coupled with <strong>HIOS 13</strong>. This combination provides a smooth user experience with a user-friendly interface and access to a wide range of applications through the Google Play Store. The Go edition of Android is specifically optimized for entry-level devices, ensuring better performance and efficiency.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Connectivity options for the Tecno Spark Go include <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, <strong>3G</strong>, and <strong>4G/LTE</strong>, ensuring that users can stay connected wherever they are. While the device does not support <strong>5G</strong>, the robust 4G capabilities make it suitable for most everyday tasks, including browsing and streaming.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The smartphone also includes <strong>WiFi connectivity</strong> for high-speed internet access, as well as an <strong>FM radio</strong> feature, allowing users to enjoy their favorite radio stations. However, it’s worth noting that the Tecno Spark Go does not come with NFC support, which may be a consideration for those who utilize contactless payment options.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Additional Features:</h4>\r\n<p>With a focus on delivering essential smartphone features without the hefty price tag, the Tecno Spark Go stands out as a reliable option for budget-conscious consumers. Its combination of a vibrant display, solid performance, and impressive battery life makes it an attractive choice for anyone looking for a dependable smartphone.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In summary, the <strong>Tecno Spark Go</strong> is designed to meet the needs of users seeking a balance between functionality and affordability. With its vibrant display, capable processor, and solid camera features, the Tecno Spark Go is a commendable addition to the smartphone market, catering to a wide range of users.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"> Android 13 (Go edition), HIOS 13</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"> Mali-G57 MP1</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"> Dual SIM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">8 MP</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"> 13 MP + 0.08 MP, 1080p@30fps</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"> 6.6 Inches, 720 x 1612 Pixels</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"> 5000 mAh</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">64GB Built-in, 4GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 26500, 23999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:47:32', '2025-06-24 14:45:29', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(25, 'Infinix Smart 7 HD', 'infinix-smart-7-hd', 2, 45, '<h2>Infinix Smart 7 HD Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Infinix Smart 7 HD is a budget-friendly smartphone that delivers a great balance of essential features for everyday users. Released on <strong>April 14, 2023</strong>, this device is ideal for those looking for a reliable phone without the high price tag. Featuring a large display, long-lasting battery, and decent performance, the Infinix Smart 7 HD is a solid choice for users in Pakistan.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For users seeking to buy Infinix Smart 7 HD in Pakistan, this phone offers an appealing combination of specs and affordability. Whether you\'re a casual user who enjoys browsing the web, social media, or watching videos, or someone who needs a phone for everyday tasks, the Infinix Smart 7 HD delivers all the necessary features.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Design and Display:</h3>\r\n<p>The Infinix Smart 7 HD comes with a compact and sleek design, making it comfortable to hold and use. With dimensions of <strong>163.88 x 75.51 x 8.65 mm</strong> and weighing <strong>196.5 grams</strong>, this phone strikes a good balance between being lightweight and sturdy. It also supports <strong>Dual SIM (Nano-SIM, dual stand-by)</strong>, providing flexibility for users managing multiple numbers or networks.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The highlight of the Infinix Smart 7 HD is its <strong>6.6-inch IPS LCD display</strong>, which offers a <strong>720 x 1612 pixels</strong> resolution. The large screen provides an immersive viewing experience, making it perfect for watching videos, browsing the web, or scrolling through social media. Although it doesn’t feature the highest resolution, the display offers clear visuals and vibrant colors, making it suitable for everyday usage.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Performance and Memory:</h3>\r\n<p>When it comes to performance, the Infinix Smart 7 HD is powered by an <strong>Octa-core 1.6 GHz processor</strong>, which ensures smooth and reliable operation for daily tasks. Whether you\'re browsing the internet, streaming videos, or switching between apps, the phone delivers solid performance. It’s built on <strong>Android 12</strong>, offering an updated operating system that is both user-friendly and responsive.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In terms of memory, the phone comes with <strong>64 GB of internal storage</strong> paired with <strong>2 GB of RAM</strong>. While this configuration may not be ideal for power users, it’s more than sufficient for those who need a phone for basic tasks like texting, calling, social media, and light gaming. Additionally, the Infinix Smart 7 HD includes a <strong>dedicated microSDXC slot</strong>, allowing users to expand their storage up to 512 GB. This is especially useful for those who need more space for apps, photos, and videos.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Camera:</h3>\r\n<p>For photography enthusiasts, the Infinix Smart 7 HD is equipped with a dual rear camera setup. The primary <strong>8 MP camera</strong> paired with a <strong>0.08 MP sensor</strong> delivers decent photos in well-lit conditions. While this may not rival higher-end smartphones, the Infinix Smart 7 HD is perfect for capturing everyday moments, whether it\'s family gatherings or scenic views. The phone also includes a <strong>back flash light</strong> to enhance low-light photography.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>On the front, the <strong>5 MP selfie camera</strong> with <strong>front flash light</strong> is designed to take decent selfies, even in dim lighting. The selfie camera also supports <strong>720p video recording</strong> at 30fps, making it ideal for video calls or quick video clips for social media.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Battery and Connectivity:</h3>\r\n<p>One of the standout features of the Infinix Smart 7 HD is its robust <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong>. This large battery capacity ensures that the phone lasts through a full day of use, even with moderate to heavy usage. Whether you’re streaming videos, browsing social media, or playing games, the phone’s battery will keep you going without the constant need to recharge.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In terms of connectivity, the Infinix Smart 7 HD is equipped with all the necessary features. It supports <strong>4G/LTE</strong>, ensuring fast internet speeds for browsing, downloading, and streaming. The phone also includes <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, <strong>WiFi</strong>, and <strong>FM radio</strong>, offering a range of connectivity options for users. However, it’s important to note that the phone does not support <strong>5G</strong> or <strong>NFC</strong>. Despite this, the Infinix Smart 7 HD provides everything needed for reliable, everyday use.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion:</h3>\r\n<p>The Infinix Smart 7 HD is an affordable yet capable smartphone that offers a great blend of essential features for users in Pakistan. Its <strong>6.6-inch display</strong>, <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong>, and <strong>dual SIM</strong> support make it ideal for those who want a functional phone without overspending. The <strong>8 MP camera</strong> setup delivers good results for casual photography, while the <strong>5 MP front camera</strong> ensures you can capture clear selfies.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For users looking to purchase Infinix Smart 7 HD at the best price in Pakistan, this phone offers excellent value for money. With a long-lasting battery, decent performance, and ample storage, the Infinix Smart 7 HD is designed to meet the needs of everyday users. Whether you’re comparing Infinix Smart 7 HD prices in Pakistan or simply want a reliable smartphone, this device should be at the top of your list.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With its budget-friendly price and well-rounded features, the Infinix Smart 7 HD is a great choice for anyone seeking an affordable smartphone that delivers solid performance for day-to-day tasks.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 12 OS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">2.0 GHz Octa Core</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5 MP</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual 13 MP 0.3 MP, <span id=\"IL_AD7\" class=\"IL_AD\">Dual LED</span> Flash</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.6 Inches</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">64GB Built-in, 2GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 21999, 18999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:47:32', '2025-06-24 14:43:08', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(26, 'Infinix Hot 30i', 'infinix-hot-30i', 2, 45, '<h2>Infinix Hot 30i Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Infinix Hot 30i is an impressive smartphone that balances performance and affordability, making it a fantastic choice for users in Pakistan. Launched on <strong>August 12, 2023</strong>, this device is tailored for those looking for a feature-rich smartphone without stretching their budget. With its sleek design and powerful specifications, the Infinix Hot 30i is designed to cater to the needs of today’s tech-savvy consumers.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Stunning Display:</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Infinix Hot 30i</strong> features a stunning <strong>6.6-inch display</strong> with a resolution of <strong>720 x 1612 pixels</strong>. The display not only delivers vibrant colors and sharp images but also boasts a <strong>90 Hz refresh rate</strong>, ensuring smooth scrolling and a more responsive experience when browsing or gaming. The water drop notch design allows for a larger screen area, making it perfect for watching videos or playing games. Users can enjoy their favorite content with clarity and detail, elevating their multimedia experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Performance that Delivers:</h3>\r\n<p>At the heart of the <strong>Infinix Hot 30i</strong> lies the <strong>Unisoc T606 processor</strong>, built on a <strong>12 nm architecture</strong>. This powerful processor, paired with a <strong>Helio G37 GPU</strong>, allows for seamless multitasking and efficient performance for everyday applications. Whether you are browsing social media, streaming videos, or playing light games, the <strong>Infinix Hot 30i</strong> provides a smooth and enjoyable experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In terms of memory, this smartphone comes with a generous <strong>128 GB internal storage</strong> and <strong>4 GB of RAM</strong>, which ensures that users have ample space for apps, photos, and videos. Although it does not feature a dedicated card slot for additional storage, the existing storage is sufficient for most users. The combination of RAM and storage makes the Infinix Hot 30i an efficient device for running multiple applications without any lag.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Captivating Camera Setup:</h3>\r\n<p>The Infinix Hot 30i features a dual-camera setup on the rear, including a <strong>13 MP primary camera</strong> that captures stunning images in various lighting conditions. The inclusion of a <strong>back flash light</strong> enhances low-light photography, allowing users to take vibrant photos even in darker environments. The camera\'s capabilities extend beyond photography; it also supports video recording, enabling users to capture their memorable moments in motion.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>On the front, the <strong>8 MP selfie camera</strong> is designed for those who enjoy taking selfies or engaging in video calls. The front camera\'s video recording capability ensures that users can maintain a connection with family and friends through high-quality video chats.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Extended Battery Life:</h3>\r\n<p>One of the standout features of the Infinix Hot 30i is its robust <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong>. This powerful battery guarantees all-day usage, allowing users to stay connected without the worry of frequent charging. Whether you are streaming, browsing, or gaming, the Infinix Hot 30i provides enough power to keep you going throughout the day.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Connectivity Options:</h3>\r\n<p>The Infinix Hot 30i is equipped with various connectivity features that enhance user convenience. With support for <strong>4G/LTE</strong>, users can enjoy fast internet speeds for browsing, streaming, and downloading content. The inclusion of <strong>Bluetooth</strong> and <strong>WiFi</strong> further expands the device\'s connectivity capabilities, making it easier to connect to other devices or access the internet. However, it\'s important to note that the phone does not support <strong>5G</strong> or <strong>NFC</strong>, which may be a consideration for some users.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion:</h3>\r\n<p>In summary, the <strong>Infinix Hot 30i</strong> stands out as an exceptional smartphone that combines performance, features, and value. With its impressive <strong>6.6-inch display</strong>, efficient <strong>Unisoc T606 processor</strong>, and dual-camera setup, this device is perfect for users seeking a reliable smartphone that meets their daily needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Whether you are looking to buy the Infinix Hot 30i in Pakistan or exploring options for an affordable smartphone, the Infinix Hot 30i provides everything you need. Its long-lasting battery ensures that you stay connected, while the ample storage and RAM allow for a smooth user experience. This smartphone is designed to enhance your mobile experience without compromising on quality or performance.</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>6.6-inch display with 720 x 1612 resolution and 90 Hz refresh rate</li>\r\n 	<li>Powered by Unisoc T606 processor and Helio G37 GPU for seamless performance</li>\r\n 	<li>128 GB internal storage and 4 GB RAM for efficient multitasking</li>\r\n 	<li>Dual rear camera (13 MP) and front camera (8 MP) for quality photography</li>\r\n 	<li>5000 mAh battery for all-day usage</li>\r\n 	<li>Supports 4G/LTE, Bluetooth, and WiFi connectivity</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<!-- HTML Structure for Styled Product Table -->', 1, 0, 31999, 28999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:47:32', '2025-06-24 14:42:08', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(27, 'Infinix Hot 30 Play', 'infinix-hot-30-play', 2, 45, '<h2>Infinix Hot 30 Play Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Infinix Hot 30 Play has quickly established itself as a strong contender in the smartphone market, particularly for users in Pakistan seeking a reliable yet budget-friendly device. Launched on <strong>May 22, 2023</strong>, this smartphone integrates impressive features, stylish design, and robust performance, making it a smart choice for anyone looking to enhance their mobile experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Dynamic Display:</h3>\r\n<p>One of the first things to notice about the Infinix Hot 30 Play is its expansive <strong>6.82-inch IPS LCD display</strong>. With a resolution of <strong>720 x 1640 pixels</strong> and a refresh rate of <strong>90Hz</strong>, this smartphone provides a visually stunning experience. Whether you\'re browsing the web, watching videos, or gaming, the screen\'s vibrant colors and sharp clarity make every interaction enjoyable. The <strong>500 nits peak brightness</strong> ensures visibility even under direct sunlight, allowing users to comfortably use their phones outdoors.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Power-Packed Performance:</h3>\r\n<p>At the core of the Infinix Hot 30 Play lies the <strong>Mediatek MT6765 Helio G37</strong> processor, built on a <strong>12 nm process</strong>. This powerful processor is designed to handle a variety of tasks seamlessly, from casual browsing to demanding gaming sessions. Coupled with the <strong>IMG PowerVR GE8320 GPU</strong>, the device ensures smooth graphics performance, making it suitable for gamers and multimedia enthusiasts alike.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With <strong>64 GB of internal storage</strong> and <strong>4 GB of RAM</strong>, users have ample space to store applications, photos, and videos. The dedicated <strong>microSDXC card slot</strong> allows for further expansion, providing flexibility for those who need more storage. This balance of performance and storage makes the Infinix Hot 30 Play a well-rounded device that meets various user needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Impressive Camera Features:</h3>\r\n<p>Photography enthusiasts will appreciate the camera capabilities of the Infinix Hot 30 Play. The rear camera setup includes a <strong>16 MP main camera</strong> paired with a <strong>QVGA sensor</strong>, enabling users to capture stunning images with depth and detail. The <strong>back flash light</strong> enhances low-light photography, ensuring you can take clear pictures even in dim environments. Video recording is also impressive, with the ability to shoot in <strong>1080p at 30fps</strong>, making it perfect for capturing memorable moments.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>On the front, the <strong>8 MP selfie camera</strong> is designed for high-quality selfies and video calls. With its own flash light, the front camera excels in low-light conditions, providing users with the tools they need to take perfect selfies anytime, anywhere.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Robust Battery Life:</h3>\r\n<p>A standout feature of the Infinix Hot 30 Play is its massive <strong>6000 mAh battery</strong>. This non-removable battery is designed to keep up with the demands of modern life, providing all-day usage on a single charge. Whether you’re streaming videos, playing games, or using social media, the Infinix Hot 30 Play ensures that you stay connected without worrying about running out of power.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Connectivity and Additional Features:</h3>\r\n<p>The Infinix Hot 30 Play is equipped with various connectivity options, making it a versatile device. It supports <strong>4G/LTE</strong>, allowing for fast internet browsing and streaming. Bluetooth and Wi-Fi connectivity ensure that users can easily connect to other devices and networks. However, it is worth noting that this model does not support <strong>5G</strong> or <strong>NFC</strong>, which may be a consideration for some users.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The phone also includes essential features like <strong>dual SIM support</strong>, enabling users to manage both personal and work numbers seamlessly. The <strong>radio feature</strong> adds an extra layer of entertainment, allowing users to tune into their favorite stations while on the go.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion:</h3>\r\n<p>In conclusion, the Infinix Hot 30 Play stands out as a remarkable smartphone that combines style, performance, and affordability. With its expansive <strong>6.82-inch display</strong>, powerful <strong>Mediatek Helio G37 processor</strong>, and robust <strong>6000 mAh battery</strong>, this device is designed to cater to the needs of diverse users.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Whether you’re looking to buy Infinix Hot 30 Play in Pakistan or simply exploring your options for a reliable smartphone, the Infinix Hot 30 Play checks all the boxes. Its impressive camera system and long-lasting battery make it a practical choice for anyone seeking a versatile and powerful smartphone experience.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13 OS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">MediaTek Helio G37</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">8 MP</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Camera: 16 MP AI lens, LED Flash</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.8 Inches</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6000 mAh, 18 watt wired</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\">64GB Built-in, 4GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 30000, 28999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:47:32', '2025-06-24 14:40:22', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(28, 'Infinix Note 30 Pro', 'infinix-note-30-pro', 2, 45, '<h2>Infinix Note 30 Pro Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>Introducing the Infinix Note 30 Pro, a flagship smartphone that combines cutting-edge technology with an elegant design. Launched on <strong>May 22, 2023</strong>, this device is tailored for users seeking a powerful and versatile smartphone experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Stunning Display:</h3>\r\n<p>The Infinix Note 30 Pro features a <strong>6.67-inch AMOLED display</strong> that captivates with its brilliant colors and sharp details. With a <strong>resolution of 1080 x 2400 pixels</strong> and support for <strong>1 billion colors</strong>, this screen offers an immersive viewing experience perfect for streaming videos, playing games, or browsing social media. The <strong>120Hz refresh rate</strong> ensures ultra-smooth scrolling, while peak brightness of <strong>900 nits</strong> makes it easy to view content in bright sunlight.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Robust Performance:</h3>\r\n<p>At the heart of the Infinix Note 30 Pro lies the <strong>MediaTek MT8781 Helio G99 processor</strong>, a high-performance chipset built on a <strong>6nm architecture</strong>. This powerful processor, combined with the <strong>Mali-G57 MC2 GPU</strong>, delivers an exceptional gaming and multitasking experience. Whether you\'re running demanding applications or enjoying graphically intensive games, this device handles it all effortlessly.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With <strong>8 GB of RAM</strong> and an impressive <strong>256 GB of internal storage</strong>, users can store a vast library of apps, photos, and videos. The <strong>dedicated microSDXC card slot</strong> allows for additional storage, making it ideal for those who need extra space for their digital content.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Exceptional Camera System:</h3>\r\n<p>The Infinix Note 30 Pro is equipped with a state-of-the-art camera system designed to capture stunning images. The <strong>108 MP main camera</strong> captures breathtaking details, making it perfect for photography enthusiasts. Complementing the main sensor are <strong>two additional 2 MP sensors</strong> that enhance your photography experience, enabling features like depth sensing and macro shots.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The back camera can record videos in <strong>1440p at 30fps</strong> or <strong>1080p at 30fps</strong>, ensuring that your memories are captured in high quality. On the front, a <strong>32 MP selfie camera</strong> with a built-in flash light ensures that you can take beautiful selfies, even in low-light conditions. The front camera also supports <strong>1080p video recording</strong>, making it perfect for vlogging or video calls.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Long-Lasting Battery Life:</h3>\r\n<p>Powering the Infinix Note 30 Pro is a robust <strong>5000 mAh Li-Po battery</strong>, designed to last throughout the day. This large battery capacity allows users to enjoy all-day performance without the need to constantly recharge. The non-removable battery is perfect for those who rely on their phones for extended periods, whether for work, entertainment, or socializing.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Connectivity Features:</h3>\r\n<p>The Infinix Note 30 Pro ensures seamless connectivity with support for <strong>4G/LTE</strong>, making browsing and streaming smooth and fast. The device also features <strong>Bluetooth</strong> for wireless connections, <strong>Wi-Fi</strong> for internet access, and <strong>FM Radio</strong> for music lovers. Additionally, this model comes with <strong>NFC</strong> capabilities, depending on the market or region, offering more convenience for mobile payments and data transfers.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Design and Build:</h3>\r\n<p>With dimensions of <strong>162.7 x 76 x 8.2 mm</strong> and a weight of <strong>203 g</strong>, the Infinix Note 30 Pro strikes a perfect balance between form and function. Its sleek design not only looks elegant but also feels comfortable in hand. The dual SIM support (Nano-SIM, dual stand-by) allows for easy management of both personal and professional numbers.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Operating System:</h3>\r\n<p>The Infinix Note 30 Pro runs on <strong>Android 13</strong> with <strong>XOS 13</strong>, offering a user-friendly interface with various customization options. Users can enjoy an array of features, including enhanced privacy controls, improved notifications, and a wide range of apps available on the Google Play Store.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion:</h3>\r\n<p>In summary, the Infinix Note 30 Pro is a powerhouse smartphone that delivers a remarkable combination of performance, camera capabilities, and design. From its stunning AMOLED display to its high-performance processor and impressive battery life, this device is ideal for anyone looking to elevate their mobile experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you are looking to buy the Infinix Note 30 Pro in Pakistan, this smartphone offers everything you need and more, making it a worthy addition to your tech arsenal.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13 OS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Mediatek MT8781 Helio G99 (6nm)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">16 MP, f/2.0, (wide), LED flash, HDR, Video (1080p@30fps)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Triple Camera: 64 MP, f/1.7, (wide), 1/2\", PDAF  2 MP, f/2.4, (depth) QVGA, Quad LED Flash</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.8 Inches</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh ,45 watt wired</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">256GB Built-in, 8GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 46799, 45999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:47:32', '2025-06-24 14:39:26', 'NULL', NULL, 0);
