(29, 'Tecno Pova 5 Pro', 'tecno-pova-5-pro', 2, 57, '<h2>Tecno Pova 5 Pro Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Tecno Pova 5 Pro is an exceptional smartphone that combines impressive performance, cutting-edge features, and affordability. Released on <strong>November 8, 2023</strong>, this phone has quickly gained popularity among users who are looking for a device that delivers powerful functionality without breaking the bank. Whether you’re a gamer, social media enthusiast, or simply need a reliable phone for everyday tasks, the Tecno Pova 5 Pro has everything you need.</p>\r\n<p>For those looking to buy Tecno Pova 5 Pro in Pakistan, this phone offers a robust set of features that make it an excellent option for both casual and power users alike. With its high-resolution display, long battery life, and impressive camera setup, the Tecno Pova 5 Pro is a standout choice in the mid-range smartphone market.</p>\r\n<h3>Design and Display</h3>\r\n<p>The Tecno Pova 5 Pro comes with a sleek and modern design. Measuring <strong>168.5 x 76.5 x 9 mm</strong> and weighing <strong>212 grams</strong>, the phone is solidly built while still being comfortable to hold. It supports <strong>Dual SIM (Nano-SIM, dual stand-by)</strong>, making it easy to switch between different networks or manage separate personal and work lines.</p>\r\n<p>The highlight of the Tecno Pova 5 Pro is its <strong>6.78-inch IPS LCD display</strong>, offering a <strong>1080 x 2460 pixels</strong> resolution with <strong>396 ppi</strong> for crisp and clear visuals. Whether you\'re watching videos, browsing, or gaming, the large screen provides an immersive experience. With a <strong>120Hz refresh rate</strong>, scrolling and gaming are incredibly smooth, enhancing the overall user experience. The display also peaks at <strong>580 nits</strong>, ensuring excellent visibility in bright environments.</p>\r\n<p>This phone is perfect for users who spend a lot of time on their devices, as it offers a comfortable and expansive display that enhances the enjoyment of streaming videos, gaming, and reading.</p>\r\n<h3>Performance and Memory</h3>\r\n<p>Under the hood, the Tecno Pova 5 Pro is powered by an <strong>Octa-core</strong> processor, featuring <strong>2x2.4 GHz Cortex-A76 cores</strong> and <strong>6x2.0 GHz Cortex-A55 cores</strong>. Combined with the <strong>Mali-G57 MC2 GPU</strong>, this device delivers a smooth and responsive performance, allowing users to multitask effortlessly and enjoy high-end gaming with minimal lag.</p>\r\n<p>The phone comes with <strong>8 GB of RAM</strong> and a generous <strong>256 GB of internal storage</strong>. This makes the Tecno Pova 5 Pro ideal for users who need ample space for apps, photos, and files. For those requiring additional storage, the device also includes a <strong>microSDXC slot</strong>, allowing you to expand the memory even further.</p>\r\n<p>Running on <strong>Android 13</strong> with <strong>HIOS 13</strong>, the Tecno Pova 5 Pro offers a clean and user-friendly interface. HIOS 13 brings in useful customizations, enhanced privacy features, and improved multitasking abilities, providing users with a smooth and enjoyable smartphone experience.</p>\r\n<h3>Camera</h3>\r\n<p>For photography enthusiasts, the Tecno Pova 5 Pro offers a versatile camera setup. The rear features a <strong>50 MP wide camera</strong> with <strong>f/1.6 aperture</strong>, capable of capturing detailed and vibrant photos, even in challenging lighting conditions. It also includes a <strong>0.08 MP depth sensor</strong>, helping to add professional-level bokeh effects to portrait shots.</p>\r\n<p>The rear camera supports <strong>1440p@30fps</strong> and <strong>1080p@30fps</strong> video recording, allowing you to shoot high-quality videos for social media or personal use. The <strong>dual LED flash</strong> ensures that low-light photography remains sharp and well-lit.</p>\r\n<p>For selfies, the Tecno Pova 5 Pro sports a <strong>16 MP front camera</strong> with an <strong>f/2.0 aperture</strong>. The front camera delivers great performance for both selfies and video calls, and the inclusion of an <strong>LED flash</strong> means that you can take clear photos even in dim lighting. It also supports <strong>1080p@30fps video recording</strong>, making it a great tool for vloggers or users who frequently engage in video calls.</p>\r\n<h3>Battery and Connectivity</h3>\r\n<p>One of the most impressive aspects of the Tecno Pova 5 Pro is its <strong>5000 mAh Li-Po battery</strong>, providing more than enough power to last through a full day of heavy use. Whether you’re streaming, browsing, or gaming, the phone’s battery life ensures that you won\'t need to worry about frequent charging.</p>\r\n<p>In terms of connectivity, the Tecno Pova 5 Pro is well-equipped. It supports <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, <strong>WiFi</strong>, <strong>4G/LTE</strong>, and even <strong>5G</strong>, making it future-proof for faster data speeds as networks continue to expand. The phone also includes an <strong>FM radio</strong>, making it a great option for those who still enjoy listening to local radio stations. Unfortunately, <strong>NFC</strong> is not available on this model.</p>\r\n<h3>Conclusion</h3>\r\n<p>The Tecno Pova 5 Pro is a fantastic mid-range smartphone that offers excellent value for money. Its combination of a large <strong>6.78-inch display</strong>, powerful <strong>Octa-core processor</strong>, and <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong> make it a great choice for users who need a reliable phone for gaming, media consumption, and everyday tasks. The <strong>50 MP camera</strong> adds further appeal, offering high-quality photography and video recording capabilities.</p>\r\n<p>For users in Pakistan looking to purchase Tecno Pova 5 Pro, this device provides everything you could need at an affordable price point. Whether you’re comparing Tecno Pova 5 Pro prices in Pakistan or simply want to get the best deal, this smartphone ensures you get a high-performing, feature-packed device.</p>\r\n<p>In short, the Tecno Pova 5 Pro stands out as one of the best options in the mid-range smartphone category. Whether you’re a tech enthusiast or a casual user, this phone delivers on every front, from performance to design.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13 OS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Mediatek Dimensity 6080 (6 nm)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">16 MP, LED Flash, Video (1080p@30fps)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Camera: 50 MP, (wide), PDAF 0.08 MP, (depth), <span id=\"IL_AD5\" class=\"IL_AD\">Dual LED</span> Flash</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.78 Inches</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh ,Fast battery 68W wired, 50% in 21 min, 50% in 15 min</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">256GB Built-in, 8GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 41999, 3499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:47:32', '2025-06-24 14:37:39', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(30, 'Audionic Airbud 550', 'audionic-airbud-550', 13, 43, '<h2>Dany Airdots 110 Wireless Earbuds Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Dany Airdots 110 Wireless Earbuds are designed to provide a superior listening experience with a range of features that cater to music lovers and professionals alike. Whether you’re commuting, working out, or enjoying some downtime, these wireless earbuds ensure clear sound quality and a comfortable fit. With an array of advanced functionalities, the Dany Airdots 110 offer excellent performance in a sleek, ergonomic design.</p>\r\n<p>At the heart of the Dany Airdots 110 Wireless Earbuds is the <strong>Bluetooth v5.0</strong> technology, which ensures a stable and efficient connection with your devices. Whether you’re using an Android or iOS device, these earbuds offer a <strong>10-meter Bluetooth range</strong>, allowing you the freedom to move around without losing connectivity. This feature is especially useful when multitasking, as you can leave your device in one place and still enjoy your music or take calls from a distance.</p>\r\n<p>The <strong>ENC (Environmental Noise Cancellation)</strong> technology is another highlight of the Dany Airdots 110. It ensures that background noise is significantly reduced, providing clearer sound and a better listening experience. Whether you’re in a noisy environment or need to focus on an important call, the <strong>ENC</strong> feature helps maintain clear communication.</p>\r\n<p>For those who enjoy outdoor activities or working out, the <strong>IPX5 water resistance</strong> rating offers protection against sweat and light rain, ensuring durability and performance even in challenging conditions. This makes the Dany Airdots 110 Wireless Earbuds a great option for fitness enthusiasts or anyone who needs reliable audio performance during physical activity.</p>\r\n<p>One of the standout features of these earbuds is their impressive battery life. With a <strong>30mAh battery in each earbud</strong> and a <strong>300mAh capacity for the charging case</strong>, the Dany Airdots 110 Wireless Earbuds provide up to <strong>24 hours of playtime</strong>. Whether you’re traveling, working long hours, or simply don’t want to worry about frequent charging, the long battery life ensures that you can listen throughout the day. Plus, with a <strong>charging time of just 1 hour</strong>, you can quickly recharge the earbuds when needed and get back to enjoying your favorite tunes.</p>\r\n<p>Comfort is key when it comes to wireless earbuds, and the <strong>Dany Airdots 110</strong> do not disappoint. The ergonomic design ensures a secure and comfortable fit, making them suitable for extended wear. Whether you’re using them for calls, listening to music, or even watching videos, the <strong>13mm driver size</strong> ensures high-quality sound across all types of audio.</p>\r\n<p>Additionally, the <strong>USB-C charging interface</strong> makes it easy to recharge the case, offering fast and convenient charging. With USB-C becoming the standard, you won’t need to worry about carrying multiple types of cables, adding another level of convenience to the Dany Airdots 110 Wireless Earbuds.</p>\r\n<p>The earbuds are also compatible with both <strong>Android and iOS devices</strong>, ensuring seamless integration with your preferred device. Pairing is simple, and once connected, you’ll enjoy uninterrupted audio quality without the hassle of manual re-pairing, as the earbuds maintain a stable connection with your smartphone or tablet.</p>\r\n<p>Despite the lack of <strong>auto-pairing</strong> functionality, the Dany Airdots 110 Wireless Earbuds offer easy manual pairing, so connecting them to your device is quick and straightforward. Once paired, the earbuds offer reliable connectivity and superior sound performance.</p>\r\n<p>With a built-in <strong>microphone</strong>, the Dany Airdots 110 also provide a hands-free calling experience. Whether you’re taking calls during a workout or in the middle of a busy day, the clear voice quality ensures smooth communication without interference.</p>\r\n<p>Overall, the Dany Airdots 110 Wireless Earbuds stand out in the market for their combination of excellent sound quality, noise cancellation, and water resistance. Their long battery life, comfortable design, and reliable Bluetooth connectivity make them a strong contender in the world of wireless audio devices. Whether you’re looking to buy them for personal use or as a gift, these earbuds are sure to meet your needs, offering an immersive audio experience that lasts all day long.</p>\r\n<p>For those searching for the <strong>best deals</strong> in Pakistan, the Dany Airdots 110 Wireless Earbuds are available from a range of online retailers. Be sure to compare prices and specs across platforms to find the right offer that suits your budget.</p>', '<ul class=\"\">\r\n 	<li><strong>Model</strong>: Audionic Airbud 550 Wireless Earbuds</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth Version</strong>: v5.3 for stable connectivity</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth Range</strong>: 10 meters</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Noise Cancellation</strong>: ENC technology</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Water Resistance</strong>: IPX4 rating</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Battery Capacity</strong>: 40mAh for buds, 300mAh for case</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Playtime</strong>: Up to 7 hours</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Charging Time</strong>: 1.5 hours for earbuds and case</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Charging Interface</strong>: Type-C</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Driver Size</strong>: 10mm</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Microphone</strong>: Quad-mic system</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 4399, 3999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:47:32', '2025-06-24 14:35:54', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
