(38, 'Ronin R-615 2.4 Amp Charger', 'ronin-r-615-2-4-amp-charger', 14, 54, '<h2>Ronin R-615 2.4 Amp Charger Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Ronin R-615 2.4 Amp Charger is a versatile and high-performance charging solution designed to meet the fast-paced demands of modern mobile devices. Whether you’re charging your smartphone, tablet, or other electronics, the R-615 provides efficient and reliable charging with the added bonus of safety features to protect your devices. Its sleek design and dual USB output ports make it a convenient and durable choice for everyday use.</p>\r\n<h3>High-Speed Charging Performance</h3>\r\n<p>One of the standout features of the Ronin R-615 2.4 Amp Charger is its ability to deliver <strong>high-speed charging</strong>. With a 2.4 Amp output, this charger offers quick and efficient charging for both IOS and Android devices. Whether you’re powering up your phone, tablet, or other USB-enabled devices, the R-615 ensures that you spend less time waiting for your battery to charge and more time staying connected. The charger is designed to offer maximum yet safe charging, so your devices are powered up swiftly without any risk of damage.</p>\r\n<h3>Dual USB Ports for Multiple Devices</h3>\r\n<p>The Ronin R-615 features <strong>dual USB output ports</strong>, allowing you to charge two devices simultaneously. This is especially useful for users who carry multiple gadgets or have a family that needs to charge more than one device at a time. The charger is compatible with <strong>Micro USB, Type-C, and Lightning cables</strong>, making it suitable for almost all modern devices, from smartphones and tablets to other USB-powered gadgets. Whether you’re using an iPhone, Android device, or any other electronic gadget, the R-615 ensures quick and efficient charging across the board.</p>\r\n<h3>Auto-ID Protection for Safety</h3>\r\n<p>Safety is a key concern when it comes to charging electronic devices, and the Ronin R-615 2.4 Amp Charger addresses this with its <strong>Auto-ID protection</strong> technology. This feature automatically identifies the device connected to the charger and adjusts the power output accordingly, ensuring your devices receive the right amount of charge without overheating or overloading. This prevents the risk of overcharging, overheating, or short circuits, which can damage both your charger and your devices. With the <strong>R-615</strong>, you can charge your gadgets confidently, knowing that they are protected.</p>\r\n<h3>Elegant and Sleek Design</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Ronin R-615</strong> is not only functional but also boasts an elegant and sleek design. Its compact, minimalist design allows it to fit seamlessly into any environment, whether it’s placed on your desk at work or in your living room at home. The stylish finish and attention to detail make the charger aesthetically pleasing, ensuring that it enhances the look of your space while providing efficient functionality.</p>\r\n<h3>Durability for Long-Term Use</h3>\r\n<p>Durability is a hallmark of the Ronin R-615 2.4 Amp Charger. Built with high-quality materials, this charger is designed to withstand the rigors of everyday use. Whether it’s being thrown into a backpack, carried in a purse, or plugged in and out multiple times a day, the R-615 can handle the wear and tear of daily life without losing performance. Its robust construction ensures that it will last for a long time, providing consistent and reliable charging whenever you need it.</p>\r\n<h3>Compatibility with Multiple Devices</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Ronin R-615</strong> is incredibly versatile in terms of compatibility. It supports various cable types, including <strong>Micro USB, Type-C, and Lightning</strong>, making it suitable for a wide range of devices. Whether you\'re an Apple or Android user, or you need to charge multiple devices with different ports, this charger has you covered. This broad compatibility means that the Ronin R-615 is the ideal solution for families, professionals, and anyone who owns multiple devices.</p>\r\n<h3>What’s in the Box?</h3>\r\n<p>The Ronin R-615 2.4 Amp Charger comes with everything you need to start charging your devices right away. Inside the box, you’ll find:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>1 x Ronin R-615 Efficient Charger</li>\r\n 	<li>1 x Charging Cable (Micro USB, Type-C, or Lightning based on your selection)</li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>High-speed 2.4 Amp charging for fast and efficient power-up</li>\r\n 	<li>Dual USB output for charging multiple devices simultaneously</li>\r\n 	<li>Auto-ID protection prevents overcharging and overheating</li>\r\n 	<li>Sleek and elegant design for enhanced aesthetic appeal</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with Micro USB, Type-C, and Lightning cables</li>\r\n 	<li>Durable build ensures long-lasting performance for everyday use</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 1799, 1245, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:47:32', '2025-06-24 14:20:59', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(39, 'Ronin R-007 Gaming Handsfree', 'ronin-r-007-gaming-handsfree', 9, 54, '<h2>Ronin R-007 Gaming Handsfree Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The <strong>Ronin R-007 Gaming Handsfree</strong> is designed to give gamers an edge in competitive play, offering high-quality audio, superior mic capabilities, and ergonomic comfort. Whether you’re a professional eSports player or a casual gamer, this handsfree promises an immersive gaming experience that takes your gameplay to the next level.</p>\r\n<h3>Immersive Gaming Experience</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Ronin R-007 Gaming Handsfree</strong> is perfect for gamers who want a high-quality audio experience without sacrificing mobility. The internal and external microphone setup ensures crystal-clear communication, allowing you to strategize with your teammates in real time or call out crucial in-game commands. The 3.5mm jack offers universal compatibility with most gaming devices, including smartphones, laptops, and gaming consoles. Whether you are playing PUBG, Fortnite, or Call of Duty, the Ronin R-007 will deliver the sound accuracy needed to dominate the battlefield.</p>\r\n<h3>High-Quality Audio</h3>\r\n<p>When it comes to sound quality, the <strong>Ronin R-007</strong> excels in delivering clear and balanced audio. The handsfree is tuned to capture every detail in the game’s sound environment, from subtle footsteps to booming explosions. This helps players remain fully aware of their surroundings, giving them a competitive advantage. The handsfree features deep bass and crisp treble, which enhances the overall sound quality whether you\'re gaming or listening to your favorite tracks.</p>\r\n<h3>Ergonomic and Lightweight Design</h3>\r\n<p>Designed with long gaming sessions in mind, the <strong>Ronin R-007</strong> has an ergonomic build that ensures comfort even during extended periods of use. The handsfree sits securely in the ears and is lightweight, making it easy to wear for hours without discomfort. The 1.2-meter wire gives you ample room to move around without feeling restricted, and the tangle-free cable design ensures you won\'t waste time untangling knots during your gameplay.</p>\r\n<h3>Plug-in Microphone for Clear Communication</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Ronin R-007</strong> is equipped with a <strong>plugin mic</strong> that offers clear and precise voice transmission, making it ideal for in-game communication. Whether you\'re in a heated battle or coordinating strategies with your teammates, this handsfree will ensure that your voice is heard without background noise or distortion. Its noise-isolating design also ensures that external sounds don’t interfere with your communication, helping you stay focused on the game.</p>\r\n<h3>Durable Build for Everyday Use</h3>\r\n<p>Gaming can be intense, and your accessories need to withstand that intensity. The <strong>Ronin R-007 Gaming Handsfree</strong> is built with high-quality materials that ensure durability, even with heavy use. Whether you’re gaming at home, on the move, or attending a gaming event, this handsfree is designed to withstand everyday wear and tear without compromising on performance.</p>\r\n<h3>Wide Compatibility</h3>\r\n<p>One of the standout features of the <strong>Ronin R-007 Gaming Handsfree</strong> is its compatibility with various devices. The <strong>3.5mm jack</strong> makes it compatible with almost any gaming console, PC, or mobile device. This versatility makes it a must-have accessory for gamers who play across multiple platforms. No need for separate headsets for different devices—this handsfree has you covered for all your gaming needs.</p>\r\n<h3>Sleek and Stylish Design</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Ronin R-007</strong> also stands out in terms of aesthetics. Available in a striking <strong>red color</strong>, it adds a touch of style to your gaming setup. Its sleek and modern design complements any gaming gear and ensures that you look as good as you perform in-game.</p>\r\n<h3>Ideal for Gamers on the Go</h3>\r\n<p>For gamers who are always on the move, the <strong>Ronin R-007 Gaming Handsfree</strong> is the perfect solution. Its portable design makes it easy to carry around, and the plug-in mic can be easily detached when not in use. This handsfree is lightweight and compact, ensuring that it doesn’t take up much space in your bag, making it ideal for travel or gaming on the go.</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>High-quality audio with deep bass and crisp treble</li>\r\n 	<li>Plugin microphone for clear in-game communication</li>\r\n 	<li>Ergonomic and lightweight design for extended use</li>\r\n 	<li>1.2-meter tangle-free cable for easy mobility</li>\r\n 	<li>3.5mm jack compatible with gaming consoles, smartphones, and PCs</li>\r\n 	<li>Durable build designed for everyday gaming use</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 2499, 2095, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:47:32', '2025-06-24 14:19:14', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(40, 'JB/T 9434-2016 Camera Tripod', 'jb-t-9434-2016-camera-tripod', 12, 58, '<h2>JB/T 9434-2016 Camera Tripod Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The JB/T 9434-2016 Camera Tripod is an essential tool for photographers, vloggers, and content creators who are looking for stability and precision in their shots. Designed for both beginners and professionals, this tripod provides a sturdy base for a variety of camera types, ensuring that every shot is stable and clear. Whether you\'re shooting landscapes, portraits, or video content, the JB/T 9434-2016 tripod delivers the perfect balance between portability and durability.</p>\r\n<p>This camera tripod features <strong>3-section aluminum legs</strong> that are both lightweight and strong. Weighing only <strong>0.8 kg</strong>, it\'s easy to carry on outdoor shoots, making it ideal for photographers on the go. Despite its lightweight design, the tripod can be extended to a <strong>maximum height of 139 cm</strong>, giving you the flexibility to shoot from different angles and perspectives. When folded, the tripod is a compact <strong>45 cm</strong>, making it convenient to pack and transport.</p>\r\n<p>One of the standout features of the JB/T 9434-2016 Camera Tripod is its <strong>quick-release leg locks</strong>. These allow you to quickly adjust the height of the tripod and lock it into place with ease. The <strong>3-section design</strong> also ensures that the tripod can be set up quickly and easily, allowing you to focus more on capturing the perfect shot rather than worrying about adjusting the equipment.</p>\r\n<p>In addition to its adjustable legs, the tripod is equipped with <strong>non-slip feet</strong> that provide a stable and secure base on a variety of surfaces. Whether you\'re shooting on smooth floors, uneven terrain, or in windy conditions, the non-slip feet ensure that the tripod remains in place, giving you peace of mind that your camera is safe and steady.</p>\r\n<p>For those who need precise control over their shots, the <strong>bubble level indicator</strong> is a valuable feature. This built-in bubble level helps you ensure that your camera is perfectly aligned for horizontal shots, making it easier to capture balanced, professional-looking images. Whether you\'re shooting stills or video, the bubble level ensures that your camera is positioned correctly, reducing the need for post-editing adjustments.</p>\r\n<p>The JB/T 9434-2016 Camera Tripod is not just about performance; it’s also designed with convenience in mind. The <strong>quick-release plate</strong> allows you to attach and detach your camera in seconds, making it easy to switch between handheld and tripod shots without losing time. This is especially useful for photographers who need to move quickly between locations or shooting angles.</p>\r\n<p>Whether you\'re a vlogger, travel photographer, or simply someone who enjoys capturing high-quality photos and videos, this tripod is an excellent addition to your gear. Its <strong>compact size</strong>, combined with its <strong>lightweight build</strong>, makes it a highly portable option for both indoor and outdoor shoots. It’s compatible with a wide range of cameras, including DSLRs, mirrorless cameras, and even smartphones with the right adapter, adding to its versatility.</p>\r\n<p>Durability is another key strength of the JB/T 9434-2016 Camera Tripod. Made from <strong>high-quality aluminum</strong>, the tripod is designed to withstand regular use while maintaining its stability and performance over time. The robust construction ensures that it can handle the weight of various camera models, providing a secure platform for your equipment.</p>\r\n<p>In addition to its functional benefits, the JB/T 9434-2016 Camera Tripod is also designed for ease of use. The <strong>leg braces</strong> provide added support and stability, while the <strong>quick-release locks</strong> make it simple to adjust the height and position of the tripod. Whether you’re setting up for a quick photo or an extended shoot, the tripod is built to be user-friendly, allowing you to focus on your creative process.</p>\r\n<p>Overall, the JB/T 9434-2016 Camera Tripod is a versatile and reliable tool for photographers and videographers alike. With its combination of <strong>adjustable height</strong>, <strong>non-slip feet</strong>, <strong>bubble level indicator</strong>, and <strong>lightweight design</strong>, this tripod is perfect for capturing smooth, professional-quality images and videos. Whether you\'re shooting in the studio or on location, the JB/T 9434-2016 Camera Tripod offers the stability and control you need to produce your best work.</p>\r\n<p>For photographers and content creators in <strong>Pakistan</strong>, the JB/T 9434-2016 Camera Tripod provides excellent value and performance, making it a top choice for anyone seeking a reliable tripod for their photography or videography needs.</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>Lightweight, portable design (0.8 kg)</li>\r\n 	<li>Max extended height: 139 cm</li>\r\n 	<li>Folded height: 45 cm</li>\r\n 	<li>3-section aluminum legs with quick-release locks</li>\r\n 	<li>Non-slip feet for stability</li>\r\n 	<li>Integrated bubble level for precision</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 0, 4599, 3299, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:47:32', '2025-06-24 14:15:23', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(41, 'Ronin R-9 Type-C Handsfree Crystal Clear Sound', 'ronin-r-9-type-c-handsfree', 9, 54, '<h2>Ronin R-9 Type-C Handsfree Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Ronin R-9 Type-C Crystal Clear Sound Handsfree is the perfect accessory for Android users who value high-quality sound and reliable performance. With its advanced design and Type-C connectivity, this handsfree is tailored for modern devices that no longer support traditional 3.5mm headphone jacks. Offering an immersive audio experience, ergonomic comfort, and noise-canceling capabilities, the Ronin R-9 is a must-have for anyone who demands more from their mobile audio.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Features of Ronin R-9 Type-C Crystal Clear Sound Handsfree:</h3>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n  <li><strong>Type-C Connectivity:</strong>\r\n  <p>As more smartphones and Android devices adopt the Type-C port, the Ronin R-9 is designed to meet the needs of users looking for a high-performance handsfree solution. The <strong>Type-C connection</strong> provides superior sound quality compared to the traditional 3.5mm jack, ensuring that you get the most out of your music, calls, and multimedia content. This handsfree is compatible with all Android devices featuring a Type-C port.</p></li>\r\n\r\n  <li><strong>Crystal Clear Sound:</strong>\r\n  <p>The Ronin R-9 Type-C Handsfree delivers exceptional audio clarity across all sound ranges. Whether you\'re listening to your favorite tunes, watching a movie, or making hands-free calls, you can expect deep bass, crisp mids, and sharp highs. The balanced sound profile makes it ideal for music lovers, gamers, and professionals who rely on crystal-clear call quality.</p></li>\r\n\r\n  <li><strong>Immersive Audio Experience:</strong>\r\n  <p>Designed to provide an immersive audio experience, the Ronin R-9 Handsfree ensures you enjoy every moment of your audio, be it music, movies, or podcasts. Its precision-tuned drivers ensure that every beat, melody, and word is delivered with clarity, allowing you to lose yourself in the sound.</p></li>\r\n\r\n  <li><strong>Noise-Canceling Microphone:</strong>\r\n  <p>With a built-in <strong>noise-canceling microphone</strong>, the Ronin R-9 makes sure your voice is heard clearly during calls, even in noisy environments. Whether you\'re in a bustling office or on a crowded street, this feature minimizes background noise for smooth, uninterrupted conversations.</p></li>\r\n\r\n  <li><strong>Ergonomic and Lightweight Design:</strong>\r\n  <p>Comfort is key, and the Ronin R-9 Handsfree is designed with this in mind. Its ergonomic shape ensures a secure and comfortable fit in your ears, while the <strong>1.2-meter tangle-free cable</strong> allows freedom of movement. Perfect for commuting, working out, or extended listening sessions.</p></li>\r\n\r\n  <li><strong>Durability and Longevity:</strong>\r\n  <p>Built with high-quality materials, the Ronin R-9 is designed for long-term use. Whether you use it daily or occasionally, its durable build resists wear and tear, making it a reliable companion for music, calls, gaming, or video conferencing.</p></li>\r\n\r\n  <li><strong>Compatibility with Modern Android Devices:</strong>\r\n  <p>The Ronin R-9 is compatible with a wide range of Android devices that support Type-C audio. Whether you\'re using a flagship smartphone or a mid-range device, this handsfree offers seamless integration and outstanding sound performance.</p></li>\r\n\r\n  <li><strong>Compact and Portable:</strong>\r\n  <p>Thanks to its compact and lightweight design, the Ronin R-9 can be easily carried in a pocket or bag. It’s the ideal handsfree solution for professionals, students, and travelers who need reliable audio on the go.</p></li>\r\n</ol>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Type-C connectivity</strong> for superior sound quality</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Crystal-clear audio</strong> with deep bass, crisp mids, and sharp highs</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Noise-canceling microphone</strong> for clear calls, even in noisy environments</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Ergonomic design</strong> for comfortable, extended use</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Tangle-free cable</strong> measuring 1.2 meters for hassle-free movement</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Durable construction</strong> ensures long-lasting performance</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Compatible with all Android devices</strong> featuring a Type-C port</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 0, 1699, 1099, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:48:38', '2025-07-25 16:52:14', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(42, 'Samsung 3 Pin Travel Adapter (45W)', 'samsung-3-pin-travel-adapter-45w', 9, 55, '<h2>Samsung 3 Pin Travel Adapter (45W) Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Samsung 3 Pin Travel Adapter (45W) is an essential accessory for anyone who needs to keep their devices charged while on the go. Whether you are traveling for business, leisure, or simply need a reliable charger for daily use, this travel adapter is designed to meet your charging needs with efficiency and convenience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Features of the Samsung 3 Pin Travel Adapter (45W):</h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n  <li><strong>Fast Charging Capability</strong>:<br>\r\n    One of the standout features of the Samsung 3 Pin Travel Adapter is its ability to provide fast charging. With a power output of 45W, this adapter ensures that your devices are charged quickly, allowing you to spend more time using them and less time waiting. It’s perfect for smartphones, tablets, and other compatible devices that support fast charging.\r\n  </li>\r\n  <li><strong>Compact and Portable Design</strong>:<br>\r\n    Designed with travelers in mind, the Samsung 3 Pin Travel Adapter features a compact design that easily fits into your bag or pocket. Its lightweight construction makes it easy to carry around without adding unnecessary bulk to your travel gear. This portability makes it a great companion for anyone who is frequently on the move.\r\n  </li>\r\n  <li><strong>Universal Compatibility</strong>:<br>\r\n    The Samsung 3 Pin Travel Adapter is compatible with a wide range of devices, including smartphones, tablets, and other USB-powered gadgets. Whether you are using a Samsung device or another brand, this adapter will efficiently charge your devices without any issues. This universality means you can travel without worrying about whether your charger will work with your devices.\r\n  </li>\r\n  <li><strong>Input and Output Specifications</strong>:<br>\r\n    The travel adapter operates on an input voltage of 100-240 V, making it suitable for international use. This feature is especially beneficial for travelers who visit countries with different voltage standards. The output of 5V provides a stable and reliable charging experience, ensuring that your devices receive the power they need without the risk of overcharging.\r\n  </li>\r\n  <li><strong>Sleek and Durable Construction</strong>:<br>\r\n    Crafted from high-quality materials, the Samsung 3 Pin Travel Adapter is built to last. Its durable design can withstand the rigors of travel, ensuring that it remains functional for years to come. The sleek appearance also adds a touch of elegance, making it a stylish addition to your tech accessories.\r\n  </li>\r\n  <li><strong>Safety Features</strong>:<br>\r\n    Samsung prioritizes user safety, and the 3 Pin Travel Adapter is no exception. It comes equipped with various safety features to protect your devices from overcharging, overheating, and short circuits. This added layer of protection provides peace of mind while charging your devices, allowing you to use them without worry.\r\n  </li>\r\n  <li><strong>Easy to Use</strong>:<br>\r\n    Using the Samsung 3 Pin Travel Adapter is straightforward. Simply plug it into a power outlet, connect your device using a compatible charging cable, and you’re ready to go. Its user-friendly design makes it accessible for everyone, from tech-savvy individuals to those less familiar with gadgets.\r\n  </li>\r\n</ol>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>Fast charging capability with a power output of 45W</li>\r\n 	<li>Compact and portable design for easy travel</li>\r\n 	<li>Universal compatibility with various devices</li>\r\n 	<li>Input voltage of 100-240 V for international use</li>\r\n 	<li>Durable construction for long-lasting performance</li>\r\n 	<li>Equipped with safety features to protect devices</li>\r\n 	<li>User-friendly design for effortless operation</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 7599, 6599, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:48:38', '2025-06-24 16:16:07', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(43, 'Samsung Galaxy A24 4G', 'samsung-galaxy-a24-4g', 2, 55, '<h2>Samsung Galaxy A24 4G Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Samsung Galaxy A24 4G is a mid-range smartphone that balances performance, style, and affordability. Released on <strong>April 19, 2023</strong>, this device comes packed with impressive features that make it ideal for everyday use, from social media browsing to photography and gaming. With a sleek design and robust hardware, the Samsung Galaxy A24 4G delivers a great user experience for those seeking a reliable smartphone at a reasonable price.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For users looking to buy Samsung Galaxy A24 4G in Pakistan, this phone is a perfect fit for both work and entertainment. It offers powerful features without compromising on style or performance, making it a solid choice in its price category.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Design and Display:</h3>\r\n<p>The Samsung Galaxy A24 4G sports a modern design with dimensions of <strong>6.38 x 3.06 x 0.33 inches</strong> and a weight of <strong>195 grams</strong>, offering a comfortable grip while still being sturdy. It supports <strong>Single SIM (Nano-SIM)</strong> or <strong>Dual SIM (Nano-SIM, dual stand-by)</strong>, providing users with flexibility in managing their network needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>At the front, the phone features a <strong>6.5-inch Super AMOLED display</strong> with a <strong>1080 x 2340 pixels</strong> resolution. This ensures bright, vibrant colors and sharp details, perfect for watching videos, browsing the internet, or playing games. With a <strong>90Hz refresh rate</strong> and <strong>1000 nits peak brightness</strong>, the display is smooth and responsive, even under direct sunlight. Whether you\'re scrolling through social media or streaming your favorite content, the Super AMOLED panel ensures a high-quality viewing experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Performance and Memory:</h3>\r\n<p>Powering the Samsung Galaxy A24 4G is the <strong>Mediatek MT8781 Helio G99</strong> processor, a capable mid-range chipset that can handle most daily tasks with ease. Whether you\'re multitasking or running demanding applications, the phone offers a smooth and lag-free performance. The <strong>Mali-G57 MC2 GPU</strong> further enhances the device’s performance, making it suitable for gaming and media consumption.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The device comes with two memory variants: <strong>6 GB</strong> or <strong>8 GB of RAM</strong>, ensuring smooth multitasking and efficient app performance. With <strong>128 GB of internal storage</strong>, you have ample space for apps, photos, videos, and documents. If you need more storage, the phone also features a <strong>dedicated microSDXC card slot</strong>, allowing you to expand the storage as needed. Whether you\'re a casual user or a power user, the Samsung Galaxy A24 4G can meet your storage and performance requirements with ease.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Running on <strong>Android 13</strong> with <strong>One UI 5.1</strong>, the Samsung Galaxy A24 4G offers a clean and user-friendly interface. One UI is known for its intuitive design and customization options, allowing users to tailor their phone experience to their preferences.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Camera:</h3>\r\n<p>The Samsung Galaxy A24 4G excels in its camera department. On the back, it is equipped with a <strong>50 MP + 8 MP + 2 MP</strong> triple camera setup, which delivers excellent photo quality in various lighting conditions. The primary <strong>50 MP lens</strong> captures sharp, detailed photos, while the <strong>8 MP</strong> wide-angle camera allows for expansive shots, making it ideal for landscapes or group photos. The <strong>2 MP</strong> camera enhances depth, improving the quality of portrait shots. The rear camera also supports <strong>4K video recording at 30fps</strong> and <strong>1080p recording</strong>, allowing you to capture high-definition videos with smooth frame rates.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The inclusion of a <strong>back flash</strong> ensures that low-light photography is not compromised, making this phone suitable for users who enjoy taking pictures at night or in dim lighting conditions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For selfie lovers, the Samsung Galaxy A24 4G features a <strong>13 MP front camera</strong>, which delivers crisp and clear selfies. The front camera also supports <strong>1080p video recording</strong>, perfect for video calls or vlogging.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Battery and Connectivity:</h3>\r\n<p>One of the standout features of the Samsung Galaxy A24 4G is its battery life. The phone is powered by a <strong>5000 mAh non-removable Li-Po battery</strong>, which offers long-lasting performance. Whether you\'re streaming videos, playing games, or using the phone for calls and browsing, the battery can easily last through a full day of use. With the phone’s power-efficient hardware and software optimizations, you won’t have to worry about frequent charging.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In terms of connectivity, the Samsung Galaxy A24 4G offers everything you need. It supports <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, <strong>WiFi</strong>, and <strong>4G/LTE</strong>, ensuring fast and reliable internet connectivity wherever you go. The phone also features an <strong>FM radio</strong> for those who enjoy listening to the radio, though it does not come with NFC or 5G support.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion:</h3>\r\n<p>The Samsung Galaxy A24 4G is an excellent choice for users looking for a budget-friendly smartphone with solid performance and a premium design. Whether you’re interested in photography, gaming, or simply need a phone for everyday tasks, the Samsung Galaxy A24 4G offers a complete package with its <strong>6.5-inch Super AMOLED display</strong>, <strong>Mediatek Helio G99 processor</strong>, and <strong>50 MP triple camera</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For users in Pakistan looking to buy Samsung Galaxy A24 4G, this phone provides excellent value for money. Its sleek design, vibrant display, and long battery life make it an attractive option in the mid-range smartphone market.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Whether you\'re comparing Samsung Galaxy A24 4G prices in Pakistan or looking for the best deal, this phone ensures you get the features you need without breaking the bank. For an all-around performer that doesn\'t compromise on quality, the Samsung Galaxy A24 4G is worth considering for your next smartphone purchase.</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>6.5-inch Super AMOLED display with 1080 x 2340 resolution and 90Hz refresh rate</li>\r\n 	<li>Mediatek Helio G99 processor for smooth and efficient performance</li>\r\n 	<li>6 GB or 8 GB RAM with 128 GB internal storage (expandable via microSDXC)</li>\r\n 	<li>50 MP + 2 MP + 2 MP triple rear camera with 1080p video recording</li>\r\n 	<li>13 MP front camera with 1080p video support</li>\r\n 	<li>5000 mAh battery for long-lasting use</li>\r\n 	<li>Android 13 with One UI 5.1 for a clean and customizable user experience</li>\r\n 	<li>4G/LTE connectivity, Bluetooth, WiFi, and FM radio support</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 0, 52999, 48999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:48:38', '2025-06-24 16:15:32', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(44, 'Oppo A58', 'oppo-a58', 2, 52, '<h2>Oppo A58 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Oppo A58 is a standout smartphone that combines cutting-edge technology with user-friendly features, catering to a wide range of users looking for reliability and performance in a device. Released on <strong>08 November 2022</strong>, this smartphone is designed to meet the demands of modern-day connectivity and multimedia consumption.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Display and Design:</h4>\r\n<p>One of the highlights of the <strong>Oppo A58</strong> is its stunning <strong>6.56-inch IPS LCD</strong> display, which offers a resolution of <strong>720 x 1612 pixels</strong>. With a <strong>90Hz refresh rate</strong> and typical brightness of <strong>480 nits</strong>, this display ensures a smooth visual experience whether you\'re scrolling through social media, watching videos, or playing games. The increased refresh rate allows for smoother animations and transitions, making it particularly appealing for gaming enthusiasts.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In terms of design, the Oppo A58 measures <strong>163.8 x 75 x 8 mm</strong> and weighs just <strong>188 grams</strong>. Its sleek profile makes it easy to handle, while the modern aesthetic adds a touch of elegance. The device supports <strong>dual SIM (Nano-SIM)</strong> functionality, allowing users to manage personal and work contacts efficiently.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Performance and Hardware:</h4>\r\n<p>Powering the Oppo A58 is the robust <strong>MediaTek Helio G85</strong> processor, which strikes a fine balance between performance and battery efficiency. With <strong>8GB of RAM</strong>, multitasking becomes a breeze, allowing users to switch between applications seamlessly without any lag. Whether you’re browsing the web or using resource-intensive applications, the Oppo A58 is equipped to handle it all.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The smartphone also features <strong>128GB of internal storage</strong>, providing ample space for apps, photos, and videos. Additionally, the <strong>microSDXC card slot</strong> allows users to expand storage as needed, making it an ideal choice for media lovers who enjoy capturing high-quality photos and videos.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Camera Capabilities:</h4>\r\n<p>Photography is an essential aspect of any modern smartphone, and the Oppo A58 does not disappoint. The device features a dual rear camera setup comprising a <strong>50MP main camera</strong> and a <strong>2MP secondary camera</strong>. This powerful combination allows users to capture stunning images with great detail. The back camera also supports <strong>1080p video recording at 30fps</strong>, making it easy to create high-definition videos for sharing on social media.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>On the front, the <strong>8MP camera</strong> is equipped to handle selfies and video calls with ease. Although it lacks a flash, the camera still performs well in various lighting conditions, and the ability to record <strong>1080p video</strong> enhances the overall user experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Battery Life:</h4>\r\n<p>Battery life is a critical factor for many smartphone users, and the Oppo A58 shines in this department with its <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong>. This powerful battery is designed to last all day, enabling users to engage in activities such as gaming, streaming, and browsing without worrying about frequent recharging. The optimized power management ensures that the device can keep up with even the most demanding usage.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Software and Connectivity:</h4>\r\n<p>The Oppo A58 runs on <strong>Android 12</strong> with the <strong>ColorOS 12.1</strong> interface, providing a smooth and intuitive user experience. The interface is designed to be user-friendly, featuring various customization options that allow users to tailor their devices to their preferences.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Connectivity options include <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, <strong>3G</strong>, and <strong>4G/LTE</strong>, ensuring that users can stay connected at all times. While the device does not support <strong>5G</strong>, the robust 4G capabilities are more than adequate for everyday tasks, including browsing and streaming.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Additional Features:</h4>\r\n<p>With <strong>WiFi</strong> connectivity, the Oppo A58 allows users to access high-speed internet whenever available. Unfortunately, it lacks features like <strong>NFC</strong> and an FM radio, but the core functionalities remain strong.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Conclusion:</h4>\r\n<p>In summary, the Oppo A58 is a well-rounded smartphone that offers an impressive combination of features and performance. With its vibrant display, powerful processor, and reliable camera setup, it is an excellent choice for users who seek a quality device without breaking the bank. Whether for personal use, work, or entertainment, the <strong>Oppo A58</strong> delivers an exceptional user experience.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13 OS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Mediatek MT6769 Helio G85 (12nm)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">8 MP, f/2.0, (wide), Panorama, Video (1080p@30fps)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Camera: 50 MP, f/1.8, (wide), AF 2 MP, f/2.4, (depth), LED Flash</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.72 Inches</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh, 33W wired, 56% in 30 min</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">256GB Built-in, 8GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 49999, 43999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:48:38', '2025-06-24 16:14:41', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(45, 'Vivo V29', 'vivo-v29', 2, 60, '<h2>Vivo V29 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Vivo V29 is a powerful smartphone packed with premium features, making it an excellent choice for tech enthusiasts. Launched on <strong>July 31, 2023</strong>, the Vivo V29 offers a sleek design, high-end performance, and a top-tier camera system, all of which come together to create a balanced and user-friendly experience. If you\'re looking to <strong>buy Vivo V29 in Pakistan</strong>, this device ticks all the boxes for a high-performing yet affordable smartphone.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Design and Display:</h3>\r\n<p>The Vivo V29 is designed to be both functional and stylish. With dimensions of <strong>164.18 × 74.37 × 7.46 mm</strong> and a weight of <strong>186g</strong>, it fits comfortably in hand while offering a premium feel. The phone supports <strong>Nano-SIM, eSIM, or Dual SIM (Nano-SIM, dual stand-by)</strong>, giving users flexibility in managing their network needs.</p>\r\n<p>The phone boasts a <strong>6.78-inch AMOLED display</strong> with a resolution of <strong>2800 × 1260 pixels</strong>. This ensures crisp and vibrant visuals, making the Vivo V29 perfect for watching videos, playing games, or simply scrolling through social media. The AMOLED screen provides excellent contrast and deep blacks, enhancing the overall viewing experience. The <strong>high-resolution</strong> screen paired with <strong>AMOLED technology</strong> ensures vivid color reproduction and sharp details, whether you\'re browsing the web or watching a movie.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Performance and Memory:</h3>\r\n<p>At the heart of the Vivo V29 is the <strong>Qualcomm Snapdragon 778G</strong> processor, a reliable chipset known for its efficient performance. This processor, combined with <strong>12 GB of RAM</strong>, ensures the phone can handle multitasking with ease, whether it\'s switching between apps or running demanding games and applications. You’ll experience smooth transitions and a lag-free interface, making it a pleasure to use for everyday tasks.</p>\r\n<p>The device comes with <strong>256 GB of internal storage</strong>, giving you ample space for apps, media, and files. Although there is <strong>no microSD card slot</strong>, the generous built-in storage should suffice for most users. Whether you’re a heavy user or someone who stores large files like videos and games, the Vivo V29 ensures you have more than enough space to manage your content efficiently.</p>\r\n<p>Running on <strong>Funtouch OS 13</strong>, based on Android, the Vivo V29 provides a clean and intuitive user experience. The software is highly customizable, with options to tweak themes, layouts, and more, allowing you to personalize the phone to your liking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Camera:</h3>\r\n<p>The Vivo V29 excels in its camera capabilities, offering a <strong>50 MP front camera</strong> for sharp selfies and crystal-clear video calls. The front camera supports <strong>1080p video recording at 30fps</strong>, ensuring that your videos are smooth and detailed, perfect for vlogging or social media content. While there is no front flash, the high-resolution camera makes up for it by producing excellent images in natural light.</p>\r\n<p>On the back, the Vivo V29 is equipped with a <strong>50 MP + 8 MP + 2 MP triple camera setup</strong>, ensuring versatile photography options. The primary <strong>50 MP lens</strong> captures detailed photos, while the <strong>8 MP</strong> wide-angle camera allows for expansive shots, making it ideal for landscapes or group photos. The <strong>2 MP</strong> camera enhances depth, improving the quality of portrait shots. The rear camera also supports <strong>4K video recording at 30fps</strong> and <strong>1080p recording</strong>, allowing you to capture high-definition videos with smooth frame rates.</p>\r\n<p>The inclusion of a <strong>back flash</strong> ensures that low-light photography is not compromised, making this phone suitable for users who enjoy taking pictures at night or in dim lighting conditions.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Battery and Connectivity:</h3>\r\n<p>The Vivo V29 is powered by a <strong>4600 mAh battery</strong>, which offers all-day performance for moderate to heavy use. Whether you\'re browsing the web, streaming videos, or engaging in long calls, the Vivo V29 can easily last a full day on a single charge. The device is also optimized for power efficiency, ensuring you get the most out of its battery life.</p>\r\n<p>In terms of connectivity, the Vivo V29 has you covered. It supports <strong>5G</strong>, ensuring faster internet speeds for browsing, streaming, and gaming. Additionally, it includes <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, <strong>WiFi</strong>, and <strong>NFC</strong>, making it easy to connect to other devices, transfer files, and make contactless payments. The phone, however, does not come with a radio, but this is not a major drawback for most users.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion:</h3>\r\n<p>The Vivo V29 is a standout smartphone that offers a perfect blend of style, performance, and functionality. Whether you\'re a photography enthusiast, a gamer, or someone who needs a reliable device for daily tasks, the <strong>Vivo V29</strong> delivers across the board. Its <strong>50 MP triple camera</strong>, <strong>Qualcomm Snapdragon 778G processor</strong>, and <strong>12 GB RAM</strong> make it a powerful device that competes well with other high-end smartphones in the market.</p>\r\n<p>If you\'re looking to buy Vivo V29 in Pakistan, you’ll be getting a premium device that offers exceptional features at a competitive price. Whether it’s the stunning <strong>6.78-inch AMOLED display</strong>, long-lasting <strong>4600 mAh battery</strong>, or the blazing-fast <strong>5G connectivity</strong>, the Vivo V29 is a reliable choice for anyone looking for a high-performance smartphone.</p>\r\n<p>For users who demand the best in terms of performance, camera quality, and display, the Vivo V29 delivers on all fronts. If you\'re in the market for a new phone, the Vivo V29 should be on your shortlist for the <strong>best features and performance in Pakistan</strong>.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13 OS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Qualcomm SM7325 Snapdragon 778G 5G (6 <span id=\"IL_AD9\" class=\"IL_AD\">nm</span>)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">50 MP, f/2.0, 22mm (wide), AF, HDR, Video (1080p@30fps)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\nTriple Camera: 50 MP, f/1.9, (wide), 1/1.56\", PDAF, OIS 8 MP, f/2.2, (ultrawide), 1/4\" 2 MP, f/2.4, (depth), Ring-LED flash\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.78 Inches , AMOLED Capacitive Touchscreen, 1B, Multitouch</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">4600 mAh , Fast battery 80W wired, 1-50% in 17 min</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">256GB Built-in, 12GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 159999, 143999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:48:38', '2025-06-24 16:13:28', 'NULL', NULL, 0);
