(46, 'M27 TWS Wireless Bluetooth Earbuds', 'm27-tws-wireless-bluetooth-earbuds', 13, 58, '<h2>M27 TWS Wireless Bluetooth Earbuds Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The M27 TWS Wireless Bluetooth Earbuds are the perfect solution for those looking to enjoy high-quality sound on the go. Whether you’re commuting, working out, or relaxing at home, these earbuds deliver a comfortable and immersive listening experience. With a sleek, in-ear design and advanced features, the M27 TWS earbuds offer a fantastic combination of style and functionality.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Bluetooth v5.3 for Seamless Connectivity:</h3>\r\n<p>One of the standout features of the M27 TWS Wireless Bluetooth Earbuds is their <strong>Bluetooth v5.3 technology</strong>. This latest version of Bluetooth ensures a stable connection, allowing you to enjoy uninterrupted music and calls. With a range of up to <strong>10 meters</strong>, you can stay connected without having to keep your device close by. This makes the M27 TWS ideal for use at the gym, in the office, or during outdoor activities.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Waterproof Design for Active Use:</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>waterproof</strong> feature adds another layer of convenience, ensuring that you can use the earbuds during intense workouts or even in light rain. Whether you\'re sweating at the gym or caught in unexpected weather, the M27 TWS Wireless Bluetooth Earbuds are built to withstand the elements, giving you peace of mind no matter where you are.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Reliable Battery Life:</h3>\r\n<p>In terms of battery life, the M27 TWS Wireless Bluetooth Earbuds provide about <strong>5 hours of playtime</strong> on a single charge. While the charging time is approximately <strong>2 hours</strong>, the durable battery ensures that you won’t have to constantly worry about recharging during the day. Though detailed information on the battery capacity of the buds and case isn’t provided, users can expect a reliable performance throughout extended listening sessions.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Comfortable Fit for Extended Use:</h3>\r\n<p>Comfort is a key feature of the M27 TWS Wireless Bluetooth Earbuds. The <strong>in-ear wearing type</strong> ensures that the earbuds fit securely and comfortably in your ears, making them suitable for prolonged use. Whether you\'re using them for conference calls, music, or podcasts, these earbuds stay in place, minimizing any discomfort that can arise from extended use.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Superior Audio Quality:</h3>\r\n<p>Although the earbuds do not have a built-in microphone, they still provide superior audio quality, making them perfect for listening to music, watching videos, or enjoying your favorite podcast. The absence of a microphone and <strong>volume control</strong> is worth noting for those looking for an all-in-one solution for both calls and media.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Seamless Connectivity:</h3>\r\n<p>When it comes to connectivity, the <strong>Bluetooth range of 10 meters</strong> offers you freedom of movement while maintaining a strong connection with your device. The pairing process is simple, and once connected, the M27 TWS Wireless Bluetooth Earbuds offer a seamless audio experience, free of disruptions.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Perfect for Everyday Use:</h3>\r\n<p>Whether you\'re looking for a budget-friendly pair of wireless earbuds or need something that can handle daily wear and tear, the M27 TWS Wireless Bluetooth Earbuds are an excellent choice. Their waterproof build, comfortable design, and reliable battery life make them stand out in a crowded market of Bluetooth earbuds in Pakistan.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Best Price and Deals in Pakistan:</h3>\r\n<p>For those searching for the <strong>best price</strong> and deals, the M27 TWS Wireless Bluetooth Earbuds are widely available across several online stores in Pakistan. They have garnered a positive reputation among users for their affordability and feature set. From music enthusiasts to fitness lovers, these earbuds offer value and performance at an unbeatable price.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion:</h3>\r\n<p>When purchasing the M27 TWS Wireless Bluetooth Earbuds in Pakistan, you can compare specs and features across multiple retailers to ensure you’re getting the best deal. These earbuds are designed for those who value both style and functionality, providing an outstanding listening experience without breaking the bank.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Overall, the M27 TWS Wireless Bluetooth Earbuds stand out in the market for their excellent combination of comfort, sound quality, and waterproof design. Whether you need them for everyday use or occasional workouts, these earbuds offer great performance and are easily accessible across Pakistan.</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Model</strong>: M27 TWS Wireless Bluetooth Earbuds</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth Version</strong>: v5.3 for stable connection</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth Range</strong>: 10 meters</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Waterproof</strong>: Yes</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Playtime</strong>: Up to 5 hours on a single charge</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Charging Time</strong>: Approximately 2 hours</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Wearing Type</strong>: In-ear design for comfort</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Volume Control</strong>: Not available</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Microphone</strong>: Not available</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 0, 2599, 1549, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:48:38', '2025-06-24 16:12:11', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(47, 'M20 TWS Wireless Bluetooth Earbuds', 'm20-tws-wireless-bluetooth-earbuds', 13, 58, '<h2>M20 TWS Wireless Bluetooth Earbuds Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The M20 TWS Wireless Bluetooth Earbuds combine functionality, comfort, and durability, making them an excellent option for anyone looking for reliable wireless earbuds on a budget. These earbuds deliver everything you need for seamless audio experiences whether you\'re commuting, working out, or just enjoying music at home. With solid Bluetooth connectivity and water resistance, the M20 TWS Wireless Earbuds stand out in the market for their convenience and feature set. They are compatible with a wide range of devices, making them a perfect accessory for users of Android, iOS, and Windows platforms.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Bluetooth 5.1 for Seamless Connectivity:</h3>\r\n<p>Equipped with <strong>Bluetooth Version 5.1</strong>, the M20 TWS Wireless Bluetooth Earbuds offer quick pairing and stable connectivity with all your devices. Whether you\'re using a smartphone, tablet, or laptop, these earbuds provide a smooth and uninterrupted connection within a range of 10 meters. You can enjoy high-quality audio streaming with no dropouts, making them perfect for listening to music, making calls, or streaming media on the go.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Water Resistance for Active Use:</h3>\r\n<p>One of the standout features of the M20 TWS Wireless Bluetooth Earbuds is their <strong>IP67 water resistance rating</strong>. This makes them suitable for workouts, outdoor activities, or even in rainy conditions without worrying about water damage. Whether you\'re sweating during a workout or caught in a light drizzle, these earbuds can handle the moisture, making them perfect for fitness enthusiasts or anyone leading an active lifestyle.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Clear Audio and Built-in Microphone:</h3>\r\n<p>The M20 TWS Wireless Bluetooth Earbuds come with a built-in <strong>microphone</strong>, ensuring that your calls are crystal clear. The microphone picks up your voice accurately while filtering out unnecessary background noise, allowing for seamless conversations. The earbuds offer balanced audio quality, making them suitable for listening to music, podcasts, or answering calls. Even though they don\'t feature advanced noise cancellation, the <strong>M20 TWS</strong> still provides a decent sound experience with clarity across different frequencies.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Compact and Lightweight Design:</h3>\r\n<p>The lightweight design of the M20 TWS Wireless Bluetooth Earbuds ensures a comfortable fit, making them easy to wear for extended periods. Whether you\'re on a long commute, working out at the gym, or just relaxing at home, these earbuds provide all-day comfort. The compact form factor also makes them easy to carry around, allowing you to pop them into your bag or pocket without taking up much space.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Decent Battery Life for Daily Use:</h3>\r\n<p>The M20 TWS Wireless Earbuds provide a <strong>3-4 hour playtime</strong> on a single charge, which is more than sufficient for most daily tasks like listening to music during commutes or making calls throughout the day. With a <strong>charging time of just 1.5 hours</strong>, you can quickly recharge the earbuds and get back to using them without long waits. The charging case adds extra power, allowing you to extend your listening time when you\'re on the go.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Wide Device Compatibility:</h3>\r\n<p>The M20 TWS Wireless Bluetooth Earbuds are highly versatile when it comes to device compatibility. Whether you\'re using an <strong>Android</strong>, <strong>iOS</strong>, or <strong>Windows</strong> device, these earbuds will work seamlessly across all platforms. This cross-platform functionality makes them a great option for users who frequently switch between devices or use multiple operating systems.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Micro USB Charging:</h3>\r\n<p>The earbuds come with a <strong>Micro USB charging interface</strong>, allowing for easy recharging. Although it may not offer the speed of more advanced charging interfaces, the micro USB still provides reliable and consistent power for everyday use. You can quickly top off the battery when needed and keep the earbuds charged up and ready for action.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Perfect for Everyday Use:</h3>\r\n<p>Whether you\'re using them for casual listening, taking calls, or working out, the M20 TWS Wireless Bluetooth Earbuds are designed for daily convenience. They offer enough features for most users who want reliable, wireless functionality at an affordable price. Their waterproof rating, Bluetooth connectivity, and compact design make them a solid choice for both active and casual users.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion:</h3>\r\n<p>If you\'re looking for affordable wireless earbuds with solid performance and useful features, the M20 TWS Wireless Bluetooth Earbuds are an excellent option. Their IP67 water resistance, Bluetooth 5.1 connectivity, and built-in microphone ensure a versatile experience across a variety of activities, from workouts to daily commutes. Whether you\'re a music lover, a fitness enthusiast, or simply need a reliable audio companion for everyday use, the M20 TWS Wireless Bluetooth Earbuds are a great value choice in Pakistan.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With seamless compatibility with Android, iOS, and Windows devices, as well as a comfortable and compact design, these earbuds deliver a high level of functionality at a budget-friendly price. Their long battery life, quick charging time, and waterproof design make them a strong competitor in the wireless earbuds market.</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>Bluetooth 5.1 with fast pairing and stable connection</li>\r\n 	<li>IP67 water resistance for sweat and moisture protection</li>\r\n 	<li>3-4 hours of playtime with 1.5 hours charging time</li>\r\n 	<li>Built-in microphone for clear calls</li>\r\n 	<li>Compact and lightweight design for comfortable all-day wear</li>\r\n 	<li>Micro USB charging interface</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with Android, iOS, and Windows devices</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 0, 2499, 1549, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:48:38', '2025-06-24 16:09:41', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(48, 'Solic Headphones SLR-811 MV With MIC Headset SLR811', 'solic-slr-811-mv', 16, 58, '<h2>Solic Headphones SLR-811 MV Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Solic Headphones SLR-811 MV are engineered for audio enthusiasts who seek a blend of comfort, clarity, and functionality. Whether you are enjoying your favorite music, engaging in gaming, or participating in online calls, these headphones are designed to deliver an exceptional auditory experience. With a host of features aimed at providing a rich sound profile, the SLR-811 MV model is a perfect companion for all your audio needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Features of Solic Headphones SLR-811 MV:</h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n  <li><strong>ComfortFit Design</strong>: \r\n  One of the standout features of the Solic Headphones SLR-811 MV is their ComfortFit design. This ensures that the headphones sit comfortably on your ears, allowing for extended listening sessions without discomfort. Whether you’re commuting, working, or relaxing at home, these headphones adapt to your needs, making them ideal for daily use.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Impressive Frequency Response</strong>: \r\n  The SLR-811 MV boasts a frequency response range of 20Hz to 20KHz. This wide range means you can enjoy deep bass notes as well as crisp high frequencies, providing a well-rounded listening experience. Whether you’re listening to classical music, rock, or electronic beats, these headphones reproduce sound faithfully, allowing you to appreciate every nuance in your audio.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>High Sensitivity</strong>: \r\n  With a microphone sensitivity of -58DB and overall sensitivity of -105dB ± 3dB (at 1000Hz), these headphones ensure that your audio is clear and impactful. This sensitivity level allows for accurate sound reproduction, making them suitable for both music and voice calls. You can engage in conversations without worrying about audio clarity, as the Solic SLR-811 MV captures every detail with precision.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Powerful 40mm Speaker Diameter</strong>: \r\n  Equipped with 40mm speakers, the Solic Headphones deliver powerful sound output that enhances your listening experience. These large drivers are capable of producing rich and dynamic audio, ensuring that you get the most out of your favorite tracks. From thumping bass to intricate melodies, the headphones handle a wide range of sound frequencies effortlessly.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Wired Connectivity Technology</strong>: \r\n  The Solic SLR-811 MV features wired connectivity through a 3.5mm stereo plug. This ensures a stable and uninterrupted audio experience, free from the potential dropouts associated with wireless headphones. The wired design is perfect for gamers and audiophiles who prioritize sound quality and reliability in their devices.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Durable Build Quality</strong>: \r\n  Designed with durability in mind, these headphones can withstand the rigors of everyday use. The robust construction ensures that the SLR-811 MV can handle the occasional bumps and drops that come with being on the move. This durability makes them a long-lasting investment for anyone looking to enhance their audio experience.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Versatile Use</strong>: \r\n  The Solic Headphones SLR-811 MV are perfect for a wide range of applications. Whether you’re listening to music, gaming, attending online classes, or making phone calls, these headphones excel in every scenario. Their versatility makes them a must-have accessory for anyone who values high-quality audio.</li>\r\n</ol>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>ComfortFit design for extended wear without discomfort</li>\r\n 	<li>Frequency response range of 20Hz to 20KHz for rich sound</li>\r\n 	<li>High microphone sensitivity of -58DB for clear calls</li>\r\n 	<li>Powerful 40mm speakers for dynamic audio performance</li>\r\n 	<li>Wired connectivity with a 3.5mm stereo plug</li>\r\n 	<li>Durable build quality for everyday use</li>\r\n 	<li>Versatile use for music, gaming, and calls</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 2999, 1799, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:48:38', '2025-08-06 13:58:47', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(49, 'Infinix Smart 8 Plus', 'infinix-smart-8-plus', 2, 45, '<h2>Infinix Smart 8 Plus Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Infinix Smart 8 Plus is a well-rounded smartphone designed for users looking for a reliable device with solid features at an affordable price. Released on <strong>December 21, 2023</strong>, this device brings together a large display, robust battery, and a powerful camera setup, all packed in a sleek and stylish design. The <strong>Infinix Smart 8 Plus</strong> is an ideal choice for those who seek a balanced smartphone experience without breaking the bank.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Display and Design:</h3>\r\n<p>The Infinix Smart 8 Plus comes with a <strong>6.6-inch IPS LCD display</strong>, offering a resolution of <strong>720 x 1612 pixels</strong>. This display size ensures ample screen real estate for browsing, streaming, and multitasking. Whether you’re watching videos or playing games, the display offers decent brightness and sharpness for daily use. The <strong>267 PPI</strong> (pixels per inch) density makes the visuals crisp and detailed, perfect for viewing content with clarity.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In terms of design, the Infinix Smart 8 Plus follows a minimalist yet modern approach. It supports <strong>Dual SIM (Nano-SIM)</strong>, making it convenient for users managing two numbers on the same device. Although it doesn’t come with premium materials or high-end protection, it is sturdy enough for regular use. The phone is lightweight, making it easy to carry around, although exact dimensions and weight are not specified.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Performance and Operating System:</h3>\r\n<p>Powered by the <strong>Mediatek Helio G36 processor</strong>, the Infinix Smart 8 Plus delivers smooth performance for everyday tasks. The chipset is engineered for efficient multitasking, allowing you to switch between apps without lag. Whether you’re browsing social media or playing light games, the Helio G36 ensures a seamless experience. Although it doesn\'t feature an advanced GPU, it is more than capable of handling casual gaming.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The phone is equipped with <strong>4GB of RAM</strong>, which is sufficient for most daily tasks, including web browsing, messaging, and video playback. The <strong>64GB of internal storage</strong> provides ample space for your apps, photos, and media. If that’s not enough, the <strong>microSDXC card slot</strong> allows you to expand the storage, ensuring you never run out of space for your data.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Running on <strong>Android 13 OS</strong>, the Infinix Smart 8 Plus offers a user-friendly interface and access to the latest Android features. The software provides a clean and intuitive experience, with options for customization to fit your preferences. You can enjoy the latest features and security updates that come with Android 13, enhancing your phone’s functionality and performance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Camera:</h3>\r\n<p>The Infinix Smart 8 Plus stands out in its segment for offering an impressive camera setup. On the rear, it features a <strong>50 MP dual camera</strong> system, which allows you to capture sharp and clear images in various lighting conditions. The camera is accompanied by an <strong>LED flash</strong> for better low-light photography, and it also supports <strong>1080p video recording at 30fps</strong>, ensuring smooth and high-quality videos.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The front-facing camera is <strong>8 MP</strong>, ideal for selfies and video calls. While the front camera doesn\'t include a flash, it still performs decently in good lighting. The camera setup is perfect for users who enjoy taking photos and videos for social media, offering clarity and detail that is impressive for a phone in this price range.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Battery:</h3>\r\n<p>The Infinix Smart 8 Plus is powered by a massive <strong>6000 mAh battery</strong>, one of the highlights of the phone. This large battery ensures long-lasting usage, making it ideal for users who need a phone that can keep up with their busy lifestyles. Whether you’re streaming videos, playing games, or making long calls, the Infinix Smart 8 Plus won’t leave you searching for a charger. The battery is designed to last all day with typical usage, making it a reliable choice for users who need extended battery life.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Connectivity:</h3>\r\n<p>In terms of connectivity, the Infinix Smart 8 Plus comes with all the essentials. It supports <strong>4G LTE</strong>, providing fast and stable internet for browsing and streaming. Other connectivity features include <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, <strong>WiFi</strong>, and an <strong>FM radio</strong> for users who enjoy listening to their favorite stations.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>While the phone lacks <strong>5G</strong> and <strong>NFC</strong>, these are not deal-breakers for most users in this price segment. The inclusion of <strong>Dual SIM support</strong> makes it a convenient option for those who need to manage multiple numbers.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion:</h3>\r\n<p>The Infinix Smart 8 Plus is a great option for those seeking a reliable smartphone at an affordable price. With its <strong>6.6-inch IPS display</strong>, <strong>50 MP dual camera</strong>, and long-lasting <strong>6000 mAh battery</strong>, the phone offers a well-rounded experience for everyday use. Whether you’re browsing, gaming, or taking photos, the Infinix Smart 8 Plus delivers satisfactory performance across the board.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you’re in the market to buy Infinix Smart 8 Plus in Pakistan, this phone provides excellent value for its price. The combination of its <strong>powerful battery</strong>, capable camera system, and expandable storage makes it a top choice for users looking to balance performance and affordability. With its reliable performance and modern features, the Infinix Smart 8 Plus ensures you get everything you need in a smartphone without compromise.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For those who prioritize battery life, camera quality, and overall performance, the Infinix Smart 8 Plus is a solid contender in the mid-range smartphone market. So, if you’re considering a new phone, the Infinix Smart 8 Plus should be on your list for <strong>best features at the lowest price in Pakistan</strong>.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13 OS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Mediatek Helio G36 (12 <span id=\"IL_AD9\" class=\"IL_AD\">nm</span>)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">8 MP, f/2.0, (wide)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Camera: 50 MP, f/1.9, (wide), AF 0.08 MP, (<span id=\"IL_AD3\" class=\"IL_AD\">auxiliary</span> lens), Ring-LED flash</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.6 Inches</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6000 mAh, Fast battery 18W wired</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">128GB Built-in, 4GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 27999, 22999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:48:38', '2025-06-24 16:03:14', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(50, 'Oppo A78', 'oppo-a78', 2, 52, '<h2>Oppo A78 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Oppo A78 is a versatile and powerful mid-range smartphone, offering a premium experience with its combination of sleek design, top-tier features, and reliable performance. Launched on <strong>May 30, 2023</strong>, the Oppo A78 stands out with its <strong>6.43-inch AMOLED display</strong>, <strong>Qualcomm Snapdragon 680 processor</strong>, and <strong>50 MP back camera</strong>, delivering both beauty and functionality in one device. Whether you\'re using it for work, entertainment, or capturing your favorite moments, the Oppo A78 offers a balanced experience that fits seamlessly into your lifestyle.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Display and Design:</h3>\r\n<p>One of the highlights of the <strong>Oppo A78</strong> is its vibrant <strong>6.43-inch AMOLED capacitive touchscreen</strong>, offering a resolution of <strong>2400 x 1080 pixels</strong>. The AMOLED display ensures bright colors and deep contrasts, making every image and video look stunning. Whether you\'re streaming your favorite shows or browsing the web, the screen offers a vivid viewing experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In terms of design, the Oppo A78 is built with a sleek and lightweight body, weighing just <strong>180g</strong>, which makes it comfortable to hold for extended periods. The phone is also protected by <strong>Corning Gorilla Glass 5</strong>, ensuring durability and resistance against everyday scratches and drops. Its <strong>dual SIM support</strong> makes it a convenient choice for users who manage both personal and professional connections from one device.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Performance and Operating System:</h3>\r\n<p>The Oppo A78 is powered by the <strong>Qualcomm Snapdragon 680</strong> processor, which offers solid performance for multitasking, gaming, and daily apps. The <strong>Adreno 610 GPU</strong> enhances your gaming experience by providing smoother graphics and responsiveness. With <strong>8 GB of RAM</strong>, switching between apps is quick and smooth, allowing you to enjoy a lag-free experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Running on <strong>Android 13</strong> with <strong>ColorOS</strong>, the Oppo A78 provides a user-friendly interface with customizable features, ensuring a personalized experience for each user. From optimized power management to privacy controls, the software is designed to improve everyday efficiency.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Storage and Expandability:</h3>\r\n<p>With <strong>256 GB of internal storage</strong>, the Oppo A78 offers ample space for apps, media, and documents. For users who need even more storage, the phone includes a <strong>microSDXC card slot</strong>, allowing for expandable storage. This flexibility ensures that users won\'t run out of space when storing photos, videos, or large apps.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Camera:</h3>\r\n<p>The camera setup of the Oppo A78 is a major highlight, with a <strong>50 MP rear camera</strong> that allows you to capture high-quality photos and videos. The phone is equipped with various camera features that let you take sharp images, even in low-light conditions. The rear camera also supports <strong>1080p video recording at 30fps</strong>, ensuring smooth and clear videos.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>On the front, the phone has an <strong>8 MP front camera</strong> for selfies and video calls. While it lacks a front flash, the camera still performs well in good lighting conditions. This makes the Oppo A78 a solid choice for users who enjoy capturing moments on the go, whether through photos or videos.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Battery:</h3>\r\n<p>The Oppo A78 is powered by a robust <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong>, offering extended usage throughout the day. Whether you\'re streaming, gaming, or working, this large battery ensures you won\'t have to worry about running out of power. Paired with the efficient Snapdragon 680 processor, the battery life is optimized for long-lasting use.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Oppo A78</strong> also features fast charging, making it convenient for users who need to quickly recharge their phone during busy days. With this feature, even a short charging session can provide enough power to keep you going.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Connectivity:</h3>\r\n<p>In terms of connectivity, the<strong> Oppo A78</strong> supports <strong>4G LTE</strong>, ensuring fast and reliable mobile internet access for browsing, streaming, and downloading. The phone also comes with <strong>Bluetooth</strong> and <strong>WiFi</strong> capabilities, allowing you to connect seamlessly with other devices.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For those who appreciate having multiple options for entertainment, the Oppo A78 includes an <strong>FM radio</strong> feature, perfect for those who enjoy listening to their favorite stations. However, it does not support <strong>5G</strong> or <strong>NFC</strong>, which are features more commonly found in higher-end models.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion:</h3>\r\n<p>The Oppo A78 is a well-rounded smartphone that delivers excellent performance, a stunning display, and a high-quality camera at a competitive price. With its <strong>6.43-inch AMOLED display</strong>, <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong>, and <strong>50 MP rear camera</strong>, the Oppo A78 offers a premium experience without breaking the bank. For users looking to buy Oppo A78 in Pakistan, this phone provides everything you need in a modern smartphone – from multitasking efficiency to photography, all packed into a stylish and durable design.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you\'re seeking a device with <strong>advanced features</strong> and solid performance, the Oppo A78 is a strong contender. It\'s perfect for those who want a reliable and high-performance smartphone for everyday tasks, social media, and capturing life\'s moments. Whether you\'re looking to purchase Oppo A78 at the best price in Pakistan or want to enjoy its long-lasting battery life and beautiful display, the Oppo A78 delivers on all fronts.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13 OS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Qualcomm SM6225 Snapdragon 680 4G (6 nm)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">8 MP, f/2.0, (wide), Video (1080p@30fps)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Camera: 50 MP, f/1.8, (wide), PDAF 2 MP, f/2.4, (depth), LED Flash</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.43 Inches</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh, Fast charging 67W wired, PD, 76% in 30 min</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">256GB Built-in, 8GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 64999, 58999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:48:38', '2025-06-24 16:01:49', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(51, 'Airbud 450 Wireless Earbuds', 'airbud-450-wireless-earbuds', 13, 62, '<h2>Airbud 450 Wireless Earbuds Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Airbud 450 Wireless Earbuds by Audionic provide the perfect blend of comfort, functionality, and high-performance sound quality. If you\'re looking for reliable wireless earbuds that offer long-lasting battery life, quick pairing, and seamless connectivity, these are a fantastic choice. Whether you are working out, commuting, or simply enjoying your favorite tunes, the Airbud 450 delivers on all fronts. Packed with advanced features like <strong>ENC (Environmental Noise Cancellation)</strong> and <strong>Voice Assistance</strong>, these earbuds are tailored to meet the needs of today\'s active lifestyle.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Quick Pairing and Seamless Connectivity:</h3>\r\n<p>One of the most essential features of the Airbud 450 Wireless Earbuds is its <strong>quick pairing</strong> capability. Equipped with Bluetooth technology, the earbuds pair effortlessly with both Android and iOS devices, allowing you to connect to your smartphone, tablet, or laptop with ease. Once paired, the connection remains stable, ensuring uninterrupted audio during calls or while listening to music.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Long Playtime and Fast Charging:</h3>\r\n<p>With <strong>up to 25 hours of playtime</strong>, the Airbud 450 guarantees extended use without needing to constantly recharge. The earbuds are perfect for long trips, workouts, or simply using throughout the day. The charging case not only provides extra power but also offers a quick charging option. With just a short charge, you can enjoy hours of uninterrupted music or calls. This makes the Airbud 450 a practical choice for users who are always on the go and prefer wireless convenience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Sweat Resistance and Waterproof Design:</h3>\r\n<p>Designed with active users in mind, the Airbud 450 Wireless Earbuds come with <strong>sweat resistance</strong> and a <strong>waterproof</strong> design. Whether you\'re hitting the gym, going for a run, or just taking a walk on a rainy day, these earbuds can handle the moisture without any issue. The durable construction ensures that your earbuds will last, even in challenging conditions, making them perfect for workouts and outdoor activities.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Touch Control for Maximum Convenience:</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>touch control</strong> feature on the Airbud 450 allows you to control your music and calls effortlessly. With just a tap, you can play or pause your music, answer calls, or skip tracks without needing to take your phone out of your pocket. This hands-free control adds an extra layer of convenience, especially when you\'re on the move.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Voice Assistance Integration:</h3>\r\n<p>The Airbud 450 supports <strong>voice assistance</strong>, making it easier for you to interact with your smartphone. Whether you’re using Siri or Google Assistant, these earbuds provide full access to voice commands, allowing you to make calls, send messages, or set reminders without needing to touch your phone.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Superior Sound Quality with ENC (Environmental Noise Cancellation):</h3>\r\n<p>For those who prioritize audio quality, the<strong> Airbud 450 Wireless Earbuds</strong> come equipped with <strong>ENC technology</strong>, which enhances sound clarity by minimizing background noise. Whether you\'re making a call or listening to music, the Environmental Noise Cancellation ensures that you only hear what you want, without distractions from external sounds. The earbuds deliver rich bass, clear mids, and crisp highs, offering an immersive audio experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Perfect Fit for Extended Use:</h3>\r\n<p>The ergonomic design of the Airbud 450 ensures a secure and comfortable fit. Whether you\'re wearing them during workouts or long commutes, these earbuds remain snugly in your ears without causing discomfort. The lightweight build adds to the comfort, making it easy to wear them for hours on end.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>One-Year Brand Warranty:</h3>\r\n<p>Audionic backs the Airbud 450 with a <strong>1-year brand warranty</strong>, giving you peace of mind in case of any malfunctions or issues. This warranty ensures that you’re covered, adding another layer of reliability to these already impressive earbuds.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion:</h3>\r\n<p>The Airbud 450 Wireless Earbuds by Audionic are an exceptional choice for anyone seeking high-performance wireless earbuds with long battery life, superior sound quality, and practical features like sweat resistance, quick pairing, and touch control. Whether you\'re an active user or someone who simply enjoys quality audio on the go, these earbuds have everything you need. With a sleek design and advanced technology, the Airbud 450 is sure to enhance your audio experience in every way.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>By offering seamless connectivity, voice assistance, and reliable durability, the Airbud 450 stands out as a top choice for users in Pakistan. Whether you\'re looking to buy Airbud 450 Wireless Earbuds for your daily commute or gym sessions, these earbuds provide exceptional value with their feature-packed design and extended playtime.</p>', '<ul data-sourcepos=\"31:1-38:0\">\r\n 	<li>Quick pairing with Bluetooth technology</li>\r\n 	<li>Up to 25 hours of playtime with fast charging</li>\r\n 	<li>Sweat and water-resistant for active use</li>\r\n 	<li>Touch control for easy music and call management</li>\r\n 	<li>ENC (Environmental Noise Cancellation) for superior sound quality</li>\r\n 	<li>Voice assistance support for hands-free commands</li>\r\n 	<li>Ergonomic and lightweight design for a comfortable fit</li>\r\n 	<li>1-year brand warranty</li>\r\n 	<li data-sourcepos=\"31:1-31:35\"></li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 0, 3899, 2959, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:48:38', '2025-06-24 15:03:26', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(52, 'Dany Airdots 101', 'dany-airdots-101', 13, 62, '<h2>Dany Airdots 101 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Dany Airdots 101 are designed to meet the demands of modern-day users who require reliable, high-quality audio accessories. Whether you are a music enthusiast, podcast listener, or someone who enjoys hands-free calling, these wireless earbuds offer an excellent balance of performance and comfort. With a compact and sleek design, they are a great option for anyone seeking an affordable yet efficient pair of earphones.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Comfortable In-Ear Fit for Daily Use:</h3>\r\n<p>The Dany Airdots 101 are engineered to fit snugly in your ears, providing a comfortable experience even during extended periods of use. Thanks to their <strong>in-ear design</strong>, they ensure a secure fit, making them ideal for workouts, daily commutes, or just casual listening at home. The lightweight build means you won’t experience any discomfort even after prolonged use, and the earbuds stay in place whether you\'re walking, running, or sitting still.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>High-Quality Sound Performance:</h3>\r\n<p>Featuring <strong>Bluetooth Version 5.3</strong>, the Dany Airdots 101 ensures stable and seamless wireless connectivity with your devices. Whether you’re listening to your favorite songs or making a call, the sound quality remains crisp and clear. The Bluetooth range covers a wide frequency range from <strong>20Hz to 20,000Hz</strong>, allowing the earbuds to deliver a well-balanced sound output with deep bass and clear treble. These airdots are designed to provide an immersive audio experience, making your music sound lively and vibrant.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Long Battery Life:</h3>\r\n<p>A key highlight of the Dany Airdots 101 is its extended battery life. With a <strong>playtime of up to 6 hours</strong> on a single charge, you can enjoy continuous music playback, whether you’re on a long trip or just relaxing at home. The quick <strong>charging time of 1.5 hours</strong> ensures that your earbuds are ready to go in no time. The long battery life makes these wireless earbuds suitable for users who are always on the go, allowing them to enjoy an uninterrupted listening experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Waterproof Design for Active Lifestyles:</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>IPX4 waterproof rating</strong> makes the Dany Airdots 101 resistant to water splashes and sweat, making them perfect for outdoor activities like running, jogging, or gym sessions. You can confidently wear them during workouts without worrying about damage from sweat or light rain. Their robust build ensures they can withstand daily wear and tear while still maintaining peak performance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Hands-Free Calling with Built-In Microphone:</h3>\r\n<p>The Dany Airdots 101 are equipped with a built-in <strong>microphone</strong>, allowing you to take calls without needing to pull out your phone. The sound clarity on calls is top-notch, making it easier to communicate even in noisy environments. The <strong>volume control feature</strong> adds to the convenience, allowing you to adjust the volume directly from the earbuds without touching your device.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Seamless Connectivity:</h3>\r\n<p>These earbuds are compatible with a wide range of devices, including both Android and iOS smartphones. Thanks to the advanced <strong>Bluetooth 5.3</strong> technology, pairing the earbuds with your phone, tablet, or other devices is quick and easy. The connection remains stable within a range of several meters, giving you the freedom to move around without losing your audio connection.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Ideal for Active and Casual Users:</h3>\r\n<p>Whether you are a fitness enthusiast looking for a reliable pair of earbuds for workouts or someone who enjoys listening to music on the go, the Dany Airdots 101 offer the perfect solution. Their <strong>waterproof design</strong>, extended battery life, and superior sound quality make them a versatile choice for anyone looking for wireless earbuds that deliver both comfort and performance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion:</h3>\r\n<p>The Dany Airdots 101 are more than just wireless earbuds—they’re a lifestyle accessory for those who prioritize comfort, sound quality, and convenience. Their lightweight and ergonomic design ensure a perfect fit, while the long battery life and waterproof features make them suitable for everyday use, regardless of the environment. Whether you’re using them for casual listening, hands-free calling, or working out, the Dany Airdots 101 are an excellent choice for both active and casual users.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Enhance your audio experience and enjoy the freedom of wireless listening with Dany Airdots 101. Pair them easily with your smartphone and take advantage of their advanced features, making your daily routine more enjoyable.</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>In-ear design for a comfortable and secure fit</li>\r\n 	<li>Bluetooth 5.3 for stable and quick connectivity</li>\r\n 	<li>Up to 6 hours of playtime on a single charge</li>\r\n 	<li>Waterproof (IPX4 rating) for sweat and splash resistance</li>\r\n 	<li>Built-in microphone for hands-free calls</li>\r\n 	<li>Fast charging time of 1.5 hours</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with Android and iOS devices</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 0, 3499, 2999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:48:38', '2025-06-24 15:02:20', 'NULL', NULL, 0);
