(53, 'Infinix Hot 40i', 'infinix-hot-40i', 2, 45, '<h2>Infinix Hot 40i Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Infinix Hot 40i is an exciting addition to the smartphone market, designed to meet the demands of users seeking functionality and style without straining their budgets. Officially launched on <strong>05 December 2023</strong>, this smartphone brings a host of impressive features and specifications that enhance the overall user experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Display and Design:</h4>\r\n<p>The Infinix Hot 40i features a vibrant <strong>6.56-inch IPS LCD</strong> display, boasting a resolution of <strong>720 x 1612 pixels</strong>. With a <strong>90Hz refresh rate</strong> and a peak brightness of <strong>480 nits</strong>, this display ensures smooth scrolling and a bright, engaging visual experience. The screen size is ideal for various tasks, from watching videos to browsing social media, making it perfect for entertainment on the go.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In terms of design, the Infinix Hot 40i maintains a sleek profile, measuring <strong>163.6 x 75.6 x 8.3 mm</strong> and weighing just <strong>190 grams</strong>. This combination of dimensions and weight provides an ergonomic feel, allowing users to hold the phone comfortably during extended use.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Performance and Hardware:</h4>\r\n<p>At the heart of the Infinix Hot 40i is the efficient <strong>Unisoc T606</strong> processor, which offers a balance of performance and power efficiency. This processor is capable of handling daily tasks, such as browsing, streaming, and gaming, without any significant lag. Coupled with <strong>8GB of RAM</strong>, multitasking becomes effortless, allowing users to run multiple applications simultaneously.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The device offers generous <strong>256GB of internal memory</strong>, providing ample space for storing apps, photos, and videos. Additionally, the <strong>microSDXC card slot</strong> allows users to expand storage, accommodating even more data as needed.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Camera Capabilities:</h4>\r\n<p>Photography enthusiasts will appreciate the camera capabilities of the Infinix Hot 40i. The rear camera setup features a <strong>50MP main camera</strong> and an additional <strong>0.08MP sensor</strong>, providing versatility for capturing various types of images. The back camera supports <strong>1080p video recording at 30fps</strong>, enabling users to create high-definition videos effortlessly.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>On the front, the <strong>32MP camera</strong> comes with a dedicated flash, ensuring bright and clear selfies, even in low-light conditions. It also supports <strong>1080p video recording</strong>, making it perfect for video calls and sharing moments on social media.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Battery Life:</h4>\r\n<p>Equipped with a powerful <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong>, the Infinix Hot 40i is built to last. This large battery capacity ensures that users can stay connected throughout the day without constantly searching for a charger. Whether you\'re browsing the web, streaming videos, or playing games, the long-lasting battery provides the freedom to enjoy your device without interruptions.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Software and Connectivity:</h4>\r\n<p>Running on <strong>Android 13 with XOS 13</strong>, the Infinix Hot 40i offers a user-friendly interface that enhances the overall experience. The XOS interface provides customization options, allowing users to tailor their devices to their preferences.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Connectivity features include <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, <strong>3G</strong>, and <strong>4G/LTE</strong> capabilities, ensuring users remain connected. While the device does not support <strong>5G</strong>, the robust 4G connectivity is more than sufficient for most daily tasks, including browsing and streaming. Additional features include <strong>WiFi</strong>, <strong>FM radio</strong>, and optional <strong>NFC</strong>, depending on the market or region.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Additional Features:</h4>\r\n<p>The Infinix Hot 40i is designed with dual SIM support, allowing users to manage both personal and work contacts easily. This feature is particularly useful for professionals who want to separate their work and personal life seamlessly.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In summary, the Infinix Hot 40i stands out as an affordable smartphone option that doesn’t compromise on features or performance. With its impressive display, powerful processor, versatile camera setup, and long-lasting battery, it caters to the needs of modern users looking for a reliable device. Whether you are a student, professional, or casual user, the <strong>Infinix Hot 40i</strong> provides an excellent balance of performance and value, making it a strong contender in the budget smartphone category.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13 OS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">2.0 GHz Octa Core</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">8 MP</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Triple Camera: 50 MP</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.6 Inches</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">128GB Built-in, 8GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 34999, 33999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:48:38', '2025-06-24 15:00:55', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(54, 'Infinix Smart 8 Pro', 'infinix-smart-8-pro', 2, 45, '<h2>Infinix Smart 8 Pro Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Infinix Smart 8 Pro is a remarkable smartphone designed to cater to the needs of budget-conscious users who demand quality and performance. Officially launched on <strong>23 January 2024</strong>, this device blends modern technology with affordability, making it an attractive option for anyone looking to enhance their mobile experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Display and Design:</h4>\r\n<p>The Infinix Smart 8 Pro boasts a vibrant <strong>6.62-inch IPS LCD display</strong> with a resolution of <strong>720 x 1612 pixels</strong>. This screen size strikes a perfect balance between usability and comfort, offering ample space for viewing content, playing games, or engaging in social media. The IPS LCD technology ensures that colors are vivid and visuals are sharp, providing a delightful experience for streaming videos or browsing photos.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The design of the Smart 8 Pro reflects Infinix’s commitment to modern aesthetics, with smooth lines and a sleek finish. Although specific dimensions and weight details are not available, the phone\'s ergonomic design ensures it fits comfortably in your hand.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Performance and Hardware:</h4>\r\n<p>At the core of the Infinix Smart 8 Pro is the powerful <strong>Mediatek Helio G36</strong> processor. This processor is optimized for everyday tasks, allowing users to navigate through apps, stream videos, and play games smoothly. With <strong>4GB of RAM</strong>, multitasking becomes effortless, enabling users to switch between applications without lag.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Storage is a crucial factor for any smartphone, and the Infinix Smart 8 Pro does not disappoint with its <strong>128GB internal memory</strong>. This ample storage capacity is perfect for saving photos, videos, and applications. Furthermore, the device features a dedicated <strong>microSDXC card slot</strong>, allowing users to expand their storage effortlessly and store even more data.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Camera Capabilities:</h4>\r\n<p>The Infinix Smart 8 Pro stands out with its impressive camera setup. On the rear, it features a dual-camera system comprising a <strong>50MP main camera</strong> and an <strong>AI camera</strong> that enhances photo quality. This combination allows users to capture stunning images with clarity and detail, perfect for any occasion. The device supports <strong>1080p video recording at 30fps</strong>, making it suitable for shooting high-definition videos to share with friends and family.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For selfies and video calls, the <strong>8MP front camera</strong> is equipped with an LED flash, ensuring that your selfies are bright and vibrant even in low-light conditions. Whether you’re capturing moments with friends or attending a video conference, the Smart 8 Pro’s camera capabilities meet your needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Battery Life:</h4>\r\n<p>A standout feature of the Infinix Smart 8 Pro is its robust <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong>. This powerful battery is designed to keep you connected throughout the day, supporting your various tasks without the constant need for recharging. Whether you’re browsing the web, streaming videos, or chatting with friends, the long-lasting battery ensures that you stay powered up during your activities.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Software and Connectivity:</h4>\r\n<p>Running on <strong>Android 13 OS</strong>, the Infinix Smart 8 Pro offers an intuitive user interface and access to a wide range of applications through the Google Play Store. The Android experience ensures users can customize their devices to suit their preferences, enhancing overall usability.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Connectivity options are plentiful, as the Smart 8 Pro supports <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, <strong>3G</strong>, and <strong>4G/LTE</strong> capabilities, ensuring users remain connected at all times. Although the device lacks <strong>5G</strong> support, the robust 4G connectivity is adequate for most daily tasks, allowing for smooth browsing and streaming experiences. Additional features include <strong>WiFi</strong> connectivity, ensuring that you can connect to networks easily.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Additional Features:</h4>\r\n<p>While the Infinix Smart 8 Pro does not feature NFC or radio functionality, its range of capabilities is more than sufficient for everyday use. The dual nano SIM support allows users to manage both personal and work contacts seamlessly, making it ideal for professionals and students alike.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Conclusion:</h4>\r\n<p>The Infinix Smart 8 Pro is a well-rounded smartphone that provides excellent value for money. With its large display, capable processor, impressive camera setup, and long-lasting battery, it meets the demands of modern users. Whether you\'re looking for a reliable device for communication, entertainment, or productivity, the Smart 8 Pro delivers a satisfying experience without breaking the bank.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13 (Go Edition)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Mediatek Helio G36 (12 nm)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">8 MP, f/2.0, (wide)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Camera: 50 MP, f/1.9, (wide), AF 0.08 MP, (<span id=\"IL_AD4\" class=\"IL_AD\">auxiliary</span> lens), Ring-LED flash</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.6 Inches</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh,Battery charging 10W wired</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">128GB Built-in, 4GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 27999, 24999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:48:38', '2025-06-24 14:59:16', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(55, 'Samsung Galaxy A05s', 'samsung-galaxy-a05s', 2, 55, '<h2>Samsung Galaxy A05s price in Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Samsung Galaxy A05s is a feature-rich smartphone designed to provide an exceptional user experience at an attractive price point. Officially released on <strong>09 February 2024</strong>, the Galaxy A05s combines modern technology with an elegant design, making it a great choice for anyone looking for a reliable device.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Display and Design:</h4>\r\n<p>The Samsung Galaxy A05s features a generous <strong>6.7-inch PLS LCD display</strong> with a resolution of <strong>1080 x 2400 pixels</strong>. This high-definition screen offers vibrant colors and sharp details, perfect for watching videos, playing games, and browsing the web. The slim bezels enhance the immersive viewing experience, allowing users to enjoy their content without distractions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With dimensions of <strong>168.0 x 77.8 x 8.8 mm</strong> and a weight of <strong>194 grams</strong>, the Galaxy A05s is designed to fit comfortably in your hand. Its sleek profile not only looks stylish but also makes it easy to handle. The phone\'s design reflects Samsung\'s commitment to quality and aesthetics, providing a modern touch to your everyday tech.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Performance and Hardware:</h4>\r\n<p>At the heart of the Samsung Galaxy A05s is the powerful <strong>Qualcomm Snapdragon 680 4G</strong> processor, built on a <strong>6 nm</strong> architecture. This chipset delivers excellent performance, allowing users to multitask efficiently and run demanding applications smoothly. Coupled with <strong>4GB of RAM</strong>, the device ensures a seamless user experience whether you\'re streaming, gaming, or using productivity apps.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Storage is never an issue with the <strong>128GB internal memory</strong>, providing ample space for all your photos, videos, and applications. Moreover, the device includes a <strong>MicroSD card slot</strong> that supports expandable storage of up to <strong>1TB</strong>, allowing you to store even more data without worrying about running out of space.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Camera Capabilities:</h4>\r\n<p>The Samsung Galaxy A05s excels in photography with its impressive camera setup. The rear camera system features a <strong>50MP main camera</strong>, accompanied by a <strong>2MP macro camera</strong> and a <strong>2MP depth sensor</strong>. This combination allows users to capture stunning photos with rich detail and vibrant colors. The <strong>FHD video recording</strong> capability at <strong>1920 x 1080 @ 60fps</strong> ensures that your videos are smooth and clear, making it perfect for documenting your life\'s moments.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>On the front, the <strong>13MP camera</strong> is ideal for selfies and video calls, providing clarity and sharpness that users will appreciate. Although the front flash is not available, the camera still performs well in various lighting conditions, ensuring you look your best in every shot.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Battery and Power:</h4>\r\n<p>One of the standout features of the Samsung Galaxy A05s is its robust <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong>. This powerful battery is designed to keep you connected throughout the day, even with heavy usage. Whether you\'re streaming videos, playing games, or browsing social media, you can count on the Galaxy A05s to last. This means less time worrying about charging and more time enjoying what you love.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Software and Features:</h4>\r\n<p>The Samsung Galaxy A05s runs on Android, ensuring a user-friendly experience with access to a wide array of applications and services. The intuitive interface makes navigation simple, and users can customize their device to suit their preferences.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In terms of connectivity, the Galaxy A05s is equipped with <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, <strong>3G</strong>, and <strong>4G LTE</strong> capabilities, ensuring you stay connected wherever you go. While it lacks <strong>5G support</strong>, the 4G capabilities are more than sufficient for most users\' daily tasks. Additional features include <strong>WiFi</strong> connectivity and a back flash for the rear camera, enhancing its versatility for everyday use.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Additional Features:</h4>\r\n<p>The Samsung Galaxy A05s has been designed with user convenience in mind. It supports dual SIM functionality, allowing users to manage personal and work numbers seamlessly. The device does not include NFC or a radio, but its extensive range of features more than compensates for these omissions.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Conclusion:</h4>\r\n<p>The Samsung Galaxy A05s is an excellent smartphone that offers a great balance of performance, design, and functionality. With its large display, capable processor, impressive camera system, and long-lasting battery, it caters to the needs of modern users. Whether you are a student, a professional, or someone who enjoys media consumption, the Galaxy A05s is a reliable choice that won\'t disappoint.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13 OS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Qualcomm SM6225 Snapdragon 680 4G (6 nm)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">13 MP, f/2.0, Video (1080p@30fps)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Triple Camera: 50 MP, f/1.8, (wide), AF 2 MP, f/2.4, (macro) 2 MP, f/2.4, (depth), LED Flash</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.7 Inches</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh, 25 watt wired</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">128GB Built-in, 6GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 38999, 36500, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:48:38', '2025-06-24 14:58:17', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(56, 'Xiaomi Redmi A2 Plus', 'xiaomi-redmi-a2-plus', 2, 61, '<h2>Xiaomi Redmi A2 Plus Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Xiaomi Redmi A2 Plus, released on <strong>August 15, 2023</strong>, is an affordable smartphone designed for users seeking basic functionality with reliable performance. Equipped with a large 6.52-inch display, a powerful 5000 mAh battery, and dual cameras, this phone offers all the essentials for daily use. Whether you\'re browsing the web, streaming videos, or capturing photos, the Redmi A2 Plus delivers a smooth and seamless experience, all at a competitive price point.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Design and Display:</h3>\r\n<p>The Xiaomi Redmi A2 Plus is built for durability and comfort, with a sleek and sturdy design. The phone measures <strong>164.9 x 76.75 x 9.09 mm</strong> and weighs <strong>192 g</strong>, giving it a solid feel without being too heavy. It comes with <strong>dual SIM support</strong>, allowing users to manage two phone numbers simultaneously – perfect for balancing work and personal life.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The phone boasts a <strong>6.52-inch HD+ Dot Drop display</strong>, providing a screen resolution of <strong>1600 x 720 pixels</strong>. While not the highest resolution on the market, the display is more than sufficient for everyday activities such as watching videos, browsing social media, and playing casual games. The screen offers vivid colors and good clarity, making it easy to enjoy content on the go.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Performance:</h3>\r\n<p>At the heart of the Redmi A2 Plus is an <strong>Octa-core processor</strong>, paired with a <strong>Mediatek Helio G36 GPU</strong>. This combination ensures that the phone runs smoothly, handling tasks like web browsing, video playback, and light gaming with ease. While it’s not designed for intensive multitasking or gaming, the performance is ideal for users who prioritize efficiency in their daily smartphone use.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The phone runs on <strong>Android 12 (Go Edition)</strong>, a streamlined version of Android optimized for entry-level devices. The <strong>3 GB of RAM</strong> ensures that users can switch between apps without significant lag. Whether you’re texting, checking emails, or using social media, the <strong>Xiaomi Redmi A2 Plus</strong> provides a smooth and reliable user experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Storage and Expandability:</h3>\r\n<p>The Xiaomi Redmi A2 Plus offers <strong>64 GB of internal storage</strong>, giving users ample space for apps, photos, and media. For those who need more storage, the phone supports expandable storage up to <strong>1 TB</strong> via a dedicated microSD card slot. This makes the device versatile and ensures you have plenty of room for storing important files, photos, and videos without worrying about running out of space.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Camera:</h3>\r\n<p>The Xiaomi Redmi A2 Plus features a <strong>dual rear camera setup</strong> that includes an <strong>8 MP primary sensor</strong> and a <strong>0.08 MP secondary sensor</strong>. The camera is equipped with a <strong>back flash light</strong>, allowing users to take clear photos even in low-light conditions. It supports <strong>1080p video recording at 30fps</strong>, ensuring you capture high-quality videos with ease.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For selfies and video calls, the phone comes with a <strong>5 MP front camera</strong>. The front camera also supports <strong>1080p video recording</strong>, ensuring smooth video chats and decent-quality selfies. While there is no front flash light, the camera performs well in natural lighting, making it suitable for everyday use.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Battery:</h3>\r\n<p>One of the standout features of the Xiaomi Redmi A2 Plus is its large <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong>. This robust battery ensures the phone can easily last throughout the day, even with heavy use. Whether you\'re watching videos, making calls, or browsing the web, the long-lasting battery life makes the Redmi A2 Plus an excellent choice for users who are always on the go.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The phone’s battery life is further enhanced by the power-efficient Android 12 Go Edition, ensuring you get the most out of each charge. With the Xiaomi Redmi A2 Plus, you won’t have to worry about constantly recharging your device during the day.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Connectivity:</h3>\r\n<p>The Redmi A2 Plus comes with a wide range of connectivity options. It supports <strong>4G LTE</strong>, ensuring fast and reliable mobile internet speeds. Additionally, the phone is equipped with <strong>Bluetooth</strong> and <strong>WiFi</strong>, providing users with multiple options for staying connected, whether at home or on the go.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For those who still enjoy listening to FM radio, the Redmi A2 Plus includes an FM radio function, adding another layer of entertainment without consuming data. Although the phone does not support <strong>5G</strong> or <strong>NFC</strong>, it offers all the essential connectivity features most users need for their everyday tasks.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion:</h3>\r\n<p>The Xiaomi Redmi A2 Plus is a budget-friendly smartphone designed for users looking for a reliable device that covers all the essentials. Its <strong>6.52-inch HD+ display</strong>, <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong>, and <strong>dual rear camera</strong> setup make it a great option for those who want a capable phone without breaking the bank.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For those looking to <strong>buy Xiaomi Redmi A2 Plus in Pakistan</strong>, this phone delivers excellent value with its efficient performance and long-lasting battery life. Whether you\'re using it for social media, taking pictures, or making calls, the Xiaomi Redmi A2 Plus offers all the core features necessary for daily use.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you\'re on the hunt for a phone that offers great features at a competitive price, the Xiaomi Redmi A2 Plus should definitely be on your list. Its affordability, combined with solid performance and essential features, makes it a top choice for budget-conscious consumers looking to <strong>purchase the Xiaomi Redmi A2 Plus at the best price in Pakistan</strong>.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 12 Go edition</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Mediatek Helio G36 (12 nm)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5 MP, f/2.2, Video (1080p@30fps)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Camera: 8 MP, f/2.0, (wide) 0.08 MP (depth), <span id=\"IL_AD4\" class=\"IL_AD\">Dual LED</span> Flash</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.5 Inches</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">64GB Built-in, 3GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 21000, 19999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:48:38', '2025-06-24 14:57:23', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(57, 'Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 Pro 512GB', 'xiaomi-redmi-note-13-pro-512gb', 2, 61, '<h2>Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 Pro 512GB Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 Pro, set for release on <strong>26 January 2024</strong>, promises to be a strong contender in the mid-range smartphone market. Combining an elegant design with powerful hardware, this phone offers users a premium experience at an affordable price. Whether you\'re a photography enthusiast or need a phone with great performance for multitasking, the Redmi Note 13 Pro delivers on all fronts.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Design and Display:</h4>\r\n<p>The <strong>Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 Pro</strong> boasts a large <strong>6.67-inch AMOLED display</strong> with a resolution of <strong>2400x1080 pixels</strong>. The vibrant colors and deep blacks make it an ideal screen for watching videos, gaming, and everyday browsing. Protected by <strong>Corning Gorilla Glass</strong>, the display is durable and resistant to scratches, ensuring long-lasting clarity and protection. The slim dimensions of <strong>161.1x 74.95x 7.98 mm</strong> and weight of <strong>188g</strong> give the phone a sleek and comfortable feel, perfect for one-handed use or carrying in your pocket. This modern design is coupled with the signature <strong>MIUI 14</strong> user interface, providing a clean, intuitive experience for users.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Performance and Hardware:</h4>\r\n<p>Powered by the <strong>MediaTek Helio G99-Ultra processor</strong>, the Redmi Note 13 Pro ensures smooth performance, even during demanding tasks. Whether you\'re gaming, streaming, or juggling multiple apps, the <strong>Mali-G57 MC2 GPU</strong> helps to deliver fluid graphics and a responsive experience. Available in <strong>8GB</strong> and <strong>12GB RAM</strong> variants, this device handles multitasking efficiently, making it a great choice for users who need power on the go.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For storage, the Redmi Note 13 Pro offers two options: <strong>256GB</strong> and <strong>512GB</strong> of internal storage. These capacities provide ample space for storing photos, videos, apps, and games without worrying about running out of space. The inclusion of a <strong>microSD card slot</strong> (via a hybrid SIM slot) allows users to expand their storage further, adding flexibility for those with higher storage needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Camera:</h4>\r\n<p>The standout feature of the <strong>Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 Pro</strong> is its <strong>200MP triple rear camera setup</strong>. The main <strong>200MP sensor</strong> ensures stunningly detailed photos with excellent clarity and color reproduction. The secondary <strong>8MP ultra-wide camera</strong> is perfect for capturing landscapes or group photos, while the <strong>2MP macro lens</strong> allows you to get up close and personal with intricate details. The back camera also supports <strong>1080p video recording</strong> at both <strong>30/60fps</strong>, delivering smooth and high-quality videos for social media or personal projects.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>On the front, the <strong>16MP selfie camera</strong> offers clear and vibrant photos, making it ideal for selfies and video calls. It supports <strong>1080p video recording</strong> at <strong>30/60fps</strong> and <strong>720p at 30fps</strong>, ensuring that your video chats are smooth and high-quality.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Battery Life:</h4>\r\n<p>The <strong>5000mAh battery</strong> on the Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 Pro ensures all-day use without frequent charging. Whether you\'re browsing the web, watching videos, or playing games, the large battery capacity keeps the phone powered through long hours of usage. Paired with efficient hardware and software optimizations, the battery life is one of the key highlights of this phone, making it a reliable option for users who are always on the go.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Operating System and Features:</h4>\r\n<p>The<strong> Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 Pro</strong> runs on <strong>MIUI 14</strong>, based on <strong>Android 13</strong>, offering users the latest Android features and security updates. MIUI 14 is known for its smooth performance and a variety of customization options that allow users to tailor their device to their preferences. Additionally, the phone comes equipped with advanced privacy features, making it a secure choice for everyday use.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Connectivity:</h4>\r\n<p>In terms of connectivity, the Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 Pro supports <strong>Dual SIM</strong> functionality with a <strong>Hybrid SIM/microSD slot</strong>. It offers <strong>4G LTE</strong> for fast mobile internet speeds, alongside reliable connectivity options such as <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, <strong>WiFi</strong>, and <strong>NFC</strong>. Although it lacks <strong>5G support</strong>, the phone is equipped with all the essential features most users require for seamless everyday connectivity. The phone’s <strong>NFC</strong> capabilities make it compatible with contactless payments and other convenient wireless features.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Summary of Key Features:</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>6.67-inch AMOLED display</strong> with <strong>2400x1080 resolution</strong> and <strong>Corning Gorilla Glass</strong> protection</li>\r\n  <li><strong>200MP+8MP+2MP triple rear camera</strong> with <strong>1080p video recording</strong></li>\r\n  <li><strong>16MP front camera</strong> with <strong>1080p/720p video recording</strong></li>\r\n  <li>Powered by the <strong>MediaTek Helio G99-Ultra processor</strong> and <strong>Mali-G57 GPU</strong></li>\r\n  <li>Available with <strong>8GB</strong> or <strong>12GB RAM</strong>, and <strong>256GB</strong> or <strong>512GB internal storage</strong></li>\r\n  <li>Expandable storage via <strong>microSD</strong> with a hybrid SIM slot</li>\r\n  <li><strong>5000mAh battery</strong> for long-lasting performance</li>\r\n  <li>Runs on <strong>MIUI 14</strong> with <strong>Android 13</strong></li>\r\n  <li>Supports <strong>Dual SIM</strong>, <strong>4G LTE</strong>, <strong>WiFi</strong>, <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, and <strong>NFC</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>The Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 Pro is a feature-packed smartphone that excels in multiple areas, including display quality, camera performance, and battery life. Whether you’re a multitasker, content creator, or casual user, this phone has the power and flexibility to meet your needs. With its modern design and powerful internals, the Redmi Note 13 Pro stands out as one of the top contenders in its price range.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13 OS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Mediatek Helio G99 Ultra</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">16 MP, f/2.4, (wide), Video (1080p@30/60fps)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Triple Camera: 200 MP, f/1.7, 23mm (wide), 1/1.4\", multi-directional PDAF, OIS 8 MP, f/2.2, (ultrawide) 2 MP, f/2.4, (macro), LED Flash</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.67 Inches, AMOLED Capacitive Touchscreen, 1B, Multitouch</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh , 67W wired, 50% in 16 min, 100% in 46 min</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">512GB Built-in, 12GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 64999, 60499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:48:38', '2026-02-25 18:59:25', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(58, 'Yolo Fortuner Pro Calling Watch', 'yolo-fortuner-pro-calling-watch', 11, 62, '<h2>Yolo Fortuner Pro Calling Watch Price in Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Yolo Fortuner Pro Calling Watch is a premium smartwatch designed for individuals who value both style and performance. With its sleek design, robust features, and competitive price in Pakistan, this smartwatch is perfect for those looking to enhance their fitness routine while staying connected on the go. Whether you’re working out or at the office, the Yolo Fortuner Pro provides a seamless experience with a blend of advanced technology and durable construction.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>Elegant Design with a Stunning Display</strong></h4>\r\n<p>The Yolo Fortuner Pro Calling Watch comes with a 33mm HD display that offers crisp and clear visuals. This large, easy-to-read screen ensures you can view notifications, fitness metrics, and messages with ease. The vibrant display makes it simple to access all your essential apps and information, even in bright sunlight. The watch is paired with a comfortable and durable silicone strap that fits snugly on your wrist, making it perfect for all-day wear.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>Bluetooth Calling & Voice Assistant</strong></h4>\r\n<p>One of the key features of the Yolo Fortuner Pro is its Bluetooth calling capability. You can make and receive calls directly from your wrist, making it convenient for situations where reaching for your phone might not be practical, such as during a workout or while driving. Along with Bluetooth calling, the Yolo Fortuner Pro also features a built-in voice assistant, allowing you to control functions with your voice, making your smartwatch experience even more intuitive.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>Comprehensive Health and Fitness Tracking</strong></h4>\r\n<p>The Yolo Fortuner Pro Calling Watch is equipped with 120+ professional sports modes, catering to a wide range of activities. Whether you’re into running, cycling, yoga, or strength training, the watch is designed to track your progress and give you insights into your workouts. It monitors your heart rate 24/7, helping you understand your cardiovascular health, while also tracking your oxygen levels to ensure you’re getting the most out of your training.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For those focused on overall wellness, the Yolo Fortuner Pro also includes a sleep quality monitor, providing valuable insights into your sleep patterns and helping you improve your rest for better recovery. Additionally, it has a step tracker to help you stay on top of your daily activity goals.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>Water Resistant and Built for Durability</strong></h4>\r\n<p>With an IP67 water resistance rating, the Yolo Fortuner Pro is built to handle everyday challenges, whether you\'re sweating it out at the gym or caught in a rainstorm. You can wear it while working out, washing your hands, or doing other daily activities without worrying about water damage. This makes it a versatile smartwatch that fits effortlessly into your active lifestyle.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>Long Battery Life</strong></h4>\r\n<p>The Yolo Fortuner Pro boasts up to 7 days of battery life on a single charge, ensuring that it keeps up with your busy schedule. Whether you\'re traveling, exercising, or managing your day-to-day tasks, you won’t have to worry about constantly charging your watch. The long-lasting battery allows you to focus on what matters without interruption.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>Seamless Connectivity and Compatibility</strong></h4>\r\n<p>The Yolo Fortuner Pro Calling Watch is compatible with both Android and iOS devices, ensuring that it fits easily into your current tech ecosystem. It syncs effortlessly with your smartphone, delivering notifications for calls, texts, and apps directly to your wrist. With Bluetooth connectivity, you can stay informed and connected, even if your phone is out of reach.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>Why Choose the Yolo Fortuner Pro Calling Watch?</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>33mm HD Display</strong>: Bright and clear visuals for easy reading.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Bluetooth Calling</strong>: Make and receive calls directly from your watch.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>120+ Professional Sports Modes</strong>: Track a wide range of activities and stay fit.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>IP67 Water Resistance</strong>: Designed to withstand splashes, sweat, and daily wear.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>24/7 Health Monitoring</strong>: Keep track of heart rate, oxygen levels, and sleep quality.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>7-Day Battery Life</strong>: Stay powered throughout the week with minimal charging.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Voice Assistant</strong>: Control functions hands-free with voice commands.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>The Yolo Fortuner Pro Calling Watch is more than just a smartwatch—it\'s a complete lifestyle tool. With its combination of health tracking, fitness features, and smart connectivity, it offers excellent value at a competitive price in Pakistan. Whether you\'re a fitness enthusiast, a professional, or someone who enjoys staying connected on the go, the Yolo Fortuner Pro is the ideal choice for you.</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>Bluetooth calling</li>\r\n 	<li>Live Watch Faces</li>\r\n 	<li>1.32-inch HD display</li>\r\n 	<li>Zinc alloy frame</li>\r\n 	<li>IP67 Water resistant</li>\r\n 	<li>sync messages/smart notification</li>\r\n 	<li>120 sport modes</li>\r\n 	<li>Heart Rate and\r\nSpO2 Tracker</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 0, 7499, 6499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:48:38', '2025-06-24 14:54:36', 'NULL', NULL, 0);
