(59, 'YOLO Fortuner Calling Smart Watch', 'yolo-fortuner-calling-watch', 11, 62, '<h2>Yolo Fortuner Pro Calling Watch Price in Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Yolo Fortuner Calling Watch is a revolutionary smartwatch designed for those who demand both style and functionality. With its cutting-edge features and sleek design, this smartwatch is a perfect choice for fitness enthusiasts and tech-savvy users alike. Available at an attractive price in Pakistan, the Yolo Fortuner is packed with features that enhance your daily life and keep you connected.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>Striking Display & Robust Build</strong></h4>\r\n<p>The Yolo Fortuner boasts a 1.32-inch HD bright display that offers vibrant colors and sharp clarity, making it easy to read notifications, fitness metrics, and messages at a glance. The zinc alloy frame provides durability and a premium feel, ensuring that this smartwatch can withstand everyday wear and tear. Whether you’re at the office or out for a jog, the Yolo Fortuner is designed to complement your lifestyle.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>Bluetooth Calling & Music Playback</strong></h4>\r\n<p>One of the standout features of the Yolo Fortuner Calling Watch is its Bluetooth calling capability. You can make and receive calls directly from your wrist, giving you the freedom to stay connected without constantly reaching for your phone. Additionally, the watch allows for seamless music playback, enabling you to enjoy your favorite tunes while working out or on the go. This combination of features ensures that you’re always connected and entertained.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>Comprehensive Fitness Tracking</strong></h4>\r\n<p>The Yolo Fortuner is equipped with over 120 sports modes, making it suitable for a variety of activities. Whether you\'re into running, cycling, swimming, or strength training, this smartwatch can track your performance accurately. It monitors essential health metrics like heart rate, blood pressure, and blood oxygen levels 24/7, providing valuable insights into your overall well-being. This makes the Yolo Fortuner not just a stylish accessory, but a vital tool for anyone serious about fitness.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>Water Resistant Design</strong></h4>\r\n<p>With an IP67 water resistance rating, the Yolo Fortuner can withstand splashes and sweat, making it a perfect companion for workouts and outdoor adventures. You can wear it without worry, whether you\'re caught in the rain or hitting the gym. This durability adds to its appeal as a versatile smartwatch that fits into any lifestyle.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>Smart Notifications & Live Watch Faces</strong></h4>\r\n<p>Stay organized and informed with smart notifications that sync messages and alerts directly to your wrist. The ability to view messages and notifications without pulling out your phone helps you stay focused and efficient. Additionally, the Yolo Fortuner features live watch faces, allowing you to personalize your device to match your mood or outfit. Choose from various styles and designs to make your watch truly your own.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>Warranty & Customer Assurance</strong></h4>\r\n<p>All Yolo smartwatches, including the Fortuner, come with a 6-month manufacturer warranty, giving you peace of mind with your purchase. This warranty reflects the brand\'s commitment to quality and customer satisfaction, ensuring that you receive a reliable product.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>Why Choose the Yolo Fortuner Calling Watch?</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>1.32” HD Display</strong>: Crisp and clear visibility for notifications and metrics.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Bluetooth Calling</strong>: Make and receive calls directly from your wrist.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>120+ Sports Modes</strong>: Comprehensive tracking for diverse fitness activities.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>IP67 Water Resistant</strong>: Built to handle sweat and splashes.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>24/7 Health Monitoring</strong>: Keep track of your heart rate, blood pressure, and oxygen levels.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Live Watch Faces</strong>: Personalize your watch to reflect your style.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Warranty Assurance</strong>: 6-month manufacturer warranty for peace of mind.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>The Yolo Fortuner Calling Watch is more than just a timepiece; it\'s an essential gadget for anyone looking to elevate their lifestyle through technology. Its combination of features, stylish design, and competitive pricing in Pakistan make it an attractive choice for those seeking a reliable and multifunctional smartwatch.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Whether you’re a fitness enthusiast, a busy professional, or someone who values connectivity, the Yolo Fortuner Calling Watch is designed to meet your needs. It’s not just a watch; it’s a comprehensive lifestyle companion that helps you stay active, connected, and in control.</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>Bluetooth calling</li>\r\n 	<li>live watch faces</li>\r\n 	<li>1.32-inch HD display</li>\r\n 	<li>Bluetooth music playback</li>\r\n 	<li>IP67 water resistant</li>\r\n 	<li>Sync messages/smart notification</li>\r\n 	<li>28 Sports modes</li>\r\n 	<li>Heart Rate and\r\nSpO2 Tracker</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 0, 9499, 5699, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:48:38', '2025-06-24 14:53:20', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(60, 'Realme Note 50 64GB', 'realme-note-50-64gb', 2, 53, '<h2>Realme Note 50 64GB Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Realme Note 50, launching on <strong>23 January 2024</strong>, is set to make a mark in the budget smartphone category. Packed with reliable features, this device is perfect for users who need a functional phone for day-to-day tasks without overspending. From a large screen to a powerful battery, the Realme Note 50 offers solid value while maintaining a sleek and lightweight design.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Display and Design:</h4>\r\n<p>The Realme Note 50 features a <strong>6.74-inch IPS HD+ display</strong>, providing users with a clear and immersive viewing experience. The screen resolution of <strong>720 x 1600 pixels</strong> delivers decent clarity for watching videos, scrolling through social media, and light gaming. This large screen makes multitasking a breeze, allowing users to easily switch between apps. With dimensions of <strong>167.2 x 76.7 x 7.9 mm</strong> and a weight of <strong>186g</strong>, the phone is comfortable to hold and carry, even during extended use.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Performance and Storage:</h4>\r\n<p>Under the hood, the Realme Note 50 is powered by the <strong>Unisoc Tiger T612 processor</strong>, a reliable chipset that balances performance and power efficiency. The <strong>Mali-G57 GPU</strong> ensures smooth visuals, making it a great choice for users who enjoy casual gaming or media consumption. The phone is equipped with <strong>4GB of RAM</strong>, which is adequate for running multiple apps simultaneously and handling everyday tasks with ease. The <strong>64GB internal storage</strong> provides ample space for your apps, photos, and files. For users who need extra storage, the device supports <strong>microSDXC cards</strong>, allowing you to expand storage according to your needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Camera:</h4>\r\n<p>The <strong>Realme Note 50</strong> comes with a <strong>dual rear camera setup</strong>, featuring a <strong>13MP primary camera</strong> and a <strong>QVGA sensor</strong>. This setup is designed to capture sharp and vibrant photos in well-lit environments. The <strong>LED flash</strong> at the back helps improve image quality in low-light conditions. The camera also supports <strong>1080p video recording at 30fps</strong>, ensuring you can capture high-quality videos for social media or personal use.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>On the front, the <strong>5MP selfie camera</strong> is equipped to take decent selfies and handle video calls. While the front camera is modest in terms of resolution, it is capable of <strong>720p video recording at 30fps</strong>, which is suitable for clear video chats.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Battery and Charging:</h4>\r\n<p>One of the standout features of the Realme Note 50 is its <strong>5000mAh battery</strong>. This large battery ensures that the phone can last throughout the day, even with heavy usage. Whether you’re streaming videos, browsing the internet, or using multiple apps, the Realme Note 50’s battery will keep you powered without frequent recharges. This makes it an ideal phone for users who prioritize battery life, especially for long commutes or travel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Operating System and User Interface:</h4>\r\n<p>The Realme Note 50 runs on <strong>Android 13</strong> with <strong>Realme UI T</strong>. This combination provides a smooth and intuitive user experience, with enhanced performance optimizations and new privacy features that come with Android 13. Realme’s user interface offers additional customization options, allowing users to personalize their device and streamline everyday tasks. Whether it’s switching between apps or customizing your home screen, Realme UI makes navigating the phone easy and efficient.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Connectivity:</h4>\r\n<p>In terms of connectivity, the Realme Note 50 supports <strong>Dual SIM</strong> functionality, enabling users to manage two numbers on one device. It offers <strong>4G LTE</strong> for fast internet speeds, along with other essential connectivity features like <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, <strong>WiFi</strong>, and <strong>GPS</strong>. However, it does not support <strong>5G</strong> or <strong>NFC</strong>, which might be a consideration for some users. While lacking <strong>FM radio</strong>, the phone has a range of connectivity options suitable for the average user.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Summary of Key Features:</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>6.74-inch HD+ IPS display</strong> with a resolution of 720 x 1600 pixels</li>\r\n  <li><strong>13MP dual rear camera</strong> with 1080p video recording</li>\r\n  <li><strong>5MP front camera</strong> with 720p video recording</li>\r\n  <li><strong>4GB RAM</strong> and <strong>64GB internal storage</strong>, expandable via <strong>microSDXC</strong></li>\r\n  <li><strong>Unisoc Tiger T612 processor</strong> with <strong>Mali-G57 GPU</strong></li>\r\n  <li><strong>5000mAh battery</strong> for long-lasting performance</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Android 13</strong> with <strong>Realme UI T</strong> for a smooth user experience</li>\r\n  <li>Supports <strong>3G</strong>, <strong>4G/LTE</strong>, <strong>WiFi</strong>, and Bluetooth</li>\r\n  <li>Sleek design: <strong>167.2 x 76.7 x 7.9 mm</strong>, <strong>186g</strong> in weight</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>The Realme Note 50 stands out as an affordable smartphone that doesn’t compromise on essential features. With its large display, long-lasting battery, and capable camera, it’s a great option for users who need a reliable phone for daily use. The combination of Android 13 and Realme’s custom UI ensures a user-friendly experience, while the phone’s overall performance and design make it a solid choice in the budget segment.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13 OS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Unisoc Tiger T612 (12 nm)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5 MP, f/2.2, 27mm (wide), HDR, Video (720p@30fps)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Camera: 13 MP, (wide), PDAF 0.08 MP ,(<span id=\"IL_AD4\" class=\"IL_AD\">auxiliary</span> lens), LED Flash</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.74 Inches</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh , 10W wired</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">64GB Built-in, 4GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 24999, 22499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:48:38', '2025-06-24 14:52:32', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(61, 'Oppo A38', 'oppo-a38', 2, 52, '<h2>Oppo A38 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Oppo A38 is a well-rounded budget smartphone designed to offer users an optimal balance of performance, battery life, and camera capabilities. Released on <strong>6 December 2023</strong>, this phone is targeted toward users who want solid features without spending too much. With a sleek design and impressive camera setup, the Oppo A38 provides great value, making it an excellent choice for those looking for a reliable smartphone for everyday use.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Display and Design:</h4>\r\n<p>The Oppo A38 boasts a <strong>6.56-inch IPS LCD display</strong> with a resolution of <strong>720 x 1612 pixels</strong>, giving users a clear and vibrant viewing experience. The display has a pixel density of <strong>~269 PPI</strong>, making it sharp enough for watching videos, browsing social media, and casual gaming. With dimensions of <strong>163.7 x 75 x 8.2 mm</strong> and weighing <strong>190g</strong>, the Oppo A38 is comfortable to hold and carry around, making it a suitable option for users who prefer a phone with a sleek, ergonomic design.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Performance and Storage:</h4>\r\n<p>The Oppo A38 is powered by an <strong>Octa-core processor</strong> that consists of <strong>2 x 2.0 GHz Cortex-A75 cores</strong> for high-performance tasks and <strong>6 x 1.8 GHz Cortex-A55 cores</strong> for energy-efficient operations. This, coupled with the <strong>Mali-G52 MC2 GPU</strong>, ensures smooth multitasking, gaming, and overall performance. The phone comes with <strong>6GB of RAM</strong>, which is sufficient for most daily tasks like running multiple apps, browsing the web, and playing light to moderate games. The <strong>128GB internal storage</strong> provides plenty of room for your photos, apps, and files, and if you need more space, the <strong>microSDXC card slot</strong> allows for expandable storage.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Camera:</h4>\r\n<p>One of the standout features of the Oppo A38 is its <strong>dual rear camera setup</strong>, which includes a <strong>50MP wide primary camera</strong> and a <strong>2MP depth sensor</strong>. The 50MP camera offers impressive image quality, even in challenging lighting conditions, while the depth sensor helps capture beautiful portrait shots with enhanced bokeh effects. The camera is capable of <strong>1080p video recording at 30fps</strong>, allowing you to shoot high-definition videos with ease. On the front, the <strong>5MP selfie camera</strong> is also capable of <strong>1080p video recording</strong>, making it a good option for video calls and selfies. Although the front camera is modest, it still delivers good quality for casual use.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Battery and Charging:</h4>\r\n<p>The Oppo A38 is equipped with a <strong>5000mAh non-removable battery</strong>, ensuring long-lasting performance throughout the day. This large battery capacity allows users to enjoy hours of web browsing, video streaming, and gaming without worrying about frequent recharges. With its energy-efficient processor and software optimizations, the phone manages battery consumption well, making it a great option for users who need a device with all-day battery life.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Operating System and User Experience:</h4>\r\n<p>Running on <strong>Android 13</strong> with Oppo’s customized user interface, the Oppo A38 delivers a smooth and intuitive experience. The Android 13 OS is known for its enhanced privacy features, better performance optimizations, and user-friendly design. Oppo’s interface adds additional functionality and customization options, giving users the freedom to personalize their phone according to their preferences. The overall experience is fluid, and the device is capable of handling multiple tasks without lag.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Connectivity:</h4>\r\n<p>The Oppo A38 offers all the necessary connectivity options you would expect in a modern smartphone. It supports <strong>Dual SIM</strong> with <strong>4G/LTE</strong> for fast data speeds, as well as <strong>WiFi</strong>, <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, and <strong>FM Radio</strong>. The absence of <strong>5G</strong> and <strong>NFC</strong> might be a drawback for some users, but for its price range, the device provides all the essential connectivity features most users need.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Summary of Key Features:</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>6.56-inch IPS LCD display</strong> with 720 x 1612 resolution (~269 PPI)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>50MP + 2MP dual rear camera</strong> with 1080p video recording</li>\r\n  <li><strong>5MP front camera</strong> for selfies and video calls</li>\r\n  <li><strong>6GB RAM</strong>, <strong>128GB internal storage</strong>, expandable via <strong>microSDXC</strong></li>\r\n  <li><strong>Octa-core processor</strong> (2 x 2.0 GHz Cortex-A75 + 6 x 1.8 GHz Cortex-A55)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>5000mAh battery</strong> for extended use</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Android 13 OS</strong> for a seamless experience</li>\r\n  <li>Supports <strong>3G</strong>, <strong>4G/LTE</strong>, <strong>WiFi</strong>, and Bluetooth</li>\r\n  <li><strong>FM Radio</strong> support for radio listeners</li>\r\n  <li>Sleek and ergonomic design: <strong>163.7 x 75 x 8.2 mm</strong>, weighing <strong>190g</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>The Oppo A38 is a well-balanced budget smartphone that caters to users looking for solid performance, an excellent camera setup, and long battery life. Its sleek design, efficient processor, and Android 13 OS make it a reliable choice for users who need a dependable phone for everyday tasks like browsing, social media, photography, and more. Whether you’re a casual user or someone who needs a device for work and entertainment, the Oppo A38 offers a fantastic mix of features at an affordable price.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13 OS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Mediatek MT6769 Helio G85 (12nm)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5 MP, f/2.2, (wide), Video (1080p@30fps)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Camera: 50 MP, f/1.8, (wide), PDAF 2 MP, f/2.4, (depth), LED Flash</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.56 Inches</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh , 33W wired, PD, 50% in 30 min</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">128GB Built-in, 6GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 43999, 40999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:48:38', '2025-06-24 14:51:25', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(62, 'Tecno Spark 10C', 'tecno-spark-10c', 2, 57, '<h2>Tecno Spark 10C Price In Pakistan</h2>\nThe<strong> Tecno Spark 10C</strong> is a budget-friendly smartphone that packs impressive features for users seeking a balance between price and performance. Released on <strong>June 16, 2023</strong>, this device is designed for users who need a reliable phone for everyday tasks such as social media browsing, photography, and multitasking.\n<h3>Design and Display:</h3>\nThe Tecno Spark 10C comes with a <strong>6.6-inch IPS LCD capacitive touchscreen</strong>, providing vibrant visuals with a resolution of <strong>720 x 1612 pixels</strong>. Although the resolution is not as high as some premium models, it is perfect for everyday use, offering clear and colorful visuals for watching videos, browsing, and gaming.\n\nWith dimensions of <strong>163.9 x 75.5 x 8.5 mm</strong>, the Tecno Spark 10C fits comfortably in your hand and pocket. Its sleek design makes it easy to handle, while the responsive touchscreen allows for smooth navigation and multitouch capability.\n<h3>Performance:</h3>\nUnder the hood, the Tecno Spark 10C is powered by the <strong>Unisoc T606 processor</strong>, supported by a <strong>Mali-G57 MP1 GPU</strong> for handling graphic-intensive tasks. Whether you\'re scrolling through social media, playing casual games, or switching between apps, the Tecno Spark 10C ensures a lag-free experience.\n\nWith <strong>4 GB of RAM</strong>, you can expect decent multitasking performance. Apps open quickly, and switching between tasks is seamless. The device comes with <strong>128 GB of internal storage</strong>, providing ample space for all your apps, photos, and videos. If you need more storage, the phone supports a <strong>microSD card</strong> of up to 256 GB, so you never have to worry about running out of space.\n\nThe phone runs on <strong>Android 12 OS</strong>, which offers a clean and intuitive interface, along with several customization options. Android 12 also enhances privacy and security, giving users more control over their data and app permissions.\n<h3>Camera:</h3>\nThe <strong>Tecno Spark 10C</strong> boasts a <strong>16 MP rear camera</strong>, designed to capture sharp and detailed photos in various lighting conditions. Whether you\'re taking photos in the day or at night, the <strong>back flash</strong> ensures that your shots come out bright and clear. The camera is also capable of recording videos, making it a great choice for capturing moments on the go.\n\nOn the front, the device features an <strong>8 MP selfie camera</strong> equipped with <strong>dual flash lights</strong>, perfect for taking clear selfies even in low-light conditions. The front camera also supports <strong>720p@30fps video recording</strong>, allowing you to shoot high-quality videos for video calls and social media.\n<h3>Battery:</h3>\nOne of the standout features of the Tecno Spark 10C is its <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong>. This high-capacity battery ensures that you can use your phone throughout the day without constantly worrying about charging. Whether you\'re streaming videos, playing games, or browsing the web, the large battery has got you covered. It offers a long-lasting experience, making it ideal for users who are always on the go.\n<h3>Connectivity:</h3>\nThe Tecno Spark 10C comes with all the essential connectivity options you need, including <strong>Bluetooth, WiFi</strong>, and <strong>4G LTE</strong>. While it does not support <strong>5G</strong>, the 4G LTE network is more than capable of providing fast browsing, streaming, and download speeds, which are perfect for everyday use.\n\nThe phone also includes a <strong>FM radio</strong> for those who enjoy listening to music or news on the go. However, <strong>NFC support</strong> is missing from the Tecno Spark 10C, which means contactless payments via your phone will not be possible. Despite this, the phone’s other connectivity options provide everything needed for daily usage.\n<h3>Dual SIM and Expandable Storage:</h3>\nFor users looking to manage two numbers simultaneously, the Tecno Spark 10C supports <strong>dual SIM</strong> functionality. This makes it easy to manage both personal and work contacts without needing a second phone. The <strong>microSD card slot</strong> allows for expandable storage of up to <strong>256 GB</strong>, ensuring that you’ll never run out of space for your apps, media, and documents.\n<h3>Conclusion:</h3>\nThe Tecno Spark 10C is an excellent choice for users seeking a budget-friendly smartphone with solid performance and a large display. With its <strong>16 MP rear camera</strong>, <strong>8 MP selfie camera</strong>, and <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong>, this phone offers an exceptional experience for users who need a reliable device for day-to-day use.\n\nWhether you\'re looking to buy Tecno Spark 10C in Pakistan or simply want a device with decent specifications at an affordable price, this smartphone is a strong contender in its category. It delivers everything you need for browsing, streaming, and capturing memories without compromising on essential features. Overall, the Tecno Spark 10C is an ideal option for budget-conscious users who want the best performance for their money.', '<div class=\"product-table\">\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 12 OS</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Unisoc T606 ,Mali-G57 MP1</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">8 MP, f/2.0, (wide), Video (1080p@30fps)</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Camera: 16 MP, (wide), PDAF 0.08 MP, (depth), <span id=\"IL_AD4\" class=\"IL_AD\">Dual LED</span> Flash</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.6 Inches</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh , 18W wired</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">128GB Built-in, 4GB RAM</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 1, 0, 24299, 23999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:49:48', '2025-04-22 11:53:06', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(63, 'Tecno Camon 20', 'tecno-camon-20', 2, 57, '<h2>Tecno Camon 20 Price In Pakistan</h2>\nThe Tecno Camon 20 is a smartphone designed for users who seek style, performance, and cutting-edge technology. Released on May 9, 2023, this device stands out with its sleek design, advanced camera setup, and powerful hardware, making it a great option for users looking to upgrade to a modern smartphone in Pakistan.\n<h3>Design and Display:</h3>\nThe Tecno Camon 20 features a <strong>6.67-inch AMOLED display</strong> with a resolution of 1080 x 2400 pixels, ensuring vibrant colors and sharp visuals. Whether you\'re watching videos, browsing social media, or playing games, this large screen offers an immersive experience. The phone\'s slim design, with dimensions of <strong>163.4 x 76.7 x 8.2 mm</strong>, ensures that it fits comfortably in your hand and pocket.\n\nThe display is AMOLED, which enhances the viewing experience with deep blacks and bright whites, making it a standout feature in its price range. Though the phone does not have any official screen protection, a quality screen guard can easily be applied for extra protection.\n<h3>Performance:</h3>\nUnder the hood, the Tecno Camon 20 is powered by a <strong>Mediatek MT6769Z Helio G85 processor</strong> and a <strong>Mali-G52 MC2 GPU</strong>, which together ensure smooth performance whether you\'re multitasking or running heavy apps. The <strong>8 GB of RAM</strong> adds to this performance by ensuring apps load quickly, and transitions between tasks are seamless.\n\nWith <strong>256 GB of internal storage</strong>, you\'ll have plenty of space for all your apps, photos, and videos. The card slot is unspecified, so external storage options may not be available, but with 256 GB, most users won’t need additional memory.\n\nThe phone runs on the latest <strong>Android 13 with HIOS 13</strong>, providing a clean and user-friendly interface. Android 13 also offers improved privacy features, customizable settings, and overall system optimizations, ensuring you get the best out of your device.\n<h3>Camera:</h3>\nPhotography enthusiasts will appreciate the <strong>64 MP triple rear camera setup</strong> of the Tecno Camon 20. The main 64 MP sensor, along with the 2 MP and AI cameras, allows for high-quality photos with rich detail and accurate colors. The <strong>back flash</strong> ensures that your low-light shots come out clear and bright. For video recording, the rear camera supports <strong>1080p@30fps</strong>, delivering smooth and sharp video quality.\n\nOn the front, you’ll find a <strong>32 MP selfie camera</strong>, which also supports <strong>1080p video recording</strong>. The front flash helps capture bright and sharp selfies even in dimly lit environments, making it perfect for video calls and social media posts.\n<h3>Battery:</h3>\nThe Tecno Camon 20 is equipped with a <strong>5000 mAh Li-Po battery</strong>, providing enough power to last through a full day of heavy use. Whether you\'re streaming videos, gaming, or simply browsing the web, this battery ensures long-lasting performance. The phone does not come with wireless charging, but the large battery capacity more than makes up for it.\n<h3>Connectivity:</h3>\nFor connectivity, the Tecno Camon 20 supports <strong>Bluetooth, 3G, 4G LTE</strong>, and <strong>WiFi</strong>, ensuring you\'re always connected, whether you’re at home or on the go. Unfortunately, the phone does not support <strong>5G</strong>, which may be a drawback for some users in areas where 5G networks are available. However, 4G LTE still offers fast download and upload speeds, making it suitable for everyday tasks.\n\nThe phone also comes with an <strong>FM radio</strong>, which is a feature not always found in modern smartphones. This allows you to enjoy music and radio shows without using mobile data.\n<h3>Additional Features:</h3>\nThe Tecno Camon 20 is a dual SIM phone, which means you can manage two numbers at once, making it a great choice for people who need to balance personal and professional contacts. Unfortunately, <strong>NFC support</strong> is missing, which could be a disadvantage if you\'re used to contactless payments.\n<h3>Conclusion:</h3>\nThe Tecno Camon 20 is a feature-packed smartphone that provides excellent value for its price. Whether you\'re a photography enthusiast, a multitasker, or someone who just wants a large, high-quality display for media consumption, the Tecno Camon 20 delivers on all fronts. With its sleek design, powerful performance, and robust battery, this smartphone is a strong competitor in its price range in Pakistan.\n\nFor those looking to buy Tecno Camon 20 in Pakistan, this phone offers an appealing combination of specs and performance. Compare it with other phones to see why it\'s one of the best options available in this category. Whether you\'re looking to upgrade or buy a new phone, the Tecno Camon 20 is worth considering.', '<div class=\"product-table\">\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13 OS</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Mediatek MT6769Z Helio G85 (12nm)</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">32 MP, f/2.5, 24mm (wide), 1/2.8\", <span id=\"IL_AD3\" class=\"IL_AD\">Dual LED</span> Flash, Video (1080p@30fps)</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Triple Camera: 64 MP, f/1.7, 26mm (wide), 1/1.7\", PDAF 2 MP, f/2.4, (depth) QVG, Ring-LED flash</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.67 Inches ,AMOLED Capacitive Touchscreen, Multitouch</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh, 33W wired</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">256GB Built-in, 8GB RAM</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 1, 0, 44999, 41999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:49:48', '2025-04-22 11:53:06', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(64, 'Oppo A18', 'oppo-a18', 2, 52, '<h2>Oppo A18 Price In Pakistan</h2>\nThe Oppo A18 is a budget-friendly smartphone that delivers impressive performance and essential features, making it a perfect choice for users seeking value for money. Released on <strong>12 February 2024</strong>, this device is designed to cater to users who need a reliable phone for daily tasks like social media, browsing, and casual gaming, all while staying on a budget.\n<h4>Display and Design:</h4>\nThe Oppo A18 comes with a <strong>6.56-inch HD+ LCD display</strong>, offering a resolution of <strong>720 x 1612 pixels</strong> with a pixel density of ~269 PPI. This large display ensures vibrant colors and good clarity, making it ideal for watching videos, scrolling through social media, or gaming. The sleek design of the phone, with dimensions of <strong>163.74 x 75.03 x 8.16 mm</strong> and a weight of <strong>188g</strong>, offers a comfortable grip, making it easy to hold and use with one hand. The <strong>Dual SIM</strong> support adds convenience for users who need to manage multiple numbers.\n<h4>Performance and Storage:</h4>\nPowering the Oppo A18 is the <strong>MediaTek Helio G85 processor</strong>, which, paired with the <strong>Mali G52 MC2 GPU</strong>, ensures smooth performance for daily multitasking, light gaming, and other tasks. The device comes with <strong>4GB of RAM</strong> and <strong>128GB of internal storage</strong>, giving users ample space to store their photos, videos, and apps. For users needing more storage, the <strong>microSDXC card slot</strong> allows for memory expansion, making it easier to keep more files on the device.\n<h4>Camera:</h4>\nThe Oppo A18 offers a modest but capable camera setup. The rear camera consists of a <strong>dual-lens system</strong> with an <strong>8MP primary camera</strong> and a <strong>2MP depth sensor</strong>, allowing users to capture detailed and bright photos. The rear camera also supports <strong>1080p video recording at 30fps</strong>, which ensures good video quality for social media uploads or casual video shooting. On the front, the phone features a <strong>5MP selfie camera</strong> capable of <strong>1080p video recording</strong>, making it suitable for video calls and selfies. The front camera provides decent performance for its class, but users should not expect high-end photo quality from a budget device.\n<h4>Battery and Charging:</h4>\nThe <strong>5000mAh battery</strong> is one of the standout features of the Oppo A18, ensuring that the phone lasts through a full day of heavy use without needing frequent recharges. Whether you are streaming, gaming, or simply using the phone for calls and texts, the large battery capacity ensures longevity, making it ideal for users on the go.\n<h4>Operating System and User Experience:</h4>\nThe Oppo A18 runs on <strong>ColorOS 13.1</strong>, based on Android, which offers a smooth and user-friendly interface. The ColorOS platform comes with several customizations, making it easy for users to tailor their smartphone experience to their preferences. With a range of system optimizations, the phone delivers a lag-free experience while maintaining efficient battery usage. <strong>ColorOS 13.1</strong> is known for its clean design and intuitive controls, allowing users to enjoy a seamless smartphone experience.\n<h4>Connectivity:</h4>\nThe Oppo A18 covers all essential connectivity options, ensuring users can stay connected in various ways. It supports <strong>3G</strong> and <strong>4G/LTE</strong> for fast internet browsing and downloads, as well as <strong>WiFi</strong> and <strong>Bluetooth</strong> for wireless connections. The phone is also equipped with <strong>FM radio</strong>, a feature that appeals to users who still enjoy listening to traditional radio. However, the device lacks <strong>NFC</strong> and <strong>5G</strong> support, which are features typically found in higher-end smartphones.\n<h4>Summary of Key Features:</h4>\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Dual SIM</strong> support (Nano-SIM, dual standby)</li>\n 	<li><strong>6.56-inch HD+ LCD display</strong> with 720 x 1612 resolution (~269 PPI)</li>\n 	<li><strong>8MP + 2MP dual rear camera</strong> with 1080p video recording</li>\n 	<li><strong>5MP front camera</strong> with 1080p video recording</li>\n 	<li><strong>4GB RAM</strong>, <strong>128GB internal storage</strong>, expandable via <strong>microSDXC</strong></li>\n 	<li><strong>MediaTek Helio G85 processor</strong> for efficient performance</li>\n 	<li><strong>5000mAh battery</strong> for long-lasting use</li>\n 	<li><strong>ColorOS 13.1</strong> with enhanced user experience</li>\n 	<li>Supports <strong>3G</strong>, <strong>4G/LTE</strong>, <strong>WiFi</strong>, and <strong>Bluetooth</strong></li>\n 	<li><strong>FM Radio</strong> support for radio lovers</li>\n 	<li>Sleek dimensions: <strong>163.74 x 75.03 x 8.16 mm</strong>, weighing <strong>188g</strong></li>\n</ul>\nThe Oppo A18 is designed for users looking for a dependable and budget-friendly smartphone that can handle essential tasks without breaking the bank. It provides excellent battery life, decent performance, and a satisfactory camera experience, making it a great choice for those who prioritize practicality over luxury. Whether you\'re into casual photography, browsing the web, or just need a smartphone to handle daily calls and messages, the Oppo A18 offers all that and more.', '<div class=\"product-table\">\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13 OS</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Mediatek MT6769 Helio G85 (12nm)</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5 MP, f/2.2, (wide), Panorama, Video (1080p@30fps)</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Camera: 8 MP, f/2.0, (wide), AF 2 MP, f/2.4, (depth, LED Flash</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.56 Inches</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">128GB Built-in, 4GB RAM</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 1, 0, 27999, 25799, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:49:48', '2025-04-22 11:53:06', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0);
