(65, 'Tecno Spark 20C', 'tecno-spark-20c', 2, 57, '<h2>Tecno Spark 20C Price In Pakistan</h2>\nThe Tecno Spark 20C is a budget-friendly smartphone designed to offer reliable performance with essential features, catering to users who want a balance between price and functionality. Released on <strong>27 November 2023</strong>, this phone is ideal for users looking for an affordable device that can handle everyday tasks such as social media, photography, and multitasking without a hitch.\n<h4>Display and Design:</h4>\nThe Tecno Spark 20C boasts a <strong>6.6-inch IPS LCD display</strong> with a resolution of <strong>720 x 1612 pixels</strong>. This large screen size is perfect for users who love watching videos, browsing the web, or playing casual games. The display ensures bright and clear visuals, providing a good viewing experience even in outdoor settings. With dimensions of <strong>163.7 x 75.6 x 8.6 mm</strong>, the phone is easy to handle and offers a sleek, modern look. The device supports <strong>dual-SIM</strong> functionality, making it convenient for those who need to use two numbers on a single phone.\n<h4>Performance and Memory:</h4>\nUnder the hood, the Tecno Spark 20C is powered by the <strong>MediaTek Helio G36 processor</strong> paired with a <strong>PowerVR GE8320 GPU</strong>, delivering smooth performance for day-to-day tasks like browsing, streaming, and light gaming. The phone comes with <strong>4GB of RAM</strong>, ensuring that multitasking and running multiple apps do not slow down the system. The <strong>128GB internal storage</strong> provides ample space for storing apps, photos, videos, and more. If users need extra storage, they can easily expand it with a <strong>microSDXC card</strong>.\n<h4>Camera:</h4>\nOne of the standout features of the Tecno Spark 20C is its <strong>50MP dual-camera setup</strong>. The main <strong>50MP sensor</strong> captures sharp and detailed photos, making it ideal for photography enthusiasts who want high-quality images on a budget. Alongside the primary camera, there is a <strong>0.08MP depth sensor</strong> for enhanced portrait shots. The device also supports <strong>1080p video recording at 30fps</strong>, ensuring smooth and clear video quality. On the front, the phone is equipped with an <strong>8MP selfie camera</strong> with a front-facing flash, perfect for capturing selfies even in low-light conditions. Both the front and rear cameras are capable of <strong>video recording</strong>, making the Tecno Spark 20C a versatile option for content creators.\n<h4>Battery Life:</h4>\nThe Tecno Spark 20C packs a <strong>5000mAh battery</strong>, providing excellent battery life for users who are always on the go. The large battery ensures that the phone can last through a full day of heavy usage without needing to recharge. Whether you’re browsing social media, streaming videos, or gaming, the battery life on this device won’t leave you hanging.\n<h4>Connectivity:</h4>\nIn terms of connectivity, the Tecno Spark 20C covers all the essential features. It supports <strong>3G</strong>, <strong>4G/LTE</strong> for fast internet speeds, and <strong>Wi-Fi</strong> for reliable wireless connectivity. The device also includes <strong>Bluetooth</strong> for connecting to wireless headphones or other Bluetooth devices. While it lacks <strong>5G</strong> support, the 4G network ensures good speed for most users. The device comes with <strong>FM radio</strong> support, making it a great option for users who still enjoy traditional radio on their smartphones. However, it does not come with <strong>NFC</strong> support, which may be a drawback for those who use NFC-based services like mobile payments.\n<h4>Operating System:</h4>\nRunning on <strong>Android 13</strong>, the Tecno Spark 20C offers the latest software experience with enhanced features and security. Android 13 provides a clean, intuitive user interface, allowing for easy navigation through apps and settings. Users can also enjoy the latest privacy features and system updates, making the phone more secure and efficient.\n<h4>Summary of Key Features:</h4>\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Dual-SIM</strong> support (Nano-SIM, dual standby)</li>\n 	<li><strong>6.6-inch IPS LCD display</strong> with a resolution of 720 x 1612 pixels</li>\n 	<li><strong>50MP + 0.08MP rear camera</strong> setup with 1080p video recording at 30fps</li>\n 	<li><strong>8MP front camera</strong> with front flash for better selfies</li>\n 	<li><strong>4GB RAM</strong>, <strong>128GB internal storage</strong>, expandable via <strong>microSDXC</strong></li>\n 	<li><strong>MediaTek Helio G36 processor</strong> for efficient performance</li>\n 	<li><strong>5000mAh battery</strong> for long-lasting usage</li>\n 	<li><strong>Android 13</strong> operating system with enhanced features</li>\n 	<li>Supports <strong>3G, 4G/LTE</strong>, <strong>Wi-Fi</strong>, and <strong>Bluetooth</strong></li>\n 	<li><strong>FM Radio</strong> support for traditional radio listening</li>\n</ul>\nThe Tecno Spark 20C is an excellent choice for budget-conscious buyers in Pakistan who need a reliable smartphone for daily use. It offers a good balance of performance, battery life, and camera features, making it a solid option in its price range. Whether you\'re interested in capturing beautiful photos, enjoying multimedia content, or simply needing a reliable device for calls and internet browsing, the Tecno Spark 20C can meet your needs without breaking the bank.', '<div class=\"product-table\">\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13 OS</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">MediaTek Helio P35</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">8 MP, Dual LED Flash</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Camera: 50 MP, (wide), 1/2.8\", PDAF 0.08 MP (auxiliary lens)</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.6 Inches</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh ,18W wired</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">128GB Built-in, 4GB RAM</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 1, 0, 26999, 26299, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:49:48', '2025-04-22 11:51:11', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(66, 'Yolo Epic Smart Watch', 'yolo-epic-bluetooth-calling-smart-watch', 11, 62, '<h2>Yolo Epic Bluetooth Calling Smart Watch Price in Pakistan</h2>\r\nThe Yolo Epic Bluetooth Calling Smart Watch is the ultimate fusion of advanced technology and stylish design, tailored for the modern user who prioritizes connectivity and fitness. Available at a competitive price in Pakistan, this smartwatch is packed with features that enhance your daily activities while keeping you in touch with your world.\r\n<h4><strong>Impressive Display &amp; Build Quality</strong></h4>\r\nEquipped with a 1.91-inch bright HD display, the Yolo Epic ensures that all your notifications and fitness data are easy to read, even in bright sunlight. The sleek design, complemented by a comfortable silicone strap, makes it perfect for all-day wear, whether you’re at work, exercising, or socializing. Its IP67 water resistance rating allows you to wear it in various environments, protecting it from splashes and sweat during workouts.\r\n<h4><strong>Comprehensive Fitness Tracking</strong></h4>\r\nWith over 120 sports modes, the Yolo Epic is engineered to support a wide array of activities. From running and cycling to yoga and weightlifting, this smartwatch allows you to monitor your workouts effectively. It tracks essential metrics such as heart rate, calories burned, and workout duration, helping you stay motivated and reach your fitness goals. The versatility in modes means you can customize your fitness experience according to your preferences.\r\n<h4><strong>Bluetooth Calling Features</strong></h4>\r\nStay connected effortlessly with the Yolo Epic\'s Bluetooth calling capabilities. You can make and receive calls directly from your wrist, giving you the freedom to stay in touch without constantly checking your phone. Whether you’re on a run or in a meeting, this feature ensures that you don’t miss important calls while remaining hands-free.\r\n<h4><strong>Long-lasting Battery Performance</strong></h4>\r\nDesigned with smart battery management, the Yolo Epic ensures that you get maximum usage without the need for frequent charging. This longevity makes it a reliable companion for both daily tasks and intensive workouts. You can focus on your activities without worrying about battery life, allowing you to live life to the fullest.\r\n<h4><strong>Enhanced User Experience</strong></h4>\r\nThe proprietary operating system is designed to provide a smooth user experience, allowing for easy navigation through apps and features. With a speaker built-in, you can enjoy music or take calls seamlessly. The Yolo Epic Bluetooth Calling Smart Watch keeps you engaged with notifications from your favorite apps, helping you stay organized and connected.\r\n<h4><strong>Durable and Comfortable Design</strong></h4>\r\nThe silicone strap not only provides comfort but also ensures durability. It can withstand the rigors of daily wear, making it suitable for various environments, from the gym to the office. Its lightweight design means you can wear it throughout the day without feeling weighed down.\r\n<h4><strong>Why Choose the Yolo Epic Bluetooth Calling Smart Watch?</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bright HD Display</strong>: Enjoy clear visibility for notifications and fitness data.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>120+ Sports Modes</strong>: Comprehensive tracking for a variety of physical activities.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth Calling</strong>: Make and receive calls directly from your wrist.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>IP67 Water Resistance</strong>: Built to handle various conditions, from workouts to everyday wear.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Smart Battery Life</strong>: Extended usage without frequent recharges.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThe Yolo Epic Bluetooth Calling Smart Watch is more than just a timepiece; it\'s an essential tool for anyone looking to enhance their lifestyle with technology. Its competitive price in Pakistan, combined with its robust features, makes it an attractive choice for those seeking a reliable smartwatch that fits their active lifestyle.\r\n\r\nIn conclusion, the Yolo Epic offers a perfect blend of functionality and style, making it a worthy addition to your tech collection. Whether you\'re a fitness enthusiast or someone who values connectivity, this smartwatch has everything you need to elevate your daily routine.', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>Bluetooth calling</li>\r\n 	<li>live watch faces</li>\r\n 	<li>1.91 inch display</li>\r\n 	<li>zinc alloy frame</li>\r\n 	<li>IP67 water resistant</li>\r\n 	<li>Sync messages / Smart notification</li>\r\n 	<li>120 sports modes</li>\r\n 	<li>Heart Rate andSpO2 Tracker</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 8499, 4999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:49:48', '2025-05-11 13:26:37', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(67, 'Yolo Supreme Bluetooth Calling Watch', 'yolo-supreme-bluetooth-calling-watch', 11, 62, '<h2>Yolo Supreme Bluetooth Calling Watch Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\nThe Yolo Supreme Bluetooth Calling Watch is an ideal blend of smart technology and modern design, perfect for individuals who value both functionality and style. This smartwatch not only enhances your daily routine with smart features but also helps you stay on top of your fitness goals with over 100+ workout modes. Available at a competitive price in Pakistan, it offers a seamless Bluetooth calling experience with a sleek, modern look.\r\n<h4><strong>Stunning Display &amp; Design</strong></h4>\r\nFeaturing a 1.78-inch AMOLED screen, the Yolo Supreme Bluetooth Calling Watch provides a crisp and vivid display, ensuring that all your notifications and metrics are easy to read even under direct sunlight. The silicon strap offers comfort for all-day wear, while its lightweight design ensures it doesn’t feel bulky on your wrist. With an IP67 water-resistant rating, you can wear it while washing your hands or in the rain without worry.\r\n<h4><strong>Unmatched Fitness Tracking</strong></h4>\r\nThis smartwatch isn’t just about making calls or looking good—it\'s packed with features that cater to your active lifestyle. The Yolo Supreme comes equipped with 100+ workout modes that cover a wide variety of exercises, from basic walking and running to more specialized routines like yoga or cycling. It helps you monitor your progress, offering insights into your workouts and overall health, so you can stay motivated to achieve your fitness goals.\r\n<h4><strong>Bluetooth Calling at Your Fingertips</strong></h4>\r\nStay connected with Bluetooth calling functionality, allowing you to make and receive calls directly from your wrist without needing to reach for your phone. Whether you\'re on the go, in the gym, or simply don\'t want to carry your phone around, this feature offers convenience and connectivity right on your wrist.\r\n<h4><strong>Reliable Battery Life</strong></h4>\r\nYolo Supreme is designed with a smart battery life management system. It offers long-lasting performance, so you don’t have to worry about charging it frequently. Even with regular usage, it provides extended battery life, making it a perfect companion for your daily adventures.\r\n<h4><strong>Durability and Comfort</strong></h4>\r\nConstructed with a silicone strap, the Yolo Supreme Bluetooth Calling Watch is both durable and comfortable, allowing for extended wear without irritation. Whether you\'re working out, at the office, or heading out for the day, this watch complements your lifestyle with ease and reliability.\r\n<h4><strong>Why Choose the Yolo Supreme Bluetooth Calling Watch?</strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>AMOLED Display</strong>: Enjoy a bright, clear display for all your smartwatch needs.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>100+ Workout Modes</strong>: Comprehensive fitness tracking for multiple types of exercises.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth Calling</strong>: Stay connected without needing to hold your phone.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>IP67 Water Resistance</strong>: Built to withstand the elements, from sweat to splashes.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Long Battery Life</strong>: No need for frequent recharges, keeping up with your busy life.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nAt an affordable price in Pakistan, the Yolo Supreme Bluetooth Calling Watch provides unmatched value with its premium features. Whether you\'re looking for an upgrade in your wearable tech or simply need a reliable smartwatch that keeps up with your lifestyle, the Yolo Supreme is an excellent choice. It combines style, function, and durability, making it a standout option in the world of smartwatches.', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>1.78 inch Amoled Display</li>\r\n 	<li>Bluetooth Calling</li>\r\n 	<li>Smart Battery Life</li>\r\n 	<li>Premium Metal Frame</li>\r\n 	<li>IP67 Water resistant</li>\r\n 	<li>100 Professional sports modes</li>\r\n 	<li>Sync messages / Smart Notification</li>\r\n 	<li>24/7 Heart Rate\r\nBlood Oxygen Monitor</li>\r\n 	<li>Live watch Faces</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 14999, 10399, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:49:48', '2025-05-12 15:36:37', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(68, 'Mi Haylou RS4 Max Smart Watch', 'haylou-rs4-max-calling-smart-watch', 11, 66, '<h2>Haylou RS4 Max Calling Smart Watch Price in Pakistan</h2>\r\nThe <strong>Haylou RS4 Max Calling Smart Watch</strong> is a perfect combination of style, technology, and fitness features, making it one of the most versatile smartwatches available in Pakistan. Offering <strong>Bluetooth calling</strong>, multiple health monitoring tools, and an impressive <strong>7-day battery life</strong>, the Haylou RS4 Max is designed for those who want to stay connected and track their fitness journey effortlessly.\r\n\r\nWith its <strong>IP68 water resistance</strong>, sleek design, and large <strong>48mm HD display</strong>, this smartwatch caters to fitness enthusiasts and professionals who prefer a gadget that performs well and looks good. Whether you\'re an Android or iOS user, the <strong>Haylou RS4 Max</strong> provides seamless compatibility, ensuring that you’re never out of touch with important notifications and calls\r\n<h3><strong>Key Features of Haylou RS4 Max Calling Smart Watch</strong></h3>\r\n<h4>1. <strong>Bluetooth Calling</strong>:</h4>\r\nOne of the standout features of the <strong>Haylou RS4 Max</strong> is its <strong>Bluetooth calling</strong> capability. The smartwatch allows you to make and receive calls directly from your wrist, thanks to its built-in <strong>speaker</strong> and microphone. Whether you\'re at the gym, driving, or on the go, you no longer need to reach for your phone to stay connected. With <strong>Bluetooth Version 5.3</strong>, it ensures fast and stable connectivity with minimal interruptions.\r\n<h4>2. <strong>Stunning HD Display</strong>:</h4>\r\nThe <strong>48mm HD display</strong> of the Haylou RS4 Max is sharp and vibrant, with a resolution of <strong>320 x 380</strong> pixels. This large screen allows for easy navigation, clear visuals, and a smooth user interface, enhancing the overall smartwatch experience. Whether you\'re viewing health metrics, notifications, or using the watch’s fitness modes, everything appears crisp and detailed on this high-quality display.\r\n<h4>3. <strong>Health Monitoring Tools</strong>:</h4>\r\nThe Haylou RS4 Max comes equipped with a variety of health tracking features that allow users to stay on top of their fitness and well-being:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Heart Rate Monitor</strong>: Track your heart rate in real time throughout the day, whether you\'re resting, working out, or sleeping. This feature helps you stay aware of your cardiovascular health.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Oxygen Level Monitoring</strong>: With the built-in <strong>SpO2 sensor</strong>, you can monitor your blood oxygen levels, ensuring you are maintaining optimal health.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Sleep Quality Monitor</strong>: The Haylou RS4 Max tracks your sleep patterns and provides detailed insights into your sleep quality. This helps you adjust your lifestyle to get better rest and improve your overall well-being.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Step Tracker &amp; Calories Burned</strong>: Keep track of your daily steps, distance traveled, and calories burned. These features help motivate you to stay active and achieve your fitness goals.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>4. <strong>Multiple Sports Modes</strong>:</h4>\r\nWhether you\'re into running, cycling, or yoga, the <strong>Haylou RS4 Max</strong> comes with <strong>multiple sports modes</strong> to suit your workout routine. These modes help you accurately track your performance in different physical activities, providing you with real-time data on your calories burned, heart rate, and more. This makes it an essential tool for anyone looking to improve their fitness level.\r\n<h4>5. <strong>Water Resistance (IP68 Rating)</strong>:</h4>\r\nThanks to its <strong>IP68 water resistance</strong>, the Haylou RS4 Max is designed to withstand dust and water. You can wear it during intense workouts, while swimming, or even in rainy weather without worrying about damage. This feature makes it a great option for outdoor enthusiasts and those who lead active lifestyles.\r\n<h4>6. <strong>Voice Assistant</strong>:</h4>\r\nWith the built-in <strong>Voice Assistant</strong>, the Haylou RS4 Max allows for hands-free control. You can perform tasks like setting reminders, sending texts, or making calls simply by using voice commands. This adds an extra layer of convenience, especially when you’re multitasking or in a situation where you can’t use your hands.\r\n<h4>7. <strong>Battery Life</strong>:</h4>\r\nThe Haylou RS4 Max is powered by a <strong>270mAh battery</strong> that provides up to <strong>7 days of battery life</strong> on a single charge. Whether you\'re using it heavily for fitness tracking and Bluetooth calls, or moderately for daily notifications, the battery life ensures that you won’t need to recharge frequently. This makes it perfect for those who don’t want the hassle of charging their device every day.\r\n<h4>8. <strong>Compatibility with Android and iOS</strong>:</h4>\r\nWhether you own an Android or an iPhone, the Haylou RS4 Max offers complete compatibility with both operating systems. You can sync the smartwatch with your smartphone to receive notifications, calls, and health data, ensuring that you\'re always connected. This versatility makes it a great choice for all smartphone users.\r\n<h3><strong>Why Should You Choose Haylou RS4 Max Calling Smart Watch?</strong></h3>\r\nThe <strong>Haylou RS4 Max Calling Smart Watch</strong> is an excellent choice for individuals who want a comprehensive fitness tracker combined with <strong>Bluetooth calling</strong> functionality. The large <strong>HD display</strong> provides crystal-clear visuals, while the <strong>IP68 water resistance</strong> ensures that the watch can withstand tough conditions, whether you\'re working out, swimming, or out in the rain.\r\n\r\nThe health monitoring tools such as the <strong>heart rate monitor</strong>, <strong>sleep tracker</strong>, and <strong>oxygen level monitoring</strong> offer valuable insights into your well-being, allowing you to maintain a healthier lifestyle. Furthermore, the <strong>7-day battery life</strong> means you won’t have to constantly recharge your device, giving you peace of mind during your busy day.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re looking for a reliable, stylish, and functional smartwatch in Pakistan, the <strong>Haylou RS4 Max</strong> is a fantastic option, offering great value for its price. Its combination of advanced features and affordable pricing makes it a top competitor in the smartwatch market.', '<ul>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\">Product name: </span>Haylou RS4 Max</li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\">Dimensions:    </span>48.3x39x11.4mm</li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\">Working temperature: </span>-10 - 45°C</li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\">Resolution: </span>320x380px</li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\">Colors: </span>Midnight Blue, Starlight Silver</li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\">Bluetooth: </span>V5.3</li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\">Water-resistance grade: </span>IP68</li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\">Battery life: </span>9 days (24/7 heart rate monitoring)</li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\">Display: </span>1.91-inch LCD display</li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\">Synced data platform: </span>Haylou Fun</li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\">Battery: </span>270mAh</li>\r\n 	<li><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\">Supported devices: </span>Android 6.0 and above, iOS 9.0 and above</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 13999, 10899, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:49:48', '2025-05-12 16:45:40', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(69, 'Kieslect Smart Calling Watch Ks Mini', 'kieslect-smart-calling-watch-ks-mini', 11, 64, '<h3 class=\"LC20lb MBeuO DKV0Md\">Kieslect Smart Calling Watch Ks Mini Price in Pakistan</h3>\nThe <strong>Kieslect Smart Calling Watch Ks Mini</strong> is a perfect blend of smart technology, fitness tracking, and stylish design. For those who are looking for a smartwatch with robust calling features, health monitoring tools, and a stunning display, the Ks Mini offers everything at an affordable price in Pakistan. With <strong>Bluetooth calling</strong>, a vibrant <strong>AMOLED HD display</strong>, and advanced health tracking options, it’s designed to elevate your smartwatch experience.\n\nIf you\'re looking to stay connected on the go while keeping an eye on your health, the Kieslect Ks Mini Smart Watch is the ideal device. Its sleek design, versatile features, and compatibility with both Android and iOS make it a must-have accessory for tech-savvy individuals in Pakistan.\n<h4><strong>Key Features of Kieslect Smart Calling Watch Ks Mini</strong></h4>\n<ol>\n 	<li><strong>Stylish Design with an AMOLED HD Display</strong>:\n<ul>\n 	<li>The <strong>Kieslect Smart Calling Watch Ks Mini</strong> comes with a <strong>44mm AMOLED HD display</strong> that offers sharp and vibrant visuals. The screen has a resolution of <strong>368 x 448</strong>, which provides a smooth and clear viewing experience, whether you’re checking notifications, making calls, or tracking your fitness.</li>\n 	<li>The overall design is modern and sleek, making it a great fashion accessory. The <strong>silicon strap</strong> ensures comfort and durability, making it ideal for everyday wear, whether you\'re at the gym or in the office.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth Calling</strong>:\n<ul>\n 	<li>One of the standout features of the Kieslect Ks Mini is its <strong>Bluetooth calling</strong> functionality. This feature allows you to answer or make calls directly from your wrist without having to take out your phone. Whether you\'re working out, driving, or simply on the go, this feature ensures seamless communication at all times.</li>\n 	<li>With the built-in speaker and microphone, you can have clear conversations even when your hands are busy.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n 	<li><strong>Voice Assistant</strong>:\n<ul>\n 	<li>The smartwatch also includes a <strong>Voice Assistant</strong> feature, which enables you to control the watch with voice commands. This adds an extra layer of convenience, especially when your hands are occupied.</li>\n 	<li>From making calls to checking the weather or setting reminders, the Voice Assistant provides a hands-free experience.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n 	<li><strong>Advanced Health Monitoring</strong>:\n<ul>\n 	<li>The <strong>Kieslect Smart Calling Watch Ks Mini</strong> offers various health-tracking features that help you monitor your overall well-being. These include a <strong>heart rate monitor</strong>, <strong>step tracker</strong>, <strong>sleep quality monitor</strong>, and <strong>oxygen level monitoring</strong>.</li>\n 	<li>The <strong>heart rate monitor</strong> keeps a close check on your pulse throughout the day, allowing you to stay on top of your cardiovascular health. Whether you\'re resting or exercising, you can track your heart rate in real-time.</li>\n 	<li>With the <strong>sleep quality monitor</strong>, you can keep track of your sleep patterns and improve your sleep cycle for better rest and recovery.</li>\n 	<li>The <strong>step tracker</strong> helps you set daily goals, encouraging an active lifestyle by counting your steps and tracking your movement.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n 	<li><strong>Multiple Sports Modes</strong>:\n<ul>\n 	<li>For fitness enthusiasts, the Kieslect Ks Mini provides <strong>multiple sports modes</strong> to cater to various workout routines. Whether you\'re running, cycling, walking, or engaged in more specialized activities, the smartwatch has a mode to suit your needs.</li>\n 	<li>These sports modes help you accurately track your fitness progress, calories burned, and workout intensity, making it an essential tool for reaching your health and fitness goals.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n 	<li><strong>Water Resistance – IP68 Rating</strong>:\n<ul>\n 	<li>With an <strong>IP68 water resistance</strong> rating, the Kieslect Smart Calling Watch Ks Mini is protected against dust and water. You can wear it during workouts, in the rain, or even while swimming without worrying about water damage.</li>\n 	<li>This makes it a versatile smartwatch that can handle tough environments, whether you’re swimming laps in the pool or caught in an unexpected downpour.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n 	<li><strong>Battery Life</strong>:\n<ul>\n 	<li>The watch is powered by a <strong>280 mAh battery</strong>, offering <strong>smart battery life</strong> that lasts for multiple days on a single charge. Depending on usage, the smartwatch can last up to a few days without needing to recharge.</li>\n 	<li>The long battery life ensures that the watch is ready to keep up with your busy lifestyle without the constant hassle of recharging.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n 	<li><strong>Compatibility</strong>:\n<ul>\n 	<li>The Kieslect Smart Calling Watch Ks Mini is compatible with both <strong>Android</strong> and <strong>iOS</strong> devices. This ensures seamless connectivity, allowing you to sync your smartphone with the smartwatch to receive notifications, calls, and other alerts directly on your wrist.</li>\n 	<li>The smartwatch supports <strong>Bluetooth version 5.2</strong>, which guarantees stable and fast connectivity with minimal lag or disconnection issues.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h4><strong>Why Should You Buy the Kieslect Smart Calling Watch Ks Mini?</strong></h4>\nThe <strong>Kieslect Smart Calling Watch Ks Mini</strong> is perfect for those who want a smartwatch that offers more than just basic functionality. It’s not just a fitness tracker but also a <strong>Bluetooth calling device</strong> that allows you to stay connected without pulling out your phone. The <strong>AMOLED HD display</strong> ensures that your visuals are sharp and bright, while the <strong>health monitoring features</strong> help you keep track of your fitness and well-being.\n\nIts sleek design, multiple sports modes, and <strong>IP68 water resistance</strong> make it suitable for both indoor and outdoor activities, while the <strong>smart battery life</strong> ensures that it stays functional for extended periods. Whether you\'re looking for a smartwatch to help you stay fit or one to keep you connected throughout the day, the Kieslect Ks Mini has all the essential features you need.\n\nAdditionally, its compatibility with both <strong>Android</strong> and <strong>iOS devices</strong> ensures that it will work seamlessly with your current smartphone, making it a highly versatile option in the smart wearable market.', '<ul>\n 	<li>Clear &amp; Stable Bluetooth Calls</li>\n 	<li>Abnormal Heart Rate Warning</li>\n 	<li>1.78″ HD Colorful Amoled Display</li>\n 	<li>Easy 24H Health Management</li>\n 	<li>Dynamic Ul</li>\n 	<li>For both Android and IOS</li>\n</ul>', 1, 50, 13999, 10899, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:49:48', '2025-04-22 11:44:51', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(70, 'Xinji Cobee C1 Pros Smart Watch', 'xinji-cobee-c1-pros-smart-watch', 11, 58, '<h2>Xinji Cobee C1 Pros Smart Watch Price In Pakistan</h2>\nThe <strong>Xinji Cobee C1 Pros Smart Watch</strong> is a perfect blend of style, durability, and functionality. Whether you’re a fitness enthusiast or simply looking for a smartwatch to stay connected, the Xinji Cobee C1 Pros offers an impressive range of features that makes it stand out in the market. With over <strong>100+ sports modes</strong>, <strong>IP68 water resistance</strong>, and a robust <strong>14-day battery life</strong>, this smartwatch is designed to keep up with your active lifestyle without compromising on style or performance.\n\nIf you\'re searching for the best value for money in the smart wearables market, the Xinji Cobee C1 Pros is the perfect option. Here’s an in-depth look at why this watch should be your next purchase.\n<h4><strong>Key Features of Xinji Cobee C1 Pros Smart Watch</strong></h4>\n<ol>\n 	<li><strong>Design and Display</strong>:\n<ul>\n 	<li>The <strong>Xinji Cobee C1 Pros Smart Watch</strong> features a large <strong>1.91-inch TFT display</strong> with a resolution of <strong>240x296 pixels</strong>. The vibrant and colorful screen provides clear visuals, making it easy to check notifications, track fitness stats, or view the time, even in bright sunlight.</li>\n 	<li>The watch has a sleek design with dimensions of <strong>37.97<em>46.86</em>10.8mm</strong>, offering a perfect balance between comfort and durability. Weighing just <strong>50g</strong>, the smartwatch is light enough for all-day wear without any discomfort.</li>\n 	<li>The <strong>TPU strap material</strong> adds flexibility, durability, and comfort. TPU is known for being resistant to oils and wear, making this watch strap perfect for everyday use.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n 	<li><strong>100+ Sports Modes</strong>:\n<ul>\n 	<li>One of the standout features of the Xinji Cobee C1 Pros Smart Watch is its <strong>100+ sport modes</strong>. Whether you\'re into running, cycling, swimming, or even less conventional activities like yoga or rowing, this smartwatch has a mode for you.</li>\n 	<li>The variety of sport modes ensures you can track and optimize your workouts, making it easier to reach your fitness goals.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n 	<li><strong>Health Monitoring</strong>:\n<ul>\n 	<li>The Xinji Cobee C1 Pros Smart Watch is equipped with a variety of health monitoring tools. From <strong>heart rate monitoring</strong> to sleep tracking, the watch helps you stay on top of your overall wellness.</li>\n 	<li>It can provide real-time data on your heart rate during workouts and rest periods, helping you maintain a balanced and healthy lifestyle.</li>\n 	<li>Sleep tracking offers insights into your sleep quality and patterns, allowing you to make adjustments for better rest and recovery.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n 	<li><strong>Water-Resistant – IP68 Rating</strong>:\n<ul>\n 	<li>The Xinji Cobee C1 Pros Smart Watch is <strong>IP68 water-resistant</strong>, making it perfect for a wide range of environments. Whether you\'re sweating during an intense workout, caught in the rain, or even swimming, this smartwatch can withstand water exposure without getting damaged.</li>\n 	<li>This feature makes it an ideal companion for swimmers and those who engage in water sports, ensuring your watch remains functional no matter the conditions.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n 	<li><strong>Battery Life</strong>:\n<ul>\n 	<li>The <strong>280mAh battery</strong> provides an impressive <strong>14-day battery life</strong>. Whether you\'re using the smartwatch for fitness tracking, checking notifications, or simply as a timepiece, you won’t need to worry about recharging it constantly.</li>\n 	<li>The long battery life is one of the most appealing features, especially for users who don’t want the hassle of frequent charging.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n 	<li><strong>Compatibility</strong>:\n<ul>\n 	<li>The Xinji Cobee C1 Pros Smart Watch is compatible with devices running <strong>Android 5.0 or higher</strong> and <strong>iOS 10.0 and above</strong>. This ensures seamless connectivity with most smartphones, allowing you to receive notifications, calls, and messages right on your wrist.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n 	<li><strong>Durability and Build Quality</strong>:\n<ul>\n 	<li>With a solid build quality and durable materials, the Xinji Cobee C1 Pros Smart Watch is designed to last. Its lightweight yet sturdy construction ensures it can withstand the rigors of daily use, whether you’re at the gym, at work, or out on an adventure.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n 	<li><strong>Connectivity and Operating System</strong>:\n<ul>\n 	<li>While the Xinji Cobee C1 Pros Smart Watch lacks features like WiFi, GPS, and NFC, it compensates by offering smooth operation through its proprietary OS, which runs efficiently on both Android and iOS platforms.</li>\n 	<li>It offers Bluetooth connectivity to ensure smooth pairing with your smartphone, providing notifications for calls, messages, and app alerts directly on the smartwatch.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h4><strong>Why Choose Xinji Cobee C1 Pros Smart Watch?</strong></h4>\nThe <strong>Xinji Cobee C1 Pros Smart Watch</strong> is designed for users who want both fitness features and everyday functionality. Whether you are tracking your workouts with one of the <strong>100+ sports modes</strong> or monitoring your heart rate and sleep quality, the watch offers everything you need to stay healthy and fit. The <strong>IP68 water resistance</strong> allows you to wear it during intense exercise or swimming without worry.\n\nWith its lightweight and comfortable design, this smartwatch can be worn all day, while its <strong>14-day battery life</strong> ensures that you won’t have to frequently recharge it. The <strong>large, colorful 1.91-inch TFT display</strong> ensures easy readability, while the <strong>TPU strap</strong> provides both comfort and durability.\n\nWhile it may lack advanced features like GPS or NFC, its affordable price point makes it a great option for users looking for a high-quality smartwatch that focuses on core fitness and health functionalities. The Xinji Cobee C1 Pros Smart Watch is an excellent choice for anyone who values health tracking, durability, and an extended battery life.', '<ul>\n 	<li>Bluetooth Calling</li>\n 	<li>1.91” HD Display&amp;60HZ Refresh Rate</li>\n 	<li>IP68 Dustproof and Waterproof</li>\n 	<li>Suport 100 Sport Modes</li>\n 	<li>ALL-ROUND HEALTH MANAGEMENT</li>\n 	<li>Smart Call/APP Notifications with Phone</li>\n 	<li>6 Colorful Straps to Suit Your Style</li>\n</ul>', 1, 50, 13999, 10899, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:49:48', '2025-04-23 13:31:03', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(71, 'Yolo Bluetooth Calling Watch Pro Max', 'yolo-bluetooth-calling-watch-pro-max', 11, 62, '<h2>Yolo Bluetooth Calling Watch Pro Max Price in Pakistan</h2>\r\nThe Yolo Bluetooth Calling Watch Pro Max offers a perfect balance of style, functionality, and performance. With its sleek design, colorful HD display, and fitness-oriented features, this smartwatch caters to tech-savvy users who want a modern watch that not only looks great but also keeps them connected and healthy. If you’re looking for a smartwatch that provides premium features at an affordable price in Pakistan, the Yolo Bluetooth Calling Watch Pro Max is a fantastic option.\r\n<h4><strong>Key Features of the Yolo Bluetooth Calling Watch Pro Max</strong>:</h4>\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth Calling</strong>:\r\nOne of the standout features of the Yolo Bluetooth Calling Watch Pro Max is its ability to make and receive calls directly from your wrist. It uses <strong>Bluetooth 5.0</strong> technology, ensuring a stable connection with your smartphone, whether it\'s an Android or iOS device. This feature is perfect for people on the go, allowing you to stay connected without reaching for your phone.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Voice Assistant Integration</strong>:\r\nThe watch also supports <strong>voice assistant</strong> features, making it easy to manage tasks like setting reminders, checking the weather, or making calls using simple voice commands. This integration adds convenience and efficiency to your daily life, ensuring you can stay hands-free while staying in control.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Health Monitoring Features</strong>:\r\nThe Yolo Bluetooth Calling Watch Pro Max comes equipped with a range of health monitoring tools to help you stay on top of your fitness and wellness. These include:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Heart Rate Monitoring</strong>: Keeps track of your heart rate in real-time, making it easier to monitor your cardiovascular health during workouts or rest periods.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Sleep Quality Monitoring</strong>: Helps you understand your sleep patterns, providing insights to improve your overall sleep quality.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Step Tracker</strong>: Counts your daily steps and encourages you to stay active throughout the day.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Oxygen Level Monitoring</strong>: Measures your blood oxygen levels, which is especially useful during intense workouts or in high-altitude environments.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Multiple Sports Modes</strong>:\r\nWith <strong>multiple sports modes</strong>, the Yolo Bluetooth Calling Watch Pro Max tracks various types of physical activities, from running and cycling to more specific workouts like yoga and swimming. This feature makes it a versatile fitness partner for both beginners and fitness enthusiasts alike.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Water Resistant - IP67 Rating</strong>:\r\nThe Yolo Bluetooth Calling Watch Pro Max comes with an <strong>IP67 water-resistant rating</strong>, meaning it can withstand water splashes and brief submersion in water. Whether you’re caught in the rain, washing your hands, or sweating during a workout, the watch can handle it without issue.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Colorful HD Display</strong>:\r\nThe <strong>48mm colorful HD display</strong> makes the watch easy to use and visually appealing. It offers bright and vibrant colors, making it easy to check notifications, health data, or the time at a glance. The large screen size ensures that the watch is easy to interact with, even in direct sunlight.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Smart Battery Life</strong>:\r\nWhile the exact battery capacity is not specified, the Yolo Bluetooth Calling Watch Pro Max boasts a <strong>smart battery life</strong> feature. This ensures that you can use the watch throughout the day for both fitness tracking and staying connected, without constantly worrying about recharging.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Silicon Strap</strong>:\r\nThe watch comes with a durable and comfortable <strong>silicon strap</strong>. This strap is both soft and flexible, making it suitable for all-day wear, whether you’re working out or going about your daily tasks. Its material is also skin-friendly, reducing the risk of irritation.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h4><strong>Compatibility</strong>:</h4>\r\nThe Yolo Bluetooth Calling Watch Pro Max is compatible with both <strong>Android and iOS</strong> devices. This cross-platform compatibility ensures that no matter which smartphone you use, the smartwatch will seamlessly integrate into your tech ecosystem.\r\n<h4><strong>Why Choose the Yolo Bluetooth Calling Watch Pro Max?</strong></h4>\r\nThe Yolo Bluetooth Calling Watch Pro Max stands out in the smartwatch market due to its unique combination of <strong>Bluetooth calling</strong>, <strong>voice assistant integration</strong>, and <strong>health monitoring features</strong>. These elements make it more than just a regular watch—it\'s a full-fledged smart device designed to enhance your daily life.\r\n\r\nWith its <strong>multiple sports modes</strong>, it provides great value for fitness enthusiasts, offering comprehensive tracking to help you meet your health and fitness goals. The <strong>heart rate monitor</strong>, <strong>sleep quality tracker</strong>, and <strong>oxygen level monitoring</strong> ensure that you stay in tune with your body, making this watch a reliable health companion.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, the <strong>IP67 water-resistant rating</strong> allows you to wear the watch in various conditions without worrying about damage. The <strong>48mm colorful HD display</strong> adds a premium touch to the watch, making it not only functional but also stylish and modern.\r\n\r\nFinally, the Yolo Bluetooth Calling Watch Pro Max offers <strong>smart battery life</strong>, ensuring it lasts long enough to meet the demands of your busy schedule. You can stay connected, monitor your health, and track your fitness progress-all while enjoying a high-quality smartwatch at a competitive price in Pakistan.', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>Bluetooth Calling</li>\r\n 	<li>Music Playback</li>\r\n 	<li>1.91” HD Bright Display</li>\r\n 	<li>120 Sports Modes</li>\r\n 	<li>IP67 Water Resistant</li>\r\n 	<li>24/7 Heart Rate, BP Blood Oxygen Monitor</li>\r\n 	<li>Zinc Alloy Frame</li>\r\n 	<li>Live Watch Faces</li>\r\n 	<li>Smart Battery Life</li>\r\n 	<li>Sync Messages Smart Notification</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 0, 12499, 9499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:49:48', '2025-05-12 15:33:39', 'NULL', NULL, 0);
