(72, 'Earldom EH144 Mobile Phone Bracket Holder', 'earldom-eh144-mobile-phone-bracket-holder', 3, 58, '<h2>Earldom EH144 Mobile Phone Bracket Holder Price In Pakistan</h2>\nThe Earldom EH144 Mobile Phone Bracket Holder is an essential accessory for anyone who values convenience and safety while driving. Designed with versatility in mind, this mobile holder is ideal for securely holding your smartphone during road trips, daily commutes, or even quick drives around town. Its innovative design and practical features make it an excellent choice for those who want both functionality and style.\n<h3>Key Features of Earldom EH144 Mobile Phone Bracket Holder:</h3>\n<ol>\n 	<li><strong>Material &amp; Durability</strong>:\nBuilt using high-quality ABS plastic and silicone, the Earldom EH144 offers a sturdy yet flexible build. The material ensures the holder is both lightweight and durable, capable of withstanding everyday wear and tear. The sunburned lines on the surface give it a refined finish, making it not just a utility tool but also a sleek addition to your car interior.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Wide Compatibility</strong>:\nThis mobile phone bracket is compatible with a wide range of smartphones, supporting devices with screen sizes ranging from 4.5 inches to 7 inches. The adjustable clip width of 62mm to 95mm makes it ideal for various mobile phones, whether you use a compact model or a larger device.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Ease of Installation</strong>:\nThe Earldom EH144 Mobile Phone Bracket Holder is designed for easy installation in different positions in your car. It can be mounted either on the <strong>center console</strong> or the <strong>windshield</strong>, offering flexibility based on your preference. The strong suction cup ensures the holder stays firmly in place, even on bumpy roads.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Adjustable &amp; Secure Grip</strong>:\nThe bracket holder features an adjustable grip that holds your phone securely without damaging its surface. The silicone padding inside the clip prevents scratches on your phone, ensuring your device stays in perfect condition. Whether you\'re navigating through a map or answering hands-free calls, your phone remains securely in place.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Compact &amp; Portable Design</strong>:\nWith dimensions of <strong>115mm x 88mm x 82mm</strong> and a weight of just <strong>177.8g</strong>, this phone holder is compact and portable. You can easily take it from one car to another or even store it when not in use. Despite its small size, the holder provides a sturdy and reliable solution for holding your smartphone.</li>\n 	<li><strong>360-Degree Rotation</strong>:\nFor enhanced convenience, the Earldom EH144 Mobile Phone Bracket Holder offers <strong>360-degree rotation</strong>, allowing you to adjust the phone to your desired angle. Whether you prefer landscape or portrait mode, you can easily swivel the holder to achieve the perfect viewing position.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Secure Suction Mechanism</strong>:\nThe strong suction cup ensures that the holder stays in place on the windshield or dashboard, even during rough drives. The suction mechanism is easy to operate, ensuring a secure and stable installation without leaving any sticky residue on your car.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Hands-Free Convenience</strong>:\nThis mobile holder is the perfect companion for hands-free driving. Whether you\'re using your phone for navigation, playing music, or attending calls, the holder keeps your device in an optimal position, ensuring both convenience and safety.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Modern Design</strong>:\nFeaturing a sleek and modern design, the <strong>Earldom EH144</strong> not only performs its function effectively but also complements your car\'s interior. The sunburned line finish adds a touch of sophistication to its overall appearance.</li>\n</ol>', '<ul>\n 	<li>Compatible with 4.5-7 inch smartphones</li>\n 	<li>Durable build with ABS plastic and silicone</li>\n 	<li>360-degree adjustable rotation for optimal viewing</li>\n 	<li>Easy installation on the center console or windshield</li>\n 	<li>Secure suction cup for firm grip on rough roads</li>\n 	<li>Lightweight, compact, and portable design</li>\n 	<li>Adjustable grip with scratch-resistant silicone padding</li>\n</ul>', 1, 0, 2000, 1290, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:49:48', '2025-04-29 09:57:03', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(73, 'Joyroom 30W Power Bank 20000mAh (JR-PBF02)', 'joyroom-30w-power-bank-20000mah-jr-pbf02', 10, 47, '<h2>Joyroom 30W Power Bank 20000mAh (JR-PBF02) Price In Pakistan</h2>\nThe Joyroom 30W Power Bank 20000mAh (JR-PBF02) is a powerful and reliable charging solution, ideal for users who need to keep their devices powered up on the go. With its large battery capacity, advanced charging capabilities, and sleek design, it stands out as a top choice for anyone seeking a portable, high-performance power bank.\n<h4>Compact and Sturdy Design</h4>\nDesigned with portability in mind, the Joyroom 30W Power Bank 20000mAh (JR-PBF02) has dimensions of <strong>151 x 69 x 29mm</strong> and weighs just <strong>460g</strong>, making it easy to carry in your bag or pocket. Despite its compact size, this power bank packs a lot of power and offers durability with its robust build quality. Whether you’re traveling, working, or commuting, the lightweight design ensures that you can always have reliable power at your fingertips without the burden of a bulky device.\n<h4>Powerful 20000mAh Battery Capacity</h4>\nOne of the main highlights of the Joyroom 30W Power Bank (JR-PBF02) is its impressive <strong>20000mAh battery capacity</strong>. With this large capacity, it is capable of charging most smartphones multiple times before needing a recharge itself. This is particularly useful for people who are frequently on the move and need a long-lasting power source to keep their devices running throughout the day. Whether you have a smartphone, tablet, or other gadgets, this power bank has enough juice to keep them charged for extended periods.\n<h4>Fast Charging with 30W Output</h4>\nEquipped with <strong>30W fast charging technology</strong>, the Joyroom 20000mAh Power Bank (JR-PBF02) ensures that your devices are charged quickly and efficiently. The <strong>Type-C output port</strong> delivers powerful and stable charging, ensuring that your devices receive the necessary power in the shortest time possible. Whether you’re in a rush or just want your devices powered up quickly, the fast-charging feature guarantees optimal performance without compromising safety.\n<h4>Type-C Input and Output Ports for Versatile Charging</h4>\nThis power bank features a <strong>Type-C input and output port</strong>, making it versatile for modern devices that use this connection. The <strong>Type-C port</strong> is fast becoming the industry standard for many gadgets, offering faster data transfer rates and charging times compared to older USB standards. Whether you\'re using it to charge the power bank itself or your devices, the Type-C port ensures efficiency and reliability.\n<h4>Polymer Lithium Battery for Safe and Efficient Performance</h4>\nThe Joyroom 30W Power Bank 20000mAh (JR-PBF02) is powered by a <strong>polymer lithium battery</strong>, which provides a range of benefits. Polymer lithium batteries are known for their high energy density, longer cycle life, and improved safety. This means that the power bank not only charges your devices efficiently but also ensures a longer lifespan and safe operation. The battery’s high energy density allows for more power in a compact size, making the Joyroom power bank both portable and powerful.\n<h4>Smart Display for Easy Monitoring</h4>\nThe <strong>JR-PBF02</strong> model comes with a <strong>display</strong>, which allows you to monitor the remaining battery life of the power bank easily. This feature ensures that you’re always aware of how much power is left, so you can recharge the power bank before it runs out completely. The display is user-friendly and provides real-time battery status, helping you plan your charging needs effectively.\n<h4>Safe and Secure Charging</h4>\nSafety is a top priority when it comes to portable power banks, and the Joyroom 30W Power Bank 20000mAh (JR-PBF02) is designed with multiple protection features. It includes safeguards against <strong>overcharging</strong>, <strong>over-discharging</strong>, and <strong>short circuits</strong>, ensuring that both the power bank and your devices are protected from any potential damage. The intelligent charging system optimizes the charging process and prevents excessive heat or power surges, making it safe to use with a wide range of devices.\n<h4>Ideal for Multiple Devices</h4>\nThis power bank is versatile and compatible with a wide variety of devices, including smartphones, tablets, wireless earbuds, and even smaller laptops. The <strong>Type-C port</strong> ensures compatibility with many modern devices, making it a universal charging solution. Whether you\'re using Android, iOS, or other gadgets, the Joyroom power bank is an excellent choice for keeping all your devices powered.\n<h4>Why Choose the Joyroom 30W Power Bank 20000mAh (JR-PBF02)?</h4>\nThe Joyroom 30W Power Bank 20000mAh (JR-PBF02) stands out for its combination of power, portability, and advanced features. With its large battery capacity, fast charging capability, and robust design, it is perfect for people who need a reliable power solution on the go. Its <strong>Type-C input/output</strong>, <strong>smart display</strong>, and <strong>polymer lithium battery</strong> offer great performance while ensuring safety and convenience. Whether you’re a professional, a traveler, or a tech enthusiast, this power bank delivers the performance you need to keep your devices charged.\n<h4>Conclusion</h4>\nFor anyone looking for a high-quality, reliable power bank, the Joyroom 30W Power Bank 20000mAh (JR-PBF02) is a fantastic choice. Its compact size, powerful battery, and fast charging make it an essential tool for keeping your devices powered wherever you go. Whether you’re traveling, working, or simply going about your day, this power bank offers the performance and convenience you need in a portable charging solution.', '<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Dimensions</strong>: 151 x 69 x 29mm; <strong>Weight</strong>: 460g, compact and portable.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Battery Capacity</strong>: 20000mAh for long-lasting power.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Fast Charging</strong>: 30W output for quick and efficient charging.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Connectivity</strong>: Type-C input and output ports for versatile use.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Battery Type</strong>: Polymer lithium battery for safety and performance.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Display</strong>: Smart display to monitor battery life in real-time.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Safety Features</strong>: Protection against overcharging, discharging, and short circuits.</li>\n</ul>', 1, 50, 8900, 7899, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:49:48', '2025-04-22 11:44:51', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(74, 'JBL M3 Mini Wireless Bluetooth Speaker', 'jbl-m3-mini-wireless-bluetooth-speaker', 4, 46, '<h2>JBL M3 Mini Wireless Bluetooth Speaker Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\nThe JBL M3 Mini Wireless Bluetooth Speaker offers an ideal blend of portability, sound quality, and modern features, making it a must-have for music lovers on the go. Designed to deliver powerful sound in a compact form, this speaker provides everything you need for an immersive audio experience, whether indoors or outdoors.\r\n<h4>Compact and Portable Design</h4>\r\nThe JBL M3 Mini Wireless Bluetooth Speaker is built for portability. With dimensions of <strong>10 x 5 x 10 cm</strong> and a weight of just <strong>0.29 kg</strong>, it’s small enough to fit in your hand or a bag, making it easy to carry. Whether you’re heading to a party, going on a trip, or just relaxing at home, this speaker is lightweight and compact, perfect for music lovers who are always on the move.\r\n<h4>Bluetooth 5.0 for Stable Connectivity</h4>\r\nEquipped with the latest <strong>Bluetooth 5.0 technology</strong>, the JBL M3 Mini Wireless Bluetooth Speaker ensures a stable and seamless connection with your devices. This allows for uninterrupted music playback from up to <strong>10 meters</strong> away, giving you the freedom to control your music wirelessly without being tethered to the speaker. The <strong>Bluetooth V5.0</strong> provides faster data transmission and lower power consumption, enhancing the overall listening experience.\r\n<h4>Waterproof Design for Outdoor Use</h4>\r\nOne of the standout features of the JBL M3 Mini Wireless Bluetooth Speaker is its <strong>waterproof design</strong>, making it an excellent companion for outdoor activities. Whether you\'re by the pool, on a beach trip, or hiking, the waterproof feature ensures that the speaker can withstand splashes and spills, providing durability in various environments. Enjoy your music without worrying about accidental water damage.\r\n<h4>Impressive Sound Quality with 30Hz-20KHz Frequency Range</h4>\r\nDespite its small size, the JBL M3 Mini Wireless Bluetooth Speaker delivers impressive sound quality. The <strong>frequency range of 30Hz to 20KHz</strong> ensures that you get balanced audio, from deep bass to crystal-clear highs. This broad frequency range allows the speaker to reproduce different types of music genres effectively, giving you a full and dynamic sound experience. Whether you’re playing pop, rock, jazz, or classical music, the speaker provides clear and vibrant sound for all your favorite tracks.\r\n<h4>Built-In Microphone for Hands-Free Calls</h4>\r\nThe JBL M3 Mini Wireless Bluetooth Speaker is equipped with <strong>mic technology</strong>, allowing you to take hands-free calls directly from the speaker. This feature is incredibly convenient for busy users who want to answer phone calls without disconnecting from the speaker. The built-in microphone ensures clear and crisp voice quality during calls, making it perfect for conference calls, virtual meetings, or casual chats with friends.\r\n<h4>Fast Charging with 1.5-Hour Charging Time</h4>\r\nThe JBL M3 Mini Wireless Bluetooth Speaker features a fast-charging design that allows the battery to charge fully in just <strong>1.5 hours</strong>. This quick charging capability means you spend less time waiting and more time enjoying your music. With its long-lasting battery life, the speaker is ready to keep your music playing for extended periods before needing a recharge.\r\n<h4>Durable and Long-Lasting Battery</h4>\r\nAlthough the exact battery capacity isn’t specified, the JBL M3 Mini Wireless Bluetooth Speaker is known for providing sufficient playtime to enjoy your favorite playlists during short outings or home gatherings. The rechargeable battery ensures that you can enjoy uninterrupted music without constantly worrying about battery life, making it a reliable choice for various listening environments.\r\n<h4>No SD Card or USB Compatibility</h4>\r\nWhile the JBL M3 Mini Wireless Bluetooth Speaker does not support <strong>SD card</strong> or <strong>USB</strong> compatibility, it makes up for this with its reliable Bluetooth connectivity. This speaker is designed for users who prefer wireless audio streaming directly from their smartphone or tablet. The lack of additional ports keeps the design simple and clean, ideal for users who prioritize portability and ease of use.\r\n<h4>Why Choose JBL M3 Mini Wireless Bluetooth Speaker?</h4>\r\nThe JBL M3 Mini Wireless Bluetooth Speaker stands out as an affordable and versatile option for anyone looking for high-quality sound in a portable package. Its combination of <strong>waterproof design</strong>, <strong>Bluetooth 5.0 connectivity</strong>, and <strong>mic technology</strong> make it suitable for various uses, whether at home or outdoors. Perfect for casual listening or hands-free calls, the JBL M3 Mini is a great addition to your tech gear.\r\n<h4>Conclusion</h4>\r\nIf you’re looking for a small but powerful speaker with modern features, the <strong>J</strong>BL M3 Mini Wireless Bluetooth Speaker is an excellent choice. With its <strong>Bluetooth V5.0</strong>, <strong>waterproof design</strong>, and <strong>built-in microphone</strong>, this speaker offers a fantastic blend of convenience and performance. Whether you’re using it at home, on the go, or at outdoor events, the JBL M3 Mini delivers impressive sound quality and durability.', '<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Compact dimensions (10 x 5 x 10 cm)</strong> and lightweight design (0.29 kg).</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth V5.0</strong> for stable wireless connection with a 10m range.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Waterproof design</strong>, ideal for outdoor use and poolside fun.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Frequency range: 30Hz to 20KHz</strong> for dynamic sound quality.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Built-in microphone</strong> for hands-free calls.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>1.5-hour charging time</strong> for fast and efficient recharging.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>No SD card or USB compatibility</strong>, focusing on wireless playback.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 1400, 999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:49:48', '2025-05-07 17:01:40', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(75, 'Mibro Lite Smart Watch', 'mibro-lite-smart-watch', 11, 50, '<h2>Mibro Lite Smart Watch Price in Pakistan</h2>\nThe <strong>Mibro Lite Smart Watch</strong> is an excellent choice for those looking to blend fitness and fashion seamlessly. This smartwatch offers a range of features designed to keep you connected, healthy, and on track with your goals. With its lightweight build, sleek design, and vibrant AMOLED display, the Mibro Lite ensures you stay ahead in style and function. If you\'re searching for a reliable and affordable smartwatch in Pakistan, the Mibro Lite Smart Watch stands out as a strong contender in its price range.\n\nCrafted with a combination of <strong>metal, plastic, and liquid silica gel</strong>, the Mibro Lite provides both durability and comfort. It’s perfect for individuals who want a smartwatch that they can wear all day, whether during workouts, at the office, or while relaxing at home.\n<h4><strong>Key Features of the Mibro Lite Smart Watch</strong>:</h4>\n<ol>\n 	<li><strong>AMOLED Display</strong>:\nThe Mibro Lite Smart Watch comes with a <strong>1.3-inch AMOLED display</strong>, offering sharp and vivid visuals. Whether you\'re checking your health stats, notifications, or simply telling the time, the display ensures clarity even in bright sunlight. AMOLED technology enhances color contrast, giving you a premium viewing experience right on your wrist.</li>\n 	<li><strong>IP68 Waterproof Rating</strong>:\nIf you\'re someone who enjoys swimming, jogging in the rain, or leading an active lifestyle, the <strong>IP68 waterproof</strong> rating of the Mibro Lite will give you peace of mind. You can wear the watch in the shower, during sweaty workouts, or even while swimming, without worrying about damaging it.</li>\n 	<li><strong>15 Sport Modes</strong>:\nWhether you\'re a fitness enthusiast or someone looking to stay active, the Mibro Lite supports <strong>15 different sport modes</strong>. From running and cycling to yoga and strength training, this smartwatch tracks your performance and provides insights to help improve your workouts.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Long Battery Life</strong>:\nWith a <strong>230 mAh battery</strong>, the Mibro Lite Smart Watch lasts up to <strong>8 days</strong> on a single charge. Unlike many other smartwatches that require daily charging, the Mibro Lite\'s battery life ensures you can go nearly a full week without needing to recharge, even with regular use.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Compact and Lightweight Design</strong>:\nWeighing only <strong>48 grams</strong> and measuring <strong>43 × 43 × 12.5 mm</strong>, the Mibro Lite is incredibly light and comfortable to wear for extended periods. Its sleek and minimalist design makes it an ideal choice for both men and women, and it can be paired with a wide variety of outfits, from casual to formal.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Proprietary OS</strong>:\nThe watch runs on a <strong>Proprietary Operating System</strong>, designed to deliver smooth performance without lag. The operating system is optimized to support the core functions of the smartwatch, allowing for quick navigation through menus and apps.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Fitness Tracking and Health Monitoring</strong>:\nThe Mibro Lite doesn\'t just track your sports activities—it also monitors essential health metrics. From <strong>heart rate monitoring</strong> to tracking your daily steps, it provides comprehensive insights into your well-being. It helps you stay motivated and encourages healthier habits by keeping a close eye on your activity levels.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Strap and Build Material</strong>:\nThe Mibro Lite\'s strap is made from a combination of <strong>metal, plastic, and liquid silica gel</strong>, ensuring both durability and comfort. This combination of materials makes the strap flexible yet tough, meaning it can withstand regular use without showing signs of wear and tear.</li>\n 	<li><strong>No SIM or GPS</strong>:\nWhile the Mibro Lite lacks <strong>SIM support</strong> and <strong>GPS</strong>, it compensates with its focus on fitness, health tracking, and a high-quality display. For users who don\'t need standalone connectivity or GPS, the Mibro Lite is a budget-friendly alternative with a strong set of core features.</li>\n 	<li><strong>No Speaker or NFC</strong>:\nAlthough the smartwatch doesn’t feature a <strong>speaker</strong> or <strong>NFC</strong>, its strengths lie in its robust build quality, stunning display, and long battery life. It’s a great option for those looking for a functional smartwatch without the extras that would significantly raise the price.</li>\n</ol>\n<h4><strong>Why Choose the Mibro Lite Smart Watch?</strong></h4>\nThe <strong>Mibro Lite Smart Watch</strong> is perfect for those looking for an affordable, reliable, and stylish smartwatch in Pakistan. With its combination of a vivid <strong>AMOLED display</strong>, <strong>15 sports modes</strong>, <strong>8-day battery life</strong>, and <strong>IP68 waterproof rating</strong>, it covers all the basics you need in a smartwatch. Its lightweight and sleek design make it suitable for everyday wear, and its health and fitness tracking features ensure you stay on top of your goals.\n\nPriced competitively, the Mibro Lite is an excellent value for money, especially considering the premium features such as the AMOLED screen and long-lasting battery. Whether you\'re using it for fitness tracking or simply to check notifications, it delivers a solid performance in all key areas.\n\nWith multiple sport modes, accurate health monitoring, and a design that is both comfortable and stylish, the Mibro Lite is a strong contender in the smartwatch market. If you\'re looking to get a feature-packed smartwatch without overspending, this is the perfect choice for you.', '<ul>\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\"> Brand: Xiaomi Mibro</li>\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\">  Name: Lite Smartwatch</li>\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\">  Optical Heart Rate Sensor</li>\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\">  Spo2 Sensor</li>\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\">  Accelerometer</li>\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\">  15 Sports Modes</li>\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\">  IP68 Waterproof</li>\n 	<li aria-level=\"1\">  Water resistance</li>\n</ul>', 1, 0, 12999, 9999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:49:48', '2025-04-29 09:57:45', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(76, 'Tecno Spark 20 Pro Plus', 'tecno-spark-20-pro-plus', 2, 57, '<h2>Tecno Spark 20 Pro Plus Price In Pakistan</h2>\nThe Tecno Spark 20 Pro Plus, set to be released on <strong>February 7, 2024</strong>, brings a combination of top-tier features and affordability, making it one of the most anticipated smartphones in the market. With a sleek design, robust performance, and a fantastic camera setup, the Tecno Spark 20 Pro Plus offers everything you need in a smartphone for daily use, photography, and entertainment.\n\nStarting with its design, the Tecno Spark 20 Pro Plus measures <strong>164.65 x 75.04 x 7.55mm</strong>, making it a slim and lightweight phone that is easy to hold and operate. This slim profile, combined with its <strong>6.78-inch AMOLED display</strong>, ensures an immersive viewing experience whether you\'re streaming videos, playing games, or browsing through apps. The AMOLED panel provides deep blacks, vibrant colors, and excellent contrast, making content on the screen look stunning. With a <strong>1080 x 2436 pixel resolution</strong>, users can enjoy sharp, detailed visuals whether they’re watching high-definition videos or scrolling through photos.\n\nUnder the hood, the Tecno Spark 20 Pro Plus is powered by the <strong>MediaTek MTK G99 Ultimate</strong> processor, a chipset that delivers smooth performance across a range of applications. Whether you\'re multitasking between apps, playing games, or watching videos, this processor ensures your device runs efficiently without lag. Paired with the <strong>Mali-G57 MC2 GPU</strong>, the phone can handle intensive graphic tasks, making it a solid option for gamers and media enthusiasts.\n\nA highlight of the Tecno Spark 20 Pro Plus is its impressive <strong>16GB RAM</strong>, which includes 8GB of physical RAM and an additional 8GB extendable RAM. This large memory ensures that you can smoothly switch between apps, run multiple applications at once, and enjoy seamless performance during heavy usage. Furthermore, with <strong>256GB of internal storage</strong>, the phone provides ample space for all your apps, games, photos, and videos. Users won’t need to worry about running out of storage anytime soon, and while there is no card slot for further expansion, the large built-in memory will be more than sufficient for most users.\n\nThe <strong>camera setup</strong> on the Tecno Spark 20 Pro Plus is another key feature that sets it apart. On the back, the phone boasts a <strong>108 MP main camera</strong>, which captures sharp, detailed, and vibrant images in a variety of lighting conditions. The secondary <strong>2 MP camera</strong> enhances the overall photography experience by adding depth, making your portrait shots look more professional. The <strong>LED flash</strong> on the back ensures that you can take clear photos even in low-light situations. For video recording, the Tecno Spark 20 Pro Plus offers smooth, high-quality video capture, making it ideal for content creators or anyone who enjoys recording their daily activities.\n\nOn the front, the <strong>32 MP selfie camera</strong> comes equipped with a <strong>dual-LED flash</strong>, making it perfect for taking high-quality selfies even in low-light environments. The front camera also supports video recording, ensuring that video calls and vlogs look crisp and clear.\n\nIn terms of connectivity, the Tecno Spark 20 Pro Plus supports <strong>4G LTE</strong>, ensuring fast mobile data speeds for browsing, downloading, and streaming. Other connectivity options include <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, <strong>Wi-Fi</strong>, <strong>GPS</strong>, and <strong>NFC</strong>, making it a well-rounded device for modern users. With <strong>NFC</strong> support, the Tecno Spark 20 Pro Plus enables contactless payments and quick pairing with compatible devices, adding to the convenience of this smartphone.\n\nThe <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong> ensures long-lasting battery life, capable of powering the device through a full day of heavy use without the need for frequent recharging. Whether you\'re using your phone for work, entertainment, or communication, this battery ensures that you stay connected throughout the day. The Tecno Spark 20 Pro Plus is designed to deliver efficient energy consumption, making the most out of its battery life.\n\nRunning on <strong>Android 14</strong>, the Tecno Spark 20 Pro Plus offers the latest Android features and security updates. The operating system brings a clean and intuitive user interface, with enhanced privacy controls and customization options, allowing you to tailor the phone to your preferences. Android 14 also provides a smoother experience with faster app launches and improved battery optimization, ensuring a seamless experience for users.\n\nIn summary, the Tecno Spark 20 Pro Plus is a smartphone that offers a powerful combination of performance, camera capabilities, and long battery life. The <strong>6.78-inch AMOLED display</strong> is perfect for media consumption, while the <strong>108 MP dual-camera setup</strong> ensures stunning photography. With <strong>16GB of RAM</strong>, <strong>256GB of storage</strong>, and a <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong>, this phone is built to handle heavy multitasking, gaming, and daily tasks with ease. Its sleek design, coupled with the powerful MediaTek chipset, makes it a great choice for those seeking a reliable smartphone at a competitive price point.', '<div class=\"product-table\">\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14 OS</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Octa-core (2 x 2.2 GHz Cortex-A76 6 x 2.0 GHz Cortex-A55),Mediatek Helio G99 Ultimate</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">32 MP, f/2.2, (wide), <span id=\"IL_AD8\" class=\"IL_AD\">Dual LED</span> Flash, Video (1080p@30fps)</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Camera: 108 MP 2 MP (macro lens), Quad LED Flash,HDR, Panorama, Video, Video (1440p@30fps, 1080p@30fps)</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">AMOLED Capacitive Touchscreen, 16M Colors, Multitouch,6.78 Inches,Corning Gorilla Glass 5</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh , Fast charging 33W wired</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">256GB Built-in, 8GB RAM</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 1, 0, 54999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:49:48', '2025-04-22 11:51:11', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(77, 'Realme C67', 'realme-c67', 2, 53, '<h2>Realme C67 Price In Pakistan</h2>\nThe Realme C67, launching on <strong>January 10, 2024</strong>, is designed to cater to users who seek powerful performance, an impressive camera setup, and an immersive viewing experience in an affordable package. This model combines sleek design, reliable hardware, and the latest software, making it a strong contender in the mid-range smartphone market.\n\nWith dimensions of <strong>164.6 x 75.4 x 7.6 mm</strong> and a weight of <strong>185g</strong>, the Realme C67 is comfortable to handle and fits easily in your pocket. The slim profile and lightweight build make it an ideal device for users who value portability without sacrificing screen size or performance. The phone\'s design also features <strong>Panda Glass</strong> protection on the front, ensuring the <strong>6.72-inch IPS LCD display</strong> is resistant to scratches and damage from daily use.\n\nThe display offers a resolution of <strong>1080 x 2400 pixels</strong>, providing vibrant colors and sharp details for an enjoyable viewing experience. Whether you\'re browsing the web, watching videos, or playing games, the large screen delivers clear visuals, making it an excellent choice for multimedia consumption. The <strong>capacitive touchscreen</strong> enhances touch responsiveness, while the large screen size ensures an immersive viewing experience.\n\nPowered by the <strong>Qualcomm SM6225 Snapdragon 685 (6nm)</strong> processor, the Realme C67 delivers solid performance for everyday tasks such as browsing, social media, and light gaming. This 6nm chipset ensures smooth multitasking and efficient energy consumption, making the phone both fast and battery-friendly. The <strong>Adreno 610 GPU</strong> enhances graphics performance, ensuring fluid visuals in games and other graphics-heavy applications.\n\nThe Realme C67 boasts <strong>8GB of RAM</strong>, ensuring that switching between apps and running multiple tasks is effortless. Additionally, with <strong>8GB of dynamic RAM</strong> available, the device can handle more intensive tasks without slowing down. The <strong>128GB internal storage</strong> provides ample space for apps, photos, and videos, and if that’s not enough, the <strong>microSDXC slot</strong> allows for storage expansion, ensuring you’ll never run out of room for your data.\n\nA standout feature of the Realme C67 is its <strong>dual-camera setup</strong> on the back, headlined by an impressive <strong>108 MP main camera</strong>. This high-resolution camera captures crisp and detailed photos, even in low-light conditions, thanks to the <strong>LED flash</strong>. The secondary <strong>2 MP camera</strong> adds depth to your shots, improving portrait photography by creating a more pronounced background blur. The <strong>8 MP front camera</strong> is perfect for selfies and video calls, offering clear image quality and <strong>1080p@30fps video recording</strong> capabilities.\n\nFor video enthusiasts, both the front and rear cameras of the Realme C67 support <strong>1080p video recording at 30fps</strong>, ensuring smooth and high-quality video capture. Whether you\'re recording memories or creating content, this camera setup provides great results for a phone in its class.\n\nOn the connectivity front, the Realme C67 offers <strong>4G LTE</strong> support, ensuring fast mobile internet speeds for browsing, streaming, and downloads. Other connectivity options include <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, <strong>Wi-Fi</strong>, and <strong>GPS</strong>, providing reliable wireless connections wherever you go. The phone also supports <strong>NFC</strong>, enabling contactless payments and data sharing with compatible devices. Although the Realme C67 lacks 5G capabilities, it makes up for it with a strong set of 4G features that cater to the majority of users.\n\nThe <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong> in the Realme C67 ensures that the phone can last through a full day of usage without requiring a recharge. Whether you\'re browsing the web, streaming content, or playing games, the large battery capacity ensures you won\'t have to worry about running out of power halfway through the day.\n\nRunning on <strong>Android 14 OS</strong>, the Realme C67 provides the latest features and updates from Google, ensuring a modern and secure user experience. The operating system is enhanced by Realme’s custom UI, offering additional features and customization options to suit your preferences. Whether it\'s split-screen multitasking or privacy-focused controls, Android 14 provides a smooth and user-friendly experience.\n\nIn summary, the Realme C67 offers a solid combination of <strong>performance</strong>, <strong>camera quality</strong>, and <strong>display features</strong> that cater to users looking for a mid-range device with high-end capabilities. With its large display, powerful camera, and long-lasting battery, the Realme C67 is an excellent choice for those who want a reliable smartphone for everyday use. The inclusion of features like <strong>dual SIM support</strong>, expandable storage, and NFC make it a versatile device that fits the needs of a wide range of users. Whether you\'re looking for a device for photography, gaming, or general use, the Realme C67 is a strong contender in its price segment.', '<div class=\"product-table\">\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14 OS</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Octa-core (4 x 2.8 GHz Cortex-A73 4 x 1.9 GHz Cortex-A53) ,Qualcomm SM6225 Snapdragon 685 (6 nm)</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">8 MP, f/2.1, (wide), Video (1080p@30fps)</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Camera: 108 MP, f/1.8, (wide), PDAF  <span id=\"IL_AD6\" class=\"IL_AD\">2 MP</span>, f/2.4, (depth), LED Flash</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.72 Inches</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh , Fast battery 33W wired</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">128GB Built-in, 8GB RAM</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 1, 0, 39999, 38499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:49:48', '2025-04-22 11:51:11', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(78, 'Infinix Hot 40 Pro', 'infinix-hot-40-pro', 2, 45, '<h2>Infinix Hot 40 Pro Price In Pakistan</h2>\nThe Infinix Hot 40 Pro is designed for users who crave both performance and style in an affordable package. Released on <strong>December 5, 2023</strong>, the Infinix Hot 40 Pro brings impressive features that set it apart in the mid-range smartphone market. It combines a <strong>108MP triple-camera system</strong>, a smooth <strong>120Hz display</strong>, and a large <strong>5000mAh battery</strong>, making it an excellent choice for users who demand a well-rounded device.\n\nWeighing <strong>199g</strong> and measuring <strong>168.6 x 76.6 x 8.3 mm</strong>, the Infinix Hot 40 Pro has a solid build that is comfortable to hold, even for extended periods. The <strong>6.78-inch IPS LCD</strong> display delivers sharp, clear visuals with a resolution of <strong>1080 x 2460 pixels</strong>. Whether you\'re streaming videos, playing games, or browsing the web, the display offers vibrant colors and smooth transitions thanks to its <strong>120Hz refresh rate</strong>. This makes everything from scrolling through social media to gaming feel faster and more responsive.\n\nThe Infinix Hot 40 Pro runs on <strong>Android 13</strong> with the custom <strong>XOS 13.5</strong> user interface, providing a clean and intuitive experience. The phone is powered by the <strong>Mediatek Helio G99 processor</strong>, a <strong>6nm chipset</strong> known for its energy efficiency and impressive gaming performance. Paired with <strong>8GB of RAM</strong>, the phone handles multitasking with ease, whether you\'re switching between apps or playing graphics-intensive games. The <strong>Mali-G57 MC2 GPU</strong> ensures smooth gaming experiences and responsive touch controls.\n\nWith <strong>256GB of internal storage</strong>, you have plenty of space to store all your photos, videos, and apps. And if you need more storage, the <strong>dedicated microSDXC slot</strong> allows you to expand the memory further. This ensures you never have to worry about running out of space for your favorite content.\n\nPhotography enthusiasts will appreciate the camera capabilities of the Infinix Hot 40 Pro. The phone boasts a <strong>108MP primary sensor</strong>, capturing detailed and high-quality photos in various lighting conditions. This is complemented by a <strong>2MP depth sensor</strong> and a <strong>0.08MP auxiliary sensor</strong> to improve portrait shots and add depth to images. The <strong>dual-LED flash</strong> ensures that even low-light shots come out bright and clear.\n\nThe camera setup also excels in videography, supporting <strong>1440p video recording at 30fps</strong> and <strong>1080p at 30fps</strong> for smooth and detailed footage. The front camera is a <strong>32MP shooter</strong> with a <strong>dual-LED flash</strong>, perfect for capturing sharp and vibrant selfies, even in low light. The front camera also supports <strong>1080p video recording at 30fps</strong>, making it great for video calls and vlogs.\n\nOne of the highlights of the Infinix Hot 40 Pro is its large <strong>5000mAh battery</strong>, which ensures all-day performance without the need for frequent charging. Whether you\'re streaming, gaming, or simply using your phone for daily tasks, the battery will last through the day. Combined with the power efficiency of the <strong>Mediatek Helio G99 processor</strong>, users can enjoy longer screen time and faster charging speeds.\n\nIn terms of connectivity, the Infinix Hot 40 Pro comes equipped with <strong>4G LTE</strong>, ensuring fast and stable internet connectivity. While the phone doesn\'t support 5G, its 4G capabilities are more than sufficient for streaming, gaming, and browsing. Other connectivity features include <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, <strong>NFC</strong>, <strong>Wi-Fi</strong>, and <strong>FM Radio</strong>, making it a versatile device for everyday use. The phone also supports <strong>dual SIM</strong> functionality, allowing users to manage two phone numbers on the same device, ideal for separating work and personal contacts.\n\nThe Infinix Hot 40 Pro is designed for users who need a phone that can keep up with their busy lives. Its <strong>large display</strong>, <strong>high-performance camera</strong>, and <strong>long battery life</strong> make it perfect for both productivity and entertainment. Whether you\'re capturing memories with the <strong>108MP camera</strong>, enjoying lag-free gaming with the <strong>Helio G99 processor</strong>, or staying connected with friends and family via <strong>dual SIM</strong> support, the Infinix Hot 40 Pro delivers all the features you need.\n\nIn conclusion, the Infinix Hot 40 Pro is an excellent mid-range smartphone that combines high-end features with affordability. Its <strong>108MP camera</strong>, <strong>6.78-inch 120Hz display</strong>, and <strong>5000mAh battery</strong> make it a standout choice for users in Pakistan looking for a reliable, feature-packed device. If you\'re in the market for a smartphone that offers great value for money, the Infinix Hot 40 Pro should be at the top of your list.', '<div class=\"product-table\">\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13 OS</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Octa-core (2 x 2.2 GHz Cortex-A76 6 x 2.0 GHz Cortex-A55) ,Mediatek Helio G99 (6nm)</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">32 MP, f/2.2, (wide), <span id=\"IL_AD7\" class=\"IL_AD\">Dual LED</span> Flash, Video (1080p@30fps)</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Triple Camera: 108 MP, f/1.8, (wide), AF 2 MP, f/2.4, (macro) 0.08 MP, (<span id=\"IL_AD3\" class=\"IL_AD\">auxiliary</span> lens), Quad LED Flash</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">IPS LCD Capacitive Touchscreen, 16M Colors, Multitouch,6.78 Inches</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh , Fast charging 33W wired, 20-75% in 35 min</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">256GB Built-in, 8GB RAM</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 1, 0, 45999, 43999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:49:48', '2025-04-22 11:51:11', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO `products` (`product_id`, `product_name`, `product_slug`, `category_id`, `brand_id`, `product_description`, `short_description`, `product_status`, `stock_quantity`, `regular_price`, `sale_price`, `product_sku`, `weight_kg`, `length_cm`, `width_cm`, `height_cm`, `tax_class`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `product_tag`, `b2b_regular_price`, `is_b2b_available`) VALUES
(79, 'Audionic Lyon Bluetooth Speaker', 'audionic-lyon-bluetooth-speaker', 4, 43, '<h2>Audionic Lyon Bluetooth Speaker Price in Pakistan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Audionic Lyon Bluetooth Speaker</strong> offers a compact, stylish, and portable sound solution for music lovers in Pakistan. With reliable Bluetooth connectivity, versatile playback options, and solid sound performance, it’s a great companion for both indoor and outdoor use. Whether you\'re at a picnic, a small party, or simply relaxing at home, this speaker ensures your music experience is rich and seamless.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Portable and Lightweight Design</h3>\r\n<p>Designed with portability in mind, the <strong>Audionic Lyon Bluetooth Speaker</strong> is easy to carry and fits conveniently in your bag or backpack. Its sleek, minimalistic design makes it ideal for users who are always on the go and want to enjoy high-quality music without bulk. The compact build makes it a great fit for travel, casual hangouts, and outdoor settings.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Powerful 3W Audio Output</h3>\r\n<p>Don’t let its size fool you — this speaker delivers <strong>3W of audio output</strong>, producing clear highs and deep lows. With a <strong>frequency response of 50Hz to 20KHz</strong>, the Audionic Lyon provides a balanced sound profile suitable for music, podcasts, and radio alike. Whether you\'re indoors or outside, enjoy a crisp and full-bodied listening experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Up to 2 Hours of Playtime</h3>\r\n<p>Equipped with a built-in <strong>rechargeable battery</strong>, the speaker delivers up to <strong>2 hours of playtime</strong> on a single charge. This makes it perfect for short trips, small events, or daily personal use. With a <strong>5V power input</strong>, it can be conveniently recharged via USB, making it compatible with power banks, laptops, and chargers.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Multiple Playback Options</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Audionic Lyon Speaker</strong> supports multiple playback sources:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Bluetooth:</strong> Wirelessly stream music with a range of up to <strong>10 meters</strong>.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>USB port:</strong> Plug in your USB drive and play your saved music directly.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>SD card slot:</strong> Insert an SD card and enjoy offline music playback.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>This variety ensures you’re never out of ways to enjoy your favorite tunes, no matter where your music is stored.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Reliable Bluetooth Connectivity</h3>\r\n<p>Thanks to its <strong>10-meter Bluetooth range</strong>, you can control playback and volume from a distance without signal interruptions. The Audionic Lyon offers a stable and seamless wireless experience, allowing you to connect with smartphones, tablets, and laptops effortlessly.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Rechargeable Battery Convenience</h3>\r\n<p>Its <strong>rechargeable battery</strong> offers a sustainable and cost-effective solution compared to traditional speakers that rely on disposable batteries. Simply plug it into a USB charger when needed, and you\'re good to go in no time. This makes it ideal for eco-conscious users and those who prefer easy charging on the move.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Perfect for Indoor and Outdoor Use</h3>\r\n<p>With a compact body, reliable wireless range, and flexible media input options, the <strong>Audionic Lyon Bluetooth Speaker</strong> is perfect for:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Home use — in your bedroom, kitchen, or living room</li>\r\n  <li>Outdoor adventures — picnics, road trips, and camping</li>\r\n  <li>Casual gatherings or study sessions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Specifications</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Power Output:</strong> 3W</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Frequency Response:</strong> 50Hz – 20KHz</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Playback Time:</strong> Up to 2 hours</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Connectivity:</strong> Bluetooth (10m range), USB, SD card</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Power Input:</strong> 5V USB charging</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Portability:</strong> Lightweight and compact design</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Audionic Lyon Bluetooth Speaker</strong> is a smart choice for music lovers who value portability, performance, and flexibility. With support for <strong>Bluetooth, USB, and SD card playback</strong>, plus a <strong>2-hour rechargeable battery</strong>, it delivers a convenient and enjoyable audio experience. Whether you\'re listening at home or on the move, the Audionic Lyon is a budget-friendly speaker that doesn’t compromise on quality.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Buy Audionic Lyon Bluetooth Speaker in Pakistan</h3>\r\n<p>Searching for the latest <strong>Audionic Lyon Bluetooth Speaker price in Pakistan</strong>? Order now to enjoy powerful sound in a sleek, travel-ready design — perfect for music wherever life takes you.</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>3W audio output</strong> for powerful sound quality.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth, SD card, and USB support</strong> for versatile media playback.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>2-hour playtime</strong> with a rechargeable battery.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Compact and portable</strong> design for on-the-go use.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth range of 10 meters</strong> for wireless music streaming.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Frequency response: 50Hz - 20KHz</strong> for balanced audio performance.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Power input: 5V</strong> for easy charging.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 3499, 1999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:49:48', '2025-07-25 17:18:29', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(80, 'Oppo Reno 11F 5G', 'oppo-reno-11f-5g', 2, 52, '<h2>Oppo Reno 11F 5G Price in Pakistan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Oppo Reno 11F 5G</strong>, launched on <strong>February 8, 2024</strong>, is a feature-rich smartphone offering sleek design, 5G connectivity, and advanced performance — all at a competitive price in Pakistan. It’s ideal for users who want a modern device without compromising on speed, visuals, or camera quality.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Design and Display</h3>\r\n<p>Weighing just <strong>177 grams</strong> and measuring <strong>6.34 x 2.94 x 0.30 inches</strong>, the Oppo Reno 11F 5G is incredibly lightweight and easy to hold. The <strong>6.7-inch AMOLED display</strong> is protected with durable <strong>Panda glass</strong>, offering both style and strength.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With a <strong>1080 x 2412 pixels</strong> resolution, <strong>120Hz refresh rate</strong>, <strong>HDR10+</strong> support, and peak brightness of <strong>1100 nits</strong>, the screen ensures crisp visuals and smooth scrolling. Whether you\'re watching movies or gaming, this display delivers a truly immersive experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Performance and OS</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Oppo Reno 11F 5G</strong> runs on <strong>Android 14</strong> with Oppo\'s custom <strong>ColorOS 14</strong>, offering a clean and customizable user experience. Under the hood, it packs the efficient <strong>MediaTek Dimensity 7050 processor</strong> and <strong>8GB of RAM</strong>, providing smooth multitasking and quick app response times.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It features <strong>256GB of internal storage</strong>, expandable via a <strong>microSDXC card</strong>. This ensures you have ample space for apps, photos, videos, and documents — perfect for heavy users.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Camera Features</h3>\r\n<p>The Reno 11F 5G boasts a versatile <strong>triple rear camera setup</strong>:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>64MP main camera</strong></li>\r\n  <li><strong>8MP ultrawide lens</strong></li>\r\n  <li><strong>2MP macro sensor</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>This setup captures vibrant, detailed shots in all lighting conditions — from landscapes to close-ups. On the front, a high-resolution <strong>32MP selfie camera</strong> ensures crystal-clear self-portraits and smooth video calls.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Video Recording Capabilities</h3>\r\n<p>Content creators will appreciate the video performance, which includes:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>4K video at 30fps</strong></li>\r\n  <li><strong>1080p video at 60fps</strong> with <strong>Electronic Image Stabilization (EIS)</strong></li>\r\n  <li><strong>Slow motion:</strong> 1080p at 120/480fps, 720p at 240/960fps</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Dual-view video mode</strong> (front + back recording)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Battery and Charging</h3>\r\n<p>The device is powered by a massive <strong>5000mAh battery</strong>, giving you all-day performance even with heavy use. Whether you\'re gaming, streaming, or working, the Reno 11F 5G won’t let you down. Fast charging support ensures you\'re powered up quickly when needed.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Connectivity and Security</h3>\r\n<p>The Oppo Reno 11F 5G supports advanced <strong>5G connectivity</strong> for ultra-fast downloads and seamless browsing. It also includes:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Bluetooth</strong></li>\r\n  <li><strong>NFC</strong></li>\r\n  <li><strong>Wi-Fi</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>The phone offers <strong>Dual SIM support</strong> for managing work and personal numbers simultaneously. Security is handled via a fast and responsive <strong>in-display fingerprint sensor</strong>, offering quick and secure access to your phone.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Specifications</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Display:</strong> 6.7\" AMOLED, 120Hz, HDR10+, 1080 x 2412 pixels</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Processor:</strong> MediaTek Dimensity 7050</li>\r\n  <li><strong>RAM:</strong> 8GB</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Storage:</strong> 256GB (expandable via microSDXC)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Rear Cameras:</strong> 64MP + 8MP + 2MP</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Front Camera:</strong> 32MP</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Video Recording:</strong> 4K@30fps, 1080p@60fps + slow-motion</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Battery:</strong> 5000mAh</li>\r\n  <li><strong>OS:</strong> Android 14 with ColorOS 14</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Security:</strong> Fingerprint Sensor</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Connectivity:</strong> 5G, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, NFC, Dual SIM</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Oppo Reno 11F 5G</strong> offers the perfect combination of sleek design, powerful performance, and cutting-edge features at a reasonable price in Pakistan. With a <strong>64MP camera system</strong>, immersive <strong>120Hz AMOLED display</strong>, and long-lasting <strong>5000mAh battery</strong>, it’s an excellent choice for users looking for premium features without a premium price.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Buy Oppo Reno 11F 5G in Pakistan</h3>\r\n<p>Looking for the latest <strong>Oppo Reno 11F 5G price in Pakistan</strong>? Order now and enjoy a smartphone that delivers on every front — style, performance, and value!</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14 OS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Octa-core (2 x 2.6 GHz Cortex-A78 6 x 2.0 GHz Cortex-A55) , Mediatek Dimensity 7050 (6 nm)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">32 MP, f/2.4, 22mm (wide), 1/2.74, Panorama, Video (4K@30fps, 1080p@30fps, gyro-EIS)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Triple Camera: 64 MP, f/1.7, 25mm (wide), 1/2.0\", PDAF  8 MP, f/2.2, 16mm, (ultrawide), 1/4.0\"  2 MP, f/2.4, (macro), LED Flash</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">AMOLED Capacitive Touchscreen, 1B, Multitouch , 6.7 inch ,1080 x 2412 Pixels (~394 PPI)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Fast battery 67W wired, PD2.0, QC3, 100% in 48 min</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">256GB Built-in, 8GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 79999, 76999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:49:48', '2025-07-25 17:17:15', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(81, 'Redmi Note 12S', 'redmi-note-12s', 2, 61, '<h2>Redmi Note 12S Price in Pakistan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Xiaomi Redmi Note 12S</strong>, released on <strong>15 September 2023</strong>, is a mid-range smartphone packed with premium features. With a <strong>108MP triple rear camera</strong>, <strong>6.43-inch AMOLED display</strong>, and a reliable <strong>Mediatek Helio G96 processor</strong>, it delivers a powerful user experience ideal for photography lovers, gamers, and multitaskers — all at a budget-friendly price in Pakistan.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Design and Display</h3>\r\n<p>Measuring <strong>159.9 x 73.9 x 8.1 mm</strong> and weighing only <strong>176 grams</strong>, the Redmi Note 12S is compact and lightweight, offering comfort during prolonged use. Its premium design and narrow bezels enhance its appeal and usability.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The highlight is the <strong>6.43-inch AMOLED display</strong> with <strong>1080 x 2400 pixel resolution</strong>. This screen delivers rich colors, deep blacks, and immersive contrast—perfect for streaming, gaming, or everyday scrolling. Though it lacks Gorilla Glass protection, the AMOLED quality ensures a high-end visual experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Performance and Hardware</h3>\r\n<p>The Redmi Note 12S is powered by the <strong>Mediatek Helio G96 octa-core processor</strong>, built on a <strong>12nm process</strong> that balances power and efficiency. Paired with the <strong>Mali-G57 MC2 GPU</strong> and <strong>8GB of RAM</strong>, this setup ensures smooth performance whether you’re gaming, multitasking, or using demanding applications.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For storage, the device offers <strong>256GB of internal memory</strong>, giving you ample space for apps, media, and files. Plus, it includes a dedicated <strong>microSDXC card slot</strong> for expanding storage as needed.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Camera Capabilities</h3>\r\n<p>Photography is a strong point of the <strong>Xiaomi Redmi Note 12S</strong>. It features a high-resolution <strong>108MP main rear camera</strong> that captures crisp, detailed images. Supporting this are an <strong>8MP ultra-wide lens</strong> for landscape shots and a <strong>2MP macro lens</strong> for close-ups. With a <strong>rear LED flash</strong>, low-light shots are also well-lit.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>On the front, a <strong>16MP selfie camera</strong> offers sharp and vibrant selfies, ideal for video calls and social media. Both front and rear cameras support <strong>1080p video recording at 30fps</strong>, providing smooth and stable video output.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Battery and Charging</h3>\r\n<p>Fueling the device is a robust <strong>5000mAh battery</strong>, ensuring long-lasting performance throughout the day, even with heavy usage. Whether you\'re streaming, gaming, or browsing, the battery supports your lifestyle. Additionally, the <strong>fast charging</strong> support helps minimize downtime and keeps you powered up quickly.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Software and User Interface</h3>\r\n<p>Running on <strong>Android 13</strong> with Xiaomi’s custom <strong>MIUI 14</strong> skin, the Redmi Note 12S delivers a fluid and customizable experience. MIUI 14 offers features like system-wide dark mode, improved privacy controls, app management enhancements, and more, tailoring the phone to fit your needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Connectivity and Features</h3>\r\n<p>The device supports <strong>Dual SIM</strong> functionality with <strong>4G/LTE</strong> connectivity, offering reliable and fast mobile internet. Although <strong>5G is not supported</strong>, its 4G capabilities are sufficient for everyday use. Other connectivity features include:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Wi-Fi</strong></li>\r\n  <li><strong>Bluetooth</strong></li>\r\n  <li><strong>NFC</strong> (region-dependent)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>However, <strong>FM radio</strong> is not included, which may be a drawback for users who enjoy radio streaming without internet.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Specifications</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Display:</strong> 6.43\" AMOLED, 1080 x 2400 pixels</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Processor:</strong> Mediatek Helio G96, 12nm</li>\r\n  <li><strong>GPU:</strong> Mali-G57 MC2</li>\r\n  <li><strong>RAM:</strong> 8GB</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Storage:</strong> 256GB + microSDXC (dedicated slot)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Rear Cameras:</strong> 108MP (main) + 8MP (ultra-wide) + 2MP (macro)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Front Camera:</strong> 16MP, 1080p video</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Battery:</strong> 5000mAh, fast charging</li>\r\n  <li><strong>OS:</strong> Android 13 with MIUI 14</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Connectivity:</strong> Dual SIM, 4G, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, NFC</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Redmi Note 12S</strong> offers premium features at an affordable price, making it an ideal choice for users in Pakistan who want performance without the flagship cost. With a <strong>108MP camera</strong>, AMOLED display, long-lasting battery, and powerful processor, it delivers exceptional value. Whether you\'re into mobile photography, casual gaming, or just need a reliable daily driver, the Redmi Note 12S is a smart investment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Buy Redmi Note 12S in Pakistan</h3>\r\n<p>Looking for the best <strong>Redmi Note 12S price in Pakistan</strong>? Order now and enjoy a balanced smartphone that excels in photography, performance, and design at a price that suits your budget!</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13 OS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Octa-core (2 x 2.05 GHz Cortex-A76 6 x 2.0 GHz Cortex-A55) ,Mediatek Helio G96</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">16 MP, f/2.4, (wide), Video (1080p@30fps)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Triple Camera: 108 MP, f/1.9, (wide), 1/1.52\", PDAF 8 MP, f/2.2, (ultrawide), 1/4.0\" 2 MP, f/2.4, (macro), LED Flash</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.43 Inches ,AMOLED Capacitive Touchscreen, Multitouch</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh, 33W wired</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">256GB Built-in, 8GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 50, 74999, 73499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:49:48', '2025-07-25 17:15:51', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(82, 'Vivo V30 5G', 'vivo-v30-5g', 2, 60, '<h2>Vivo V30 5G Price in Pakistan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Vivo V30 5G</strong>, launched on <strong>March 13, 2024</strong>, is a feature-rich flagship smartphone that blends top-tier performance, premium aesthetics, and advanced technology. With cutting-edge specifications, stunning visuals, and blazing-fast 5G connectivity, the Vivo V30 5G is ideal for users seeking a premium mobile experience in 2024.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Design and Display</h3>\r\n<p>The Vivo V30 5G features a slim and lightweight design with dimensions of <strong>164.4 x 75.1 x 7.5 mm</strong> and a weight of only <strong>186 grams</strong>. It’s easy to handle and comfortable to carry, all while maintaining a sleek and modern appearance.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The smartphone boasts a large <strong>6.78-inch AMOLED display</strong> with a <strong>1260 x 2800 pixel resolution</strong>, delivering ultra-sharp images and vibrant colors. Whether you\'re watching videos, browsing the web, or gaming, the screen offers an immersive visual experience. The display is protected by <strong>Schott Alpha Glass</strong> for added durability against scratches and minor impacts.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Performance and Software</h3>\r\n<p>Under the hood, the Vivo V30 5G is powered by the high-performance <strong>Qualcomm Snapdragon® 7 Gen 3 processor</strong>, making multitasking and running heavy apps effortless. Combined with <strong>12 GB of RAM</strong>, this device delivers seamless operation and superior responsiveness for gaming, productivity, and entertainment.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The phone runs on the latest <strong>Android 14 OS</strong>, offering a refined, customizable interface and enhanced security. The user experience is smooth and intuitive, providing access to the latest features from Google and Vivo.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Storage Capacity</h3>\r\n<p>The Vivo V30 5G comes with <strong>256 GB of internal storage</strong>, providing ample space for apps, videos, photos, and other media. While it doesn’t support external memory cards, the internal storage is more than enough for most users’ needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Camera System</h3>\r\n<p>The device features a stunning <strong>dual 50 MP rear camera</strong> setup with <strong>Optical Image Stabilization (OIS)</strong>, ensuring crisp, blur-free photos and stable videos. The rear camera supports <strong>4K video recording at 30fps</strong> and <strong>1080p video at 30fps</strong> with gyro-EIS for enhanced video stabilization.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>front-facing 50 MP selfie camera</strong> is equally powerful, supporting <strong>4K and 1080p video recording</strong>. Whether you\'re capturing memories or attending virtual meetings, the Vivo V30 5G ensures professional-grade clarity and detail in every shot.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Battery Life</h3>\r\n<p>Equipped with a long-lasting <strong>5000mAh Li-Ion battery</strong>, the Vivo V30 5G provides all-day power for even the most demanding users. Whether you’re gaming, streaming, or working, this battery ensures consistent performance without frequent charging interruptions.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Connectivity and Features</h3>\r\n<p>The Vivo V30 5G supports ultra-fast <strong>5G network connectivity</strong> for seamless streaming, downloads, and online gaming. Other connectivity features include <strong>Wi-Fi</strong>, <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, <strong>NFC</strong>, and <strong>dual SIM support</strong>, making it ideal for both personal and business use.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Security is also a priority, with <strong>facial recognition</strong> and a responsive <strong>in-display fingerprint sensor</strong> ensuring your data remains protected and easily accessible only by you.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Specifications</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Display:</strong> 6.78\" AMOLED, 1260 x 2800 pixels, Schott Alpha Glass</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Processor:</strong> Qualcomm Snapdragon® 7 Gen 3</li>\r\n  <li><strong>RAM:</strong> 12 GB</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Storage:</strong> 256 GB (no memory card slot)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Rear Camera:</strong> Dual 50 MP with OIS, 4K video</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Front Camera:</strong> 50 MP, 4K & 1080p video</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Battery:</strong> 5000mAh Li-Ion</li>\r\n  <li><strong>OS:</strong> Android 14</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Connectivity:</strong> 5G, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, NFC, Dual SIM</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Security:</strong> Face Unlock, In-display Fingerprint</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Vivo V30 5G</strong> is a flagship-grade smartphone that delivers excellence in every aspect—design, performance, photography, and connectivity. Ideal for professionals, content creators, and everyday users alike, this phone provides a top-notch user experience in 2024. If you\'re looking for a premium 5G smartphone at a competitive price in Pakistan, the Vivo V30 5G should be at the top of your list.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Buy the Vivo V30 5G in Pakistan Today</h3>\r\n<p>Searching for the latest <strong>Vivo V30 5G price in Pakistan</strong>? Order now and experience flagship-level power, design, and photography all in one sleek device!</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14 OS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Octa-core (1 x 2.63 GHz Cortex-A715 3 x2.4 GHz Cortex-A715 4x 1.8 GHz Cortex-A510),Qualcomm Snapdragon 7 Gen 3</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">50 MP, f/2.0, 21mm (wide), AF, HDR, <span id=\"IL_AD5\" class=\"IL_AD\">Dual LED</span> Flash, Video (1080p@30fps)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Triple Camera: 50 MP, f/1.9, 23mm (wide), 1/1.55\", PDAF, OIS 50 MP, f/2.0, 15mm, (ultrawide), 1/2.76\", AF 2 MP, f/2.4 (market/region dependent), Ring-LED flash</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.78 Inches ,AMOLED Capacitive Touchscreen, 1B, Multitouch ,1260 x 2800 Pixels (~453 PPI)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh, Fast battery 80W wired, PD, 100% in 48 min</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">256GB Built-in, 12GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 139999, 120999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:49:48', '2025-07-25 17:11:46', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(83, 'Tecno Camon 20 Pro', 'tecno-camon-20-pro', 2, 57, '<h2>Tecno Camon 20 Pro Price in Pakistan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Tecno Camon 20 Pro</strong>, launched on <strong>09 May 2023</strong>, is a powerful mid-range smartphone offering a premium experience at an affordable price in Pakistan. Featuring a brilliant <strong>6.67-inch AMOLED display</strong>, high refresh rate, strong camera setup, and smooth performance, it is an excellent choice for users seeking versatility in gaming, photography, and multitasking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Design and Display</h3>\r\n<p>The Tecno Camon 20 Pro showcases a modern, sleek design with dimensions of <strong>163.4 x 76.7 x 7.8 mm</strong>, ensuring a comfortable grip and a stylish look. It features a vibrant <strong>6.67-inch AMOLED screen</strong> with a <strong>120Hz refresh rate</strong> and <strong>1080 x 2400 resolution</strong>, delivering smooth visuals and rich colors for an immersive viewing experience—perfect for streaming, gaming, and daily browsing.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Performance and Hardware</h3>\r\n<p>Powered by the <strong>MediaTek Dimensity 8050 processor</strong> and paired with the <strong>Mali-G57 MC2 GPU</strong>, the Tecno Camon 20 Pro ensures efficient performance even during demanding tasks. With <strong>8GB of RAM</strong> and <strong>256GB internal storage</strong>, users can multitask, store large files, and run apps smoothly. The presence of a <strong>dedicated microSD card slot</strong> adds storage flexibility, making it ideal for power users.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Camera System</h3>\r\n<p>The phone features a powerful <strong>64MP main camera</strong> that captures sharp and detailed photos, supported by a <strong>2MP depth sensor</strong> and an <strong>AI camera</strong> for enhanced image processing. The <strong>32MP front selfie camera</strong> delivers crisp and vibrant selfies, even in low light thanks to the <strong>front-facing flash</strong>. Both front and rear cameras support <strong>1080p video recording at 30fps</strong>, making the device suitable for content creation and casual photography.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Battery and Charging</h3>\r\n<p>The Tecno Camon 20 Pro is powered by a long-lasting <strong>5000mAh battery</strong>, offering full-day usage on a single charge. Whether you’re gaming, browsing, or watching videos, the phone keeps up without frequent recharging. It also supports <strong>fast charging</strong>, letting you power up quickly and get back to your routine without extended downtime.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Operating System and User Interface</h3>\r\n<p>Running on <strong>Android 13</strong> with <strong>HIOS 13</strong>, Tecno’s custom UI, the Camon 20 Pro delivers a smooth and customizable user experience. The interface is intuitive and packed with smart features, making daily operations seamless and enjoyable for all users.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Connectivity Options</h3>\r\n<p>The smartphone supports <strong>3G</strong>, <strong>4G/LTE</strong>, <strong>WiFi</strong>, and <strong>Bluetooth</strong> for consistent connectivity. Though it lacks 5G, the 4G speeds are sufficient for most tasks. Additional features include <strong>NFC</strong> for contactless transactions and <strong>FM Radio</strong> for offline entertainment, making it a complete package for everyday use.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Specifications</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Display:</strong> 6.67\" AMOLED, 120Hz, 1080 x 2400 resolution</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Processor:</strong> MediaTek Dimensity 8050</li>\r\n  <li><strong>RAM:</strong> 8GB</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Storage:</strong> 256GB (expandable via microSD)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Rear Camera:</strong> 64MP + 2MP + AI Cam</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Front Camera:</strong> 32MP with Flash</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Battery:</strong> 5000mAh, Fast Charging</li>\r\n  <li><strong>OS:</strong> Android 13 with HIOS 13</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Connectivity:</strong> 3G, 4G, WiFi, Bluetooth, NFC, FM Radio</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Tecno Camon 20 Pro</strong> is an excellent mid-range smartphone packed with premium features at a competitive price in Pakistan. From its AMOLED display and powerful processor to its high-resolution camera and long-lasting battery, it’s perfect for users who want performance, style, and value in one device. Whether you\'re into mobile photography, gaming, or everyday productivity, the Camon 20 Pro delivers on all fronts.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Looking for the Best Tecno Camon 20 Pro Price in Pakistan?</h3>\r\n<p>Shop the <strong>Tecno Camon 20 Pro</strong> today and enjoy top-tier features without breaking the bank. Perfect for users who demand more from their smartphone!</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13 OS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">2.2Ghz Octa Core  , Mediatek <a class=\"google-anno\" href=\"https://www.whatmobile.com.pk/Tecno_Camon-20-Pro#\"> <span class=\"google-anno-t\">MT8781</span></a> Helio G99</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"