(84, 'Fendior S300 Ultra 2 7 Straps Smart Watch', 'fendior-s300-ultra-2-7-straps-smart-watch', 11, 58, '<h2>Fendior S300 Ultra 2 7 Straps Smart Watch Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Fendior S300 Ultra 2 7 Straps Smart Watch</strong> is a stylish and feature-rich wearable designed for users who value connectivity, health monitoring, and personalization. With an elegant 49mm HD display and compatibility across both Android and iOS platforms, this smartwatch is ideal for anyone looking to stay organized, fit, and fashionable.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\r\n\r\n<h4>1. Bluetooth Calling</h4>\r\n<p>With built-in <strong>Bluetooth calling</strong>, the Fendior S300 Ultra 2 lets you answer or make calls directly from your wrist. It’s perfect for hands-free communication while driving, working out, or multitasking throughout your day.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>2. Health & Fitness Tracking</h4>\r\n<p>Track your health around the clock with integrated sensors that provide:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Heart Rate Monitoring</strong> for real-time cardio insights</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Sleep Quality Tracking</strong> to optimize rest and recovery</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Step Counting</strong> to help monitor daily movement</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Oxygen Level Monitoring</strong> for wellness awareness during workouts or rest</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h4>3. Multiple Sports Modes</h4>\r\n<p>Whether you\'re running, cycling, walking, or participating in other workouts, the watch’s <strong>multiple sports modes</strong> let you track performance and stay motivated toward your fitness goals.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>4. 49mm HD Display with Interchangeable Straps</h4>\r\n<p>The <strong>49mm high-definition display</strong> delivers crisp visuals and smooth touch responsiveness. The package includes <strong>7 interchangeable straps</strong>, giving you the flexibility to customize your smartwatch for various outfits, moods, or occasions.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>5. Long Battery Life</h4>\r\n<p>The built-in battery provides <strong>3–5 days of usage</strong> on a single charge, reducing the need for frequent recharging and keeping up with your busy lifestyle.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>6. Bluetooth 5.0 Connectivity</h4>\r\n<p>Enjoy fast, reliable pairing with <strong>Bluetooth 5.0</strong>. Receive app notifications, control music playback, and check messages instantly on your wrist—compatible with both <strong>Android and iOS devices</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Why Choose the Fendior S300 Ultra 2?</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Stylish Customization:</strong> Includes 7 straps to personalize your look every day.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Comprehensive Health Tracking:</strong> Stay informed about your heart rate, sleep, and oxygen levels.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Smart Communication:</strong> Make and receive calls on the go with Bluetooth calling.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Fitness Ready:</strong> Track your progress with diverse sports modes.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Affordable Pricing:</strong> Premium smartwatch features at a budget-friendly price in Pakistan.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Bluetooth Version:</strong> 5.0</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Screen Size:</strong> 49mm HD display</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Battery Life:</strong> 3–5 days</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Compatibility:</strong> Android & iOS</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Sports Modes:</strong> Multiple</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Health Features:</strong> Heart rate, sleep, oxygen, steps</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Straps:</strong> 7 interchangeable straps included</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Fendior S300 Ultra 2 Smart Watch</strong> is a perfect blend of fashion, fitness, and functionality. Whether you\'re managing your day, improving your health, or enhancing your look, this smartwatch has the features to support every part of your lifestyle.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Order Your Fendior S300 Ultra 2 Today</h3>\r\n<p>Looking for the latest <strong>Fendior S300 Ultra 2 7 Straps Smart Watch price in Pakistan</strong>? Get yours now and enjoy smart connectivity, health monitoring, and a fashionable edge—all in one powerful wearable.</p>\r\n', '<div class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel\" dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<ul data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:12\">\r\n 	<li data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:12\"><strong>Brand:</strong> Generic</li>\r\n 	<li data-sourcepos=\"2:2-2:29\"><strong>Model Name:</strong> S300 Ultra</li>\r\n 	<li data-sourcepos=\"3:2-3:20\"><strong>Style:</strong> Casual</li>\r\n 	<li data-sourcepos=\"4:2-4:25\"><strong>Display:</strong> 49mm OLED with 240 x 240 resolution</li>\r\n 	<li data-sourcepos=\"5:2-5:41\"><strong>Special Feature:</strong> Always On Display</li>\r\n 	<li data-sourcepos=\"6:2-6:45\"><strong>Free Gift:</strong> Includes Airpods 7 straps for customization</li>\r\n 	<li data-sourcepos=\"7:2-7:34\"><strong>Protection:</strong> Water resistant</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 5999, 3299, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:49:48', '2025-07-25 17:08:22', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(85, 'DT900 Smart Watch', 'dt900-ultra-smart-watch', 11, 58, '<h2>DT900 Ultra Smart Watch Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>DT900 Smart Watch</strong> is designed for users who want a perfect blend of performance, style, and value. Whether you need to stay connected, track your health, or manage daily tasks with ease, this smartwatch delivers all of that and more—at a competitive price in Pakistan.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With features like <strong>Bluetooth calling</strong>, <strong>voice assistant</strong>, and <strong>multiple sports modes</strong>, the DT900 is ideal for fitness enthusiasts and professionals alike. Its modern design, full-touch display, and robust health tracking tools make it a reliable companion in any setting—be it the gym, the office, or a casual day out.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Features of the DT900 Smart Watch</h3>\r\n\r\n<h4>1. Bluetooth Calling</h4>\r\n<p>Answer and make calls directly from your wrist with the DT900’s <strong>Bluetooth calling</strong> feature. Stay connected while driving, exercising, or attending meetings—without needing to reach for your phone.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>2. Voice Assistant</h4>\r\n<p>Use voice commands to send messages, set reminders, or check the weather with the built-in <strong>voice assistant</strong>. It offers a convenient hands-free experience for multitaskers on the go.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>3. Multiple Sports Modes</h4>\r\n<p>Track your workouts across various activities such as running, cycling, and more with real-time metrics and performance feedback.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>4. Health Monitoring Suite</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Heart Rate Monitor:</strong> Track your heart rate 24/7 for better cardiovascular awareness.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Sleep Monitoring:</strong> Understand your sleep quality and cycles to improve rest and recovery.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Blood Oxygen Monitoring:</strong> Monitor your oxygen saturation levels, especially helpful during exercise or at high altitudes.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h4>5. IP67 Water Resistance</h4>\r\n<p>The DT900 Smart Watch is <strong>IP67 water-resistant</strong>, making it safe for everyday use, including handwashing and light water exposure. It’s built to keep up with your active lifestyle.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>6. Wide Device Compatibility</h4>\r\n<p>Compatible with both <strong>Android</strong> and <strong>iOS</strong> devices, this smartwatch easily syncs with your phone via Bluetooth 5.2, ensuring seamless connectivity.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>7. Full-Touch Display</h4>\r\n<p>The <strong>49mm full-touch AMOLED screen</strong> with a <strong>484 x 396 resolution</strong> provides sharp visuals and smooth touch response, making navigation and readability effortless.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>8. Battery Performance</h4>\r\n<p>With a <strong>280mAh battery</strong>, the DT900 offers <strong>2 to 3 days of use</strong> on a single charge. It’s optimized for users who need a reliable, long-lasting smartwatch.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>9. Customizable Look</h4>\r\n<p>The DT900 includes <strong>multiple strap options</strong>, allowing you to switch styles between sporty and professional settings with ease.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Why Choose the DT900 Smart Watch?</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>DT900 Smart Watch</strong> brings premium features like health monitoring, Bluetooth calling, and voice control into an affordable package. It\'s perfect for users looking to enhance productivity, track fitness, or simply stay stylish without overspending. Whether you\'re chasing fitness goals or handling business calls on the go, this smartwatch has the features to support your lifestyle.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With <strong>IP67 durability</strong>, <strong>Bluetooth 5.2 connectivity</strong>, and a brilliant display, the DT900 stands out as a top-tier smartwatch option in Pakistan at an affordable price point.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Upgrade your daily routine with the DT900 Ultra Smart Watch</strong>—a smart investment for health, convenience, and connectivity.</p>', '<strong>Brand</strong> Generic\r\n<strong>Model name</strong> DT900 Ultra\r\n<strong>Style</strong> Casual\r\n<strong>Screen size</strong> 49 Millimeters\r\n<strong>Special features</strong> Always On Display\r\n<strong>Protection</strong> Water Proof\r\n<strong>Free Gift</strong> 7 Starps Silicon case', 1, 50, 6499, 4199, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:49:48', '2025-07-25 17:06:42', 'NULL', NULL, 0);
