(86, 'Ronin R-4400 Black Wolve Wireless Headsets', 'ronin-r-4400-black-wolve-wireless-headsets', 16, 54, '<h2>Ronin R-4400 Black Wolve Wireless Headsets Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Ronin R-4400 Black Wolve Wireless Headsets offer an impressive audio experience tailored for music enthusiasts and casual listeners alike. Designed for comfort and functionality, these headsets are ideal for use during commutes, workouts, or simply relaxing at home. With cutting-edge features and a sleek design, they stand out in the competitive audio accessories market.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Ergonomic Design and Comfort</h3>\r\n<p>The Ronin R-4400 Black Wolve headsets are built with the user’s comfort in mind. Their lightweight and ergonomic design ensures that you can enjoy long listening sessions without discomfort. Whether you\'re tuning into your favorite playlists, attending virtual meetings, or enjoying podcasts, these headsets provide a snug, secure fit that stays in place.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Seamless Connectivity</h3>\r\n<p>Featuring <strong>Bluetooth version 5.1</strong>, the Ronin R-4400 ensures stable and fast connections with a range of up to <strong>10 meters</strong>. The pairing process is quick and easy, compatible with both <strong>Android and iOS</strong> devices. Enjoy the convenience of wireless freedom without interruptions or lag.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Impressive Battery Life</h3>\r\n<p>The built-in <strong>500mAh battery</strong> offers up to <strong>10 hours of playtime</strong> on a single charge. With a charging time of <strong>4–5 hours</strong>, these headsets are easy to recharge during downtime and offer all-day performance for work, travel, or leisure activities.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Versatile Usage</h3>\r\n<p>Though the Ronin R-4400 does not feature active noise cancellation or a built-in microphone, it still delivers rich and balanced sound for a variety of uses. It’s ideal for music playback, casual listening, watching movies, or relaxing with podcasts. The straightforward audio-only design makes it user-friendly and distraction-free.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Built for Everyday Life</h3>\r\n<p>While it lacks advanced features like water resistance or auto-pairing, the Ronin R-4400 is durable enough for daily use. Whether you’re switching between devices or carrying them on-the-go, their reliable performance and broad compatibility with smartphones, tablets, and laptops make them a practical accessory.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Enhancing Your Listening Experience</h3>\r\n<p>With a well-balanced sound profile, the Ronin R-4400 Black Wolve headsets enhance every genre—from bass-heavy beats to acoustic tracks. Users who value simplicity and sound quality over complicated controls will appreciate the clean listening experience these wireless headsets provide.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Ronin R-4400 Black Wolve Wireless Headsets</strong> offer a stylish, comfortable, and efficient audio solution for users seeking wireless convenience and solid performance. Despite missing features like noise cancellation or a mic, these headsets excel in what matters most—sound quality and comfort.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Whether you’re commuting, working out, or enjoying downtime, the Ronin R-4400 delivers dependable performance at an affordable price. Step into the world of wireless audio and enhance your everyday experience with the Ronin R-4400 Black Wolve Wireless Headsets.</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>Wireless connectivity with Bluetooth 5.1 for easy pairing</li>\r\n 	<li>Lightweight and comfortable design for extended use</li>\r\n 	<li>Approximately 10 hours of playtime on a single charge</li>\r\n 	<li>500mAh battery capacity for lasting performance</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for music, movies, and casual listening</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatibility with Android and iOS devices</li>\r\n 	<li>No microphone, perfect for focused listening experiences</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 0, 8299, 4299, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:49:48', '2025-08-06 14:01:26', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(87, 'Qualcomm Quick Charge 3.0A Car Charger', 'qualcomm-quick-charge-3-0a', 9, 58, '<h2>Qualcomm Quick Charge 3.0A Car Charger Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Qualcomm Quick Charge 3.0A Car Charger is a high-performance accessory designed for fast and efficient charging while you’re on the road. Whether you\'re commuting, taking a long road trip, or just running errands, this charger ensures that your smartphone, tablet, or other USB-powered device stays powered up and ready to go. With its advanced charging technology, dual USB ports, and built-in safety features, it’s the perfect companion for modern users.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Ultra-Fast Charging with Qualcomm Quick Charge 3.0</h3>\r\n<p>Powered by <strong>Qualcomm Quick Charge 3.0</strong> technology, this car charger offers significantly faster charging speeds compared to standard chargers—up to 38% more efficient. Compatible with a wide range of smartphones and tablets, it reduces charging time so you can stay connected and productive throughout your journey.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Dual USB Ports for Simultaneous Charging</h3>\r\n<p>The charger includes <strong>two USB ports</strong>, enabling you to charge two devices at once. <strong>Output 1</strong> delivers <strong>2.0A</strong>, ideal for steady charging, while <strong>Output 2</strong> provides a high-speed <strong>3.1A</strong> output. Whether you’re charging two smartphones or a phone and a tablet, this dual-port setup offers flexibility and efficiency.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Universal Device Compatibility</h3>\r\n<p>This charger is compatible with all USB-powered devices, including both <strong>Android and iOS</strong> smartphones and tablets. Whether you use Samsung, iPhone, Huawei, Xiaomi, or other brands, the Qualcomm Quick Charge 3.0A charger ensures fast and reliable performance. It’s an excellent choice for families, professionals, or anyone using multiple devices on the go.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Advanced Safety Features</h3>\r\n<p>To protect both your vehicle and your devices, the charger includes a built-in <strong>safety circuit</strong>. It safeguards against <strong>overcharging, overheating, and short circuits</strong>, offering peace of mind with every use. This makes it a dependable choice for daily use, ensuring your devices remain safe and your car\'s electronics are protected.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>LED Light Indicator</h3>\r\n<p>The integrated <strong>LED light</strong> makes it easy to locate the USB ports at night or in low-light conditions. This small yet thoughtful feature enhances usability, letting you plug in your devices without distraction or hassle. The subtle glow also adds a touch of modern design to your car’s interior.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Compact and Travel-Friendly Design</h3>\r\n<p>Designed with portability in mind, the Qualcomm Quick Charge 3.0A Car Charger boasts a <strong>compact and durable build</strong> that fits snugly into any vehicle’s charging port. Its <strong>sleek profile</strong> ensures it won’t block other controls or take up unnecessary space, making it a smart choice for any car setup.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Perfect for Commuting and Long Trips</h3>\r\n<p>This charger is a must-have for frequent travelers, commuters, and busy users who depend on their devices for <strong>navigation, communication, and entertainment</strong>. It keeps your gadgets charged and ready to go, making it the ideal travel companion for personal and professional use alike.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Qualcomm Quick Charge 3.0A Car Charger</strong> is a powerful, safe, and user-friendly charging solution for anyone who spends time on the road. With <strong>dual USB ports</strong>, <strong>fast charging</strong> technology, <strong>universal compatibility</strong>, and essential <strong>safety features</strong>, it’s built to meet the demands of modern users. Whether you’re commuting to work or embarking on a road trip, this charger ensures that your devices stay charged and ready for whatever comes next.</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>Qualcomm Quick Charge 3.0 technology for ultra-fast charging.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Dual USB ports</strong> for charging two devices simultaneously.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Output 1: 2.0A</strong>, <strong>Output 2: 3.1A</strong> for versatile charging.</li>\r\n 	<li>Universal compatibility with all <strong>smartphones</strong> and <strong>tablets</strong>.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Safety circuit</strong> to prevent overcharging and overheating.</li>\r\n 	<li>Built-in <strong>LED lights</strong> for easy use in low-light conditions.</li>\r\n 	<li>Compact and durable design for everyday use.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 0, 2499, 1299, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:49:48', '2025-07-25 17:00:43', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(88, 'KW9 Max Smart Watch', 'kw9-max-smart-watch', 11, 58, '<h2>KW9 Max Smart Watch Price in Pakistan With Specification</h2>\n<p>Looking for a fitness companion that\'s lightweight, water-resistant, and packed with features? Look no further! This sleek fitness tracker boasts a comfortable silicone strap and a durable design, making it the perfect choice for active individuals on the go.</p>\n<p><strong>Built for Any Workout:</strong> Don\'t let the rain or sweat slow you down! This tracker features an IP67 water resistance rating, meaning it can withstand splashes, showers, and even accidental dunks. Whether you\'re hitting the gym, pounding the pavement, or swimming laps, this tracker will stay by your side.</p>\n<p><strong>Track Your Progress:</strong> This tracker goes beyond just counting steps. It boasts multiple sports modes to accurately monitor your activity, no matter your favorite workout. From running and cycling to hiking and yoga, this tracker provides valuable data to help you optimize your training and reach your fitness goals.</p>\n<p><strong>Stay Connected at a Glance:</strong> A crystal-clear 2.2-inch full-touch display allows you to easily view your stats, notifications, and even control music playback right from your wrist. The intuitive interface ensures you stay connected and informed without ever having to fumble for your phone.</p>\n<p><strong>Long-lasting Power:</strong> This tracker boasts a powerful battery that can keep up with your active lifestyle. With a 2-3 day battery life on a single charge, you can focus on your workouts and leave the worrying about battery life behind.</p>\n<p><strong>Lightweight Comfort:</strong> At only 50 grams, this tracker is so light you\'ll barely notice it\'s there. The comfortable silicone strap ensures a secure and irritation-free fit, perfect for all-day wear.</p>\n<p><strong>This fitness tracker is the perfect companion for anyone who wants to take their health and fitness to the next level. With its sleek design, advanced features, and long-lasting battery life, it\'s the ultimate tool to help you stay motivated and achieve your goals.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Please note:</strong> This description does not include information about RAM, ROM, Wi-Fi, GPS, or NFC functionality as the provided data sheet indicates they are not present.</p>', '<span class=\"first-token\">• </span><strong>Model Name:</strong> KW9 MAX Smartwatch Series 9 (Latest Model)\n• <strong>Display:</strong> 2.2\" Inch OLED Display, Latest Menu Styles\n• <strong>Chipset:</strong> JL6958\n• <strong>App:</strong> Lefun Health (Note: Double-check app spelling for accuracy)\n• <strong>Connectivity:</strong> Bluetooth 5.0\n• <strong>Features:</strong> Music playback, Sports &amp; Fitness Features, Calculator, Password protection\n• <strong>Battery Timing:</strong> 1-3 Days (may vary depending on usage)\n• <strong>Watch Size:</strong> 42-44 mm\n• <strong>Water Resistant</strong>', 1, 0, 4999, 2999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:49:48', '2025-04-29 09:55:40', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(89, 'Infinix Note 40', 'infinix-note-40', 2, 45, '<h2>Infinix Note 40 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Infinix Note 40 is an exceptional smartphone that combines advanced features with sleek design, catering to users who demand performance and style. Launched on <strong>March 18, 2024</strong>, this device is tailored to meet the needs of a diverse audience, whether for work, entertainment, or social connectivity.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Design and Build</h3>\r\n<p>One of the key attributes of the Infinix Note 40 is its <strong>dual SIM support</strong>. This feature allows users to operate two phone numbers simultaneously, making it ideal for managing personal and professional communications. The phone is designed with practicality and elegance in mind, measuring <strong>164.13 x 74.53 x 7.75 mm</strong> and weighing just <strong>190 grams</strong>, offering a lightweight and comfortable grip for daily use.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Software and Interface</h3>\r\n<p>Running on <strong>Android 14</strong> with the custom <strong>XOS 14</strong> interface, the Infinix Note 40 delivers a fluid, user-friendly experience. The system is highly customizable and optimized for productivity, making it easy to navigate between apps, settings, and features with minimal effort.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Display Quality</h3>\r\n<p>The standout feature of this device is its large <strong>6.78-inch AMOLED display</strong>, offering a sharp resolution of <strong>1080 x 2436 pixels</strong> and an ultra-smooth <strong>120Hz refresh rate</strong>. Whether you\'re gaming, streaming, or browsing, the display ensures vivid colors and crisp details. Protected by <strong>Corning Gorilla Glass</strong>, it also offers added durability against scratches and minor drops.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Powerful Performance</h3>\r\n<p>The Infinix Note 40 is powered by the <strong>Mediatek Helio G99 Ultimate processor</strong>, designed for seamless multitasking and smooth performance. Paired with the <strong>Mali-G57 MC2 GPU</strong>, it handles gaming and media playback with ease, delivering visually rich and lag-free experiences even during intense usage.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Memory and Storage</h3>\r\n<p>With <strong>8 GB of RAM</strong> and <strong>256 GB of internal storage</strong>, the Infinix Note 40 provides generous space for apps, media, and files while ensuring efficient multitasking. Although it does not support expandable storage, the built-in capacity is sufficient for most users’ needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Camera System</h3>\r\n<p>Photography is a major highlight of the Infinix Note 40. The device features a powerful <strong>108 MP rear camera</strong> with <strong>Optical Image Stabilization (OIS)</strong> for capturing sharp and vibrant images even in low light. It supports advanced video recording at <strong>2K@30FPS</strong> and <strong>1080P@60FPS</strong>, ideal for content creators and vloggers. On the front, a <strong>32 MP selfie camera</strong> delivers detailed, well-lit portraits, perfect for social media and video calls.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Battery Life</h3>\r\n<p>The phone is equipped with a high-capacity <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong>, ensuring long-lasting usage throughout the day. Efficient power management features integrated into Android 14 extend battery life further, making it suitable for heavy users who rely on all-day performance without frequent charging.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Connectivity and Extras</h3>\r\n<p>Connectivity options on the Infinix Note 40 include <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, <strong>Wi-Fi</strong>, <strong>3G</strong>, <strong>4G/LTE</strong>, and <strong>NFC</strong> for mobile payments and quick file sharing. The inclusion of <strong>FM radio</strong> adds a bonus for users who enjoy listening to their favorite stations offline. While it lacks 5G support, the fast and stable 4G coverage ensures reliable internet connectivity for everyday tasks.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion</h3>\r\n<p>In conclusion, the Infinix Note 40 stands out as a feature-rich smartphone that expertly balances performance, design, and usability. With its impressive AMOLED display, strong battery life, high-resolution cameras, and sleek aesthetics, it’s a great choice for tech enthusiasts and everyday users alike. Whether you\'re into gaming, photography, or productivity, the Infinix Note 40 delivers exceptional value in today’s smartphone market.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14 OS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Octa-core (2 x 2.2 GHz Cortex-A76  <span id=\"IL_AD7\" class=\"IL_AD\">6 x</span> 2.0 GHz Cortex-A55) ,Mediatek Helio G99 Ultimate</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Triple Camera: 108 MP, f/1.9, (wide), 1/1.52\", PDAF  <span id=\"IL_AD5\" class=\"IL_AD\">2 MP</span>, f/2.4 3rd unspecified camera, Quad LED Flash</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">32 MP, f/2.2, (wide), 1/3.1</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.78 Inches , AMOLED Capacitive Touchscreen, Multitouch</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Fast <span id=\"IL_AD10\" class=\"IL_AD\">battery</span> 45W wired, 50% in 26 min (<span id=\"IL_AD9\" class=\"IL_AD\">advertised</span>) 20W, wireless MagCharge, Reverse wired, Reverse wireless</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">256GB Built-in, 8GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 54999, 51199, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:49:48', '2025-07-25 16:58:28', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(90, 'Tecno Camon 30', 'tecno-camon-30', 2, 57, '<h2>Tecno Camon 30 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Tecno Camon 30, released on <strong>23 April 2024</strong>, is an advanced smartphone that combines impressive performance, top-tier features, and a sleek design. It\'s an ideal option for users seeking a device with a powerful camera system, extensive storage, and smooth performance. Whether you’re a multitasker, gamer, or photography enthusiast, the Tecno Camon 30 is built to meet your needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Design and Display</h3>\r\n<p>The Tecno Camon 30 features a slim and stylish design with dimensions of <strong>165.27 x 75.33 x 7.7mm</strong>, making it lightweight and comfortable to hold. Its build quality feels premium, offering both durability and ease of use.</p>\r\n<p>The phone boasts a <strong>6.78-inch AMOLED display</strong> with a <strong>120Hz refresh rate</strong>. This high refresh rate ensures smooth visuals, perfect for gaming, video streaming, and everyday use. The display resolution of <strong>240 x 320 pixels</strong> might seem modest, but the AMOLED technology ensures rich colors and deep contrasts, making content look vibrant and immersive.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Performance and Processing Power</h3>\r\n<p>At the heart of the Tecno Camon 30 lies the <strong>Helio G99 Ultimate processor</strong>, an efficient and powerful chipset designed for smooth performance. Whether you\'re gaming, multitasking, or using demanding applications, the Helio G99 delivers responsive performance with minimal lag. Complementing this is the <strong>Mali-G57 MC2 GPU</strong>, which ensures that graphics-intensive tasks like gaming run smoothly.</p>\r\n<p>The device is equipped with a staggering <strong>24GB of RAM</strong> (12GB RAM + 12GB extended), ensuring seamless multitasking. Whether you’re switching between apps, playing games, or streaming videos, the Tecno Camon 30 delivers excellent performance.</p>\r\n<p>In terms of storage, the phone offers <strong>256GB or 512GB of internal memory</strong>, giving you more than enough space to store your apps, photos, videos, and documents. Although it doesn’t support expandable storage, its internal memory is sufficient for most users.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Camera System</h3>\r\n<p>Photography is where the Tecno Camon 30 shines. The device comes with a <strong>50MP front camera</strong> for capturing high-quality selfies. The front camera also supports <strong>video recording</strong> and includes a <strong>front flash light</strong> for low-light selfies.</p>\r\n<p>On the rear, the Tecno Camon 30 is equipped with a <strong>50MP primary camera</strong> and a <strong>2MP AI Cam</strong>, offering versatility in photography. The <strong>back flash light</strong> ensures clear photos in darker settings, while <strong>video recording</strong> capabilities add to its content creation potential.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Battery Life and Charging</h3>\r\n<p>Powering the Tecno Camon 30 is a <strong>5000mAh battery</strong>, designed to last all day. Whether you\'re browsing the web, streaming, or gaming, the large battery capacity ensures consistent performance. Coupled with the Helio G99’s efficient power usage, the phone easily handles long hours of use.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Operating System and Connectivity</h3>\r\n<p>The Tecno Camon 30 runs on <strong>Android 14</strong>, offering the latest features and performance optimizations. Tecno’s user interface adds customizations and intuitive controls that enhance overall usability.</p>\r\n<p>Connectivity features include <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, <strong>Wi-Fi</strong>, <strong>3G</strong>, <strong>4G/LTE</strong>, and <strong>NFC</strong> (region-dependent). Although <strong>5G</strong> isn’t supported, its 4G capabilities offer fast and stable internet speeds for most users.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion</h3>\r\n<p>The Tecno Camon 30 is a feature-packed smartphone that delivers on all fronts. From its high-quality camera setup and long-lasting battery to its sleek design and powerful hardware, it’s well-suited for users seeking a high-performance device. Whether you\'re a gamer, content creator, or everyday user, the Camon 30 offers a smooth and immersive mobile experience. With options for up to <strong>512GB storage</strong> and <strong>24GB RAM</strong>, this device is a true powerhouse in its segment.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14 OS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">2.2Ghz Octa Core  , Mediatek <a class=\"google-anno\" href=\"https://www.whatmobile.com.pk/Tecno_Camon-20-Pro#\"> <span class=\"google-anno-t\">MT8781</span></a> Helio G99,Mediatek Helio G99 Ultimate</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">50 MP, (wide), AF, Dual-LED dual-tone flash, Video (1080p@30fps)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual camera: 50 MP, f/1.9, (wide), 1/1.57\", PDAF, OIS 2 MP, (depth), <span id=\"IL_AD3\" class=\"IL_AD\">Dual LED</span> Flash</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.78 Inches ,AMOLED Capacitive Touchscreen, Multitouch</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh,  Fast charging 70W wired, 0-100% in 45 min (advertised)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">256GB Built-in, 12GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 57999, 55999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:49:48', '2025-07-25 16:54:43', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(91, 'Infinix Note 40 Pro', 'infinix-note-40-pro', 2, 45, '<h2>Infinix Note 40 Pro Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\nThe Infinix Note 40 Pro is a cutting-edge smartphone designed to elevate your mobile experience. Released on <strong>March 18, 2024</strong>, this device is tailored for tech enthusiasts and everyday users alike, blending style with high-performance features. With an array of capabilities, the Infinix Note 40 Pro stands as a formidable contender in the smartphone market.\r\n\r\nOne of the most notable aspects of the Infinix Note 40 Pro is its <strong>dual SIM support</strong>. This feature allows users to manage two different phone numbers seamlessly, making it ideal for balancing personal and professional communications. Whether you want to take advantage of different mobile plans or separate your work and personal calls, this functionality provides added convenience.\r\n\r\nThe <strong>dimensions of the device</strong> are <strong>164.35 x 74.6 x 7.75 mm</strong>, and it weighs <strong>190 grams</strong>. This lightweight design ensures a comfortable grip, making it easy to handle for extended periods. The Infinix Note 40 Pro runs on <strong>Android 14</strong>, enhanced with the <strong>XOS 14</strong> user interface, providing a smooth, responsive experience. The user interface offers numerous customization options, allowing users to personalize their smartphone to suit their preferences.\r\n\r\nFeaturing a stunning <strong>6.78-inch AMOLED display</strong>, the Infinix Note 40 Pro delivers breathtaking visuals. With a resolution of <strong>1080 x 2436 pixels</strong> and a peak brightness of <strong>1300 nits</strong>, users can enjoy vibrant colors and sharp details in all lighting conditions. The <strong>120Hz refresh rate</strong> enhances the overall viewing experience, providing fluid motion and responsiveness, whether you\'re scrolling through social media, playing games, or watching videos. Additionally, the display is protected by <strong>Corning Gorilla Glass</strong>, ensuring durability against scratches and impacts.\r\n\r\nIn terms of memory, the Infinix Note 40 Pro boasts <strong>256 GB of internal storage</strong>, providing ample space for apps, photos, and videos. Coupled with <strong>12 GB of RAM</strong>, the smartphone can efficiently handle multitasking, allowing users to run multiple applications simultaneously without any lag. Although the device does not feature expandable storage, the generous internal capacity is more than sufficient for most users.\r\n\r\nPerformance-wise, the Infinix Note 40 Pro is powered by the <strong>MediaTek Helio G99 Ultimate processor</strong>. This chipset delivers robust performance for gaming, streaming, and day-to-day tasks. The <strong>Mali-G57 MC2 GPU</strong> complements the processor, enabling smooth graphics rendering for an enhanced gaming experience. Whether you\'re engaged in heavy gaming or simple browsing, the Infinix Note 40 Pro can handle it all.\r\n\r\nPhotography enthusiasts will appreciate the camera capabilities of the Infinix Note 40 Pro. The <strong>108 MP triple rear camera setup</strong> includes two additional 2 MP sensors, allowing for versatile photography options. The main camera captures stunning detail and vibrant colors, while the secondary sensors enhance the photographic experience, particularly in portrait and macro shots. Users can record videos in <strong>2K resolution at 30fps</strong> or in <strong>1080p at 60fps</strong>, ensuring high-quality content creation. For selfies, the <strong>32 MP front camera</strong> comes equipped with a flash, making it easy to capture bright, clear self-portraits even in low light.\r\n\r\nBattery life is another strong suit of the Infinix Note 40 Pro. With a <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong>, the device is designed to last through long days of usage, whether you\'re streaming, gaming, or browsing. This large capacity ensures that users can stay connected without the constant worry of running out of power.\r\n\r\nIn terms of connectivity, the Infinix Note 40 Pro offers a variety of options, including <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, <strong>3G</strong>, <strong>4G/LTE</strong>, and <strong>WiFi</strong> support. While it does not support 5G, the robust 4G connectivity provides reliable internet access for streaming and browsing. Additionally, the device features an <strong>FM radio</strong>, a fun option for music lovers, and <strong>NFC</strong> capability, depending on the market or region.\r\n\r\nIn summary, the Infinix Note 40 Pro is a well-rounded smartphone that caters to a wide range of user needs. With its impressive features, high-performance specifications, and sleek design, it represents a valuable addition to anyone\'s tech arsenal. Whether you are a professional needing a reliable device or a casual user looking for a great smartphone experience, the Infinix Note 40 Pro is designed to meet and exceed expectations.', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14 OS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Octa-core (2 x 2.2 GHz Cortex-A76 6 x 2.0 GHz Cortex-A55) ,Mediatek Helio G99 Ultimate</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">32 MP, f/2.2, (wide), 1/3.1, <span id=\"IL_AD3\" class=\"IL_AD\">Dual LED</span> Flash, Video (1080p@30fps)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Triple Camera: 108 MP, f/1.8, (wide), 1/1.67\", PDAF, OIS 2 MP, f/2.4 2 MP, f/2.4, Quad LED Flash</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.78 Inches ,3D Curved AMOLED Capacitive Touchscreen, Multitouch</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh,  Fast battery 70W wired, 50% in <span id=\"IL_AD2\" class=\"IL_AD\">20 min</span> (advertised), 20W wireless MagCharge, Reverse wired, Reverse wireless</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">256GB Built-in, 12GB RAM ( 12GB Extended RAM), UFS 2.2</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 10, 69999, 66999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:51:44', '2025-05-25 16:55:50', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(92, 'Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 Pro Plus', 'xiaomi-redmi-note-13-pro-plus', 2, 61, '<h2>Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 Pro Plus Price In Pakistan</h2>\nThe Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 Pro Plus sets a new standard for smartphones, blending advanced technology with a stylish design to cater to the needs of modern users. Released on <strong>January 26, 2024</strong>, this smartphone is designed for those seeking a high-performance device without compromising on aesthetics or functionality.\n\nOne of the standout features of the Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 Pro Plus is its <strong>dual SIM support</strong>, which allows you to manage two phone numbers effortlessly. This feature is perfect for users who want to separate work and personal calls or take advantage of different mobile plans. With a sleek and lightweight design, the phone measures <strong>161.1 x 74.95 x 8.9 mm</strong> and weighs just <strong>188 grams</strong>, making it comfortable to hold and use throughout the day.\n\nPowered by <strong>MIUI 14</strong>, based on Android, the Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 Pro Plus offers a smooth and intuitive user experience. The interface is user-friendly and packed with customization options, enabling you to tailor your smartphone to suit your preferences.\n\nThe smartphone boasts a stunning <strong>6.67-inch CrystalRes AMOLED display</strong> with a resolution of <strong>2712 x 1220 pixels</strong>. This high-resolution screen delivers vibrant colors and sharp details, making it ideal for streaming videos, playing games, and browsing the web. With <strong>Corning Gorilla Glass Victus</strong> providing added protection, users can enjoy peace of mind knowing their screen is resistant to scratches and accidental drops.\n\nIn terms of memory and performance, the Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 Pro Plus offers impressive options. Users can choose between <strong>256 GB or 512 GB</strong> of internal storage, complemented by <strong>8 GB or 12 GB</strong> of RAM. This combination ensures smooth multitasking and fast app launches, making it suitable for both casual users and heavy multitaskers. Additionally, the phone supports <strong>microSD expansion</strong>, allowing you to increase storage as needed for photos, videos, and apps.\n\nUnder the hood, the smartphone is powered by the <strong>MediaTek Dimensity 7200-Ultra processor</strong>. This powerful chipset is designed to handle demanding applications and games with ease, ensuring a responsive and efficient user experience. The accompanying <strong>Mali-G610 GPU</strong> enhances graphics performance, providing stunning visuals for gaming and media consumption.\n\nBattery life is a crucial aspect of any smartphone, and the Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 Pro Plus excels in this area with its robust <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong>. Users can enjoy extended usage without worrying about frequent recharging. The combination of efficient power management and a large battery capacity makes this device ideal for those who rely on their smartphones for day-to-day tasks.\n\nWhen it comes to photography, the Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 Pro Plus does not disappoint. It features an impressive <strong>200 MP triple rear camera setup</strong>, consisting of an 8 MP ultra-wide lens and a 2 MP depth sensor. This versatile camera system allows you to capture stunning images in various settings, from sweeping landscapes to detailed close-ups. Video recording capabilities are equally impressive, with support for <strong>4K resolution at 30fps</strong> and <strong>1080p recording at 60fps</strong>, providing flexibility for content creators and casual users alike. The <strong>16 MP front camera</strong> is perfect for selfies and video calls, ensuring high-quality image capture.\n\nConnectivity options on the Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 Pro Plus are extensive, making it a versatile choice for users. It supports <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, <strong>3G</strong>, <strong>4G/LTE</strong>, and <strong>5G</strong> connectivity, ensuring you can stay connected no matter where you are. Additionally, the phone features <strong>NFC</strong>, allowing for quick data transfer and mobile payments, depending on the market or region.\n\nIn conclusion, the Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 Pro Plus is a powerhouse of a smartphone, designed to meet the diverse needs of today’s users. With its exceptional performance, stunning display, and impressive camera capabilities, it stands out as a leading option in the competitive smartphone market. Whether you are a professional, a gamer, or someone who enjoys capturing moments on camera, the Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 Pro Plus is designed to provide an outstanding mobile experience.', '<div class=\"product-table\">\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14 OS</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Octa-core (2 x 2.8 GHz Cortex-A715 6 x 2.0 GHz Cortex-A510) ,Mediatek Dimensity 7200 Ultra (4 <span id=\"IL_AD6\" class=\"IL_AD\">nm</span>)</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">32 MP, f/2.2, (wide), <span id=\"IL_AD8\" class=\"IL_AD\">Dual LED</span> Flash, Video (1080p@30fps)</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Triple Camera: 200 MP, f/1.7, 23mm (wide), 1/1.4\", multi-directional PDAF, OIS 8 MP, f/2.2, (ultrawide) 2 MP, f/2.4, (macro), dual-LED dual-tone flash</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.67 Inches ,AMOLED Capacitive Touchscreen, 68B Colors, Multitouch</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh , Fast charging 120W wired, PD3.0, 100% in 19 min (advertised)</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">512GB Built-in, 12GB RAM, UFS 3.1</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 1, 0, 139999, 132999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:51:44', '2025-04-22 11:51:11', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(93, 'Realme Note 50 128GB', 'realme-note-50-128gb', 2, 53, '<h2>Realme Note 50 Price In Pakistan</h2>\nThe Realme Note 50 is a smartphone designed to meet the diverse needs of users looking for a reliable and feature-rich device. Released on <strong>January 23, 2024</strong>, this smartphone stands out for its combination of performance, design, and affordability. Ideal for both casual users and tech enthusiasts, the Realme Note 50 brings a host of features that enhance your daily mobile experience.\n\nWith <strong>dual SIM support</strong>, the Realme Note 50 allows users to maintain separate lines for personal and professional use without the need for multiple devices. This convenience is perfect for those who want to stay connected with family, friends, and work. The phone\'s dimensions of <strong>167.2 x 76.7 x 7.9 mm</strong> make it comfortable to hold, while its lightweight design at <strong>186 grams</strong> ensures ease of use throughout the day.\n\nThe smartphone runs on <strong>Android 13</strong> with <strong>Realme UI T</strong>, providing a smooth and intuitive user experience. This operating system is designed to optimize performance while offering various customization options that allow users to personalize their devices. Whether you\'re browsing social media, streaming videos, or using productivity apps, the Realme Note 50 is equipped to handle it all.\n\nOne of the standout features of the Realme Note 50 is its <strong>6.74-inch IPS HD+ display</strong>. With a resolution of <strong>720 x 1600 pixels</strong>, the screen delivers bright and vibrant visuals, making it perfect for watching videos or browsing photos. The IPS technology ensures wide viewing angles and consistent color reproduction, enhancing your viewing experience. Although the screen protection details are not specified, the display is designed to be durable and functional.\n\nStorage is a critical consideration for any smartphone, and the Realme Note 50 excels in this area. It comes with <strong>64 GB of internal memory</strong>, which provides ample space for apps, photos, and media files. Additionally, the device features <strong>4 GB of RAM</strong>, allowing for smooth multitasking and application switching. For users requiring more storage, the <strong>microSDXC card slot</strong> enables further expansion, ensuring you never run out of space for your essential files.\n\nPerformance-wise, the Realme Note 50 is powered by the <strong>Unisoc Tiger T612</strong> processor, coupled with the <strong>Mali-G57</strong> GPU. This combination ensures efficient processing capabilities and decent graphics performance, making it suitable for light gaming and everyday tasks. Users can expect responsive performance whether browsing the web or using applications.\n\nPhotography enthusiasts will appreciate the dual-camera setup on the back of the Realme Note 50. The <strong>13 MP primary camera</strong>, along with a <strong>QVGA sensor</strong>, captures vibrant and detailed images, while the presence of a back flash light enhances low-light photography. Video recording capabilities include <strong>1080p at 30fps</strong>, allowing users to capture high-quality videos. On the front, the <strong>5 MP camera</strong> is perfect for selfies and video calls, with the ability to record in <strong>720p at 30fps</strong>.\n\nBattery life is another highlight of the Realme Note 50. With a <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong>, this smartphone is designed to keep you powered throughout the day. Users can engage in various activities without worrying about frequent recharges. The combination of a large battery and efficient performance ensures that you can enjoy multimedia content, browse social media, and communicate without interruption.\n\nIn terms of connectivity, the Realme Note 50 is equipped with a range of options, including <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, <strong>3G</strong>, and <strong>4G/LTE</strong> support. Although it does not support 5G, it remains a practical choice for most users, providing reliable connectivity for everyday tasks. The device also supports <strong>WiFi</strong>, allowing for fast internet access at home or on the go.\n\nOverall, the <strong>Realme Note 50</strong> is an impressive smartphone that balances performance, design, and affordability. Its array of features, from the vibrant display to the powerful battery, make it a valuable addition to any user\'s tech arsenal. Whether you\'re a student, a working professional, or someone who enjoys staying connected with friends and family, the Realme Note 50 is designed to meet your needs without breaking the bank.\n\n&nbsp;', '<div class=\"product-table\">\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14 OS</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Octa-core (2 x 1.8 GHz Cortex-A75 6 x 1.8 GHz Cortex-A55),Unisoc Tiger T612 (12 nm)</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5 MP, f/2.2, 27mm (wide), HDR, Video (720p@30fps)</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Camera: 13 MP, (wide), PDAF 0.08 MP ,(<span id=\"IL_AD5\" class=\"IL_AD\">auxiliary</span> lens), LED Flash</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.74 Inches ,IPS LCD Capacitive Touchscreen, 16M Colors, Multitouch</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh, Battery charging 10W</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">128GB Built-in, 4GB RAM</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 1, 0, 27999, 25999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:51:44', '2025-04-22 11:51:11', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0);
