(94, 'Xiaomi Redmi 12', 'xiaomi-redmi-12', 2, 61, '<h2>Xiaomi Redmi 12 Price In Pakistan</h2>\nThe Xiaomi Redmi 12 is a powerful smartphone that merges cutting-edge technology with user-friendly design. Officially launched on <strong>12 September 2023</strong>, this device offers a comprehensive suite of features, making it an excellent choice for anyone in the market for a new phone.\n<h4>Design and Display:</h4>\nThe Redmi 12 showcases a sleek and modern design with dimensions of <strong>168.6 x 76.3 x 8.2 mm</strong> and a weight of <strong>198.5 grams</strong>. This makes it a comfortable fit for your hand, allowing for easy navigation and usage throughout the day. The device supports <strong>Hybrid Dual SIM (Nano-SIM, dual stand-by)</strong> functionality, making it easy to separate work and personal calls.\n\nThe smartphone features a generous <strong>6.79-inch IPS LCD display</strong> with a resolution of <strong>1080 x 2460 pixels</strong>. This impressive screen size offers vibrant colors and sharp details, enhancing your viewing experience whether you’re streaming videos, playing games, or browsing social media. While specific screen protection details are unavailable, the display\'s quality ensures that users can enjoy content with clarity and brightness.\n<h4>Performance and Hardware:</h4>\nPowering the Xiaomi Redmi 12 is the <strong>Mediatek Helio G88 (12nm) Octa-core processor</strong>, which offers smooth performance and efficient multitasking capabilities. Coupled with <strong>8GB of RAM</strong>, this device ensures a seamless experience while running multiple applications and games simultaneously. With <strong>128GB of internal storage</strong>, users will have ample space for their apps, photos, and other media. For those requiring additional storage, the phone also features a <strong>card slot</strong> for microSD expansion.\n<h4>Camera Capabilities:</h4>\nPhotography enthusiasts will appreciate the camera setup on the Redmi 12. The rear camera boasts a triple-lens system with a <strong>50 MP main sensor</strong>, complemented by <strong>8 MP and 2 MP secondary sensors</strong>. This configuration enables users to capture stunning images with clarity and detail, making it perfect for various shooting conditions. The device supports <strong>back flash light</strong>, ensuring well-lit photos even in low-light situations, and allows for impressive video recording.\n\nOn the front, the Xiaomi Redmi 12 includes an <strong>8 MP camera</strong>, suitable for selfies and video calls. While it lacks a front flash, it still captures decent images under adequate lighting. Users can enjoy front video recording capabilities as well, making this smartphone a good choice for those who frequently engage in video chats or content creation.\n<h4>Battery Life:</h4>\nOne of the standout features of the Xiaomi Redmi 12 is its robust <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong>. This substantial capacity means users can engage in various activities—like gaming, browsing, and streaming—without worrying about running out of power during the day. The efficient battery management ensures that you can stay connected longer, making it ideal for busy lifestyles.\n<h4>Software and Connectivity:</h4>\nThe Xiaomi Redmi 12 operates on <strong>Android 13</strong> with <strong>MIUI 14</strong>, providing a smooth and intuitive user interface. Users can customize their experience with a variety of themes and settings that make the device uniquely theirs.\n\nConnectivity options on the Redmi 12 are extensive, featuring <strong>Bluetooth</strong> for wireless accessories, as well as <strong>3G</strong> and <strong>4G/LTE</strong> support for fast internet browsing. While the device does not support <strong>5G</strong>, it still meets the connectivity needs of most users. Additional features include <strong>radio</strong>, <strong>WiFi</strong>, and <strong>NFC</strong> capabilities, depending on the region, further enhancing its versatility.\n<h4>Additional Features:</h4>\nThe Xiaomi Redmi 12 not only focuses on performance but also emphasizes user satisfaction. The combination of a robust design, powerful hardware, and impressive specifications makes it an attractive option in the smartphone market. Whether you are a student, a professional, or a tech enthusiast, the Xiaomi Redmi 12 is built to cater to your needs.\n\nIn summary, the Xiaomi Redmi 12 stands out with its competitive features and attractive design, making it an appealing choice for those looking for a reliable smartphone. Its high-quality display, versatile camera capabilities, long-lasting battery, and modern software make it a compelling option for anyone seeking a new device.', '<div class=\"product-table\">\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13 OS</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Octa-core (2x 2.0 GHz Cortex-A75 6 x 1.8 GHz Cortex-A55),Mediatek Helio G88 (12nm)</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">8 MP, f/2.1, (wide), Video (1080p@30fps)</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Triple Camera: 50 MP, f/1.8, (wide), PDAF 8 MP, f/2.2, (ultrawide) 2 MP, f/2.4, (depth), LED Flash</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.79 Inches ,IPS LCD Capacitive Touchscreen, 16M Colors, Multitouch</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh,  Fast charging 18W wired, PD</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">256GB Built-in, 8GB RAM</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 1, 0, 38999, 36999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:51:44', '2025-04-22 11:51:11', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(95, 'Vivo Y100', 'vivo-y100', 2, 60, '<h2>Vivo Y100 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\nThe Vivo Y100 is designed for those who value performance and aesthetics in their smartphones. Released on <strong>April 30, 2024</strong>, this device is a perfect blend of advanced technology and user-friendly features. The smartphone is engineered to meet the demands of modern users, ensuring a smooth and enjoyable experience.\r\n\r\nEquipped with <strong>dual SIM support</strong>, the Vivo Y100 allows you to manage your personal and professional life effortlessly. This feature ensures that you can stay connected without the hassle of carrying multiple devices. With a lightweight design of <strong>186 grams</strong>, this smartphone feels comfortable in your hand, making it suitable for extended use.\r\n\r\nOne of the standout features of the Vivo Y100 is its <strong>6.67-inch AMOLED display</strong>. With a resolution of <strong>2400 x 1080 pixels</strong> and a refresh rate of <strong>120 Hz</strong>, this screen delivers vivid colors and smooth transitions. Whether you\'re streaming your favorite shows, playing games, or scrolling through social media, the stunning display enhances every visual experience. The AMOLED technology ensures deeper blacks and better contrast, providing a more immersive viewing experience.\r\n\r\nPowered by <strong>Funtouch OS 14</strong>, the Vivo Y100 runs smoothly on the Android platform, offering a user-friendly interface along with various customization options. The operating system is designed to optimize performance and enhance battery life, allowing users to enjoy their devices longer without needing frequent recharges.\r\n\r\nIn terms of storage, the Vivo Y100 does not disappoint. With <strong>256 GB of internal memory</strong> and <strong>16 GB RAM</strong>, you have ample space to store apps, photos, videos, and other important files. Additionally, the <strong>8 GB extendable RAM</strong> feature ensures smooth multitasking, enabling you to switch between applications seamlessly without any lag. This capability makes the Vivo Y100 an excellent choice for gamers and multitaskers alike.\r\n\r\nThe device\'s performance is powered by the <strong>Snapdragon 685 processor</strong>, which delivers reliable speed and efficiency. This processor is designed to handle demanding tasks, ensuring that you can enjoy high-quality gaming and seamless browsing. The combination of a powerful processor and generous RAM ensures that the Vivo Y100 can handle any task you throw at it.\r\n\r\nWhen it comes to photography, the Vivo Y100 excels with its dual-camera system. The <strong>50 MP primary back camera</strong> captures stunning images with incredible detail, while the <strong>2 MP secondary camera</strong> provides additional functionality for depth effects. This setup allows you to take impressive photos in various lighting conditions, making it a fantastic option for photography enthusiasts. The <strong>8 MP front camera</strong> is perfect for selfies and video calls, ensuring you always look your best.\r\n\r\nThe Vivo Y100 is equipped with a robust <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong>, allowing you to use your device for an entire day without needing to recharge. Whether you\'re streaming videos, playing games, or simply browsing the web, this battery life ensures that you stay connected when it matters most.\r\n\r\nFor connectivity, the Vivo Y100 supports <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, <strong>3G</strong>, <strong>4G/LTE</strong>, and <strong>WiFi</strong>, making it versatile for different network conditions. It also includes <strong>NFC</strong> functionality for quick payments and file sharing, as well as <strong>FM Radio</strong> for entertainment on the go. This array of connectivity options ensures that you stay connected, no matter where you are.\r\n\r\nOverall, the Vivo Y100 stands out as an exceptional smartphone that combines advanced technology, a stunning display, and impressive performance. Whether you’re a student, a professional, or a casual user, this smartphone is designed to cater to all your needs, making it a worthy addition to your digital life.', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13 OS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Octa-core (4 x 2.8 GHz 4 x 1.9 GHz) ,Qualcomm Snapdragon 685 (6 nm)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">8 MP, f/1.8, (wide), Video (1080p@30fps)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Camera: 50 MP, f/1.8, (wide), PDAF 2 MP, f/2.4, (ultrawide), LED Flash</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.67 Inches ,AMOLED Capacitive Touchscreen, 1B, Multitouch</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh, Fast battery 80W wired, 1-45% in 15 min (advertised)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">256GB Built-in, 8GB RAM ( 8GB of Extended RAM ), UFS 2.2</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 10, 54999, 51999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:51:44', '2025-05-24 14:10:10', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(96, 'Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra', 'samsung-galaxy-s24-ultra', 2, 55, '<h2>Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra Price In Pakistan</h2>\nThe Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra represents the pinnacle of smartphone innovation, blending superior technology with sleek aesthetics. Launched on January 19, 2024, this device is engineered for those who demand the best in mobile technology.\n\nWith a robust dual-SIM support feature, users can easily switch between two networks or integrate a SIM card with an eSIM, ensuring seamless connectivity. The phone dimensions, measuring <strong>162.3 x 79.0 x 8.6 mm</strong> and weighing <strong>232 grams</strong>, provide a substantial yet comfortable feel in hand, making it ideal for daily use.\n\nAt the heart of the <strong>Galaxy S24 Ultra</strong> is its stunning <strong>6.8-inch Dynamic AMOLED 2X display</strong>. With a resolution of <strong>3120 x 1440 (Quad HD+)</strong>, this screen delivers vibrant colors and sharp images, making it perfect for streaming videos, gaming, or browsing social media. The AMOLED technology ensures deeper blacks and enhanced contrast ratios, providing an immersive viewing experience.\n\nThe phone operates on the latest version of Android, ensuring users have access to the newest features and security updates. With <strong>512 GB of internal memory</strong>, users will have ample space to store their apps, photos, and videos. Coupled with <strong>12 GB of RAM</strong>, the Galaxy S24 Ultra guarantees smooth multitasking and an efficient performance for even the most demanding applications.\n\nPhotography enthusiasts will appreciate the remarkable camera system on this device. The <strong>back camera setup features a staggering 200 MP primary lens</strong> combined with a <strong>50 MP ultra-wide lens</strong>, a <strong>12 MP telephoto lens</strong>, and a <strong>10 MP periscope lens</strong>. This versatile configuration allows users to capture stunning images in various conditions, whether in bright daylight or low-light scenarios. The back camera can record videos in <strong>UHD 8K (7680 x 4320) at 30fps</strong>, making it possible to create professional-quality videos directly from your smartphone. The <strong>12 MP front camera</strong> is perfect for selfies and video calls, offering impressive clarity and detail.\n\nPowering all these features is a <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong> that supports extended usage throughout the day. This capacity ensures that you can enjoy streaming, gaming, and browsing without worrying about running out of battery. Whether you\'re out on the town or in a meeting, the Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra is designed to keep up with your lifestyle.\n\nIn terms of connectivity, the Galaxy S24 Ultra is equipped with the latest technologies, supporting <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, <strong>3G</strong>, <strong>4G/LTE</strong>, and <strong>5G</strong> networks, allowing users to stay connected at high speeds. WiFi and NFC functionalities further enhance the connectivity options, enabling quick and easy connections to other devices.\n\nOverall, the Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra is an exceptional smartphone that combines powerful performance, stunning visuals, and a versatile camera system. Whether you\'re a professional, a gamer, or someone who enjoys high-quality photography, this device is built to exceed your expectations.', '<div class=\"product-table\">\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14 OS</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Octa-core (1 x 3.39GHz Cortex-X4 &amp; 3x3.1GHz Cortex-A720 2 x 2.9GHz Cortex-A720 2 x 2.2GHz Cortex-A520)</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">12 MP, f/2.2, 26mm (wide), Dual Pixel PDAF, Dual video call, Auto-HDR, HDR10 , Video (4K@30/60fps, 1080p@30fps)</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Quad Camera: 200 MP, f/1.7, 24mm (wide), 1/1.3\", multi-directional PDAF, Laser AF, OIS 50 MP, f/3.4, 111mm (periscope telephoto), PDAF, OIS, 5x optical zoom 10 MP, f/2.4, 67mm (telephoto), 1/3.52\", Dual Pixel PDAF, OIS, 3x optical zoom 12 MP, f/2.2, 13mm, (ultrawide), 1/2.55\", Dual Pixel PDAF, Super Steady video, LED Flash</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.8 Inches ,Dynamic LTPO AMOLED 2X Capacitive Touchscreen, Multitouch</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh, Fast battery 45W wired, PD3.0, 65% in 30 min (<span id=\"IL_AD8\" class=\"IL_AD\">advertised</span>), 15W wireless (Qi/PMA), 4.5W reverse wireless</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">256GB Built-in, 12GB RAM, UFS 4.0</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 1, 0, 469999, 413999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:51:44', '2025-04-22 11:51:11', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(97, 'Vivo Y03', 'vivo-y03', 2, 60, '<h2>Vivo Y03 Price In Pakistan</h2>\nIntroducing the Vivo Y03, a smartphone designed to meet the needs of users seeking performance, style, and value. Released in March 2024, the Vivo Y03 combines a sleek design with impressive features, making it a strong contender in the mid-range smartphone market. Powered by the <strong>Mediatek Helio G85 processor</strong>, this device ensures a smooth user experience whether you\'re gaming, streaming, or multitasking.\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Display:</strong> The Vivo Y03 boasts a <strong>6.56-inch IPS LCD</strong> display with a resolution of <strong>1612 x 720 pixels</strong>. This vibrant screen supports a refresh rate of <strong>90Hz</strong>, ensuring fluid scrolling and an enjoyable viewing experience. Although it lacks advanced screen protection, the display is adequately bright and responsive, ideal for everyday use, including social media browsing and video playback.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Performance:</strong> At the heart of the Vivo Y03 is the <strong>Mediatek Helio G85 processor</strong> paired with a <strong>Mali-G52 MC2 GPU</strong>. This combination allows the phone to handle various tasks efficiently, from running applications to playing games. With <strong>4GB of RAM</strong>, users can expect a responsive performance. The phone also includes expandable RAM features, allowing you to boost performance as needed.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Storage:</strong> The Vivo Y03 comes with a generous <strong>128GB</strong> of internal storage, providing ample space for apps, photos, and videos. The dedicated <strong>microSDXC slot</strong> allows for further expansion, accommodating your growing storage needs without sacrificing dual SIM functionality.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Camera:</strong> Capture stunning photos with the Vivo Y03\'s dual-camera setup, featuring a <strong>13MP main camera</strong> and a <strong>0.08MP secondary camera</strong>. The camera system supports <strong>1080p video recording at 30fps</strong>, ensuring quality videos for social media sharing. For selfies, the <strong>5MP front camera</strong> allows you to capture clear and vibrant self-portraits, making it an excellent choice for social media enthusiasts.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Battery:</strong> The Vivo Y03 is equipped with a powerful <strong>5000mAh battery</strong>, designed to keep you connected throughout the day. This large battery capacity ensures long-lasting usage, making it suitable for heavy users who engage in gaming, streaming, and browsing without the worry of frequent recharging.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Operating System:</strong> Running on <strong>Funtouch OS 14.0 based on Android 14</strong>, the Vivo Y03 offers a user-friendly interface with a host of features for customization and convenience. This latest operating system provides smooth navigation and a responsive experience, making daily tasks effortless.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Connectivity:</strong> The Vivo Y03 supports <strong>Dual SIM Dual Standby (DSDS)</strong>, allowing users to manage two nano SIMs and one microSD card simultaneously. Connectivity features include <strong>4G LTE</strong>, <strong>3G</strong>, <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, and <strong>WiFi</strong> capabilities, ensuring reliable internet access. Although it lacks 5G support, the device\'s 4G performance is more than adequate for most users. It also features <strong>FM radio</strong>, allowing users to enjoy their favorite stations on the go.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Design and Build:</h3>\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Dimensions and Weight:</strong> With dimensions of <strong>163.63 x 75.58 x 8.39 mm</strong> and weighing just <strong>185 grams</strong>, the Vivo Y03 is designed to be comfortable to hold and easy to use. Its sleek profile makes it a stylish addition to your daily essentials.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Durability:</strong> While the Vivo Y03 does not come with specified water resistance or advanced screen protection, its solid build quality offers durability for everyday use.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Why Choose the Vivo Y03?</h3>\nThe Vivo Y03 stands out as a budget-friendly smartphone that delivers on performance, display quality, and camera capabilities. Its large battery, modern software, and sleek design make it a compelling choice for anyone looking for a reliable smartphone without breaking the bank. Whether you are a student, a professional, or someone who simply enjoys using technology, the Vivo Y03 offers a well-rounded experience that caters to various needs.', '<div class=\"product-table\">\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14 OS</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Octa-core (2 x 2.0 GHz Cortex-A75  <span id=\"IL_AD7\" class=\"IL_AD\">6 x</span> 1.8 GHz Cortex-A55),Mediatek Helio G85 (12nm)</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"><span id=\"IL_AD6\" class=\"IL_AD\">5 MP</span>, f/2.2, (wide)</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Camera: 13 MP, f/2.2, (wide), PDAF 0.08 MP, f/3.0 (auxiliary lens), LED Flash</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.56 Inches ,IPS LCD Capacitive Touchscreen, 16M Colors, Multitouch</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh, 15W wired</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">64 Built-in, <span id=\"IL_AD5\" class=\"IL_AD\">4GB RAM</span>, eMMC 5.1</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 1, 0, 24999, 23799, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:51:44', '2025-04-22 11:51:11', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(98, 'Samsung Galaxy A15', 'samsung-galaxy-a15', 2, 55, '<h2>Samsung Galaxy A15 Price in Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The <strong>Samsung Galaxy A15</strong> is the latest model from Samsung, offering a fantastic blend of advanced features and value. Priced at <strong>Rs. 38,999 PKR</strong>, this smartphone is designed to cater to users who require performance and style at an affordable price.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Display & Design</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Samsung Galaxy A15</strong> features a stunning <strong>6.5-inch Super AMOLED display</strong> that provides vibrant colors and crystal-clear details. With a <strong>resolution of 1080 x 2340 pixels</strong> and a refresh rate of <strong>90Hz</strong>, the display offers smooth scrolling, better video playback, and immersive gaming experiences. This phone is built to last with dimensions of <strong>160.1 x 76.8 x 8.4 mm</strong> and a weight of <strong>200g</strong>, offering a premium look and feel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Performance</h3>\r\n<p>Equipped with the <strong>Mediatek Helio G99</strong> processor, the <strong>Samsung Galaxy A15</strong> delivers powerful performance for gaming, multitasking, and day-to-day operations. The phone comes with <strong>6GB or 8GB of RAM</strong>, allowing for seamless switching between apps and handling multiple tasks with ease. Additionally, the phone comes with <strong>128GB or 256GB of internal storage</strong>, with a <strong>microSDXC card slot</strong> supporting expandable storage to up to 1TB, so you\'ll never run out of space for apps, photos, and videos.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Camera Features</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Samsung Galaxy A15</strong> is built to capture stunning photos with its <strong>50MP primary camera</strong>, complemented by <strong>5MP and 2MP secondary cameras</strong> for depth sensing and ultra-wide shots. Whether you\'re capturing memories during the day or at night, the <strong>back flash</strong> will help you get bright, clear pictures. The <strong>13MP front camera</strong> allows for excellent selfies and video calls, ensuring you always look your best in photos and videos. For video recording, both the front and rear cameras support <strong>1080p@30fps</strong> for smooth, high-quality footage.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Battery Life</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Samsung Galaxy A15</strong> comes with a long-lasting <strong>5000mAh battery</strong> that ensures you stay powered throughout the day. Whether you\'re watching videos, playing games, or browsing the web, this phone will keep up with your needs without needing a recharge. The phone also supports fast charging, so you can get back to using it without waiting too long.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Connectivity & More</h3>\r\n<p>Stay connected with the <strong>Samsung Galaxy A15</strong>, which supports <strong>4G LTE</strong>, WiFi, and Bluetooth for seamless internet browsing and device pairing. You also get <strong>NFC</strong> for easy payments and pairing with other devices. While this phone does not support 5G, the existing 4G connectivity is more than sufficient for most users, ensuring fast and reliable internet speeds.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Why Choose Samsung Galaxy A15?</h3>\r\n<p>If you\'re looking for a smartphone that combines performance, camera quality, and battery life, the <strong>Samsung Galaxy A15</strong> is the ideal choice. With its beautiful display, powerful performance, and reliable camera, it\'s a great option for those who want a high-quality smartphone without breaking the bank. Available at <strong>Rs. 38,999 PKR</strong>, it provides excellent value for money.</p>\r\n', '<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Price</strong>: Rs. 38,999 PKR</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Display</strong>: 6.5-inch Super AMOLED, 90Hz</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Camera</strong>: 50MP + 5MP + 2MP rear, 13MP front</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Processor</strong>: Mediatek Helio G99</li>\r\n    <li><strong>RAM</strong>: 6GB / 8GB</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Storage</strong>: 128GB / 256GB (Expandable)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Battery</strong>: 5000 mAh</li>\r\n    <li><strong>SIM</strong>: Single SIM (Nano-SIM) or Hybrid Dual SIM</li>\r\n    <li><strong>OS</strong>: Android 14, One UI 6</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Release Date</strong>: December 2023</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Connectivity</strong>: 4G LTE, WiFi, Bluetooth, NFC</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 10, 52999, 38999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:51:44', '2025-05-30 14:39:43', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(99, 'DLA6 Cooling Fan Mobile Phone Radiator Semiconductor Backclip', 'dla6-cooling-fan', 6, 58, '<h2>DLA6 Cooling Fan Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\nThe <strong>DLA6 Cooling Fan</strong> is designed to keep your smartphone cool during intense gaming sessions, live streaming, or any other high-performance tasks. This lightweight and portable cooling fan is perfect for gamers, streamers, and content creators who need their devices to stay at optimal temperatures without overheating. It offers a range of features that enhance its performance while being user-friendly and universally compatible.\r\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li><strong>Effective Cooling Performance:</strong> The <strong>DLA6 Cooling Fan</strong> uses high conductivity materials and a large cooling area to ensure your smartphone stays cool, even during extended gaming or streaming sessions. The fan’s powerful yet ultra-quiet nine-leaf design ensures effective heat dissipation without being noisy, allowing you to stay focused on your game or stream.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Compact and Lightweight Design:</strong> Measuring just <strong>84x120x48mm</strong> and weighing <strong>111g</strong>, the DLA6 cooling fan is easy to carry and use anywhere. Whether you are traveling, at home, or streaming on the go, the compact size allows for hassle-free portability. Its <strong>fighter engine-like exterior design</strong> adds a futuristic and stylish look, making it a great accessory for any tech-savvy user.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Universal Compatibility:</strong> One of the standout features of the DLA6 Cooling Fan is its <strong>universal compatibility</strong>. It can be used with most smartphones that have a width between <strong>73mm and 104mm</strong>, making it perfect for a wide range of devices. Whether you\'re an Android user or have an iPhone, this cooling fan will fit securely and work efficiently.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Two-Way Spring Clamping:</strong> The DLA6 Cooling Fan uses a two-way <strong>spring clamping system</strong>, which ensures that it stays tightly clamped to your phone without loosening over time. This design is ideal for those who frequently switch between different devices or need to adjust the fan quickly during live streams or gaming.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Ultra-Quiet Operation:</strong> Despite its powerful cooling capabilities, the <strong>DLA6 cooling fan</strong> operates with minimal noise. The <strong>nine-leaf silent fan</strong> allows for ultra-quiet operation, so you won\'t be disturbed by loud fan noises while you\'re concentrating on your gameplay or communicating with your audience during live streams.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Easy to Install and Use:</strong> Setting up the DLA6 Cooling Fan is simple. With its straightforward installation process, you can easily attach and remove the fan as needed. Its plug-and-play operation means you won’t need any additional software or setup steps to get started.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3>Why You Need the DLA6 Cooling Fan:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Prevents Overheating:</strong> Ensures your phone stays cool during heavy use, extending its lifespan.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Quiet and Powerful:</strong> Experience effective cooling without disturbing noise.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Universal Fit:</strong> Compatible with a wide range of smartphones.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Portable and Stylish:</strong> Lightweight design with a modern sci-fi look.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThe <strong>DLA6 cooling fan</strong> is the perfect accessory for mobile gamers, live streamers, or anyone who pushes their smartphone to the limit. Say goodbye to overheating problems and keep your device running smoothly even during the most demanding tasks.\r\n<h3>Specifications:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Product Name:</strong> DLA6 Cooling Fan</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Product Size:</strong> 84x120x48mm (including packaging)</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Weight:</strong> 111g</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Voltage/Current:</strong> 5V/2A</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Compatibility:</strong> Smartphones with widths between 73-104mm</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Cooling Fan Type:</strong> Nine-leaf silent fan</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Clamping Mechanism:</strong> Two-way spring clamping for a secure fit</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Conclusion:</h3>\r\nIf you’re looking to enhance your mobile gaming or streaming experience, the <strong>DLA6 Cooling Fan</strong> is a must-have accessory. It offers advanced cooling technology, a sleek design, and is universally compatible with most smartphones. Whether you\'re a professional gamer or a casual user, this fan will keep your phone performing at its best.\r\n<h3>Purchase Your DLA6 Cooling Fan Today:</h3>\r\nLooking for the best <strong>DLA6 cooling fan price in Pakistan</strong>? Buy the DLA6 Cooling Fan now and keep your phone cool during long gaming sessions or live streams. It’s available at great prices across Pakistan, so don’t miss out!', '<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Powerful Cooling:</strong> Prevents phone overheating during gaming and streaming.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Ultra-Quiet Operation:</strong> Nine-leaf silent fan ensures effective yet quiet cooling.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Universal Compatibility:</strong> Fits smartphones with widths between 73-104mm.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Lightweight and Portable:</strong> Compact design, easy to carry and install.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Secure Clamping:</strong> Two-way spring clamping holds your phone tightly without loosening.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Stylish Design:</strong> Sci-fi inspired fighter engine exterior adds a modern touch.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 4999, 1999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:51:44', '2025-05-12 17:31:52', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(100, 'Joyroom Mini Magnetic Power Bank JR-W020 (10000mAh)', 'joyroom-mini-magnetic-power-bank-jr-w020-10000mah', 10, 47, '<h2>Joyroom Mini Magnetic Power Bank JR-W020 (10000mah) Price In Pakistan</h2>\nThe Joyroom Mini Magnetic Power Bank JR-W020 (10000mAh) is a versatile and compact power bank designed to meet your daily charging needs with ease. Its sleek design and powerful features make it an excellent choice for anyone on the go. Whether you’re traveling, at work, or just out for the day, this power bank ensures that your devices stay charged and ready to use without the hassle of finding a power outlet.\n<h4>Compact Design, Powerful Performance</h4>\nThe Joyroom Mini Magnetic Power Bank JR-W020 (10000mAh) is built with a compact form factor, measuring just <strong>110.7 x 67.7 x 19.8mm</strong> and weighing <strong>195g</strong>, making it easy to carry in your pocket or bag. Despite its small size, this power bank packs a <strong>10000mAh</strong> battery capacity, allowing you to charge multiple devices on a single charge. Whether you\'re charging your smartphone, wireless earbuds, or other electronic devices, this power bank delivers reliable power whenever you need it.\n<h4>Wireless Charging Capability</h4>\nOne of the standout features of the Joyroom Mini Magnetic Power Bank JR-W020 is its magnetic wireless charging capability. It can wirelessly charge compatible devices without the need for cables, offering a seamless charging experience. This feature is especially useful for users who prefer hassle-free charging, as it eliminates the need for constantly plugging and unplugging cables.\n<h4>Versatile Charging Ports</h4>\nIn addition to wireless charging, the Joyroom Mini Magnetic Power Bank JR-W020 (10000mAh) is equipped with both <strong>Type-C</strong> and <strong>USB output ports</strong>, giving you multiple options for charging your devices. The <strong>Type-C port</strong> serves as both an input and output, allowing for fast charging of your devices as well as quick recharging of the power bank itself. The additional <strong>USB output port</strong> ensures compatibility with a wide range of devices, making this power bank an ideal choice for people with multiple gadgets.\n<h4>Lithium-Polymer Battery for Durability</h4>\nThe Joyroom JR-W020 features a <strong>Lithium-Polymer battery</strong>, which offers better safety and durability compared to traditional lithium-ion batteries. This type of battery is known for its longer life span, ensuring that the power bank will provide consistent performance over time. It also supports efficient power delivery, so your devices charge faster while conserving battery life.\n<h4>User-Friendly Features</h4>\nThe Joyroom Mini Magnetic Power Bank JR-W020 (10000mAh) is not only designed for performance but also ease of use. Its <strong>magnetic</strong> function allows it to attach easily to compatible phones, providing a secure and stable connection for wireless charging. The slim, lightweight design ensures it won’t add bulk, and its compact size makes it highly portable, fitting comfortably in your hand or bag.\n\nThis power bank is compatible with a variety of devices, including Android and iOS smartphones, tablets, and other USB-powered electronics. Whether you\'re on the go or at home, this power bank ensures that you stay connected and powered throughout the day.\n<h4>Ideal for Daily Use</h4>\nWith a <strong>10000mAh</strong> capacity, the Joyroom Mini Magnetic Power Bank JR-W020 can fully charge most smartphones at least twice, depending on the device\'s battery size. This makes it ideal for daily commutes, long travels, or any situation where you won’t have easy access to a power source. It’s also great for emergencies, ensuring you always have a backup charge for your essential devices.\n<h4>Conclusion</h4>\nIn today’s fast-paced world, staying powered up is essential, and the Joyroom Mini Magnetic Power Bank JR-W020 (10000mAh) delivers just that with its combination of compact size, powerful battery, and versatile charging options. Whether you\'re buying it for yourself or as a gift, this power bank offers a convenient solution for staying connected throughout the day.', '<ul>\n 	<li><strong>10000mAh</strong> battery capacity for multiple charges.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Magnetic wireless charging</strong> for a hassle-free experience.</li>\n 	<li>Compact size: <strong>110.7 x 67.7 x 19.8mm</strong>, lightweight at <strong>195g</strong>.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Type-C</strong> and <strong>USB output ports</strong> for versatile charging.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Lithium-Polymer battery</strong> for enhanced safety and durability.</li>\n 	<li>Quick recharging via <strong>Type-C input/output</strong>.</li>\n 	<li>Compatible with both <strong>Android</strong> and <strong>iOS</strong> devices.</li>\n</ul>', 1, 50, 7000, 6200, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:51:44', '2025-04-22 11:44:51', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(101, 'Logini Lt-w1 Luxe Smart Watch', 'logini-lt-w1-luxe-smart-watch', 11, 48, '<h2>Logini Lt-w1 Luxe Smart Watch Price In Pakistan</h2>\nIn today\'s fast-paced world, staying connected while maintaining your personal style is essential. The <strong>Logini Lt-w1 Luxe Smart Watch</strong> brings a perfect balance of modern technology and elegant design to your wrist. For those seeking a smartwatch that offers more than just the basics, this timepiece is a must-have. With the ability to stay connected to your smartphone, track your fitness, and manage notifications, the Logini Lt-w1 Luxe ensures you have <strong>more connectivity</strong> and <strong>more opportunities</strong> at your fingertips.\n\n<strong>Key Features</strong>:\n<ol>\n 	<li><strong>Advanced Connectivity</strong>:\nThe Logini Lt-w1 Luxe Smart Watch offers seamless integration with your smartphone, allowing you to receive calls, texts, and app notifications directly on your wrist. Whether you\'re on the go, in a meeting, or at the gym, you\'ll never miss an important update.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Fitness Tracking</strong>:\nStay on top of your health with built-in fitness tracking features. The watch monitors your steps, heart rate, and even your sleep patterns. These insights can help you make better decisions about your daily routine and fitness goals.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Exquisite Craftsmanship</strong>:\nCrafted from high-quality materials, the Logini Lt-w1 Luxe is more than just a piece of technology—it\'s a statement of style. The sleek, modern design makes it suitable for any occasion, whether you\'re at work, attending an event, or hitting the gym. The watch also boasts a durable build, ensuring it lasts for years while maintaining its elegant look.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Long Battery Life</strong>:\nNothing is more frustrating than having to charge your device constantly. Thankfully, the Logini Lt-w1 Luxe comes with a long-lasting battery that allows you to use the watch for several days on a single charge. It’s perfect for those who are always on the go and don’t want to worry about running out of power.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Customizable Watch Faces</strong>:\nMake your watch truly yours with customizable watch faces. You can switch between a variety of styles depending on your mood or occasion. Whether you prefer a classic analog look or a digital interface, the Logini Lt-w1 Luxe allows you to express your personal style.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Water Resistance</strong>:\nWorried about getting your watch wet? With water-resistant technology, you can wear the Logini Lt-w1 Luxe while washing your hands, in the rain, or even while swimming. This makes it perfect for those who live an active lifestyle or simply want peace of mind knowing their watch is protected from the elements.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Notifications and Alerts</strong>:\nStay updated with all your important notifications, including messages, social media alerts, and calendar reminders. You can even set custom alerts for specific apps or contacts, ensuring you stay informed without constantly checking your phone.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Comfortable Design</strong>:\nWith an ergonomic design, the Logini Lt-w1 Luxe sits comfortably on your wrist for long periods, making it ideal for both day and night wear. The adjustable straps ensure a perfect fit, regardless of wrist size.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Competitive Pricing</strong>:\nWhen compared to other luxury smartwatches, the Logini Lt-w1 Luxe offers exceptional value for money. If you\'re looking for a smartwatch with premium features without breaking the bank, this is the perfect option for you. Available at competitive prices in Pakistan, this watch combines style and technology at an affordable price point.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Support for Multiple Languages</strong>:\nDesigned with a global audience in mind, the Logini Lt-w1 Luxe supports multiple languages, including English and Urdu, making it ideal for users in Pakistan.</li>\n</ol>\n<strong>Why Choose the Logini Lt-w1 Luxe Smart Watch?</strong>\n\nIn a market flooded with smartwatches, the Logini Lt-w1 Luxe stands out due to its combination of <strong>affordability</strong>, <strong>durability</strong>, and <strong>sophistication</strong>. It offers everything a modern user in Pakistan needs—from basic smartphone connectivity to advanced health monitoring and a long-lasting battery. Whether you\'re a fitness enthusiast or a busy professional, this watch caters to all your needs while maintaining a sleek and stylish design.\n\nAvailable now across Pakistan, the Logini Lt-w1 Luxe Smart Watch is your ideal choice for a reliable and stylish wearable. The smart combination of design and functionality makes it the perfect tool for those who want to enhance their day-to-day experience.', 'The Logini Lt-w1 Luxe Smart Watch is your perfect companion for daily connectivity, fitness tracking, and more. Designed with premium materials and packed with modern features, this smartwatch offers style and functionality for every occasion in Pakistan.', 1, 50, 17999, 8999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:51:44', '2025-04-22 11:44:51', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0);
