(102, 'Zero Revoltt Smart Watch', 'zero-revoltt-smart-watch', 11, 63, '<h2>Zero Revoltt Smart Watch Price in Pakistan</h2>\nThe Zero Revoltt Smart Watch offers an impressive range of features for those looking to combine style and functionality in their wearable tech. Whether you\'re a fitness enthusiast, tech lover, or someone seeking a versatile smartwatch, the Zero Revoltt delivers on all fronts. Priced competitively in Pakistan, this smartwatch is packed with advanced health monitoring tools, multiple sports modes, Bluetooth calling, and a sleek metal strap design.\n<h3>Design and Build</h3>\nOne of the standout features of the Zero Revoltt Smart Watch is its stylish and durable design. Featuring a metal strap and IP67 water resistance, it’s designed to handle everyday wear and tear, including water exposure. The watch offers a premium look, making it suitable for both casual and formal settings.\n\nIts 36mm IPS display ensures that everything you see is clear and vibrant, with a 360x360 resolution. Whether you\'re checking your notifications, tracking your fitness metrics, or making Bluetooth calls, the display remains sharp and easily readable, even in bright conditions. The Zero Revoltt Smart Watch isn’t just functional—it also looks the part, making it a great addition to any outfit.\n<h3>Key Features and Connectivity</h3>\nIn terms of connectivity, the Zero Revoltt Smart Watch supports Bluetooth version 5.2, ensuring fast and stable connections with your smartphone. While the watch doesn’t have GPS, it does offer Bluetooth calling, allowing you to make and receive calls directly from your wrist. This is particularly useful for users on the go who need to stay connected without always having their phone in hand. The addition of a built-in speaker further enhances this functionality.\n\nAnother noteworthy feature is the voice assistant support. Whether you\'re using Android (version 5.0 and above) or iOS (version 9.0 and above), the smartwatch integrates seamlessly, allowing you to interact with your phone’s voice assistant for hands-free control.\n<h3>Fitness and Health Monitoring</h3>\nThe Zero Revoltt Smart Watch comes equipped with a variety of health monitoring features. These include a heart rate monitor, calories burned tracker, step tracker, sleep quality monitor, and oxygen level monitoring. These tools make it easy for users to keep an eye on their health and fitness progress throughout the day.\n\nThe multiple sports modes allow users to track different types of physical activities, whether it’s running, walking, or other exercises. With the detailed health insights provided by the smartwatch, it becomes an essential fitness companion, helping users meet their health goals. Tracking steps, monitoring your heart rate during workouts, or assessing your sleep quality are all easily accessible from your wrist.\n<h3>Battery Life and Charging</h3>\nBattery life is always an important consideration when it comes to smartwatches, and the Zero Revoltt Smart Watch doesn’t disappoint. It features a 400mAh battery, which offers 2-3 days of usage on a single charge. While heavy usage may require more frequent charging, the watch\'s power-efficient design ensures that you won\'t be tethered to a charger every day.\n\nThe extended battery life makes this smartwatch ideal for those with an active lifestyle. Whether you\'re attending meetings, working out, or simply going about your daily routine, the Zero Revoltt Smart Watch stays powered up, keeping you connected and informed.\n<h3>Compatibility and Usability</h3>\nThe Zero Revoltt Smart Watch is compatible with both Android (5.0 and above) and iOS (9.0 and above) devices, making it a versatile option for a wide range of users. The user interface is intuitive and easy to navigate, ensuring that even those new to smartwatches will have no trouble accessing its features.\n\nWith its range of health and fitness tracking capabilities, Bluetooth calling, voice assistant integration, and sports mode options, the Zero Revoltt Smart Watch brings together a wealth of technology in a sleek, user-friendly package. Whether you\'re looking to monitor your health, stay connected, or simply want a smartwatch that complements your style, the Zero Revoltt is an ideal choice.\n<h3>Final Thoughts</h3>\nThe Zero Revoltt Smart Watch combines robust features, durability, and style at a price point that makes it accessible for many. With its metal strap, water resistance, and health monitoring tools, this smartwatch is a fantastic option for anyone in Pakistan looking for a device that goes beyond just telling time. Its competitive pricing and broad feature set make it an attractive option when compared to other smartwatches on the market.\n\nFor those wanting the best of both worlds—functionality and fashion—the Zero Revoltt Smart Watch offers an excellent balance, whether you\'re using it for fitness tracking, Bluetooth calls, or simply keeping up with daily notifications.', '<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Display</strong>: 36mm IPS, 360x360 resolution</li>\n 	<li><strong>Design</strong>: Stylish metal strap, IP67 water-resistant</li>\n 	<li><strong>Health Monitoring</strong>: Heart rate, calories burned, sleep quality, step tracker, oxygen level monitoring</li>\n 	<li><strong>Connectivity</strong>: Bluetooth 5.2, compatible with Android 5.0+ and iOS 9.0+</li>\n 	<li><strong>Battery</strong>: 400mAh capacity, lasts 2-3 days</li>\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth Calling</strong>: Yes</li>\n 	<li><strong>Multiple Sports Modes</strong>: Stay active and track various activities</li>\n</ul>', 1, 50, 29999, 10999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:51:44', '2025-04-22 11:44:51', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(103, 'Ronin R-1500 Headphone', 'ronin-r-1500-headphone', 13, 54, '<h2>Ronin R-1500 Headphone Price In Pakistan</h2>\nThe Ronin R-1500 Headphone is a well-designed audio device that delivers an immersive listening experience. Whether you\'re a music lover, gamer, or someone who needs reliable headphones for calls, the Ronin R-1500 offers excellent features to meet your needs. Designed with premium sound quality, these headphones are ideal for anyone seeking rich audio and seamless wireless connectivity.\n<h4>Superior Sound Quality and Performance</h4>\nThe Ronin R-1500 Headphone is equipped with a 40mm driver that ensures deep bass and crisp treble, providing you with an enhanced audio experience. This makes it perfect for listening to various music genres, watching movies, or gaming, ensuring every detail of the sound is clear. The Bluetooth version 5.3 ensures strong connectivity with minimal lag, making the Ronin R-1500 a top choice for both casual and professional users.\n<h4>Wireless Connectivity</h4>\nWith Bluetooth version 5.3, the Ronin R-1500 delivers a stable wireless connection up to a range of 10 meters. Whether you\'re moving around your home or office, you won’t experience any interruptions in sound quality. This allows you to enjoy freedom from cables while experiencing uninterrupted music, podcasts, or calls.\n<h4>Comfortable and Durable Design</h4>\nThese headphones are built with comfort in mind. The Ronin R-1500 features a lightweight design, and the adjustable headband ensures it fits perfectly for extended listening sessions. Additionally, the headphones have an <strong>IP68 water resistance rating</strong>, which protects them from sweat and splashes. This makes the Ronin R-1500 a durable option, whether you\'re using them at the gym, while commuting, or in various weather conditions.\n<h4>Long Battery Life</h4>\nOne of the standout features of the Ronin R-1500 Headphone is its impressive battery performance. The <strong>500mAh battery</strong> provides up to <strong>6 hours of playtime</strong>, making it suitable for long commutes, extended gaming sessions, or binge-watching your favorite shows. The headphone charges quickly too, needing only <strong>1.5 hours</strong> for a full charge via a <strong>Type-C charging interface</strong>. This ensures minimal downtime between uses, so you can get back to enjoying your music as soon as possible.\n<h4>Integrated Microphone for Calls</h4>\nFor those who need a reliable headset for calls, the Ronin R-1500 Headphone includes an integrated microphone that ensures crystal-clear voice quality. Whether you\'re using the headphones for hands-free calling or voice commands, the built-in microphone ensures you\'re always heard clearly. This makes the Ronin R-1500 perfect for professional use, as well as casual chatting with friends.\n<h4>Auto Pairing for Ease of Use</h4>\nOne of the user-friendly features of the Ronin R-1500 is its <strong>auto-pairing</strong> capability. Once you\'ve paired the headphone with your device for the first time, it will automatically connect the next time you turn it on. This feature adds convenience and ensures that you’re ready to listen in no time, without having to fumble with your device settings each time.\n<h4>Broad Compatibility</h4>\nThe Ronin R-1500 Headphone is designed to work with a wide range of devices. Whether you\'re using <strong>Android, iOS</strong>, or other Bluetooth-enabled devices, you can easily connect the headphone without any compatibility issues. This universal compatibility ensures that no matter what device you\'re using, you can enjoy premium sound without hassle.', '<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth version 5.3</strong> for stable wireless connectivity.</li>\n 	<li><strong>40mm driver</strong> ensures clear audio with deep bass.</li>\n 	<li><strong>IP68 water resistance</strong> for durability in various conditions.</li>\n 	<li><strong>6 hours of playtime</strong> with a <strong>500mAh battery</strong>.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Type-C charging interface</strong>, with 1.5-hour fast charging.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Auto pairing</strong> for instant connection.</li>\n 	<li>Compatible with <strong>Android and iOS</strong> devices.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Integrated microphone</strong> for clear voice calls.</li>\n</ul>', 1, 50, 8599, 4699, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:51:44', '2025-04-29 10:33:22', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(104, 'JOYROOM JR-T03S PRO 2 Active Noise Cancelling ANC TWS WIRELESS Earbuds', 'joyroom-jr-t03s-pro2-anc-tws-wireless-earbuds', 13, 47, '<h2>JOYROOM JR-T03S PRO 2 ANC TWS WIRELESS Earbuds Price in Pakistan</h2>\nThe JOYROOM JR-T03S PRO 2 ANC TWS Wireless Earbuds redefine your audio experience with cutting-edge technology and a sleek design. Whether you are commuting, working out, or just enjoying some downtime, these earbuds offer the perfect blend of comfort, sound quality, and functionality.\n<h3>Exceptional Sound Quality</h3>\nAt the heart of the JOYROOM JR-T03S PRO 2 is its <strong>dynamic vocalism principle</strong>, which delivers rich, immersive sound. With a frequency response range of <strong>20 to 20,000 Hz</strong>, you can experience every note in your favorite music with clarity and precision. The earbuds boast a <strong>sensitivity of 103±3dB</strong>, ensuring that even the softest sounds are heard clearly.\n<h3>Active Noise Cancellation</h3>\nOne of the standout features of these earbuds is their <strong>active noise cancellation (ANC)</strong> technology. This allows you to block out unwanted background noise, letting you focus on your music, podcasts, or calls without distractions. Whether you\'re in a bustling café or on a crowded train, the JOYROOM JR-T03S PRO 2 ensures a serene listening environment.\n<h3>Advanced Connectivity</h3>\nEquipped with <strong>Bluetooth 5.2</strong>, these earbuds provide a stable and reliable connection with your devices. This latest wireless technology offers faster transmission speeds and lossless audio quality, enhancing your overall listening experience. The <strong>TWS (True Wireless Stereo)</strong> capability ensures that you enjoy stereo sound without the hassle of wires.\n<h3>Comfortable and User-Friendly Design</h3>\nThe JOYROOM JR-T03S PRO 2 earbuds are designed with your comfort in mind. The newly upgraded touch control feature allows you to manage playback and calls effortlessly, making it easy to switch tracks or answer calls without fumbling for your device. The <strong>1:1 size fit</strong> ensures a snug and comfortable experience, making them ideal for prolonged use.\n<h3>Impressive Battery Life</h3>\nWith a battery capacity of <strong>45mAh</strong>, the earbuds offer around <strong>5 hours</strong> of playtime on a single charge. The charging case, with a capacity of <strong>360mAh</strong>, provides additional charges to keep you powered throughout the day. The fast charging feature means you can get back to listening in just <strong>1.5 hours</strong>, so you never miss a beat.\n<h3>Convenient Features</h3>\nThe JOYROOM JR-T03S PRO 2 earbuds come with a range of user-friendly features, including <strong>Apple Siri support</strong>, making it easy to manage your tasks and music with voice commands. The earbuds also support <strong>wireless charging</strong>, ensuring that keeping them powered is as convenient as possible.\n<h3>Why Choose JOYROOM JR-T03S PRO 2 ANC TWS Wireless Earbuds?</h3>\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Active Noise Cancellation:</strong> Enjoy a quieter listening experience.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth 5.2 Connectivity:</strong> Reliable and fast connection to your devices.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Dynamic Sound Quality:</strong> Immerse yourself in rich, clear audio.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Touch Control:</strong> Easy management of music and calls.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Long Battery Life:</strong> Enjoy extended listening time with quick charging.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Conclusion</h3>\nThe JOYROOM JR-T03S PRO 2 ANC TWS Wireless Earbuds are the perfect companion for anyone seeking high-quality audio, comfort, and convenience. Whether you are a music lover, a frequent traveler, or someone who takes calls on the go, these earbuds provide the functionality and performance you need.\n<h3>Purchase Your JOYROOM JR-T03S PRO 2 Earbuds Today!</h3>\nElevate your listening experience with the JOYROOM JR-T03S PRO 2 ANC TWS Wireless Earbuds. Buy them at the best price in Pakistan and enjoy superior sound quality and advanced features that fit perfectly into your lifestyle.', '<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Active Noise Cancellation (ANC):</strong> Blocks out unwanted background noise for an immersive listening experience.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Dynamic Sound Quality:</strong> Frequency response range of 20-20,000 Hz for rich audio clarity.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth 5.2 Connectivity:</strong> Fast and stable wireless connection for seamless audio streaming.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Touch Control:</strong> Easy playback and call management with intuitive touch features.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Comfortable Fit:</strong> Ergonomically designed for all-day wear with a snug 1:1 size fit.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Impressive Battery Life:</strong> Up to 5 hours of playtime; quick charge in just 1.5 hours.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Wireless Charging Support:</strong> Convenient charging with a 360mAh case for extended use.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Apple Siri Support:</strong> Hands-free access to voice commands and tasks.</li>\n</ul>', 1, 50, 6499, 3999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:51:44', '2025-04-29 10:46:12', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(105, 'Apple AirPods Pro (2nd generation)', 'airpods-pro', 13, 42, '<h2>Apple AirPods Pro (2nd generation) Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\nExperience the pinnacle of audio technology with the Apple AirPods Pro (2nd generation). Designed for those who seek superior sound quality, comfort, and cutting-edge features, these wireless earbuds are perfect for music lovers, busy professionals, and anyone on the go.\r\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li><strong>Active Noise Cancellation:</strong> The Apple AirPods Pro (2nd generation) comes equipped with advanced <strong>active noise cancellation (ANC)</strong> technology. This feature effectively blocks out unwanted background noise, allowing you to immerse yourself fully in your music or calls. Whether you’re in a bustling café or commuting on public transport, you can enjoy a serene listening experience.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Water Resistance:</strong> With an <strong>IPX4 water resistance rating</strong>, these earbuds are designed to withstand sweat and splashes from any direction. Whether you’re working out at the gym or caught in the rain, you can confidently wear your AirPods Pro (2nd generation) without worry.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Auto Pairing:</strong> The seamless <strong>auto pairing</strong> feature ensures that your AirPods connect instantly to your devices. Once you take them out of the case, they are ready to use, saving you time and hassle.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Microphone and Audio Quality:</strong> The built-in microphone allows for clear calls and voice commands. Combined with the dynamic driver technology, the sound quality is crystal clear, offering rich bass and detailed highs that enhance your listening experience.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth 5.0 Connectivity:</strong> Utilizing <strong>Bluetooth 5.0</strong>, the AirPods Pro (2nd generation) offers a stable connection with a range of up to <strong>10 meters</strong>. This means you can enjoy your music without interruptions while moving around your space.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Battery Life:</strong> With a playtime of up to <strong>5 hours</strong>, these earbuds are perfect for long listening sessions. The charging case provides additional charges, ensuring you can keep your AirPods powered throughout the day. While the exact charging time may vary, it generally takes about <strong>3 to 4 hours</strong> to fully charge the case.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Comfortable Fit:</strong> Designed for all-day wear, the AirPods Pro (2nd generation) includes customizable silicone tips to ensure a snug and comfortable fit. You can choose from different sizes to find the perfect match for your ears.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3>Why Choose Apple AirPods Pro (2nd generation)?</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Unmatched Sound Quality:</strong> Enjoy your favorite songs and podcasts with incredible clarity and detail.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Active Noise Cancellation:</strong> Block out distractions and focus on what you love.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Water-Resistant Design:</strong> Perfect for any lifestyle, whether you’re at the gym or outdoors.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Instant Connectivity:</strong> Connects effortlessly to your Apple devices.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Stylish and Portable:</strong> The sleek design complements your style and is easy to carry.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Conclusion</h3>\r\nThe <strong>Apple AirPods Pro (2nd generation)</strong> is more than just a pair of earbuds; it’s an audio experience that combines state-of-the-art technology with comfort and style. Whether you are making calls, listening to music, or enjoying podcasts, these earbuds deliver the performance you need.\r\n<h3>Purchase Your AirPods Pro Today!</h3>\r\nTake your audio experience to the next level with the Apple AirPods Pro (2nd generation). <strong>Buy now</strong> at the best price in Pakistan and enjoy the unmatched quality and features that Apple products are known for.', '<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Active Noise Cancellation:</strong> Immerse yourself in sound while blocking out distractions.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Water Resistant:</strong> IPX4 rating protects against sweat and splashes.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Auto Pairing:</strong> Instant connection to your devices for seamless use.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth 5.0:</strong> Stable connectivity with a range of up to 10 meters.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Microphone Included:</strong> Crystal-clear calls and voice commands.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Up to 5 Hours of Playtime:</strong> Enjoy long listening sessions without interruption.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Comfortable Fit:</strong> Customizable silicone tips for a secure and comfortable fit.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 6500, 2799, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:51:44', '2025-09-20 09:48:05', 'NULL', 1250.00, 1),
(106, 'OnePlus 30W Wrap Adapter', 'oneplus-30w-wrap-adapter', 14, 51, '<h2>OnePlus 30W Wrap Adapter Price in Pakistan</h2>\nThe OnePlus 30W Warp Adapter is a game-changer when it comes to ultra-fast charging for your OnePlus devices. Specifically engineered for speed, safety, and convenience, this adapter is designed to keep you powered up without compromising performance. Whether you\'re browsing, gaming, or multitasking, the OnePlus 30W Warp Adapter delivers fast and efficient charging, keeping your device cool and safe.\n\n<strong>Seamless Fast Charging Experience</strong>\n\nThe OnePlus 30W Warp Adapter is crafted with integrated circuits that are cleverly built into the adapter itself. This advanced engineering ensures that heat is dissipated before it reaches your phone. As a result, you can enjoy faster, safer, and cooler charging, even while using your device for intensive tasks. Unlike conventional chargers, the Warp Charge 30 adapter doesn’t slow down your phone during use. This charger allows you to experience smooth performance whether you’re streaming videos, playing games, or navigating apps on your OnePlus device.\n\n<strong>Charge in Minutes, Not Hours</strong>\n\nWith the OnePlus 30W Warp Charger, overnight charging becomes a thing of the past. Plug in your OnePlus 7 Pro, or any compatible device, for just 20 minutes to get hours of power. This means you spend less time tethered to the wall and more time enjoying your day. The Warp Charge technology ensures that your device charges quickly without overheating, even when you\'re using power-hungry apps. The intelligent design of this charger also protects your phone\'s battery health, giving you long-lasting performance over time.\n\n<strong>Compatibility Across Multiple OnePlus Devices</strong>\n\nOne of the standout features of the OnePlus 30W Warp Adapter is its extensive compatibility. This charger works seamlessly with several models, including:\n<ul>\n 	<li>OnePlus 3, 3T, 5, 5T</li>\n 	<li>OnePlus 6, 6T</li>\n 	<li>OnePlus 7, 7 Pro, 7T, 7T Pro</li>\n 	<li>OnePlus 8, 8 Pro, 8T</li>\n 	<li>OnePlus Nord, Nord 2, Nord 3</li>\n 	<li>OnePlus 9 Pro, 10 Pro, 11 series, and future models.</li>\n</ul>\nThis backward compatibility means you can use this charger with a range of OnePlus devices, delivering fast-charging speeds no matter which model you have.\n\n<strong>Built for Safety and Reliability</strong>\n\nThe <strong>OnePlus Warp Charge 30W Adapter</strong> is designed with safety in mind. Its integrated circuit system not only ensures faster charging but also keeps your device safe from overcharging, overheating, and voltage fluctuations. The charger is certified to meet global safety standards, so you can trust it to perform reliably in any situation. Whether you\'re at home, at the office, or on the go, the Warp Charge adapter provides the power you need, when you need it.\n\n<strong>Why Choose OnePlus 30W Warp Charger?</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Ultra-Fast Charging</strong>: With the ability to charge up to 30W, this adapter significantly reduces charging time compared to standard chargers.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Safe and Cool</strong>: Heat dissipation technology ensures that your phone stays cool even during high-demand usage.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Wide Compatibility</strong>: The charger is compatible with a broad range of OnePlus devices, including flagship models from the OnePlus 7 to the OnePlus 11 series.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Durability</strong>: Built with high-quality materials to last, ensuring that your investment pays off in the long run.</li>\n</ul>\nIn addition to these benefits, the OnePlus 30W Warp Adapter is incredibly easy to use. Just plug in your compatible OnePlus device, and the Warp Charge technology kicks in automatically. There’s no need to worry about configuring settings or managing battery health — the adapter handles it all for you.\n\n<strong>In the Box:</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li>OnePlus Warp Charge 30W Adapter</li>\n 	<li>User Manual</li>\n</ul>\nThis OnePlus fast charger is a must-have for anyone looking for a reliable, efficient charging solution for their OnePlus devices. Whether you’re a gamer, professional, or casual user, the OnePlus 30W Warp Adapter delivers power without compromises, helping you stay connected and productive throughout the day.\n\nBy choosing the OnePlus 30W Warp Adapter, you’re opting for cutting-edge charging technology that aligns with OnePlus’s commitment to innovation and quality. For users in Pakistan, the OnePlus Warp Charge 30W Adapter offers an unbeatable combination of speed, safety, and convenience — all packed into a sleek, compact design.\n\nThis is your ultimate fast-charging solution for your OnePlus device.', '<ul>\n 	<li>Official OnePlus 30W Warp Adapter for ultra-fast charging</li>\n 	<li>Charges OnePlus devices safely and efficiently with integrated heat dissipation</li>\n 	<li>Provides 50% charge in just 20 minutes for uninterrupted use</li>\n 	<li>Backwards compatible with OnePlus 3 to 11 series and Nord models</li>\n 	<li>Designed to prevent overheating, overcharging, and voltage issues</li>\n 	<li>Compact, lightweight design for easy portability</li>\n 	<li>Includes one Warp Charge 30W Adapter in the box</li>\n</ul>', 1, 50, 4499, 2499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:51:44', '2025-04-29 10:27:42', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(107, 'OnePlus Warp Charge 65W Power Adapter', 'oneplus-65w-warp-charger', 14, 51, '<h2>OnePlus 65W Warp Charger Price In Pakistan</h2>\nThe OnePlus 65W Warp Charger sets a new benchmark in fast charging technology, offering unparalleled speed and efficiency for your OnePlus devices. As the fastest charging solution from OnePlus, the 65W Warp Charger is designed to provide a safer and more efficient charging experience. Whether you\'re powering up your phone, tablet, or even a laptop, this charger delivers exceptional performance, keeping your device cool while charging.\n\n<strong>Faster, Cooler, Safer Charging</strong>\n\nWith the OnePlus 65W Warp Charger, you can charge your device without worrying about overheating. Built with dedicated circuitry for efficient heat management, this charger ensures your phone stays cool, even during high-speed charging. Safety is paramount, which is why the charger includes automatic hardware safeguards and software optimizations. These features ensure that your device charges quickly while maintaining the battery\'s long-term health.\n\nUnlike conventional fast chargers, the OnePlus Warp Charge 65W Adapter doesn’t slow down your device while charging. You can continue to browse, stream, and play games while your phone charges — all with the same fast performance. It’s a perfect solution for users who demand speed without compromising safety or functionality.\n\n<strong>Charge a Day’s Power in Just 15 Minutes</strong>\n\nTime is precious, and the OnePlus Warp Charge 65W Adapter helps you save it. Just 15 minutes of charging will provide your device with enough power to get through an entire day. For instance, you can charge the OnePlus 8T from 1% to 58% in just 15 minutes, and a full charge takes only 39 minutes. This makes it the ideal solution for people who are always on the go and need a fast, reliable charging solution.\n\n<strong>Speed for All Your Devices</strong>\n\nOne of the standout features of the OnePlus 65W Warp Charger is its versatility. Doubling the speed of the Warp Charge 30T, this adapter delivers almost 100% efficiency at a 65W output, providing fast charging not only for your OnePlus phone but also for tablets, laptops, and other USB-C compatible devices. Whether you\'re powering up your phone, tablet, or laptop, this charger delivers the power you need with incredible speed. It\'s also fully backward-compatible with previous OnePlus models, offering Fast Charge speeds for older devices.\n\n<strong>Compatibility Across Multiple OnePlus Models</strong>\n\nThe OnePlus 65W Warp Charger is designed for compatibility with a wide range of devices. It works with:\n<ul>\n 	<li>OnePlus 3, 3T, 5, 5T</li>\n 	<li>OnePlus 6, 6T</li>\n 	<li>OnePlus 7, 7 Pro, 7T, 7T Pro</li>\n 	<li>OnePlus 8, 8 Pro, 8T</li>\n 	<li>OnePlus Nord, Nord 2, Nord 3</li>\n 	<li>OnePlus 9 Pro, 10 Pro, 11 series, and future OnePlus models.</li>\n</ul>\nThanks to this extensive compatibility, the OnePlus 65W Warp Adapter is a versatile charging solution that can power not only the latest devices but also older ones at fast charging speeds.\n\n<strong>Built for Durability and Safety</strong>\n\nThe OnePlus Warp Charge 65W Adapter is built with high-quality materials and features several protective mechanisms to ensure safe, reliable charging every time. The smart charging system adjusts power output based on the connected device, preventing issues like overcharging, overheating, and voltage fluctuations. This helps prolong the lifespan of both the charger and your device.\n\n<strong>Technical Specifications:</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Color</strong>: White</li>\n 	<li><strong>Dimensions</strong>: 55mm x 33mm x 56.5mm</li>\n 	<li><strong>Weight</strong>: 118g</li>\n 	<li><strong>Input</strong>: 100-240V ~ 50/60Hz 1.8A</li>\n 	<li><strong>Output</strong>: 5.0V 3.0A or 10.0V 6.5A (65.0W MAX)</li>\n 	<li><strong>Port Type</strong>: USB-C</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>In the Box:</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li>OnePlus Warp Charge 65W Adapter</li>\n 	<li>User Manual</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>Why Choose OnePlus Warp Charge 65W?</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Ultra-Fast Charging</strong>: Delivers up to 65W output, ensuring your device is ready to go in minutes.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Versatile Compatibility</strong>: Works with a range of OnePlus devices, including phones, tablets, and laptops.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Cool and Safe</strong>: Advanced heat management technology prevents overheating while charging.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Portable and Durable</strong>: Compact design with high-quality materials for long-lasting use.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Backwards Compatible</strong>: Works with older OnePlus models, ensuring fast charge speeds even for previous devices.</li>\n</ul>\nThis makes the OnePlus Warp Charge 65W Adapter an essential accessory for anyone who owns multiple OnePlus devices or needs a fast-charging solution for travel, work, or home. By offering versatility, speed, and safety, this charger stands out as a reliable option for keeping your devices powered up and ready to go.\n\nThe OnePlus Warp Charge 65W is a must-have for anyone looking to experience the fastest charging technology that OnePlus has to offer. Whether you’re at home, at work, or on the move, this charger ensures your device is always ready for the day ahead.', '<ul>\n 	<li>Official OnePlus 65W Warp Charger for ultra-fast charging</li>\n 	<li>Charges from 1% to 58% in just 15 minutes, full charge in 39 minutes</li>\n 	<li>Advanced heat management ensures cooler, safer charging</li>\n 	<li>Compatible with OnePlus 3 to 11 series and Nord models</li>\n 	<li>Turbo charges tablets, laptops, and other USB-C devices</li>\n 	<li>Backwards compatible with older OnePlus devices</li>\n 	<li>Compact, durable design with USB-C port for versatile use</li>\n 	<li>Includes one Warp Charge 65W Adapter in the box</li>\n</ul>', 1, 50, 4499, 2799, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:51:44', '2025-04-29 10:05:44', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(108, 'OnePlus Super Vooc 80W Charger', 'oneplus-super-vooc-80w-charger', 14, 51, '<h2 class=\"product_title entry-title\">OnePlus Super Vooc 80W Charger <span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-style: inherit;\">Price in Pakistan</span></h2>\nThe OnePlus 80W Super VOOC Charger represents the next generation of ultra-fast charging technology, offering maximum convenience and efficiency for users on the go. Built to deliver blazing-fast charging speeds, this charger is designed to work seamlessly with a wide range of OnePlus devices, ensuring that your phone is powered up in just minutes. Whether you\'re at home, in the office, or traveling, the OnePlus 80W Super VOOC Charger keeps your device charged safely and quickly.\n\n<strong>Accelerated Charging Speed</strong>\n\nWith <strong>80W MAX charging power</strong>, the OnePlus 80W Super VOOC Charger sets a new standard in fast charging. It can charge a <strong>OnePlus 10 Pro 5G</strong> from 1% to 50% in just 12 minutes, and a full charge is achieved in only 32 minutes. This means you no longer need to wait hours for your phone to charge—just plug in for a few minutes and you\'re ready to go. The charger is backward-compatible with several OnePlus devices, making it an excellent choice for anyone looking to experience fast charging with their existing OnePlus phone.\n\n<strong>Safety and Temperature Control</strong>\n\nOne of the main concerns with fast charging is safety, but the OnePlus 80W Super VOOC Charger has you covered. The charger is equipped with a <strong>built-in intelligent control chip</strong> that monitors the temperature 25 times per second. This allows it to dynamically adjust the output power to ensure safe charging without overheating. The charger’s casing is made of UL95-V0 grade material, which is highly resistant to high temperatures, offering an extra layer of protection during use. This combination of intelligent power management and durable materials ensures safe and reliable charging, no matter how often you use it.\n\n<strong>Universal Compatibility for Travelers</strong>\n\nThe OnePlus 80W Charger is not only fast but also versatile. It supports a wide range of voltage inputs, from AC100 to 240V, making it perfect for international travel. Whether you\'re traveling for business or leisure, this charger can adapt to different power grids, ensuring you can charge your devices wherever you are. However, depending on the country, you may need to use a plug adapter that fits the local power outlets.\n\n<strong>Compatibility Across Multiple Devices</strong>\n\nThe OnePlus 80W Super VOOC Charger offers a high level of compatibility with several OnePlus models. It is designed to work with:\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>OnePlus 8 Pro, 8T</strong></li>\n 	<li><strong>OnePlus 9, 9 Pro</strong></li>\n 	<li><strong>OnePlus 10 Pro</strong></li>\n 	<li><strong>OnePlus Nord CE 5G, Nord CE 2 5G, Nord CE 2 Lite 5G</strong></li>\n 	<li><strong>OnePlus Nord 2 5G, Nord 2T 5G</strong></li>\n</ul>\nThis wide-ranging compatibility means you can use this charger for multiple devices, offering fast charging speeds no matter which OnePlus device you own. It’s also future-proof, ensuring it will work with upcoming OnePlus models as well.\n\n<strong>What\'s in the Box?</strong>\n\nThe package includes:\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>OnePlus SUPER VOOC 80W Power Adapter</strong></li>\n 	<li><strong>USB-A to Type-C Cable</strong></li>\n</ul>\nThis ensures you have everything you need to start fast charging your OnePlus device right away.\n\n<strong>Why Choose the OnePlus 80W Super VOOC Charger?</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Ultra-Fast Charging</strong>: Charges your phone up to 50% in just 12 minutes and full charge in 32 minutes.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Safety and Durability</strong>: Built with high-grade materials and intelligent temperature control to ensure safe, cool charging.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Travel-Friendly</strong>: Supports AC100-240V, making it convenient for use in various countries.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Wide Device Compatibility</strong>: Works with multiple OnePlus devices, including the 8, 9, 10 series and Nord models.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Smart Power Management</strong>: Built-in chip adjusts power output dynamically to prevent overheating.</li>\n</ul>\nThe OnePlus 80W Super VOOC Charger is an essential accessory for anyone looking to experience the fastest, most efficient charging technology available. Whether you need to quickly power up your phone before heading out or charge multiple OnePlus devices, this charger is built to deliver the speed and safety you need. Its compact, travel-ready design makes it an ideal solution for anyone on the move.\n\nThis OnePlus 80W Charger is your go-to solution for fast and reliable charging, ensuring you stay powered up without waiting around. Perfect for professionals, travelers, or anyone who values speed and efficiency, the OnePlus 80W Super VOOC Charger is a top choice for fast charging in Pakistan.', '<ul>\n 	<li>Official OnePlus 80W Super VOOC Charger for ultra-fast charging</li>\n 	<li>Charges OnePlus 10 Pro 5G to 50% in just 12 minutes</li>\n 	<li>Equipped with intelligent temperature control for safe charging</li>\n 	<li>Supports AC100-240V for easy international use</li>\n 	<li>Compatible with OnePlus 8 to 10 series and Nord models</li>\n 	<li>Includes USB-A to Type-C Cable for versatile charging options</li>\n 	<li>Made with high-grade, heat-resistant materials for added safety</li>\n</ul>', 1, 50, 6999, 2999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:51:44', '2025-04-29 10:06:06', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(109, 'Samsung 25W Super Fast Charger | USB Type-C', 'samsung-25w-super-fast-charger-usb-type-c', 14, 55, '<h2>Samsung 25W Super Fast Charger Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\nThe Samsung 25W Super Fast Charger with Type-C connectivity is designed to provide your devices with the efficient power support they need. With <strong>Power Delivery (PD)</strong> technology, this charger ensures rapid charging while maintaining safe power management. It’s the ideal solution for those looking to quickly charge their <strong>Samsung Galaxy</strong> smartphones and other USB-C compatible devices. Offering up to <strong>25W of power</strong>, the charger is perfect for modern-day power needs, making it a reliable option for both everyday use and travel.\r\n\r\n<strong>Super Fast Charging Technology</strong>\r\n\r\nThe Samsung 25W Super Fast Charger utilizes <strong>Power Delivery (PD) technology</strong>, which is optimized to charge compatible devices at up to <strong>25 watts</strong>. For devices that support Super Fast Charging (SFC), this charger can deliver the maximum speed, reducing charging times significantly. Whether you\'re charging your <strong>Samsung Galaxy S23 Ultra, S22 Plus</strong>, or <strong>Note 20 Ultra</strong>, you’ll enjoy rapid charging speeds that keep your devices powered up in no time.\r\n\r\nEven for devices that don\'t support SFC, the <strong>Samsung 25W Charger</strong> adjusts to deliver the best possible speed, ensuring efficient charging without compromising device safety. It works across a wide range of models, from older <strong>Galaxy Note</strong> devices to the latest <strong>A series</strong> phones.\r\n\r\n<strong>Versatility Across Devices</strong>\r\n\r\nOne of the key benefits of the Samsung 25W Super Fast Charger is its versatility. While it delivers the highest speeds for the latest <strong>Galaxy S</strong> and <strong>Note</strong> models, it also supports fast charging for other devices. If you own a <strong>Samsung Galaxy A71, A52</strong>, or even older devices like the <strong>Galaxy S10</strong>, this charger is an excellent choice to ensure your device gets charged quickly and efficiently. Plus, it works seamlessly with other USB-C devices, including tablets and accessories.\r\n\r\n<strong>Durable Design and Safety Features</strong>\r\n\r\nSamsung prioritizes safety alongside speed. The Samsung 25W Charger is constructed using high-quality materials to ensure durability. The charger features <strong>intelligent safety controls</strong> that regulate the flow of electricity to prevent overcharging and overheating. This is achieved through advanced <strong>temperature control</strong> that measures the charger’s internal temperature multiple times per second to ensure optimal performance. It’s a reliable option for those who charge their devices multiple times a day.\r\n\r\n<strong>Worldwide Use and Travel Ready</strong>\r\n\r\nAnother advantage of the Samsung 25W Super Fast Charger is its <strong>100-240V input range</strong>, making it suitable for use in various countries. Whether you\'re at home, in the office, or traveling abroad, this charger adapts to different power outlets, allowing you to charge your devices no matter where you are. Simply pair it with a country-specific adapter, and you’ll have a fast, safe charging experience on the go.\r\n\r\n<strong>In the Box</strong>\r\n\r\nThe Samsung 25W Super Fast Charger comes with:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>25W USB-C Power Delivery Wall Adapter</strong></li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Type-C to Type-C Cable</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThis combination ensures that your device can reach its optimal charging speed, especially when paired with the official Samsung charging cable.\r\n\r\n<strong>Compatibility with Multiple Samsung Devices</strong>\r\n\r\nThis charger is compatible with a wide range of Samsung smartphones and devices, including:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Samsung Galaxy S23 / S23 Plus / S23 Ultra</strong></li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Samsung Galaxy S22 / S22 Plus / S22 Ultra</strong></li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Samsung Galaxy S21 / S21 Plus / S21 Ultra</strong></li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Samsung Galaxy Note 20 / Note 20 Ultra</strong></li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Samsung Galaxy Note 10 / Note 10+</strong></li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Samsung Galaxy A Series</strong>: A70, A71, A72, A73, A52, A53, A32, A33, and more</li>\r\n 	<li>It also works with older models like the <strong>Galaxy S8, S9</strong>, and <strong>Note 8/9</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nIf you own other devices that support USB-C charging, the Samsung 25W Charger will also provide reliable charging speeds.\r\n\r\n<strong>Why Choose the Samsung 25W Super Fast Charger?</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Super-Fast Charging:</strong> Optimized for Samsung devices, delivering up to 25W of power to keep your phone charged in no time.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Versatile Compatibility:</strong> Works with a wide range of Samsung devices, including the Galaxy S, Note, and A series, as well as other USB-C devices.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Safe and Reliable:</strong> Built-in safety features regulate temperature and prevent overheating, ensuring your device charges safely.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Travel-Friendly Design:</strong> Its wide voltage input range makes it ideal for international use, ensuring you can charge your phone wherever you are.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Durable Build:</strong> High-quality materials and advanced safety mechanisms make this charger a long-lasting and reliable accessory.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nWith the Samsung 25W Super Fast Charger, you can count on fast, efficient charging, whether you’re powering up your smartphone, tablet, or other compatible devices. Its sleek design and compact size make it a perfect addition to your tech essentials, ensuring your devices stay charged throughout the day.', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>Samsung 25W Super Fast Charge<strong>r</strong> with Type-C connection</li>\r\n 	<li>Supports <strong>Power Delivery (PD)</strong> for fast, efficient charging</li>\r\n 	<li>Charges Galaxy devices up to <strong>25W</strong></li>\r\n 	<li>Works with a wide range of Samsung Galaxy S, Note, and A series models</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Intelligent safety features</strong> for temperature control and overheating prevention</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Travel-friendly</strong> with 100-240V voltage input for international use</li>\r\n 	<li>Includes <strong>USB-C to USB-C cable</strong> for optimized charging</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 4999, 2299, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:51:44', '2025-09-20 09:58:54', 'NULL', 500.00, 1);
