(110, 'Samsung 45W Super Fast Charger', 'samsung-45w-super-fast-charger', 14, 55, '<h2>Samsung 45W Super Fast Charger Type-C EU Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\nThe Samsung 45W Super Fast Charger Type-C EU offers a powerful, efficient charging solution designed to meet the demands of today’s fast-paced world. Built with <strong>Super Fast Charging 2.0</strong> technology, this charger is capable of delivering up to <strong>45W</strong> of power, making it one of the fastest chargers available for Samsung devices. Whether you\'re using a Galaxy Note, S Series, or other compatible models, this charger ensures that you spend less time waiting for your phone to charge and more time using it.\r\n\r\n<strong>Super Fast Charging 2.0 for Maximum Efficiency</strong>\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the Samsung 45W Charger is its <strong>Super Fast Charging 2.0</strong> technology, which is capable of delivering up to 45W of power. This technology is specifically optimized for devices like the <strong>Galaxy Note 10+</strong>, <strong>Note 10+ 5G</strong>, <strong>A91</strong>, and other future models, allowing you to charge your phone to full capacity in a fraction of the time it takes with standard chargers. The charger is also backward compatible with <strong>Super Fast Charging 25W</strong>, making it suitable for devices such as the <strong>Galaxy Note 10</strong>, <strong>S10 5G</strong>, <strong>A90 5G</strong>, and others.\r\n\r\nWhether you need a quick top-up or a full charge, this charger can handle it with ease. With <strong>Power Delivery (PD) 3.0</strong> and <strong>PPS</strong> (Programmable Power Supply) support, it intelligently manages power delivery based on your device’s needs, optimizing both speed and safety.\r\n\r\n<strong>Designed for Modern Connectivity</strong>\r\n\r\nThe Samsung 45W Super Fast Charger comes with a <strong>USB Type-C interface</strong>, offering a universal solution for fast charging across a range of devices. Type-C connectivity ensures high-speed data transfer and efficient power delivery, making it ideal for users who need to stay connected while their devices charge. It also supports other Type-C-enabled devices, giving you greater flexibility with your tech gadgets.\r\n\r\n<strong>Safety and Durability for Long-Lasting Use</strong>\r\n\r\nSamsung has always prioritized safety, and this <strong>45W Super Fast Charger</strong> is no exception. It is equipped with safety mechanisms to prevent overheating and overcharging. This ensures that your device remains safe, even during extended charging sessions. The charger has a built-in <strong>high-temperature resistant casing</strong> that offers reliable performance, even during continuous use.\r\n\r\n<strong>Universal Compatibility for All Your Devices</strong>\r\n\r\nThis charger is compatible with a wide range of Samsung devices, including:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Galaxy Note 10+</strong>, <strong>Note 10+ 5G</strong></li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Galaxy A91</strong></li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Galaxy S10 5G</strong></li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Galaxy A90 5G</strong>, <strong>A80</strong>, <strong>A70</strong></li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Galaxy Book S</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nAdditionally, it supports future devices, making it a future-proof solution for anyone invested in Samsung’s ecosystem.\r\n\r\n<strong>In the Box</strong>\r\n\r\nThe package includes:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Samsung 45W Super Fast Charger</strong></li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Type-C to Type-C 5A Cable</strong></li>\r\n 	<li><strong>User Manual</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nWith everything included in the box, you can start fast charging your compatible devices right away.\r\n\r\n<strong>Ideal for Travel and Daily Use</strong>\r\n\r\nThe Samsung 45W Charger is designed to be compact and lightweight, making it easy to carry with you wherever you go. With an input voltage range of <strong>100-240V</strong>, it’s suitable for international travel, ensuring you can charge your devices in different countries without any hassle. Simply pack it along with your gear, and you\'ll never have to worry about your phone or tablet running out of power.\r\n\r\n<strong>Why Choose the Samsung 45W Super Fast Charger Type-C EU?</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Ultra-Fast Charging</strong>: Delivers up to <strong>45W</strong> of power for the fastest possible charging speeds.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Safety Assured</strong>: Built with safety features to prevent overheating, overcharging, and short circuits.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Universal Compatibility</strong>: Works with a wide range of Samsung devices and other USB Type-C gadgets.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Compact and Travel-Friendly</strong>: Lightweight and easy to carry, perfect for travel or everyday use.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Includes Type-C Cable</strong>: Comes with a <strong>1-meter Type-C to Type-C cable</strong> for convenient and reliable charging.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThe Samsung 45W Super Fast Charger Type-C EU is the ideal solution for users looking for speed, safety, and reliability in their charging experience. Its cutting-edge technology ensures that your devices charge faster and more efficiently than ever before, while its durable construction makes it a long-lasting accessory in your tech arsenal. Whether you\'re at home, at work, or on the go, this charger delivers the performance you need to keep your devices powered up.\r\n\r\nThis <strong>45W Samsung Charger</strong> is now available in Pakistan, offering a top-tier charging experience for a wide variety of Samsung devices. Stay powered up and connected with <strong>Samsung’s Super Fast Charging 2.0</strong> technology.', '<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Official Samsung 45W Super Fast Charger</strong> with Type-C interface</li>\r\n 	<li>Delivers up to 45W of power with <strong>Super Fast Charging 2.0</strong> technology</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with Galaxy Note 10+, S10 5G, A90 5G, and more</li>\r\n 	<li>Includes <strong>Type-C to Type-C 5A cable</strong> for reliable, fast charging</li>\r\n 	<li>Supports PD 3.0 and PPS for efficient power management</li>\r\n 	<li>Safety features prevent overheating and overcharging</li>\r\n 	<li>Compact design, ideal for travel with <strong>100-240V</strong> support</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 7500, 2999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:51:44', '2025-09-20 09:55:34', 'NULL', 570.00, 1),
(111, 'Samsung 15W Fast Adapter', 'samsung-15w-fast-adapter', 14, 55, '<h2>Samsung 15W Fast Adapter Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\nThe Samsung 15W Fast Adapter with Type-C interface is designed to offer efficient, fast charging for a wide range of Samsung devices. Whether you\'re using it with your Galaxy smartphone or tablet, this <strong>15W Power Adapter</strong> ensures that your device charges quickly and safely, so you can get back to using it in no time. Built to meet the highest standards, this adapter is compact, lightweight, and ideal for both home use and travel.\r\n\r\n<strong>Fast Charging with PD Technology</strong>\r\n\r\nEquipped with <strong>Power Delivery (PD) technology</strong>, the Samsung 15W Adapter delivers power up to <strong>15W</strong>, allowing for rapid charging of compatible devices. This ensures that your Samsung device can receive the optimal power it needs to charge efficiently. The adapter supports <strong>Fast Charging</strong> technology, offering an output voltage of <strong>9V</strong> and a current of <strong>1.67A</strong>, which is ideal for fast charging Galaxy smartphones, tablets, and other devices that support USB-C fast charging.\r\n\r\n<strong>Versatile USB-C Interface</strong>\r\n\r\nThe <strong>USB-C interface</strong> of the Samsung 15W Adapter is designed for modern devices, ensuring faster power delivery and data transfer compared to older USB-A chargers. Whether you’re charging your Galaxy smartphone, tablet, or even other compatible devices, the Type-C interface ensures a stable and reliable charging experience. With its <strong>universal compatibility</strong>, this adapter can also be used with other USB-C devices, making it a flexible addition to your tech accessories.\r\n\r\n<strong>Compact and Travel-Friendly Design</strong>\r\n\r\nWeighing just <strong>38.5g</strong> and with dimensions of <strong>37 x 22.5 x 74.1 mm</strong>, the Samsung 15W Adapter is compact and highly portable, making it the perfect travel companion. Whether you\'re at home, in the office, or on the go, this charger is small enough to fit into your bag or pocket without adding any unnecessary bulk.\r\n\r\nThe adapter supports an input voltage of <strong>100-240V</strong>, making it suitable for international use, so you can travel with confidence knowing that your devices will stay charged wherever you go. The Samsung 15W Fast Adapter is perfect for frequent travelers who need a reliable charger that works across different regions.\r\n\r\n<strong>Optimized for Samsung Devices</strong>\r\n\r\nThis 15W Samsung Fast Adapter is specifically optimized for use with Samsung Galaxy devices, ensuring that they receive the fastest and safest charging possible. It\'s compatible with a wide range of Samsung devices, including popular models like the Galaxy S series, Galaxy Note series, and many others. It also supports backward compatibility, meaning it can charge older devices at their maximum charging speeds.\r\n\r\nThe charger offers two charging modes:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Normal Charge:</strong> Output voltage of <strong>5V</strong> with a current of <strong>2A</strong>, ideal for regular charging needs.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Fast Charge:</strong> Output voltage of <strong>9V</strong> with a current of <strong>1.67A</strong>, ensuring rapid charging for compatible devices.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>Safety and Durability Built In</strong>\r\n\r\nSamsung has always prioritized safety, and the <strong>15W Fast Adapter</strong> is no exception. It comes equipped with multiple safety features, including protection against overcharging, overheating, and short-circuiting. These features ensure that your device remains safe during every charge, no matter how long it\'s plugged in.\r\n\r\nThe adapter’s casing is made from high-quality, heat-resistant materials to ensure durability over long-term use. This makes it a reliable choice for both daily charging and extended use during travel.\r\n\r\n<strong>In the Box</strong>\r\n\r\nWhen you purchase the Samsung 15W Fast Adapter, you’ll receive:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Samsung 15W Power Adapter</strong></li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Quick Start Guide</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nWhile the adapter itself does not come with a charging cable, it’s compatible with any <strong>USB-C to USB-C</strong> or <strong>USB-C to USB-A</strong> cable, offering flexibility depending on your device\'s port type.\r\n\r\n<strong>Why Choose the Samsung 15W Fast Adapter?</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Efficient Fast Charging:</strong> Provides up to 15W of power for quick and reliable charging of compatible devices.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Compact and Lightweight:</strong> Easily fits in your pocket or bag, making it ideal for travel.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Wide Compatibility:</strong> Works with a broad range of Samsung devices and other USB-C gadgets.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Durable and Safe:</strong> Designed with safety features to protect your devices from overheating and overcharging.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>USB-C Interface:</strong> Modern connectivity for faster charging and data transfer.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nWhether you need a reliable charger for daily use or a travel-friendly option for charging on the go, the Samsung 15W Fast Adapter is the perfect solution. Its combination of fast charging, safety features, and compact design makes it a must-have accessory for any Samsung user.', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>Official Samsung 15W Fast Adapter with USB-C interface</li>\r\n 	<li>Delivers up to 15W of power with <strong>PD</strong> and <strong>Fast Charging</strong> technology</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with a wide range of Samsung devices</li>\r\n 	<li>Lightweight and portable design, perfect for travel</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Safety features</strong> include protection from overheating and overcharging</li>\r\n 	<li>Supports <strong>100-240V input voltage</strong> for international use</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 2499, 1499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:51:44', '2025-09-20 09:54:48', 'NULL', 450.00, 1),
(112, 'Motor Bike Stand BY551', 'motor-bike-stand-by551', 3, 58, '<h2>Motor Bike Stand BY551 Price In Pakistan</h2>\nIntroducing the MOTOR BIKE STAND BY551, a versatile and durable solution for securely holding your mobile devices while riding. Whether you’re on a motorcycle, electric bicycle, or even a baby carriage, the BY551 is designed to cater to your needs. This innovative bike stand is a must-have accessory for riders who value convenience and functionality during their outdoor activities.\n<h3>Key Features of the MOTOR BIKE STAND BY551:</h3>\n<ol>\n 	<li><strong>Durable Construction</strong>:\nThe BY551 is crafted from high-quality plastic, ensuring its longevity and reliability. Its robust build can withstand the rigors of outdoor use, making it a dependable choice for various riding scenarios. Whether you are riding in the city or on rugged terrain, this stand will hold up to your adventures.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Versatile Compatibility</strong>:\nOne of the standout features of the MOTOR BIKE STAND BY551 is its compatibility with various devices. It can securely hold smartphones, GPS units, and other digital devices. This versatility means you can easily use your device for navigation, music, or communication without worrying about it falling or getting damaged.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Adjustable and Portable Design</strong>:\nThe BY551 stands out with its adjustable design, allowing for arbitrary size adjustments to accommodate different devices. This means you can customize the fit based on your device\'s size, ensuring a snug and secure hold. The compact and portable design makes it easy to carry along, so you can take it with you wherever you go.</li>\n 	<li><strong>360-Degree Rotation</strong>:\nThe 360-degree rotation feature of the BY551 allows you to position your device at any angle. This flexibility is particularly useful for adjusting your device for optimal visibility while riding. Whether you prefer landscape or portrait orientation, the BY551 can be easily adjusted to meet your preferences.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Clear Line of Sight</strong>:\nThe design of the MOTOR BIKE STAND BY551 ensures that you maintain a clear line of sight while using your device. This is crucial for safety, especially when navigating through busy streets or scenic routes. You can keep your focus on the road ahead while still having access to your device.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Installation Hole for Versatile Use</strong>:\nThe inclusion of an installation hole in the BY551 adds to its versatility. This feature allows you to mount the stand in various positions, providing flexibility for different riding styles. Whether you\'re using it on a bicycle or a baby carriage, the stand adapts to your needs.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Ideal for Outdoor Activities</strong>:\nThe BY551 is not just limited to motorcycle use; it’s also perfect for outdoor activities and sports. Whether you’re cycling through the park, hiking, or enjoying a leisurely ride, this bike stand enhances your experience by keeping your devices secure and accessible.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Easy to Install</strong>:\nInstalling the MOTOR BIKE STAND BY551 is a breeze. With its user-friendly design, you can quickly set it up without the need for complicated tools or instructions. This ease of installation means you can spend less time fussing with your equipment and more time enjoying your ride.</li>\n</ol>', '<ul>\n 	<li>Durable construction from high-quality plastic</li>\n 	<li>Versatile compatibility with smartphones, GPS, and more</li>\n 	<li>Adjustable size to fit various devices securely</li>\n 	<li>360-degree rotation for optimal viewing angles</li>\n 	<li>Clear line of sight for safe navigation</li>\n 	<li>Installation hole for versatile mounting options</li>\n 	<li>Ideal for outdoor activities and sports</li>\n 	<li>Easy to install without any tools</li>\n</ul>', 1, 50, 2000, 1299, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:51:44', '2025-04-29 10:31:39', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(113, 'Xiaomi 22.5W Power Bank (10000mAh)', 'xiaomi-22-5w-power-bank-10000mah', 10, 61, '<h2>Xiaomi 22.5W Power Bank (10000mAh) Price In Pakistan</h2>\nThe Xiaomi 22.5W Power Bank (10000mAh) is an essential accessory for anyone who needs reliable, fast charging on the go. Whether you’re a frequent traveler, outdoor enthusiast, or someone who simply spends a lot of time away from outlets, this power bank ensures that your devices stay charged and ready for use. It delivers powerful charging speeds, ensuring you get the most out of your mobile devices, tablets, or even smaller gadgets.\n<h3>High-Capacity Battery for Maximum Use</h3>\nAt the heart of the Xiaomi 22.5W Power Bank is its 10000mAh lithium-ion polymer battery. This high-capacity battery allows you to charge your smartphone or other devices multiple times before the power bank needs recharging. It’s designed to keep your devices powered throughout the day, making it a perfect companion for long trips, business meetings, or simple daily use.\n<h3>Fast Charging Technology</h3>\nWhat sets this Xiaomi power bank apart from others is its <strong>22.5W fast charging technology</strong>. With a USB-C input and output, you can charge your devices much faster compared to standard power banks. This is especially helpful when you\'re in a hurry and need a quick power boost. The USB-C port ensures efficient power delivery, making it compatible with newer smartphones, tablets, and even laptops. Additionally, the USB-A output offers versatility by letting you charge traditional devices as well.\n<h3>Dual Port Connectivity</h3>\nThe Xiaomi 22.5W Power Bank offers both <strong>USB-A and USB-C output ports</strong>, allowing you to charge two devices simultaneously. Whether you’re powering up your smartphone and Bluetooth earphones, or a tablet and portable speaker, this power bank’s dual connectivity is built for multitasking. The inclusion of multiple ports makes it ideal for users who rely on a range of electronic devices during their daily routine.\n<h3>Compact and Sleek Design</h3>\nDespite its powerful capabilities, the Xiaomi 22.5W Power Bank comes in a compact and sleek form factor. Measuring just <strong>147.8 x 73.9 x 15.3mm</strong>, it\'s slim enough to fit in your pocket, bag, or even a small pouch. Its portable size makes it easy to carry, ensuring you\'re always ready for any charging emergency. The lightweight design ensures that it won’t add unnecessary bulk, even if you’re already carrying other items.\n<h3>Enhanced Safety Features</h3>\nXiaomi has incorporated advanced safety features into this power bank to protect your devices. It has built-in protections against <strong>overcharging, overheating, and short circuits</strong>. These features ensure your devices remain safe during the charging process, giving you peace of mind when charging overnight or in different environments.\n<h3>Universal Compatibility</h3>\nThe Xiaomi 22.5W Power Bank (10000mAh) is compatible with a wide variety of devices, from smartphones and tablets to more advanced gadgets like smartwatches and portable speakers. Its USB-C port makes it perfect for the latest Android smartphones, as well as other gadgets that support USB-C input/output. Additionally, the USB-A port extends its compatibility to older devices, making it an all-around charging solution for users with a mix of modern and legacy devices.\n<h3>Ideal for Multiple Environments</h3>\nWhether you’re working in an office, commuting, hiking, or simply spending the day at a coffee shop, the Xiaomi 22.5W Power Bank will keep your devices charged in any environment. Its durable construction ensures it can withstand daily wear and tear, while its efficient power delivery guarantees you’re never left without charge when you need it most.\n<h3>Summary</h3>\nIn conclusion, the Xiaomi 22.5W Power Bank (10000mAh) is the perfect solution for anyone looking to stay powered up while on the go. Its high capacity, fast charging technology, and dual port connectivity make it one of the most versatile power banks on the market. Add in its compact design and advanced safety features, and it\'s clear that this power bank is a must-have accessory for modern life.\n\n&nbsp;', '<ul>\n 	<li>High-capacity 10000mAh lithium-ion polymer battery</li>\n 	<li>Fast 22.5W charging with USB-C input/output</li>\n 	<li>Dual ports: USB-C and USB-A for simultaneous charging</li>\n 	<li>Compact design, easy to carry</li>\n 	<li>Built-in protection against overcharging, overheating, and short circuits</li>\n 	<li>Compatible with a wide range of devices including smartphones, tablets, and smartwatches</li>\n</ul>', 1, 50, 5999, 5499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:51:44', '2025-04-22 11:44:51', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(114, '30cm RGB Ring Light', '30cm-rgb-ring-light', 3, 58, '<h2>30cm RGB Ring Light Price In Pakistan</h2>\nThe 30cm RGB Ring Light is a must-have lighting accessory for content creators, vloggers, and influencers looking to enhance the quality of their photos and videos. With a diameter of 30cm (12 inches), this ring light offers a balanced and evenly distributed light, reducing shadows and providing soft illumination that highlights your subject in the best possible way.\n\nOne of the standout features of this RGB ring light is its <strong>color customization</strong> capabilities. It offers a wide spectrum of colors, allowing you to choose from vibrant hues such as red, green, blue, pink, and cyan-blue. Whether you are creating engaging content for your social media platforms, shooting professional-looking videos, or hosting live streams, the color customization feature enables you to create visually dynamic lighting effects that make your content stand out. The RGB modes, such as <strong>rainbow, breath, fade</strong>, and more, add a creative flair to your videos, making them more captivating and engaging for your audience.\n\nThe 30cm RGB Ring Light also comes with <strong>adjustable brightness levels</strong>, ensuring that you have full control over the intensity of the light. Whether you\'re working in a well-lit room or a dim environment, the brightness control feature allows you to set the perfect illumination to match your needs. From soft lighting for casual vlogs to brighter, more intense lighting for professional shoots, this ring light can cater to a variety of settings and scenarios.\n\nWhat makes this ring light truly versatile is its ability to cater to various creative needs. It\'s not just a lighting accessory for video creators—it is also perfect for <strong>makeup tutorials</strong>, <strong>product photography</strong>, and <strong>decorative lighting</strong>. The <strong>RGB LEDs</strong> produce beautiful catchlights in your eyes, giving a professional look to your videos and photos. Whether you\'re capturing portraits, filming TikTok videos, or participating in video conferences, the 30cm RGB Ring Light ensures that you always have optimal lighting.\n\nIn addition to being a functional lighting tool, the 30cm RGB Ring Light offers <strong>dynamic lighting modes</strong> that are perfect for special occasions or themed shoots. Modes like <strong>chasing, windmill, and circle</strong> create stunning lighting effects that enhance the visual appeal of your content. These modes are ideal for holidays, parties, or even just adding some mood lighting to your room.\n\nThis RGB ring light is designed with user-friendliness in mind. It is lightweight and easy to set up, making it portable enough to carry with you for outdoor shoots or travel. It can be mounted on a <strong>tripod</strong> for hands-free use, allowing you to adjust the height and angles to get the perfect lighting. The ring light is compatible with a wide range of <strong>smartphones and cameras</strong>, making it highly adaptable to different devices and setups.\n\nWhen it comes to <strong>performance</strong>, the 30cm RGB Ring Light is equipped with <strong>high-brightness LEDs</strong> that offer <strong>long-lasting durability</strong>. The LED lights are energy-efficient and provide consistent brightness without flickering, ensuring that your content remains sharp and professional-looking even during extended shooting sessions. The <strong>color temperature options</strong> include both warm and cool light settings, which can be adjusted to suit the mood of your shoot.\n\nAnother important feature of the 30cm RGB Ring Light is its <strong>sturdy build quality</strong>. Made from <strong>high-quality materials</strong>, this ring light is built to last, offering durability without compromising on performance. Its robust design ensures that it can withstand regular use, while its lightweight construction makes it easy to transport and set up wherever you need it.\n\nFor content creators in Pakistan, the 30cm RGB Ring Light is an essential tool for creating high-quality content. Whether you’re just starting out or are a professional looking to upgrade your setup, this ring light offers the perfect balance of versatility, durability, and performance. With its wide range of <strong>color customization options</strong>, <strong>adjustable brightness</strong>, and <strong>dynamic modes</strong>, you can create unique and visually appealing content that captivates your audience.\n\nIn conclusion, the 30cm RGB Ring Light is a versatile and reliable lighting accessory that is ideal for a wide range of creative applications. Its customizable color settings, adjustable brightness, and dynamic modes make it the perfect choice for anyone looking to elevate their video and photo content. Whether you\'re using it for vlogging, streaming, makeup tutorials, or even just decorative lighting, the 30cm RGB Ring Light delivers professional-quality lighting at an affordable price.', '<ul>\n 	<li>30cm (12-inch) RGB ring light</li>\n 	<li>Adjustable brightness levels</li>\n 	<li>Dynamic RGB color modes (rainbow, breath, fade)</li>\n 	<li>Versatile for vlogging, streaming, and photography</li>\n 	<li>Eye-catching lighting effects for enhanced aesthetics</li>\n</ul>', 1, 50, 4999, 3499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:51:44', '2025-04-29 10:30:06', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(115, 'Jmary MW-16 Microphone', 'jmary-mw-16-microphone', 13, 75, '<h2>Jmary MW-16 Microphone Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\nThe Jmary MW-16 wireless microphone is designed to enhance the audio quality of your recordings, making it perfect for vloggers, videographers, and content creators. This wireless microphone for camera and mobile offers a seamless recording experience, allowing you to focus on capturing the best audio without the hassle of tangled wires.\r\n<h3><strong>Clear and Crisp Sound</strong></h3>\r\nOne of the standout features of the Jmary MW-16 microphone is its ability to deliver clear, crisp sound. Whether you\'re filming a video, recording a podcast, or capturing interviews, this microphone ensures that your audio comes through with professional clarity. The omnidirectional pickup pattern captures sound from all directions, making it ideal even if you\'re not directly facing the microphone.\r\n<h3><strong>2.4G Wireless Technology for Stable Connections</strong></h3>\r\nThanks to the advanced <strong>2.4G wireless microphone technology</strong>, the Jmary MW-16 offers a reliable connection for both camera and mobile applications. This wireless setup means you can move freely while recording without worrying about losing the connection. With a range of up to 20 meters (65 feet), it\'s the perfect companion for outdoor shoots, interviews, and live streaming, ensuring you\'re always connected.\r\n<h3><strong>Plug-and-Play for Easy Setup</strong></h3>\r\nSimplicity is key when it comes to recording, and the Jmary MW-16 microphone offers a true plug-and-play experience. There’s no need for complex setup procedures. Just connect the receiver to your camera or mobile device, and attach the transmitter to the microphone. Within seconds, you\'re ready to start recording high-quality audio, making this wireless microphone suitable even for beginners.\r\n<h3><strong>Long Battery Life for Extended Recording</strong></h3>\r\nThe Jmary MW-16 wireless microphone is equipped with a long-lasting battery, allowing for up to 8 hours of continuous recording. This extended battery life ensures that you can focus on your content without worrying about your microphone dying in the middle of a shoot. Whether you\'re conducting long interviews, filming a series of vlogs, or recording a concert, the Jmary MW-16 will be there to provide consistent performance.\r\n<h3><strong>Compact and Portable Design</strong></h3>\r\nThe compact and lightweight design of the <strong>J</strong>mary MW-16 microphone makes it incredibly portable. You can easily carry it in your pocket or bag, making it a great solution for on-the-go creators. Its minimalistic design does not compromise functionality, making it a perfect fit for vloggers, journalists, and any creator needing a professional yet portable audio solution.\r\n<h3><strong>Why Choose the Jmary MW-16 Wireless Microphone?</strong></h3>\r\nThe Jmary MW-16 microphone stands out for its ease of use and superior sound quality. It’s a wireless microphone for mobile and camera setups, offering flexibility and freedom of movement, making it a go-to solution for content creators who want to upgrade their audio game. Its <strong>omnidirectional pickup pattern</strong> ensures that all voices are captured with clarity, making it suitable for a variety of recording environments.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Benefits:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Improved Audio Quality</strong>: This microphone delivers professional-level sound for video recordings, podcasts, interviews, and more.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Increased Flexibility</strong>: The wireless design allows for easy movement while recording, making it ideal for dynamic shoots.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Easy Setup</strong>: No complicated installations—just plug in and start recording with this plug-and-play wireless microphone.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Portable and Lightweight</strong>: Its compact design makes it easy to carry around, whether you\'re filming in a studio or on location.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><strong>Ideal for Content Creators</strong></h3>\r\nFor vloggers, videographers, and podcasters who need professional-grade audio without the bulky equipment, the Jmary MW-16 wireless microphone is the ideal choice. Its <strong>2.4G wireless technology</strong> ensures a stable connection, while its long battery life keeps you recording for hours. With this microphone, you get reliable performance every time, ensuring your audience always hears you loud and clear.\r\n\r\nWhether you\'re creating content for social media, YouTube, or any other platform, the Jmary MW-16 wireless microphone for camera and mobile offers the versatility, portability, and quality you need to take your recordings to the next level.', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>2.4G wireless technology for stable connections with up to 20 meters range</li>\r\n 	<li>Omnidirectional pickup pattern ensures clear sound from all directions</li>\r\n 	<li>Plug-and-play operation with no complicated setup required</li>\r\n 	<li>Long battery life providing up to 8 hours of continuous recording</li>\r\n 	<li>Compact and lightweight design, perfect for on-the-go recording</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 14999, 9999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:51:44', '2025-05-12 15:49:06', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(116, 'K9 Dual Microphone', 'k9-dual-microphone', 8, 58, '<h2>K9 Dual Microphone Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\nThe K9 Dual Microphone is an essential tool for anyone looking to record clear and professional-quality audio without the hassle of wires. This <strong>wireless lavalier microphone</strong> is perfect for vloggers, YouTubers, podcasters, and live streamers on platforms like Facebook, Instagram, and TikTok. Its auto-sync feature and wide compatibility make it a versatile choice for content creators who need reliable audio for both Android and iPhone devices.\r\n<h3><strong>Wireless Freedom with Auto-Sync Technology</strong></h3>\r\nThe K9 Dual Microphone offers the convenience of wireless operation, allowing creators to move freely while recording. It’s designed with <strong>auto-sync technology</strong>, which ensures that the audio is perfectly synchronized with your video. Whether you\'re recording in a home studio or on the go, this feature helps you avoid time-consuming post-production syncing, saving you hours of editing work.\r\n<h3><strong>Perfect for Vloggers and Live Streamers</strong></h3>\r\nFor vloggers and live streamers on platforms like YouTube, Instagram, or TikTok, the K9 Dual Microphone provides an excellent solution. Its <strong>wireless lavalier microphone</strong> setup means you can walk, talk, and interact with your audience without being tethered by cables. This makes it ideal for on-the-move recordings, whether you\'re filming a tutorial, hosting a live Q&amp;A session, or conducting interviews.\r\n<h3><strong>Wide Device Compatibility</strong></h3>\r\nOne of the standout features of the K9 Dual Microphone is its broad compatibility. It\'s designed to work seamlessly with <strong>iPhone models</strong> including the iPhone 7, 8, X, XS, XR, 11, and 12, as well as a wide range of <strong>Android and Type C handsets</strong>. This versatility ensures that regardless of what device you\'re using, you can rely on the <strong>K9 microphone</strong> to deliver clear, professional audio every time.\r\n<h3><strong>Professional-Grade Sound Quality</strong></h3>\r\nThe K9 wireless lavalier microphone is built with a <strong>unidirectional polar pattern</strong>, which helps it focus on the sound directly in front of the microphone, reducing background noise and enhancing the clarity of your voice. Whether you\'re recording an interview, shooting a vlog, or streaming live content, this microphone ensures that your audience can hear you loud and clear.\r\n\r\nIts <strong>crystal transducer</strong> technology captures sound with precision, ensuring that every word is delivered with high clarity and minimal distortion. This feature is especially beneficial for podcasters and YouTubers who want to ensure their audience enjoys a smooth listening experience.\r\n<h3><strong>Designed for Ease of Use</strong></h3>\r\nSimplicity and ease of use are at the core of the K9 Dual Microphone design. This <strong>wireless lavalier microphone</strong> offers <strong>plug-and-play functionality</strong> with no complicated setups or software installations required. Simply connect it to your device, and you\'re ready to record. This makes it ideal for beginners as well as professionals who need a reliable, hassle-free microphone solution.\r\n<h3><strong>Compact and Portable Design</strong></h3>\r\nThe K9 Dual Microphone is lightweight and compact, making it incredibly easy to carry with you wherever you go. Whether you\'re traveling to different locations for shoots or need to record on the move, this <strong>wireless microphone</strong> fits easily into your bag, ensuring that you never miss the chance to capture high-quality audio. Its <strong>transmitter set</strong> design further enhances portability without compromising on performance.\r\n<h3><strong>Why Choose the K9 Dual Microphone?</strong></h3>\r\nThe K9 Dual Microphone stands out as a top choice for content creators, offering a combination of <strong>wireless convenience</strong>, <strong>professional-grade sound</strong>, and <strong>universal compatibility</strong>. Whether you\'re an experienced YouTuber, an Instagram influencer, or just starting out with vlogging, this microphone ensures that your content is backed by high-quality audio.\r\n\r\n<strong>Key Benefits:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Auto-sync Wireless Technology</strong>: Automatically syncs audio with your video, eliminating the need for post-editing adjustments.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Wide Compatibility</strong>: Works with both Android and iPhone devices, including Type C handsets.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Unidirectional Pickup Pattern</strong>: Reduces background noise, focusing on clear voice capture.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Plug-and-Play Operation</strong>: Simple setup with no need for additional software or apps.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Portable and Compact</strong>: Small enough to carry in your pocket, ideal for content creators on the go.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><strong>Versatile Recording for Any Content</strong></h3>\r\nWhether you\'re recording at home or shooting on location, the K9 wireless microphone ensures that your audio remains crisp and professional. It’s perfect for vloggers, live streamers, interviewers, and podcasters who want to ensure their audience experiences the best sound possible. From home studio recordings to live outdoor sessions, the K9 Dual Microphone is built to perform.\r\n\r\nThis K9 microphone for vloggers and other content creators is easy to use, professional, and built with the flexibility to adapt to your recording environment. If you\'re looking for a wireless microphone that delivers high-quality audio for both Android and iPhone users, the K9 Dual Microphone is your go-to solution.', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>Wireless lavalier microphone with auto-sync for hassle-free audio</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with both Android and iPhone devices, including Type C handsets</li>\r\n 	<li>Unidirectional polar pattern to reduce background noise</li>\r\n 	<li>Plug-and-play operation for quick and easy setup</li>\r\n 	<li>Lightweight and portable design for recording on the go</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 2599, 1999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:51:44', '2025-05-12 13:39:21', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(117, 'Apple iPhone USB-C Power Adapter 20W', 'apple-usb-c-power-adapter-20w', 14, 42, '<h2>Apple USB-C Power Adapter 20W Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\nThe Apple USB-C Power Adapter 20W is a compact and efficient charger designed to provide fast charging for your iPhone, iPad, or other compatible devices. Whether you’re at home, in the office, or on the go, this power adapter offers a reliable and powerful solution for keeping your devices charged. With its sleek design and efficient performance, it’s the perfect accessory for anyone who needs to charge their devices quickly and conveniently.\r\n<h3><strong>Fast Charging for iPhone and iPad</strong></h3>\r\nThe Apple USB-C Power Adapter 20W is designed to support fast charging, delivering 20 watts of power to your device. This means you can charge your iPhone or iPad faster than ever before. Whether you’re powering up an iPhone 12, iPad Air, or other compatible devices, this <strong>USB-C charger</strong> ensures that your battery is topped up in no time. For those with busy schedules, the ability to charge quickly is invaluable, allowing you to stay connected and productive throughout the day.\r\n<h3><strong>Universal Compatibility</strong></h3>\r\nWhile the Apple USB-C Power Adapter 20W is ideal for Apple devices, it’s also compatible with a wide range of other products. This power adapter can be used with any device that supports USB-C charging, making it a versatile accessory for all your tech needs. Whether you’re charging an Android device, wireless earbuds, or other gadgets, the 20W power adapter has the flexibility to meet your requirements.\r\n<h3><strong>Compact and Portable Design</strong></h3>\r\nOne of the standout features of the Apple USB-C Power Adapter 20W is its compact and lightweight design. It’s small enough to carry in your bag, making it an ideal travel companion for anyone who needs to keep their devices charged on the go. Despite its small size, it packs a powerful punch, delivering <strong>20W of power</strong> to charge your device efficiently. The portability of this adapter makes it perfect for professionals, travelers, and students who are always on the move.\r\n<h3><strong>Reliable and Durable</strong></h3>\r\nAs with all Apple products, the USB-C Power Adapter 20W is built with quality and durability in mind. It’s designed to provide safe and reliable charging, with protection against overcharging, overheating, and short-circuiting. You can trust this <strong>Apple charger</strong> to keep your devices powered up without any risk of damage. The long-lasting build ensures that you’ll get years of use out of this essential accessory.\r\n<h3><strong>Ideal for Everyday Use</strong></h3>\r\nWhether you’re charging your iPhone, iPad, or any other compatible device, the Apple USB-C Power Adapter 20W is a must-have accessory. It’s perfect for everyday use, offering convenience and speed without compromising on quality. Simply connect your <strong>USB-C to Lightning cable</strong> (sold separately) to this adapter, and you’ll be ready to charge your device at full speed.\r\n<h3><strong>Perfect for Busy Lifestyles</strong></h3>\r\nFor those with busy schedules, the Apple USB-C Power Adapter 20W is the perfect solution. It charges devices rapidly, allowing you to power up during short breaks or when you’re in a hurry. Whether you’re at work, school, or traveling, this <strong>USB-C adapter</strong> ensures that your devices are ready to go when you need them most.\r\n<h3><strong>Apple Quality and Performance</strong></h3>\r\nWhen you choose the Apple USB-C Power Adapter 20W, you’re investing in the quality and performance that Apple is known for. This adapter is built to deliver the best possible charging experience, ensuring that your devices are charged safely and efficiently. With <strong>20W of power</strong>, you can charge your iPhone 12 up to 50% in just 30 minutes, making this adapter one of the fastest options available.\r\n<h3><strong>Why Choose the Apple USB-C Power Adapter 20W?</strong></h3>\r\nIf you’re looking for a reliable, fast, and compact charger for your Apple devices, the Apple USB-C Power Adapter 20W is an excellent choice. It combines <strong>fast charging</strong> technology with a <strong>compact design</strong>, making it easy to use at home, at work, or on the go. Whether you need to charge your iPhone, iPad, or other USB-C devices, this adapter offers the versatility and power you need.\r\n<h3><strong>Key Features of the Apple USB-C Power Adapter 20W</strong>:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Fast Charging</strong>: Delivers 20W of power to quickly charge your iPhone or iPad.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Universal Compatibility</strong>: Works with a variety of USB-C devices, including Android phones and wireless earbuds.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Compact and Portable</strong>: Lightweight design makes it easy to carry in your bag for on-the-go charging.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Durable and Reliable</strong>: Built to last with protection against overcharging, overheating, and short-circuiting.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Ideal for Travel</strong>: Small enough to take anywhere, making it a perfect accessory for travelers.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nWhether you’re charging at home or on the move, the Apple USB-C Power Adapter 20W is the ultimate solution for fast and reliable charging. Its <strong>universal compatibility</strong>, compact design, and fast charging capabilities make it a must-have accessory for anyone using Apple devices or other USB-C gadgets.', '<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"2c06d56d-3387-4dde-96a7-a5526c1ccfe0\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark\">\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>20W USB-C power adapter for fast charging iPhones, iPads, and other devices</li>\r\n 	<li>Universal compatibility with any USB-C-enabled device</li>\r\n 	<li>Compact and portable design, perfect for travel and on-the-go charging</li>\r\n 	<li>Built-in protection against overcharging, overheating, and short-circuiting</li>\r\n 	<li>Ideal for professionals, travelers, and anyone with a busy lifestyle</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"mb-2 flex gap-3 empty:hidden -ml-2\">\r\n<div class=\"items-center justify-start rounded-xl p-1 flex\"></div>\r\n</div>', 1, 50, 7499, 5499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:51:44', '2025-05-28 13:15:08', 'NULL', NULL, 0);
