(118, 'Ws13 Max Smart Watch', 'ws13-max-smart-watch', 11, 48, '<h2>Ws13 Max Smart Watch Price In Pakistan</h2>\nThe Ws13 Max Smart Watch is a feature-packed device designed to cater to the modern user’s needs. It combines essential health tracking tools, Bluetooth calling, and multiple sports modes, making it an ideal companion for fitness enthusiasts and tech-savvy users alike. With its sleek design, compatibility with both <strong>Android and iOS devices</strong>, and an array of advanced features, the Ws13 Max stands out as a versatile smartwatch at an affordable price.\n<h3><strong>Sleek Design with TFT Display</strong></h3>\nThe Ws13 Max Smart Watch boasts a stunning <strong>49mm TFT display</strong> that offers clear visuals and a user-friendly interface. Whether you’re checking your notifications or monitoring your workout progress, the large display ensures that you get all the information you need at a glance. The smooth <strong>silicone strap</strong> adds comfort to your wrist, making it ideal for all-day wear. Its lightweight and stylish design make it perfect for daily use or special occasions.\n<h3><strong>Bluetooth Calling and Voice Assistant</strong></h3>\nStay connected without reaching for your phone with the <strong>Bluetooth calling</strong> feature. The <strong>Ws13 Max Smart Watch</strong> allows you to make and receive calls directly from your wrist. It’s equipped with a built-in speaker and microphone, making it easy to handle calls during workouts or while driving. Additionally, the integrated <strong>voice assistant</strong> feature provides hands-free control, allowing you to perform tasks such as setting reminders, checking the weather, or sending messages via voice commands.\n<h3><strong>Advanced Health Monitoring Features</strong></h3>\nHealth tracking is one of the key features of the Ws13 Max Smart Watch. It comes with several built-in monitoring systems that help you stay on top of your fitness goals. The <strong>heart rate monitor</strong> continuously tracks your heart rate throughout the day, giving you a real-time view of your heart’s health. The watch also tracks your <strong>calories burned</strong>, helping you manage your diet and activity levels more effectively. Another useful feature is the <strong>oxygen level monitor</strong>, which keeps tabs on your body’s oxygen levels, particularly useful during workouts or high-altitude activities. Additionally, the watch comes with a <strong>step tracker</strong> that keeps a record of your daily steps and distance covered, encouraging you to stay active throughout the day.\n<h3><strong>Multiple Sports Modes</strong></h3>\nFor those who lead an active lifestyle, the Ws13 Max Smart Watch offers multiple sports modes, allowing you to track a variety of activities such as running, walking, cycling, and more. Whether you’re hitting the gym or going for a morning jog, this smartwatch is designed to provide accurate data on your performance, helping you improve your workout efficiency over time. The fitness modes allow you to set personal goals and monitor your progress.\n<h3><strong>IP67 Water Resistance</strong></h3>\nThe Ws13 Max Smart Watch is rated <strong>IP67</strong> for water resistance, meaning it can handle splashes, sweat, and even brief submersion in water. Whether you’re washing your hands, caught in the rain, or sweating it out during an intense workout, you won’t have to worry about damaging your watch. This feature makes it a reliable companion for both indoor and outdoor activities.\n<h3><strong>Reliable Connectivity and Smart Battery Life</strong></h3>\nThe Ws13 Max Smart Watch is equipped with <strong>Bluetooth 5.0</strong>, ensuring a stable and efficient connection with your smartphone. This means you can easily sync your watch with your phone to receive notifications, manage music, and more, without any connection issues. The smartwatch also comes with a <strong>smart battery life</strong>, allowing you to use it for extended periods without frequent recharging. While the battery capacity isn’t specified, users can expect a reliable and long-lasting performance from this device.\n<h3><strong>Compatibility with Android and iOS Devices</strong></h3>\nOne of the advantages of the Ws13 Max Smart Watch is its broad compatibility with both <strong>Android</strong> and <strong>iOS devices</strong>. Whether you’re using an iPhone or an Android smartphone, you can seamlessly sync your watch with your device to receive notifications, messages, and calls. This flexibility ensures that the <strong>Ws13 Max</strong> can be used by a wide range of users, regardless of their preferred smartphone platform.\n<h3><strong>Why Choose the Ws13 Max Smart Watch?</strong></h3>\nIf you’re looking for a smartwatch that offers advanced features at an affordable price, the Ws13 Max Smart Watch is a great choice. It combines health tracking, Bluetooth calling, and a stylish design in one convenient package. Whether you’re interested in monitoring your fitness or staying connected on the go, the Ws13 Max offers all the functionality you need.\n<h3><strong>Key Features of the Ws13 Max Smart Watch</strong>:</h3>\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth Calling</strong>: Make and receive calls directly from your watch without touching your phone.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Voice Assistant</strong>: Hands-free control with built-in voice assistant functionality.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Health Monitoring</strong>: Track your heart rate, calories burned, steps, and oxygen levels.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Multiple Sports Modes</strong>: Tailored fitness tracking for various sports and activities.</li>\n 	<li><strong>IP67 Water Resistance</strong>: Durable and water-resistant, ideal for both indoor and outdoor activities.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Compatibility</strong>: Works with both Android and iOS devices, ensuring wide accessibility.</li>\n 	<li><strong>TFT Display</strong>: Large 49mm screen for easy navigation and clear visuals.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth 5.0</strong>: Stable and efficient connectivity with your smartphone.</li>\n</ul>\nWith its impressive set of features, the Ws13 Max Smart Watch is the perfect companion for anyone looking to enhance their daily life with cutting-edge technology and health monitoring.', '<ul>\n 	<li>Bluetooth calling with built-in speaker and microphone.</li>\n 	<li>Voice assistant for hands-free control and convenience.</li>\n 	<li>Heart rate, calorie burn, and oxygen level monitoring.</li>\n 	<li>Multiple sports modes for fitness tracking.</li>\n 	<li>IP67 water resistance for protection against splashes and sweat.</li>\n 	<li>Compatible with both Android and iOS devices.</li>\n 	<li>Large 49mm TFT display for easy navigation.</li>\n 	<li>Stable Bluetooth 5.0 connectivity.</li>\n</ul>', 1, 50, 7000, 4499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:51:44', '2025-04-22 11:44:51', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(119, 'BD-17 Tripod', 'bd-17-tripod', 12, 58, '<h2><strong>BD-17 Tripod Price In Pakistan</strong></h2>\r\nThe BD-17 Tripod is a versatile and durable accessory designed for photography enthusiasts, vloggers, and content creators. With its adjustable height and built-in Bluetooth remote control, this tripod is perfect for capturing steady shots, filming videos, and taking selfies. The <strong>1700mm adjustable height</strong> makes it suitable for various shooting angles, while the <strong>Bluetooth remote</strong> ensures you can operate the camera or smartphone without physical interaction, providing more flexibility and creativity in your work.\r\n<h3><strong>Adjustable Height and Sturdy Build</strong></h3>\r\nOne of the standout features of the BD-17 Tripod is its impressive <strong>1700mm maximum height</strong>. This allows users to adjust the tripod to their desired height, making it suitable for everything from close-up shots to wide-angle outdoor photography. Whether you’re filming content for YouTube, capturing family moments, or snapping professional photos, the tripod’s height adaptability ensures you get the perfect frame every time.\r\n\r\nBuilt with sturdy materials, the BD-17 Tripod offers reliable support for your camera or smartphone. The legs are reinforced to provide stability even on uneven surfaces, ensuring that your device remains steady throughout the shoot. The tripod’s robust design is ideal for both indoor and outdoor use, giving photographers and videographers confidence during long shooting sessions.\r\n<h3><strong>Bluetooth Remote Control for Easy Operation</strong></h3>\r\nA key feature of the BD-17 Tripod is the <strong>Bluetooth remote control</strong>, which makes it easier than ever to take photos or record videos from a distance. The <strong>remote control ring design</strong> allows you to take out the remote with ease, making it convenient for spontaneous selfies or group shots. It’s perfect for solo creators who want to film content without needing to be near the camera or smartphone.\r\n\r\nConnecting the <strong>Bluetooth remote</strong> is simple:\r\n<ol>\r\n 	<li>Turn on the Bluetooth remote by sliding the button on the side.</li>\r\n 	<li>Wait for the blue light to start flashing, indicating that the device is ready to pair.</li>\r\n 	<li>Open the Bluetooth settings on your smartphone and search for nearby devices.</li>\r\n 	<li>Click on \"SelfiCom\" to connect and pair the remote with your phone.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\nOnce connected, you can easily capture shots from a distance, eliminating the need for an additional person to take your photos. Whether you’re taking group photos, action shots, or simply recording yourself, the <strong>BD-17 Tripod</strong> makes it easy to stay in control of your shots.\r\n<h3><strong>Instructions for Bluetooth Remote</strong></h3>\r\nTo maintain the battery life of the BD-17 Tripod Bluetooth remote, it’s important to use and charge the device every four months, even if it’s not in use. This ensures that the remote remains functional for longer periods. Additionally, it’s advised not to use the remote in environments that are too hot or cold to avoid damaging the internal components. Lastly, users should refrain from disassembling the remote to prevent malfunctions.\r\n\r\nThe Bluetooth remote’s convenience is enhanced by its compact design. It fits comfortably in your hand or pocket, allowing for easy transport and usage whenever needed. Whether you’re traveling or shooting at home, the BD-17 Tripod’s Bluetooth remote ensures seamless operation.\r\n<h3><strong>Perfect for Content Creators and Photographers</strong></h3>\r\nThe BD-17 Tripod is particularly beneficial for content creators, vloggers, and photographers who require hands-free operation of their camera or smartphone. With the ability to adjust the height and use the Bluetooth remote control, creators can focus on their content without worrying about handling their devices. The tripod is compatible with a wide range of smartphones and cameras, making it a versatile tool for any creative project.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re filming a vlog, creating a time-lapse, or capturing still photography, the BD-17 Tripod delivers reliability and ease of use. Its stable legs and durable build ensure that it can withstand the rigors of daily use, whether indoors or outdoors. The tripod’s adaptability makes it a must-have accessory for anyone serious about their photography or videography journey.\r\n<h3><strong>Tips for Maintaining the BD-17 Tripod</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Ensure that the tripod is stored in a dry and safe environment when not in use to prevent damage.</li>\r\n 	<li>Avoid contact with liquids as it may affect the Bluetooth remote’s functionality.</li>\r\n 	<li>Periodically check the tripod for any loose parts or screws, and tighten them as needed to maintain stability.</li>\r\n 	<li>Clean the tripod legs and joints after outdoor use to ensure smooth movement and longevity.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><strong>Why Choose the BD-17 Tripod?</strong></h3>\r\nThe BD-17 Tripod offers a perfect balance of functionality and ease of use, making it ideal for a wide range of photography and videography applications. Its <strong>1700mm adjustable height</strong> and <strong>Bluetooth remote control</strong> provide flexibility for various shooting angles and scenarios. Whether you’re a professional photographer or a casual vlogger, this tripod is designed to meet your needs, ensuring steady shots and hands-free operation.\r\n\r\nWith its durable build and intuitive design, the BD-17 Tripod is a reliable accessory for capturing high-quality content. Whether you’re working in a studio or filming on location, this tripod provides the support and flexibility you need to elevate your creative projects.\r\n<h3><strong>Key Features of the BD-17 Tripod</strong>:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Height Adjustment</strong>: 1700mm maximum height for versatile shooting angles.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth Remote Control</strong>: Operate your device from a distance for selfies, group shots, and more.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Remote Control Ring Design</strong>: Easy to remove and use the remote at any time.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Sturdy Build</strong>: Reinforced legs for stability on various surfaces.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Compatibility</strong>: Works with most smartphones and cameras for broad usability.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Easy Bluetooth Pairing</strong>: Simple connection process with smartphones.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Ideal for Content Creators</strong>: Perfect for vlogging, photography, and video recording.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>1700mm adjustable height for versatile shooting angles.</li>\r\n 	<li>Bluetooth remote control for hands-free operation.</li>\r\n 	<li>Easy Bluetooth pairing with smartphones.</li>\r\n 	<li>Reinforced tripod legs for added stability.</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with smartphones and cameras.</li>\r\n 	<li>Perfect for vlogging, photography, and group selfies.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 3499, 2399, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:51:44', '2025-05-12 15:40:44', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(120, 'Login LT-N25 Free Style Wireless Neckband', 'login-lt-n25-free-style-wireless-neckband', 13, 48, '<h2>Login LT-N25 Free Style Wireless Neckband Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\nThe Login LT-N25 Free Style Wireless Neckband is the perfect audio accessory for anyone seeking comfort, convenience, and reliable sound quality on the go. Designed with a sleek and ergonomic style, this wireless neckband offers hands-free functionality, making it ideal for workouts, commutes, or casual use throughout the day.\r\n\r\nOne of the key highlights of the Login LT-N25 is its Bluetooth 5.3 technology. With this advanced Bluetooth version, users can experience a strong and stable wireless connection within a range of up to 10 meters. Whether you\'re moving around the house or out for a jog, the seamless connection ensures that your music or calls stay uninterrupted.\r\n\r\nThe <strong>auto pairing</strong> feature adds convenience, allowing the neckband to automatically connect to your device as soon as it’s powered on. This makes setup quick and hassle-free, especially for those who switch between devices frequently. The Login LT-N25 is compatible with both <strong>Android and iOS devices</strong>, offering broad compatibility that fits into any lifestyle.\r\n\r\nDesigned for long-lasting use, the neckband is powered by a 200mAh battery, providing up to <strong>3-4 hours of playtime</strong> on a single charge. This makes it ideal for extended music sessions, long phone calls, or a day\'s worth of casual listening. Plus, with just <strong>1 hour of charging time</strong>, the Login LT-N25 is ready to go whenever you are.\r\n\r\nFor those who take calls on the go, the neckband comes equipped with a built-in microphone. You can enjoy clear, hands-free calling with ease, making it suitable for both professional and personal use. Whether you’re at the gym or working from home, you’ll stay connected without the need for a handheld device.\r\n\r\nThough the Login LT-N25 does not feature <strong>noise cancellation</strong> or <strong>water resistance</strong>, its lightweight design and reliable performance make it a solid choice for users who value simplicity and functionality. This neckband is tailored for users who need a budget-friendly, dependable wireless headset for everyday tasks.\r\n<h3>Features of Login LT-N25 Free Style Wireless Neckband:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth Version 5.3</strong>: Strong wireless connection up to 10 meters</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Auto Pairing</strong>: Automatic connection with your device</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Playtime</strong>: Up to 3-4 hours on a single charge</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Charging Time</strong>: Fully charged in 1 hour</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Battery Capacity</strong>: 200mAh for extended usage</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Microphone</strong>: Built-in for hands-free calls</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Compatibility</strong>: Works with both Android and iOS devices</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nDespite lacking water resistance or noise-canceling features, the Login LT-N25 focuses on delivering essential features that make it an excellent option for budget-conscious consumers looking for reliable audio performance.\r\n\r\nThe lightweight design of the neckband ensures all-day comfort, making it a great option for extended wear. Its <strong>Bluetooth 5.3</strong> technology not only offers faster and more stable connections but also reduces latency, ensuring smooth and lag-free audio during gaming or video watching.\r\n\r\nThe Login LT-N25 Free Style Wireless Neckband is ideal for individuals who prioritize functionality and affordability over premium features. Whether you\'re listening to music, taking calls, or watching your favorite content, this neckband provides the essentials without unnecessary frills.\r\n\r\nFor users who are constantly on the move, the <strong>auto pairing</strong> function ensures that your neckband is always ready when you are, while the compact design makes it easy to carry around without any inconvenience. Its reliable <strong>Bluetooth range of 10 meters</strong> gives users the freedom to move around without being tethered to their devices.\r\n\r\nThe built-in <strong>microphone</strong> makes the Login LT-N25 an excellent choice for hands-free calling, allowing users to handle their calls efficiently whether they\'re at home, in the office, or on the road.', '<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth 5.3</strong>: Offers stable wireless connection up to 10 meters</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Battery Life</strong>: 200mAh capacity delivers 3-4 hours of playtime</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Auto Pairing</strong>: Quickly connects with your device for convenience</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Microphone</strong>: Built-in for hands-free calls</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Compatibility</strong>: Works with both Android and iOS devices</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Charging Time</strong>: Fully charged in just 1 hour</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 8747, 3499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:51:44', '2025-09-29 18:32:35', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(121, 'Crown S10 10+1 Smart Watch', 'crown-s10-10-1-smart-watch', 11, 58, '<h2>Crown S10 10+1 Smart Watch</h2>\nThe <strong>Crown S10 10+1 Smart Watch</strong> is an impressive addition to your tech collection, blending style, functionality, and advanced health monitoring features. Designed for individuals who lead an active lifestyle, this smartwatch offers an array of capabilities that cater to fitness enthusiasts and casual users alike.\n<h4>Stylish Design and Comfort</h4>\nWith a sleek and modern design, the Crown S10 10+1 Smart Watch features a durable silicon strap that ensures comfort during prolonged wear. Its lightweight build makes it ideal for daily use, whether you\'re at the office, working out at the gym, or enjoying a leisurely stroll. The IP67 water-resistant rating adds to its appeal, allowing you to wear it during various activities without the worry of water damage.\n<h4>Key Features</h4>\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth Calling:</strong> Stay connected on the go with Bluetooth calling functionality. You can receive and make calls directly from your wrist, providing convenience during busy moments.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Voice Assistant:</strong> The smartwatch integrates seamlessly with your smartphone’s voice assistant, allowing you to control functions hands-free. This feature enhances your user experience, making it easier to manage tasks while multitasking.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Multiple Sports Modes:</strong> The Crown S10 10+1 is equipped with multiple sports modes, enabling you to track your performance across various activities. Whether you’re running, cycling, or engaging in gym workouts, this smartwatch helps you monitor your progress effectively.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Health Monitoring Features</h4>\nHealth is paramount, and the Crown S10 10+1 Smart Watch takes this seriously. It includes an array of health monitoring features designed to keep you informed about your wellness:\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Heart Rate Monitor:</strong> Keep track of your heart rate in real-time, helping you maintain optimal levels during workouts and daily activities.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Calories Burned Tracker:</strong> Monitor the calories you burn throughout the day, assisting you in managing your fitness goals effectively.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Sleep Quality Monitor:</strong> Gain insights into your sleep patterns with the sleep quality monitoring feature, helping you understand your rest cycles and improve your sleep habits.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Step Tracker:</strong> Track your daily steps effortlessly, motivating you to stay active and achieve your fitness targets.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Oxygen Level Monitoring:</strong> The smartwatch also includes an oxygen level monitoring feature, ensuring you can keep tabs on your overall health status.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Connectivity</h4>\nThe Crown S10 10+1 Smart Watch utilizes Bluetooth version 5.0 for seamless connectivity with your devices. This ensures a stable connection while providing a reliable user experience. Although it doesn’t feature GPS, the smartwatch effectively tracks your activities using your smartphone’s GPS functionality.\n<h4>Display and Battery Life</h4>\nThe smartwatch boasts a TFT display with a generous screen size of 49mm, making it easy to view notifications, messages, and fitness data. While the battery capacity specifics aren’t disclosed, the smartwatch is designed to offer smart battery life, ensuring you stay connected throughout your daily routines without frequent recharging.\n<h4>Why Choose the Crown S10 10+1 Smart Watch?</h4>\nWhen you decide to <strong>buy the Crown S10 10+1 Smart Watch</strong>, you are investing in a device that not only elevates your style but also enriches your health and fitness journey. This smartwatch is designed to complement your lifestyle, offering both elegance and utility.\n\nThe <strong>Crown S10 10+1 Smart Watch</strong> is available for purchase across various online stores in Pakistan. You can compare specifications and features before making a purchase to ensure it meets your expectations. With its competitive features and stylish design, this smartwatch stands out among others in the market, making it an excellent choice for anyone looking to enhance their tech collection.\n\nIn conclusion, the Crown S10 10+1 Smart Watch is a reliable companion for those who prioritize health, connectivity, and style. With features that cater to a wide range of users, from fitness enthusiasts to professionals, this smartwatch is a versatile addition to your lifestyle.', '<ul>\n 	<li>Stylish and comfortable silicon strap</li>\n 	<li>Bluetooth calling for hands-free convenience</li>\n 	<li>Integrated voice assistant for easy management</li>\n 	<li>Multiple sports modes to track fitness activities</li>\n 	<li>Advanced health monitoring (heart rate, calories, sleep quality, steps, oxygen level)</li>\n 	<li>IP67 water-resistant design for durability</li>\n 	<li>TFT display with a 49mm screen for clear visibility</li>\n 	<li>Bluetooth version 5.0 for seamless connectivity</li>\n</ul>', 1, 50, 5999, 3499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:53:04', '2025-04-22 11:44:51', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(122, 'Login LT-W2 HORIZON', 'login-lt-w2-horizon', 11, 48, '<h2>Login LT-W2 HORIZON Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\nIf you\'re someone who loves technology as well as fashionable gadgets that amp up your style then the Login LT-W2 HORIZON smartwatch is the perfect option for you. It is designed beautifully with an all encompassing 1.96 inch screen having an AMOLED touch with a resolution of 410x502 pixels that allows the user to navigate through the watch smoothly. Furthermore it comes attached with a zinc alloy body which is both light and durable adding to its benefits. Ranging in colors of Starlight and classic Black, this watch weighs only 47 grams making it suitable for every occasion.\r\n\r\nThe Login LT-W2 HORIZON also makes mobile calling a feature, allowing users to design their watch around their contacts throughout the day. You have the capability of answering calls, managing your call logs, and saving your contacts. On top of all that, the watch does support basic messaging apps which come in handy for those who love being connected around the clock allowing you to answer messages while you work out.\r\n\r\nThis watch is custom designed for those who love being active and outdoors. It does this through heart rate and blood pressure monitoring systems which help the user stay focused. You can also add on lifestyle tracking as it keeps record of the calories burnt, the distance runs and even the number of steps taken. For a more ‘women friendly’ touch it has additional female health reminders to keep them on track. In addition, the watch really helps support people with various body types as it has over 100 custom workout modes to reshape your body the way you want.\r\n\r\nThe Login LT-W2 HORIZON employs Bluetooth 5.3 for wireless connections and is embedded with Jieli JL7013 for efficiency. The app that goes with the watch allows users to connect with Android 5.1 and further versions as well as iOS versions upwards from version 8.0. Through this app, data can be synced and additional features like message notifications, daily use tracking, and custom dials can be set.\r\n\r\nWith its other features, the Login LT-W2 HORIZON also has routine carrying features making it multifunctional. It has a voice assistant, controls for music and a camera, a stopwatch, alarm clock, weather updates, and finally a calculator. The watch has AMOLED display that makes it user friendly to use even in harsh direct sunlight.\r\n\r\nI\'m sure, it\'s safe to say that this smart watch\'s IP68 rating makes it resistant to water and dust which makes it appealing to users who want to wear it in different environments. In optimal conditions, you can use this device for anywhere between 3 to 15 days depending on whether or not you are actually actively using the watch. Since this smartwatch is wirelessly charged, it takes roughly 90 minutes for it to fully charge which is great since it means less downtimes.\r\n\r\nThe Login LT-W2 HORIZON has been designed to be a fashionable yet practical smartwatch. Its smartwatch features are suitable for both an active and leisurely lifestyle. Thanks to its adoption across different languages and its user-friendliness, this smartwatch is ideal for a user who’s looking for a dependable wearable gadget at a reasonable price.', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>Sleek, lightweight design in Starlight and Black</li>\r\n 	<li>2X Extra Belt</li>\r\n 	<li>1.96” AMOLED touch screen, 410×502 resolution</li>\r\n 	<li>Bluetooth calling with call history and contact storage</li>\r\n 	<li>Health monitoring: heart rate, oxygen, blood pressure, sleep, and women\'s health reminders</li>\r\n 	<li>100+ sports modes, pedometer, distance, and calorie tracking</li>\r\n 	<li>IP68 water and dust resistance</li>\r\n 	<li>Powered by Jieli JL7013 chip with Bluetooth 5.3</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with Da Fit app on Android 5.1+ and iOS 8.0+</li>\r\n 	<li>300mAh battery lasts 3-5 days, wireless charging in 1.5 hours</li>\r\n 	<li>Extra features: calculator, weather, alarm, voice assistant, music, and photo control</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 17500, 9399, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:53:04', '2025-05-12 13:37:13', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(123, 'Login LT-WB6 Earbuds', 'login-lt-wb6-earbuds', 13, 60, '<h3 class=\"h2\">Login LT-WB6 Earbuds Price In Pakistan</h3>\nLogin LT-WB6 Earbuds mark the beginning of a new epoch in the history of wireless audio. It guarantees no compromise on sound quality as well as pairing efficiency for the mobile users. The Active Noise Cancellation (ANC) and Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC) features makes sure that nothing disturb you while you engage in music or during calls. The Login LT-WB6 Earbuds works well with both Android and iOS devices and is well suited for commuters, fitness lovers, and everyone who is looking for high-quality wireless audio.\n\nThese earbuds operate on Bluetooth 5.3 technology at which delivers a pleasantly stable and fast pairing across a distance of ten meters. This Bluetooth version also takes care of smooth connections, thus no hiccups when listening to your favourite songs or making phone calls. It also has an auto-pairing option that competently pairs two devices automatically eliminating the trouble of manual pairing.\n\nWith the Login LT-WB6 Earbuds, users can now take calls without taking out their handsets thanks to the built-in microphone. Moreover, Enhanced Noise Compensation (ENC) technology boosts the quality of calls by suppressing outside noise – your voice is what’s prevalent even in density populated areas. This technology is very useful for those who answer calls while on the go or in bustling locations.\n\nWhile outside and needing a quick recharge, you can use their case designed to hold a 200mAh battery. These earbuds boast an impressive 20+ hours of battery life and recharge in 1.5 hours, making it perfect for long and active days. During normal use, it isn’t hard to get more than 6 hours of usage, so powering these devices is not an issue at all. To make things easier, you can put them in a case during transport that fits in your pocket or bag, providing you with lightweight storage.\n\nThe Login LT-WB6 focuses on earbud comfort/purchase with durable materials that can last long. Placing orders currently allows you the opportunity to get some music-friendly lightweight earplug without difficulty. While the earbuds are effective for indoor use, they do have struggles when it comes to outdoor performance. As an alternative, these won’t rust on exposure but will degrade gradually. It isn’t hard to see them lasting in moisture and damp locations for a decent amount of time.\n\nIn addition of music and calls, the Login LT-WB6 Earbuds are crafted for convenience as they can be used with iOS and Android seamlessly. They integrate with mainstream mobile operating systems, thus ensuring easy access with almost all of the smartphones and tablets existing in the market. In addition to the above, the touch controls can be used to play or pause a song, raise or lower the volume, or take a call which is efficient and makes it hands free.\n\nFocusing on accessibility with an aspect of quality, Login LT-WB6 Earbuds are one of the most affordable wireless earbuds that come with premium features enabling the users to get the best quality audio without having to break the bank. These wireless earbuds can appeal to a wide range of markets- right from average consumers to professional users who want a mic with clear quality during their calls. For those students living in Pakistan, or elsewhere who are looking for something for both entertainment and work, the Login LT-WB6 Earbuds are a good option as for the price they offer great sound quality.', '<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Advanced Noise Cancellation</strong>: Active Noise Cancellation (ANC) and Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC) for clear audio.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Stable Bluetooth Connectivity</strong>: Bluetooth 5.3 ensures stable connections within 10 meters.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Hands-Free Calling</strong>: Built-in mic with ENC for improved call clarity.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Extended Battery Life</strong>: 3-4 hours of playtime per charge, up to 6 hours with case recharge.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Quick Recharge</strong>: 1.5 hours for a full charge via the compact charging case.</li>\n 	<li><strong>User-Friendly</strong>: Auto-pairing, touch controls, and Android/iOS compatibility for easy use.</li>\n</ul>', 1, 50, 10498, 5149, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:53:04', '2025-04-23 13:32:41', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(124, 'Login LT-X Series Wireless Speaker', 'login-lt-x-series-wireless-speaker', 4, 48, '<h2>Login LT-X Series Wireless Speaker Price In Pakistan</h2>\nThere is a series of three wireless speakers developed by Login branded Login LT-X that is meant for use by more sophisticated audiences. This makes them most suitable for gamers, music lovers, and maybe people who just appreciate sound quality. The Login LT-X Series features stunning two-way speakers boasting great treble and bass response and defines itself as compact and elegant. The speaker system comes with two separate speakers that reproduce every low beat, every pulse, and each sound crisp sufficiently.\n\nWith their specific designs Login LT-X Series Wireless Speaker is ready for both indoor and outdoor settings as it is lightweight which makes it easy to carry as well as site. You can use it around your house, in your friend’s house or a picnic at a park and not have to worry as the sound quality would still be the same alongside the compact nature of the speaker. Its modernistic style enables it to easily fit any environment whether it’s a chic apartment or any small gatherings of family or friends.\n\nThe LT-X Series incorporates a unique twin speaker arrangement to offer an in depth audio listening experience. Be it movie watching, gaming, or enjoying your playlist, this wireless twin speaker ensures that all sounds are clear and robust. This nicely balanced audio stereo output is optimal for a plethora of musical genres hence perfect for any sound expert.\n\nLogin LT-X Series is a wireless Bluetooth speaker which can be easily connected to multiple devices like mobile phones, tablets, laptops amongst others. This convenient wireless feature surely adds to the convenience of the user by allowing them to enjoy audio without having to be tied down with a cable and losing sound’s quality whilst moving around. The Bluetooth range limits does not impede the functionality because the music and audio can still be modified from afar.\n\nWhile creating the LT-X Series, emphasis was laid on performance and durability, and this is the reason for its long lasting battery which means you won’t have to often recharge it. It makes for a great device for almost any small functions, family event or even for personal listening, where no interruption can be tolerated during music or audio playback.So you can have a few hours of entertainment with no interruptions – stay with painting, crying films or gaming.\n\nThis speaker produces a clear and equally sounding audio regardless of the sound volume. This means that any sound can be reproduced and its audible without distortion. The speaker login LT X Series Wireless has an impressive treble, mid, and bass balance which makes the speaker an all-purpose one. Its small size enables it to be placed on most surfaces be it a desk, a shelf or an outdoor table without consuming much space.\n\nThis wireless speaker has an easy to use interface which facilitates its ease of usage and allows users to control the volume, skip songs and play songs more conveniently. In case a user cherishes both style and audio the speaker reasonably compliments contemporary design along with great sound quality.\n\nIn summary, the Login LT-X Series Wireless Speaker is perfect for those who want a lightweight design without compromising sound quality. Thanks to its dual speakers, you can enjoy good audio during your favorite music and movie sessions. It is also a compact speaker with Bluetooth features and long-lasting battery life, which is an essential requirement for present-day consumers. This speaker has the audio performance required for the house, social events, and even personal use while also fitting well with the interior of any room.', '<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Rich Audio</strong>: Twin speakers deliver clear, immersive sound quality for music, movies, and gaming.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Compact Design</strong>: Sleek and portable, perfect for indoor or outdoor