(125, 'LOGIN Gamers Earbuds (LT-GB20)', 'lt-gb20-gaming-earbuds', 13, 48, '<h2>LT-GB20 Gaming Earbuds</h2>\nThe LT-GB20 Gaming Earbuds are made to ensure that your ears live through an entirely different level of gaming that can be termed as professional. These in ear gaming earbuds provide an astonishing level of sound detail so that every sound detail is comprehensible. Be it planning your next move in an online match where multiple people are playing or going through an offline campaign on your own, LT-GB20s embedded speakers will make sure that you are always in the zone.\n\nWith an integration of 5.3 Bluetooth version, the gaming earbuds are very reliable and have a superb connection so that the audio does not glitch even in the most intense of gaming sessions. These transmitters have a distance of 15 meters enabling you with complete movement freedom along with top-quality sound for a wire free experience and enables more concentration on the game.Kindly note that this information is highly dynamic which is prone to changes. The Bluetooth chip AC6983 improves connection stability and lowers latency so that sound and graphics are in sync at all times.\n\nLT-GB20 earbuds will be a great companion while gaming and they will provide you up to 5 hours of playtime along when combined with the charging case, you get a total of 40 hours. Both the earbuds consist of a 25mAh battery and the case which has a capacity of 200mAh can also charge them quickly so you are ready for your next session. The battery of the earbuds is completely charged in 1.5 hours while the case gets recharged in only 2 hours. Such battery performance makes LT-GB20 a perfect fit for everyday gaming sessions, working out, or simply listening to music.\n\nThe LT-GB20 gaming earbuds are comfortable on the ears as well. These earbuds are in the ear type so they stay inside the ear comfortably and don’t cause pain even when worn for longer durations. The users can also control the volume directly from the earbud owing to an embedded volume control function. This feature is exclusively suitable for gamers as it allows them to change sound settings without having to pause the game.\n\nThe LT-GB20 Earbuds do have built-in microphones for voiceover communication during multiplayer games so as to speak easily with the other members of the team. Its microphone quality guarantees the ideal transmission of your voice, which makes it possible to coordinate the team effort effectively. You will be heard over the sound, whether you are discussing strategies with your teammates or simply talking to your friend, for these earbuds will do the job without any noise or disturbances.\n\nBut this is not only suitable for gaming, of course; it’s also perfect for music, movies, and even phone calls. Thanks to the deep bass and a great sound profile, the content sounds terrific, no matter what it is. The black color is very classy, and the design allows wearing them during the gaming session, at the gym, or even at the office.\n\nLT-GB20 Gaming Earbuds are 39.5g, which is as lightweight as it gets, comfortable to wear for long hours. They are designed to sit snugly within your ears so that you have adequate comfort as well as stability while you listen for extended periods. With a clean bean design, these earbuds not only serve their purpose but also look good.\n\nTo summarize, we can say that the LT-GB20 Gaming Earbuds are aimed at individuals seeking sound performance and comfort as well as conveniences. The LT-GB20, which comes with Bluetooth 5.3, solid battery life, and a gamer’s features, makes these earbuds worthy of every single use. For gaming, music, or simply for daily use, LT-GB20s do the job perfectly and will suit anyone in search of good wireless earphones that excel in gaming as well.', '<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Precision Audio</strong>: Crystal-clear sound quality tailored for an immersive gaming experience.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth 5.3</strong>: Reliable, low-latency connection with up to 15 meters of wireless range.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Long Battery Life</strong>: 5 hours playtime, 40 hours standby with the 200mAh charging case.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Comfortable Fit</strong>: Lightweight, in-ear design for extended wear.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Built-In Microphone</strong>: Clear audio for seamless team communication.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Stylish Design</strong>: Sleek black finish that complements any setup.</li>\n</ul>', 1, 0, 7998, 3199, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:53:04', '2025-04-29 10:00:21', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(126, 'LT-SB20 - Wireless Soundbar', 'lt-sb20-wireless-soundbar', 4, 48, '<h2>LT-SB20 Wireless Soundbar Price In Pakistan</h2>\nThe LT-SB20 Wireless Soundbar is an exceptional sound solution that lets you redefine how you enjoy your home entertainment systems. Its soundbar technology makes it able to provide hi-fi sound reproduction that captures all the audio nuances clearly and sufficiently which can be useful whether during a movie time, music time, or game time. The LT-SB20 has been designed such that it immerses the users with warm sound and enhances movies with undeniably impressive sound reproduction right in their sitting rooms.\n\nThe LT-SB20 soundbar uses Bluetooth 5.0 which makes it easy for users to stream their favorite content wirelessly and connect their devices to their soundbar without much hassle. When using a smart phone or a smart TV to stream information, LT-SB20 is capable of keeping the sound clear and in sync with the video even while positioned away from the device. For an effortless connection that is almost 10 meters long, it is optimal to perform sound transmission without connecting wires.\n\nThe technology called the true bass in the LT-SB20 soundbar offers some excellent deep low frequency sounds which can be very useful for an outstanding listening experience and also incorporates an exciting movie watching time. The rich bass of this soundbar completes its Hi-Fi sounding overall audio and helps create a true sound stage allowing you to hear each note and every sound in the room easily as the sounds are well balanced.\n\nThe LT-SB20 soundbar is a great fit for almost any room aesthetic with its elegant and refined appearance. The soundbar measuring only 65mm in height can be positioned directly in front of your television, or placed on the wall, conserving space whilst providing strong audio performance. The use of contemporary design assists in not only space-efficient design but also expands options for placement in different configurations.\n\nThe LT-SB20’s Wireless Soundbar has a very basic and simple interface where users can easily control volume, bass and treble levels of the speaker without much hassle. For convenience, it also comes with support for remote controls so audio settings can be adjusted without moving from the sitting area. Such controls are intuitive and ensure the LT-SB20 could be used even by the youngest family members without stress.\n\nThe LT-SB20 soundbar is very attractive because of its versatility.With ease, the soundbar can connect to smartphones, smart TVs, notebooks, tablets, and PCs. Because of this, it is appropriate for a variety of settings, such as while watching a film, listening to a podcast, or simply playing a game. Thanks to the soundbar\'s excellent technology, all of the formats may coexist without any flaws regardless of the source.\n\nYes, the LT-SB20 performs remarkably well but it is also energy efficient and ideal for long-term use. When the soundbar is not in use, it switches to standby mode which saves power and increases its operational longevity. For those who love to use their soundbar for long periods, this is a great feature that decreases wear and keeps the system in good condition for a number of years.\n\nTo conclude, the LT-SB20 Wireless Soundbar is an ultimate entertainment tool where users can enhance their home entertainment experience. Offering true bass technology along with Bluetooth 5.0 connectivity and an elegant design, the device guarantees an upgrade within its bloodline when it comes to the listening experience. You are at the right place; if the movie night is made more interesting, the favorite playlist is being played, or the LT-SB20 soundbar is experiencing great times while podcasting, the soundbar does deliver sound that enhances every experience. In search of style, efficient use and good sound? This soundbar is the solution you are looking for and if it is combined with any modern home cinema system it becomes a fantastic option for any modern home.', '<ul>\n 	<li><strong>High-Fidelity Sound</strong>: Crisp and dynamic audio for immersive home entertainment.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth 5.0</strong>: Stable wireless connection up to 10 meters for easy streaming.</li>\n 	<li><strong>True Bass Technology</strong>: Deep bass for enhanced sound quality in movies and music.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Compact Design</strong>: Slim profile fits easily into any setup, with wall-mounting option.</li>\n 	<li><strong>User-Friendly Controls</strong>: Simple volume and sound adjustments, with remote control support.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Wide Compatibility</strong>: Pairs with smart TVs, mobile phones, tablets, and more.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Energy Efficient</strong>: Power-saving mode when not in use for extended durability.</li>\n</ul>', 1, 0, 11498, 4499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:53:04', '2025-04-23 11:38:25', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0);
