s to charge their devices effectively. It has an excellent design, ample protection, as well as speed and is surely going to meet the demands of its users for a long time to come. Use LOGIN for faster charging and know that you are using an excellent product.', '<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Fast Charging</strong>: 2.4A output for quick power delivery</li>\n 	<li><strong>Durable Design</strong>: Built to withstand daily use</li>\n 	<li><strong>Ergonomic Tip</strong>: Easy to plug and unplug without hassle</li>\n 	<li><strong>Flat Cable Design</strong>: Prevents tangling and twisting</li>\n 	<li><strong>Versatile Compatibility</strong>: Works with a wide range of devices</li>\n</ul>', 1, 0, 1747, 699, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:53:04', '2025-04-29 10:03:50', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
