equire good audio on daily basis.\n\nDurable and Flexible Build The LT-H9 construction uses high elastic wire which adds to its durability and flexibility. This wire is specially constructed to be rugged and its high elasticity avoids tangling and damage allowing you to enjoy your audio in peace. These earphones are built to withstand a lot of wear and tear. You can either be throwing them in your bag or wearing them while working out. Perfect for Music Lovers To music lovers, the LT-H9 Handsfree 3.5mm is not just another device, it is a device that allows you to enjoy sound in its natural state.\n\nWhether you are listening to the latest songs or your favorite tracks, the earphones ensure that sound is of high quality where every song is well amplified. The combination of comfort, sound and durability makes them the best selection for those who cherish audio experience. Versatile and User-Friendly The LT-H9 is flexible as it is multifunctional as it is intended that it can be used together with almost all devices that have the 3.5mm audio jack. This means while you may want to use your smartphone, tablet, laptop or any other compatible device, the LT-H9 can easily be connected. Such a design is very friendly making it possible to use various devices within a very short time making it ideal for a person with a number of gadgets.\n<h2>Conclusion</h2>\nTo sum up, the LT-H9 Handsfree 3.5mm from Login Smart Technology is incomparable with any other product when it comes to audio comprehension. With its micro crystal clear sound, ergonomic design, and durable build, these handsfree earphones can be described as a universal product catering for the needs of both very active and not that enthusiastic music lovers. Do enhance your audio encounters for such is the LT-H9. Wonder and be surrounded by the quality sound which can transform any everyday activity.', '<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Micro Crystal Clear Sound</strong>: Exceptional audio quality for an immersive experience</li>\n 	<li><strong>Thunder Sound</strong>: Powerful bass for music enthusiasts</li>\n 	<li><strong>Lightweight Design</strong>: Comfortable for prolonged wear</li>\n 	<li><strong>High-Definition Speaker</strong>: Delivers clear sound quality</li>\n 	<li><strong>High Elastic Wire</strong>: Durable and flexible for easy handling</li>\n 	<li><strong>Ergonomic Fit</strong>: Designed for comfort during extended use</li>\n</ul>', 1, 0, 5373, 2099, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:53:04', '2025-04-29 10:00:02', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(131, 'LT-P1 Cooling Fan Power Bank', 'lt-p1-cooling-fan-power-bank', 10, 48, '<h2>LT-P1 Cooling Fan Power Bank Price In Pakistan</h2>\nLOGIN LT-P1 Cooling Fan Power Bank is an innovative accessory which incorporates power and comfort at a certain level in a small device. This is made especially for gamers or persons always on the go. LT-P1 has an integrated fan which allows for comfortable TO use and can efficiently power a device with its 5000mAh battery. Therefore, it is great for using on outdoor activities, travelling or everyday use.\n<h2>5000mAh Battery Power for All day Charging.</h2>\nLOGIN LT-P1 uses a lithium polymer battery with a massive capacity of 5000mAh. The lithium polymer battery is designed in such a way that a user can recharge a majority of their electronic devices and can now carry their FP/Fpads or smartphones seamlessly. A smartphone or any device this mobile power battery will power is compatible with USB interfaces so that they can be connected. It provides peace-of-mind and helps people as mobile devices are easily recharged for long hours and one would never be disabled in crucial moments.\n<h2>Cooling Fan for the Worst of Weather Conditions</h2>\nA mosts outstanding feature is the integrated cooling fan that the LT-P1 is equipped with. It is a good idea to have a fan when it hot or when you are engaged in physically exhausting tasks as it will provide you with a cooling breeze. The fan is best for summer days, hot outings, and even crowded areas where you can not avoid heat and the device is still charging. For active people who wish to warm themselves while charging a fan that also serves as a power bank is great.\n<h2>Lightweight and Portable</h2>\nIt’s easy to stow in a bag, backpack, or even a pocket because of the small size and light weight of the LOGIN LT-P1 Cooling Fan Power Bank. Its attention to detail means you can always have it with you without bothersome bulk. This is particularly beneficial for backpackers outdoors and those who spend a lot of time outside. Just throw it in with the other important items and go out without fear of running out of power and cooling to the device.\n<h2>Versatile and User-friendly</h2>\nThe LOGIN fan power bank is meant to be attractive and easy for the user to operate. It has a USB output and supports smartphones, tablets, wearables, etc. The easy-to-use interface of the power bank allows users to bring any device and plug it in without any hassle for charging while the fan runs quietly and smoothly. The LT-P1 is perfect for anyone who wants to charge their devices while being on the move and also being comfortable at the same time.\n<h2>Perfect for Camping</h2>\nThe fans that the LOGIN LT-P1 Cooling Fan Power Bank is a must when you are on the move. It’s dual usage is very useful and convenient. If you are at a concert, trekking, or even camping, this shy-type power bank with a fan will not only provide power to devices, but relief from a hot summer day. The LT-P1 makes it possible to stay in touch and look great at the same time, making it ideal for summer excursions and trips.\n\nDurable Build for Everyday Use Built with quality materials, the LT-P1 is designed to withstand daily wear and tear. The durable design will surely be dependable for most active users, since it can bear strenuous activities and tough environments. And no matter how you use it, whether it’s a hot train ride, a camping trip or just for backup power, you can always depend on the LT-P1 to withstand any situation.\n\nEnvironmentally Friendly Power Solution The LOGIN LT-P1 Cooling Fan Power Bank has distinguishing features apart from its functional properties in that it aids the environment by decreasing the amount of fans and extra power it requires. Because of this, it is very efficient as it wastes less and uses extra energy, and is suitable for eco-friendly customers.\n\nWhy Choose the LOGIN LT-P1 Cooling Fan Power Bank? LOGIN LT-P1 Cooling Fan Power Bank is a multipurpose fan power bank that allows consumers to keep cool and stay charge throughout the day. Having an efficient design and with a 5000mAh battery integrated with a fan, even active users can rely on it. This is handy a fan power bank for hot days outside or for people who need back up.', '<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Dual Functionality</strong>: 5000mAh power bank with a built-in cooling fan</li>\n 	<li><strong>Portable &amp; Lightweight</strong>: Compact for easy carrying during outdoor activities</li>\n 	<li><strong>Cooling Relief</strong>: Built-in fan offers a refreshing breeze when needed</li>\n 	<li><strong>USB Charging</strong>: Compatible with various devices for quick, portable charging</li>\n 	<li><strong>Ideal for Hot Days</strong>: Essential for staying cool and powered on the go</li>\n 	<li><strong>Durable Design</strong>: Sturdy build for daily use</li>\n</ul>', 1, 0, 9498, 3749, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:53:04', '2025-04-29 09:59:35', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(132, 'Audionic Boom Box 101 Speaker With Mic', 'audionic-boom-box-101-speaker-with-mic', 4, 43, '<h2>Audionic Boom Box 101 Speaker With Mic Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\nFor customers that strive for both quality audio and high adaptability in a portable device. This speaker has very nice sound with useful characteristics such as Bluetooth 5.3, SD card support, and an embedded mic, making it perfect for both indoor and outdoor activities. Having a strong and waterproof look and a quick charging Li-Po battery, the Boom Box 101 can take the party wherever you go.\r\n<h2>Rich Audio has many Uses</h2>\r\nWith such a large frequency response of 20Hz to 20,000Hz, Audionic Boom Box 101 offers precise highs, rich mids, and sturdy bass, thus producing a good listening experience. You can use it for a party, take it to leisure, or use it when you need good sound on the move. During all these scenarios, this speaker’s strong sound lets the listener enjoy every moment.\r\n\r\nThe Bluetooth 5.3 technology promises strong and efficient connections over a distance of ten meters. The Boom Box 101 Speaker integrates Bluetooth 5.3 that technology creates a fantastic streaming experience by minimizing signal loss. With Bluetooth 5.3 technology, connect to smartphones, tablets, or laptops effortlessly and listen to music or podcasts without being tangled in wires.\r\nAs for the Audionic Boom Box 101 Speaker, the built-in microphone makes it perfect for hands-free calling and voice commands. With such a function, the speaker can be used without the need to make interruptions to take any calls. You can talk to voice assistants and make calls with ease, making it a great addition to your devices.\r\n<h2>SD Card Usage to Have Music of One’s Choice</h2>\r\nIn addition to Bluetooth, the Audionic Boom Box 101 Speaker has SD card support and that enables you to play your favorite songs saved up in your SD card. People who do not wish to have their music online or would want to have a playlist ready without going through the hassle of connecting a device will find this option ideal for their needs. Just plug in your SD card and the speaker will start playing the music variable right away enhancing your listening options.\r\n<h2>Quick to Charge Li-Po Battery for Lots of Usage Hours</h2>\r\nWith a Li-Po battery that can get charged to its 100% level in 1.5 hours, the Boom Box 101 Speaker comes in with high powered lasting battery so that one can listen and not have to keep switching off for charging. This rapid charge battery has so less downtime that it is best suited for anyone who is constantly moving about. Whether a person is going on a vacation or an occasion is being hosted, the Boom Box 101 brings a steady battery life to sustain the adventure.\r\n<h2>The design is tough and waterproof so it can be used outdoors.</h2>\r\nThe Audionic Boom Wireless Bluetooth Speaker is solidified with reasonable expectation that the client will enjoy outside exercise with the boom. Its robust construction stands up to the elements so anywhere from the beach to the mountains, the speaker can be taken without worries. The built of the speaker is such that high-quality sound is produced regardless of whether indoors or outdoors.\r\n\r\n<strong>What’s thing that actually comes into mind that why Audionic Boom Boom Box 101 should be the first choice over other devices as mic supported speaker is?</strong>\r\n\r\nHowever, the Audionic Boom Box 101 Speaker With Mic is more than simply a speaker. It’s one of the modern Portable sound solution which can be used in a range of applications. Acoustic networking is possible with features like Bluetooth 5.3 making it pockets ease, SD card inputs allowing songs to be played upon request and as horizontal charging lithium battery which takes little time to get full, making it reference for everyone looking to ease their auditory system. Using the built-in microphone in the unit increases the scope of usage as hands free mode allows for departing phone calls and voice commands. On top of this, the unit is still sturdy, waterproof, and makes usage possible in both indoor and outdoor environments.\r\n\r\nThis strong and compact music speaker provides a solution to most issues of the music lovers of today. Take your music anywhere you go with Audionic Boom Box 101 Speaker With Mic which is practical and delivers great sound.', '<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>High-Quality Sound</strong>: Delivers rich, clear audio with a wide frequency range of 20Hz - 20,000Hz</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth 5.3</strong>: Stable connectivity with a 10m range for wireless streaming</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Built-In Mic</strong>: Ideal for hands-free calling and voice assistance</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>SD Card Compatibility</strong>: Easy access to your favorite music library</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Durable &amp; Waterproof</strong>: Built to withstand splashes, making it perfect for outdoor use</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Fast Charging</strong>: Li-Po battery charges in 1.5 hours for long-lasting performance</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 12000, 3499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:53:04', '2025-05-12 11:46:05', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(133, 'Vivo X100', 'vivo-x100', 2, 60, '<h2>Vivo X100 Price In Pakistan</h2>\nThe vivo X100 smart phone comes out fit for the fans of technology as well as fans of mobile photography. The vivo X100 offers a cutting-edge smartphone packed with great functionality, modern aesthetics and advanced capabilities.\n<h2>Fantastic Display</h2>\nThe vivo X100 manufacturers seem to understand its strong selling point, and that is the beauty of a large screen, this time at a whopping 6.78-inches with AMOLED technology. This display which has a resolution of 2800 x 1260 pixels is able to give excellent color saturation and contrast to give an invariably great experience be it browsing or gaming. The 120Hz refresh rate is high allowing for smooth interaction with the device while scrolling through favorites or playing fast paced games. Furthermore, The display is capable of 3000 nits peak brightness which helps in viewing the contents even in bright sunshine.\n<h2>Remarkable Performance That Leaves The User Satisfied</h2>\nThe Vivo X100 has a high chipset, the Dimensity 9300 processor, which is said to be formidable. This new chipset has been built using the 4nm process node. It’s a complete 8-core CPU architecture which incorporates high-performance and efficient cores of a maximum clock speed of 3.25 GHz. With 12 GB or 16 GB of RAM, there is no question about multitasking as it allows a user to juggle multiple demanding apps with switching with no lag. In addition to 256 GB or 512 GB UFS 4.0 storage, users purchase more than enough space for their apps, photos, and videos.\n<h2>Perfect Camera System</h2>\nPhotographs turn out to be one of the appealing features of the vivo X100. The rear camera setup incorporates a 50 MP main sensor, 50 MP ultra-wide and a 64 MP telephoto lens letting the users to take great images in different circumstances. And a 32 MP front facing camera takes care of selfies. The X100 comes with multiple scene modes, such as Night, Portrait, and Supermoon, making it easier to the users to get great photos in different lighting conditions. Such features as laser focusing and optical image stabilization further enhance the camera system for the ease of taking clear and sharp images.\n\nLong-lasting Battery Life With a capacity sufficient to maintain power all day, the vivo X100 is fitted with a 5000 mAh battery. But don\'t panic; the FlashCharge technology that comes with the device is 120W so topping up is never a problem. With this battery configuration, a balanced series connection design of dual cells is achieved. This enables performance as well as safety in such configurations.\n\nDurability and Design The vivo X100 is IP68 ready certified, dust and water are no longer a worry for users in different surroundings, which is fantastic. A glass back cover adds some sophistication to the device as it is 164.05 x 75.19 x 8.49 mm in size and weighs around 206g, making it easy to hold in hand.\n\nLatest Operating System Powered by Funtouch OS 14, which is constructed on Android 14, the vivo X100 does present a straightforward user experience that rewards customization options for the user while also giving a number of add-ons that increase overall productivity and entertainment.\n\nConnectivity Features Be online with Wi-Fi 6 and Wi-Fi 7 for great and seamless internet experience. Having Bluetooth 5.4, USB type C, the device is also compatible with NFC features for a range of easy transactions and data transfers.', '<div class=\"product-table\">\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Funtouch OS 14 based on Android 14</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dimensity 9300 with 8-core CPU (3.25 GHz + 2.85 GHz + 2.0 GHz)</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual SIM support</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Front 32 MP</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Rear 50 MP + 50 MP + 64 MP with various scene modes</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.78 inches AMOLED, 2800 x 1260 resolution, 120 Hz refresh rate</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh with 120W FlashCharge technology</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Options of 12 GB + 256 GB or 16 GB + 512 GB, LPDDR5X and UFS 4.0</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 1, 0, 210899, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:53:04', '2025-04-22 11:51:11', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(134, 'Vivo Y300', 'vivo-y300', 2, 60, '<h2>Vivo Y300 Price In Pakistan</h2>\nThe Vivo Y300 is a new budget 5G smartphone that is aimed at users who want appreciatable features without spending much of their budget on it.The smartphone was officially launched on 21st December 2024 and has quickly gained popularity in the mid-range market segment as we move into 2025. With its impressive features, it offers an exceptional experience for users who crave power, performance, and affordability. The device is designed to meet the needs of those seeking a balanced smartphone that delivers top-tier performance without breaking the bank. Whether it\'s for gaming, productivity, or everyday use, this smartphone continues to be a popular choice among tech enthusiasts and budget-conscious consumers in the new year.\n<h2>Vivo Y300 Display &amp; Design</h2>\nThe Vivo Y300 features a huge 6.78 inches AMOLED capacitive touchscreen with the pixel resolution of 1080 x 2400 which is quite high for pictures to be vivid. At a rate of 120 Hz, scrolling, gaming or video playbacks is practically smooth and fluid. The device does seem to delivers an immersive viewing experience and its pretty good for watching movies, playing games or even surfing the net. Deeper blacks and brighter colors are possible because the AMOLED technology directly improves brightness and contrast.\n<h2>Cameras.</h2>\nFor photography fans, the Vivo Y300 is not a letdown. It has a competent dual camera which consists of a 64MP main sensor and a 2MP sub sensor. This facility helps the users to shoot clear sharp images with accurate colors in different lighting conditions. The LED flash light enhances the possibilities further, enabling to take perfect images even in darkness. To the front of the device is a 16 MP selfie camera that offers bright clear selfies making it ideal for social media and video calls.\n<h2>Performance &amp; Processor.</h2>\nThe Vivo Y300 uses Qualcomm SM6375 Snapdragon 695 5G chip with 6nm process technology which guarantees smooth working and power efficiency. The processor is coupled with an Octa core CPU with a speed of 2.2 GHz which provides better multitasking. Be it browsing, gaming or running many applications at the same time, Vivo Y300 manages the task successfully. This device has 8 GB of RAM so fast app loading and swift switching of apps occurs without any hitches.\n<h2>Storage</h2>\nThe Vivo Y300 comes with an internal storage capacity of 128GB UFS 2.2 that should be enough to accommodate numerous applications, games and media files. Besides, it also has a memory card slot which adds to the maximum storage level. The UFS 2.2 technology has been developed as an improvement to the storage technology allowing for faster read and write levels that enhance better performance of the system consisting of faster app launches and variation of other tasks.\n<h2>Battery Life</h2>\nThe Vivo Y300 carries a gigantic capacity of a typical Li-ion battery of 5000mAh which is sufficient to last a whole day with heavy usage under one charge only. This large battery also lets you use the phone for a long time without thinking about charging it. It is quite beneficial and suitable for individuals with active mobile phone use and being up and about.\n<h2>Connectivity &amp; 5G Support</h2>\nThe Vivo Y300 is also a 5G enabled device and as such it has internet speed that guarantees an uninterrupted experience while browsing the web, streaming films as well as gaming. It is fully compatible with the new generation of 5G networks meaning that faster data rates and low lag are present. Be it 5G network for streaming HD videos or 5G capable mobile games with lots of performance Vivo Y300 gets the job done with very small delays.\n<h2>Conclusion</h2>\nThe Vivo Y300 is a feature-packed smartphone offered at an affordable price. The Y300 boasts 5G technology, excellent performance, a decent camera system, and good battery life. For those who depend heavily on their smartphones but are not willing to spend a fortune, the Vivo Y300 is ideal. The Y300 is also available in a variety of colors and has a big AMOLED screen, making it a great choice for budget-conscious buyers in Pakistan.', '<div class=\"product-table\">\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14 OS</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"> 128GB Built-in, 8GB RAM</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Camera: 64 MP, f/1.8, (wide), PDAF, OIS + 2 MP, f/2.4, (depth)</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">16 MP, f/2.0, (wide), Video (1080p@30fps)</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">2.2 Ghz Octa Core</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.78 Inches , AMOLED Capacitive Touchscreen, Multitouch</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"> (Li-Po Non removable), 5000 mAh</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 1, 0, 79999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:53:04', '2025-04-22 11:51:11', 'coming_soon\r', NULL, 0);
