(135, 'Vivo T3 Pro', 'vivo-t3-pro', 2, 60, '<h2>Vivo T3 Pro</h2>\r\nThe Vivo T3 Pro is a next-generation smartphone running on the Android operating system, targeting users who seek nothing short of great performance and top-notch features. Having been launched about january 2025, T3 Pro packs plenty of aggressive hardware, great camera functionalities and an impressive screen display. Constructed with modern aesthetics and great functionality detail, The Vivo T3 Pro should be able to accommodate most of your everyday activities with ease and most importantly enhance the media experience.\r\n<h2>Display and Design:</h2>\r\nThe Vivo T3 Pro features a larger screen measure 6.77 inches and is of the AMOLED technology which promises and delivers better and brighter colors. It is capable of supporting 1B colors and has a nifty 120Hz refresh rate making animations smoother and touch interactions more seamless and visual clear. With regards to the display, it has a peak brightness of 4500 nits, this will guarantee that even in the harshest sunlight the user will be able to view the screen without any problems. In its entirety the Schott Xensation glass will make the phone a lot more resilient to scratches as well as accidental drops. Its dimensions which are 163.7 x 75 x 7.5 mm also fully contributes to the phones attractiveness as it manages to weigh only 184g for a smart phone of this size.\r\n<h2>Performance and Storage:</h2>\r\nThe Vivo T3 Pro boasts the latest Qualcomm Snapdragon 7 Gen 3 processor manufactured using the latest 4nm technology. With a configuration which consists of a high performing octa-core CPU (1x2.63 GHz Cortex-A715, 3x2.4 GHz Cortex-A715 and 4x1.8 GHz Cortex-A510), this device is built for speed. With the Adreno 720 GPU, the Vivo T3 Pro is able to perform gaming, multitasking and other demanding operations with ease.\r\n\r\nThis smartphone has 2 options for storage which are 128GB and 256GB with 8GB of RAM both making use of UFS 2.2 interface. However, since the device does not have a microSD card slot, potential users must select the type of storage to purchase first since there won’t be the possibility for purchase expansion.\r\n<h2>Camera Features:</h2>\r\nTo capture images under different lighting and environmental conditions efficiently, the Vivo T3 Pro has an 8MP ultra-wide camera and a wide-angle camera that is 50MP. Images captured by the primary camera are stabilized thanks to OIS (Optical Image Stabilization) as well as fast and precise focusing made possible by PDAF (Phase Detection Autofocus). The T3 Pro can record 4K videos at frame rates of 30/60fps for excellent video quality.\r\n\r\nThe 16 MP selfie camera located on the front is equally sufficient to take high-quality selfies or video calls.The photos are good and detailed with good color even in low light situations as well.\r\n<h2>Battery Life and Charging:</h2>\r\nThe Vivo T3 Pro smartphone is powered by a 5500mAh non-removable battery which guarantees that the device can comfortably go a full day without dying with only one charge. Whether you are combating boredom browsing, streaming videos or gaming you will never ever run out of power. Battery is charged through 80W wired fast charging, meaning it only takes 21 minutes to charge it halfway and thus one spends less time charging and more time with their device. In addition, the T3 Pro has 7.5W reverse charging, which meaning you can provide other devices power.\r\n<h2>Additional Features:</h2>\r\nThe Vivo T3 Pro is a dual SIM device with nano-SIM slots which mean you can connect two networks whereby both can be used at the same time. Furthermore, the device has an IP64 rating, which means it’s dust and water resistant and can withstand daily spills and splashes.\r\n\r\nMore things happen with the Vivo T3 Pro, and it runs on Android 14 with Funtouch 14 in the background. And what’s more, with T3 Pro you’re offered latest Android updates, features and support for customization.\r\n\r\nAlso integrated in communication features are the Wi-Fi 802.11 a/b/g/n/ac, Bluetooth 5.4, GPS, USB Type-C 2.0 with OTG functions and stereo speakers that provide quality sound.\r\n<h2>Final Thoughts:</h2>\r\nIn summary, the Vivo T3 Pro is a great device and has a perfect balance of power, performance and features and the price is quite reasonable too. With its decent AMOLED display, high Snappdragon refreshing chipset, triple camera setup and fast charging, Vivo T3 Pro definitely is a good option for users looking to purchase a feature loaded smartphone. Be it mobile gamers, camera buffs or average users who need a smartphone that could literally do everything, Vivo T3 Pro has been made keeping them in mind.', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14, up to 2 major Android upgrades, Funtouch 14</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">128GB 8GB RAM, 256GB 8GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">50 MP, f/1.8, (wide), 1/1.95\", 0.8µm, PDAF, OIS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">8 MP, f/2.2, 120˚ (ultrawide)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual SIM (Nano-SIM, dual stand-by)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Octa-core (1x2.63 GHz Cortex-A715 &amp; 3x2.4 GHz Cortex-A715 &amp; 4x1.8 GHz Cortex-A510)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.77 inches, AMOLED, 1B colors, 120Hz, 4500 nits (peak)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Li-Ion 5500 mAh, non-removable</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 80000, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:53:04', '2025-07-30 14:40:53', 'coming_soon', NULL, 0),
(136, 'Realme 13', 'realme-13', 2, 53, '<h3 class=\"h2\">Realme 13 Price In Pakistan</h3>\nBest described as a sophisticated device, the Realme 13 is among the latest 5G smartphones to hit the market. Its launch date is January 2025. The phone has impressive specifications and comes in a stylish design. It has dimensions measuring 165.6 x 76.1 x 7.8 mm and weighs 190 grams, making it solid but comfortable to hold. It supports dual SIM cards on a hybrid slot. The phone follows IP64 rating for dust and water resistance which makes it both attractive and functional.\n\nRealme 13 with its IPS LCD display stands out with a 120Hz refresh rate supporting scrolling and gaming smoothly. What is particularly impressive is the size of the display. It is 6.72 inches in diameter. The display has a resolution of 1080 x 2400 pixels allowing for sharp and clear pictures to be visible. No matter whether video is playing or one is browsing the internet, the screen is optimized for maximum enjoyment including the content. The device supports about 86.5% screen to body ratio allowing the users to immerse themselves into content.\n\nThe Realme 13 Smartphone gets its processing power from the Mediatek Dimensity 6300 chipset, which is produced on a 6nm process node. This octa-core chip has a configuration of dual 2.4 GHz Cortex-A76, and six 2.0 GHz Cortex-A55 cores and handles a good amount of processing for very basic tasks, as well as look after light gaming and multitasking. As for graphics performance, the Mali-G57 MC2 GPU is also present which is good for mobile gamers.\n\nThree configurations are offered for the Realme 13 smartphone\'s storage: 8 GB RAM and 128 GB of storage, 8 GB RAM and 256 GB of storage, and 12 GB RAM and 256 GB of storage. This will guarantee that you have enough space for all of your apps and the storage space for your photos, videos, and files. It also has a microSDXC card slot which employs a diluted SIM slot for an added option of increased storage.\n\nCamera capabilities are another point to consider with the Realme 13 and its dual rear camera system. It also has a 50 MP wide-angle camera with f/1.8 aperture, PDAF, and OIS for high-quality photos in low light condition as its primary camera instead. And there is another camera for providing more detail. The camera is equipped with a 1440p video capturing capability at 30 frames per second and 30 and 60 frames per second at 1080p as well as gyro-EIS and OIS to help avoid shake. A 16 MP front camera with an f/2.5 lens provides users with high-quality selfies and has the ability to capture videos in HD quality.\n\nThe Realme 13 comes with a reasonable 5000 mAh battery, capable of lasting a day with moderate use. It is capable of fast charging up to 45W which allows for 50% in 30 minutes making it great for busy users. One of the phone\'s many features is supporting a large battery while remaining slim and compact.\n\nUsing Android 14 for the Realme 13 modified with Realme UI 5.0 that provides ease of use as well as many functions aimed at improving the user experience. Among them are widget customization, an app drawer, and even features to protect your privacy.\n\nFor the’ connectivity features, the Realme 13 is capable of 5G networks, has Wi-Fi 802.11, Bluetooth 5.3 technology, and Type-C 2.0 USB connectivity. It also has a side-mounted fingerprint scanner, an accelerometer, gyro, proximity sensor as well as a compass to enhance security and usability.\n\nOn one hand, Realme 13 comes in colors of Speed Green and Dark Purple, on the other hand, it offers technological power with nice design. If you are looking for a gaming, photography or an all-purpose smartphone, the Realme 13 has enough features to meet most needs. A combination of a modern look with an impressive specification seems to make it perfect for both techies and ordinary users.\n\nWhat is the Realme 13 price or where to buy Realme 13 in Pakistan? Top online stores offer the Realme 13 price, best deals. Wait for a couple of months to see more Realme 13 deals, especially for those who want to buy Realme 13 at the least possible price in Pakistan.', '<div class=\"product-table\">\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"> Android 14, Realme UI 5.0</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">128GB 8GB RAM, 256GB 8GB RAM, 256GB 12GB RAM</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">50 MP, f/1.8, 26mm (wide), PDAF, OIS</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"> 16 MP</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"> Hybrid Dual SIM (Nano-SIM, dual stand-by)</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Octa-core (2x2.4 GHz Cortex-A76 &amp; 6x2.0 GHz Cortex-A55)\nGPU</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.72 inches, IPS LCD</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh, non-removable</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 1, 0, 64999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:53:04', '2025-04-23 11:17:15', 'NULL\n', NULL, 0),
(137, 'Samsung Galaxy S25 Ultra', 'samsung-galaxy-s25-ultra', 2, 55, '<h2 class=\"h2\">Samsung Galaxy S25 Ultra</h2>\nSamsung’s Ultra series just got even better with the addition of the Samsung Galaxy S25 Ultra. It is designed for users who like to have best features, performance and design. Set to be accessible in the January 2025, the Galaxy S25 Ultra looks to be the very first of a number of flagship smartphones designed that will offer all the high-end features that will meets the needs of both the technology fanatics and the lay users.\n\nAlso powering the Samsung Galaxy S25 Ultra is a well-performing Qualcomm Snapdragon 8 Gen 4 processor along with the Adreno 830 GPU. This combination is able to ensure solid application performance across the board, heavy multitasking, or high graphics and fast-paced action in a game. Android 14 is now fully accommodated so that the users can enjoy the latest in OS features along with improved data security, better battery control managing and enhanced user configurable aspects.\n\n6.83-inch ionit display can be appreciated with its high screen resolution of 1800 x 3440 pixels. Such display characteristics and dimensions create great conditions for comfortable watching movies as well as for playing games and working. It is clear that Samsung has gone through great lengths to ensure the quality of the display, hence ensuring that the display is equally efficient for those who enjoy being outside or indoors.\n\nIn the lineup of features of the Samsung Galaxy S25 Ultra is an outstanding feature that stands out among other smartphones in the market which is its camera system. As for the rear camera, it consists of four lenses, the main one having 200 MP. To improve depth and color accuracy, the camera is also equipped with three additional 50 MP lenses. This phone is a master to this art. It has a primary front camera of sixteen megapixels which also allows selfies and video recording to allow video calls in good quality.\n\nOn the other hand, Samsung Galaxy S25 Ultra does not drop the baton when it comes to battery life as it has got a 5100 mAh battery allowing the users to use the phone without frequent recharging within the day. It does not matter if one is streaming media, browsing or gaming, the battery is made to work efficiently so that people remain connected for longer. Moreover, the phone offers quick chargers, so users won’t have to wait long to recharge their devices and will quickly get back to the full power that has been dropped.\n\nThe Galaxy S25 Ultra has an internal storage of 256 GB plus 12 GB RAM, more than enough space to keep various apps, media files as well as documents and perform multiple operations without latency. Even though there is no microSD card slot available with the device, its internal memory has enough capability to serve the majority of users, be it daily routines or large amount of videos and images.\n\nSamsung Galaxy S25 Ultra stands out for a number of reasons especially with its connectivity features. The phone offers 5G connectivity which allows for faster downloads, better streaming and improved gaming experience. Moreover, activities like payments can be made effortless through contactless technology support like NFC, and Bluetooth and Wi-Fi are good for device and network connections. The dual SIM capability also enables users to use two phone numbers or networks from one gadget which makes it very practical.\n\nContinuing with its tradition of using high quality materials, Samsung has made the Galaxy S25 Ultra Cell Phone with a modern stylish design that fits into the niche. Every part of it is made in a way that it feels extremely comfortable in the palm of a hand of regardless of the user’s hand size, not to mention the good materials used while making it.\n\nMany people are interested in the Samsung Galaxy S25 Ultra price in Pakistan or features and who are planning to acquire Samsung Galaxy S25 Ultra, soon the market will seek out this model. The device satisfies high-performance tasks, its advanced photography capability, long periods of battery life as well as fast connectivity. If you desire a smartphone that comes with power, style and efficiency look no further than Samsung Galaxy S25 Ultra.\n\nThis essay outlines the product review of the Samsung Galaxy S25 Ultra with the emphasis on SEO target keywords to increase its visibility on various search engines. The summary describes the features and specifications of the phone in a clear manner that reads well and does not sound too stiff.', '<div class=\"product-table\">\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">256 GB internal with 12 GB RAM</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Quad 200 MP</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">16 MP front camera</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual SIMSamsung Galaxy S25 Ultra</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Adreno 830</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.83 inches with high-resolution clarity (1800 x 3440 pixels)</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5100 mAh for long-lasting usage</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 1, 0, 404999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:53:04', '2025-04-23 11:17:50', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(138, 'Realme 13 Pro', 'realme-13-pro', 2, 53, '<h2>Realme 13 Pro Price In Pakistan</h2>\nThe Realme 13 Pro is the newest smartphone made for users who never settle for compromises when it comes co performance and features. Focused on a user-friendly mobile experience, this device integrates strong hardware, aesthetics, and camera potentials.\n\nThe Realme 13 Pro incorporates the Qualcomm SM7435-AB Snapdragon 7s Gen 2 chipset that has surely packed a punch with fast processing. The device does not lag or stutter even with multiple applications running in the background. This device is suitable for all tasks including web surfing, gaming or working on serious applications. The Adreno 720 GPU used in pairing up with the Realme 13 Pro helps this device with great multimedia performance and graphics.\n\nThe display of the 13 Pro is 6.7 inches in size which means that the users can comfortably watch their favorite videos, pictures and play games. Every image appearing on the screen is crisp and rich in colors and therefore suitable for viewing photographs and videos. Weighing at 1080 x 2412 resolution, all images are sure to wow audiences. For protection, Corning Gorilla Glass 7i is also quite scratch and impact resistant while retaining transparency and clarity.\n\nThe photography capabilities of the Realme 13 Pro are enhanced by a dual 50 MP camera configuration on the rear side of the device. The main lens has a 50MP resolution and offers clear and vivid pictures, while the secondary camera, an 8MP one, allows for wider shots, making great photos of scenery and groups of people. You also have the 32 MP camera as the front surface for selfies that makes sure that images are always sharp and can come out nicely. Rest assured, whether it is bright sun outdoors or night in a dark room, the Realme 13 Pro will polish itself to the surrounding to produce clear and accurate images.\n\nRegarding the onboard battery, the Realme 13 Pro specifications come with a decent 5200 mAh battery that ensures you do not have to look for a charging cable the entire day. Even while watching streams, or playing video games, or using more than a couple of applications, the battery will not fail. And if your phone battery goes low, you will not have to wait too long since it also supports fast battery charging.\n\nAnother advantage is the storage on the Realme 13 Pro, which has 128 GB, 256 GB or 512 GB of internal storage. Such abundant storage allows you to download many large files, many photos, many apps and games without worrying about storage shortage. And together with 8 GB or 12 GB of RAM, the Realme 13 Pro is able to still be fast and responsive to commands even when more than one application is open.\n\nThere is dual SIM support so users can have two phone numbers or networks. In this sense, the device is harmonious for personal and professional use. Once you switch on the device, there is no stress weighing on the task as the device supports 5G network, further self-explaining the smooth and seamless experience the device is expected to yield.\n\nThe smartphone Realme 13 Pro runs on Android 14. As with its predecessors Android 14 provides users with control over many interfaces and customization options. Android 14 comes with the updated features and enhancements for overall smooth, safe and seamless functioning of the smartphone.\n\nIn conclusion, the Realme 13 Pro is a great option for anyone seeking a stylish and powerful smartphone. Whether you are looking for a camera that can take breathtaking images, a battery that can last for long hours, or one of the best performances available, the Realme 13 Pro meets all these and other needs. When available do not forget to buy Realme 13 Pro as you will have access to this great phone’s all features.\n\nAs for the people looking for Realme 13 Pro price in Pakistan, the smartphone will be in the stock of reputable online sellers soon and they will be able to sell it at reasonable prices that will still make it worthwhile considering how the device is privileged with a lot of features considering the price.\n\nPowered by impressive hardware and accompanied by a brilliant camera and high-end design, the Realme 13 Pro is the device that should be in the hands of users who want to improve their smartphone experience.', '<div class=\"product-table\">\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">128/256/512 GB internal with 8/12 GB RAM</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">50 MP + 8 MP dual rear camera</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">32 MP front camera</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual SIM</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Qualcomm SM7435-AB Snapdragon 7s Gen 2</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.7-inch screen with 1080 x 2412</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5200 mAh with fast charging</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 1, 0, 89999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:53:04', '2025-04-22 11:51:11', 'coming_soon\r', NULL, 0),
(139, 'Infinix Hot 50', 'infinix-hot-50', 2, 45, '<h2>Infinix Hot 50 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\nIf performance is your main concern, the Infinix Hot 50 is a great smartphone that covers all the features, yet price is very competitive. With its attractive look, solid performance, and advanced camera features, it certainly one of the best options for the users across Pakistan. Here’s everything you need to know about this wonderful device.\r\n<h2>Amazing Display to Provide Complete Immersion</h2>\r\nThe Infinix Hot 50 comes with a size 6.78 inches screen LCD display, looking at the resolution of 1080 x 2408 pixels. The screen graphics are enhanced making the colors look as rich and details sharp allowing viewing, gaming or any browsing to be enjoyable. The display also has a 120Hz refresh rate to ensure that the transitions run smoothly during usage.\r\n<h2>Great Performance with MediaTek Helio G100 installed</h2>\r\nThe MediaTek Helio G100 couples with a Mali-G57 MC2 GPU powered the phone and together handle the multitasking and gaming features effortlessly. Irrespective of whether you are watching, playing games or working, the Infinix Hot 50 does not have lag issues.\r\n<h2>Big Space and Memory</h2>\r\nWith 128GB internal and 8GB of RAM that comes with the Infinix Hot 50, there is more than enough storage space for applications, as well as users photos and videos. The phone also supports additional storage via an external card allowing even more storage space to be created.\r\n<h2>Sleek Design with Impdoming Looks</h2>\r\nInfinix Hot 50 packs a 6.82″ screen on its front panel. The multi-layer GPS with a 5-inch display aids in navigating easier. The smartphone comprises plastic body materials. Corning Gorilla Glass is used for front cover protection. It has rounded edges, and four feet slots for the speakers and microphone were designed. The volume rockers are conveniently placed on the side.\r\n\r\nBesides the settings, the speakers provide reasonable sound. Sounds from notifications are pleasant. Editors model uses 1080 x 2400 resolution as Desktops from distance measure. There are still logos remaining in the corner of the display and the service buttons are unit design pieces.\r\n<h2>Use of S-Carbon During the Production Process</h2>\r\nInfinix Hot 50 features a fanciful aesthetic. The color choices offered by the smartphone are elegant. Available colors are bright pink, black canvas, and cobalt blue, which include clear details for stylish impressions. Users have strong expectations for Infinix Handy properties that abide by environmental standards. The body is made without any extra coatings. Low-energy compressed colors were specifically chosen to create the design at Infinix.\r\n<h2>Hunt for the Unbreakable Device is an Ongoing Endeavor</h2>\r\nIn the middle of the smartphone frames sits a shiny gray chassis. Arms figure covers the display from dirt or scratches, making the display resistant to damage. However, anything that looks onto the cover blacks out the light several hours at a time. Total frames contain a total of 30 screws. Customers also have strong expectations for different properties than users of metallic substances in the case of Infinix smartphones.\r\n<h2>What are the reasons for purchasing Infinix Hot 50 in Pakistan?</h2>\r\nThe Infinix Hot 50 comes to allow modern users to meet modern life with all possible features at a reasonable cost. They cater for gamers, photographers, and even multitaskers. With its dual SIM card support, advanced camera setup, and smooth performance, the Infinix Hot 50 is a good smartphone for anyone who needs style and quality in one reliable device.\r\n<h2>Conclusion</h2>\r\nWhen looking for a combination of style, performance, and usability, the Infinix Hot 50 is an excellent choice. It’s made with advanced technologies but is still easy to use, making it ideal for smartphone users in Pakistan. Check it out and enjoy premium features at an affordable cost.', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">128GB internal storage and 8GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"> 50 MP + 8 MP + 2 MP</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"> 8MP</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual SIM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"> Mail-G57 MC2</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.78 Inches, 1080 x 2408 Pixels (~389 PPI)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"> 5000mAh</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 10, 39999, 37499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:53:04', '2025-05-25 16:53:09', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(140, 'Infinix Hot 50i', 'infinix-hot-50i', 2, 45, '<h2>Infinix Hot 50i Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\nThe <strong>Infinix Hot 50i</strong> is a dynamic and feature-rich smartphone that caters to the needs of everyday users in Pakistan. It combines stylish design with powerful specifications, making it a great choice for those looking for reliability and efficiency. Here’s an in-depth look at what makes the Infinix Hot 50i a top contender in the smartphone market.\r\n<h2>Immersive Display for Everyday Entertainment</h2>\r\nThe phone features a 6.7-inch LCD screen with a resolution of 720 x 1600 pixels. This large display delivers bright visuals and sharp colors, making it suitable for streaming videos, playing games, and browsing the internet. The responsive touchscreen ensures smooth navigation, providing an enjoyable user experience.\r\n<h2>Efficient Performance with MediaTek Helio G81</h2>\r\nAt its core, the <strong>MediaTek Helio G81 processor</strong> powers the Infinix Hot 50i, delivering smooth multitasking and efficient performance. The G52 MC2 GPU with a frequency of 820MHz ensures lag-free gaming and seamless graphics rendering. Whether you’re managing multiple apps or enjoying mobile games, this device handles it all effortlessly.\r\n<h2>Generous Storage and Memory Options</h2>\r\nThe Infinix Hot 50i offers two storage variants: <strong>128GB and 256GB</strong>, paired with <strong>6GB RAM</strong>. This ensures ample space for your photos, videos, and apps. Additionally, the phone supports expandable storage up to <strong>2TB</strong>, providing the flexibility to store even more content without worrying about running out of space.\r\n<h2>Advanced Camera System</h2>\r\nCapture life’s moments in stunning detail with the phone’s <strong>48MP rear camera</strong>, which is supported by dual flash for enhanced photography in low light. The camera also supports video recording at <strong>1080p@30fps and 720p@30fps</strong>, making it ideal for capturing high-quality videos. The <strong>8MP front camera</strong>, complete with front flash, ensures vibrant selfies and smooth video calls.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Rear Camera</strong>: 48MP with dual flash and advanced video capabilities.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Front Camera</strong>: 8MP with a flash for sharp selfies, even in dim lighting.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2>All-day Battery Life</h2>\r\nWith its <strong>5000mAh battery</strong>, the Infinix Hot 50i ensures that you can stay connected all day without frequent recharging. The battery is designed for efficiency, offering extended hours of use for gaming, streaming, or working on the go.\r\n<h2>Sleek and Lightweight Design</h2>\r\nThe phone is designed with ergonomics in mind, weighing just <strong>184g</strong> and measuring <strong>165.7mm x 77.1mm x 8.1mm</strong>. Its slim and lightweight build makes it easy to handle and carry, while its modern design adds a touch of sophistication to your lifestyle.\r\n<h2>Connectivity and Network Support</h2>\r\nStay connected with the <strong>dual SIM</strong> functionality, allowing you to manage personal and work contacts effortlessly. The device supports <strong>4G/LTE</strong>, ensuring fast and reliable internet speeds. Other connectivity features include Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, and GPS, catering to all your communication needs.\r\n<h2>Why Choose the Infinix Hot 50i in Pakistan?</h2>\r\nThe Infinix Hot 50i offers a blend of performance, style, and affordability, making it an excellent choice for smartphone users in Pakistan. Its impressive camera capabilities, robust battery life, and ample storage options make it suitable for various needs, whether for work or leisure.\r\n<h2>Final Thoughts</h2>\r\nIf you’re looking for a smartphone that delivers value for money without compromising on performance, the <strong>Infinix Hot 50i</strong> is the perfect pick. Its sleek design, powerful processor, and advanced camera features ensure a superior user experience. With support for expandable storage and long battery life, this device is ideal for users seeking both functionality and style.', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"> XOS 14.5 Powered by Android™14</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"> 128GB / 256GB, 6GB</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"> 48MP</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"> 8MP</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual SIM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">G52 MC2 820MHz</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"> 6.7 Inches, 720 x 1600</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"> 5000mAh</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 10, 32999, 28999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:53:04', '2025-05-23 10:15:09', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(141, 'Infinix Hot 50 Pro', 'infinix-hot-50-pro', 2, 45, '<h2 class=\"h2\">Infinix Hot 50 Pro Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\nThe Infinix Hot 50 Pro comes with all the right features making it a great choice for most users in Pakistan today. It offers a range of high end features complemented by elegant design, making it professional and stylish for performance oriented people. This is an in-depth articulation of the intricate details of the Infinix Hot 50 Pro.\r\n<h2>Superior Screen for Seamless Experience on Video Watching and Gameplay</h2>\r\nThe smartphone has an elegant 6.78 inches FHD+ AMOLED display with 1080 x 2436 pixel resolution. This bright screen offers cutting edge clarity and colors making it ideal for watching videos, using the internet or playing games. The edge to edge design of this display also contributes to the user’s enjoyment retaining a fully immersive experience.\r\n<h2>Quality that Match the Performance with MediaTek Helio G100</h2>\r\nInfinix Hot 50 Pro is powered by the MediaTek Helio G100, optimizing the device for lag-free games and efficient processing. Further improvement in graphics performance is added by the Mail-G57 MC2 GPU contributing to a seamless gaming experience. Together with 8GB of RAM, it is integrated into the smartphone facilitating high capacity programs and applications.\r\n<h2>Expanding Storage with Numerous Alternatives</h2>\r\nIn case the default storage of this device is not enough for the user there is an option to extend this up to 256GB with an additional microSD card. By offering this option to increase the primary storage, you do not lose focus on important information due to low overall capacity.\r\n<h2>Stunning Camera for a Variety of Selfie Applications</h2>\r\nThe Infinix Hot 50 Pro has a primary camera that is 50 MP with 2 MP and a quad flash for brighter images and efficient low-light settings; it also provides sharper images due to its double lens system. Taking advantage of the advanced camera system in playing back the original quality of 2K at 30fps video combined with a clear dynamic grab, the recording modes will allow doing.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Camera: 50MP strong camera with a quad flash for sharp images, owing to 2 MP dual lens system.02K, 1080P, and 720P video options.</li>\r\n 	<li>Camera: 8MP with flash to enhance pictures and video call quality with a smoother experience.</li>\r\n 	<li>Battery supporting demands even for the toughest of users.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nA significant advantage of the Infinix Hot 50 Pro is its impressive battery rated at 5000mAh. Users can enjoy their devices all day without worrying about running out of battery while working, even while gaming or live streaming.\r\n<h2>Sleek and Lightweight Design</h2>\r\nThe Infinix Hot 50 Pro weighs 190g, with a thickness of 7.4mm, and as such is thin and light. It is easy to hold due to its modern and ergonomic design, which is also good looking.\r\n<h2>Advanced Connectivity Features</h2>\r\nThe Infinix Hot 50 Pro features dual SIM, 4G/LTE as well as Wi-Fi connectivity and so is always up to date with current technological trends. It is an intelligent smartphone due to its NFC connectivity which allows wireless transactions to be made without any hassles. Bluetooth compatibility further allows for quick connection for wireless sound and devices of different kinds.\r\n<h2>Why Choose the Infinix Hot 50 Pro in Pakistan?</h2>\r\nThe Infinix Hot 50 Pro does not lack in style or provides aesthetic undesired features. It delivers an AMOLED screen as pristine as its camera which is perfect for any activities. In terms of expandable memory, powerful core, and sufficient battery life, it can suit the demands of both personal and business use.', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"> XOS 14.5 Powered by Android™14</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"> 128GB/8GB</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"> 50MP + 2MP, 2K 30FPS/1080P 60FPS/ 1080P 30FPS/720P 30FPS</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"> 8MP</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual SIM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"> Mail-G57 MC2</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.78, FHD+AMOLED</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"> 5000mAh(TYP)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 10, 44999, 39999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:53:04', '2025-05-23 10:36:40', 'NULL', NULL, 0);
