(142, 'Infinix Smart 9', 'infinix-smart-9', 2, 45, '<h2>Infinix Smart 9 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\nThe Infinix Smart 9 is an affordably priced smartphone oriented towards the needs of contemporary users in Pakistan. Its sleek design and well-placed specifications attract users whose needs are performance, aesthetics, and satisfaction. Let\'s take a closer look at its capabilities.\r\n<h2>Great Display for Day to Day Usage</h2>\r\nIn addition, the a six point seven inch IPS a-Si display has a resolution of 720 x 1600 pixels and provides sharp images and color. With the edge to edge screen design, you are guaranteed an outstanding viewing experience, be it watching videos, surfing the Internet, or playing video games.\r\n<h2>Smooth Performance with Helio G81</h2>\r\nOn the inside the Infinix smart 9 runs on the G81 Helio, which guarantees that there will be no lag when switching between applications or when running applications. The G52 MC2 has a computational speed of 820 MHz, which helps in improving the graphics within casual games. With the device available in 3GB/4GB RAM variants and with additional Virtual RAM of 6GB/8GB, lag for day to day applications is almost guaranteed.\r\n<h2>Loaded to the Hilt</h2>\r\nThe device has an internal memory of 64GB/128GB which is enough for apps, photos and videos. For additional multimedia features there is a microSD slot to expand the memory by 2TB, thus making it suitable for those who have many media files.\r\n<h2>High-Quality Camera Setup</h2>\r\nYou can take high-quality and vivid photos using the 13 MP rear camera with unique settings. Moreover, the presence of 8 MP front camera with flash allows to take bright selfies even at night. Both cameras enable the recording of video, so it is for those who have a passion for photography.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Rear Camera: 13MP with flash for close up and vivid photos.</li>\r\n 	<li>Front Camera: 8 MP with flash for sharp selfies and good video call.</li>\r\n 	<li>Video Recording: Available on both front and back cameras for ease.</li>\r\n 	<li>Long-Lasting Battery Life</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThe 5000mAh battery virtually has no rivals as it allows for prolonged calls, streaming or gaming. So regardless of whether you are travelling or at home, the battery makes certain there are no breaks in usage throughout an entire day.\r\n<h2>Sleek and Lightweight Design</h2>\r\nWith a weight of 188 g and a thickness of 8.35 mm, the Infinix Smart 9 has an elegant physique that is comfortable to hold. Because it supports dual SIM, users who have two numbers can benefit on this.\r\n<h2>Connectivity and OS Features</h2>\r\nThe smartphone has OS Android 14 Go edition, designed for better interface and lesser resource usage. It has 4-G LTE for browsing online faster and features built-in Bluetooth, Wi-Fi and radio for effortless connection.\r\n<h2>Why Use the Infinix Smart 9 in Pakistan?</h2>\r\nSmart 9 is considered a worthy smartphone in the Infinix lineup due to its price point when compared with another competing smartphone by the same company. This model features a mild and efficient battery, a decent processor, and an option for additional storage space that distinguishes it Creatively from other smartphones across the competition. Smart 9 also comes in attractive colors and a catchy sleek design adding to the aesthetic appeal.\r\n\r\nInfinix Smart 9 is great for special occasions and even looking to buy for oneself in Pakistan. Most of the mobile devices are lightweight in general with this one being no exception.', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14 (Go edition)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">64GB/128GB/3GB/4GB + Expandable Upto (6GB/8GB)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">13 MP</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"> 8 MP</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual SIM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">G52 MC2 820MHz</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"> 6.70 Inches</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 28999, 26499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:53:04', '2026-03-13 18:55:38', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(143, 'Sparx Neo 5 Pro', 'sparx-neo-5-pro', 2, 74, '<h2>Sparx Neo 5 Pro Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\nThe Sparx Neo 5 Pro is a well-rounded smart phone that is more than just a simple device. It comes with robust features and is a very trustworthy device. The technical specifications make this device suitable for modern mobile users in Pakistan.\r\n<h2>General Features</h2>\r\nGoing live on 31st October 2023, Sparx Neo 5 Pro supports dual SIM feature, which allows users to have both personal and work numbers without any hassle. Multitasking tends not to be an issue as the device is powered by an octa-core processor and a user-friendly interface that gets the job done.\r\n<h2>Display</h2>\r\nThe display has a 6.5-inch mesmeric touchscreen and graphics enhancing your interaction with it. If one is watching videos or surfing the internet, the Sparx Neo 5 pro\'s screen comes fully equipped with impressive images, colors making the device aesthetically pleasing in terms of content.\r\n<h2>Camera</h2>\r\nBring memories alive with Sparx Neo 5 Pro through its camera features. A 13MP back camera comes with flash lighting, enabling captures of finer details in photos even when there is a low light scenario. Along with that, there’s an 8MP front camera, fit for taking selfies or making video calls, ensuring clarity and good shooting quality all the time. Both cameras are capable of recording videos, therefore you can use them for different purposes.\r\n\r\nBattery and Performance The Sparx Neo 5 Pro has a bigger 5000mAh battery that allows the phone to be used throughout the day without worries of frequent charging. Perfect for daily power users, this battery can last for a long duration. Further, the phone’s octa-core processor works in tandem with the battery for exciting gaming, streaming, or any other common tasks. Connectivity Let yourself be free with the multitasking abilities of the Sparx Neo 5 Pro. 4G/LTE is included for fast internet, Bluetooth is for file sharing, and WiFi is for browsing purposes.\r\n\r\nThere’s no 5G connection, but the features that are already there are enough for ordinary users in Pakistan. Additional Features A few more things that make this phone ideal for daily users is the availability of a radio and support for microSD expansion. There’s no word on the phone’s weight and dimensions yet, but the sleek and slim design is perfect for prolonged usage.', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">32GB Built-in, 2GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Triple Camera: 13 MP + 2MP (Macro) + VGA, LED Flash</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">8 MP, LED Flash</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Octa-Core</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.5 Inches, 720 x 1600 Pixels</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 18499, 17549, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:53:04', '2025-05-12 14:42:49', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(144, 'Xiaomi Redmi A3x', 'xiaomi-redmi-a3x', 2, 61, '<h2>Xiaomi Redmi A3x Price In Pakistan</h2>\nIn the case that you are looking for a smartphone in Pakistan with a good range of features without burning a hole in your pocket, the Xiaomi Redmi A3x could be your go-to gadget. In addition to offering a long battery life and adequate hardware and software upgrades, this device is perfect for the average user.\n<h2>General Features</h2>\nOn January 2025, Xiaomi Redmi A3x was launched and aimed for multi–usage. As it comes with dual Standby for two Nano-SIM cards, it can be easily used for both personal and business use without difficulties. At the same time the device is powered by Android 14 OS with MIUI which gives a secured platform with the latest features and updates.\n\nWith a smaller weight of 193 g and comfortable and reasonable dimensions of 168.3 x 76.3 x 8.3 mm, it is easy to use and comfortable to carry.\n<h2>Display</h2>\nScreen size is a key consideration for any phone; the Redmi A3x manages to impress with its 6.71 inch, 720 x 1650 pixels resolution screen. The 90Hz refresh rate provides efficient scrolling and good performance in gaming within the screen while Eye Care DC Dimming technology is used to relieve user fatigue during long phone usage.\n<h2>Performance and Memory</h2>\nXiaomi Redmi A3x has been constructed using an octa-core Unisoc T603 chipset which performs adequately to manage multitasking and graphics demands from various apps and games with ease. It has an internal configuration of 3GB RAM and 64GB storage which can be considered decent since it accommodates basic applications, media and files. For those who don’t have enough space, up to 1TB is offered from the microSD card which is sufficient to store data.\n<h2>Camera</h2>\nUse the 8MP AI dual rear camera to snap stunning photographs with clarity and detail regardless of mildly changing circumstances. You can shoot high-quality videos at 30 fps due to its ability of 1080p recording. The 5MP front camera allows you take selfies and engage in video calls that are clear enough for social media posting.\n<h2>Battery</h2>\nUtilise the 5000mAh battery which can last an entire day and is ideal for work, playing games, or communicating without worrying about charging it too often. Other than the above-mentioned functionalities, this is the major reason why it is a robust device.\n<h2>Connectivity and Additional Features</h2>\n4G/LTE, Bluetooth, Wi-Fi, and FM radio that can be used for entertainment are all available in the Redmi A3x. Although its major disadvantage is the absence of 5G and NFC, other wireless connections are well suited for daily usage.', '<div class=\"product-table\">\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">64GB Built-in, 3GB RAM</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual camera: 8 MP, f/2.0, (wide) + 0.08 MP (auxiliary lens), LED Flash</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5 MP, f/2.2, (wide), Video (1080p@30fps)</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Octa-Core, Unisoc T603 SoC , Mali-G57 MP1</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.71 Inches, 720 x 1650 Pixels (~268 PPI)</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 1, 0, 20999, 17999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:53:04', '2025-04-22 11:51:11', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(145, 'Tecno Spark 20', 'tecno-spark-20', 2, 57, '<h2>Tecno Spark 20 Price In Pakistan</h2>\nWith all the features expected from a smartphone of this age, the Tecno Spark 20 is a device that will definitely impress. It appears to be an all-around phone that is not only capable but also stylish and high performing. Let\'s turn our focus now to the aspects that seal the deal for the Tecno Spark 20.\n<h2>Display and Design</h2>\nWhen it comes to the screen, The Tecno Spark 20 is equipped with a 6.6 inch IPS LCD touchscreen with 720 x 1612 screen resolution and 90Hz refresh rate. This guarantees that visuals will be fluid when streaming videos, browsing the internet or gaming. 163.7 x 75.6 x 8.5 mm which are the phone\'s dimensions translates into a device that is easy to hold and operate, aside from the fact that its modern aesthetics make it appealing.\n<h2>Performance</h2>\nPowered by a Mediatek Helio G85 processor coupled with a Mali-G52 GPU, the Tecno Spark 20 is capable of fairly reliable and efficient performance. Even while multitasking and employing strenuous applications, the combination of 8GB RAM along with 256 giga internal storage guarantees seamless execution. Furthermore, for those that require more storage, there is an option to expand storage using a microSD card.\n<h2>Camera Performance Quite Simply Impressive With A Head Turning Design</h2>\nThe camera system of the Tecno Spark 20 is not an ordinary one. The 50MP dual rear camera apart from the auxiliary lens captures clear and colorful images. Even in photos with low light levels, your pictures will pop thanks to the Dual LED flash and the PDAF (Phase Detection Autofocus) feature of the phone. The dual LED flash on the 32 MP front camera makes it easy to take good selfies and use video calls with sharp and detailed results.\n<h2>Battery</h2>\nThe Tecno Spark 20 has 5000mAh Non-removable Li-Po battery and offers long usage hours with a single charge which is very beneficial to the users. During the day, whether the user is attending meetings or streaming or gaming, the phone battery will serve their daily purpose.\n<h2>Connectivity and Features</h2>\nThere are multiple ways to stay in touch with friends using the Tecno Spark 20 that is Bluetooth, WiFi, an FM radio, and even 4G LTE. With the dual SIM feature, the user can change his/her network with no hassle, while the Android 13 OS allows for a simple operation.\n<h2>Why Buy Tecno Spark 20?</h2>\nThe Tecno Spark 20 is a synthesis of looks, performance, and essentiality. It is a phone that is easy to operate in daily situations, but is also suitable for users who want a good quality of the camera and a lot of battery life. The Tecno Spark 20, with its reasonable price, has plenty of storage space, modern style, and many additional capabilities.\n\n&nbsp;', '<div class=\"product-table\">\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">128GB, 8GB</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Camera: 50 MP</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">32 MP</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Octa-core (2 x 2.0 GHz Cortex-A75 + 6 x 1.8 GHz Cortex-A55)</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.6 Inches, 720 x 1612 Pixels (~267 PPI)</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 1, 0, 32999, 32499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:53:04', '2025-04-22 11:51:11', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(146, 'Realme C65', 'realme-c65', 2, 53, '<h2>Realme c65 Price In Pakistan</h2>\nThe Realme C65 sports the features which an avid user expects from his smart phone as it provides ample performance, storage space, and flexibility to the user. This new device has all the features and the pretty designs to appeal to a wide variety of people in Pakistan and even serve both casual and power users well.\n<h2>Display and Design</h2>\nThe 720 x 1604 resolution is complemented well by the 6.67 inch LCD screen which can display vibrant colors and sharp images as well as video. The thin profile of the smartphone which is 7.6 mm thick and weighing 185g makes the phone to not be cumbersome to hold. Irrespective of the activities involving watching videos or browsing the internet, the combination of screen size and clarity does improve your experience.\n<h2>Performance and Storage</h2>\nThe Helio G85 processor from MediaTek paired with the ARM Mali-G52 GPU allows multitasking, gaming and app usage without any hiccups. This particular phone has 8GB of LPDDR4x RAM which should fit most casual users needs and 256GB of internal storage which has a very large capacity for photos, videos and files. If that’s not enough, the Realme C65 has expandable storage up to 2TB which gives it an advantage to be popular among the users who are always short of space.\n<h2>Battery and Power Management</h2>\nThe Realme C65’s battery rating is 5000mAh which means it lasts long through a busy day with frequent charging. For both heavy users or those who use it for work and entertainment, this battery capacity guarantees that the phone is used on a regular basis.\n<h2>Camera Features</h2>\nTake great photos, thanks to the 50 MP rear camera, which provides LED flash for low-light photography. The 8MP front camera takes clear selfies and facilitates video calls. Videos of up to 1080p resolution and frame speeds up to 30fps for the Realme C65 are also possible.\n<h2>Software and Connectivity</h2>\nBased on Android 14, the newest version of Android, the software is user-friendly as well as responsive. The phone allows usage of two sims, 4G LTE and Wifi which allows easy access to calls, surfing the internet and watching videos. The presence of features like Bluetooth and expandable storage adds to its usability while absence of NFC and 5G serves the purpose of making it cheaper.\n<h2>Who Should Buy Realme C65?</h2>\nGamers: There is a MediaTek Helio G85 inside and the fact that the screen size is quite big so it makes it easy to game\n\nPhotography Enthusiasts: 50MP images can be clicked with ease and in low light environments, it won’t be a challenge.\n\nHeavy Users: Since this phone already has 5000mAh rating it will be more efficient for people with expandable storage since it will be a device that is reliable and lasts long.\n\nEveryday Users: Thanks to its vivid aesthetics, light weight and useful applications, it is an ideal companion for the day to day work and fun.\n\nThe Realme C65 combines impressive specifications, ample memory storage and an ergonomic style, so as to make phone usage wonderful. It’s effective features as well as performance put it among the best devices for people in Pakistan seeking an economical and dependable gadget.\n\nIf you require more detail or any other sections, please do not hesitate to contact me!', '<div class=\"product-table\">\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"> 8GB LPDDR4x RAM/256GB</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">50MP</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\"> 8 MP</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual SIM</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">ARM Mali-G52</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.67 inches</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000mAh</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 1, 0, 44999, 44599, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:53:04', '2025-04-22 11:51:11', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(147, 'Vivo V40', 'vivo-v40', 2, 60, '<h2>Vivo V40 Price In Pakistan</h2>\nThe Vivo V40 is defined as a flagship smartphone that integrates technology, design, and performance into one unit. Released in January 2025, it is aimed at users who seek powerful performance, great camera capabilities and high quality display. It doesn’t matter if you are a gamer, a photographer, or a multitasker, the Vivo V40 is prepared for you.\n<h2>Outstanding Screen and Build</h2>\nWith impressive contrast, accurate colors, and high-definition images, the Vivo V40 is equipped with a 6.78 inch AMOLED with a resolution of 1260 x 2800. From movie watching to gaming and jednodirectional browsing, the display guarantees breathtaking visuals. Enhancing the toughness of the display is Schott Xensation glass that offers high resistance to scratches.\n\nConsidering that the dimensions of the Vivo V40 are 164.16 x 74.93 x 7.58 mm and weights 190g, it is a lightweight smartphone that gives a pleasing ergonomic feel since it can be operated and gripped with one hand. For users who are style conscious, it is an ideal phone as it possesses a sleek and modern design other than the functionality it offers.\n<h2>Vivo V40: Year’s Best Performance Phone, See How It Perfoms</h2>\nQualcomm SM7550 is one of the underrated mobiles nowadays in terms of the performance it has to offer, it tends to be smooth and quick with the way it works and operates, games as well as apps don’t stress out the mobile in any way. The highlight of its performance is the Adreno 720 GPU which sits quite well with a 12GB RAM making the mobile phone a perfect pick for gamers.\n\nStorage has always been a concern for consumers but this model appears to be having 12GB RAM which is capable of running multiple tasks at the same time without lagging. After all, it’s 2023, and everyone is expected to use their phones for a lot of things, a phone jump can serve as can be quite helpful due to its versatility.\n<h2>Vivo V40: The Pinnacle Phone For Photography Lovers</h2>\nWhile clicking photos using a mobile phone some tend to complain about the inability or low quality to take good photographs and tend to use a camera instead, the dual setup of the rear cameras is perfectly capable of doing that as it consists of two smart cameras with 50MP, one of which is a primary camera and the other is a wide lens which would allow you to take deep vivid sharp shots be it zoomed or from a longer end, regardless of the lighting scenario. Even the front camera is quite impressive and pulls up 50MP while being able to brighten selfies.\n\nBoth the front and back cameras have the ability to record 4K video at 30 frames per second as well as 1080p video at 30 frames per second providing room to record professional videos. A professional-quality picture can be taken in low-light conditions thanks to the Ring-LED flash on the back.\n<h2>Powerful Battery and Quick Recharge</h2>\nWith a 5500mAh battery you can be reassured that you are capable to work through an entire day without worrying about recharge or battery. Be it streaming content, gaming or working the Vivo V40 supports all your needs without the inconvenience of low battery.\n\nAlso it is compatible with fast charging which allows you to quickly charge your device not worrying about the long waiting time.\n<h2>Support of Network and Connectivity,</h2>\nVivo V40 includes all the relevant connectivity that you need with Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, 4G/LTE, and 5G. From streaming web content to playing games online, everything is possible with fast Internet Om the phone includes NFC which provides assistance in paying and connecting with devices.\n<h2>Updated Software / Improved User Interface</h2>\nFuntouch OS is installed on Vivo V40 which also has Android 14, this makes the mobile operating system quite easy to navigate. Furthermore, Funtouch OS has got a variety of features which include user interface, device security, and overall simplicity, speed, and convenience to the end user. The graphics and layout are appealing to the eye and the device itself is modified to operate at high speed.\n\nTo put it simply, the Vivo V40 is an advanced mobile device that integrates the latest technology and great performance. No matter whether you use a phone for work, gaming, taking picture, or entertainment purposes, it is specifically made for that. It has an impressive screen, powerful camera setup, a strong battery, and rapid speed and I can go on and on talking about this smartphone.', '<div class=\"product-table\">\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14 based on Funtouch OS</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"wp-image-1222 alignnone\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">12 GB + 12GB Expandable / 256</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">50 MP</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">50 MP + 50 MP</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual SIM</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Qualcomm SM7550-AB Snapdragon 7 Gen 3</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.78 Inches</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5500 mah</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 1, 0, 139999, 127999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:53:04', '2025-04-22 11:51:11', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(148, 'Vivo V40e', 'vivo-v40e', 2, 60, '<h2>Vivo v40e Price In Pakistan</h2>\nThe Vivo V40e is a remarkable smartphone that matches advanced technology, decent performance, and fashionable appearance. The Vivo V40e was published on January 2025. It aims a wide range of users, regardless if you are after a gaming, photography, or multitasking phone. Vivo V40e, on the other hand, has slowly carved its way into the mid-range smartphone category due to its impressive specifications and performance at a rather reasonable price.\n<h2>Sleek Design and Colorful Display</h2>\nThe Vivo V40e features a 6.77 inch AMOLED display that is surprisingly immersive. additionally features a resolution of 2392 x 1080 and a 120Hz refresh rate where scrolling, animations and graphics are smooth. videos, games, and even browsing can be experienced in vibrant and bright colors enhancing the contrast making it ideal for entertainment and everyday usage.\n\nThe blacks are deep while the vivid colors pop out because of the AMOLED source making the whole viewing experience a movie like one and it fits within the palm of your hand. Also, this device dimension is 163.72 x 75.00 x 7.49 mm with approximately the same mass as a small apple which makes it effortlessly usable and easier to carry around.\n<h2>Powerful Performance with MediaTek Dimensity</h2>\nConsider this: Vivo V40e features a MediaTek Dimensity 7300 processor, a powerful SoC meant to be able to jump from one task to another, or handle a game with no hitches. Having 8GB LPDDR4X RAM allows for this device to be rather quick and responsive while featuring 8GB of expandable ram provides the device with extra memory for demanding tasks. This ensures that you won’t have any hiccups in your application switching, gameplay, and heavy multitasking activities.\n\nEven during gaming, streaming of videos, or any other activity that requires high performance out GPU, the AMD G615 MC2 ensures quality graphic rendering in every activity. Even for those who use their phones for gaming, productivity, or entertainment, Vivo V40e handles it beautifully.\n<h2>High-Quality Camera System</h2>\nAnother major selling point of the Vivo V40e is its camera system. The smartphone is equipped with a 50MP Sony IMX882 OIS primary camera with an optical image stabilizer (OIS). Therefore, shooting outdoors in the evening will not yield blurry pictures. The main camera is combined with a 8MP ultra wide-angle camera, allowing the integration of more of the scene in a single photo, great when taking photos of groups of people and vast landscapes.\n\nOn the front, the mobile has a 50MP AF ultra–wide–angle selfie camera which is capable of focusing and has a 2.0 aperture and a 92° field of view. It allows you to take great looking, detailed selfies and also ultra wide group selfies. So portrait selfies or group selfies, both can be taken on the Vivo V40e easily as it does not let you down in terms of camera options and quality.\n\nThe front and back shooters also come with video recording features and can record in good quality 4k resolution. If you are vlogging, capturing an important event or travel videos, the recording on the Vivo V40e will not disappoint and be smooth and clear.\n<h2>All-day Battery Life and Fast Charging</h2>\nThe Vivo V40e has a battery of 5500mAh which is more than enough to last you for the whole day. Be it browsing, using applications or playing games, you will never have to worry about your mobile phone battery dying on you during the day. For those users that do not have time to wait for their phones to charge, the Vivo V40e comes with fast charging options to charge your phone in no time.\n<h2>5G Connectivity and Enhanced Network Features</h2>\nThe Vivo V40e Phone ensures a fast and reliable crossing for this purpose as it is equipped with 5G, 4G/LTE and Wi-Fi. Internet connections that provide high-speed data suffice whether you are streaming movies, playing games, or browsing the webs.\n\nThere are other usage options as the phone can also be connected via Bluetooth which enables connections with wireless gadgets such as headphones, smart watches, and speakers etc. The Vivo V40e allows users to be completely wireless.\n<h2>Software and User Experience</h2>\nThe Vivo V40e phone unlike other phones has a user interface that is quite clean and straight forward, more so, it runs on android 14 Funtouch OS. The aim of Funtouch OS is to enhance the ease of use of the applications and devices by allowing for faster processes and safer features.\n\nWhat\'s more, thanks to the Vivo V40e Phone, users have more control and rely more on their voice commands in an efficient easy. The tech savvy and even those who aren’t are ensured a great experience using the device.\n\nAccording to the review, the Vivo V40e smartphone is fairly balanced since it has a good quality screen, strong performance, great cameras, and a long-lasting battery. Thanks to its excellent 5G features and stylish body, it is definitely a worthwhile buy for users who want a phone that does all the work needed and does all this at a reasonable price.', '<div class=\"product-table\">\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14 Funtouch</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"wp-image-1222 alignnone\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">8GB LPDDR4X RAM + 8 GB Expandable / 256GB</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">50 MP Sony IMX882 OIS Main Camera: OIS supported; f/1.79; FOV 79°; 5P lens 8 MP Ultra Wide-Angle Camera: f/2.2; FOV 116°; 5P lens</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">50 MP AF Ultra Wide-Angle Selfie Camera: AF supported; f/2.0; FOV 92°; 5P lens</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual SIM</p>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">50 MP AF Ultra Wide-Angle Selfie Camera: AF supported; f/2.0; FOV 92°; 5P lens</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.77 Inches</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-row\">\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5500 mah</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 1, 0, 99999, 92999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:53:04', '2025-04-22 11:51:11', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(149, 'Audionic Battlebuds Wireless Earbuds', 'audionic-battlebuds-wireless-earbuds', 13, 43, '<h2>Audionic Battlebuds Wireless Earbuds Price In Pakistan</h2>\nAudionic Battlebuds Wireless Earbuds offer an exceptional audio experience for those who value both convenience and high-quality sound. With the latest Bluetooth technology and an impressive design, these earbuds have quickly become a popular choice for mobile users in Pakistan.\n<h3>Key Features of Audionic Battlebuds Wireless Earbuds:</h3>\nThe Audionic Battlebuds Wireless Earbuds are designed to provide an unmatched experience with features that cater to every need of modern-day users. Whether you\'re working out, commuting, or simply enjoying your favorite tunes, these earbuds have you covered.\n\n<strong>Noise Cancellation (ENC)</strong>: One of the standout features of the Audionic Battlebuds is its Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC). This technology ensures that you can focus on your music or calls, even in noisy environments. Whether you’re on a busy street or in a crowded room, these earbuds will help block out unwanted noise, delivering clear and crisp sound.\n\n<strong>Water-Resistant Design</strong>: Designed to withstand the rigors of daily life, the Audionic Battlebuds Wireless Earbuds are water-resistant. You can comfortably wear them while working out, running, or when caught in light rain without worrying about them getting damaged.\n\n<strong>Bluetooth 5.4</strong>: The Audionic Battlebuds Wireless Earbud<strong>s</strong> are equipped with the latest Bluetooth 5.4 technology, ensuring stable connectivity with your device up to a distance of 10 meters. This means you can move freely without the fear of losing connection, making them perfect for workouts, commuting, or casual listening.\n\n<strong>Type-C Charging</strong>: These wireless earbuds feature Type-C charging, providing you with faster and more convenient charging. Say goodbye to the hassle of waiting hours for your earbuds to charge – the <strong>Audionic Battlebuds Wireless Earbuds</strong> come with a quick charging time of just 1.5 hours.\n\n<strong>Auto Pairing</strong>: With Audionic Battlebuds, connecting your device is effortless. The earbuds automatically pair with your device as soon as you open the case, eliminating the need for manual connection. This ensures you’re ready to enjoy your music or take calls without any delay.\n\n<strong>Extended Battery Life</strong>: Featuring a 35mAh battery in the earbuds and a 400mAh battery in the case, these earbuds offer a playtime of 3-4 hours on a single charge. Whether you\'re listening to music or attending long calls, you can rely on these earbuds for extended use throughout the day.\n\n<strong>Compatibility</strong>: The Audionic Battlebuds Wireless Earbuds are compatible with both Android and iOS devices, making them a versatile option for all types of smartphones and tablets. No matter what device you use, you can enjoy seamless connectivity with these earbuds.\n<h3>Why Choose Audionic Battlebuds Wireless Earbuds?</h3>\nThe Audionic Battlebuds Wireless Earbuds are not only designed for performance but also for convenience. They come equipped with a microphone, ensuring that you can take calls with ease, all while enjoying superior sound quality. Whether you need a reliable pair of earbuds for work, exercise, or relaxation, these are designed to meet all your needs.\n\nFor those in Pakistan looking to buy Audionic Battlebuds Wireless Earbuds, these are a fantastic choice. Their combination of advanced features, reliable battery life, and water-resistant design makes them a top contender for anyone searching for a great wireless earbud experience. These earbuds offer the perfect balance of performance and affordability, providing you with an excellent option for your everyday needs.\n\nIn summary, if you\'re in the market for Audionic Battlebuds Wireless Earbuds, look no further. With features like noise cancellation, Bluetooth 5.4, water resistance, and more, these earbuds are built to last and deliver a seamless experience for users. Whether you\'re buying them for casual listening or professional use, the <strong>Audionic Battlebuds</strong> provide value, quality, and performance in one affordable package.', '<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Noise Cancellation</strong>: Enjoy clear audio with Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC).</li>\n 	<li><strong>Water-Resistant</strong>: Keep your earbuds safe from sweat and splashes.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth 5.4</strong>: Seamless wireless connection with a 10-meter range.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Type-C Charging</strong>: Fast and convenient charging for your earbuds and case.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Auto Pairing</strong>: Effortless connection to your device when opened.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Long Battery Life</strong>: Play music for up to 3-4 hours with a 35mAh capacity.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Compatibility</strong>: Works with both Android and iOS devices.</li>\n</ul>', 1, 50, 9999, 4599, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:53:04', '2025-04-22 11:44:51', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0);
