(150, 'X8 Ultra Bluetooth Calling Watch', 'x8-ultra-smartwatch', 11, 58, '<h2>X8 Ultra Bluetooth Calling Watch Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\nX8 Ultra Bluetooth Calling Watch seems to be the best combination of elegance, utility and cost-effectiveness. You can purchase it in Pakistan for an amount of just Rs. 2150. This smartwatch is mostly suitable for people who wish to be connected while simultaneously monitoring their health and fitness goals. It has advanced features such as Bluetooth calling, heart rate sensor, and a 50 mm screen that make it the perfect solution in a modern day wearable at an attractive price tag.\r\n<h2><>Key Features of the X8 Ultra Bluetooth Calling Watch:</h2>\r\nThe X8 Ultra Bluetooth Calling Watch is packed with several features that makes it easier to undertake simple tasks in your daily life. Each of your health needs, fitness requirements, and communications with family and friends are able to be addressed by this smartwatch. Below are some of the amazing features of the X8 Ultra Bluetooth Calling Watch:\r\n\r\n<p><b>Bluetooth Calling:</b> Calling and answering phone calls can be done using the watch on your wrist with the help of the Bluetooth calling feature. Those who go to the gym or are frequently on the move will find this feature useful because they won’t need their phone with them in order to speak to their contacts.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Features of Health Monitoring</b>: The X8 ultra bluetooth calling watch has a couple of health tracking features which include a heart rate monitor, calories burnt, sleep quality monitor, and a step counter. This will enable you to intensively track your health metrics and change your wigs for a healthy lifestyle across the roads.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Oxygen Level Monitoring:</b> Monitor your oxygen levels using this feature so that you are always healthy.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Water Resistance:</b> The X8 Ultra Bluetooth Calling Watch is categorized under IP67 rating which further means that the watch is also water resistant. Drops of sweat ,rain or even splash the watch remains intact. So whether you jogging in the rain or washing your hands the watch tends to operate perfectly.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Multiple Sports Modes:</b> The X8 Ultra has several sporting modes for those who would like to jog, cycle or do yoga. These help in monitoring performance and encouraging.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Display:</b> X8 Ultra features a 50mm TFT display with a resolution of 240x296 therefore enabling the consumer to be able to use the watch in varying weather conditions. Notifications, messages and activity tracking will be clearly readable in HD.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Strap/Band: </b>The silicon strap is used to maintain comfort when using the X8 Ultra Bluetooth Calling Watch. This ensures that you are able to wear the watch for extended durations without causing discomfort. The strap does not interfere whether you are exercising or even in a meeting.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Bluetooth 5.0: </b>The X8 Ultra is embedded with Bluetooth 5.0, thus allowing adequate and stable pairing with your phone and other gadgets. Bluetooth is now known to expend lesser energy and widen its reach thanks to this new implementation.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Battery Life:</b> With a decent 300MAH battery, a person would be able to utilize this device for 2-3 days on a single full charge which would be ideal for people that go for long trips as they would not have to change the smartwatch multiple times during the day.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Compatibility:</b>The X8 Ultra Bluetooth Calling Watch is designed to work with android and iOS gadgets therefore you can make the most out of its features without stressing about the gadget’s operating system.</p>\r\n<h2>Why Choose the X8 Ultra Bluetooth Calling Watch? </h2>\r\nThe X8 Ultra Bluetooth Calling Watch is able to appeal both the average individuals and sophisticated users as it possesses great features while remaining easy to use. The watch has a sleek design while possessing advanced health monitoring and Bluetooth calling features allowing people who are more on the tech side to use it easily.\r\n\r\nThe X8 Ultra Bluetooth Calling Watch, available in Pakistan for Rs. 2150, stands out as a great buy. It delivers all the features of a high-end smartwatch but at a much lower price. Whether you are purchasing it for yourself or as a present for a loved one, this smartwatch will not disappoint.\r\n<h2>Where to Buy the X8 Ultra Bluetooth Calling Watch?</h2>\r\nAre you interested in getting your hands on the X8 Ultra Bluetooth Calling Watch online at the best pricing? It is possible to buy it from various retailers so you are guaranteed a reasonable price in Pakistan. This great deal of Rs. 2150 should not be missed by anyone.', '<strong>Bluetooth Calling:</strong> Stay connected with ease.\r\n<strong>Health Monitoring:</strong> Includes heart rate, sleep quality, and oxygen level tracking.\r\n<strong>Water Resistant:</strong> IP67 for enhanced durability.\r\n<strong>Compatibility:</strong> Works with both Android and iOS devices.\r\n<strong>Display:</strong> 50mm TFT screen with 240x296 resolution.\r\n<strong>Battery Life:</strong> 2-3 days on a single charge.\r\n<strong>Strap:</strong> Comfortable silicon band.\r\n<strong>Multiple Sports Modes:</strong> Track your activity effortlessly.', 1, 50, 5999, 2150, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:53:04', '2025-09-19 14:46:53', 'NULL', 1000.00, 1),
(151, 'Watch 8 Ultra Smart Watch', 'watch-8-ultra-smart-watch', 11, 58, '<h2>Watch 8 Ultra Smart Watch Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Watch 8 Ultra Smart Watch has an elegant style to it that is also highly functional and offers you a multitude of options. Combined with its silicone strap and IP67 water resistance, the watch is sturdy enough to withstand day-to-day activities including using the watch in the gym, going for a jog, or even a swim.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Display & Design:</strong> Thanks to an impressive 240 x 286 screen resolution, the Watch 8 Ultra\'s 1.85-inch Full Touch screen delivers a clear image regardless of the conditions. Thanks to the touchscreen, it is simple to scroll through applications and features with just a tap.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Battery & Charging:</strong> The battery of Watch 8 Ultra will last for about two to three days, allowing you to use your watch throughout your busy schedule without frequently charging it.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Operating System & Performance:</strong> The contract has its own brand of OS systems meaning that the user experience is fluid and offers a variety of sports modes as well for tracking. Walking, running, cycling, or other activities are recorded by the Watch 8 Ultra in order to help you stay focused on your goal.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Speaker & Connectivity:</strong> The speaker allows you to conduct calls using your wrist, like hands-free devices. There is no support for Wi-Fi, GPS, or NFC, but that is not the core of the watch’s intended purpose, which is decent for the price range.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Affordable Price:</strong> When looking at the value offered by the Watch 8 Ultra Smart Watch, which retails at 2,150 PKR, the features offered are similar to many of the expensive smartwatches available in the market. Bearing in mind a more-affordable option that has heaps of features embedded in it, the Watch 8 Ultra would fulfill that need.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you wish to purchase the ‘Watch 8 Ultra Smart Watch’ at the most affordable price in Pakistan, you can get the best offers on the internet. It meets the necessity as well as the aesthetics, making it an appealing gadget for both tech addicts and fitness lovers. Many of its other watch features, including the several sports modes, water-resistance, and accessibility of the interface, make it a decent wearable for anyone who is looking for a budget smartwatch.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Whether you want it for your performance, price, or based on features, the Watch 8 Ultra Smart Watch will be sold allowing you to buy it from multiple websites in Pakistan. This should help you find the best price for the Watch 8 Ultra Smart Watch.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>To get the best price of the Watch 8 Ultra Smart Watch in Pakistan, don\'t wait as the offer is for 2,150 PKR only before the time expires!</p>', '<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Display Size:</strong> 1.85 inches</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Water Resistance:</strong> IP67</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Battery Life:</strong> 2–3 days</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Operating System:</strong> Proprietary OS</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Speaker:</strong> Yes</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Strap Material:</strong> Silicon</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Sports Modes:</strong> Multiple modes</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Connectivity:</strong> No NFC, No GPS, No Wi-Fi</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Color:</strong> Available in multiple colors</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Warranty:</strong> Check with the retailer</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 50, 3900, 2150, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:54:36', '2025-06-24 16:34:26', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(152, 'Blaze 18W Charger (Type A - Type C Cable Included)', 'blaze-18w-charger', 14, 56, '<h2>Blaze 18W Charger Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>With its blazing Quick Charge™ 3.0 technology, which is guaranteed to charge your compatible device to up to 80% in just 35 minutes, the Blaze 18W USB-A Wall Charger emerges to be the best answer to all your charging needs. Our Blaze wall charger is the optimal choice for charging while you are on a plane or working in an office due to its blend of performance and portability.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>The Key Features of the Blaze 18W USB-A Wall Charger include;</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Quick Charging Efficiency:</strong> Worry no more about never-ending charging cycles with the blatant speed provided by the Quick Charge™ 3.0 technology that allows up to 18W of power.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Wide Compatibility:</strong> Boom! All Unite’s devices are fast charging enabled and so along with your device’s tech specs, you can use the Ardiman Blaze charger without issues.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Compact Design:</strong> Having lightweight features allows the Blaze 18W USB-A Wall Charger to be incredibly handy, allowing the user to take it on the go.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Durable Build:</strong> With a robust build and versatile unity’s input voltage of 100-240V AC, it is reliable when needed.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>The Technical Specifications include the following;</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Max Output: 18W.</li>\r\n  <li>Input: Frequencies of 50/60 Hz, 100-240V AC and 1.5A.</li>\r\n  <li>Output:</li>\r\n  <li>5V = 3A.</li>\r\n  <li>9V = 2A.</li>\r\n  <li>12V = 1.5A.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Warranty:</strong> Through the <em>6 months</em> duration of warranty the charger is included, the complimentary cable is not included.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Looking inside the Box you will find;</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>A Blaze 18W USB-A Wall Charger x 1</li>\r\n  <li>Complimentary Type C Cable x 1</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Why Choose Blaze 18W USB-A Wall Charger?</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Time is Money;</strong> That is the exact reason we made this stylish and sleek charger to cut down the useless waiting time period.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Compact and Portable:</strong> It can be carried in your pocket or bag without weighing you down.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Affordable:</strong> A state-of-the-art charger worth PKR 1200 serves you well with its extraordinary build and features.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>An All-in-One Solution</h2>\r\n<p>Smartphones, tablets, and even USB devices can be easily powered up for use with the Blaze 18W charger. It is power-efficient and delivers power as needed to make sure your device charges quickly and does not harm the battery health.</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>Blaze 18W USB-A Wall Charger with Quick Charge™ 3.0 technology.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Fast charging:</strong> 80% in 35 minutes (compatible devices only).</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Compact, portable design;</strong> ideal for home or travel.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Input: 100-240V;</strong> Output: 18W (5V=3A, 9V=2A, 12V=1.5A).</li>\r\n 	<li>Includes a free Type C cable (not covered by the warranty).</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 1200, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:54:36', '2025-06-24 16:35:09', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(153, 'Rapid Duo 12W (Type C Cable Included)', 'rapid-duo-12w-dual-port-charger', 14, 56, '<h2>Taar Rapid Duo 12W USB Charger Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Rapid Duo 12W Charger is a multi-dimensional dual rechargeable USB which is both proficient and effective. This is the ideal revision for homes, offices, and students since it employs aging smart charge technology in conjunction with a strong yet simple design.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Features of The Rapid Duo 12W Charger</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Compatible with Multiple Devices:</strong> Works perfectly even if two charging devices are plugged in.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Smart Charge Technology:</strong> Self-adjusting charge suitable for each device.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>High-Speed Charging:</strong> When connected to a power source, any device plugged in will instantly be powered.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Self-Protection Mechanism:</strong> Provides protection against overheating, short-circuiting enabling a secure charge.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>LED Charging Indicator:</strong> Using LEDs enable display of device prospects.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Technical Specifications</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Input: 100-240V AC, 50/60 Hz, 1.5 A.</li>\r\n  <li>Output: 5V = 2.4A (12W MAX).</li>\r\n  <li>Warranty: 6 months for the charger (complimentary cable not included).</li>\r\n  <li>What’s in the Box?</li>\r\n  <li>One unit charger</li>\r\n  <li>Taar Type C set</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Why Choose the Rapid Duo 12W Charger?</h2>\r\n<p>Great Battery Charging with Maximized Efficiency: With its Smart Charge Technology, charging all your USB devices becomes quick and easy.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Two-Device Functionality:</strong> Charge two devices at once without wasting any charging time.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Economical and Handy:</strong> Because of its light weight, it is perfect for travel or day-to-day use.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Safe Power Supply:</strong> The devices are protected from overheating and overcharging due to built-in protections.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Low Cost Perks:</strong> For PKR 1000, one receives cutting-edge capabilities with a six-month warranty for added security.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Ideal for Every Single One Of Your Devices</h2>\r\n<p>The Rapid Duo 12W Charger works with a diverse array of USB-powered devices, which include smartphones, tablets, smartwatches and several more. At home or outside, the charger does its work and never lets the device down.</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>Rapid Duo 12W Dual Port Charger with Smart Charge Technology.</li>\r\n 	<li>Charge two devices at once without compromising speed.</li>\r\n 	<li>Built-in protection against overcharging, overheating, and short circuits.</li>\r\n 	<li>LED indicator for charging status.</li>\r\n 	<li>Compact, travel-friendly design.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 1000, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:54:36', '2025-06-24 16:36:14', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(154, 'Fusion Dual-Boost PD 45W (C to C Cable Included)', 'fusion-dual-boost-pd-45w-usb-c-charger', 14, 56, '<h2>Fusion Dual-Boost PD 45W USB-C Charger Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>A high-performance wall charger made for quick and effective charging is the Fusion Dual Boost PD 45W Charger. This charger enables you to charge two devices at once at maximum speed thanks to its PD USB-C and Quick Charge 3.0 USB-A ports. The Fusion Dual Boost Charger is designed to meet all of your power requirements, whether you need to charge your laptop, tablet, or smartphone.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Features of the Fusion Dual Boost PD 45W Charger</h2>\r\n<strong>Dual Charging Ports:</strong> The Fusion charger features a PD USB-C Port and a Quick Charge 3.0 USB-A Port, enabling you to charge two devices at the same time without compromising on speed or efficiency.\r\n<p><strong>PD USB-C Port (45W Output):</strong> Perfect for devices like iPhone, iPad, MacBook Air, and other PD-compatible devices. With 45W maximum output, it ensures fast and efficient charging for your high-power devices.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Quick Charge 3.0 (USB-A Port):</strong> Delivers up to 18W output for fast charging of compatible devices, including Android smartphones, tablets, and other Quick Charge-enabled products.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Compact and Sleek Design:</strong> The Fusion Dual Boost charger is small and lightweight, making it perfect for travel, office, or home use.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Wide Compatibility:</strong> It works with a variety of devices including iPhones, iPads, MacBooks, and Samsung smartphones, as well as other devices that support fast charging.</p>\r\n<strong>Built-in Protection:</strong> Safeguards against overheating, overcharging, and short-circuiting to ensure safe and reliable operation.\r\n\r\n<h2>Technical Specifications</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Input: 100-240V AC, 50/60 Hz, 1.5 A</li>\r\n  <li>Output (USB-C Port): 5V = 3A, 9V = 2A, 12V = 1.5A (45W Max)</li>\r\n  <li>Output (USB-A Port - Quick Charge 3.0): 5V = 3A, 9V = 2A, 12V = 1.5A (18W Max)</li>\r\n  <li>Warranty: 6 months (covers charger only; cable not included in warranty)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>What’s Included</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Fusion Dual Boost PD 45W Charger x 1</li>\r\n  <li>Taar Premium Cable (C to C) x 1</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Why Choose the Fusion Dual Boost PD 45W Charger?</h2>\r\n<strong>High-Speed Charging:</strong> Enjoy fast and efficient charging with a 45W USB-C Port and 18W Quick Charge 3.0 USB-A Port.\r\n<p><strong>Charge Two Devices Simultaneously:</strong> No need to wait for one device to charge. The Fusion Dual Boost lets you power up two devices at once, saving you time.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Sleek, Portable Design:</strong> Compact and lightweight, this charger is designed for portability, making it easy to carry around wherever you go.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Safe and Reliable:</strong> The charger comes with built-in safety features that protect your devices from overheating and overcharging.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Affordable Price:</strong> Available for just PKR 2150, this charger offers excellent value for money, backed by a 6-month warranty for your peace of mind.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Perfect for a Wide Range of Devices</h2>\r\n<p>The Fusion Dual Boost PD 45W Charger is compatible with a wide variety of devices, including iPhones, iPads, MacBook Airs, Samsung smartphones, and other fast-charging USB-powered devices. Whether you\'re at home, in the office, or traveling, you can count on this charger to keep your devices powered up and ready to go.</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>Fusion Dual Boost PD 45W Charger with PD USB-C &amp; Quick Charge 3.0.</li>\r\n 	<li>Charge two devices simultaneously at high speed.</li>\r\n 	<li>Maximum output of 45W for efficient power.</li>\r\n 	<li>Compact and sleek design for portability.</li>\r\n 	<li>6-month warranty, cable not covered.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 2800, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:54:36', '2025-06-24 16:37:14', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(155, 'Awaaz Buds', 'awaaz-buds-wireless-earbuds', 13, 56, '<h2>Awaaz Buds Wireless Earbuds Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>Introducing the Awaaz Buds, a true game-changer in the world of wireless audio. With advanced features such as Bluetooth 5.3 and ENC (Environmental Noise Cancellation) technology, these earbuds ensure that you get the best sound quality and a seamless listening experience. Whether you\'re enjoying music, attending calls, or engaging in online meetings, the Awaaz Buds provide exceptional clarity, convenience, and comfort.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Superior Sound Quality</h3>\r\n<p>The Awaaz Buds deliver premium audio quality with rich stereo sound that elevates your music experience. Whether you’re grooving to your favorite tracks or diving into immersive podcasts, these wireless earbuds will take your listening to the next level. The True Wireless Stereo (TWS) feature enhances your audio experience by providing rich, high-fidelity sound across both earbuds.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Advanced Connectivity</h3>\r\n<p>Equipped with the latest Bluetooth 5.3, the Awaaz Buds ensure a stable and strong connection, allowing you to move freely without worrying about disconnects. Whether you’re working out at the gym, commuting, or relaxing at home, you can trust these earbuds to stay connected. Additionally, the Bluetooth HD Broadband Calling ensures that your calls are clear and uninterrupted, even in noisy environments.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Effortless Master-Slave Switching</h3>\r\n<p>The Awaaz Buds feature master-slave switching, making it easier than ever to use the earbuds. This feature allows for quick transitions between the left and right earbuds, ensuring that you can easily switch between calls and music without missing a beat.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Extended Battery Life</h3>\r\n<p>The Awaaz Buds come with an impressive 5 hours of playtime on a single charge, and the charging case provides an additional 15 hours of playtime. That’s a total of 20 hours of listening time, so you can enjoy your music and calls without constantly needing to recharge.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Crystal-Clear Voice Calls</h3>\r\n<p>With ENC technology, the Awaaz Buds offer exceptional call quality by minimizing background noise. Whether you’re in a crowded space or on a noisy commute, your voice will come through clearly on calls, providing an excellent communication experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Touch Control for Convenience</h3>\r\n<p>The Awaaz Buds feature touch controls, making it easy to manage your music, adjust volume, and handle calls without needing to reach for your phone. With a simple tap, you can control your listening experience seamlessly.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Type C Charging for Fast Recharging</h3>\r\n<p>The Awaaz Buds come with a Type C charging port, allowing you to quickly and conveniently recharge the earbuds when needed. The modern and widely-used Type C connector ensures fast recharging, so you spend less time plugged in and more time enjoying your music.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Sleek and Comfortable Design</h3>\r\n<p>Designed for comfort and style, the Awaaz Buds are lightweight, ergonomic, and fit comfortably in your ears. Whether you’re running errands or enjoying a workout, the Awaaz Buds stay securely in place, offering all-day comfort.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Why Choose Awaaz Buds?</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Seamless Connectivity:</strong> Enjoy uninterrupted audio with Bluetooth 5.3.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Long Battery Life:</strong> Play for up to 20 hours with the charging case.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Crystal-Clear Calls:</strong> Advanced noise cancellation ensures clear voice calls.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Convenient Touch Controls:</strong> Manage your music and calls with a simple tap.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Stylish and Comfortable:</strong> Sleek design that fits comfortably for hours.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Affordable:</strong> Priced at just 4500 PKR, the Awaaz Buds offer exceptional value for the features they provide.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Upgrade your audio experience with the Awaaz Buds and enjoy superior sound quality, seamless connectivity, and long-lasting battery life. Get yours today for just 2150 PKR and take your wireless audio experience to the next level.</p>\r\n', '<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Wireless Audio Excellence:</strong> Enjoy true wireless stereo sound with Awaaz Buds.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth 5.3:</strong> Seamless connectivity for uninterrupted music and calls.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Advanced Noise Reduction:</strong> Crystal-clear voice calls with ENC technology.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Long Battery Life:</strong> 5 hours of playback, 20 hours with charging case.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Touch Control:</strong> Easy-to-use touch controls for music and calls.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Type C Charging:</strong> Convenient and fast charging with Type C cable.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Master-Slave Switching:</strong> Effortless switching between buds.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 4500, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:54:36', '2025-06-24 16:38:33', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(156, 'Awaaz Zabar True Wireless Earbuds', 'awaaz-zabar-true-wireless-earbuds', 13, 56, '<h2>Awaaz Zabar True Wireless Earbuds Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>Awaaz Zabar True Wireless Earbuds offer a premium audio experience, designed for music lovers, professionals, and on-the-go individuals. Equipped with advanced features, these earbuds provide exceptional sound, superior connectivity, and ergonomic comfort, making them the perfect choice for everyday use. Whether you\'re listening to your favorite music, attending virtual meetings, or taking calls, Awaaz Zabar ensures the best possible experience with its clear, powerful audio and seamless Bluetooth connectivity.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Audio Quality</h2>\r\n<p>Awaaz Zabar Earbuds are engineered to deliver superior audio performance, allowing you to enjoy your music in high fidelity. With its high-quality sound output, you’ll experience every note and beat as it was intended. Whether you\'re into bass-heavy tracks or crisp vocals, these earbuds can handle all genres with ease.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Exceptional Battery Life</h2>\r\n<p>Stay connected and enjoy your music for longer periods with Awaaz Zabar\'s impressive battery life. The earbuds themselves offer 6 hours of continuous playtime, while the accompanying charging case extends the total playtime to 24 hours. Whether you\'re commuting, working, or relaxing, you won\'t have to worry about running out of battery.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Seamless Connectivity</h2>\r\n<p>With Bluetooth 5.3, Awaaz Zabar ensures fast and stable connectivity to your devices. The improved Bluetooth technology provides stronger signals and lower latency, offering smooth audio streaming for both music and calls. Furthermore, Awaaz Zabar features Master Slave Switching Technology, allowing you to switch between devices effortlessly, without interruptions.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Comfortable Design</h2>\r\n<p>Comfort is essential for long listening sessions, and Awaaz Zabar delivers. Designed with an ergonomic in-ear shape, these earbuds fit securely in your ears, providing a comfortable experience for hours. Their lightweight design ensures that you won’t feel any discomfort, even during extended use.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Touch Control</h2>\r\n<p>With intuitive touch control, managing your audio and calls has never been easier. A single tap allows you to pause, play, answer calls, or skip tracks, all without having to take out your device.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Multi-Link Technology</h2>\r\n<p>Awaaz Zabar supports Multi-Link Technology, allowing you to connect to multiple devices simultaneously. This feature is ideal for users who want to switch between their phone, tablet, or laptop without needing to reconnect manually each time.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Type-C Charging Port</h2>\r\n<p>The earbuds feature a Type-C charging port, ensuring fast and efficient charging. No need to worry about long charging times — simply plug in your charger and enjoy a quick boost of power.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Stylish Lanyard Design</h2>\r\n<p>A convenient lanyard design adds portability and prevents you from losing your earbuds. You can easily carry them around your neck, making them always accessible when you need them.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Warranty</h2>\r\n<p>Awaaz Zabar comes with a 12-month warranty, offering peace of mind in case you face any issues with the product. The warranty covers the earbuds themselves, ensuring you\'re covered for any manufacturing defects or malfunctions.</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Playtime:</strong> 6 hours (earbuds) / 24 hours (with charging case)</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth Version:</strong> 5.3</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Audio Performance:</strong> Superior sound quality with ENC (Environmental Noise Cancellation)</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Control:</strong> Touch controls for easy operation</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Charging:</strong> Type-C port for fast and convenient recharging</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Design:</strong> Comfortable in-ear design with a secure fit</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Technology:</strong> Master Slave Switching, Multi-Link Technology</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Battery Type:</strong> Lithium polymer</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Warranty:</strong> 12 months</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 7000, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:54:36', '2025-06-24 16:39:34', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(157, 'Premium PD Cable 4A', 'premium-pd-cable-4a', 9, 54, '<h2>Premium PD Cable 4A Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Premium PD Cable 4A is engineered for high-speed charging and fast data transfer, making it a perfect accessory for modern devices that support Power Delivery (PD) technology. Designed to provide efficient and reliable charging for your iPhone and other compatible smartphones, this cable ensures your devices receive power at the fastest rate possible, reducing the time you need to wait for a full charge.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Fast Charging with Power Delivery (PD)</h2>\r\n<p>Power Delivery (PD) technology, based on the USB-C standard, is becoming increasingly popular for delivering faster charging speeds. The Premium PD Cable 4A supports 30W Power Delivery, allowing your devices to charge significantly faster than conventional charging methods. For example, you can charge your iPhone up to 60% in just 30 minutes, saving you valuable time when you\'re on the go. This cable is ideal for fast-charging compatible devices such as iPhones, smartphones, tablets, and even laptops that support PD technology.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Durability and High-Quality Build</h2>\r\n<p>Crafted from high-quality materials, the Premium PD Cable 4A is built to last. The cable features a TPE (Thermoplastic Elastomer) exterior, known for its durability and flexibility. Unlike standard cables, TPE is resistant to wear and tear, ensuring the longevity of the cable even with regular use. The connectors are designed with pure copper wiring and double-molded aluminum foiling to improve the cable\'s performance and resist damage from constant bending or twisting.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Fast Data Transfer</h2>\r\n<p>In addition to its fast charging capabilities, the Premium PD Cable 4A also supports high-speed data transfer. This means you can not only charge your device quickly but also transfer files and sync your data at lightning-fast speeds. Whether you\'re transferring large files, photos, or videos, this cable ensures your data moves efficiently without any interruptions.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Perfect Compatibility with Apple and Other Devices</h2>\r\n<p>The Premium PD Cable 4A is compatible with a wide range of devices, including Apple® products such as iPhones, iPads, and MacBooks. It also works with other smartphones and USB-C enabled devices that support Power Delivery. With this versatile cable, you no longer need to carry multiple cables for different devices—just one cable for all your charging and data transfer needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Specifications:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Type:</strong> C to Lightning</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Power Delivery:</strong> 30W Fast Charging</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Cable Length Options:</strong> 1 Meter, 2 Meters</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Material:</strong> High-quality TPE for durability</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Wiring:</strong> Pure Copper with Double-Molded Connectors</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Aluminum Foiling:</strong> Enhances cable strength and reduces interference</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Warranty:</strong> 1 Year</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Charging Speed:</strong> Charges iPhone to 60% in 30 minutes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Why Choose Premium PD Cable 4A?</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Super-fast Charging:</strong> With 30W Power Delivery, this cable can charge devices faster than traditional cables, especially iPhones and other compatible devices.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Durable Build:</strong> The cable’s TPE material is highly resistant to wear and tear, ensuring longevity.</p>\r\n<p><strong>High-Speed Data Transfer:</strong> Not just for charging, this cable supports efficient data syncing.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Wide Compatibility:</strong> Compatible with most USB-C and Apple devices, making it an ideal all-in-one charging solution.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Warranty:</strong> 1-year warranty for added peace of mind.</p>\r\n<p>Whether you\'re at home, in the office, or on the move, the Premium PD Cable 4A is your reliable solution for fast charging and quick data transfer. Its high-quality construction ensures that you\'ll enjoy dependable performance for years to come, all while charging your devices safely and efficiently.</p>\r\n\r\n<strong>Price:</strong> PKR 1000\r\n\r\n<p>Buy Now and get your Premium PD Cable 4A to enjoy the benefits of fast charging and data transfer, all backed by a 1-year warranty.</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>30W Power Delivery for fast charging of iPhones and other compatible devices.</li>\r\n 	<li>Durable TPE material with pure copper wiring for maximum longevity.</li>\r\n 	<li>Double-molded aluminum connectors for enhanced durability.</li>\r\n 	<li>Fast data transfer for seamless syncing of files.</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with Apple devices (iPhone, iPad) and USB-C devices.</li>\r\n 	<li>Available in 1m and 2m lengths for flexible usage.</li>\r\n 	<li>1-year warranty for peace of mind.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 1000, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:54:36', '2025-06-24 16:40:48', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(158, 'Vivo Y200 4G', 'vivo-y200-4g', 2, 60, '<h2>Vivo Y200 4G Price in Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>Equipped with top-tier features and specifications, Vivo Y200 4G is a modern smartphone meant to provide seamless performance. The device is to be sold in Pakistan for an estimated price of PKR 65,999, which is rather reasonable as it utilizes exceptional technology and has a strong build quality.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Design and Display</h2>\r\n<p>Two remarkably eye-catching colors, Green and Silver, are available to choose from the Vivo Y200 4G model alongside a reasonable thickness which is roughly around 163.23 × 75.93 × 7.79mm to 7.95mm depending on the color. The phone offers a lightweight feel weighing just above 180 grams at about 190 grams, which makes it easy to hold.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Not only does the phone feel good in hand, but due to the AMOLED screen and the resolution of 1080 x 2400 pixels, the phone provides unparalleled sharp visuals making it perfect to game or even binge-watch your favorite show with the 6.67-inch screen.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Performance and Software</h2>\r\n<p>Thanks to the Qualcomm Snapdragon 685 processor, which is paired with Adreno 619 GPU, the phone performs exceptionally while multitasking and gaming as it provides a seamless experience. Because the phone is equipped with 8GB RAM, the phone can handle heavy applications and games with ease on top of being able to run on the latest updated Android 14 system.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Storage and Expandability</h2>\r\n<p>The Vivo Y200 4G has two built-in storage options which include 128GB and 256GB, respectively, allowing enough space for videos, photos, and applications. The device also offers expandable storage that allows a maximum of 1TB.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Camera Capabilities</h2>\r\n<p>For those who enjoy taking pictures, the 50MP + 2MP combination of rear cameras will take breathtaking photos for you thanks to their astounding detail. Additionally, the phone includes a 32MP frontal camera which takes stunning and clear selfies. Both cameras are capable of recording videos, which is perfect for vloggers and content creators.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Battery Life</h2>\r\n<p>With the Vivo Y200 4G offered with a battery of 5000mAh, you can be sure of seamless and uninterrupted performance whereby you get to use your device for a whole day without getting worried about charging it frequently.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Connectivity Features</h2>\r\n<p>With the diversity of TWV devices such as Dual SIM, 4G LTE, WiFi, and Bluetooth, the Vivo Y200 4G makes wire-free connection a delight to use. However, it does not support 5G and NFC.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price in Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>In Pakistan, the price of Vivo Y200 4G is competitive. Even though it is suspected to be PKR 65,999, it sure does have an edge in terms of its competitors in the Pakistani mid-market of smartphones.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>It is recommended to Buy Vivo Y200 4G if you intend to:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Snapdragon 685 chipset that is fast and advanced</li>\r\n  <li>An appealing large 6.67 inches screen that uses AMOLED technology</li>\r\n  <li>Massive internal storage that can go up to 1 TB</li>\r\n  <li>50 MP and 32 MP dual rear and front camera respectively which are of high quality</li>\r\n  <li>The battery can last for an extended period of time with a capacity of 5000 mAh.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Conclusively, Vivo Y200 4G is arguably one of the best smartphones available in today’s market with regards to its price. Vivo Y200 4G can be bought in Pakistan to add to the style one can also enjoy strong and exceptional performance.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"wp-image-1222 alignnone\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">8GB RAM, 128gb / 256gb</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">50 MP + 2 MP</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">32 MP</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Qualcomm Snapdragon 685</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.67 inches</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000mAh</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 10, 58499, 55499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:54:36', '2025-06-24 17:06:05', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(159, 'Samsung Galaxy A55 5G', 'samsung-galaxy-a55-5g', 2, 55, '<h2>Samsung Galaxy A55 5G Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>If you’re in the market for a Samsung Galaxy A55 5G, then you\'d be looking at an elegant-looking phone with exemplary battery life. Priced at PKR 125,000, the A55 boasts a seamless design along with powerful hardware and 5G capabilities.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Here\'s all you need to know about the Samsung Galaxy A55, including its key features, specifications, and pricing.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Samsung Galaxy A55 5G Price in Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>In Pakistan, the selling price of the Samsung Galaxy A55 sits at PKR 125,000. Thanks to its 5G connectivity and other competitive specs, the price is an excellent choice for those that value new phones.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Features of Samsung Galaxy A55 5G</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>Display & Design:</h3>\r\n<p>The phone sports the impressive 6.6-inch FHD+ sAMOLED display with an Infinity-O design which means whether you are gaming or watching videos, you will definitely get an immersive experience. The color quality and overall visuals are stunning due to the phone\'s resolution sitting at 1080 x 2340.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Performance:</h3>\r\n<p>In terms of performance, the Samsung Galaxy A55 is quite capable as it packs an Exynos 1480 (4nm) CPU along with 8 GB of RAM and 256 GB of internal storage. If there is a takeaway from these specifications, it is that you will be able to run heavy applications, files, or even games without any lag.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Camera Setup:</strong> The primary camera module blends a 50 MP primary sensor that delivers lifelike image quality, a 12 MP ultra-wide lens for capturing magnificent landscapes, and a 5 MP macro lens for shooting a range of objects at different distances. The 32 MP front camera offers detailed selfies and records video at a maximum resolution of UHD 4K.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Battery Life:</strong> Samsung equipped the Galaxy A55 5G with a 5000mAh battery sufficient to keep you working all day. Whether for a quick gaming session, watching videos, or for work, the phone has the battery capacity to last you.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Connectivity:</strong> The device supports all the latest communication technologies, including 5G, which will make browsing incredibly fast. In addition, the phone has features such as Bluetooth, WiFi, and NFC, which are useful when conducting safe transactions.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Why Buy Samsung Galaxy A55 5G in Pakistan?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Enhanced Performance:</strong> Due to its built Exynos 1480 processor, the device will allow you to complete tasks without spending much time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Stunning Display:</strong> Thanks to the full HD+ screen, expect brilliant colorful graphics and crisp images.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Advanced Cameras:</strong> Take stunning shots and videos with the 50 MP triple cameras, and record high-definition media with a mobile device.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Future-Ready:</strong> Due to this smartphone having integrated 5G, it will allow you to use it for many years in the future.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Samsung Galaxy A55 5G is priced at PKR 125,000 in Pakistan\'s market, making it a performance-packed phone with perfect camera functionality. You can purchase it from a wide range of stores across Pakistan.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><em>To explore the potential of the next generation of technology, the Samsung Galaxy A55 5G is the best option for you. Grab one now!</em></p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"wp-image-1222 alignnone\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">8GB RAM, 256 GB</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">50 MP + 12 MP + 5 MP</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">32 MP</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Nano - SIM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Exynos1480 (4nm)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.6 Inches</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000mAh</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 139999, 125000, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:54:36', '2025-06-24 17:11:57', 'NULL', NULL, 0);
