(160, 'Realme C61', 'realme-c61', 2, 53, '<h2>Realme C61 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Realme C61 is a cutting-edge smartphone and still is easy on the pocket too. Given its targeted price of Rs. 30,999 in Pakistan, it is definitely Realme’s best offering yet. This phone packs a punch and caters to all of your needs, whether you are someone who enjoys multitasking, a gaming addict, or someone who simply enjoys capturing photos.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Display & Design</h2>\r\n<p>The phone is fitted with a 6.74-inch IPS LCD touchscreen which has a 90Hz refresh rate. This very feature makes it a great option for streaming videos, and playing games while also allowing for realistic and lively graphics. Due to its thickness of 7.84mm and weight of 188 grams, this phone is extremely comfortable to hold, and single-handed use is also fairly easy, making it quite handy.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Performance</h2>\r\n<p>The smartphone’s UNISOC T612 chip alongside a Mali-G57 GPU ensures that the phone can perform multiple tasks at any given point without any hiccups. The phone is equipped with 6 GB of RAM, which can be complemented with 12 GB of Dynamic RAM, allowing for smooth task switching. This combined with 128 GB of memory means that enough space will be provided for all your photos, videos, and apps. If that still does not satisfy you, additional storage can be added using a microSD card.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Camera Technology</h2>\r\n<p>The 50 MP rear camera records vibrant, stunning photos, making it a point-and-shoot camera. The phone also has a 5 MP front camera with flash installed in it, so you never run out of selfies and video calls. Both cameras are capable of recording videos, so you can always remember the best moments.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Battery</h2>\r\n<p>One full charge of the Realme C61 with the 5000mAh battery allows you to use the phone all day. This means no earlier charging. Whether you\'re streaming, gaming, or working, this device is suitable for all modes.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Connectivity & Other Features</h2>\r\n<p>Be connected with 4G LTE, WiFi, Bluetooth, Dual Sim, and more. This phone is also able to play FM channels in radio mode. The device does not have 5G and NFC, but that is not a worry as the performance is decent for the price.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Reasons to Buy Realme C61 in Pakistan</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Price:</strong> Rs. 30,999 is a good price for the features.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Camera Quality:</strong> 50 Megapixels main camera for nice pictures.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Display:</strong> 90Hz screen refresh rate for better fluidity.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Battery:</strong> 5000mAh battery is good for a full day.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Space:</strong> 128GB built-in storage and more can be added.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Analysis of Competitors</h2>\r\n<p>Rival smartphone companies cannot manage to match the Realme C61 camera quality as it comes with great features like its dynamic RAM contour and efficient processor. Especially, it puts all of the amendments necessary for low-budget phone buyers together.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Conclusion</h2>\r\n<p>In Pakistan, the Realme C61 stands as one of the strongest options for smartphone users looking for performance, style, and a good price. Available for just Rs. 30,999, this is without a doubt one of the must-haves for people looking for a smartphone providing value.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"wp-image-1222 alignnone\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6GB RAM + 12GB Dynamic Ram, 128GB</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">50 MP</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5 MP</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">UNISOC T612</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.74 Inches</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000mAh</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 10, 32999, 29499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:54:36', '2025-06-24 17:12:41', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(161, 'Tecno SPARK 30 Pro', 'tecno-spark-30-pro', 2, 57, '<h2>Tecno SPARK 30 Pro Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Tecno SPARK 30 Pro is a high-quality yet affordable smartphone for those seeking a mid-range device. This device encompasses stylish features and innovative technology with exceptional performance to match. Launched on November 8, 2024, it is priced at PKR 42,999, making it clear that it targets users with a lower budget but higher expectations for quality.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Tecno SPARK 30 Pro Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Tecno SPARK 30 Pro is an aesthetically pleasing phone that fits well into the mid-range category, priced at PKR 42,999. Featuring several advanced capabilities fused with affordability, the device makes a strong case for itself in the smartphone market for potential buyers looking to upgrade their devices.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Stunning Display</h2>\r\n<p>At 6.78 inches, the AMOLED display stands out as one of the most appealing features of the Tecno SPARK 30 Pro. The smooth graphics and immersive visuals are made possible by its 120Hz refresh rate combined with the 1080 x 2436 pixels resolution. Moreover, the display\'s peak brightness of 1700 nits makes it useful for outdoor usage, even under bright sunlight.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Unmatched Performance</h2>\r\n<p>The Tecno SPARK 30 Pro is powered by a Mediatek Helio G100 (6 nm) processor, partnered with a Mali-G57 MC2 GPU. This setup is optimal for streaming, gaming, or multitasking on the device. The smartphone features 8GB of RAM, which allows it to handle demanding applications without lag. Additionally, there are 128GB and 256GB storage options to house all your applications, videos, and photos. If that\'s not enough, the device supports expandable storage via a microSDXC card slot.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Award-Winning Camera System</h2>\r\n<p>Photography enthusiasts will appreciate the impressive 108MP rear camera that captures detailed photos in both low and high light conditions. For low-light conditions, a Quad-LED flash is included for better night-time photography. The front side features a 13MP selfie camera with Dual-LED dual-tone flash, capable of taking great selfies and video calls. Both the front and rear cameras can record videos up to 1080p@30fps, while the rear camera can record videos up to 1440p@30fps, offering a movie-like experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Durable Non-Removable Battery</h2>\r\n<p>The Tecno SPARK 30 Pro features a 5000mAh non-removable battery capable of lasting a full day. Whether you’re gaming, streaming, watching videos, or browsing, this smartphone provides excellent battery life, ensuring you stay connected throughout your activities.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Features and Connectivity</h2>\r\n<p>The Tecno SPARK 30 Pro offers excellent connectivity options, including WiFi, Bluetooth, and 4G LTE. Additional perks of the phone include NFC support (dependent on region). The smartphone also supports dual SIM (nano SIM), making it ideal for individuals who use multiple mobile phone networks with ease.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Why should you purchase the Tecno SPARK 30 Pro in Pakistan?</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Reasonable Price:</strong> The smartphone offers competitive specifications that are typically found in pricier models. It provides great value for your money, catering to a broader audience.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Great Display:</strong> The smartphone features a 6.78-inch AMOLED display with a 120Hz refresh rate, providing an amazing user experience.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Professional Camera:</strong> The rear camera boasts 108MP, allowing you to take professional-level photos.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Great Multi-Tasking Abilities:</strong> The phone is equipped with a Mediatek Helio G100 processor and 8GB RAM, supporting multiple tasks and intensive games without lag.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Great Battery:</strong> With a 5000mAh battery, this phone is perfect for people who stay out all day.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Final Thoughts</h2>\r\n<p>The Tecno SPARK 30 Pro is a stylish smartphone packed with ample features for its price. It impresses with its AMOLED screen, 108MP camera, and great battery output of 5000mAh. At a price of PKR 42,999, it is a great deal, outperforming many other options in its class.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Tecno Spark 30 Pro offers a lot for its price. If you\'re looking for this phone’s prices in Pakistan, this is your best chance. Hurry up, get the Tecno Spark 30 Pro, and enjoy modern technology!</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14, HIOS 14</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"wp-image-1222 alignnone\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">8GB RAM, 128GB / 256GB</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">108 MP</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">13 MP</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual SIM (Nano-SIM, dual stand-by)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Mediatek Helio G100 (6 nm)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.78 inches</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh, non-removable</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 10, 39999, 37999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:54:36', '2025-06-24 17:13:26', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(162, 'Infinix GT 20 Pro', 'infinix-gt-20-pro', 2, 45, '<h2>Infinix GT 20 Pro Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Infinix GT 20 Pro is the perfect blend of performance, high-end features, and elegance, making it one of the most sought-after devices in Pakistan. Priced at just PKR 1,000, it offers incredible value for those in the market for a powerful and versatile mobile phone.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>The Infinix GT 20 Pro is equipped with the following features:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><b>Seamless Performance with 6GB RAM:</b></li>\r\n  <p>The Infinix GT 20 Pro comes with 6GB of RAM, allowing you to run several applications without stutter. Whether you\'re playing high-end games, watching videos, or working on productivity apps, this phone ensures uninterrupted service.</p>\r\n\r\n  <li><b>Supports a Range of Documents:</b></li>\r\n  <p>With 128GB of ROM, you\'ll never be short on space. Store your favorite videos, photos, and apps without affecting the phone’s efficiency or speed.</p>\r\n\r\n  <li><b>Exquisite Build and Design:</b></li>\r\n  <p>Sleek, modern, and high-tech are just a few words that describe the build and design of the Infinix GT 20 Pro. Its lightweight body and thin design make it easy to use for long periods, providing premium comfort.</p>\r\n\r\n  <li><b>Excellent Graphics and Speed:</b></li>\r\n  <p>The sharp display offers accurate, bright, and saturated visuals, resulting in a better experience for streaming, gaming, and web browsing. The combination of a solid processor guarantees fast loading times and superb responsiveness.</p>\r\n\r\n  <li><b>Affordable and Value-Packed:</b></li>\r\n  <p>The Infinix GT 20 Pro is reasonably priced for its range in Pakistan. Whether you’re a student, professional, or casual user, this mobile device meets your requirements within a reasonable budget.</p>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Why Buy Infinix GT 20 Pro in Pakistan?</h2>\r\n<p><b>Competitive Price:</b> This phone is one of the most affordable options available, with a price tag of only PKR 1,000.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Versatile Usage:</b> Perfect for mobile gaming, selfie photography, and multitasking.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Reliable Brand:</b> Infinix is known in Pakistan as a trustworthy mobile brand with a long lifespan and effective customer care service.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Where to Buy the Infinix GT 20 Pro?</h2>\r\n<p>You can purchase the Infinix GT 20 Pro from top online shops in Pakistan. Make sure to check for the best prices and features available. Set price alerts to take advantage of discounts and promotions as they become available.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14, XOS 14</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"wp-image-1222 alignnone\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">8/12GB, 256 GB</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">108 MP + 2 MP + 2 MP</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">32 MP</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual SIM (Nano-SIM, dual stand-by)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Mediatek Dimensity 8200 Ultimate</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.78 inches</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh, non-removable</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 99999, 94499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:54:36', '2025-06-24 17:14:13', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(163, 'Xiaomi Redmi Note 14', 'xiaomi-redmi-note-14', 2, 61, '<h2>Xiaomi Redmi Note 14 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>Would you believe that the Xiaomi Redmi Note 14 is available in the Pakistan market at an unmatchable price of <strong>PKR 1000</strong> while being feature-packed as it is? With a target audience that caters to technophiles, Xiaomi has made sure that the Note 14 is built to impress.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>The Following are the salient features of Xiaomi Redmi Note 14:</h3>\r\n<strong>Impressive Multitasking with 8GB RAM:</strong>\r\n<p>With 8GB RAM packed within the design, the Xiaomi Redmi Note 14 can easily handle your streaming, gaming, and workloads. There will be no concern whatsoever regarding performance or specs hiccups while favoring uninterrupted usage.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With internal memory storage of up to 128GB and 256GB, you also have the option to add extra storage space through a card slot. Such generous options ensure that you are never left freezing with no space.</p>\r\n\r\n<strong>Vivid AMOLED Display:</strong>\r\n<p>The Note 14 sports a 6.7-inch AMOLED screen with a 1080 x 2400 pixel resolution. In addition, the Corning Gorilla Glass 5 protection provides durability and scratch resistance, ensuring an immersive experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<strong>High-End Dual Camera Set-up:</strong>\r\n<p>The availability of a 50MP rear camera with a 20MP front camera allows you to capture your precious moments in high quality, with HDR, Panorama, and even video recording features.</p>\r\n\r\n<strong>Long-Lasting Battery:</strong>\r\n<p>The 5110mAh battery capacity is appreciated by its users, as it ensures longer periods of phone usage. Together with streamlined software, the battery is effective for those who use their phones often.</p>\r\n\r\n<strong>Modern Design and Build:</strong>\r\n<p>The Xiaomi Redmi Note 14 is a beautiful and functional device, with a stunning weight of 190g and slimness of 7.99mm.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Why Buy Xiaomi Redmi Note 14 in Pakistan?</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Best Price:</strong> It is by far the cheapest option on the market at <strong>PKR 1,000</strong>.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Industry Leading Features:</strong> Designed for gaming, streaming, and multitasking, this Xiaomi Redmi Note 14’s performance does it all with ease, thanks to its advanced Mediatek Dimensity 7025 Ultra Mobile processor and IMG BXM-8-256 graphics.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Respected Company:</strong> Xiaomi has built a reputation over the years for reliability and providing good support to its customers, ensuring that users experience no hiccups.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Where to Buy Xiaomi Redmi Note 14 in Pakistan?</h3>\r\n<p>Check out Xiaomi Redmi Note 14 at online shops in Pakistan. Visit the available stores to get the best deal in terms of prices, specifications, and bargains. Be sure to set alerts for discounts and other promotional offers in advance.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"wp-image-1222 alignnone\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">8GB, 128/256GB</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">50 MP</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">20 MP</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Mediatek Dimensity 7025 Ultra (6 nm)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.7 Inches</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5110 mAh</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 10, 52999, 48999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:54:36', '2025-06-24 17:15:14', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(164, 'Xiaomi Redmi Note 14 Pro Plus', 'xiaomi-redmi-note-14-pro-plus', 2, 61, '<h2>Xiaomi Redmi Note 14 Pro Plus Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>Xiaomi has worked hard to create a smartphone that combines affordability with competitive features: the Xiaomi Redmi Note 14 Pro Plus is priced at Rs. 141,999/- and can be considered one of the most, if not the most powerful smartphone to be released by the company in 2025.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Specifications</h2>\r\n<p>The Redmi Note 14 Pro Plus is powered by a Qualcomm Snapdragon 8 Gen 3 chipset. This allows the device to run even the most demanding applications without a hitch. The device comes with 8 GB of RAM, making it ideal for multitasking or gaming as it provides a seamless experience. It also comes with internal storage variants of either 128GB or 256GB, which is enough for most users, offering ample space for apps, media, and documents. Unfortunately, there isn’t an external card slot, meaning that memory cannot be expanded further, but the inbuilt storage should suffice for the average consumer.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Display</h2>\r\n<p>The Redmi Note 14 Pro Plus is equipped with a 6.73-inch AMOLED display that makes colors more vibrant while improving the depth of blacks, creating a more captivating experience. The scrolling speed is uninterrupted due to the 120Hz refresh rate, which remains true while using social media, watching videos, or gaming. The display guarantees every piece of content to be crystal clear, providing excellent visuals.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Camera System</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'re interested in photography, then the Xiaomi Redmi Note 14 Pro Plus will not disappoint. Its primary rear camera is 200MP, enabling you to take high-resolution photos. The ultra-wide 8MP camera allows you to capture vast skies, while the 2MP macro sensor provides the ability for close-ups of small objects. With the support of 4K video recording, you\'re guaranteed astounding videos with intricate details. The front camera features 32MP, designed to provide crisp selfies and clear video calls, even in low-light conditions.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Battery Life</h2>\r\n<p>With a 5000mAh battery, the Redmi Note 14 Pro Plus ensures that you can use your device all day without running out of power. Thanks to its fast charging technology, you can quickly charge the device and continue using it without interruptions. The battery is efficient enough to handle activities like video streaming, internet browsing, and gaming.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>OS & Connectivity</h2>\r\n<p>The Xiaomi Redmi Note 14 Pro Plus runs on Android 14, offering a smooth and user-friendly interface. The device supports 5G networks, Bluetooth 5.3, Wi-Fi 6, and NFC, allowing you to connect to other devices with ease. Additionally, the dual SIM feature enables you to manage both personal and work calls effortlessly.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price in Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Xiaomi Redmi Note 14 Pro Plus offers a feature-packed experience similar to other flagship smartphones, but at a more affordable price of Rs. 141,999. Whether you want to capture stunning photos, enjoy gaming, or need a reliable device for daily tasks, this phone has it all. With its powerful hardware, amazing camera, and sleek design, the Xiaomi Redmi Note 14 Pro Plus is one of the best devices in the flagship category.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Why Buy the Xiaomi Redmi Note 14 Pro Plus?</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Best Performance:</strong> Snapdragon 8 Gen 3 and 8GB RAM for better performance with minimal lags.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Amazing Visuals:</strong> AMOLED display with 120Hz for a better viewing experience.</li>\r\n  <li>Incredible photo and video results thanks to the 200MP rear camera.</li>\r\n  <li>With a great 5,000mAh battery and fast charging, you\'ll never run out of charge during the day.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Reasonable Cost:</strong> Premium features at a competitive price of only Rs. 141,999.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"wp-image-1222 alignnone\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">12, 512 GB</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">200MP+8MP+2MP</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">20MP</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual SIM, Hybrid Slot (SIM or microSD)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Snapdragon 7s Gen 3</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">6.7 Inch</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5110mAh (typ) high-capacity battery</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 10, 138999, 134999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:54:36', '2025-06-24 17:16:09', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(165, 'Ronin R-290 Mini Earbuds', 'ronin-r-290-mini-earbuds', 13, 49, '<h2>Ronin R-290 Mini Earbuds Price in Pakistan & Features</h2>\r\n<p>The Ronin R-290 Mini Earbuds offer a budget-friendly audio solution with Bluetooth 5.3 connectivity, a compact charging case, and universal compatibility. Priced at Rs. 4,199/- in Pakistan, these earbuds are an excellent option for daily use, providing both functionality and affordability.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Ronin R-290 Mini Earbuds Features & Specifications</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Bluetooth v5.3 for Stable Connectivity:</strong> With Bluetooth 5.3, these earbuds ensure a strong and stable connection within a 10-meter range, providing seamless music and call quality.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Compact Charging Case (260mAh):</strong> The Ronin R-290 Mini Earbuds case supports USB-C fast charging, reducing downtime and ensuring quick power-ups.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Decent Playtime (3.5-4 Hours):</strong> Enjoy uninterrupted music or calls for up to 4 hours on a single charge.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Built-in Mic for Calls:</strong> These earbuds feature a high-quality microphone for clear voice calls, making them ideal for hands-free conversations.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Lightweight & Comfortable:</strong> Designed for everyday use, these earbuds are small, lightweight, and easy to carry.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Compatibility with Android & iOS:</strong> The Ronin R-290 Mini Earbuds are universally compatible with Android smartphones, iPhones, tablets, and more.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>No Water Resistance & Noise Cancellation:</strong> While these earbuds do not support noise cancellation or water resistance, they are still a great choice for casual use.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Ronin R-290 Mini Earbuds Price in Pakistan – Is It Worth Buying?</h3>\r\n<p>With a price of Rs. 4,199/-, the Ronin R-290 Mini Earbuds offer essential features like Bluetooth 5.3, a 260mAh charging case, and up to 4 hours of playtime. If you\'re looking for budget-friendly earbuds with clear audio and mic support, this is a solid option.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Why Buy Ronin R-290 Mini Earbuds?</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Affordable price in Pakistan:</strong> Priced at a reasonable Rs. 4,199, making them accessible for all.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Reliable Bluetooth 5.3 connectivity:</strong> Ensures stable connection for audio and calls.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Comfortable fit for daily use:</strong> Small, lightweight, and ergonomic design for extended wear.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>USB-C charging with a compact case:</strong> Fast charging and a convenient charging case for ease of use.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Clear microphone for calls:</strong> Ensures high-quality calls with minimal background noise.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Where to Buy Ronin R-290 Mini Earbuds in Pakistan?</h3>\r\n<p>You can buy Ronin R-290 Mini Earbuds online in Pakistan from various e-commerce stores. Compare prices to get the best deal and enjoy quality wireless audio at an affordable price!</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Model:</strong> Ronin R-290 Mini Earbuds</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth Version:</strong> v5.3 with a 10m range</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Battery Life:</strong> 3.5-4 hours playtime</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Charging Case:</strong> 260mAh, USB-C fast charging</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Compatibility</strong>: Works with Android &amp; iOS</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Noise Cancellation:</strong> No</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Water Resistance:</strong> No</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Auto Pairing:</strong> Not supported</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 6499, 4199, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:54:36', '2025-06-24 17:16:46', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(166, 'Ronin R-83 10000mAh Power Bank', 'ronin-r-83-10000mah-power-bank', 10, 54, '<h2>Ronin R-83 10000mAh Power Bank Price in Pakistan & Features</h2>\r\n<p>The Ronin R-83 Power Bank is a trustworthy and compact charging solution for those requiring a swift and effective power backup. This power bank ensures that your devices are kept charged, whether you are on a trip, traveling, or working. With a competitive price of Rs. 4,299/- in Pakistan, it provides a cost-effective option for reliable power backup.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Ronin R-83 10000mAh Power Bank Features & Specifications</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>High-Capacity Battery (10000mAh):</strong> With a 10,000mAh capacity, the Ronin R-83 Power Bank, equipped with a Lithium Polymer battery, guarantees to keep your devices charged for an extended period.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Multiple Charging Ports:</strong> It features two USB output ports, allowing you to charge multiple devices simultaneously. Additionally, it comes with a Type-C output for enhanced connectivity.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Fast Charging Support:</strong> Compared to other power banks, the Ronin R-83 charges your smartphone or tablet much quicker, thanks to its efficient power management system.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Compact & Portable Design:</strong> Lightweight and sleek, the compact design makes it easy to slip into your pocket, backpack, or suitcase, making it perfect for people on the go.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Universal Compatibility:</strong> The Ronin Power Bank is compatible with Android, iOS, Tablets, Smart Watches, and more, ensuring backup power is always accessible.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Ronin R-83 10000mAh Power Bank Price in Pakistan – Is It Worth Buying?</h2>\r\n<p>At a price of Rs. 4,299/-, the Ronin R-83 10000mAh Power Bank is reasonably priced. Its efficiency, durability, and features such as fast charging, multiple ports, and compact design make it a solid choice for daily use.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Why Buy Ronin R-83 10000mAh Power Bank?</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Economical Rate:</strong> The 10,000mAh battery provides maximum backup at an affordable price.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Fast Charging & Compact:</strong> Lightweight and quick charging for on-the-go convenience.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Dual USB & Type-C Output:</strong> Enables charging multiple devices at once.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Where to Buy Ronin R-83 10000mAh Power Bank in Pakistan?</h2>\r\n<p>The Ronin R-83 10000mAh Power Bank is available at a variety of e-commerce websites in Pakistan.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You can purchase it from Phones Dukan to find the best prices and deals.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you\'re looking for a long-lasting and affordable power bank, the Ronin R-83 10000mAh Power Bank is a great choice.</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Model:</strong> Ronin R-83 10000mAh Power Bank</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Battery Capacity:</strong> 10000mAh Lithium Polymer</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Ports:</strong> 2x USB + Type-C Output</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Compact &amp; Portable:</strong> Lightweight and easy to carry</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Compatibility:</strong> Works with all smartphones &amp; tablets</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Fast Charging:</strong> Provides quick power backup for devices</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 7399, 4299, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:54:36', '2025-06-24 17:18:30', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(167, 'Ronin Wireless Mini POD (R-590)', 'ronin-wireless-mini-pod-r-590', 13, 54, '<h2>Ronin Wireless Mini POD (R-590) Price in Pakistan & Features</h2>\r\n<p>Do you need a pair of wireless earbuds that are both affordable and high-quality? The Ronin Wireless Mini POD (R-590) caters to both casual listeners and professionals. It is currently available in Pakistan for just 3,999 rupees. This wireless mini pod boasts impressive sound quality, perfect connectivity, and a sleek design.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Bluetooth 5.0 & 10m Range</h3>\r\n<p>The upgraded Bluetooth 5.0 eliminates audio dropouts and offers a stable connection within a 10-meter range, ensuring seamless audio quality.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Battery Life & Charging:</strong></li>\r\n  <li><strong>Earbuds Battery:</strong> 30mAh each</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Charging Case:</strong> 200mAh</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Playtime:</strong> 3-4 hours</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Charging Time:</strong> 2 hours</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Auto Pairing & Easy Connectivity:</strong> Once the Ronin R-590 Mini PODs are out of their charging case, they automatically pair with the device that was last connected to them. These earbuds are easy to use and work seamlessly with both iOS and Android devices.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Built-in Microphone for Clear Calls</h3>\r\n<p>The built-in microphone ensures that your voice calls are clear and free from disturbance, making it easy to stay in touch with friends or colleagues.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Compact & Lightweight Design</h3>\r\n<p>These earbuds are designed for comfort and portability, making them easy to carry in your purse or pocket due to their small yet powerful stature.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Ronin Wireless Mini POD (R-590) Price in Pakistan – Is It Relevant?</h2>\r\n<p>The Ronin Wireless Mini POD (R-590) presents itself as an attractive option for users looking for high-quality wireless earbuds at an affordable price of Rs. 3,999/-. While it offers Bluetooth 5.0, auto pairing, and decent battery life, it does not feature noise cancellation or water resistance, which may be a downside for some users.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Why Buy Ronin Wireless Mini POD (R-590)?</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Cost-effective for Pakistani users</li>\r\n  <li>Low energy usage with strong Bluetooth 5.0 connectivity</li>\r\n  <li>Automatic connection for quick access</li>\r\n  <li>Minimalistic and ergonomic design</li>\r\n  <li>Adequate battery capacity for casual listeners</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Where to Buy Ronin Wireless Mini POD (R-590) in Pakistan?</h2>\r\n<p>You can easily find the Ronin Wireless Mini POD (R-590) on various online shopping websites in Pakistan. Be sure to compare prices from different online stores to secure the best deal.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Overall, the Ronin Wireless Mini POD (R-590) earbuds are a highly recommended option for buyers looking for affordability and optimum quality.</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Model:</strong> Ronin Wireless Mini POD (R-590)</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth Version</strong>: 5.0 with 10m range</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Battery Life:</strong> 3-4 hours playtime, 200mAh case capacity</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Microphone:</strong> Yes, with clear sound quality</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Compatibility:</strong> Supports Android &amp; iOS devices</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Auto Pairing:</strong> Yes, for instant connectivity</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Charging Time:</strong> 2 hours</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 7, 5999, 3999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:54:36', '2025-06-24 17:19:12', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(168, 'Ronin R-280 Bluetooth Headset', 'ronin-r-280-bluetooth-headset', 13, 49, '<h2>Ronin R-280 Bluetooth Headset Price In Pakistan and Specifications</h2>\r\n<p>The <strong>Ronin R-280 Bluetooth Sports Partner</strong> is built for people who are always on the move. Whether you\'re jogging, working out, or commuting, these wireless earbuds provide the balance of comfort, performance, and price that today\'s users demand. Priced at <strong>₨ 3,499 in Pakistan</strong>, they are considered one of the <strong>best Bluetooth earbuds in Pakistan</strong> within this budget range.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Featuring <strong>Bluetooth 5.0</strong>, the Ronin R-280 ensures a stable and fast connection. Whether you\'re streaming music or taking calls, the connection stays smooth and uninterrupted within a range of <strong>up to 10 meters</strong>. You can keep your phone in your pocket or bag and still enjoy high-quality audio without signal drops.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>One of the standout features is its <strong>100mAh battery</strong>, which delivers a solid <strong>talk time of up to 5 hours</strong>. That’s enough for daily commutes, gym sessions, or even multiple conference calls. When not in use, it holds a charge for an impressive <strong>100 hours of standby time</strong>, meaning you won’t have to constantly charge it. The <strong>charging time of just 2 hours</strong> makes it easy to top up the battery during downtime.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The lightweight build and ergonomic fit make the <strong>Ronin R-280 Sports Earbuds</strong> comfortable to wear for extended periods. Whether you\'re in the middle of a workout or on a long call, they stay secure without causing discomfort. Their sleek, sporty design also makes them a stylish choice for both casual and active users.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Users searching for <strong>Ronin R-280 price in Pakistan</strong> will find that this model delivers excellent value. At <strong>PKR 3,499</strong>, it provides features that are usually found in more expensive models. It\'s a strong competitor to other earbuds in the same price range and is often considered a <strong>top wireless earbud for under 4000 PK</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For those who rely on wireless audio throughout the day, call clarity is essential. The Ronin R-280 supports crisp voice transmission, making it reliable for both business and personal calls. It filters background noise well enough to keep communication clear, even in moderately noisy environments.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Durability is also a key factor in everyday use. While the Ronin R-280 is lightweight, it is designed to withstand regular wear and tear. The robust outer shell resists minor bumps, while the internal components are built to last longer under daily use conditions. This makes it a solid pick for users who want a balance of quality and affordability.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With strong market presence and consistent customer feedback, Ronin has positioned the R-280 as a budget-friendly alternative to higher-end models. Whether you want to <strong>buy Ronin R-280 in Pakistan</strong> for personal use or as a gift, the combination of performance, price, and warranty support makes it an ideal option.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>To sum it up, if you\'re looking for a <strong>Bluetooth earbud with a long-lasting battery, solid call quality, and reliable Bluetooth connectivity</strong> at a great price, the <strong>Ronin R-280 Bluetooth Sports Partner</strong> is one of the best choices available. Its <strong>price of 3,499 PKR</strong> makes it accessible for a wide range of users, from students to professionals. It\'s a solid fit for anyone wanting to enjoy music, calls, or podcasts wirelessly without breaking the bank.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Looking for the <strong>best and cheapest Bluetooth earbuds in Pakistan</strong>? The Ronin R-280 offers everything you need for an active lifestyle at a reasonable cost. Order today and enjoy wireless freedom with lasting performance.</p>', '<ul>\r\n  <li>Model: Ronin R-280 Bluetooth Sports Partner</li>\r\n  <li>Bluetooth Version: 5.0</li>\r\n  <li>Battery Capacity: 100mAh</li>\r\n  <li>Talk Time: Up to 5 Hours</li>\r\n  <li>Standby Time: Up to 100 Hours</li>\r\n  <li>Operating Range: Up to 10 meters</li>\r\n  <li>Charging Time: 2 Hours</li>\r\n  <li>Perfect for workouts, calls, and travel</li>\r\n  <li>Price in Pakistan: <strong>₨ 3,499</strong></li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 3499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:54:36', '2025-06-24 17:19:56', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(169, 'Ronin R-628 20W Wall Charger', 'ronin-r-628-20w-wall-charger', 14, 62, '<h2>Ronin R-628 20W Wall Charger Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>If you are looking for a fast-charging and reliable wall charger, the Ronin R-628 20W Wall Charger is a great option. With its dual output (USB and PD), this charger provides efficient charging for smartphones, tablets, and other devices. Available at a price of Rs. 2,499/- in Pakistan, this charger is a cost-effective solution for users who need a durable and high-performance charger.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Ronin R-628 20W Wall Charger Price in Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The latest Ronin R-628 20W Wall Charger price in Pakistan is Rs. 2,499/-. Prices may vary slightly depending on different online stores and sellers. If you are looking to buy Ronin R-628 20W Wall Charger at the best price, check multiple retailers for the most competitive offers.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Ronin R-628 20W Wall Charger Features</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Fast Charging:</strong> Equipped with 20W power output, it charges devices quickly.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>USB &amp; PD Output:</strong> Supports multiple charging methods for compatibility with a wide range of devices.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Compact Design:</strong> The small and lightweight design makes it easy to carry while traveling.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Durable Build:</strong> Made from high-quality materials for longevity.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Universal Compatibility:</strong> Works with Android, iPhones, tablets, and other gadgets.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Why Buy Ronin R-628 20W Wall Charger?</h2>\r\n<p>Many users prefer this charger due to its affordable pricing, fast charging technology, and reliable build quality. If you want a charger that offers powerful charging without overheating or overloading your device, this is a great choice.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Ronin R-628 20W Wall Charger Lowest Price in Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>Looking for the lowest price? The Ronin R-628 20W Wall Charger is currently available for Rs. 2,499/- in Pakistan. Compare prices from different stores before making a purchase to get the best deal.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Where to Buy Ronin R-628 20W Wall Charger in Pakistan?</h2>\r\n<p>You can buy Ronin R-628 20W Wall Charger online from reliable e-commerce stores across Pakistan. Check prices, specifications, and customer reviews before placing an order.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For users searching for an affordable, fast-charging wall adapter, the Ronin R-628 20W Wall Charger is a top pick. Get yours today at the best price!</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Model:</strong> Ronin R-628</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Charging Type:</strong> Fast Charging</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Output:</strong> USB and PD</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Compatible with:</strong> Multiple devices</li>\r\n 	<li>Compact &amp; lightweight design</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 5000, 2499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:54:36', '2025-06-25 10:38:55', 'NULL', NULL, 0);
