(170, 'YOLO YoPod2 EarBuds', 'yolo-yopod2-earbuds', 13, 62, '<h2>YOLO YoPod2 EarBuds Price in Pakistan</h2>\r\nThe latest price of YOLO YoPod2 EarBuds in Pakistan is Rs. 3,999/-. As with many electronics, the prices are not constant and will vary from online store to online store. Those wishing to purchase a YOLO YoPod2 EarBuds should look for multiple offers before making a purchase, as it can yield better prices.\r\n<h3>YOLO YoPod2 EarBuds Features</h3>\r\nENC Noise Cancellation – This feature cuts down on background noise, providing clearer calls and better music quality.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth 5.2</strong> – Offers stable and fast connectivity with almost no delay in audio.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Auto Pairing</strong> – Disconnecting the earbuds from the charging case instantly connects the earbuds to the device.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>IPX4 Water Resistance</strong> – Sweat and light splashes are not an issue, making the ear pods perfect for workouts.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Long Battery Life</strong> – Delivers 3 to 4 hours of audio on one charge.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Quick Charging</strong> – The earbuds can be fully charged within just 1.5 hours.</li>\r\n 	<li>Universal Compatibility – The earbuds work perfectly with Android and iOS devices.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nWhy Buy YOLO YoPod2 EarBuds? These earbuds are an excellent choice for users who need affordable, high-performance wireless earbuds. The IPX4 rating protects against sweat, making them out for sports and outdoor activities.\r\n<h2>YOLO YoPod2 EarBuds Lowest Price in Pakistan</h2>\r\nThe YOLO YoPod2 EarBuds are available for Rs. 3999/- so if you do want to get the lowest rate possible, make sure you check other platforms because prices do vary depending on the particular e-commerce site.\r\n<h2>Where to Buy YOLO YoPod2 EarBuds in Pakistan?</h2>\r\nIn Pakistan, you can purchase YoPod2 Ear Buds from a number of retailers and e-commerce websites like Phones Dukan. Look for the best prices, best specifications, and customer reviews before making the purchase.\r\n\r\nFor wireless earbuds that are affordable and of superb sound quality, have noise cancellation, and water resistance, the YOLO YoPod2 EarBuds are amazing. Looking for an immersive audio experience? Order yours today and reap the benefits.', '<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Model:</strong> YOLO YoPod2</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth Version:</strong> 5.2</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Noise Cancellation:</strong> ENC</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Water Resistance:</strong> IPX4</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Battery Life:</strong> 3-4 hours</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Charging Time</strong>: 1.5 hours</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Compatibility:</strong> Android &amp; iOS</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 6499, 3999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:54:36', '2025-05-11 13:27:48', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(171, 'Audionic Airbud 500', 'audionic-airbud-500', 13, 43, '<h2>Audionic Airbud 500 Price In Pakistan</h2>\n<p>The Audionic Airbud 500 comes to mind for all-day wearers seeking reliable activies. With a trustworthy Bluetooth 5.3 connection, quad microphones, long battery life, and clear audio, all your activities will be covered with ease. The Audionic Airbud 500 will also provide a decent fit and sound quality whether you are working, traveling, or hitting the gym. Audiophiles will rejoice as the sound quality is simply immaculate.</p>\n\n<p>At the moment, Audionic Airbud 500 is priced at <span>Rs. 4,499/-</span>. Most retailers have differing rates so make sure to check other stores as well for better offers. If you want to buy Audionic Airbud 500 for the best price do take time to check various online stores.</p>\n<h3>Audionic Airbud 500 Features</h3>\n<p>Advanced Noise Cancellation blocks out all unwanted background commotion ensuring clear sound. With Bluetooth 5.3, stability and speed of connection are guaranteed over a 15m range. The quad microphone system improves call clarity and recognition of speech.</p>\n\n<p>The IPX54 rating certifies protection against sweat and minor water splashes. Long list of features continue with 7 hours of playtime on a single charge. Playtime is greatly aided by the earbuds charging in 1.2 hours while the case charges in 2. Fast, efficient charging is guaranteed with the USB-C interface.</p>\n<h2>Why Buy Audionic Airbud 500?</h2>\n<p>The Audionic Airbud 500 is perfect if you seek budget-friendly high-definition earbuds. The earbuds are equipped with Bluetooth 5.3 for automatic pairing, while the quad mic system enhances call clarity. The device is rated IPX54 which enables use during workouts and casual outdoor activities, while the USB-C port enables easy and rapid charging.</p>\n<h2>Audionic Airbud 500 Lowest Price in Pakistan</h2>\n<p>For an optimized price offer, check out the Audionic Airbud 500, which is listed at <span>Rs. 4,499/-</span> at this time. Always remember to check multiple online stores for the best price.</p>\n<h2>Where to Buy Audionic Airbud 500 in Pakistan?</h2>\n<p>Audionic Airbud 500 can be purchased online from reliable vendors all over Pakistan. It’s always advisable to check for authenticity, warranty, and customer feedback information before making any purchases.</p>\n\n<em>Purchase the Audionic Airbud 500 for inexpensive wireless earbuds and enjoy long battery life, high call quality, superior noise cancellation, and delay-free audio. Place an order now and enjoy the best sound quality!</em>', '<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Model:</strong> Audionic Airbud 500</li>\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth Version:</strong> 5.3</li>\n 	<li><strong>Noise Cancellation:</strong> Yes</li>\n 	<li><strong>Water Resistance:</strong> IPX54</li>\n 	<li><strong>Battery Life:</strong> Up to 7 hours</li>\n 	<li><strong>Charging Time:</strong> 1.2 hours (buds), 2 hours (case)</li>\n 	<li><strong>Charging Interface:</strong> USB-C</li>\n 	<li><strong>Compatibility:</strong> Android &amp; iOS</li>\n</ul>', 1, 50, 8899, 4499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:54:36', '2025-04-22 11:44:51', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(172, 'Audionic Airbud Signature S600 Wireless Earbuds', 'audionic-airbud-signature-s600-wireless-earbuds', 13, 43, '<h2>Audionic Airbud Signature S600 Wireless Earbuds Price In Pakistan</h2>\n<p>The Audionic Airbud Signature S600 Wireless Earbuds are up to par with sound quality, battery life, and connectivity. The ergonomic shape these earbuds come equipped with, along with the Bluetooth 5.3, provides the user with comfort while listening to anything. With the wireless quad mic system, crystal clear call quality is achieved, along with unbelievable noise cancellation that’s perfect for when you’re commuting, working, or exercise.</p>\n\n<p>As of now the Audionic Airbud signature S600 wireless earbuds price in Pakistan is <span>Rs. 4,699/-</span>. But pricing is subject to change based on the retailer. If you are looking for the best deal, check prices from several online retailers so you can purchase at the lowest cost possible.</p>\n<h3>Audionic Airbud Signature S600 Wireless Earbuds Features</h3>\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Advanced Noise Cancellation</strong> - Blocks background noise for a clear audio experience.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth 5.3 Connectivity</strong> – Stable and fast pairing with a 10m range.</li>\n 	<li><strong>IPX5 Water Resistance</strong> - Covers users during workouts without the fear of excessive sweating or splashes.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Quad Mic System</strong> - Increased call quality by reducing ambient noise.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Fast Charging &amp; Long Battery Life</strong> - The charging case provides up to 48 hours of playtime.</li>\n 	<li><strong>USB-C Charging Interface</strong> - Both fast and efficient charging are supported.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Why Buy Audionic Airbud Signature S600 Wireless Earbuds?</h2>\n<p>If you’re in the market for earbuds that have premium built quality, Airbud Signature S600 is one of the best wireless earbuds available. The Audionic Airbud Signature S600 Wireless Earbuds have high quality sound features and calling capabilities, and the battery can also last a long time.</p>\n\n<p>The IPX5 water-resistance rating makes these earbuds gym and outdoors friendly, while USB-C charging means power up is easy and efficient. Audionic Airbud Signature S600 Wireless Earbuds Lowest Price in Pakistan Check out different online sites to find the lowest price in Pakistan.</p>\n\n<p>The headset price is currently <span>Rs. 4,699/-</span> but payment discounts can be utilized. Where to Buy Audionic Airbud Signature S600 Wireless Earbuds in Pakistan? The Audionic Airbud Signature S600 is available at some of the most reputable online shops in Pakistan.</p>\n\n<p>Remember to check the warranty and return policies and read through customer experience reviews if any before finalizing your order. Get your hands on the Audionic Airbud Signature S600 Wireless Earbuds today for superior audio quality, long-lasting battery, and best in class noise cancellation.</p>', '<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Model:</strong> Audionic Airbud Signature S600</li>\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth Version:</strong> 5.3</li>\n 	<li><strong>Noise Cancellation:</strong> Yes</li>\n 	<li><strong>Water Resistance:</strong> IPX5</li>\n 	<li><strong>Battery Life:</strong> Up to 48 hours with the case</li>\n 	<li><strong>Charging Time:</strong> 30-45 minutes (buds), 1.5 hours (case)</li>\n 	<li><strong>Charging Interface:</strong> USB-C</li>\n 	<li><strong>Compatibility:</strong> Android &amp; iOS</li>\n 	<li><strong>Mic:</strong> Quad Mic for clear calls</li>\n</ul>', 1, 0, 8299, 4699, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:54:36', '2025-04-23 11:42:58', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(173, 'ALIEN-3 AC Power 2.0 Speaker', 'alien-3-ac-power-2-0-speaker', 4, 49, '<h2>ALIEN-3 AC Power 2.0 Speaker Price In Pakistan</h2>\n<p>If one intends to watch television, play video games, or listen to music, the Audionic Alien-3 AC Power 2.0 Speaker would ensure that the audio is clear and well defined. The speaker is constructed with regards to power output, style, and durability so every user would be pleased with their purchase.</p>\n\n<p>You can buy the Audionic Alien-3 AC Power 2.0 Speaker in Pakistan for <span>Rs. 1,699/-</span>. The product is sold at different online shops that sell the device for the best price in the market.</p>\n<h3>Audionic Alien-3 AC Power 2.0 Speaker Features</h3>\n<p><strong>Power Output:</strong> Offers a maximum power output of P.M.P.O, 300W and R.M.S., 3W x2 for maximum sound effect.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Drive Unit:</strong> The Two Point Five inch driver is fitted and provides clearer sound.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Frequency Response:</strong> The device operates on a frequency of 60Hz to 20kHz and provides clear high frequency sounds as well as deep bass.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Impedance:</strong> The device works at an impedance of 4 Ohms which makes it very power efficient without compromising on sound quality.</p>\n\n<p><strong>AC Power Input:</strong> Accepts between 90V and 230V AC power so it can be used at home or in the office.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Compact &amp; Stylish Design:</strong> It is suitable for any modern environment.</p>\n<h2>Reasons to purchase Alien-3 AC Power 2.0 Speakers by Audionic:</h2>\n<p>If you require a strong and affordable speaker set, look no further than the Alien-3 AC Power 2.0 speaker. It is perfect for personal entertainment as it provides soothing sound, strong bass, and beautiful sheen.</p>\n<h2>Audionic Alien-3 AC Power 2.0 Speaker Set Available at Lowest Possible Price in Pakistan</h2>\n<p>The price of the speaker tends to fluctuate from <span>Rs. 1,699/-</span> on various platforms. You can easily find lower rates in Pakistan through other online vendors, who might possess special offers and additional rates on selected platforms.</p>\n<h2>Who sells Audionic Alien-3 AC Power 2.0 Speaker in Pakistan?</h2>\n<p>Purchasing Alien-3 AC Power 2.0 speakers is easy through trusted online stores in Pakistan. One must always check for warranty, return policies, and prior user ratings beforehand.</p>\n\n<em>Slightly upgrade your speaker system with the Alien-3 AC Power 2.0 speakers at an incredibly low price!<em>', '<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Model:</strong> Audionic Alien-3 AC Power 2.0 Speaker</li>\n 	<li><strong>Drive Unit:</strong> 2.5\"</li>\n 	<li><strong>Output Power:</strong> P.M.P.O. 300W / R.M.S. 3W x2</li>\n 	<li><strong>Impedance:</strong> 4 Ohms</li>\n 	<li><strong>Frequency Response:</strong> 60Hz - 20kHz</li>\n 	<li><strong>Power Input:</strong> 90V-230V</li>\n 	<li><strong>Type:</strong> 2.0 AC Power Speaker</li>\n</ul>', 1, 50, 1699, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:54:36', '2025-04-23 13:16:52', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(174, 'Maxon Z-20 PD Power Bank 20000mAh', 'maxon-z-20-pd-power-bank-20000mah', 10, 49, '<h2>Maxon Z-20 PD Power Bank 20000mAh Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>Maxon Z-20 PD Power Bank 20000mAh is relatively cheap and can be purchased online with some retailers selling it for just <span>Rs. 3,699 PKR</span>, making it one of the top rated mid-range power banks out there.The Maxon Z-20 PD Power Bank 20000mAh’s selling point is that it can charge many devices at the same time. Thanks to its power bank quick charge level, it also supports charging tablets and phones without wasting too much time. With an impressive built-in battery, this zik maxon power bank becomes one of the best gadget chargers around during travels or moving around for work.</p>\r\n<h3>Maxon Z-20 PD Power Bank 20000mAh Features</h3>\r\n<p>Loosely speaking, the Zik Maxon power bank is one of the few models with masive size extremely large power battery over 20k mAh.</p>\r\n<p>Supports quick charge: Power bank supports 18 watts quick charge through type-c ports and USB outputs.</p>\r\n<h4>Type-C Input &amp; Output:</h4>\r\n<p>The device allows for smoother communication with other smart devices with supporting type c peripherals such as phone tablet &amp; laptop</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Input: 5V-3A, 9V-2A, 12V-1.5A</li>\r\n 	<li>Output: 5V/3A, 9V/2.22A, 12V/1.67A</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>USB Output:</h4>\r\n<p>The faster charging specification also provides up to 22.5watts of total maximum power, greatly improving the charging speed.</p>\r\n<h4>Total Power Output:</h4>\r\n<p>22.5W Max power output, optimal power supply efficiency.</p>\r\n<h4>Portable &amp; Compact Design:</h4>\r\n<p>Light weight and slim body make it simple to carry around anywhere. Perfect for traveling and everyday use.</p>\r\n<h2>What are the reasons to purchase the Maxon Z-20 PD Power Bank 20000mAh?</h2>\r\n<p>If you are looking for a power bank that charges quickly and has a large storage capacity, the Maxon Z-20 PD Power Bank will suit you just great. With its several charging options, you can be sure that all of your devices will remain charged even while you\'re on the go.</p>\r\n<h2>Maxon Z-20 PD Power Bank 20000mAh Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>For those who are trying to find the maximum Z-20 PD Power Bank for the cheapest price in Pakistan, make sure to search through various online platforms to see which is cheaper. The price I found was <span>Rs. 3,699/-,</span> selling for this price at the moment with potential sales in the future.</p>\r\n<h2>Where to Purchase Maxon Z-20 PD Power Bank 20000mAh in Pakistan?</h2>\r\n<p>The Maxon Z-20 PD Power Bank 20000mAh can be located in most trusted online retail stores in Pakistan. Don\'t forget to look at warranty information, return conditions, and other customer ratings before making your buying decision.</p>\r\n\r\n<em>Don’t get drained out even when you are away from the wall socket with the Maxon Z-20 PD Power Bank 20000mAh! You will be able to enjoy fast charging and battery life you can truly rely on.</em>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Model:</strong> Maxon Z-20 PD Power Bank 20000mAh</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Battery Capacity:</strong> 20000mAh</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Quick Charge:</strong> Yes</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Type-C Input:</strong> 5V-3A, 9V-2A, 12V-1.5A</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Type-C Output:</strong> 5V/3A, 9V/2.22A, 12V/1.67A</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>USB Output:</strong> 4.5V-5A to 12V-1.5A</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Total Output Power:</strong> 22.5W (Max)</li>\r\n 	<li>Portable &amp; Lightweight Design</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 0, 4800, 3699, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:54:36', '2025-05-25 11:44:55', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(175, 'Maxon Z-10 PD Power Bank 10000mAh', 'maxon-z-10-pd-power-bank-10000mah', 10, 49, '<h2>Maxon Z-10 PD Power Bank 10000mAh Price In Pakistan</h2>\n<p>The Maxon Z-10 PD Power Bank, equipped with 10,000mAh, is designed with your convenience in mind. This portable charger is perfect for busy travelers and professionals on the go as it provides reliable power and quick charging solutions for all your devices.</p>\n<h3>Features of Maxon Z-10 PD Power Bank 10,000mAh:</h3>\n<h4>Battery Capacity 10,000mAh:</h4>\n<p>For users of Android and iOS alike, this power bank promises multiple charges throughout the day while keeping you connected thanks to its 10,000mAh lithium battery. Regardless of what OS your devices are on, Maxon has you covered.</p>\n<h4>Quick Charging Capabilities:</h4>\n<p>With a total output of 22.5W, charging time is minimal. While using the Quick Charge and Power Delivery (PD) methods, Maxon ensures power is fed to all devices in the fastest manner possible to save you more time.</p>\n<h4>Type-C Input Charging Ports:</h4>\n<ul>\n 	<li>5V-3A, 9V-2A, 12V-1.5A</li>\n 	<li>Type-C Output Charging Ports:</li>\n 	<li>5V/3A, 9V/2.22A, 12V/1.67A</li>\n 	<li>USB Output - 4.5V-5A to 12V-1.5A</li>\n 	<li>Total Output - 22.5W (Max)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Multiple Ports for Versatile Charging:</h4>\n<p>With additional USB ports, this power bank makes charging multiple devices at once simple and easy. The built-in smart chips also guarantee safety by redistributing power where it\'s most needed while eliminating the chance of overheating and overcharging.</p>\n<h4>Portable and Lightweight Design:</h4>\n<p>It fits easily into the pocket making it easy to carry. So, whether you are traveling for business, on a holiday, or out commuting, the Maxon Z-10 PD Power Bank 10000mAh is the perfect travel partner for you.</p>\n<h4>Smart Safety Features:</h4>\n<p>This power bank ensures safety of devices using overcharge protection, short circuit protection, and temperature control.</p>\n<h2>Maxon Z-10 PD Power Bank 10000mAh Price In Pakistan</h2>\n<p>The Maxon Z-10 PD Power Bank 10000mAh stands out not only for its cheap price in Pakistan but its high performance as well. This unit’s price in Pakistan is <span>2950 PKR</span>, which is very affordable for a quality power bank.</p>\n<h2>Why Buy Maxon Z-10 PD Power Bank 10000mAh?</h2>\n<ul>\n 	<li>Light weight and portable design makes it easy to take anywhere</li>\n 	<li>One year warranty covers any manufacturing defects</li>\n 	<li>Cheapest in the country at <span>2950 PKR</span></li>\n 	<li>High capacity 10000mAh battery</li>\n 	<li>Compact design makes it easy to carry</li>\n 	<li>PD &amp; Quick Charge support ensures devices charge fast</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Where To Buy Maxon Z-10 PD Power Bank 10000mAh In Pakistan?</h2>\n<p>Where can I find the best price for the Maxon Z-10 PD Power Bank 10000mAh? Buy it now from recommend online retailers in Pakistan and get dependable power whenever you want.</p>\n\n<p>Enhance the way you charge your devices with the Maxon Z-10 PD Power Bank 10000mAh so that you never have to worry about running out of battery.</p>', '<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Battery Capacity:</strong> 10000mAh for long-lasting backup</li>\n 	<li><strong>Fast Charging:</strong> 22.5W output with PD &amp; Quick Charge support</li>\n 	<li><strong>Ports:</strong> Type-C input/output, USB output</li>\n 	<li><strong>Compatibility:</strong> Works with smartphones, tablets &amp; more</li>\n 	<li><strong>Warranty:</strong> 1-year brand warranty for reliability</li>\n</ul>', 1, 50, 3499, 2950, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:54:36', '2025-04-22 11:44:51', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
