li><strong>Multiple Outputs:</strong> Type-C, USB, and Lightning ports</li>\n 	<li><strong>Compact &amp; Lightweight:</strong> Mini design for easy portability</li>\n 	<li><strong>Smart Display:</strong> Shows real-time battery status</li>\n</ul>', 1, 50, 4800, 3950, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:54:36', '2025-04-22 11:44:51', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
