with Maxon B-102 Sky Soul Earbuds – premium sound at an unbeatable price!\n\n&nbsp;', '<ul>\n 	<li>Premium wireless earbuds with ANC &amp; ENC</li>\n 	<li>7-hour playback, 120-hour standby</li>\n 	<li>Transparency mode for real-world awareness</li>\n 	<li>Quad mic for crystal-clear calls</li>\n 	<li>Bluetooth 5.3 with 15m range</li>\n 	<li>Type-C fast charging, 360mAh case battery</li>\n 	<li>1-year brand warranty</li>\n</ul>', 1, 50, 5250, 4700, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:54:36', '2025-04-22 11:44:51', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(179, 'Maxon M-01 SMARTWATCH', 'maxon-m-01-smartwatch', 11, 49, '<h2>Maxon M-01 SMARTWATCH Price In Pakistan</h2>\nThe Maxon M-01 Smartwatch is a feature-packed wearable designed for tech enthusiasts who seek premium features at an affordable price. If you\'re looking for a stylish yet functional smartwatch, the Maxon M-01 Smartwatch price in Pakistan makes it an excellent choice. Priced at just Rs. 5,499/-, this watch offers cutting-edge features, Bluetooth calling, 100+ sports modes, and IP68 water resistance, making it a great option for fitness lovers and daily users alike.\n\n<strong>Vivid 2.01-Inch Display</strong>\nThe Maxon M-01 Smartwatch boasts a large 2.01-inch infinite full-touch display, offering vibrant colors and sharp visuals. Whether you’re checking notifications, tracking fitness stats, or making calls, the high-resolution display provides an excellent viewing experience.\n\n<strong>Bluetooth Calling &amp; Built-in Speaker</strong>\nStay connected with the Maxon M-01 Smartwatch, thanks to Bluetooth calling support. You can answer calls directly from your wrist without reaching for your phone. The built-in speaker ensures clear voice quality for seamless conversations.\n\n<strong>Comprehensive Health Monitoring</strong>\nTrack your health with the Maxon M-01 Smartwatch. It includes essential health features such as:\n✔ Heart rate monitoring for 24/7 tracking\n✔ Oxygen level monitoring (SpO2) to check blood oxygen levels\n✔ Step tracker to help you stay active\n\n<strong>100+ Sports Modes for Active Lifestyles</strong>\nFor fitness enthusiasts, the Maxon M-01 Smartwatch supports 100+ sports modes to accurately track your workouts. Whether you’re into running, cycling, or yoga, this smartwatch ensures precise tracking of your performance.\n\n<strong>IP68 Water Resistance – Wear It Anywhere!</strong>\nNo need to worry about splashes or sweat! The Maxon M-01 Smartwatch is IP68 water-resistant, making it perfect for outdoor activities, workouts, and everyday wear.\n\n<strong>Seamless Connectivity &amp; Compatibility</strong>\nThe Maxon M-01 Smartwatch seamlessly connects with both Android and iOS devices. It syncs effortlessly with your smartphone, allowing you to receive notifications, control music, and more.\n\n<strong>Maxon M-01 Smartwatch Price in Pakistan – Best Deal!</strong>\nThe Maxon M-01 Smartwatch price in Pakistan is Rs. 5,499/-, making it a budget-friendly option compared to other smartwatches in the market. You can buy it online from trusted e-commerce platforms to enjoy the best deals.\n<h2>Why Choose Maxon M-01 Smartwatch?</h2>\n✔ Affordable price: Get premium features without breaking the bank\n✔ Large vibrant display: 2.01-inch full-touch screen\n✔ Bluetooth calling: Answer calls with a built-in speaker\n✔ Health tracking: Heart rate, oxygen monitoring, and step counter\n✔ Fitness companion: 100+ sports modes for activity tracking\n✔ Water-resistant: IP68 rating for durability\n<h2>Where to Buy Maxon M-01 Smartwatch in Pakistan?</h2>\nLooking to buy Maxon M-01 Smartwatch in Pakistan? You can purchase it online at the best price of Rs. 5,499/- from top e-commerce websites. Compare prices, check customer reviews, and grab the best deal today!', '<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Display:</strong> 2.01-inch vivid full-touch screen</li>\n 	<li><strong>Water Resistance:</strong> IP68 certified</li>\n 	<li><strong>Bluetooth Calling:</strong> Yes</li>\n 	<li><strong>Sports Modes:</strong> 100+ available</li>\n 	<li><strong>Health Tracking:</strong> Heart rate, oxygen level monitoring, step tracker</li>\n 	<li><strong>Compatibility:</strong> Works with Android &amp; iOS</li>\n 	<li><strong>Speaker:</strong> Built-in for calls and notifications</li>\n</ul>', 1, 50, 6999, 5499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:54:36', '2025-04-23 12:47:53', 'NULL\r', NULL, 0),
(180, 'Vbon 2-in-1 Twin Earbuds With ANC', 'vbon-2-in-1-twin-earbuds-with-anc', 13, 59, '<h2>Vbon 2-in-1 Twin Earbuds With ANC Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>Searching for Active Noise Cancellation (ANC) premium-quality wireless earbuds? The Vbon 2-in-1 Twin Earbuds deliver an immersive sound experience with superior battery life and seamless connectivity. Available at an affordable price of Rs. 4200/- in Pakistan, these earbuds are an excellent choice for audiophiles and casual users alike.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Vbon 2-in-1 Twin Earbuds Features & Specifications</h3>\r\n\r\n<strong>1. Superior Noise Cancellation</strong>\r\n<p>With Active Noise Cancellation (ANC) technology, these earbuds reduce unwanted background noise so you can enjoy crystal-clear sound.</p>\r\n\r\n<strong>2. Long-Lasting Battery Performance</strong>\r\n<p>Enjoy up to 48 hours of continuous listening, making these earbuds ideal for long journeys, daily use, and workouts. With a 220-hour standby time, you won\'t need frequent charging.</p>\r\n\r\n<strong>3. Bluetooth 5.4 for Seamless Connectivity</strong>\r\n<p>The latest Bluetooth 5.4 technology is included in these headphones, which provide a dependable, lag-free connection for an improved wireless experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<strong>4. IPX4 Water Resistance</strong>\r\n<p>These earphones are a trustworthy companion for outdoor sports and exercises as the IPX4 waterproof grade guarantees protection against sweat and light rain.</p>\r\n\r\n<strong>5. Type-C Fast Charging</strong>\r\n<p>The Vbon 2-in-1 Twin Earbuds\' Type-C fast charging feature ensures that you may listen to music more without having to wait for it to charge.</p>\r\n\r\n<strong>6. Comfortable & Ergonomic Fit</strong>\r\n<p>These earbuds are a reliable companion for outdoor activities and workouts because of their IPX4 waterproof rating, which provides protection against sweating and light rain.</p>\r\n\r\n<strong>7. Auto Pairing & Multi-Device Compatibility</strong>\r\n<p>The setup process is made simple by the auto pairing technology, which instantly pairs to your smartphone. Both iOS and Android smartphones can use these earphones.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Why Buy Vbon 2-in-1 Twin Earbuds in Pakistan?</h2>\r\n<p>The Vbon 2-in-1 Twin Earbuds are a great choice if you\'re searching for wireless earbuds of high-quality at a reasonable price. Their IPX4 waterproofing, Bluetooth 5.4, 48-hour battery life, and ANC offer the ideal balance of durability and performance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Vbon 2-in-1 Twin Earbuds Price in Pakistan (2025)</h2>\r\n<p>The Vbon 2-in-1 Twin Earbuds is the perfect option for those who want high-quality music without going over budget because they cost Rs. 4200 in Pakistan. Get the finest discounts by comparing prices from various online sellers.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Where to Buy Vbon 2-in-1 Twin Earbuds in Pakistan?</h2>\r\n<p>The Vbon 2-in-1 Twin Earbuds are available for purchase in Pakistan through the online store of <a title=\"Phones Dukan\" href=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Phones Dukan</a>. Remember to look for the best deal by exploring discounts and special offers!</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Final Thoughts</h2>\r\n<p>The Vbon 2-in-1 Twin Earbuds are unique in the market because of their amazing feature set, which includes Active Noise Cancellation, Bluetooth 5.4, a 48-hour battery life, and IPX4 waterproofing. These earbuds provide an amazing experience whether you\'re a gamer, music fan, or someone who needs reliable earphones for calls.</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>Vbon 2-in-1 Twin Earbuds with Active Noise Cancellation (ANC)</li>\r\n 	<li>48-hour battery life with Type-C fast charging</li>\r\n 	<li>IPX4 waterproof for durability</li>\r\n 	<li>Auto pairing with Bluetooth 5.4</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with Android &amp; iOS</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 5999, 4200, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 12:55:37', '2025-06-24 16:33:05', '', NULL, 0),
(181, 'MEMO Magnetic Cooler Fan CX07', 'memo-magnetic-cooler-fan-cx07', 6, 67, '<h2>Memo CX07 Magnetic Cooler Fan Price In Pakistan: A Comprehensive Guide</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>In Pakistan\'s diverse climate, mobile phones often overheat during extended usage, especially while gaming or streaming. To address this, the Memo CX07 Magnetic Cooler Fan offers an efficient and user-friendly solution. This device is designed to maintain optimal phone temperatures, ensuring smooth performance during intensive tasks.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Features</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>1. Dual Attachment Mechanism</h3>\r\n<p>The Memo CX07 comes with a magnetic attachment system and an elastic back clip. The magnetic feature allows for quick and secure attachment to compatible phones, while the back clip ensures stability for devices without magnetic capabilities. This dual approach guarantees a firm grip, preventing any accidental detachment during use.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>2. Advanced Semiconductor Cooling Technology</h3>\r\n<p>Equipped with a semiconductor-based cooling pad, the Memo CX07 rapidly dissipates heat. Upon activation, the built-in cooling plate begins to function immediately, providing instant cooling without any delay. This feature is particularly beneficial during live broadcasts or intense gaming sessions, where maintaining a stable temperature is crucial.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3. Low Noise Operation</h3>\r\n<p>Despite its powerful cooling capabilities, the Memo CX07 operates quietly. The fan\'s design efficiently disperses air from all sides, delivering a strong cooling effect without causing disturbances. This ensures that your gaming or streaming experience remains uninterrupted by noise.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4. Rapid Cooling Design</h3>\r\n<p>The fan features a ring-shaped air door cooling design, which increases the heat dissipation area. Combined with power-driven semiconductor refrigeration, this design allows the fan to cool your device swiftly, preventing overheating and ensuring consistent performance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5. Plug-and-Play Simplicity</h3>\r\n<p>The Memo CX07 is designed for ease of use. It features a built-in Type-C port, allowing for quick and straightforward connection. Simply plug it into your device, and the cooling process begins immediately, eliminating the need for complex setups.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Specifications</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Model Number:</strong> CX07</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Product Type:</strong> Magnetic Back Clip 2-in-1</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Dimensions:</strong> 62 x 65 x 26 mm</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Interface:</strong> Type-C</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Weight:</strong> Approximately 68g</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Input Power Requirement:</strong> 5V/3A (15W)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Cooling Technology:</strong> Semiconductor-based</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Attachment Methods:</strong> Magnetic and back clip</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Noise Level:</strong> Low (below 25dB)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Pricing in Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Memo CX07 is available across various online platforms in Pakistan, with prices ranging from Rs. 2,915 to Rs. 4,499, depending on the retailer and any ongoing promotions. For instance:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>SaamanOnline:</strong> Rs. 3,150 (discounted from Rs. 5,000)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Dev-Tech:</strong> Rs. 3,299 (discounted from Rs. 5,999)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>HM Store:</strong> Rs. 4,499 (discounted from Rs. 4,999)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>It\'s advisable to compare prices and check for any additional shipping fees or promotions before making a purchase.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Why Choose Memo CX07?</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Enhanced Gaming Experience:</strong> The efficient cooling prevents lag and performance throttling, ensuring a seamless gaming experience.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Extended Device Longevity:</strong> By maintaining optimal operating temperatures, the Memo CX07 helps in prolonging the lifespan of your device.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Portable and Lightweight:</strong> Its compact design makes it easy to carry, allowing you to keep your device cool on the go.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Silent Operation:</strong> The low noise level ensures that your gaming or streaming sessions are not disturbed by fan noise.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Conclusion</h2>\r\n<p>The Memo CX07 Magnetic Cooler Fan stands out as a reliable accessory for mobile users in Pakistan seeking to enhance their device\'s performance during intensive tasks. With its advanced cooling technology, dual attachment methods, and user-friendly design, it offers a practical solution to overheating issues. Whether you\'re a gamer, streamer, or someone who frequently uses resource-intensive applications, the Memo CX07 ensures that your device remains cool and performs optimally.</p>', '<ul>\r\n 	<li>Dual Attachment Design: Magnetic and back-clip for secure attachment to phones.</li>\r\n 	<li>Semiconductor Cooling Technology: Rapid heat dissipation for optimal performance.</li>\r\n 	<li>Quiet Operation: Low noise for uninterrupted gaming or streaming.</li>\r\n 	<li>Plug-and-Play: Easy setup with a Type-C interface.</li>\r\n 	<li>Lightweight: Weighs only 68g for portability.</li>\r\n 	<li>Power Requirements: 5V/3A input for efficient cooling.</li>\r\n 	<li>Price in Pakistan: Rs. 2,915 to Rs. 4,499.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 2699, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-24 11:11:00', '2025-09-19 14:49:00', 'NULL', 1849.00, 1);
