(182, 'Maxon B-202 Sound Soul Earbuds', 'maxon-b-202-sound-soul-earbuds', 13, 49, '<h2>Maxon B-202 Sound Soul Earbuds Price In Paksitan and Specifications</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Maxon B-202 Sound Soul Earbuds</strong> are designed for users who expect clear audio, modern features, and solid battery life—all at a budget-friendly price. Priced at <strong>₨ 3,750 in Pakistan</strong>, these earbuds strike the perfect balance between affordability and quality. If you\'re in the market for <strong>ENC earbuds under 4000 PKR</strong>, this is a strong contender.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>At the core of the <strong>B-202 Sound Soul Earbuds</strong> are <strong>5U dynamic speakers</strong> that produce clear mids, deep bass, and crisp highs. Whether you\'re listening to music, watching videos, or taking calls, the sound profile remains consistent and balanced. With <strong>Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC)</strong>, these earbuds reduce background noise, allowing you to stay focused on the conversation or the music—ideal for commuting or working from busy spaces.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Battery performance is reliable with a playback time of up to <strong>5 hours</strong> on a full charge. The <strong>charging case</strong> with a <strong>300mAh capacity</strong> extends your usage time and supports quick top-ups via the <strong>Type-C charging port</strong>. The earbuds themselves carry a <strong>30mAh battery</strong>, which is optimized for efficient power usage, ensuring longer playtime without frequent recharging. It takes just <strong>1.3 hours</strong> to fully charge, making them easy to use even on a tight schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Bluetooth version 5.4</strong> ensures faster pairing, lower power consumption, and a stable connection with your device. Whether you\'re using Android or iOS, the <strong>10-meter transmission range</strong> gives you the freedom to move around without worrying about dropouts or lag.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Comfort hasn\'t been overlooked. The <strong>Maxon B-202 Earbuds</strong> come with <strong>extra eartips</strong> to help users find the perfect fit, making them suitable for extended wear. The lightweight and ergonomic design ensures they sit securely in the ears, even during workouts or long listening sessions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In terms of design and usability, the earbuds come in a sleek form factor with a minimalist finish. The charging case is compact and pocket-friendly, making it convenient for users who are always on the go. A subtle LED indicator lets you monitor charging status, and the <strong>USB Type-C cable</strong> included in the box ensures you’re ready to power up at any time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With a <strong>standby time of up to 130 hours</strong>, the B-202 keeps a charge when not in use, so it’s ready whenever you are. For users looking to <strong>buy Maxon B-202 Sound Soul Earbuds in Pakistan</strong>, this product is a great value—offering modern wireless audio features without a high price tag.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>These earbuds are covered by a <strong>1-year official brand warranty</strong>, adding peace of mind and confidence to your purchase. Whether you’re purchasing online or from a local retailer, the brand’s warranty support is available nationwide.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>To summarize, if you want <strong>affordable earbuds with ENC, 5U drivers, Bluetooth 5.4, and USB Type-C charging</strong>, the <strong>Maxon B-202 Sound Soul Earbuds</strong> are a smart buy. Their <strong>price in Pakistan of 3750 PKR</strong> makes them accessible without compromising on quality or features. For users comparing options in this price range, this model delivers exceptional value.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For anyone searching for the <strong>lowest price of Maxon B-202 Sound Soul Earbuds in Pakistan</strong> or planning to <strong>purchase Maxon B-202 Earbuds online</strong>, this listing ensures the product meets both performance and budget expectations.</p>', '<ul>\r\n  <li>Model: B-202 Sound Soul Earbuds</li>\r\n  <li>5U Dynamic Speakers for rich sound</li>\r\n  <li>Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC)</li>\r\n  <li>Up to 5 Hours Playback Time</li>\r\n  <li>Bluetooth 5.4 with 10-meter range</li>\r\n  <li>300mAh Charging Case | 30mAh Earbuds</li>\r\n  <li>USB Type-C Charging | 1.3 Hours to Full Charge</li>\r\n  <li>130 Hours Standby Time</li>\r\n  <li>Extra Eartips Included</li>\r\n  <li>Price in Pakistan: <strong>₨ 3,750</strong></li>\r\n  <li>1-Year Official Brand Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 5000, 3750, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-25 11:11:00', '2025-05-05 14:07:09', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(183, 'Maxon B-101 Sky Stone Earbuds', 'maxon-b-101-sky-stone-earbuds', 13, 49, '<h2>Maxon B-101 Sky Stone Earbuds Price In Pakistan and specifications</h2>\r\n<p>The <strong>Maxon B-101 Sky Stone Earbuds</strong> offer an impressive mix of performance, design, and convenience—all at an affordable price of <strong>₨ 4,299 in Pakistan</strong>. These wireless earbuds are equipped with modern features that users genuinely need today: <strong>Active Noise Cancellation (ANC)</strong>, <strong>Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC)</strong>, fast charging, and a reliable 6-hour battery life.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Whether you\'re taking calls, enjoying music, or gaming, the <strong>B-101 Sky Stone Earbuds</strong> provide a smooth and uninterrupted wireless experience, thanks to their <strong>Bluetooth 5.4 connectivity</strong> with a <strong>12-meter range</strong>. The inclusion of <strong>Quad Mics</strong> ensures clear voice pickup even in noisy surroundings, while <strong>Transparency Mode</strong> lets you stay aware of your surroundings without taking the earbuds out.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>These earbuds also feature <strong>low latency (45ms)</strong>, making them a great choice for mobile gamers or users watching videos, where audio delay can be a dealbreaker. The <strong>8mm speaker drivers</strong> deliver balanced sound with punchy bass and crisp vocals, enhancing the overall listening experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>One of the standout aspects of the <strong>Maxon B-101 Sky Stone Earbuds</strong> is their long-lasting battery. Each earbud holds a <strong>45mAh battery</strong>, offering up to <strong>6 hours of continuous playback</strong>. Combined with the <strong>400mAh charging case</strong>, users get an extended standby time of up to <strong>130 hours</strong>, while the case itself can go into standby for up to <strong>520 days</strong>. A full charge takes just <strong>about an hour</strong>, making them ready to go again in no time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Comfort and convenience are also key priorities. The earbuds come with <strong>extra eartips</strong> to ensure a snug and comfortable fit, while the <strong>in-ear wearing detection</strong> feature automatically pauses your music when you remove the earbuds. <strong>Touch sensor controls</strong> allow you to manage calls, adjust volume, and control playback with just a tap.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>These earbuds also support <strong>main-secondary earbud switching</strong>, meaning either earbud can function independently, offering better flexibility during use. It’s a subtle but valuable feature, especially during long calls or while multitasking.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For connectivity, the <strong>USB to Type-C cable</strong> included in the box ensures fast and safe charging. The earbuds are easy to pair with both Android and iOS devices. Whether you’re using them for office meetings, online classes, or leisure, these earbuds maintain a stable and high-quality connection.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In terms of build and design, the <strong>B-101 Sky Stone Earbuds</strong> come in a modern and compact form factor. The charging case fits easily in your pocket, making it perfect for daily travel. And with a <strong>1-year brand warranty</strong>, users can purchase with confidence, knowing they are backed by reliable after-sale service.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>At a competitive price of just <strong>₨ 4,299</strong>, the <strong>Maxon B-101 Sky Stone Earbuds</strong> stand out in the crowded market of TWS earbuds. They offer premium features without the premium price tag, making them an excellent choice for users in Pakistan looking for value and performance.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you\'re planning to <strong>buy B-101 Sky Stone Earbuds in Pakistan</strong>, this model ticks all the boxes—<strong>ANC, ENC, long battery, Bluetooth 5.4, fast charging</strong>, and excellent voice clarity. Whether you\'re comparing other models or looking for the <strong>lowest price of B-101 Sky Stone Earbuds</strong>, this product delivers what it promises.</p>', '<ul>\r\n  <li>Model: B-101 Sky Stone Earbuds</li>\r\n  <li>Active Noise Cancellation (ANC)</li>\r\n  <li>Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC)</li>\r\n  <li>6-Hour Playback Time</li>\r\n  <li>Quad Mic with Transparency Mode</li>\r\n  <li>Ultra Low Latency: 45ms</li>\r\n  <li>Bluetooth 5.4 | 12m Range</li>\r\n  <li>400mAh Charging Case | 1 Hour Charging Time</li>\r\n  <li>Touch Sensor Controls</li>\r\n  <li>Price in Pakistan: <strong>₨ 4,299</strong></li>\r\n  <li>1-Year Brand Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 5999, 4299, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-26 11:11:00', '2025-05-05 13:55:47', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(184, 'Xiaomi Redmi Note 13', 'xiaomi-redmi-note-13', 2, 61, '<h2>Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 is a remarkable smartphone that combines cutting-edge technology and design at an accessible price point. Officially launched on <strong>26 January 2024</strong>, this device is crafted to meet the needs of everyday users while providing a premium experience. With a host of features and specifications, the Redmi Note 13 is a worthy contender in the mid-range smartphone market.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Display and Design:</h4>\r\n<p>The Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 boasts a vibrant <strong>6.67-inch AMOLED display</strong> with a resolution of <strong>2400 x 1080 pixels</strong>. This impressive screen delivers vivid colors and deep contrasts, making it perfect for watching videos, gaming, and browsing. The <strong>Corning Gorilla Glass 3</strong> protection ensures durability, safeguarding the screen from scratches and minor impacts.</p>\r\n<p>In terms of design, the Redmi Note 13 measures <strong>162.2 x 75.5 x 7.97 mm</strong> and weighs <strong>188.5g</strong>, striking a balance between style and functionality. The smartphone\'s sleek and modern look is complemented by its comfortable grip, making it a pleasure to hold and use.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Performance and Hardware:</h4>\r\n<p>Under the hood, the Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 is powered by the <strong>Snapdragon 685 processor</strong>, providing efficient and fast performance. This robust chipset, coupled with <strong>6GB or 8GB of RAM</strong>, ensures that users can multitask smoothly and enjoy a lag-free experience, whether they\'re playing games, streaming videos, or using multiple apps simultaneously.</p>\r\n<p>Storage options include <strong>128GB and 256GB</strong>, offering ample space for all your apps, photos, and videos. The device supports expandable storage of up to <strong>1TB</strong> through a hybrid SIM slot, allowing users to increase their storage capacity without hassle.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Camera Capabilities:</h4>\r\n<p>Photography enthusiasts will appreciate the Xiaomi Redmi Note 13\'s impressive camera setup. The rear features a <strong>108MP primary camera</strong>, an <strong>8MP ultra-wide camera</strong>, and a <strong>2MP depth sensor</strong>, enabling users to capture stunning photos in various conditions. The <strong>108MP sensor</strong> ensures that images are rich in detail and color, while the additional cameras enhance versatility, allowing for creative photography options.</p>\r\n<p>On the front, the <strong>16MP camera</strong> is perfect for selfies and video calls, delivering clear and bright images. With video recording capabilities of <strong>1080p at 30fps</strong>, users can create high-quality videos that capture their memorable moments.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Battery and Power:</h4>\r\n<p>A standout feature of the Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 is its substantial <strong>5000mAh battery</strong>, designed to keep users connected throughout the day. With this battery capacity, users can enjoy extended hours of usage without needing to recharge frequently. Whether you’re browsing the web, streaming content, or gaming, the Redmi Note 13 provides reliable battery life to support your activities.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Software and Features:</h4>\r\n<p>Operating on <strong>MIUI 14</strong>, based on Android, the Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 offers a user-friendly interface with plenty of customization options. The software is optimized for performance, allowing for a smooth navigation experience.</p>\r\n<p>In terms of connectivity, the Redmi Note 13 is equipped with various essential features, including <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, <strong>WiFi</strong>, <strong>3G</strong>, and <strong>4G LTE</strong> capabilities, ensuring that users can connect easily to the internet and other devices. While it lacks <strong>5G support</strong>, the existing 4G LTE functionality is sufficient for most users’ needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4>Additional Features:</h4>\r\n<p>The Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 includes additional features that enhance its usability. Although there is no <strong>NFC</strong> support, the smartphone provides robust connectivity options for most daily tasks. The phone\'s design also incorporates a rear flash for the back camera, ensuring quality photography in low-light conditions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In summary, the Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 stands out as an excellent choice for users seeking a reliable and feature-packed smartphone. With its stunning display, powerful performance, impressive camera capabilities, and long-lasting battery, it effectively meets the demands of modern smartphone users. Whether you’re a student, professional, or casual user, the Redmi Note 13 delivers a balanced blend of functionality and style.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13 OS</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">Qualcomm SM6225 Snapdragon 685 (6 nm)</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">16 MP, f/2.4, (wide), Video (1080p@30fps)</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">Triple Camera: 108 MP, f/1.8, 24mm (wide), 1/1.67\", PDAF, OIS; 8 MP, f/2.2 (ultrawide); 2 MP, f/2.4 (macro), LED Flash</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">6.67 Inches, AMOLED Capacitive Touchscreen, 1B Colors</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh, 33W wired, 50% in 29 min, 100% in 70 min</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">256GB Built-in, 8GB RAM</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 47999, 45999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-27 11:11:00', '2026-02-25 18:58:53', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(185, 'Xiaomi Redmi 14C', 'xiaomi-redmi-14c', 2, 61, '<h2>Xiaomi Redmi 14C Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Xiaomi Redmi 14C is a unique phone designed to meet the needs of the modern user in Pakistan. Packed with advanced technology and impressive features, it delivers great performance and value. From breathtaking visuals to efficient battery life, the Xiaomi Redmi 14C ensures an exceptional user experience without disappointment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Display and Design</h2>\r\n<p>The display of the Xiaomi Redmi 14C is stunning, featuring a <strong>6.88-inch LCD</strong> screen with a <strong>120Hz refresh rate</strong>, making scrolling and gaming a delight. The <strong>1640 x 720 resolution</strong> provides rich details that enhance video watching, gameplay, and casual browsing. The screen is protected by <strong>Corning Gorilla Glass</strong>, making it scratch-resistant and able to withstand minor impacts. Its <strong>207g weight</strong> and sleek design make it easy to use for extended periods without discomfort.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Performance and Software</h2>\r\n<p>Gaming, browsing, and entertainment can be demanding for smartphones, but the Xiaomi Redmi 14C excels thanks to the <strong>MediaTek Helio G81-Ultra processor</strong> and <strong>Mali-G52 MC2 GPU</strong>, delivering seamless multitasking and smooth graphics. It runs on <strong>Android 14</strong>, offering an up-to-date, user-friendly experience with various customization and security features.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Storage and Memory</h2>\r\n<p>The Xiaomi Redmi 14C comes with <strong>128GB of internal storage</strong>, expandable via a microSD card. It also offers <strong>4GB or 6GB RAM</strong>, allowing users to easily perform multiple tasks simultaneously without experiencing lag.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Battery Life</h2>\r\n<p>With its large <strong>5160mAh battery</strong>, the Xiaomi Redmi 14C offers impressive battery life, allowing users to stream videos, play games, or make calls for extended periods without the need to recharge. Its energy-efficient performance ensures you stay connected throughout the day without interruptions.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Camera Capabilities</h2>\r\n<p>The Xiaomi Redmi 14C features a <strong>50MP main camera</strong> alongside a <strong>2MP depth sensor</strong> for stunning portrait shots and a <strong>0.08MP auxiliary lens</strong> for added versatility. The phone\'s <strong>13MP front-facing camera</strong> with a flash ensures bright, clear selfies even in low light. Both the front and rear cameras support <strong>1080p video recording at 30fps</strong>, making it perfect for video enthusiasts.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Features and Connectivity</h2>\r\n<p>While the Xiaomi Redmi 14C does not support <strong>5G</strong> or <strong>NFC</strong>, it still offers useful features such as <strong>FM Radio</strong> and a <strong>good LED flash</strong>. The device supports <strong>Dual SIM</strong> functionality, allowing users to keep their work and personal contacts separate. Connectivity options include <strong>4G LTE</strong>, <strong>WiFi</strong>, and <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, ensuring seamless connections and fast data speeds.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Xiaomi Redmi 14C – Why You Should Buy It Now</h2>\r\n<p>The Xiaomi Redmi 14C offers a fresh, modern design and blends style with functionality, making it a great choice for users in 2022. Powered by a high-performance processor, a versatile camera system, and a long-lasting battery, it provides excellent value for the price. Whether you\'re a student, professional, or tech enthusiast, this phone is a versatile option for all.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">64GB/128GB/3GB/4GB, Expandable Up to (6GB/8GB)</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">13 MP</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">8 MP</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual SIM</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">G52 MC2 820MHz</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">6.70 Inches</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>', 1, 10, 27999, 25999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-28 11:11:00', '2025-06-24 16:29:09', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(186, 'Vivo Y19s', 'vivo-y19s', 2, 60, '<h2>Vivo Y19s</h2>\r\n<p>The Vivo Y19s is a smartphone that offers a solid balance of performance, modern features, and an appealing design, making it a great choice for both average users and professionals. Its dual SIM capability and robust hardware ensure that you can stay connected and complete your tasks without feeling overwhelmed during the day.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Perfectly Bright and Canvas-Like</h2>\r\n<p>The Vivo Y19s features a <strong>6.68-inch LCD display</strong> with a resolution of <strong>1608 × 720 pixels</strong>. The vibrant colors and sharp graphics make it ideal for gaming, watching videos, or browsing the web. The <strong>90Hz refresh rate</strong> ensures smooth scrolling and seamless performance, making the overall viewing experience enjoyable, whether you’re playing games or simply navigating apps.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Analyzes Background Quite Well</h2>\r\n<p>The Vivo Y19s is powered by the <strong>Unisoc T612 processor</strong> with <strong>Mali-G52 MC2 GPU</strong>, ensuring smooth multitasking and the ability to handle heavy applications. With <strong>6GB LPDDR4X RAM</strong> and <strong>128GB internal memory</strong>, it provides ample space for your apps, images, and videos. Plus, if you need more storage, you can expand it up to <strong>1TB</strong> using a microSD card, ensuring you never run out of space for your content.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Efficient Operating System</h2>\r\n<p>Running on <strong>Android 14</strong> with <strong>Funtouch OS 14</strong>, the Vivo Y19s provides a smooth, user-friendly interface. The OS enhances productivity with advanced app management, customizable themes, and security features, ensuring an efficient and secure experience for daily tasks.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Stunning Photography</h2>\r\n<p>The Vivo Y19s excels in the camera department with a <strong>50 MP + 0.08 MP dual rear camera setup</strong>. The main camera captures sharp, detailed photos, while the secondary lens provides depth sensing for beautiful portrait shots. The <strong>5 MP front camera</strong> delivers high-quality selfies and clear video calls. The rear flashlight ensures that you can capture great images even in low-light environments.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Battery for All Day Use</h2>\r\n<p>The Vivo Y19s is equipped with a <strong>5500mAh battery</strong>, ensuring long-lasting power for all your activities. Whether you\'re gaming, streaming, or working, the massive battery will last through the day without needing a recharge, making it ideal for heavy usage.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Connectivity Options</h2>\r\n<p>The Vivo Y19s offers excellent connectivity features such as <strong>4G LTE</strong>, <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, and <strong>WiFi</strong>, ensuring fast and stable internet access. The built-in <strong>FM radio</strong> is a great bonus for music lovers. While it lacks NFC, the device works smoothly with other modes of connectivity, providing everything you need for seamless communication.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Compact and Durable Design</h2>\r\n<p>With dimensions of <strong>165.75 × 76.10 × 8.10 mm</strong> and weighing <strong>198g</strong>, the Vivo Y19s is lightweight and easy to hold, making it ideal for daily use. Its solid design and strong materials make it durable and reliable for everyday tasks.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14 Funtouch OS 14</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">6 GB LPDDR4X, 128 GB</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">50 MP, 0.08 MP</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">5 MP</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual SIM</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">Mali-G52 MC2</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">6.68 inches</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">5500 mAh</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>', 1, 0, 36799, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-01 11:11:00', '2025-06-24 16:27:24', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(187, 'Vivo Y28', 'vivo-y28', 2, 60, '<h2>Vivo Y28 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Vivo Y28 mobile phone is designed to stylishly meet your daily needs. Officially released in January 2025, this smartphone offers commendable performance, great battery backup, and stunning graphics, making it one of the best phones under 40,000 PKR in Pakistan.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Display and Design</h2>\r\n<p>The Vivo Y28 features a <strong>6.56-inch screen</strong> with a <strong>resolution of 720 x 1608</strong> and a <strong>90 Hz refresh rate</strong>, making it smooth and easy on the eyes. This ensures bright colors and smooth motion, whether you\'re gaming, browsing, or watching videos. With dimensions of <strong>163.7 mm x 75.4 mm x 8.1 mm</strong> and a weight of just <strong>186 grams</strong>, the Vivo Y28 is comfortable to hold and use for extended periods.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Performance and Storage</h2>\r\n<p>Powered by the <strong>octa-core MediaTek Helio G85 processor</strong> and <strong>Mali G57 MP2 GPU</strong>, the Vivo Y28 can efficiently handle basic and advanced tasks. It comes with <strong>8GB RAM</strong> and <strong>128GB of internal storage</strong>, making it suitable for running high-resource apps, games, or professional-grade tasks. For those who need additional storage, the device supports <strong>microSDXC</strong> for expanded memory options, ensuring you won’t run out of space for your videos, photos, or files.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Battery</h2>\r\n<p>The Vivo Y28 stands out for its <strong>6000mAh battery</strong>, perfect for long hours of use. Whether you’re gaming, watching videos, or running social media, this powerful battery ensures your device runs all day without needing frequent recharges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Camera Features</h2>\r\n<p>Camera enthusiasts will appreciate the dual rear cameras on the Vivo Y28. It features a <strong>50 MP main camera</strong> for high-quality photos and a <strong>2MP depth sensor</strong> for capturing stunning portraits with bokeh effects. The <strong>8 MP front camera</strong> ensures clear selfies and video calls, and with <strong>LED flash</strong> and <strong>1080p video recording</strong>, you can capture great shots even in low-light conditions.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Who Should Buy Vivo Y28?</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Gamers</strong> looking for a unique and immersive gaming experience, with improved display and performance.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Heavy application users</strong> who need a device that can handle demanding apps and multitask efficiently.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Photography enthusiasts</strong> who want a durable device with high-quality camera settings for excellent photos.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Anyone seeking an affordable yet powerful smartphone</strong> with ample storage, multitasking capabilities, and impressive performance.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Conclusion</h2>\r\n<p>The Vivo Y28 is a stylish and functional smartphone packed with performance and features. Whether you\'re gaming, taking photos, or multitasking, this device offers excellent value for money in Pakistan. With its powerful battery, efficient performance, and high-quality camera, the Vivo Y28 is ideal for users looking for an affordable yet competitive smartphone.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">8/128, 6/128</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">50 MP, 2 MP</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">8 MP</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual SIM</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">Mali G57 MP2</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">6.56 inches</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">6000 mAh</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>', 1, 10, 45999, 41999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-02 11:11:00', '2025-06-24 16:26:11', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(188, 'Oppo A3', 'oppo-a3', 2, 52, '<h2>Oppo A3 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\nThe Oppo A3 is an efficient smartphone for modern day users. Styled for modern day use with a unique design, reliable performance and advanced camera features, Oppo A3 is a great option for smartphones that can provide both style and usability.\r\n<h2>Display and Build</h2>\r\nIt is equipped with a large 6.67 inch LCD touchscreen display and a relatively high 90Hz display refresh rate which assures better visuals whether scrolling through apps or watching videos. The HD  resolution (1604 x 720) is sufficient to give lively colors and detailed images. Furthermore, the device is made with panda core screen protector offering twice the protection from regular usage.\r\n\r\nThe combined size of 165.77mm x 76.08mm x 77.68mm makes the device easy to grab and its biodegradable weight of 186g makes the device easy to carry and doesn’t take away from its strength.\r\n<h2>Performance and Memory</h2>\r\nWorry not, Oppo A3 will look after you as it offers a Qualcomm Snapdragon 6s 4G Gen1 processor with an Adreno 610 GPU providing good performance for almost every task on the device. No matter if you are gaming or multitasking, the device doesn’t lag and provides a satisfactory experience.\r\n\r\nThe internal storage can be either 128GB or 256GB which can be expanded most likely using memory cards for a user that needs more space for apps, photos, and files. The 6GB of RAM provides the necessary performance for a better end use as well.\r\n<h2>Battery and Power Management</h2>\r\nThanks to the 5100mAh batteries, users can be active on the phone for the whole day without having to recharge it multiple times. Power management is also improved which helps the battery span longer despite users constantly using the phone.\r\n<h2>Camera System</h2>\r\nThe Oppo A3 has been furnished with dual-rear mounted camera which consists of the 50MP main sensor and 2MP secondary sensor allowing users to take clear images even when the condition isn’t favorable. It is possible to take photographs in low lighting thanks to the LED flash which is also included. Meanwhile, the camera enables for video capturing at 1080P@30fps for the purpose of shooting nice video footage.\r\n\r\nA 5MP front facing camera is suitable both for taking selfies as well as for video calls that allow for either 1080 or 720 P video recording. The only problem is the absence of front flash light which does have its drawbacks in taking images in poorer light conditions.\r\n<h2>Software and Connectivity</h2>\r\nPowered by Android 14 OS, the Oppo A3 presents an impressively easy as well as customizable display. Another interesting feature that this phone has to offer is its dual SIM (Nano-SIM) functionality, hence making it suitable for users that work and have their own personal line as well.\r\n\r\n4G LTE, WiFi or WLAN, Bluetooth and NFC (depending on region) are among the connectivity options available ensuring voice communication as well as data transmission. Its aggressive connections capabilities enable the Oppo A3 to meet the expectation of contemporary smartphones.\r\n<h2>Who Should Buy Oppo A3?</h2>\r\nCasual Users: Easily navigable and powered with very basic elements, makes it appropriate for use on standard activities.\r\n\r\nPhotography Enthusiasts: The camera’s ability to capture images at 50 megapixels should guarantee good photo quality.\r\n\r\nGamers and Streamers: The Snapdragon processor and the 90Hz display allow good gaming and streaming experience.\r\n\r\nLong-Duration Users: The 5100mAh battery avoids the repeated charging issue and allows for long usage times.\r\n\r\nThe Oppo A3 is remarkable for its features, performance, and design. It can be used to suit a variety of activities including work, entertainment, or taking pictures; this smartphone bears such characteristics which can be useful for many in Pakistan. Let’s take a look at its specifications and features that enhance the experience of viewing on a mobile device.', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14 OS</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">6GB / 128GB / 256GB</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">50 MP, 2 MP</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">5 MP</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual SIM (Nano-SIM, dual stand-by)</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">Adreno 610@1050MHz</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">6.67 Inches</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">5100mAh</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>', 1, 10, 46999, 39999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-03 11:11:00', '2025-05-24 09:10:05', 'NULL', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO `products` (`product_id`, `product_name`, `product_slug`, `category_id`, `brand_id`, `product_description`, `short_description`, `product_status`, `stock_quantity`, `regular_price`, `sale_price`, `product_sku`, `weight_kg`, `length_cm`, `width_cm`, `height_cm`, `tax_class`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `product_tag`, `b2b_regular_price`, `is_b2b_available`) VALUES
(189, 'Xiaomi Redmi A3', 'xiaomi-redmi-a3', 2, 61, '<h2>Xiaomi Redmi A3 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>Budget-conscious buyers who want value for money will be glad to know that the Xiaomi Redmi A3 is an extraordinary smartphone. Released on the 13th of February 2024, this device features a great combination of impressive hardware, effective software, and workable design that is able to get the job done. So, whether you want to multitask, view outstanding graphics, or get consistent battery performance, the Xiaomi Redmi A3 has it all sorted for you.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>General Features and Design</h2>\r\n<p>The weight of the Xiaomi Redmi A3 is only <strong>193g</strong>, while its dimensions are <strong>168.3 x 76.3 x 8.3 mm</strong>, making this phone convenient to hold and use while providing an attractive and robust construction. It has <strong>Dual SIM support</strong>, enabling the management of work and personal relationships at the same time. The phone runs on <strong>MIUI and Android 14 (Go edition)</strong>, which ensures smooth operation without hanging issues while improving communication, security, and the interface overall.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Immersive Display for Every Task</h2>\r\n<p>With this performance, the mobile is perfectly suited for the end-user as it implements a <strong>6.71 IPS LCD Panel</strong> with a <strong>720 x 1650 resolution</strong>, and with settings adjusted accordingly, clearer content can be displayed at undeniably vivid colors. It also features a nice <strong>90Hz refresh rate</strong>, ensuring fluidity when scrolling through social media or watching videos. Not only are the visuals impressive, but the display also features <strong>Corning Gorilla Glass 3</strong>, which protects from scratches and drops on a daily basis.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Cutting-Edge Storage and Memory</h2>\r\n<p>The Xiaomi Redmi A3 features <strong>4GB of RAM</strong> and <strong>128GB of internal storage</strong>, enabling users to multitask efficiently while being able to download applications, photos, and videos. However, if that isn’t sufficient, users can expand storage with a <strong>microSDXC card</strong> without losing a second SIM, making it ideal for Dual-SIM users. This storage configuration allows you to save files without running out of space.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Maximum Performance at The Capacity</h2>\r\n<p>The Xiaomi Redmi A3 is equipped with the <strong>MediaTek Helio G36</strong> processor, delivering sufficient performance for daily operations or light gaming. It also features the <strong>PowerVR GE8320 GPU</strong>, enhancing the multimedia experience, especially when watching videos. This hardware setup allows users to run multiple applications without worrying about slow animations or poor smoothness.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Enhanced Battery Capacity</h2>\r\n<p>The Xiaomi Redmi A3 impresses with its adequate battery life powered by a <strong>5000mAh battery</strong>. This type of battery allows you to stay online throughout the day while doing a great deal—whether it\'s watching movies, playing games, snapping pictures, or making phone calls. Additionally, the power consumption management system adjusts the battery usage patterns, minimizing the need for frequent charging.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Take Pictures Like a Pro with AI Cameras</h2>\r\n<p>The Xiaomi Redmi A3 comes equipped with an <strong>8MP AI dual rear camera</strong> that offers a very reasonable focus. The program automatically detects the camera mode, making it easier to take stunning pictures. Whether capturing picturesque views or close-ups, rest assured the camera will adapt to the image requirements. The <strong>5MP front camera</strong> delivers stunning selfies with great detail, and the camera supports <strong>1080p video at 30fps</strong>, ensuring smooth and steady video shots.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you\'re a night-time photographer or need extra lighting for your shots, the <strong>back LED flash</strong> is the ideal solution for taking images in low-light environments.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Connectivity Options</h2>\r\n<p>The Xiaomi Redmi A3 offers <strong>Wi-Fi</strong>, <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, and <strong>4G/LTE</strong> connectivity for fast browsing. While the phone lacks 5G, 4G ensures high-quality streaming, downloading, and mobile communication. The dual SIM feature makes it convenient for users who need two numbers on one device.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Built for Durability and Everyday Use</h2>\r\n<p>Being practical, the Xiaomi Redmi A3 is designed to cater to users on a daily basis, performing most tasks with ease. It is lightweight, increasing portability, while the <strong>Corning Gorilla Glass 3</strong> ensures protection from scratches and drops. This device has a strong frame and features suited for modern consumers, guaranteeing longevity and durability.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Why Choose the Xiaomi Redmi A3?</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Balanced Performance:</strong> The smartphone meets the user’s demands with its <strong>MediaTek Helio G36 processor</strong> and <strong>4GB of RAM</strong>, offering smooth performance and efficient multitasking.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Ample Storage:</strong> With <strong>128GB internal memory</strong> and expandable storage, you will never run out of space.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Stunning Display:</strong> The <strong>6.71 inch IPS LCD display</strong> with a <strong>90Hz refresh rate</strong> provides an engaging viewing experience.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Reliable Camera Setup:</strong> <strong>8MP AI dual rear camera</strong> and <strong>5MP front camera</strong> for clear and vivid images.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Long Battery Life:</strong> The <strong>5000mAh battery</strong> ensures your phone stays powered throughout the day.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Conclusion</h2>\r\n<p>The Xiaomi Redmi A3 is a multifunctional smartphone that offers great specifications, a reliable camera, and good build quality, making it ideal for users prioritizing performance, convenience, and affordability. If you are looking to purchase the Xiaomi Redmi A3 in Pakistan, this phone offers unbeatable value for money with excellent features that beat competitors in its price range.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 13 OS Go edition</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Octa-core (4 x 2.2 GHz Cortex-A53 4 x 1.6 GHz Cortex-A53) ,Mediatek Helio G36 (12 nm)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim, Dual Standby (Nano-SIM)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5 MP, Video (1080p@30fps)</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Camera: 8 MP, (wide) 0.08 MP (<span id=\"IL_AD4\" class=\"IL_AD\">auxiliary</span> lens), <span id=\"IL_AD5\" class=\"IL_AD\">Dual LED</span> Flash</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">Corning Gorilla Glass 3 ,6.71 Inches</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-row\">\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh , Battery charging 10W</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n<p class=\"mtr-icon\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory</p>\r\n<p class=\"mtr-value\">128GB Built-in, 4GB RAM</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 1, 10, 23999, 19399, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-04 11:11:00', '2025-06-24 16:24:18', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(190, 'Oppo A3x', 'oppo-a3x', 2, 52, '<h2>Oppo A3 Price in Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The sleek appearance of the Oppo A3x makes it compatible with its use for entertainment, tasks, and productivity. Furthermore, the phone’s advanced technology, camera capabilities, and battery life make it an appealing option in Pakistan when looking for a trustworthy phone on a budget.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The heart of the A3x is its <strong>Snapdragon 6s 4G Gen1</strong>, an efficient processing core that allows users to perform different tasks at the same time. With the <strong>Adreno GPU 610</strong> powered in the phone, it also allows users to enhance their gaming and multimedia montage with a high-quality graphics experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With a large <strong>6.67 inch, 1604 x 720 display</strong>, users are provided with sufficient clarity for all their content in high definition. The high-definition content accompanied with <strong>90Hz</strong> of users scrolling through apps and videos will improve interactivity on the device. Overall, the Oppo A3x has advanced features while being affordable, allowing it to be widely accepted.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Ample Storage and Expandability</h2>\r\n<p>Oppo A3X comes with <strong>64GB</strong> and <strong>128GB internal storage</strong>, which is quite sufficient for the apps, photos, and videos. Plus, the memory can be upped to <strong>1TB</strong> using the microSD card slot, this aids in adding even more content with clarity of not running out of space.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Impressive Dual-Camera Setup</h2>\r\n<p>Equipped with two cameras on the rear, both having a <strong>13MP</strong> and <strong>2MP</strong>, it makes it easier to take photos and videos of good quality. Whether it be portraits, landscapes, or close-up shots, the Oppo A3x will deliver the sharpness and clarity needed. Moreover, the <strong>8MP front camera</strong> even allows for good quality and detailed selfies, as well as video calls. Along with both cameras, videos can be taken in <strong>1080p at 30fps</strong> and this can be used the whole day with ease.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Long-lasting Battery Life</h2>\r\n<p>The <strong>5100mAh battery</strong> provides the A3x with all the connection power it needs throughout the day. This large battery ensures that whether it is streaming videos, playing games, or even browsing the web, this phone will last longer than expected. This adds up to the battery life of the phone, making it perfect for long usage throughout the day.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Dual SIM and Connectivity Features</h2>\r\n<p>The Oppo A3x comes with <strong>Dual SIM</strong> functionality, which is ideal for users with both personal and work accounts on one phone. The phone is also able to connect to the internet via <strong>Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, 3G, and 4G/LTE</strong>, which are all capable of fast and reliable connectivity. The absence of the fifth generation of mobile networks (<strong>5G</strong>) on this phone shouldn’t worry most users as there are no major drawbacks regarding the connection that the Oppo A3x provides.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Software Updates and User Experience</h2>\r\n<p>The Oppo A3x runs on the <strong>Android 14</strong> operating system, coupled with <strong>ColorOS</strong>. The UI is better made than in previous iterations, allowing for a more pleasant experience. <strong>ColorOS</strong>, on the other hand, is made to take the Android experience a step further through various enhancements, customization options, add-ons, and security features.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Conclusion</h2>\r\n<p>To summarize every point above, the Oppo A3x performs exceptionally well as a smartphone with great specifications, having a good look and feel, and decorated with a lot of features. Considering the price, it is a perfect smartphone for those who want to own a high-end smartphone in Pakistan without wasting much money.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14 ColorOS</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1222\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">64GB, 128GB</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">13MP, 2 MP</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">8MP</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual SIM</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">Qualcomm Snapdragon 6s 4G Gen1</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">6.67 inches</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">5100mAh</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n', 1, 10, 27999, 25499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-05 11:11:00', '2025-06-24 16:23:35', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(191, 'Samsung Galaxy A16', 'samsung-galaxy-a16', 2, 55, '<h2>Samsung Galaxy A16 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Samsung Galaxy A16 comes as the perfect device for consumers looking for style, performance, and price. It has all the qualities that an average smartphone user is looking for: a good-looking phone, a high-performing device, and features that accommodate day-to-day tasks seamlessly.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Enjoy and Indulge</h2>\r\n<p>The Super AMOLED screen of the Samsung Galaxy A16 is very large at <strong>6.7 inches</strong> – content on this screen is a feast for the eyes thanks to vibrant colors, deep blacks, and sharp contrast as well as crisp and detailed images at <strong>1080 x 2340 pixel resolution</strong>. If you simply want to watch your favorite show, browse through social media, or even play video games, you will not be disappointed. One of the best technologies used for screens is Super AMOLED, and it allows for great gaming and video watching.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Even though this screen technology provides an amazing viewing experience while watching videos and playing games, it also conserves power, which increases the life of the battery. The Samsung Galaxy A16 has a big display that measures <strong>6.7 inches</strong> that allows users with large phone heads to use the phone with only one hand for gaming, for multi-tasking or even watching media.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Unveils Performance</h2>\r\n<p>Samsung Galaxy A16 is driven by the <strong>Mediatek Helio G99</strong>, let’s mention that its performance is acceptable for all of your everyday chores. The SoC is built on a <strong>6nm technology</strong> and it solves issues of running applications, multitasking, or playing heavy graphics without difficulty. With the installed <strong>8GB RAM</strong> or <strong>6GB RAM</strong> variants, the phone operates as you would like it to, be it scrolling, watching, or switching applications.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Mali-G57 MC2</strong> serving as the GPU for the device promises stable and high frame rates which is suitable for extreme gaming and video playback and other applications that require heavy graphics use. Regardless of the endeavor, entertainment or productivity, the smartphone device of Samsung Galaxy A16 is guaranteed not to disappoint.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Camera Configurations</h2>\r\n<p>With the main camera being versatile enough at <strong>50MP</strong>, Samsung Galaxy A16 becomes an interesting purchase for those loving mobile photography. Pictures taken at varying distances whether they are portraits, landscapes or indoors, in little light, this camera will be able to deliver vivid and sharply defined images with proper color fidelity. Together with <strong>8MP ultra wide</strong> and <strong>2MP depth sensor</strong>, the Samsung Galaxy A16 enables you to take astonishing shots from several different locations and waiting for each shot to be different.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For all your selfie needs, the <strong>13MP front camera</strong> delivers breathtaking and impressive self-images which are perfect for posting on social media or for video calls. Although it does not have a front flash, the camera gives good images in both bright and lowlight situations and so can be used for general photography. Another useful feature of Samsung Galaxy A16 is the ability to record videos using the rear and front cameras which can shoot quality video.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Durable Battery</h2>\r\n<p>There is a <strong>5000mAh battery</strong> on the Samsung Galaxy A16 which is meant to last the user through a full day. This battery means that whether you are browsing the web, watching videos, or gaming, the battery will not require replenishment any time soon. The device also has rapid charging so that you do not have to wait long before you can use the device again.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Samsung Galaxy A16 has a powerful battery which ensures that the device can withstand prolonged and constant use. Therefore, this phone is a must-buy for people who rely heavily on smartphones for work as well as entertainment and much more.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Connectivity and Network Features</h2>\r\n<p>Samsung Galaxy A16 supports both LTE and Wi-Fi connectivity and can let you browse the internet, however, <strong>5G service is unfortunately unavailable</strong>. The device should be considered modem for the purpose of plugging in cable internet, indeed this will not allow you to use the phone for www streaming purposes but gaming will be available. The Samsung Galaxy A16 also offers Bluetooth features enabling your interconnection of smart accessories such as speakers, headphones and smartwatches amongst others. Besides, the device has an inbuilt <strong>NFC feature</strong>, hence an enhanced transactional experience by virtue of eliminating the need to swipe a card.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You may also wish to consider the fact that Samsung Galaxy A16 has got a dedicated slot for a SIM which means that additional storage can be done by incorporating a <strong>microSD</strong> overtime as needed allowing you to accumulate your photo albums, videos, and applications without hassle. This hence means that all the contents and applications can be saved and retain the purpose they were created intended for without any form of advertisement.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Android 14 for Seamless User Experience</h2>\r\n<p>Samsung Galaxy A16 is powered by <strong>Android 14</strong> so you can expect a pleasant experience while using the device. Features within the system are designed with productivity and security in mind. In addition, there is a simple yet appealing interface that is adjustable in order to change the appearance of the device.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>There is also the option of grabbing a Samsung Galaxy A16, it is neither too complicated nor too simplistic. The Samsung Galaxy A16 offers strong MNP and Roman has taken extra care to design the menu of Android 14 in a manner that is easy to understand.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Conclusion</h2>\r\n<p>The Samsung Galaxy A16 stands out not only for its striking looks but also for affordable pricing. As for the users, they are equipped with <strong>Super AMOLED screen</strong>, <strong>Mediatek Helio G99 CPU</strong>, decent camera, and a durable <strong>5000mAh battery</strong> that feeds power to all the components. Surely a decent value for a regular consumer. Capturing high-quality images is effortless or, as an avid gamer, you will also have a steady support throughout the entire gaming session.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14 OS</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"wp-image-1222 alignnone\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">6GB/8GB, 128GB/256GB</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">50 MP, 5 MP, 2 MP</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">13 MP</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual SIM</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">Mediatek Helio G99 (6 nm)</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">6.7 Inches</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">5000 mAh</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>', 1, 10, 50999, 47999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-06 11:11:00', '2025-06-24 16:22:30', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(192, 'Samsung Galaxy A06', 'samsung-galaxy-a06', 2, 55, '<h2>Samsung Galaxy A06 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Samsung Galaxy A06 comes as the perfect device for consumers looking for style, performance, and price. It has all the qualities that an average smartphone user is looking for: a good-looking phone, a high-performing device, and features that accommodate day-to-day tasks seamlessly.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>The Galaxy A06 is a well-designed piece of technology and has an epic display.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The phone Galaxy A06 comes with a large screen of <strong>6.7 inches HD LCD</strong> that has a resolution of <strong>720 x 1600 pixels</strong>. The display alone is a huge factor for the phone as it allows for an immersive experience. The dimensions of the phone are <strong>167.3 x 77.3 x 8.0 mm</strong> and the weight is <strong>189g</strong> which makes this phone very light and slim, ensuring comfort while holding or using the phone with the single-handed mode for watching videos and browsing webpages.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>For casual or daily use, The Samsung Galaxy A06 is reliable and is powerful enough for the task at hand.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>In regards to the settings, this gaming phone supports multitasking and stream functions along with casual games. The device\'s technology includes <strong>Mediatek Helio G85</strong> and <strong>Mali-G52 MC2</strong>. The device comes with different variants of <strong>4GB</strong> and <strong>6GB</strong> with an internal storage of <strong>64GB</strong> and <strong>128GB</strong> respectively, therefore providing enough space for apps, videos, and pictures. This device also comes with a <strong>microSD card slot</strong> which allows for storage expansion of up to one terabyte.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Take Exceptional Photos Without any Difficulty</h2>\r\n<p>An important highlight of the Samsung Galaxy A06 is its camera configuration. Even more with a <strong>2MP depth sensor</strong>, the <strong>50MP primary rear camera</strong> guarantees vivid and detailed images. It also provides the best option for video recording, as it can support <strong>FHD videos in 60 frames per second</strong>. As for the users who love taking self-portraits, the pictures will come out bright, colorful, crisp, and detailed, which is made possible by an <strong>8MP front camera</strong> that is mounted on the device.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Strong and Sturdy Battery</h2>\r\n<p>The Galaxy A06 is powered by a <strong>5000 mAh battery</strong> which makes it perfect for those who require an active phone on the go without too much hassle of staying just around the charger as it allows for long usage in terms of business, videos, calls, and much more.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Improved Connectivity Options</h2>\r\n<p>One can benefit from options like <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, <strong>4G/LTE</strong>, and <strong>WiFi</strong>. The <strong>dual SIM</strong> feature makes it easier to switch between work and personal calls.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Why Would One Buy Samsung Galaxy A06?</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Excellent at a Low Price</strong> – An incredible combination of quality and all at a great price.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Camera Phobia</strong> – With the <strong>50MP rear camera</strong>, it is easy to take elegant pictures and videos.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Storage Woes Never Again</strong> – You can expand memory by a whopping <strong>1TB</strong>.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>No Downtime</strong> – Utilize the <strong>Helio G85 processor</strong> that allows for unrestricted usage.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Working Hardware and Pace</strong> – With a <strong>5000mAh battery</strong>, one can use the device all through the day.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Ideal for Everyone</h2>\r\n<p>No matter whether you are a learner, a practitioner, or just a photography lover, the Samsung Galaxy A06 is suitable for everyone. Its operation using an <strong>Android 14 system</strong> gives significant ease of use.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Ending Remarks</h2>\r\n<p>Simplifying, the Samsung Galaxy A06 is the perfect combination of style, power, and practicality all in one device. Due to its wonderful screen, fast processor, high-resolution cameras, and decent battery capacity, this smartphone is built with versatility in mind. So if you are looking to get an upgrade or a reliable device to switch to, the Galaxy A06 is a suitable option.</p>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"wp-image-1222 alignnone\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">4/6 GB, 64/128 GB</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">50 MP, 2 MP</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">8 MP</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual SIM</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">Mediatek Helio G85</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">6.7 Inches</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">5000mAh</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>', 1, 10, 25999, 23499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-07 11:11:00', '2025-06-24 16:20:39', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(193, 'Realme C75', 'realme-c75', 2, 53, '<h2>Realme C75 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Realme C75 comes with a set of cutting-edge specifications which make it tailor-made for modern work and play requirements with great performance. Ever since its launch on <strong>23rd December 2024</strong>, it has gained major traction owing to its low cost to value package. The device is well suited to the masses with a set price of <strong>48499 PKR</strong>. Here we will discuss its specifications, core features and try to answer the question whether it is worth the investment or not.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Realme C75 Price in Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>Standing firmly at a price of <strong>48499 PKR</strong>, it is one of the best contenders for a smartphone in the mid tier market. If you wish to compare its pricing and features with other smartphones in the same tier and range, you would be disappointed due to its unmatched pricing to value ratio that the Realme C75 offers.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Design and Display</h2>\r\n<p>It goes without saying that the <strong>6.72 inch display</strong> is one of the many attractions of the smartphone, but it does come with a unique twist. The display offers the resolution of <strong>2400 x 1080</strong> allowing a smooth experience with a refresh rate of <strong>90Hz</strong>. Whether you intend to scroll through social media, binge on videos or gaming, the device delivers stellar visuals in a fully immersed environment. To top it off, <strong>ArmorShell glass</strong> has also been added, allowing better durability while keeping the device scratch and dent resistant.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Performance and Memory</h2>\r\n<p>The Realme C75 processes applications seamlessly thanks to its <strong>MediaTek Helio G92 Max</strong> processor and <strong>Mali-G52 MC2 GPU</strong>. Branded to target multi-taskers and gamers, it features <strong>8GB of RAM</strong> and an additional <strong>16GB Dynamic RAM</strong>. With these specifications, resource-intensive applications can be easily run. Moreover, you have the option to choose between <strong>128GB</strong> and <strong>256GB of internal storage</strong>, further expanding the capacity with a <strong>Micro SD slot</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Camera Features</h2>\r\n<p>With a powerful <strong>50 MP rear camera</strong>, the Realme C75 allows for the capture of professional-grade pictures, whether you want to take a picture at night or during the day, the phone performs exceptionally through its <strong>8MP front camera</strong>. Furthermore, it allows for video recordings of up to <strong>1080p at 30 fps</strong> ideal for social media content.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Battery Life</h2>\r\n<p>Perhaps the most noteworthy aspect of the Realme C75 is its <strong>6000 mAh battery</strong>, it can easily last a day on a single charge. Thus, ensuring you are able to stream videos, play games, or work without the phone losing battery.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Connectivity and Other Features</h2>\r\n<p>Realme C75 ensures fast data connections through <strong>LTE/4G</strong> as well as <strong>Bluetooth 5.0</strong> which is a clear indication of wireless connectivity. Other considerable features include support for <strong>FM Radio</strong> and <strong>Dual SIM</strong> which makes it ideal for general use. On the downside, the device lacks <strong>NFC</strong> and <strong>5G</strong> compatibility, however, other features make up for these limits.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Why Buy Realme C75 in Pakistan?</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Pricing Relevance:</strong> Realme C75 with all emphasized features costs only <strong>48499 PKR</strong> which is very affordable.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Advantages in Display:</strong> Grab its full HD plus display with a 90 Hz refresh rate that will provide you with an exceptional viewing experience.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Robust Performance Whilst Playing:</strong> Performance of the device is a smooth operation thanks to the use of a <strong>MediaTek Helio G92 Max processor</strong>.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Power Bank:</strong> Thanks to the <strong>6000mAh battery</strong>, you can rest assured that you will be able to communicate throughout the day.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Superior Camera:</strong> You can now take any event with <strong>50 MP rear cameras</strong> in great detail.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14 OS</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"wp-image-1222 alignnone\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">8 GB 16GB Dynamic RAM, 128/256GB</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">50 MP</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">8 MP</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual sim</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">MediaTek Helio G92 Max</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">6.72 Inches</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">6000mAh Massive Battery</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n', 1, 0, 49999, 48499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-08 11:11:00', '2025-06-24 16:19:51', 'NULL', NULL, 0),
(194, 'Xiaomi Redmi Note 14 Pro', 'xiaomi-redmi-note-14-pro', 2, 61, '<h2>Xiaomi Redmi Note 14 Pro Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The Xiaomi Redmi Note 14 Pro is setting new benchmarks in the smartphone market with its cutting-edge features and competitive pricing. Priced at just Rs. 77,999/- in Pakistan, this device offers exceptional value for tech enthusiasts who demand performance and style.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Performance and Storage</h2>\r\n<p>Powered by the <strong>MediaTek Helio G100-Ultra</strong> processor built on a 6nm architecture, the Redmi Note 14 Pro ensures smooth multitasking and efficient power usage. With <strong>8GB or 12GB RAM</strong> options, you can run multiple apps seamlessly without experiencing lag. The massive <strong>256GB and 512GB internal storage</strong> ensures ample space for all your apps, photos, and videos.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Display and Design</h2>\r\n<p>The smartphone boasts a <strong>6.67-inch AMOLED capacitive touchscreen</strong> with a resolution of <strong>2400×1080 pixels</strong>. With a peak brightness of <strong>1800 nits</strong>, the display delivers vivid colors and stunning visuals, even under bright sunlight. <strong>Corning Gorilla Glass Victus 2</strong> adds durability, making it resistant to scratches and drops. The phone’s sleek dimensions (<strong>162.16×74.92×8.24mm</strong>) and lightweight (<strong>180g</strong>) design make it easy to handle.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Camera Capabilities</h2>\r\n<p>Capture moments in unparalleled detail with the <strong>200MP triple rear camera setup</strong>, complemented by an <strong>8MP ultra-wide lens</strong> and a <strong>2MP macro sensor</strong>. Features like HDR, panorama, and <strong>4K video recording</strong> enhance your photography experience. The <strong>32MP front camera</strong> with 1080p video capabilities ensures you look your best during video calls and selfies.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Battery Life</h2>\r\n<p>Equipped with a <strong>5500mAh high-capacity battery</strong>, the Xiaomi Redmi Note 14 Pro supports extended usage. The fast-charging feature lets you quickly recharge and stay connected without interruptions.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Connectivity and Features</h2>\r\n<p>The Redmi Note 14 Pro supports <strong>4G LTE</strong>, <strong>NFC</strong>, <strong>WiFi</strong>, and <strong>Bluetooth</strong> for seamless connectivity. With its dual SIM capability, you can manage personal and professional connections effortlessly. However, it does not support <strong>5G</strong> or radio functionality.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price in Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>At an unbeatable price of <strong>Rs. 77,999</strong>, the Xiaomi Redmi Note 14 Pro combines premium features with affordability. This makes it a top choice for those seeking a high-performance smartphone without breaking the bank.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Why Buy Xiaomi Redmi Note 14 Pro?</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>High-Quality Display:</strong> AMOLED screen with vivid visuals.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Powerful Processor:</strong> Handles demanding apps and games.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Exceptional Camera:</strong> 200MP for crystal-clear photography.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Long Battery Life:</strong> Stay connected all day.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Affordable Price:</strong> Competitive pricing for premium features.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<div class=\"product-table\">\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1215\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/os.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"31\" height=\"31\" /> OS\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">Android 14</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"wp-image-1222 alignnone\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/memory-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Memory\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">8/12 GB, 256/512GB</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1219\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Rear Camera\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">200MP 8MP 2MP</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1218\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/front-camera.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Front Camera\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">32MP</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1217\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/sim-card.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> SIM\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">Dual Sim</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1216\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/cpu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> CPU\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">MediaTek Helio G100-Ultra, 6nm Octa-core</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1220\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/display.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Display Size\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">6.67 Inches</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"table-row\">\r\n    <div class=\"table-cell\">\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-icon\">\r\n        <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1221\" src=\"http://www.phonesdukan.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/battery.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" /> Battery\r\n      </p>\r\n      <p class=\"mtr-value\">5500mAh (typ) high-capacity battery</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n', 1, 10, 73999, 70999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-09 11:11:00', '2025-06-24 16:19:10', '', NULL, 0),
(195, 'Infinix Fast Charger 33W', 'infinix-33-watt-charger-original', 14, 45, '<h2>Infinix 33 Watt Charger Original Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>If you are looking for a reliable and fast charging solution for your Infinix device, the <strong>Infinix Original Fast Charger 33W</strong> is the perfect option. Designed to deliver efficient charging performance, this original charger ensures that your smartphone gets powered up quickly without compromising battery health.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Infinix Original Fast Charger 33W</strong> comes with an output of <strong>5V 3A</strong> and <strong>10V 3.3A</strong>, offering a maximum power of <strong>33W</strong>. Whether you are at home, in the office, or traveling, this charger guarantees stable and consistent power delivery, thanks to its <strong>input range of 100-240V</strong>. It’s not just powerful but also safe, protecting your device from overcharging, overheating, and short circuits.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>One of the best features of this charger is its <strong>packaging</strong>. The <strong>Infinix Fast Charger</strong> comes sealed in a <strong>Zip Lock Bag</strong>, ensuring that you receive a fresh and untouched product. At <strong>Phones Dukan</strong>, you can now get this original Infinix charger for just <strong>Rs. 2,999</strong> in Pakistan, offering you a fantastic deal compared to its typical retail price.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This charger is compact, lightweight, and easy to carry in your bag or pocket, making it highly travel-friendly. The white color adds a clean and elegant look, perfectly matching most Infinix smartphones.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>When you buy the <strong>Infinix 33W Charger</strong> from Phones Dukan, you are guaranteed a 100% authentic product. Many online stores sell imitations, but at Phones Dukan, quality and customer trust are our top priorities.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Infinix Fast Charger 33W price in Pakistan</strong> has been fluctuating recently, but at <strong>Rs. 2,999</strong>, you are getting a genuine and durable charger that will serve you for years. It supports a wide range of Infinix models and is backward compatible with devices that require lower wattage.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Not just fast, the charger also maintains optimal temperature, extending the life of your device’s battery. Whether you need to juice up your device before heading out or while on the go, the <strong>Infinix Charger 33W</strong> is built to meet your needs efficiently.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Phones Dukan makes it easy to <strong>buy Infinix Original Fast Charger</strong> online, delivering across Pakistan with quick shipping times. Place your order now and experience premium charging performance without the premium price tag.</p>', '<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Brand:</strong> Infinix</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Model:</strong> U180XEB</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Input:</strong> 100-240V</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Output:</strong> 5V 3A / 10V 3.3A (33W)</li>\r\n  <li>100% original product</li>\r\n  <li>Packaged in a <strong>Zip Lock Bag</strong></li>\r\n  <li><strong>Price:</strong> Rs. 2,999 PKR</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Color:</strong> White</li>\r\n  <li>Fast and safe charging</li>\r\n  <li>Available now at <strong>Phones Dukan</strong></li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 3499, 2998, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-04-27 10:57:10', '2025-04-29 10:24:20', '', NULL, 0);
