(197, 'Infinix Original Fast Charger 45W', 'infinix-original-fast-charger-45W', 14, 45, '<h2>Infinix Original Fast Charger 45W Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>Looking for a powerful charger for your Infinix smartphone? The <strong>Infinix Original Fast Charger 45W</strong> is built for speed and efficiency. Designed specifically to work with Infinix devices, this genuine charger delivers a maximum output of <strong>45W</strong>, ensuring your phone charges faster and stays safer.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Infinix 45W Charger</strong> is engineered with precision, featuring an <strong>input voltage of 100-240V 50/60Hz 1.8A</strong> and an <strong>output voltage of 5.0V=2.0A or 11.0V=4.1A</strong>. Whether you\'re at home, the office, or traveling, it provides consistent and efficient charging, keeping your device powered up when you need it most.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Each package includes a genuine <strong>Infinix Type A to Type C cable</strong> to match the charger\'s fast charging capabilities. No need to worry about compatibility issues — this cable is designed to support Infinix\'s 45W Flash Charge technology, ensuring maximum performance and quick power delivery for supported models like the <strong>Infinix Zero X Pro</strong> and others.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What sets the <strong>Infinix 45W Flash Charger</strong> apart is its authentic quality. Manufactured by Infinix in China, it meets strict standards for reliability and safety. It also features a robust output port (Female Type USB A), making it versatile for different devices that require fast charging.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Packaged securely in a <strong>box pack</strong>, the charger and cable are protected from damage during shipping. Phones Dukan now offers the <strong>Infinix 45W Charger</strong> at an affordable price of just <strong>Rs. 3,499 PKR</strong> — a fantastic deal for anyone looking to upgrade their charging experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>When you <strong>buy Infinix 45W Charger</strong> from Phones Dukan, you\'re guaranteed an authentic, durable product. Many users notice a significant improvement in charging time, battery protection, and overall device performance after switching to the original charger. Avoid low-quality knock-offs and invest in a charger designed for your device.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>At Phones Dukan, we understand how important it is to maintain your device\'s battery health. That\'s why we offer only genuine accessories like the <strong>Infinix Original Fast Charger 45W</strong>. With multiple safety features built-in, including protection against overheating, short-circuiting, and overcharging, you can rest easy knowing your phone is safe while charging.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you\'re wondering about the <strong>Infinix 45W Charger price in Pakistan</strong>, Phones Dukan offers one of the best deals online. Our easy ordering process and quick delivery service ensure that you get your charger without any hassle.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Upgrade your charging setup today. Get your <strong>Infinix 45 Watt Fast Charger</strong> now at Phones Dukan and experience fast, efficient, and safe charging every day!</p>', '<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Brand:</strong> Infinix</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Model:</strong> U450XEA Box Pack</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Output Port:</strong> Female Type USB A</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Input Voltage:</strong> 100-240V 50/60Hz 1.8A</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Output Voltage:</strong> 5.0V=2.0A / 11.0V=4.1A (45W MAX)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Charging Cable:</strong> Type A to Type C (Included)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Color:</strong> White</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Package:</strong> Box Pack</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Price:</strong> Rs. 3,499 PKR</li>\r\n  <li>Compatible with Infinix Zero X Pro and other models supporting 45W Flash Charge</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 3999, 3498, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-04-27 11:53:27', '2025-04-29 10:24:22', '', NULL, 0),
(198, 'Airpods Pro 2 Black Edition Type C Charging', 'airpods-pro-2-black-edition-type-c-charging', 13, 42, '<h2>AirPods Pro 2 (2nd Generation) – Best Price in Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The <strong>AirPods Pro 2</strong> (2nd Generation) bring an unbeatable wireless audio experience, with cutting-edge features that make them a must-have for anyone looking for superior sound quality. These wireless earbuds are designed to provide a comfortable fit, immersive sound, and seamless integration with both Android and iPhone devices. Offering <strong>active noise cancellation</strong> and a <strong>MagSafe charging case</strong>, the AirPods Pro 2 (2nd Generation) are packed with the latest technology to give you an exceptional listening experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Features of AirPods Pro 2 (2nd Generation):</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Noise Cancellation:</strong> Block out unwanted background noise for an immersive listening experience with the active noise cancellation feature.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>High-Quality Sound:</strong> AirPods Pro 2 delivers crystal-clear sound with deep bass and rich detail, making them perfect for music lovers.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>MagSafe Charging Case:</strong> The included <strong>USB-C MagSafe charging case</strong> offers fast and convenient wireless charging. Simply place your AirPods on the charging case, and you’re good to go. No cables are required!</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Touch Control:</strong> Intuitive touch controls allow you to manage calls, adjust volume, or switch between tracks with a simple tap.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Water-Resistant (IP54):</strong> AirPods Pro 2 are built to resist sweat and light splashes, making them ideal for workouts or outdoor activities.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Easy Setup and In-Ear Detection:</strong> These earbuds automatically respond when placed in or removed from your ear, offering a hassle-free setup and seamless user experience.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Compatible with Both Android and iPhone:</strong> Whether you\'re an Android user or an iPhone enthusiast, the AirPods Pro 2 connects effortlessly via Bluetooth.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>What’s in the Box?</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>AirPods Pro 2 ANC USB-C</strong></li>\r\n  <li><strong>Type-C to Type-C Charging Cable</strong></li>\r\n  <li><strong>User Manual</strong></li>\r\n  <li><strong>Extra Silicone Ear Tips</strong></li>\r\n  <li><strong>Lanyard</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Why Choose AirPods Pro 2 (2nd Generation)?</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Active Noise Cancellation:</strong> Enjoy pure, uninterrupted sound with real-time noise blocking, letting you focus on what matters most.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Battery Life:</strong> Up to 6 hours of listening time on a single charge and an additional 24 hours when paired with the charging case, ensuring you stay powered throughout the day.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>MagSafe Charging Convenience:</strong> The included MagSafe charging case makes it easy to wirelessly charge your AirPods Pro 2, eliminating the need for additional cables.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Affordable Alternative:</strong> While the AirPods Pro 2 (2nd Generation) offers similar looks and features to the original AirPods Pro 2, it comes at a more affordable price point, making it a great option for those seeking quality without the premium price tag.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Affordable Quality at Best Price in Pakistan</h3>\r\n<p>If you\'re looking for the <strong>best price in Pakistan</strong> for the <strong>AirPods Pro 2</strong> (2nd Generation), you\'re in the right place. This product provides the premium features of high-end earbuds, such as <strong>noise cancellation, superior sound quality, and easy wireless charging</strong>, at a budget-friendly price of <strong>Rs. 3,499</strong>.</p>\r\n<p>These AirPods Pro 2 (2nd Generation) are a fantastic choice for anyone who wants the <strong>AirPods Pro look</strong> and sound without the hefty price tag. While they do lack some of the Apple-specific features like <strong>Adaptive EQ</strong> and <strong>Transparency Mode</strong>, they offer excellent value for those who want solid performance without the premium price.</p>\r\n<p>For those who want premium features at a competitive price, the <strong>AirPods Pro 2</strong> (2nd Generation) is your perfect match.</p>', '<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>AirPods Pro 2 (2nd Generation)</strong> Wireless Earbuds with <strong>USB-C MagSafe Charging Case</strong></li>\r\n  <li><strong>Noise Cancellation</strong> technology for enhanced listening</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Up to 6 hours</strong> of listening time and 24 hours with the case</li>\r\n  <li><strong>IP54 water-resistant</strong> design for sweat and splash protection</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Touch Controls</strong> for easy call and music management</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Compatible with Android and iPhone</strong> devices via Bluetooth</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Best Price in Pakistan:</strong> Rs. 3,499 (limited time offer)</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 5000, 3498, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-04-27 12:35:59', '2025-04-27 12:35:59', '', NULL, 0),
(199, 'Neepho LED Soft Ring Light 26/33 CM', 'neepho-led-soft-ring-light-26-33-cm', 9, 68, '<h2>Neepho LED Soft Ring Light 26/33CM – Best Price in Pakistan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Neepho LED Soft Ring Light 26/33CM</strong> is designed to upgrade your lighting setup whether you are a professional photographer, a YouTuber, a makeup artist, or simply someone who loves capturing the perfect shot. With its versatile features and high-quality design, this ring light becomes an essential tool for creating stunning photos, videos, and livestreams.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Features of Neepho LED Soft Ring Light 26/33CM</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>26/33 CM Size:</strong> Choose between two convenient sizes, perfect for desktop or studio use.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Adjustable Color Temperature:</strong> Fine-tune your lighting from warm 3000K to bright daylight 6000K to match any mood or setting.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Dimmable Brightness:</strong> Easily control the intensity of the light to get the perfect exposure for your photos and videos.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Universal Phone Holder:</strong> Holds your smartphone securely in the center of the ring for balanced lighting and better framing.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>360-Degree Rotation:</strong> Adjust the ring light to any angle, allowing maximum flexibility for all your creative needs.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Durable Build:</strong> Features a sturdy, stylish black body with a round, soft ring light design.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Light Size:</strong> 26CM or 33CM LED soft ring light</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Body Color:</strong> Black</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Shape:</strong> Round</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Style:</strong> Only light (stand and accessories optional)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Perfect Lighting for Every Application</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The Neepho LED Soft Ring Light 26/33CM is made for anyone serious about high-quality lighting. Whether you are shooting portrait photography, recording tutorial videos, attending Zoom meetings, or streaming live on social media, this ring light ensures that your face is evenly lit and shadows are minimized. Thanks to its <strong>Adjustable Color Temperature</strong> and <strong>Dimmable Brightness</strong>, you have total control over your environment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Universal Phone Holder for Added Convenience</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The built-in <strong>Universal Phone Holder</strong> is compatible with most smartphones, making it extremely convenient for content creators. Your device stays centered, ensuring balanced lighting that reduces blemishes and imperfections on screen.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>360-Degree Rotatable Design</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Creativity knows no limits with the <strong>360-Degree Rotatable</strong> design. Whether you prefer vertical or horizontal shooting, you can easily adjust the angle to capture the perfect shot every time.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Affordable Quality – Neepho LED Soft Ring Light 26/33CM Price in Pakistan</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Looking for the best value? The <strong>Neepho LED Soft Ring Light 26/33CM Price in Pakistan</strong> is just <strong>Rs. 4199</strong>. At this competitive price, you get premium features often found in more expensive lighting setups. No need to compromise on quality when you can get professional results within your budget.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Why Buy the Neepho LED Soft Ring Light 26/33CM?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Ideal for photography, videography, makeup tutorials, online meetings, and more</li>\r\n  <li>Easy-to-adjust color temperature and brightness for ultimate flexibility</li>\r\n  <li>Durable and stylish design with black finish</li>\r\n  <li>Comes with a universal smartphone holder for convenience</li>\r\n  <li>Affordable price tag of just <strong>Rs. 4199</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Enhance your photo and video quality with the <strong>Neepho LED Soft Ring Light 26/33CM</strong>. Whether you\'re building a professional studio or upgrading your home office, this versatile ring light is a smart investment for bright, flawless lighting every time.</p>', '<ul>\r\n  <li>26/33 CM LED Soft Ring Light – Perfect for photos, videos, and content creation</li>\r\n  <li>Adjustable Color Temperature from 3000K to 6000K for ideal lighting</li>\r\n  <li>Dimmable Brightness to fine-tune your environment</li>\r\n  <li>Universal Phone Holder for secure smartphone mounting</li>\r\n  <li>360-Degree Rotatable design for flexible positioning</li>\r\n  <li>Stylish Black Round Shape for professional setups</li>\r\n  <li>Available now at just Rs. 4199 PKR</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 5200, 4199, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-04-27 14:42:20', '2025-04-27 14:42:20', '', NULL, 0),
(200, 'P9 ULTRA 2 SMART WATCH COMBO WITH HEADPHONES', 'p9-ultra-2-smart-watch-combo-with-headphones', 11, 58, '<h2>P9 ULTRA 2 SMART WATCH COMBO WITH HEADPHONES – Now in Pakistan!</h2>\r\n  <p>The <strong>P9 ULTRA 2 SMART WATCH COMBO WITH HEADPHONES</strong> offers you the perfect blend of style, technology, and value. Priced at <strong>2,999 PKR</strong>, this combo brings premium features at an affordable rate for users in Pakistan.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Premium Design and Build Quality</h3>\r\n  <p>The <strong>P9 ULTRA 2 SMART WATCH COMBO WITH HEADPHONES</strong> features a durable silicon strap and a vivid 49mm IPS display. Built to handle daily use, the watch is also <strong>IP67 water-resistant</strong>, making it ideal for fitness and casual wear.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Smart Calling and Voice Assistant</h3>\r\n  <p>Enjoy Bluetooth Calling and built-in Voice Assistant support, compatible with both Android and iOS devices. Manage calls, control music, and get updates easily, all from your wrist.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Health and Fitness Tracking</h3>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Heart Rate Monitor:</strong> Keep track of your heart health daily.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Calories Burned Tracker:</strong> Stay motivated by monitoring calories burned.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Sleep Quality Monitor:</strong> Analyze and improve your sleeping patterns.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Step Tracker:</strong> Record your steps and reach fitness goals.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Oxygen Level Monitoring:</strong> Get real-time oxygen level insights.</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Smooth Connectivity</h3>\r\n  <p>With <strong>Bluetooth 5.2</strong> technology, the watch offers a stable, fast connection. It pairs seamlessly with smartphones and the bundled headphones, ensuring smooth communication and media playback.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Battery and Performance</h3>\r\n  <p>Designed for efficient power usage, the <strong>P9 ULTRA 2 SMART WATCH COMBO WITH HEADPHONES</strong> delivers smart battery life to keep up with your busy schedule, supporting calls, notifications, and health tracking effortlessly.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Price and Availability in Pakistan</h3>\r\n  <p>Now available for only <strong>2,999 PKR</strong>, down from 7,500 PKR — offering almost <strong>60% OFF</strong>! If you are looking to <strong>buy P9 ULTRA 2 SMART WATCH COMBO WITH HEADPHONES in Pakistan</strong>, this is the best time to grab it at the lowest price.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Why Choose the P9 ULTRA 2 Smart Watch Combo?</h3>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>Outstanding features at an unbeatable price</li>\r\n    <li>Seamless Bluetooth calling and voice assistant support</li>\r\n    <li>Comprehensive health monitoring options</li>\r\n    <li>High-quality silicon strap with water resistance</li>\r\n    <li>Top-rated product with a 5.0-star review</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <p>Don\'t miss the chance to <strong>buy P9 ULTRA 2 SMART WATCH COMBO WITH HEADPHONES in Pakistan</strong> at the best price available. Stocks are limited!</p>', '<ul>\r\n  <li>Bluetooth calling feature for Android & iOS</li>\r\n  <li>Multiple sports modes with health monitoring</li>\r\n  <li>IP67 water-resistant silicon strap</li>\r\n  <li>49mm IPS Display for better clarity</li>\r\n  <li>Battery built for smart and lasting performance</li>\r\n  <li>Price in Pakistan: <strong>Only 2,999 PKR</strong></li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 3500, 2999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-04-28 10:41:43', '2025-04-28 10:41:43', '', NULL, 0),
(201, 'Guider Mobile Holder', 'guider-mobile-holder', 3, 58, '<h2>Guider Mobile Holder Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n  <p>Introducing the <strong>Guider Mobile Holder</strong>, a must-have bike accessory now available for just <strong>1199 PKR</strong>. Engineered with precision, this mobile holder brings an unbeatable blend of style, functionality, and safety to your biking adventures. Whether navigating city streets or exploring countryside trails, the Guider Mobile Holder is built to perform and impress.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Elegant Design Built for Performance</h3>\r\n  <p>The <strong>Guider Mobile Holder for bike</strong> boasts a sleek geometric structure that seamlessly blends with the aesthetics of any motorcycle or cycle. Not only does it offer a minimalist design, but it also provides a stable and secure grip for your mobile device, making it a stylish and practical addition to your bike.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Built with Bikers in Mind</h3>\r\n  <p>Crafted specifically for bikers, the <strong>Guider Mobile Holder</strong> ensures that your phone remains firmly in place even on the bumpiest rides. Thanks to the robust back locking mechanism and strengthening knob, you can focus on the road without worrying about your device slipping or falling.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Safety Lighting for Night Riders</h3>\r\n  <p>Safety should never be compromised. That’s why the Guider Mobile Holder comes with an integrated LED safety riding warning light. Whether riding during low-light conditions or at night, the bright LEDs make you more visible to others, greatly enhancing your safety on the road.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Navigate Easily with the Built-in Compass</h3>\r\n  <p>With the Guider Mobile Holder’s built-in compass, you can venture into unknown territories without losing your sense of direction. This auxiliary feature helps you stay on track without the need for additional navigation devices, keeping your ride smooth and hassle-free.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Why Choose the Guider Mobile Holder?</h3>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Durable and Weather-Resistant:</strong> Built to withstand long rides and unpredictable weather conditions.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Easy Installation:</strong> Hassle-free setup with no specialized tools needed.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Wide Compatibility:</strong> Adjustable clamps fit various smartphone models easily.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>360-Degree Rotation:</strong> Customize your viewing angle for maximum comfort and visibility.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Affordable Price:</strong> Get premium quality at just <strong>1199 PKR</strong>.</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Perfect for Every Rider</h3>\r\n  <p>If you\'re looking to <strong>buy Guider Mobile Holder</strong> that offers durability, performance, and safety features at a reasonable price, look no further. Designed with the modern biker in mind, the Guider Mobile Holder enhances both your riding safety and your overall journey experience.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Guider Mobile Holder Price in Pakistan</h3>\r\n  <p>At a competitive price of <strong>1199 PKR</strong>, the <strong>Guider Mobile Holder price in Pakistan</strong> makes it one of the best value-for-money bike accessories available today. Combining premium design and innovative features, it’s a product that every biker should have.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Conclusion</h3>\r\n  <p>The <strong>Guider Mobile Holder</strong> offers bikers more than just a phone mount. With added safety features like the LED warning light and the built-in compass, it redefines convenience and safety. Upgrade your biking adventures by securing your phone smartly and safely with the Guider Mobile Holder. Order now before stock runs out!</p>', '<ul>\r\n  <li>Sleek and simple geometric design</li>\r\n  <li>Perfect for bike rides on all terrains</li>\r\n  <li>Strong back locking system for mobile safety</li>\r\n  <li>Integrated LED safety riding warning light</li>\r\n  <li>Built-in compass for navigation ease</li>\r\n  <li>Durable, weather-resistant construction</li>\r\n  <li>360° rotation for adjustable viewing angle</li>\r\n  <li>Price: <strong>1199 PKR</strong></li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 1500, 1199, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-04-28 11:07:45', '2025-04-28 11:07:45', '', NULL, 0),
(202, 'Boya BY-V20 Ultracompact 2.4GHz Wireless Microphone', 'boya-by-v20-ultracompact-2-4ghz-wireless-microphone-system', 8, 69, '<h2>BOYA BY-V20 Microphone Price in Pakistan – 9499 PKR</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>When it comes to professional recording on the go, the <strong>BOYA BY-V20 Microphone</strong> stands out with its superb features and affordable price. Whether you\'re a content creator, vlogger, or podcaster, this microphone is crafted to elevate your recording experience. If you are searching for the <strong>BOYA BY-V20 Microphone price in Pakistan</strong>, you can grab it for just <strong>9499 PKR</strong> at Phones Dukan.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Ultracompact and Lightweight Design</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>BOYA BY-V20 Microphone</strong> is built to be extremely lightweight and portable. The transmitter weighs only 9.5g and the receiver just 6g, making it easy to carry wherever you go. Its compact design ensures hassle-free recording sessions whether you are indoors or outdoors. Plug in the receiver and you\'re ready to start capturing high-quality audio without any complicated setups.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Perfect Compatibility with USB-C Devices</h3>\r\n<p>Specially designed for Android devices featuring USB-C ports, the <strong>BOYA BY-V20 Microphone</strong> ensures universal compatibility across a wide range of smartphones and tablets. No more worrying about adapters or converters – just connect and start recording instantly.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Simultaneous Recording and Charging</h3>\r\n<p>Running out of battery during recording can disrupt important sessions. BOYA solves this problem with a smart design: the receiver has a USB-C charging port that allows simultaneous recording and device charging. Perfect for long live streams, webinars, podcasting, or course recordings without interruptions.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Exceptional Noise Cancellation</h3>\r\n<p>Audio clarity can make or break a recording. The <strong>BOYA BY-V20 Microphone</strong> comes equipped with an easy-to-use noise cancellation feature. A single press of the NR button on the transmitter activates noise reduction, filtering out background noise and ensuring crisp, clean sound, even in busy environments. Whether you are recording indoors, in a café, or on a busy street, your voice will always come through clearly.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Long-Lasting Battery Life</h3>\r\n<p>A fully charged transmitter of the <strong>BOYA BY-V20 Microphone</strong> can last up to 9 continuous hours, allowing for extended recording sessions without the need for frequent recharging. Meanwhile, the receiver does not require independent charging, providing users with a smooth and efficient recording experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Omnidirectional Sound Pickup and Wide Range</h3>\r\n<p>The built-in omnidirectional microphone picks up sound from all directions, ensuring every word is captured with accuracy. Thanks to a 50-meter operating range, you have the freedom to move around while recording without losing signal quality. This makes the <strong>BOYA BY-V20 Microphone</strong> ideal for interviews, event coverage, and outdoor shoots.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Automatic Pairing and Easy Operation</h3>\r\n<p>Forget about complicated pairing procedures. The <strong>BOYA BY-V20 Microphone</strong> automatically pairs the transmitter and receiver, making setup quick and easy. With true plug-and-play functionality, even beginners can achieve professional-level recordings without needing technical expertise.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>BOYA BY-V20 Microphone Features Summary:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Dual channel wireless system</li>\r\n  <li>USB-C connectivity for Android devices</li>\r\n  <li>Noise cancellation function for superior audio</li>\r\n  <li>9 hours battery life on transmitters</li>\r\n  <li>Omnidirectional mic with 360&deg; pickup</li>\r\n  <li>Simultaneous recording and device charging</li>\r\n  <li>50m operating range for flexible movement</li>\r\n  <li>Compact and lightweight for portability</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Why Buy BOYA BY-V20 Microphone in Pakistan from Phones Dukan?</h3>\r\n<p>At Phones Dukan, we offer the <strong>BOYA BY-V20 Microphone</strong> at the best price in Pakistan — <strong>9499 PKR</strong>. Enjoy original products, nationwide delivery, and top-notch customer service. If you are planning to <strong>purchase BOYA BY-V20 Microphone at best price</strong>, you are in the right place.</p>', '<ul>\r\n  <li>Professional-grade dual channel wireless system</li>\r\n  <li>Designed for Android devices with USB-C ports</li>\r\n  <li>Ultracompact and lightweight for easy portability</li>\r\n  <li>Noise cancellation for clearer audio</li>\r\n  <li>Simultaneous recording and phone charging</li>\r\n  <li>9 hours long battery life</li>\r\n  <li>50m wireless operating range</li>\r\n  <li>Price: <strong>9499 PKR</strong></li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 10500, 9499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-04-28 11:52:14', '2025-05-06 12:48:03', '', NULL, 0),
(203, 'BOYA BY-MW3 Wireless Microphone', 'boya-by-mw3-wireless-microphone', 8, 69, '<h2>BOYA BY-MW3 Wireless Microphone Price in Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The <strong>BOYA BY-MW3 Wireless Microphone</strong> is a practical solution for content creators, vloggers, and professionals who need clear and uninterrupted audio for mobile recordings. Whether you\'re shooting a video, going live, or capturing interviews, this microphone brings professional-quality sound with simple usability.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The plug-and-play functionality makes this mic stand out. Unlike many wireless mics, there\'s <strong>no need for an external app, Bluetooth setup, or adapters</strong>. Simply plug the receiver into your iOS device, power on the microphone, and you\'re ready to record instantly. The auto-connect feature saves time and eliminates complications during urgent shoots or live sessions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Designed for convenience and durability, the BOYA BY-MW3 Wireless Microphone features a <strong>built-in rechargeable battery that lasts up to 8 hours</strong> on a full charge. It supports <strong>long-distance wireless transmission up to 65 feet</strong> in an open environment. Even in places with moderate obstacles like walls, you can expect a solid 40 feet range, making it reliable for indoor and outdoor shoots.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The microphone is lightweight and compact, ensuring it doesn’t get in your way while filming or streaming. If you\'re live streaming for hours and worried about battery drain on your phone, you can conveniently <strong>plug a Type-C cable into the receiver</strong> to charge your device while using the microphone – an incredibly useful feature during extended content sessions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With a <strong>price of just 1,999 PKR</strong>, the BOYA BY-MW3 Wireless Microphone is among the most affordable wireless mic options in Pakistan. This is significantly lower compared to the competitor listings such as <strong>Rs. 3,449</strong>, making it a great value for money without compromising on quality.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you\'re searching for a <strong>BOYA BY-MW3 Wireless Microphone price in Pakistan</strong>, or planning to <strong>buy BOYA BY-MW3 Wireless Microphone</strong> online, this deal gives you professional audio performance at a budget-friendly cost. Ideal for mobile journalists, educators, content creators, and everyday users.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Features Recap:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>No need for additional apps or Bluetooth</li>\r\n  <li>Auto-connects instantly to iOS devices</li>\r\n  <li>Up to 8 hours of continuous recording on a single charge</li>\r\n  <li>Wireless range up to 65ft in ideal conditions</li>\r\n  <li>Allows Type-C charging while in use</li>\r\n  <li>Crystal-clear sound quality ideal for interviews, YouTube, podcasts, and more</li>\r\n  <li>Priced competitively at <strong>Rs. 1,999</strong> in Pakistan</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>This microphone is a go-to option for those seeking <strong>BOYA BY-MW3 Wireless Mic features</strong> without spending big. It’s perfect for mobile setups, simple to operate, and ensures reliable audio capture for every recording need.</p>', '<ul>\r\n  <li>Plug & Play – no app, no adapter needed</li>\r\n  <li>Built-in battery with up to 8 hours runtime</li>\r\n  <li>Stable transmission range up to 65ft</li>\r\n  <li>Lightweight and ideal for android & iOS devices</li>\r\n  <li>Auto-connect feature for quick setup</li>\r\n  <li>Recharge on the go via Type-C</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 2999, 1999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-05-05 12:53:17', '2025-05-06 14:20:19', '', NULL, 0),
(204, 'AULA S603 Gaming Headphones | High-Quality Wired Gaming Headset', 'aula-S603-gaming-headphones', 16, 72, '<p>The AULA S603 Gaming Headphones are built to enhance your gaming experience by delivering powerful sound and comfort, all at an unbeatable price of just <strong>3999 PKR</strong>. Whether you’re in a competitive match or simply enjoying your favorite games, these headphones are engineered to keep you immersed with every sound.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>High-Definition Audio for Total Immersion</h3>\r\n<p>With a powerful 50mm loudspeaker unit, the AULA S603 brings you the immersive sound you need to feel every action in the game. Experience the shock and excitement of every battlefield as if you\'re actually there. The headphones offer a wide frequency range from 20Hz to 20,000Hz, providing crisp highs, balanced mids, and deep bass. Feel the thrill of the game with each footstep, gunshot, or explosion, as the S603 gives you a truly realistic audio experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Advanced Noise Cancellation</h3>\r\n<p>For gamers who need to focus, the AULA S603 features active noise-cancellation, ensuring that background noise doesn\'t interfere with your gaming sessions. This feature is especially beneficial in busy environments, allowing you to hear only the critical in-game sounds. Whether you\'re playing on a crowded train or in a busy home, these headphones will help you stay immersed in the game.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Adjustable Microphone for Clear Communication</h3>\r\n<p>The AULA S603 comes equipped with an adjustable microphone that can be bent and repositioned freely to find the best angle for clear communication. The microphone ensures that your voice comes through crisp and clear, allowing for smooth teamwork in multiplayer games. Whether you\'re giving strategic commands or chatting with friends, the S603 ensures you\'re heard loud and clear without any distractions.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>7-Color RGB Breathing Lights</h3>\r\n<p>What sets the AULA S603 apart is its vibrant 7-color RGB breathing lights. These lights pulse in a stunning circular pattern, creating a cool and immersive gaming atmosphere. The lights add a touch of style to your setup, making the AULA S603 not only a high-performance gaming accessory but also a visually appealing one.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Comfortable Design for Long Sessions</h3>\r\n<p>The AULA S603 has been designed with comfort in mind. The lightweight design and suspended head beam ensure a snug yet painless fit, even during long gaming sessions. You can play for hours without experiencing discomfort, allowing you to fully immerse yourself in the game.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Durability and Quality Construction</h3>\r\n<p>Built to last, the AULA S603 is made with high-quality materials, ensuring long-term durability. The fabric earcups are soft and comfortable, providing a secure fit while also keeping you cool. The headphones are engineered to withstand the wear and tear of daily gaming use.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Perfect for Gaming and Everyday Use</h3>\r\n<p>While the AULA S603 is designed for gamers, its exceptional audio quality and comfort make it suitable for everyday use as well. Whether you’re listening to music, watching movies, or attending virtual meetings, these headphones deliver outstanding performance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>50mm loudspeaker drivers for superior sound quality.</li>\r\n  <li>Active noise cancellation for an undisturbed listening experience.</li>\r\n  <li>Adjustable and flexible microphone for clear communication.</li>\r\n  <li>RGB breathing lights with 7 colors to enhance the gaming atmosphere.</li>\r\n  <li>Lightweight, comfortable design for extended gaming sessions.</li>\r\n  <li>USB wired connection for a stable and reliable connection.</li>\r\n  <li>Priced at just 3999 PKR, offering great value for gamers.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Price:</strong> 3999 PKR</p>', '<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Brand:</strong> AULA</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Model:</strong> S603 Gaming Headset</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Driver Size:</strong> 50mm for high-definition audio</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Active Noise Cancellation:</strong> Yes</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Connectivity:</strong> Wired, USB connection</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Microphone:</strong> Adjustable and flexible for clear communication</li>\r\n  <li><strong>RGB Lighting:</strong> 7 color breathing LED lights</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Sensitivity:</strong> 103dB</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Impedance:</strong> 38Ω</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Frequency Range:</strong> 20Hz-20KHz</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Price:</strong> 3999 PKR</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 4999, 3999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-05-07 10:28:19', '2025-08-06 13:57:58', '', NULL, 0),
(205, 'Jedel SH-712 Noise Cancelling Headphones', 'jedel-sh-712-noise-cancelling-headphones', 16, 58, '<h2>Jedel SH-712 Noise Cancelling Headphones Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The <strong>Jedel SH-712 Noise Cancelling Headphones</strong> offer an exceptional listening experience whether you\'re working, traveling, or just enjoying your favorite music. Priced at just <strong>4199 PKR</strong>, these headphones combine advanced technology with comfort to deliver premium sound quality without compromise.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Noise Cancelling Technology:</strong> The SH-712 is equipped with advanced noise cancellation to block out unwanted sounds, ensuring an immersive listening experience, whether you\'re on a noisy commute or at home.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Adjustable Headband & Plush Cushions:</strong> Designed with comfort in mind, the <strong>adjustable headband</strong> ensures a snug fit, while the <strong>plush ear-pad cushions</strong> provide all-day comfort, even during extended listening sessions.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Built-in Microphone & Call Functions:</strong> With an integrated microphone and call functions, these headphones allow for hands-free conversations, whether you\'re on a call or enjoying an online video. The microphone also features a mute button for easy control.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>FM Radio & Extra Bass:</strong> The SH-712 comes with built-in FM radio, perfect for on-the-go listening, and extra bass functionality for deep, rich sound that adds another dimension to your music.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Connectivity & Controls:</strong> Easily connect the headphones via USB, and control your music with the <strong>in-line controls</strong> for volume and playback adjustments.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Why Choose Jedel SH-712 Noise Cancelling Headphones?</h3>\r\n<p>These headphones are engineered for high-performance listening with <strong>HD voice quality</strong> and <strong>stereo sound</strong>. Whether you’re using them for work or leisure, the <strong>SH-712</strong> delivers crystal-clear audio with the added benefit of noise cancellation, allowing you to focus on what matters most.</p>\r\n<p>Moreover, with a cable length of <strong>2 meters</strong>, you can enjoy the freedom to move without restriction. The <strong>boom microphone</strong> ensures clear communication, whether you\'re gaming or attending a virtual meeting, while the <strong>leather cushions</strong> add an extra touch of luxury.</p>', '<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Brand:</strong> Jedel</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Model:</strong> SH-712</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Price:</strong> 4199 PKR</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Noise Cancelling Technology</strong></li>\r\n    <li><strong>Adjustable Headband for Comfort</strong></li>\r\n    <li><strong>Plush Ear-Pad Cushions</strong></li>\r\n    <li><strong>Built-in Microphone and Volume Control</strong></li>\r\n    <li><strong>FM Radio & Extra Bass Features</strong></li>\r\n    <li><strong>Connectivity:</strong> USB</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 5499, 4199, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-05-07 12:37:24', '2025-08-06 13:56:21', '', NULL, 0),
(206, 'SIGMA SC-95 POWER BANK (20,000mAh) Ghauri-2', 'sigma-SC-95-power-bank-20000mAh-ghauri-2', 10, 70, '<h2>SIGMA SC-95 POWER BANK (20,000mAh) Ghauri-2 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>If you’re searching for a <strong>high-capacity 20000mAh Power Bank</strong> with premium fast charging features, then this PD + QC22.5W power bank is the right fit. Packed with advanced features and powerful charging output, it ensures your devices are always powered whether you’re indoors or outdoors.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This <strong>22.5W Power Bank</strong> delivers <strong>PD (Power Delivery) + QC (Quick Charge)</strong> fast charging support. With <strong>dual fast charge</strong> capabilities, it significantly reduces charging time, making it more efficient than traditional power banks. The <strong>USB1/USB2</strong> ports and <strong>Type-C PD output</strong> give you the freedom to charge multiple devices simultaneously, ensuring flexibility on the go.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With a massive <strong>20000mAh capacity</strong>, this power bank is designed to charge your smartphone multiple times. Whether you\'re going on a trip or need backup charging for your workday, this mobile power station has got your back. It supports <strong>fast charging protocols like QC3.0, FCP, PE, and PD</strong>, making it compatible with almost all major smartphone brands including Apple, Samsung, Xiaomi, and Huawei.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This model is especially optimized for <strong>iPhone devices</strong>. It supports PD fast charging for iPhone 8, 8 Plus, X, XS, XR, XS Max, 11, 11 Pro, 11 Pro Max, 12, 13, and 14 series – so you don’t have to worry about slow power-ups. With support for <strong>self-fast charging</strong>, the power bank itself also gets charged rapidly, which saves you even more time.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔌 Technical Specifications:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Capacity:</strong> 20000mAh / 74Wh</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Type-C PD Input:</strong> 5V/3A, 9V/2A (18W Max)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Type-C PD Output:</strong> 5V/3A, 9V/2.25A (20W Max)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Micro Input:</strong> 5V/2A, 9V/2A (18W Max)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>USB1/2 Output:</strong> 5V/3A, 9V/2A</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Combined Output (Type-C + USB1 + USB2):</strong> 5V/3A</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Weight:</strong> Approx. 530g</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>The power bank features <strong>three output ports</strong> that allow simultaneous charging. You can choose between <strong>USB and Type-C ports</strong>, based on your device needs. The built-in <strong>power level display</strong> gives you real-time visibility of the battery status, so you always know when to recharge.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What makes it stand out is its <strong>durable design</strong> and <strong>comfortable grip</strong>. The smooth, clean finish and compact size mean it fits easily into your bag or pocket, making it ideal for travel and outdoor use.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>At just <strong>₨6299 in Pakistan</strong>, this 20000mAh PD + QC 22.5W Power Bank offers excellent value compared to other high-end brands. You get the same high-speed charging experience without overspending.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Why Buy This Power Bank?</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Affordable price in Pakistan</strong> compared to market alternatives</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Supports multiple fast charging technologies</strong> for both input and output</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Ideal for frequent travelers, mobile professionals, and students</strong></li>\r\n  <li><strong>Reliable performance with longer battery life</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Whether you want to <strong>buy a 20000mAh Power Bank</strong> for your personal use or gift it to someone who needs reliable charging on the go, this model checks all the right boxes. Don’t miss out on this high-performance charging solution.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Buy now from Phones Dukan at the best price in Pakistan – only ₨6299!</strong></p>', '<ul>\r\n  <li>Capacity: 20000mAh high-performance battery</li>\r\n  <li>Dual Fast Charging: PD + QC22.5W</li>\r\n  <li>Compatible with QC3.0, FCP, PD, PE protocols</li>\r\n  <li>3 Output Ports: Type-C, USB1, USB2</li>\r\n  <li>Supports PD fast charging for iPhones & Android</li>\r\n  <li>Power Display for battery level monitoring</li>\r\n  <li>Sleek, portable, comfortable grip</li>\r\n  <li>Price in Pakistan: <strong>₨6299 Only</strong></li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 7499, 6299, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-05-07 14:41:03', '2025-05-07 15:00:23', '', NULL, 0),
(207, 'BX-172 Portable Bluetooth Speaker', 'bx-172-portable-bluetooth-speaker', 4, 58, '<h2>BX-172 Portable Bluetooth Speaker Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The <strong>BX-172 Portable Bluetooth Speaker</strong> by BLUK’S is a compact yet powerful audio companion, engineered for those who love quality sound and modern design. Whether you\'re at home, outdoors, or hosting a small gathering, this <strong>mini Bluetooth speaker</strong> delivers strong performance in a lightweight body at an affordable price of <strong>₨2299 in Pakistan</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Equipped with advanced audio components, the <strong>BX-172 Rechargeable Bluetooth Speaker</strong> produces <strong>HD stereo sound with rich bass</strong>. Thanks to the built-in strong horn, drivers, and dual passive radiators, it creates immersive sound that fills the room and energizes your music experience. The deep bass and dynamic highs offer more than just music — they offer an atmosphere.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Adding more excitement to your music sessions is the built-in <strong>RGB colorful light show</strong>. As the beat drops, the RGB lights pulse and change colors in sync with your tunes. Whether it’s for night parties, gaming setups, or relaxing evenings, this <strong>Bluetooth speaker with RGB light</strong> turns every moment into a vibrant experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The BX-172 comes with a <strong>1200mAh rechargeable battery</strong>, offering up to <strong>5 to 6 hours of non-stop playback</strong> on a single charge. The battery life may vary depending on volume level and content played, but it consistently delivers reliable performance whether indoors or on the go. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>This <strong>portable wireless Bluetooth speaker</strong> supports the latest Bluetooth technology, enabling a more <strong>stable and faster connection</strong>. Once connected, it remembers your device, thanks to its smart memory function, making future pairing seamless. You can also <strong>pair two BX-172 speakers</strong> together for a wider sound stage and louder output, utilizing its <strong>TWS (True Wireless Stereo)</strong> support. This feature allows users to enjoy music in stereo mode by wirelessly syncing two speakers from one device.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Model:</strong> BLUK\'S BX-172</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Battery:</strong> 1200mAh (Rechargeable)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Playtime:</strong> Up to 6 Hours (Depending on volume)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Audio:</strong> HD Stereo Sound with Deep Bass</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Lights:</strong> RGB light effects synchronized with music</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Bluetooth:</strong> Stable connection with memory mode</li>\r\n  <li><strong>TWS Support:</strong> Connect two BX-172 speakers simultaneously</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Design:</strong> Waterproof, portable, and handheld design</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>The waterproof and durable casing makes this speaker ideal for both indoor and outdoor use. Whether it\'s a beach day, hiking trip, or picnic, the speaker is built to endure light splashes while keeping the music going.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thanks to its <strong>portable and handheld design</strong>, you can carry the BX-172 anywhere with ease. Despite its small size, the speaker packs a punch and adds visual charm to your space with its RGB lighting.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Looking to <strong>buy BX-172 Bluetooth Speaker in Pakistan</strong>? You’re in the right place. Phones Dukan offers the <strong>BX-172 Portable Bluetooth Speaker</strong> at the best price of <strong>₨2299</strong>. This speaker is a perfect gift option for music lovers, tech enthusiasts, and even kids who enjoy music with a light show.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Why Choose BX-172 Bluetooth Speaker?</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>HD sound with rich bass in a compact body</li>\r\n  <li>RGB light display enhances your music sessions</li>\r\n  <li>Perfect balance of performance, portability, and price</li>\r\n  <li>Great value at only ₨2299 in Pakistan</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>BLUK\'S Portable Wireless Bluetooth Speaker</strong> offers much more than just sound. It\'s about quality, portability, and visual enjoyment – all packed in one smart device. Grab yours today from Phones Dukan and experience true wireless sound in style.</p>', '<ul>\r\n  <li>Model: BLUK\'S BX-172 Portable Bluetooth Speaker</li>\r\n  <li>HD Stereo Sound with powerful bass performance</li>\r\n  <li>Cool RGB light show synced to music beats</li>\r\n  <li>1200mAh rechargeable battery – 5–6 hours playtime</li>\r\n  <li>Stable Bluetooth connection with memory mode</li>\r\n  <li>Supports TWS for wireless stereo pairing</li>\r\n  <li>Compact, handheld and waterproof design</li>\r\n  <li>Price in Pakistan: <strong>₨2299</strong></li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 3599, 2299, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-05-07 16:36:17', '2025-05-07 16:39:11', '', NULL, 0);
