(208, 'BX88 Wireless Speaker Price In Pakistan – 10W Output, Powerful Sound & Portability', 'bx88-wireless-speaker', 4, 58, '<h2>BX88 Wireless Speaker Price In Pakistan and specifications</h2>\r\n<p>Looking for an affordable wireless speaker that delivers quality sound and long battery life? The <strong>BX88 Wireless Speaker</strong> is your go-to option. With powerful 10W output, advanced Bluetooth 5.0 technology, and a compact build, this speaker is designed to meet your music needs both indoors and outdoors. The <strong>BX88 Wireless Speaker Price in Pakistan</strong> is just <strong>3199 PKR</strong>, offering excellent value for anyone seeking a budget-friendly yet feature-packed audio solution.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Bluks BX88 Wireless Speaker</strong> is built to produce immersive audio, thanks to its dual drivers that deliver deep bass and crisp treble. Whether you\'re watching a movie, listening to music, or taking calls, the BX88 ensures an enjoyable audio experience. With up to <strong>12 hours of playback</strong>, you can rely on this speaker for day-long entertainment.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Connectivity is seamless with <strong>Bluetooth 5.0</strong>, which ensures fast pairing with all Bluetooth-enabled devices including smartphones, tablets, and laptops. If you prefer non-Bluetooth options, the BX88 also supports <strong>AUX and TF card</strong> modes, offering flexible playback options.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Designed with portability in mind, this speaker features a <strong>lightweight and rugged design</strong> that is also <strong>splash-proof</strong>. Whether you\'re going on a picnic, traveling, or just chilling at home, this speaker fits right into your lifestyle. LED indicators enhance the speaker\'s look, giving it a modern and stylish appearance.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Another highlight is the <strong>built-in microphone</strong>, which makes hands-free calling smooth and convenient. Perfect for video calls, voice chats, or virtual meetings, the mic ensures clear audio without distortion.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>BX88 Wireless Speaker Features:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Output Power:</strong> 10W for loud and clear audio</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Battery Backup:</strong> Up to 12 hours on a full charge</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Connectivity:</strong> Bluetooth 5.0, AUX, TF card</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Water Resistance:</strong> Splash-proof design</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Charging Port:</strong> Fast charging with Type-C</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Built-in Microphone:</strong> For hands-free calling</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Portability:</strong> Lightweight and easy to carry</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Compatibility:</strong> Works with Android, iOS, Windows devices</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Whether you\'re buying for yourself or gifting it to a music enthusiast, the <strong>BX88 Bluetooth speaker</strong> makes for a smart purchase. Available for just <strong>3199 PKR</strong>, it provides high-end features without breaking your budget.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Buy BX88 Speaker in Pakistan</strong> now from a trusted online store and enjoy premium sound quality, long battery life, and robust connectivity in one compact package.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you\'re searching for the <strong>BX88 price 2025</strong>, want a reliable <strong>portable speaker 10W</strong>, or need detailed <strong>BX88 speaker features</strong>, this listing is your complete guide.</p>', '<ul>\r\n  <li>BX88 Wireless Speaker with powerful 10W audio output</li>\r\n  <li>Long-lasting battery with up to 12 hours of playback</li>\r\n  <li>Advanced Bluetooth 5.0 connectivity for stable pairing</li>\r\n  <li>Multi-mode playback: Bluetooth, AUX, TF card</li>\r\n  <li>Compact, water-resistant, and perfect for travel</li>\r\n  <li>Built-in microphone for hands-free calls</li>\r\n  <li>Affordable price of 3199 PKR in Pakistan</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 0, 4499, 3199, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-05-07 16:51:46', '2025-05-14 09:16:30', '', NULL, 0),
(209, 'Wiwu Pencil One', 'wiwu-pencil-one ', 9, 73, '<h2>Wiwu Pencil One Price In Pakistan and specification</h2>\r\n<p>The <strong>Wiwu Pencil One</strong> is a high-quality universal stylus designed to provide a seamless writing and drawing experience across all capacitive touchscreen devices. Whether you\'re an artist, student, professional, or casual user, this stylus is made to perform with precision and comfort. If you\'re searching for the <strong>Wiwu Pencil One Price in Pakistan</strong>, it\'s currently available at an affordable <strong>2250 PKR</strong>, making it a great value for its features.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Crafted from durable <strong>aluminum alloy</strong>, the Wiwu Pencil One offers a premium feel in hand. The stylus is designed with a <strong>non-slip rubber grip</strong>, ensuring comfort during long writing or sketching sessions. This makes it especially useful for students taking notes, teachers marking documents, and designers working on digital illustrations.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Wiwu Pencil One stands out due to its <strong>2-in-1 functionality</strong>. On one end, it features a <strong>transparent disc tip stylus</strong>, which enhances accuracy by allowing you to see exactly where the pen touches the screen. This level of precision is especially useful for drawing, editing images, or writing on devices like the iPad or Samsung tablets. On the other end, there\'s a <strong>regular ballpoint pen</strong>, which comes in handy when you need to jot down quick notes on paper.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Compatibility is one of the strongest aspects of this stylus. The <strong>Wiwu Pencil One stylus</strong> works flawlessly with a wide range of devices, including iPads, iPhones, Android smartphones, Kindle, tablets, and even touchscreen laptops. There\'s no need to worry about pairing or charging—it’s ready to use straight out of the box.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Users in Pakistan looking to <strong>buy Wiwu Pencil One stylus</strong> can rely on this tool for smooth gliding, fast response, and high accuracy on any capacitive touchscreen. Whether you\'re using drawing apps, taking digital notes, or just navigating your phone, this stylus performs consistently without lags or delays.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In terms of portability, the slim and lightweight profile makes it easy to carry in your bag or pocket. Plus, the durable build ensures it can withstand daily use without damage. Its simple plug-and-play functionality—without the need for Bluetooth or batteries—adds to its convenience, especially for on-the-go users.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Wiwu Pencil One features</strong> are tailored to meet the demands of modern users who switch between paper and screen. The stylus delivers a natural writing feel while maintaining consistent sensitivity across apps and platforms.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>At just <strong>2250 PKR</strong>, the <strong>Wiwu Pencil One Price in Pakistan</strong> positions this stylus as an affordable yet high-end tool for creative and practical use. Compared to other stylus pens in this price range, the Wiwu Pencil One offers greater compatibility, build quality, and user experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>So whether you\'re a digital artist needing accurate strokes, a teacher highlighting key points, or a student solving assignments on a tablet, this <strong>Wiwu universal stylus pen</strong> makes an excellent everyday companion.</p>', '<ul>\r\n  <li>Wiwu Pencil One universal stylus compatible with all capacitive screens</li>\r\n  <li>Precision disc tip for accurate sketching and note-taking</li>\r\n  <li>Smooth writing experience with 2-in-1 pen: stylus + ballpoint</li>\r\n  <li>Comfortable non-slip grip for extended use</li>\r\n  <li>Premium build with aluminum alloy body</li>\r\n  <li>Ideal for iPad, Android, iPhone, laptops, tablets</li>\r\n  <li>Available in Pakistan for just 2250 PKR</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 2699, 2250, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-05-07 17:21:11', '2025-05-08 10:33:27', '', NULL, 0),
(210, 'WiWU Core Power Bank Wi-P007', 'wiwu-core-power-bank-wi-p007', 10, 73, '<h2>WiWU Core Power Bank Wi-P007 Price In Pakistan And Specifications</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'re looking for a premium power solution for your mobile devices, the <strong>WiWU Core Power Bank Wi-P007</strong> is a reliable and feature-rich option available in Pakistan. With a <strong>10000mAh capacity</strong>, fast charging support, built-in cables, and <strong>wireless Apple Watch charging</strong>, it\'s engineered for users who carry multiple devices and don’t want to compromise on power or portability.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Power That Lasts All Day</h3>\r\n<p>The WiWU Core Power Bank Wi-P007 packs a high-capacity <strong>10000mAh battery (3.85V/38.5Wh)</strong> with a <strong>rated capacity of 6000mAh at 5V/2A</strong>. It is capable of charging devices multiple times on a single charge. Whether you’re powering up your <strong>iPhone 13</strong>, <strong>Samsung Galaxy</strong>, or <strong>Apple Watch</strong>, this power bank handles them all efficiently.</p>\r\n<p>For Apple Watch users, this device is a game changer. The <strong>built-in wireless charger (2.5W Max)</strong> magnetically aligns with your Apple Watch to deliver smooth and secure wireless charging. It supports all major Apple Watch models including <strong>Series 8, Ultra, 7, SE, and earlier versions</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Fast & Versatile Charging Outputs</h3>\r\n<p>Equipped with multiple charging outputs, this device is more than just a power bank. It offers:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>USB Output:</strong> 5V⎓4.5A, 4.5V⎓5A, 9V⎓2A, 12V⎓1.5A up to <strong>22.5W</strong></li>\r\n  <li><strong>Type-C Input/Output:</strong> Supports <strong>PD20W</strong> with 5V⎓3A, 9V⎓2.22A, 12V⎓1.67A</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Lightning Input:</strong> 5V⎓2.4A</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Built-in Type-C & Lightning Cable Output:</strong> Up to 20W fast charging</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>You can <strong>charge up to four devices simultaneously</strong>, including iPhone, Android phones, AirPods, and your Apple Watch — ideal for travel, business, or everyday use.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Designed for All Your Devices</h3>\r\n<p>This power bank is compatible with:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>iPhone 14/13/12/11/X/XS/8 Series</strong></li>\r\n  <li><strong>Apple Watch Series 2 to 8 / Ultra / SE</strong></li>\r\n  <li>Android brands like <strong>Samsung, Motorola, LG, OnePlus, Google Pixel, Huawei</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>No need to carry extra cables – it features <strong>two integrated cables</strong> (Type-C and Lightning), <strong>USB-C input/output</strong>, and <strong>USB-A output</strong>, ensuring you\'re always ready.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Energy Efficient Performance</h3>\r\n<p>With an <strong>energy conversion rate of ≥75%</strong>, the WiWU Wi-P007 maintains excellent performance with minimal power loss. Its built-in smart chip optimizes charging efficiency and protects your devices from overcharging and overheating.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Durable & Travel-Friendly</h3>\r\n<p>Built with premium materials and designed with portability in mind, the WiWU Core Power Bank Wi-P007 fits easily in your pocket or bag. Whether you’re commuting, on vacation, or in the office, it’s your reliable charging companion.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Executive Quality Standards</h3>\r\n<p>This model complies with <strong>GB/T35590-2017 standards</strong>, ensuring safety and durability. It’s perfect for professionals and tech-savvy users who demand reliable backup power.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>WiWU Core Power Bank Wi-P007 Price in Pakistan</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>WiWU Core Power Bank Wi-P007 (10000mAh)</strong> is now available at <strong>Phones Dukan</strong> for just <strong>7999 PKR</strong>. It offers premium value with fast charging, multi-device support, and wireless Apple Watch charging — a complete charging solution for today’s smart device users.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Why Buy WiWU Power Bank in Pakistan from Phones Dukan?</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Competitive Price: <strong>7999 PKR</strong></li>\r\n  <li>100% Original Product</li>\r\n  <li>Cash on Delivery Available</li>\r\n  <li>Nationwide Shipping</li>\r\n  <li>After-Sales Support</li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Brand:</strong> WiWU</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Model:</strong> Wi-P007</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Battery Capacity:</strong> 10000mAh (Rated: 6000mAh)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Total Output:</strong> 22.5W Max</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Dual built-in cables:</strong> Lightning & Type-C</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Magnetic wireless charging:</strong> for Apple Watch (2.5W Max)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>USB-A and USB-C ports</strong></li>\r\n  <li><strong>Compatible with:</strong> iPhone, Apple Watch, Android</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Supports:</strong> PD 20W fast charging</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Price in Pakistan:</strong> 7999 PKR</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 9999, 7999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-05-08 11:04:21', '2025-05-08 11:20:05', '', NULL, 0),
(211, 'Faster Cruze Pro FBT-100 Earbuds - ANC & ENC ', 'faster-cruze-pro-fbt-100-earbuds', 13, 76, '<h2>Faster Cruze Pro FBT-100 Earbuds – ANC & ENC Wireless Excellence at 4999 PKR</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Faster Cruze Pro FBT-100 Earbuds</strong> bring powerful performance and advanced features into one sleek and comfortable package. Priced at just <strong>4999 PKR</strong>, these earbuds are an excellent choice for anyone looking for <strong>premium wireless earbuds with ANC and ENC</strong> in Pakistan.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Crystal-Clear Sound with ANC & ENC</h3>\r\n<p>The standout feature of the <strong>Faster Cruze Pro FBT-100</strong> is its <strong>Active Noise Cancellation (ANC)</strong> and <strong>Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC)</strong> technologies. Whether you\'re commuting, working in a noisy environment, or simply relaxing, these features help block out unwanted background noise, letting you enjoy your music and phone calls with clarity.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With <strong>ANC</strong>, external sounds are actively canceled for a distraction-free listening experience. At the same time, <strong>ENC filters ambient noise during calls</strong>, ensuring the person on the other end hears your voice loud and clear—ideal for professionals and remote workers.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Ergonomic and Comfortable Fit for All-Day Use</h3>\r\n<p>Designed with a lightweight and <strong>ergonomic shape</strong>, these earbuds offer a snug fit that stays secure even during workouts. Whether you’re at the gym, on a walk, or at your desk, the <strong>Faster Cruze Pro FBT-100 earbuds</strong> provide lasting comfort.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Their <strong>IPX5 rating</strong> ensures resistance to sweat and water splashes, making them a great pick for fitness lovers and active lifestyles.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Impressive Battery Life</h3>\r\n<p>Enjoy up to <strong>8 hours of playtime on a single charge</strong>, with multiple recharges available from the compact case. You can count on these earbuds to last through your daily activities, whether it’s meetings, playlists, or podcasts.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The included <strong>charging case</strong> is pocket-sized, allowing you to power up your earbuds anywhere, anytime—great for on-the-go use.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Reliable Wireless Performance</h3>\r\n<p>With <strong>Bluetooth 5.0</strong>, you get strong, lag-free connectivity and a stable connection across devices. Pairing is quick and seamless, and once connected, the earbuds maintain excellent signal stability for both music and calls.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Intuitive Touch Controls</h3>\r\n<p>Managing music, calls, or activating voice assistants is simple thanks to <strong>responsive touch controls</strong> built into each earbud. No more reaching for your phone every time you want to change a song or answer a call.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Why Choose Faster Cruze Pro FBT-100 Earbuds?</h3>\r\n<p>If you\'re searching for <strong>wireless earbuds under 5000 in Pakistan</strong> that deliver on both sound quality and features, the Faster Cruze Pro FBT-100 is a top contender. It combines the essentials—<strong>ANC, ENC, Bluetooth 5.0, and ergonomic comfort</strong>—without pushing your budget.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Priced at only <strong>4999 PKR</strong>, these <strong>noise-canceling earbuds in Pakistan</strong> offer excellent value and performance compared to more expensive models. They’re equally suitable for calls, music, workouts, or downtime.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Specifications:</h3>\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"8\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <th>Feature</th>\r\n    <th>Detail</th>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Type</td>\r\n    <td>Wireless Bluetooth Earbuds</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Noise Cancellation</td>\r\n    <td>ANC + ENC</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Connectivity</td>\r\n    <td>Bluetooth 5.0</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Battery Life</td>\r\n    <td>8 hours + Charging Case</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Water Resistance</td>\r\n    <td>IPX5 (sweat and splash resistant)</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Design</td>\r\n    <td>Ergonomic, lightweight</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Touch Control</td>\r\n    <td>Yes</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Price in Pakistan</td>\r\n    <td>4999 PKR</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h3>Why Buy From Us?</h3>\r\n<p>At <strong>Phones Dukan</strong>, we offer 100% genuine products at the <strong>best prices in Pakistan</strong>. The <strong>Faster Cruze Pro FBT-100 Earbuds</strong> come with fast delivery, secure packaging, and excellent customer support.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Conclusion</h3>\r\n<p>If you\'re in the market for <strong>affordable wireless earbuds with noise cancellation</strong>, the <strong>Faster Cruze Pro FBT-100</strong> is a smart buy. With its dual ANC & ENC technology, comfortable fit, and excellent audio performance, it\'s ideal for daily use at an unbeatable price of <strong>4999 PKR</strong>.</p>', '<ul>\r\n  <li>Active Noise Cancellation (ANC) for immersive sound</li>\r\n  <li>Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC) for clear calls</li>\r\n  <li>Up to 8 hours playtime + charging case</li>\r\n  <li>Bluetooth 5.0 stable connectivity</li>\r\n  <li>Comfortable ergonomic design</li>\r\n  <li>IPX5 water-resistant – perfect for workouts</li>\r\n  <li>Touch controls for easy use</li>\r\n  <li>Price in Pakistan: 4999 PKR</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 6499, 4999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-05-15 15:30:46', '2025-05-16 12:27:40', '', NULL, 0),
(212, 'FASTER RGBP1 – ENC EARBUDS', 'faster-rgbp1-enc-bluetooth-earbuds', 13, 76, '<h2>FASTER RGBP1 – ENC EARBUDS Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n  <p>\r\n    If you’re searching for reliable and feature-packed earbuds, the <strong>Faster RGBP1 Bluetooth Earbuds</strong> offer excellent performance with a premium feel — all at an affordable price of <strong>5799 PKR</strong> in Pakistan. Designed for comfort and audio clarity, these wireless in-ear headphones are made to fit your everyday lifestyle.\r\n  </p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Premium Wireless Audio with Bluetooth 5.3</h3>\r\n  <p>\r\n    With advanced <strong>Bluetooth 5.3 technology</strong>, the Faster RGBP1 delivers a smooth and fast wireless connection. Whether you’re listening to music, streaming videos, or attending calls, this version ensures lower latency and improved range, making your audio experience seamless and interruption-free.\r\n  </p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Active Noise Cancellation and Clear Calling</h3>\r\n  <p>\r\n    These earbuds feature <strong>Active Noise Cancellation (ANC)</strong> that minimizes background noise so you can focus on your favorite content. Whether you\'re commuting or working in a noisy place, the noise cancelling earbuds let you enjoy distraction-free audio. The <strong>ENC (Environmental Noise Cancellation)</strong> also ensures crystal-clear call quality, filtering out surrounding sound during voice calls.\r\n  </p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>All-Day Battery Life with Compact Charging Case</h3>\r\n  <p>\r\n    On a full charge, the <strong>Faster RGBP1 earbuds</strong> offer up to <strong>6 hours of continuous playback</strong>. The portable charging case provides additional power for multiple recharges, making it a dependable companion for your day-to-day listening needs.\r\n  </p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Comfortable Fit for Daily Use</h3>\r\n  <p>\r\n    These <strong>in-ear wireless earbuds</strong> are ergonomically designed to fit securely and comfortably. Whether you’re exercising, walking, or relaxing at home, the earbuds sit gently in your ear without causing discomfort. The lightweight build makes them ideal for extended use.\r\n  </p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Water-Resistant and Workout-Ready</h3>\r\n  <p>\r\n    With an <strong>IPX4 water resistance rating</strong>, the Faster RGBP1 earbuds can withstand sweat and light rain. This makes them suitable for gym workouts, outdoor runs, or just regular daily use in all weather conditions.\r\n  </p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Touch Controls and Smart Features</h3>\r\n  <p>\r\n    The earbuds come equipped with intuitive <strong>touch-sensitive controls</strong> for managing playback, answering calls, or activating voice assistants. Enjoy hands-free convenience at your fingertips.\r\n  </p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Why Buy the Faster RGBP1 Earbuds in Pakistan?</h3>\r\n  <p>\r\n    At a budget-friendly price of <strong>5799 PKR</strong>, these earbuds deliver features usually found in more expensive models. Whether it’s sound quality, durability, or design, the <strong>Faster RGBP1 Bluetooth Earbuds</strong> check all the boxes.\r\n  </p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Order with Confidence</h3>\r\n  <ul>\r\n    <li>Estimated delivery time: 1-3 working days</li>\r\n    <li>7-day exchange or replacement policy</li>\r\n    <li>Complaints reported within 24 hours are eligible for a refund</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <p>\r\n    Don\'t compromise on sound. Choose <strong>Faster RGBP1 Bluetooth Earbuds</strong> — your perfect companion for music, calls, and everyday convenience.\r\n  </p>', '<ul>\r\n  <li>Bluetooth Version: 5.3 for stable and fast connection</li>\r\n  <li>Active Noise Cancellation for clear, immersive sound</li>\r\n  <li>Up to 6 hours playtime with compact charging case</li>\r\n  <li>IPX4 water resistance — perfect for workouts and daily use</li>\r\n  <li>Ergonomic and lightweight in-ear design</li>\r\n  <li>Smart touch controls for music and calls</li>\r\n  <li>Price in Pakistan: 5799 PKR</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 6999, 5799, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-05-1