(213, 'Sigma Wireless TG-1 Gaming Earbuds', 'sigma-tg1-wireless-gaming-earbuds', 13, 70, '<h2>Sigma TG-1 Wireless Gaming Earbuds Price in Pakistan – Premium Sound for Every Gamer</h2>\r\n  <p>\r\n    The <strong>Sigma TG-1 Wireless Gaming Earbuds</strong> are built for players who want both style and performance. Designed with active noise cancellation, low-latency Bluetooth connection, and deep bass sound, these earbuds elevate your mobile and console gaming sessions. Available now at just <strong>4999 PKR</strong>, the TG-1 offers excellent value for money in the gaming audio category.\r\n  </p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Designed for Gaming and Entertainment</h3>\r\n  <p>\r\n    Gaming demands speed and clarity. That’s why the Sigma TG-1 earbuds are tuned for real-time audio response with minimal delay. Thanks to Bluetooth technology, these <strong>wireless gaming earbuds</strong> offer a seamless connection, letting you stay locked into every move, shot, and voice command.\r\n  </p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Rich Bass and Crystal-Clear Sound</h3>\r\n  <p>\r\n    Equipped with <strong>bass sound music earphone technology</strong>, the TG-1 delivers powerful low frequencies alongside balanced mids and highs. Whether you\'re in a fast-paced game or enjoying your music playlist, the sound quality stays consistent and immersive.\r\n  </p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Noise Cancellation and Clear Communication</h3>\r\n  <p>\r\n    With <strong>Active Noise Cancellation</strong>, background sounds are reduced so you can focus better. The built-in microphone ensures your teammates hear you clearly during gameplay. Even in noisy environments, communication remains uninterrupted.\r\n  </p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Touch Control and Hands-Free Convenience</h3>\r\n  <p>\r\n    Say goodbye to buttons. The Sigma TG-1 earbuds feature <strong>smart touch controls</strong> for managing music, answering calls, or activating voice assistants. It’s all just a tap away, giving you full control without pulling out your device.\r\n  </p>\