(215, 'BX-11 Double Mic ANC Earphones with iPhone & Type-C Connector', 'bluks-bx-11-mic-anc-earphones', 8, 58, '<h2>Bluks BX-11 Mic ANC Earphones Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Introducing the <strong>Bluks BX-11 Mic ANC Earphones</strong> – the ultimate companion for anyone who values superior audio performance, comfort, and advanced technology. With crystal-clear sound, deep bass, and <strong>Active Noise Cancellation (ANC)</strong>, these earphones are engineered to deliver an immersive listening experience whether you\'re working, gaming, or simply enjoying your favorite music. Available now for just <strong>₨ 3,499</strong> in Pakistan, the <strong>BX-11 Mic ANC</strong> offers exceptional value without compromising on quality.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Crystal-Clear Audio & Dual Microphones</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Bluks BX-11 Mic ANC</strong> earphones come equipped with a <strong>dual-microphone system</strong>, ensuring crystal-clear voice clarity. Whether you’re making a call, participating in a virtual meeting, or chatting with friends while gaming, the dual microphones eliminate background noise and deliver <strong>noise-free calls</strong>. Experience natural, uninterrupted conversations, no matter where you are.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Active Noise Cancellation (ANC)</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Designed to enhance your listening experience, the <strong>Active Noise Cancellation (ANC)</strong> feature reduces unwanted background noise, allowing you to fully immerse in your audio. Whether you\'re traveling, working in a noisy environment, or enjoying your favorite tunes, <strong>ANC</strong> ensures focused and distraction-free listening. It’s perfect for long flights, commutes, or even quiet moments at home.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Ergonomic Design for All-Day Comfort</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Bluks BX-11</strong> is designed with ergonomics in mind, featuring soft silicone ear tips that provide a snug, secure fit. The lightweight structure ensures comfort even during extended listening sessions, making these earphones ideal for all-day use. Say goodbye to ear fatigue, whether you’re enjoying your favorite music, watching movies, or gaming.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Wide Device Compatibility</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>With dual <strong>iPhone Lightning</strong> and <strong>Type-C</strong> connectors, the <strong>Bluks BX-11 Mic ANC Earphones</strong> are compatible with a wide range of devices. Whether you have an iPhone, Android smartphone, tablet, or laptop, you can seamlessly connect your earphones without the hassle of adapters. This makes the <strong>BX-11</strong> perfect for anyone who uses multiple devices throughout the day.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Durable & Tangle-Free Cable</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Bluks BX-11</strong> features a <strong>tangle-free, durable cable</strong> that resists wear and tear over time. You won’t have to worry about annoying tangles or the cable getting damaged from daily use. This sturdy cable ensures long-lasting performance, providing you with a reliable audio experience for months to come.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Inline Controls & Hands-Free Calling</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Convenience is key with the built-in inline controls. With simple buttons, you can easily adjust volume, control music playback, and manage calls without reaching for your phone. The integrated microphone also allows you to take calls and give voice commands, making your audio experience more efficient and enjoyable.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Why Choose Bluks BX-11 Mic ANC Earphones?</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Premium Sound Quality:</strong> Enjoy deep bass, clear highs, and smooth mids that bring your music to life.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Active Noise Cancellation (ANC):</strong> Focus on your audio without background distractions.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Dual-Mic System:</strong> Enjoy high-quality voice calls and clear communication.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>All-Day Comfort:</strong> Soft, ergonomic ear tips designed for a secure fit.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Versatile Compatibility:</strong> Compatible with both <strong>iPhone</strong> and <strong>Type-C devices</strong>.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Affordable Price:</strong> Get premium features at an unbeatable price of <strong>₨ 3,499</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Specifications:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Model:</strong> BX-11</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Microphone:</strong> Dual-mic system for enhanced voice clarity</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Noise Cancellation:</strong> Active Noise Cancellation (ANC) technology</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Compatibility:</strong> iPhone Lightning & Type-C devices</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Cable Type:</strong> Tangle-free, durable design</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Warranty:</strong> 1-year manufacturer warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Buy with Confidence:</h3>\r\n<p>Available for <strong>₨ 3,499</strong>, the <strong>Bluks BX-11 Mic ANC Earphones</strong> are an unbeatable deal in the Pakistani market. They combine premium sound, comfort, and cutting-edge technology at an affordable price. Order yours today and enjoy exceptional sound quality, whether you’re on the go, at the office, or relaxing at home.</p>', '<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Premium Sound Quality:</strong> Deep bass, crisp highs, and balanced mids.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Active Noise Cancellation (ANC):</strong> Blocks out distractions for better listening.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Dual-Mic Clarity:</strong> Clear calls and voice transmission.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Ergonomic Fit:</strong> Comfortable silicone ear tips for long sessions.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Wide Compatibility:</strong> Works with iPhone Lightning and Type-C devices.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Price:</strong> ₨ 3,499</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 4999, 3499, 'BX-11 Double Mic ANC Earphones with iPhone & Type-C Connector', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-05-21 14:22:57', '2025-05-30 11:48:58', '', NULL, 0),
(217, 'Samsung Galaxy A05', 'samsung-galaxy-a05', 2, 55, '<h2>Samsung Galaxy A05 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>The <strong>Samsung Galaxy A05</strong> is the latest addition to the A-series lineup, delivering a balanced blend of performance and value for those looking for a reliable smartphone. Priced at <strong>Rs. 27,999 PKR</strong>, this smartphone is equipped with powerful specifications designed to meet your everyday needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Display & Design</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Samsung Galaxy A05</strong> boasts a large <strong>6.7-inch PLS LCD display</strong> that ensures you can enjoy your favorite content with stunning clarity. Whether you\'re watching videos, playing games, or browsing the web, the display provides vibrant colors and sharp details. The <strong>screen resolution</strong> of <strong>720 x 1600</strong> ensures clear visuals without compromising battery life. Its sleek design, with dimensions of <strong>168.8 x 78.2 x 8.8 mm</strong>, makes it easy to hold and use with one hand, while the phone\'s <strong>weight</strong> of <strong>195g</strong> feels sturdy yet comfortable.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Performance</h3>\r\n<p>Under the hood, the <strong>Samsung Galaxy A05</strong> runs on the <strong>Mediatek MT6769V/CZ Helio G85</strong> processor, known for its power efficiency and smooth performance. Whether you\'re multitasking or using demanding apps, this smartphone delivers reliable results. Paired with <strong>4GB RAM</strong>, the Galaxy A05 runs smoothly, allowing you to switch between apps effortlessly. Additionally, with <strong>128GB of internal storage</strong> and a <strong>MicroSD card slot</strong> supporting up to <strong>1TB</strong>, you have plenty of space for all your apps, photos, and videos.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Camera Features</h3>\r\n<p>Capture the moments that matter most with the <strong>50MP primary camera</strong> and the <strong>2MP depth sensor</strong>. The <strong>Samsung Galaxy A05</strong> delivers high-quality shots, perfect for everyday photography. Whether you\'re taking a selfie with the <strong>8MP front camera</strong> or recording in <strong>FHD</strong> at <strong>60fps</strong>, this device ensures clear and crisp results. The <strong>back flash</strong> ensures you can capture great photos even in low-light conditions, making it ideal for both day and night photography.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Battery Life</h3>\r\n<p>One of the standout features of the <strong>Samsung Galaxy A05</strong> is its impressive <strong>5000mAh battery</strong>. With this large battery, you can easily get through a full day of use without worrying about running out of power. Whether you\'re streaming videos, browsing social media, or playing games, the <strong>Galaxy A05</strong> has enough juice to keep up with your needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Connectivity & More</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Samsung Galaxy A05</strong> supports <strong>4G LTE</strong>, <strong>WiFi</strong>, and <strong>Bluetooth</strong>, ensuring you\'re always connected to your network. Unfortunately, the phone does not support <strong>5G</strong>, but the existing 4G capabilities are more than enough for smooth internet browsing and online activities.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Why Choose Samsung Galaxy A05?</h3>\r\n<p>If you\'re in the market for a reliable, affordable smartphone with impressive features, the <strong>Samsung Galaxy A05</strong> is a fantastic choice. With its powerful camera, efficient processor, and long-lasting battery, it\'s the perfect smartphone for everyday users. Priced at <strong>Rs. 27,999 PKR</strong>, it offers great value without compromising on performance.</p>\r\n', '<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Price</strong>: Rs. 27,999 PKR</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Display</strong>: 6.7-inch PLS LCD</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Camera</strong>: 50MP + 2MP rear, 8MP front</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Processor</strong>: Mediatek Helio G85</li>\r\n    <li><strong>RAM</strong>: 4GB</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Storage</strong>: 128GB (Expandable up to 1TB)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Battery</strong>: 5000 mAh</li>\r\n    <li><strong>SIM</strong>: Dual-SIM (Nano-SIM)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>OS</strong>: Android 12</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Release Date</strong>: February 2024</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Connectivity</strong>: 4G LTE, Bluetooth, WiFi</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 29999, 27999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-05-29 12:04:00', '2025-05-30 14:14:56', '', NULL, 0),
(218, 'Samsung Galaxy A36 5G', 'samsung-galaxy-a36-5g', 2, 55, '<h2>Samsung Galaxy A36 5G Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Samsung Galaxy A36 5G</strong> is a high-performance smartphone designed for users who demand top-notch features, performance, and photography capabilities. With an innovative design, powerful chipset, and large display, it’s the ideal smartphone for work, entertainment, and everything in between. Available now for just <strong>₨ 113,999</strong> in Pakistan, this device offers incredible value.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Impressive 6.7-inch Super AMOLED Display</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Samsung Galaxy A36 5G</strong> features a massive <strong>6.7-inch Super AMOLED display</strong> that brings your content to life. With a resolution of <strong>1080 x 2340 pixels</strong> and a <strong>120Hz refresh rate</strong>, this screen provides smooth and vibrant visuals. Whether you\'re watching movies, gaming, or browsing, the high resolution and stunning colors deliver a premium viewing experience. Plus, with a peak brightness of <strong>1000 nits</strong>, you can easily view the screen even in bright outdoor environments.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Snapdragon 6 Gen 3 for Unmatched Performance</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Under the hood, the <strong>Samsung Galaxy A36 5G</strong> is powered by the <strong>Snapdragon 6 Gen 3</strong> chipset, paired with a <strong>2.4 GHz Octa-Core CPU</strong> that ensures smooth multitasking, gaming, and app performance. Whether you\'re streaming videos, playing games, or using demanding apps, the <strong>Galaxy A36</strong> offers exceptional speed and responsiveness, making it ideal for every task.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>50MP Triple Camera System for Stunning Photography</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Capture breathtaking photos with the <strong>50MP main rear camera</strong> of the <strong>Samsung Galaxy A36 5G</strong>. With advanced features such as Optical Image Stabilization (OIS), this camera ensures sharp and blur-free photos in any lighting conditions. The camera setup also includes an <strong>8MP ultra-wide lens</strong> and a <strong>5MP depth sensor</strong>, allowing you to take wide-angle shots and portrait photos with ease. For selfies, the <strong>12MP front camera</strong> ensures crisp, clear images with vibrant colors and great detail.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Long-Lasting 5000mAh Battery with Fast Charging</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Samsung Galaxy A36</strong> comes equipped with a powerful <strong>5000mAh battery</strong>, ensuring all-day usage without the need to recharge. Whether you\'re watching videos, gaming, or working on the go, this large battery will keep up with your needs. The phone also supports fast charging, ensuring that you can quickly power up your device and get back to your activities in no time.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Massive Storage & Expandable Memory</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Samsung Galaxy A36 5G</strong> offers ample storage with <strong>8GB of RAM</strong> and <strong>256GB of internal storage</strong>, giving you plenty of space for apps, photos, videos, and documents. If you need more storage, the device also includes a dedicated microSD card slot, allowing you to expand your storage capacity up to <strong>1TB</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Enhanced 5G Connectivity</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>With built-in 5G support, the <strong>Samsung Galaxy A36</strong> provides ultra-fast internet speeds, making it perfect for streaming, gaming, and downloading content at lightning speeds. Stay connected with the latest network technology and enjoy seamless connectivity for all your online needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>6.7-inch Super AMOLED Display:</strong> Vibrant, sharp visuals with a 120Hz refresh rate.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Snapdragon 6 Gen 3 Chipset:</strong> 2.4 GHz Octa-Core CPU for fast performance.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>50MP Triple Camera:</strong> Capture stunning photos with OIS and wide-angle shots.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>5000mAh Battery:</strong> Long-lasting power with fast charging capabilities.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>8GB RAM + 256GB Storage:</strong> Ample space for your apps and media, expandable via microSD card.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>5G Connectivity:</strong> Enjoy fast internet speeds for streaming and gaming.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Price:</strong> ₨ 113,999</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Specifications:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Model:</strong> Samsung Galaxy A36 5G</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Display:</strong> 6.7-inch Super AMOLED, 120Hz refresh rate, 1080 x 2340 pixels</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Processor:</strong> Snapdragon 6 Gen 3, 2.4 GHz Octa-Core CPU</li>\r\n    <li><strong>RAM:</strong> 8GB</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Storage:</strong> 256GB (Expandable via microSD card)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Camera:</strong> 50MP + 8MP + 5MP Rear, 12MP Front</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Battery:</strong> 5000mAh, Fast Charging</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Operating System:</strong> Android with One UI</li>\r\n    <li><strong>5G Support:</strong> Yes</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Price:</strong> ₨ 113,999</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Order the Samsung Galaxy A36 5G Today</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Samsung Galaxy A36 5G</strong> is available now for just <strong>₨ 113,999</strong> in Pakistan. With its premium features, stunning display, and powerful performance, this smartphone is perfect for both work and play. Don\'t miss out on this amazing deal – order now and experience the future of mobile technology.</p>', '<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Display:</strong> 6.7-inch Super AMOLED, 120Hz refresh rate, 1000 nits peak brightness.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Performance:</strong> Snapdragon 6 Gen 3 with 2.4 GHz Octa-Core CPU.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Camera:</strong> 50MP + 8MP + 5MP rear triple cameras, 12MP front camera for selfies.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Battery:</strong> 5000mAh with long-lasting power and fast charging.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8GB RAM + 256GB ROM, expandable storage.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Price:</strong> ₨ 113,999</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 119999, 113999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-05-29 12:10:58', '2025-05-30 12:31:38', '', NULL, 0);
