(219, 'Vivo Y29', 'vivo-y29', 2, 60, '<h2>Vivo Y29 Smartphone Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Vivo Y29</strong> is a powerhouse designed to offer an unparalleled smartphone experience with its exceptional features. Available for <strong>₨ 45,999</strong> in Pakistan, this smartphone comes packed with everything you need, from a crystal-clear AMOLED display to a powerful battery and high-end camera capabilities. Whether you\'re a photography enthusiast, a gamer, or a professional, the Vivo Y29 is equipped to meet your demands.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Stunning 6.78-inch AMOLED Display</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Vivo Y29</strong> features a <strong>6.78-inch AMOLED display</strong> with a <strong>2800 x 1260</strong> resolution, offering a sharp and vivid visual experience. With its high-definition <strong>FHD+ resolution</strong>, you can expect bright, clear images that pop, whether you\'re watching movies, playing games, or browsing social media. The AMOLED technology provides vibrant colors and deep contrasts, enhancing your visual experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Powerful Performance with MediaTek Dimensity 8200</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Vivo Y29</strong> is powered by the advanced <strong>MediaTek Dimensity 8200</strong> processor, which provides high-speed performance and ensures smooth multitasking. Coupled with <strong>8GB of RAM</strong> (expandable to <strong>12GB</strong>), this phone handles all your tasks, from running apps to gaming, without any lag. It offers <strong>256GB of internal storage</strong>, providing ample space for your photos, videos, apps, and more.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>50MP Front & Rear Cameras for Superior Photography</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Capture every moment in stunning detail with the <strong>50MP front camera</strong> and the <strong>50MP rear camera</strong> equipped with Optical Image Stabilization (OIS) for sharp, blur-free images. The rear camera also features a <strong>12MP portrait camera</strong> and an <strong>8MP wide-angle lens</strong>, making it perfect for every type of shot, from wide landscapes to detailed portraits. Whether you\'re shooting in low light or bright conditions, the <strong>Vivo Y29</strong> delivers exceptional results every time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The front camera also supports <strong>Night Mode</strong> and <strong>Portrait Mode</strong>, enabling you to take professional-grade selfies in any lighting condition. Whether you\'re at a party, in the office, or on a scenic vacation, your photos will always stand out.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Long-Lasting Battery with 80W Fast Charging</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Vivo Y29</strong> comes with a robust <strong>4600mAh battery</strong> that ensures you can go all day without worrying about running out of power. If you need a quick boost, the phone supports <strong>80W fast charging</strong>. Get up to <strong>50% charge in just 10 minutes</strong>, ensuring you’re never left waiting for long periods before your phone is ready to use again.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Elegant and Sleek Design</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Vivo Y29</strong> is crafted with a <strong>glass back</strong> and comes in two stunning colors: <strong>Himalayan Blue</strong> and <strong>Space Black</strong>. The sleek design not only looks premium but also feels comfortable in your hand. The dimensions of <strong>16.418 cm x 7.437 cm x 0.746 cm</strong> and weight of <strong>188g</strong> make it easy to carry around while offering a premium build quality that feels solid yet light.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Funtouch OS 13 for a Seamless Experience</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Running on <strong>Funtouch OS 13</strong>, the <strong>Vivo Y29</strong> offers a smooth and intuitive interface, giving you access to a range of customization options and efficient task management tools. It comes with advanced features that enhance your device\'s performance, making it easy to navigate through apps, settings, and multimedia content.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Dual SIM and 5G Connectivity</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>With support for <strong>Dual SIM Dual Standby (DSDS)</strong> and compatibility with <strong>5G networks</strong>, the <strong>Vivo Y29</strong> ensures that you stay connected with fast internet speeds and excellent network coverage. Whether you’re in a city or a remote area, the Vivo Y29 offers seamless connectivity across different network types, including <strong>5G</strong>, <strong>4G LTE</strong>, and <strong>3G</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Enhanced Security with In-Display Fingerprint Sensor</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Your personal data is secure with the <strong>in-display fingerprint sensor</strong> on the <strong>Vivo Y29</strong>. This cutting-edge biometric technology ensures that only you can access your phone, providing an added layer of security.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>6.78-inch AMOLED FHD+ Display</strong> with vibrant colors and sharp visuals.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>50MP Front & Rear Cameras</strong> for excellent photography, with OIS and night mode.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>MediaTek Dimensity 8200 Processor</strong> for superior performance.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>8GB/12GB RAM & 256GB Storage</strong> for seamless multitasking.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>4600mAh Battery</strong> with <strong>80W Fast Charging</strong>.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Dual SIM (5G Support)</strong> for seamless connectivity.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Funtouch OS 13</strong> for smooth UI and customizable experience.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>In-Display Fingerprint Sensor</strong> for enhanced security.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Specifications:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Model:</strong> Vivo Y29</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Display:</strong> 6.78-inch AMOLED FHD+ (2800 x 1260)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Processor:</strong> MediaTek Dimensity 8200</li>\r\n    <li><strong>RAM:</strong> 8GB / 12GB</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Storage:</strong> 256GB</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Camera:</strong> 50MP Front, 50MP + 12MP + 8MP Rear</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Battery:</strong> 4600mAh (80W Fast Charging)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Operating System:</strong> Funtouch OS 13</li>\r\n    <li><strong>SIM:</strong> Dual SIM (5G Support)</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Fingerprint Sensor:</strong> In-display</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Price:</strong> ₨ 45,999</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Buy with Confidence:</h3>\r\n<p>Available for <strong>₨ 45,999</strong>, the <strong>Vivo Y29</strong> is an unbeatable deal in the Pakistani market. They combine premium sound, comfort, and cutting-edge technology at an affordable price. Order yours today and enjoy exceptional sound quality, whether you’re on the go, at the office, or relaxing at home.</p>', '<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Display:</strong> 6.78-inch AMOLED FHD+ screen for vibrant, sharp visuals.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Camera:</strong> 50MP front & rear cameras with OIS for stunning photos.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Battery:</strong> 4600mAh battery with 80W fast charging for all-day use.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Performance:</strong> Powered by MediaTek Dimensity 8200, 8GB/12GB RAM + 256GB storage.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Design:</strong> Sleek glass body, available in Himalayan Blue and Space Black.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Price:</strong> ₨ 45,999</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 49999, 45999, 'Vivo Y29', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-05-29 12:21:36', '2025-05-30 12:05:59', 'Vivo Y29', NULL, 0),
(220, 'WS15 Smartwatch Your Ultimate Fitness and Style Companion', 'ws15-smartwatch ', 11, 58, '<h2>WS15 Smartwatch Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n  <p>The WS15 Smartwatch is your ultimate companion for fitness, style, and connectivity, priced at an affordable 2999 PKR. Designed to cater to both active individuals and those seeking reliable health monitoring, this sport smart watch combines cutting-edge technology with a sleek, unisex design. Whether you’re hitting the gym, tracking your daily steps, or managing calls on the go, the WS15 Smartwatch delivers functionality and flair in one compact package.</p>\r\n  <p>Featuring a vibrant 2.2-inch big screen with a 320x240 IPS display, the WS15 Smartwatch ensures crystal-clear visuals, making it easy to navigate notifications, fitness stats, or incoming calls. The touch screen interface is intuitive, allowing seamless control whether you’re checking your heart rate or switching between multisport tracking modes. With its life waterproof and dustproof design (IP65 rating), this smartwatch is built to withstand sweat, splashes, and tough conditions, making it ideal for workouts or outdoor adventures.</p>\r\n  <p>Health and fitness tracking are at the core of the WS15 Smartwatch. The heart rate tracker provides real-time insights into your cardiovascular health, helping you optimize workouts or monitor your well-being throughout the day. The sleep tracker analyzes your sleep patterns, offering valuable data to improve rest and recovery. For fitness enthusiasts, the multisport tracker supports various activities, from running to cycling, ensuring you can monitor performance across different exercises. Additional features like the passometer, speed measurement, and fitness tracker make it a versatile tool for achieving your health goals.</p>\r\n  <p>Stay connected with the WS15 Smartwatch’s call and message features. Answer calls, receive push notifications, and get message reminders directly on your wrist, keeping you in the loop without needing to check your phone. The ZTFit app, compatible with both iOS and Android, enhances your experience with APP control, letting you customize settings, track data, and manage notifications effortlessly. Whether you’re a tech-savvy user or someone looking for elder care solutions, the WS15 Smartwatch’s user-friendly interface and practical features make it a perfect fit.</p>\r\n  <p>Style meets durability with the WS15 Smartwatch. Its alloy case and silica gel band ensure comfort and longevity, while the square design adds a modern, fashion-forward touch. With 10 interchangeable straps included, you can switch up your look to match any occasion, from casual outings to formal events. The private mold design ensures exclusivity, and the option to customize the logo adds a personal touch for those seeking a unique accessory.</p>\r\n  <p>Battery life is a standout feature, offering 11 to 30 days of usage on a single charge, so you can rely on the WS15 Smartwatch for extended periods without constant recharging. Backed by a 12-month warranty, this smartwatch guarantees peace of mind and quality craftsmanship. Manufactured in Guangdong, China, by an OEM brand, the WS15 Smartwatch combines affordability with premium features, making it a top choice for anyone seeking a sport smart watch with robust functionality.</p>\r\n  <p>Priced at just 2999 PKR, the WS15 Smartwatch offers unmatched value for a device that blends fitness tracking, smart connectivity, and stylish design. Whether you’re monitoring your heart rate, tracking sleep, or staying connected with calls and messages, this smartwatch is designed to keep up with your lifestyle. Its life waterproof rating and anti-impact build make it a reliable companion for active users, while the big screen and long battery life ensure convenience and usability. Order your WS15 Smartwatch today and elevate your fitness journey with a device that’s as versatile as you are.</p>', '  <ul>\r\n    <li>WS15 Smartwatch with 2.2-inch big screen for clear visuals</li>\r\n    <li>Heart rate tracker, sleep tracker, and multisport tracking</li>\r\n    <li>Life waterproof and dustproof for active lifestyles</li>\r\n    <li>10 customizable straps for style and comfort</li>\r\n    <li>APP control via ZTFit for iOS and Android</li>\r\n    <li>Long-lasting battery: 11–30 days</li>\r\n    <li>Only 2999 PKR with a 12-month warranty</li>\r\n  </ul>', 1, 10, 4499, 2999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-27 12:19:04', '2025-09-19 14:41:55', '', 2299.00, 1),
(221, 'X10 Pro Max Smart Watch', 'x10-pro-max-smart-watch', 11, 58, '<h2>X10 Pro Max Smart Watch Price In Pakistan– Style, Fitness</h2>\r\n  <p>The X10 Pro Max Smart Watch, priced at just 1,940 PKR, is a game-changer for anyone seeking a blend of style, functionality, and affordability in Pakistan. This feature-packed smartwatch is designed to keep you connected, healthy, and active, making it an ideal choice for fitness enthusiasts, professionals, and tech-savvy individuals. With its sleek design and advanced features, the X10 Pro Max Smart Watch stands out as a top contender in the wearable tech market, offering unmatched value at the lowest price in Pakistan.</p>\r\n  <p>At the heart of the X10 Pro Max Smart Watch is its stunning 50mm AMOLED display, delivering vibrant colors and sharp visuals for an immersive user experience. Whether you’re checking notifications, tracking your fitness goals, or navigating the interface, the full-touch capacitive screen ensures smooth and responsive interactions. The premium stainless steel frame, paired with a comfortable silicone strap, adds durability and elegance, making it suitable for both casual and professional settings. Its IP67 water-resistant rating means you can wear it confidently during workouts, light rain, or daily activities without worrying about splashes or sweat.</p>\r\n  <p>Health monitoring is a key strength of the X10 Pro Max Smart Watch. The built-in heart rate monitor provides real-time data to help you track your cardiovascular health during workouts or throughout the day. The sleep quality monitor analyzes your sleep patterns, offering insights to improve rest and recovery. Additionally, the oxygen level monitoring feature keeps you informed about your blood oxygen levels, a valuable tool for wellness tracking. With the step tracker and calorie burn counter, you can monitor your daily activity and stay motivated to achieve your fitness goals. The multiple sport modes, including running, cycling, and yoga, cater to a variety of activities, making this smartwatch a versatile companion for active lifestyles.</p>\r\n  <p>Stay connected effortlessly with the X10 Pro Max Smart Watch’s Bluetooth calling and notification features. With Bluetooth V5.0, it syncs seamlessly with both Android and iOS devices, allowing you to make and receive calls directly from your wrist. The voice assistant simplifies tasks like setting reminders or checking the weather, while real-time notifications for calls, SMS, WhatsApp, and other apps keep you in the loop without needing to reach for your phone. Whether you’re managing a busy schedule or staying connected on the go, this smartwatch ensures you never miss a beat.</p>\r\n  <p>The X10 Pro Max Smart Watch is designed for convenience and longevity. Its 330mAh battery delivers an impressive 4–5 days of usage on a single charge, so you can rely on it for extended periods without frequent recharging. The included magnetic USB charging cable makes powering up quick and hassle-free, with a full charge taking just around two hours. The smartwatch’s compatibility with Android and iOS devices, combined with its user-friendly companion app, ensures easy setup and customization, including multiple watch faces and language support (English, Urdu, Arabic, and more).</p>\r\n  <p>Priced at only 1,940 PKR, the X10 Pro Max Smart Watch offers premium features at an unbeatable value, making it one of the best smartwatches to buy in Pakistan. Its robust health tracking, Bluetooth calling, and stylish design make it a perfect fit for men, women, or anyone looking for a reliable fitness tracker and digital companion. Whether you’re purchasing the X10 Pro Max Smart Watch for personal use or as a thoughtful gift, its versatility and performance deliver exceptional quality. Shop now to experience the X10 Pro Max Smart Watch features at the lowest price in Pakistan and elevate your daily routine with a device that combines innovation and affordability.</p>', '  <ul>\r\n    <li>X10 Pro Max Smart Watch with 50mm AMOLED display</li>\r\n    <li>Heart rate monitor, sleep tracker, and oxygen level monitoring</li>\r\n    <li>IP67 water-resistant for daily wear</li>\r\n    <li>Bluetooth calling and voice assistant support</li>\r\n    <li>Multiple sport modes for versatile fitness tracking</li>\r\n    <li>4–5 days battery life with 330mAh capacity</li>\r\n    <li>Only 1,940 PKR, compatible with Android and iOS</li>\r\n  </ul>', 1, 10, 3500, 1940, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-27 12:41:59', '2025-07-27 13:24:21', '', NULL, 0),
(222, 'HK10 PRO Max Smartwatch', 'hk10-pro-max-smartwatch', 11, 58, '<h2>HK10 PRO Max Smartwatch Price In Pakistan Style, Fitness</h2>\r\n<p>The HK10 PRO Max Smartwatch, priced at an affordable 5,940 PKR, is the ultimate blend of style, technology, and value, making it a top choice for anyone in Pakistan looking to buy a feature-rich smartwatch. Whether you’re a fitness enthusiast, a busy professional, or someone who loves staying connected, this smartwatch offers everything you need at the lowest price in Pakistan. With its sleek design, advanced health monitoring, and seamless connectivity, the HK10 PRO Max Smartwatch is built to enhance your daily life, from tracking workouts to managing calls on the go.</p>\r\n<p>The HK10 PRO Max Smartwatch boasts a stunning 50mm AMOLED display with a 485x520 resolution, delivering bright, clear visuals that make every glance enjoyable. Whether you’re checking fitness stats, reading notifications, or navigating the interface, the responsive touchscreen ensures effortless control. The watch’s durable zinc alloy frame and comfortable silicone strap combine style with practicality, perfect for both casual outings and intense workouts. Its IP67 water-resistant rating protects against water splashes, sweat, and dust, so you can wear it confidently during exercise or in unpredictable weather.</p>\r\n<p>Health and fitness tracking are at the core of the HK10 PRO Max Smartwatch features. The heart rate monitor provides real-time insights, helping you monitor your heart health during workouts or daily activities. The sleep quality monitor tracks your rest patterns, offering data to improve your sleep habits. For comprehensive wellness, the oxygen level monitoring feature keeps you informed about your blood oxygen levels, while the step tracker and calorie burn counter help you stay on top of your activity goals. With multiple sport modes, including running, cycling, and yoga, this smartwatch supports a range of activities, making it ideal for fitness lovers who want to track their progress with precision.</p>\r\n<p>Connectivity is a breeze with the HK10 PRO Max Smartwatch. Equipped with Bluetooth V5.3, it syncs smoothly with Android and iOS devices, allowing you to make and receive calls directly from your wrist using the built-in speaker and microphone. The voice assistant simplifies tasks like setting alarms or checking updates, while real-time notifications for calls, texts, and apps like WhatsApp keep you connected without reaching for your phone. Whether you’re juggling a packed schedule or staying in touch with friends, this smartwatch ensures you’re always in the loop.</p>\r\n<p>The 320mAh battery delivers smart battery life, lasting several days on a single charge, depending on usage. From tracking your steps to taking calls, the HK10 PRO Max Smartwatch keeps up with your active lifestyle without needing frequent recharges. The included wireless charging cable makes powering up quick and convenient, with a full charge taking just a couple of hours. The companion app offers customization options, including a variety of watch faces and support for multiple languages like English, Urdu, and Arabic, making it user-friendly for everyone in Pakistan.</p>\r\n<p>At just 5,940 PKR, the HK10 PRO Max Smartwatch offers unmatched value, combining premium features with affordability. It’s one of the best smartwatches you can buy in Pakistan, perfect for anyone seeking a reliable fitness tracker, stylish accessory, or smart connectivity solution. The HK10 PRO Max Smartwatch price in Pakistan makes it an excellent choice for personal use or as a gift, delivering high-end performance without breaking the bank. Compare its features—AMOLED display, health monitoring, and Bluetooth calling—and see why it stands out. Shop now to grab the HK10 PRO Max Smartwatch at the lowest price in Pakistan and elevate your everyday experience with a device that’s as versatile as you are.</p>', '<ul>\r\n  <li>HK10 PRO Max Smartwatch with vibrant 50mm AMOLED display</li>\r\n  <li>Tracks heart rate, sleep, oxygen levels, and steps</li>\r\n  <li>IP67 water-resistant for active use</li>\r\n  <li>Bluetooth calling and voice assistant for easy connectivity</li>\r\n  <li>Multiple sport modes for fitness tracking</li>\r\n  <li>320mAh battery with smart battery life</li>\r\n  <li>Just 5,940 PKR, works with Android and iOS</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 15000, 7899, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-27 13:57:29', '2025-09-29 07:33:17', '', NULL, 0),
(223, 'MK X16 Pro Smart Watch', 'mk-x16-pro-smart-watch', 11, 58, '<h2>MK X16 Pro Smart Watch Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>Looking for a smart watch that blends style, functionality, and affordability? The <strong>MK X16 Pro Smart Watch</strong> is your perfect match, priced at just <strong>1899 PKR</strong>. Packed with cutting-edge features, this sleek device keeps you connected, tracks your fitness goals, and elevates your everyday style. Whether you\'re hitting the gym, heading to work, or relaxing at home, the MK X16 Pro is designed to keep up with your lifestyle.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Why Choose the MK X16 Pro Smart Watch?</h3>\r\n<p>This isn’t just a watch—it’s a companion. With a <strong>1.99-inch HD touchscreen</strong>, the MK X16 Pro delivers crisp visuals and smooth navigation. The <strong>TFT screen</strong> ensures vibrant colors, making it easy to read notifications or check your fitness stats, even in bright sunlight. Plus, with <strong>IP68 water resistance</strong>, you can wear it while swimming, washing dishes, or caught in the rain without worry.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The MK X16 Pro comes with <strong>seven premium straps</strong>, one for each day of the week. From sleek silver to bold black, you can switch up your look effortlessly. Want to make it truly yours? Set a custom wallpaper or choose from <strong>multiple watch faces</strong> to match your mood or outfit. The <strong>alloy case</strong> adds durability and a premium feel, ensuring your smart watch looks as good as it performs.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Stay Connected, Always</h3>\r\n<p>Stay in the loop with notifications from your favorite apps like <strong>WhatsApp, Instagram, Facebook, and Twitter</strong>. The MK X16 Pro supports <strong>call and message reminders</strong>, so you’ll never miss an important update. With <strong>Bluetooth 5.0</strong>, you get a stable, fast connection to your phone, whether you’re using <strong>Android</strong> or <strong>iOS</strong>. The built-in <strong>voice assistant</strong> makes it easy to set reminders, make calls, or check the weather hands-free.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Fitness Tracking That Empowers You</h3>\r\n<p>Take charge of your health with the MK X16 Pro’s advanced fitness features. The <strong>heart rate monitor</strong> tracks your pulse in real-time, helping you optimize your workouts. The <strong>sleep tracker</strong> analyzes your sleep patterns, so you can wake up feeling refreshed. Plus, the <strong>step tracker</strong> and <strong>activity monitor</strong> keep tabs on your daily movement, motivating you to stay active. Whether you’re running, cycling, or walking, this smart watch provides the data you need to hit your goals.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Built for Convenience and Durability</h3>\r\n<p>With a <strong>270 mAh battery</strong>, the MK X16 Pro offers reliable power to get you through your day. It’s designed for <strong>all-day comfort</strong>, with a lightweight build that feels great on your wrist. The <strong>square screen shape</strong> gives it a modern, stylish edge, while the <strong>non-detachable battery</strong> ensures a sleek design without compromising on performance. No need to worry about complicated setups—this watch is <strong>compatible with multiple languages</strong>, including English, Spanish, French, and more, making it accessible to users worldwide.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Why Buy from Us?</h3>\r\n<p>At just <strong>1899 PKR</strong>, the MK X16 Pro offers unbeatable value. You get premium features like a <strong>voice assistant</strong>, <strong>fitness tracking</strong>, and <strong>social media notifications</strong> without breaking the bank. The included <strong>premium box packing</strong> makes it a great gift for yourself or someone special. Compared to other smart watches, the MK X16 Pro stands out for its versatility, style, and affordability.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Perfect for Every Lifestyle</h3>\r\n<p>Whether you’re a fitness enthusiast, a busy professional, or someone who loves staying connected, the MK X16 Pro fits seamlessly into your life. Its <strong>multiple dials</strong> and customizable features let you tailor it to your needs, while the <strong>IP68 waterproof rating</strong> ensures it can handle whatever your day throws at you. From tracking your morning run to displaying notifications during a meeting, this smart watch does it all.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Ready to Upgrade Your Wrist Game?</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>MK X16 Pro Smart Watch</strong> is more than just a gadget—it’s a lifestyle upgrade. For only <strong>1899 PKR</strong>, you get a feature-rich, stylish, and durable smart watch that keeps you connected and motivated. Don’t settle for less when you can have it all. Grab yours today and experience the perfect blend of technology and style!</p>', '<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>MK X16 Pro Smart Watch:</strong> Stylish, feature-packed, and affordable at 1899 PKR.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Fitness Tracking:</strong> Monitors heart rate, steps, and sleep for a healthier you.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>IP68 Waterproof:</strong> Perfect for daily wear, even in water.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>1.99\" HD Touchscreen:</strong> Vibrant display with customizable watch faces.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Seven Premium Straps:</strong> Switch up your style for every day of the week.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Social Media Alerts:</strong> Stay connected with notifications from WhatsApp, Instagram, and more.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 3500, 1899, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-27 14:40:47', '2025-07-27 14:57:50', '', NULL, 0),
(224, 'Stereo TWS ENC Wireless Earbuds', 'stereo-tws-enc-wireless-earbuds', 13, 58, '<h2>Stereo TWS ENC Wireless Earbuds Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>Looking for high-quality earbuds that won’t break the bank? The <strong>Stereo TWS ENC Wireless Earbuds</strong> are your go-to choice, priced at an unbeatable <strong>1050 PKR</strong> in Pakistan. These earbuds combine cutting-edge technology, sleek design, and affordability, making them perfect for music lovers, fitness enthusiasts, and busy professionals alike. Whether you’re jamming to your favorite tunes, taking calls on the go, or sweating it out at the gym, these earbuds deliver exceptional performance without compromise.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Why Choose Stereo TWS ENC Wireless Earbuds?</h3>\r\n<p>These earbuds are packed with features that make them stand out in the crowded market of wireless audio. With <strong>Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC)</strong>, you get crystal-clear calls and an immersive music experience, even in noisy environments like crowded streets or busy cafes. The <strong>IPX5 water resistance</strong> rating ensures they can handle sweat, rain, or accidental splashes, making them a reliable companion for workouts or outdoor adventures.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Bluetooth 5.3</strong> technology offers a stable, fast connection with a <strong>10-meter range</strong>, so you can move freely without worrying about dropouts. Whether you’re using an <strong>Android</strong> or <strong>iOS</strong> device, the earbuds pair effortlessly, thanks to their <strong>auto-pairing</strong> feature. Just open the case, and they’re ready to connect—no fuss, no hassle.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Superior Sound and Comfort</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Stereo TWS ENC Wireless Earbuds</strong> deliver rich, high-fidelity stereo sound that brings your music, podcasts, and calls to life. The built-in <strong>microphone</strong> ensures your voice comes through loud and clear, making these earbuds ideal for hands-free calls or virtual meetings. With a lightweight, ergonomic design, they fit snugly in your ears, providing all-day comfort whether you’re running, working, or relaxing.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Power That Keeps Up with You</h3>\r\n<p>Battery life is a game-changer with these earbuds. Each bud has a <strong>40mAh battery</strong>, offering up to <strong>3-4 hours of playtime</strong> on a single charge. The <strong>3000mAh charging case</strong> extends your listening time, keeping you powered for days without needing a recharge. When it’s time to power up, the <strong>USB-C charging</strong> gets the job done in just <strong>1.5 hours</strong>, so you’re never left waiting. Whether you’re commuting, traveling, or hitting the gym, these earbuds are built to keep up with your lifestyle.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Designed for Every Moment</h3>\r\n<p>The <strong>Stereo TWS ENC Wireless Earbuds</strong> are more than just audio gear—they’re a lifestyle upgrade. Their <strong>sleek, compact design</strong> makes them easy to carry, and the <strong>premium charging case</strong> adds a touch of style while protecting your earbuds. With <strong>IPX5 water resistance</strong>, they’re perfect for intense workouts or outdoor runs, ensuring durability no matter the conditions. The <strong>universal compatibility</strong> with Android and iOS devices means anyone can enjoy their features, from students to professionals.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Unbeatable Value at 1050 PKR</h3>\r\n<p>At just <strong>1050 PKR</strong>, these earbuds offer premium features at a budget-friendly price. Compared to other <strong>TWS earbuds in Pakistan</strong>, the Stereo TWS ENC Wireless Earbuds deliver exceptional value without sacrificing quality. You get advanced <strong>ENC noise cancellation</strong>, reliable <strong>Bluetooth 5.3 connectivity</strong>, and a <strong>long-lasting battery</strong>—all for a fraction of the cost of premium brands. Plus, the <strong>12-month warranty</strong> and <strong>fast shipping</strong> ensure you can shop with confidence.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Perfect for Every Lifestyle</h3>\r\n<p>Whether you’re a fitness junkie, a music enthusiast, or someone who needs reliable earbuds for calls, these earbuds are designed to fit seamlessly into your life. The <strong>IPX5 water resistance</strong> makes them ideal for workouts, while the <strong>ENC technology</strong> ensures clear communication during calls or virtual meetings. The <strong>3-4 hour playtime</strong> and high-capacity charging case mean you can enjoy uninterrupted audio all day long. From morning jogs to late-night study sessions, these earbuds are your perfect companion.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Why Shop with Us?</h3>\r\n<p>When you buy the <strong>Stereo TWS ENC Wireless Earbuds</strong> from us, you’re getting more than just a great product. Our commitment to quality means you’ll receive <strong>100% original earbuds</strong> with a <strong>12-month warranty</strong> and <strong>7-day return policy</strong>. With <strong>lightning-fast shipping</strong> across Pakistan, your new earbuds will be at your doorstep in no time. At <strong>1050 PKR</strong>, you’re getting unbeatable value for a feature-packed product that rivals more expensive models.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Ready to Elevate Your Audio Experience?</h3>\r\n<p>Don’t settle for tangled wires or subpar sound. The <strong>Stereo TWS ENC Wireless Earbuds</strong> offer the perfect blend of style, performance, and affordability. For only <strong>1050 PKR</strong>, you get <strong>ENC noise cancellation</strong>, <strong>IPX5 water resistance</strong>, and <strong>Bluetooth 5.3 connectivity</strong> in a sleek, durable package. Upgrade your audio game today and enjoy the freedom of true wireless sound. Shop now and experience the difference!</p>', '<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Stereo TWS ENC Wireless Earbuds:</strong> Premium sound for only 1050 PKR.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>ENC Noise Cancellation:</strong> Crystal-clear calls and immersive audio.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>IPX5 Water Resistant:</strong> Ideal for workouts and outdoor adventures.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Bluetooth 5.3:</strong> Seamless 10m connectivity with Android and iOS.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Long-Lasting Battery:</strong> Up to 4 hours of playtime, 3000mAh case.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Fast Charging:</strong> Fully charged in just 1.5 hours via USB-C.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 1999, 1050, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-27 15:13:47', '2025-09-19 14:40:55', '', 700.00, 1),
(225, 'Faster NERV WATCH 1', 'faster-nerv-watch-1', 11, 76, '<p>Looking for a smartwatch that blends style, functionality, and value? The <strong>Faster NERV WATCH 1</strong>, priced at just <strong>Rs. 7,499/-</strong>, is the perfect choice for Pakistan’s fast-paced lifestyles. Whether you\'re a fitness enthusiast, a busy professional, or always connected, this smartwatch delivers exceptional value with its premium features.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>Why Faster NERV WATCH 1 Stands Out</h2>\r\n  <p>In a digital world, the <strong>Faster NERV WATCH 1</strong> redefines what a smartwatch can do. Its ergonomic design, featuring an <strong>anti-static silicone strap</strong> and <strong>IP67 waterproof rating</strong>, ensures durability and comfort. The <strong>1.83-inch Full HD TFT display</strong> with a <strong>240 x 284 dpi resolution</strong> offers vibrant, clear visuals for notifications and fitness stats, keeping you engaged without screen clutter.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>Stay Connected with Ease</h2>\r\n  <p>The <strong>Faster NERV WATCH 1</strong> keeps you connected without reaching for your phone. With <strong>Bluetooth calling</strong>, you can make and receive calls directly from your wrist—ideal for hands-free convenience during commutes or meetings. Compatible with <strong>Android and iOS</strong>, it syncs seamlessly via the <strong>Da Fit app</strong>. Get real-time notifications for calls, messages, and apps, and control music or check your schedule effortlessly.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>Health and Fitness Tracking</h2>\r\n  <p>Take control of your wellness with advanced health monitoring. The <strong>heart rate monitor</strong> tracks your cardiovascular health in real time, while the <strong>sleep quality monitor</strong> analyzes patterns and offers tips for better rest. With <strong>step tracking</strong> and <strong>multiple sports modes</strong>, the NERV WATCH 1 supports activities like running, cycling, swimming, and yoga, acting like a personal trainer on your wri