>!</p>', '  <p><strong>Faster NERV WATCH 1</strong>: Sleek, stylish smartwatch for modern lifestyles.</p>\r\n  <p><strong>Price</strong>: Rs. 7,499/-, the best deal in Pakistan.</p>\r\n  <p><strong>Features</strong>: 1.83” Full HD TFT display, IP67 waterproof, heart rate & sleep tracking.</p>\r\n  <p><strong>Connectivity</strong>: Bluetooth calling, Android/iOS compatible.</p>\r\n  <p><strong>Battery</strong>: Long-lasting 230mAh for all-day use.</p>\r\n  <p><strong>Shop Now</strong>: Get the lowest price with free nationwide delivery.</p>', 1, 10, 13999, 7499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-07-30 13:43:11', '2025-07-30 13:50:56', '', NULL, 0),
(226, 'Faster NERV WATCH 2 PRO', 'nerv-watch-2-pro', 11, 76, '<h2>Faster NERV WATCH 2 PRO Price in Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>Need a smartwatch that blends cutting-edge features with sleek design? The <strong>Faster NERV WATCH 2 PRO</strong>, priced at just <strong>Rs. 10,199/-</strong>, is the ultimate choice for Pakistan’s dynamic lifestyles. Perfect for fitness trainers, tech enthusiasts, or anyone who values staying connected, this smartwatch offers unmatched practicality and elegance. Whether you’re managing a busy schedule in Karachi or exploring trails in Islamabad, the NERV WATCH 2 PRO is your ideal companion.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>A Fitness Tracker Redefined</h2>\r\n  <p>The <strong>Faster NERV WATCH 2 PRO</strong> sets a new standard for smartwatches. Its <strong>2.01-inch AMOLED display</strong> with a <strong>410 x 502 pixel resolution</strong> delivers vivid colors and sharp visuals, ensuring notifications, apps, and watch faces are crystal clear. Protected by <strong>2.5D hardened glass</strong>, the display resists scratches and minor impacts. The <strong>zinc alloy frame</strong> and <strong>PC back case</strong> provide an <strong>IP68 waterproof rating</strong>, blending style with durability. Comfortable for all-day wear, this smartwatch is ready for workouts, swimming, or any adventure.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>Stay Connected, Always</h2>\r\n  <p>With the <strong>Faster NERV WATCH 2 PRO</strong>, staying connected is effortless. Its <strong>Bluetooth calling</strong> feature lets you make and receive calls directly from your wrist, offering hands-free convenience during meetings or workouts. Compatible with <strong>iOS 9.0+ and Android 4.4+</strong>, it syncs seamlessly with your smartphone via the <strong>GloriFit app</strong>, available on Google Play or the App Store. Get instant notifications for messages, calls, and apps, and control music playback without touching your phone. From scheduling to communication, this smartwatch simplifies your day.</p>\r\n\r\n  <