(232, 'QUEST X - ANC + ENC EARBUDS', 'quest-x-anc-enc-earbuds', 13, 76, '<h2>QUEST X - ANC + ENC EARBUDS Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>Ready to upgrade your audio game? The <strong>Faster QUEST X ANC + ENC Earbuds</strong> are here to deliver premium sound at an unbeatable price of just <strong>3,499 PKR</strong>. Available exclusively at PhonesDukan.com, these earbuds are perfect for music lovers, commuters, and anyone who wants crystal-clear audio without breaking the bank. Whether you’re in Lahore, Karachi, or Islamabad, these earbuds are designed to fit your lifestyle, offering cutting-edge features that rival top brands like Apple AirPods or Samsung Galaxy Buds.</p>\r\n\r\n    <h3>Why Choose the Faster QUEST X ANC + ENC Earbuds?</h3>\r\n    <p>These earbuds are all about delivering a high-quality audio experience without the hefty price tag. With <strong>Active Noise Cancellation (ANC)</strong> and <strong>Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC)</strong>, the QUEST X ensures you hear every beat clearly, whether you’re in a noisy café or on a crowded bus. The <strong>10mm speaker size</strong> pumps out rich bass, crisp highs, and balanced mids, making every song, podcast, or call sound amazing. Available in sleek Blue, Black, or White, these earbuds look as good as they sound.</p>\r\n\r\n    <h3>Immersive Sound with ANC + ENC</h3>\r\n    <p>The <strong>Faster QUEST X ANC + ENC Earbuds</strong> take your listening experience to the next level. ANC blocks out ambient noise, letting you focus on your music or calls without distractions. ENC ensures your voice comes through loud and clear during calls, even in busy environments like markets or offices. Whether you’re chatting with friends or taking a work call, these earbuds make sure you’re heard perfectly. With a <strong>transmission range of over 10 meters</strong>, you can move freely without losing connection to your device.</p>\r\n\r\n    <h3>Long-Lasting Battery Life</h3>\r\n    <p>Say goodbye to constant rech