(235, 'Slick X - Earbuds', 'faster-slick-x-earbuds', 13, 76, '<h2>Slick X - Earbuds Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n<p>Ready for wireless audio that fits your lifestyle and budget? The <strong>Faster Slick X Earbuds</strong>, priced at just <strong>4,199 PKR</strong> on PhonesDukan.com, bring premium sound and modern features to your fingertips. Perfect for music lovers, commuters, or gym-goers in Karachi, Lahore, or Islamabad, these earbuds offer a sleek design, long-lasting battery, and cutting-edge tech. With a <strong>20-hour total playback time</strong> and <strong>Bluetooth 5.4</strong>, the Slick X earbuds compete with high-end brands like JBL or Sony at a fraction of the cost, making them a standout choice for 2025 in Pakistan.</p>\r\n\r\n    <h3>Why Choose Faster Slick X Earbuds?</h3>\r\n    <p>The <strong>Faster Slick X Earbuds</strong> are all about delivering high-quality audio in a compact package. Their <strong>10mm speaker size</strong> produces deep bass, clear vocals, and sharp highs, ensuring your music, podcasts, or calls sound amazing. The <strong>Digital LED Display</strong> on the charging case shows battery levels at a glance, adding a modern touch to your audio gear. Available in stylish Black or White, these earbuds are lightweight and comfortable, perfect for all-day wear. Plus, with <strong>IPX4 water resistance</strong>, they’re built to handle sweat or light rain, ideal for workouts or outdoor adventures in Pakistan.</p>\r\n\r\n    <h3>Impressive Battery Life and Connectivity</h3>\r\n    <p>Keep the music going with the Slick X earbuds’ <strong>6 hours of playback</strong> per charge, plus an additional <strong>14 hours</strong> from the charging case, giving you a total of <strong>20 hours of playback time</strong>. The included <strong>Type-C charging cable</strong> makes recharging quick and hassle-free, so you’re never left without your tunes. With <strong>Bluetooth 5.4</strong>, you get a stable, low-latency connection and a <strong>transmission range of over 10 meters</strong>, letting you move freely without audio dropouts. Compatible with Android, iOS, and Windows devices, these earbuds sync effortlessly with your smartphone, tablet, or laptop.</p>\r\n\r\n    <h3>Designed for Comfort and Durability</h3>\r\n    <p>The <strong>Faster Slick X Earbuds</strong> are crafted for life on the go. Their compact, in-ear design ensures a secure fit, even during intense workouts or long commutes. The <strong>IPX4 water-resistant</strong> rating protects against sweat and light splashes, making them perfect for gym sessions or rainy days in Rawalpindi or Peshawar. The included <strong>extra ear tips</strong> let you customize the fit for optimal comfort and sound isolation, ensuring you get the best audio experience. Whether you’re working, exercising, or relaxing, these earbuds are built to keep up.</p>\r\n\r\n    <h3>Perfect for Every Routine</h3>\r\n    <p>From busy professionals to fitness enthusiasts, the Slick X earbuds are versatile enough for any lifestyle. Their intuitive touch controls make it easy to manage music, calls, or voice assistants like Siri or Google Assistant with a tap. The <strong>Slick X earbuds features</strong> like the Digital LED Display and Bluetooth 5.4 enhance usability, while the high-quality audio ensures clear calls and immersive music. Whether you’re studying in a café, jogging in a park, or gaming at home, these earbuds deliver reliable performance tailored to your needs.</p>\r\n\r\n    <h3>Why Shop at PhonesDukan.com?</h3>\r\n    <p>At <strong>4,199 PKR</strong>, the <strong>Slick X earbuds price in Pakistan</strong> offers unmatched value compared to competitors like the Anker Soundcore Liberty 4 or JBL Tune Flex, which cost significantly more. These earbuds pack premium features into a budget-friendly package, making them one of the <strong>best earbuds in Pakistan</strong> for 2025. PhonesDukan.com ensures a seamless shopping experience with <strong>fast nationwide delivery</strong> and a <strong>7-day exchange policy</strong>, so you can <strong>buy Slick X earbuds</strong> with confidence from anywhere in Pakistan.</p>\r\n\r\n    <h3>What’s in the Box?</h3>\r\n    <ul>\r\n        <li>Faster Slick X Earbuds</li>\r\n        <li>Type-C charging cable</li>\r\n        <li>Extra ear tips</li>\r\n        <li>User manual</li>\r\n        <li>Warranty card</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <h3>Upgrade Your Audio Game</h3>\r\n    <p>The <strong>Faster Slick X Earbuds</strong> combine sleek design, bold sound, and long-lasting battery life for just <strong>4,199 PKR</strong>. Whether you’re after high-quality audio for music, calls, or gaming, these earbuds deliver. Visit PhonesDukan.com to grab the <strong>best Slick X earbuds price in Pakistan</strong> and enjoy premium wireless audio that fits your lifestyle and budget!</p>\r\n\r\n    <h3>Are the Faster Slick X Earbuds compatible with my device?</h3>\r\n    <p>Yes, they work seamlessly with Android, iOS, and Windows devices via Bluetooth 5.4.</p>\r\n\r\n    <h3>How long does the battery last?</h3>\r\n    <p>The earbuds provide 6 hours of playback, with an additional 14 hours from the charging case, totaling 20 hours.</p>\r\n\r\n    <h3>Are these earbuds water-resistant?</h3>\r\n    <p>Yes, they have an IPX4 rating, making them resistant to sweat and light splashes, ideal for workouts.</p>\r\n\r\n    <h3>Where can I buy Faster Slick X Earbuds in Pakistan?</h3>\r\n    <p>Shop at PhonesDukan.com for 4,199 PKR with fast delivery across Pakistan.</p>', '    <ul>\r\n        <li><strong>Faster Slick X Earbuds</strong>: Sleek earbuds with vibrant sound.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>Price</strong>: 4,199 PKR – top value in Pakistan.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>Features</strong>: 20-hour playback, Digital LED Display, Bluetooth 5.4.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>Design</strong>: Compact in Black or White, IPX4 water-resistant.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>Included</strong>: Type-C cable, extra ear tips, warranty card.</li>\r\n    </ul>', 1, 10, 5699, 4199, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-01 16:22:41', '2025-08-01 16:28:03', '', NULL, 0),
(236, 'ARC X ENC Over Ear Earbuds – 40 Hours Playback', 'faster-arc-x-enc-over-earbuds', 13, 76, '<h2>Faster ARC X ENC Over Ear Earbuds Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Let me introduce the <strong>ARC X ENC Over Ear Earbuds</strong> which work flawlessly for music, calls, and all other functions one might need. Their advanced features make ARC X earbuds and cutting-edge technology one of the most, if not the most, advanced earbuds in the market.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Long Battery Life</h3>\r\n<p>The earbuds have the ability to play music for <strong>40 hours straight</strong> on one single charge. Users can listen to music, podcasts, and attend calls without the need to worry about the battery throughout the day. Whether the user is commuting, working out, or relaxing at home, ARC X earbuds have comfort and performance all at once.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC)</h3>\r\n<p>Talking about features, <strong>ENC</strong> or <strong>Environmental Noise Cancellation technology</strong> helps in blocking out background noises for the user. The blockage of background noises works especially well for calls. When listening to music, the earbuds are capable of drowning out external background noises as well. Users can enjoy ARC X earbuds while sitting at a busy street or at a crowded cafe and enjoy a complete audio experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Comfortable Over-Ear Design</h3>\r\n<p>The comfort features on the earbuds aid in focusing on the music. The <strong>over-ear design</strong> is a perk as it fits the user both securely and comfortably. The earbuds are now free to enjoy music for hours without the need to tackle ear fatigue.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Transmission Range</h3>\r\n<p>Perhaps one of the most impressive characteristics of the ARC X ENC Over Ear Earbuds is their <strong>transmission range</strong> of over 10 meters, allowing users the freedom to move about a room or even outside without the risk of disconnection.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Convenient Charging</h3>\r\n<p>These earbuds have their limitations, of course. Like any Bluetooth device, they can only be worn for a limited time. Thankfully, these earbuds come with a <strong>Type-C cable</strong> that greatly reduces charging time, improving convenience. Moreover, earbuds have become far more prominent in today’s society, leading to their inclusion in standard packages alongside manuals and warranty cards that improve the overall purchase.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Color Options</h3>\r\n<p>Choose the color that suits you best from our selection of sleek and stylish earbuds in both <strong>Blue</strong> and <strong>White</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Price and Delivery</h3>\r\n<p>For only <strong>6,799 PKR</strong>, the earbuds come at a wonderful price, and with <strong>free delivery</strong> in Pakistan, one can stay sure that the transaction experience will be smooth.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Perfect for All Users</h3>\r\n<p>These stylish earbuds provide superb audio at a remarkable value to the consumer. They are great for any kind of user, be it a music lover, a traveler, or a person who is fond of long phone calls. Don’t wait long and buy these earbuds to dive into a world of audio bliss.</p>', '<ul>\r\n  <li>Up to <strong>40 hours of playback</strong> for extended use.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>ENC Technology</strong> for clearer calls and immersive sound.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Over-ear design</strong> provides enhanced comfort for long listening sessions.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Transmission range</strong> of over 10 meters, ensuring excellent connectivity.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Type-C charging cable</strong> for quick and efficient recharging.</li>\r\n  <li>Available in two stylish colors: <strong>Blue</strong> & <strong>White</strong>.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Price:</strong> 6,799 PKR with free shipping.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 10, 9999, 9999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-04 14:32:48', '2025-08-04 14:43:20', '', NULL, 0);
