(237, 'ROAR EARBUDS - ANC+ENC', 'roar-earbuds', 13, 76, '<h2>Roar Earbuds ANC+ENC Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n  <p>Step into a world of crystal-clear audio with the Roar Earbuds, designed to elevate your listening experience whether you\'re commuting, working out, or relaxing at home. Priced at just 3,499 PKR, these wireless earbuds combine cutting-edge technology with sleek design, offering premium features at a budget-friendly price. With Active Noise Cancellation (ANC) and Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC), these earbuds ensure you hear only what matters—your music, podcasts, or calls—without distractions from the world around you.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>Unmatched Sound Quality and Noise Cancellation</h2>\r\n  <p>The Roar Earbuds are built with 10mm dynamic drivers, delivering rich bass, crisp highs, and balanced mids for an immersive audio experience. Whether you\'re vibing to your favorite playlist or catching up on a podcast, the sound quality remains exceptional across genres. The ANC technology blocks out low-frequency noises like traffic or airplane hums, while ENC ensures your voice comes through clearly during calls, even in noisy environments. Perfect for professionals, students, or anyone on the go, these earbuds let you focus on what you love.</p>\r\n\r\n  <p>Unlike other earbuds in this price range, the Roar Earbuds use advanced Bluetooth 5.3 for a stable, lag-free connection up to 10 meters. Pair them with your phone, laptop, or tablet, and enjoy seamless switching without interruptions. The supported Bluetooth profiles (A2DP, HFP, AVRCP) guarantee compatibility with a wide range of devices, making these earbuds a versatile choice for any tech-savvy user.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>All-Day Battery Life and Fast Charging</h2>\r\n  <p>Never worry about running out of juice. The Roar Earbuds offer up to 7 hours of playback on a single charge at 60% volume, with the charging case extending that to a whopping 35 hours. Whether you\'re on a long commute or an all-day study session, these earbuds keep up with your lifestyle. The Type-C charging cable ensures a full charge in just 1.5 hours, so you can get back to your music or calls in no time. Plus, the compact case is easy to carry, fitting snugly in your pocket or bag.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>Designed for Comfort and Style</h2>\r\n  <p>Available in three sleek colors—Green, Grey, and Black—the Roar Earbuds are as stylish as they are functional. The ergonomic design ensures a secure fit, whether you\'re hitting the gym or relaxing at home. With an IPX4 rating, these earbuds are sweat- and splash-resistant, making them ideal for workouts or outdoor adventures. The package includes extra ear tips in multiple sizes, so you can find the perfect fit for all-day comfort.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>What\'s in the Box?</h2>\r\n  <p>When you buy the Roar Earbuds for 3,499 PKR, you get more than just earbuds. The package includes a user manual, a warranty card, extra ear tips for a customized fit, and a Type-C charging cable. Everything you need to start enjoying premium audio is right there, making this a hassle-free purchase with incredible value.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>Why Choose Roar Earbuds?</h2>\r\n  <p>At 3,499 PKR, the Roar Earbuds offer features that rival premium brands without breaking the bank. The combination of ANC and ENC ensures an uninterrupted listening experience, while the long battery life and fast charging keep you powered up all day. Whether you\'re a music lover, a gamer, or someone who needs clear calls for work, these earbuds deliver on every front. The sleek design, reliable Bluetooth 5.3, and thoughtful extras like extra ear tips make the Roar Earbuds a standout choice in Pakistan’s wireless earbud market.</p>\r\n\r\n  <p>Ready to upgrade your audio game? Order your Roar Earbuds today for just 3,499 PKR and enjoy fast delivery across Pakistan. Experience the perfect blend of affordability, performance, and style with every beat.</p>', '  <ul>\r\n    <li>Active Noise Cancellation (ANC) + Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC) for immersive sound</li>\r\n    <li>Bluetooth 5.3 with 10m+ range for seamless connectivity</li>\r\n    <li>7-hour playback per charge, 35-hour case for all-day use</li>\r\n    <li>Fast 1.5-hour Type-C charging, ergonomic design in Green, Grey, Black</li>\r\n    <li>Price: 3,499 PKR - includes extra ear tips, warranty, manual</li>\r\n  </ul>', 1, 10, 5499, 3499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-04 15:52:38', '2025-08-04 15:59:37', '', NULL, 0),
(238, 'FUSION - X HYBRID ANC + 6 Mic ENC Earbuds', 'fusion-x-earbuds', 13, 76, '  <h2>Fusion X Earbuds Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n  <p>Immerse yourself in a world of pristine sound with the Fusion X Earbuds, your go-to choice for high-quality audio at an unbeatable price of 5,999 PKR. These earbuds combine advanced technology with a sleek, user-friendly design, making them perfect for music lovers, gamers, and professionals alike. Featuring Hybrid Active Noise Cancellation (ANC) and 6-Mic Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC), the Fusion X Earbuds deliver an exceptional listening experience by blocking out distractions and ensuring clear calls, even in noisy environments.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>Top-Tier Noise Cancellation and Audio Quality</h2>\r\n  <p>The Fusion X Earbuds are equipped with 10mm dynamic drivers, delivering deep bass, clear mids, and sharp highs for a balanced, immersive sound. Whether you\'re listening to your favorite tracks, streaming a podcast, or diving into a gaming session, these earbuds provide rich audio that rivals premium brands. The Hybrid ANC technology effectively reduces background noise, such as traffic or chatter, creating a focused listening environment. Meanwhile, the 6-Mic ENC system ensures your voice is heard clearly during calls, filtering out ambient sounds for professional-grade call quality. This makes the Fusion X Earbuds ideal for work-from-home setups, busy commutes, or workouts.</p>\r\n\r\n  <p>With Bluetooth 5.4, you get a stable, low-latency connection that works flawlessly up to 10 meters. Pair these earbuds with your smartphone, tablet, or laptop, and enjoy uninterrupted audio for music, videos, or gaming. The advanced Bluetooth profiles ensure compatibility with a wide range of devices, making the Fusion X Earbuds a versatile addition to your tech collection.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>Long-Lasting Battery and Quick Charging</h2>\r\n  <p>Keep the music playing all day with the Fusion X Earbuds’ impressive battery life. A single charge provides up to 7 hours of playback, while the charging case extends that to 35 hours, perfect for long trips, workdays, or marathon gaming sessions. The earbuds charge fully in just 1 hour, and the case takes about 1.5 hours via the included Type-C cable. This fast-charging feature means less downtime and more time enjoying your audio. The compact, feather-light case slips easily into your pocket, ensuring portability without sacrificing power.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>Sleek Design and All-Day Comfort</h2>\r\n  <p>Available in stylish Black and White color variants, the Fusion X Earbuds are designed to look as good as they sound. Their sleek, shiny finish and ergonomic shape provide a comfortable fit for extended wear, whether you\'re at the gym, on a call, or relaxing at home. With an IPX4 rating, these earbuds are sweat- and splash-resistant, making them a great companion for workouts or outdoor activities. The package includes extra ear tips for a personalized fit, ensuring comfort and noise isolation for every user.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>What’s Included?</h2>\r\n  <p>For just 5,999 PKR, the Fusion X Earbuds come with everything you need to get started: a user manual, a warranty card, extra ear tips, and a Type-C charging cable. This all-in-one package offers incredible value, making these earbuds a smart choice for anyone seeking premium features at an affordable price.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>Why Choose Fusion X Earbuds?</h2>\r\n  <p>At 5,999 PKR, the Fusion X Earbuds stand out in Pakistan’s wireless earbud market by offering high-end features without the premium price tag. The combination of Hybrid ANC and 6-Mic ENC ensures you enjoy distraction-free audio and clear calls, while the 35-hour battery life keeps you powered up for days. Bluetooth 5.4 provides a reliable connection, and the sleek design adds a touch of style to your everyday routine. Whether you\'re a student, professional, or fitness enthusiast, these earbuds are built to enhance your audio experience.</p>\r\n\r\n  <p>Don’t settle for less—grab your Fusion X Earbuds today for 5,999 PKR and enjoy fast, reliable delivery across Pakistan. Experience premium sound, advanced noise cancellation, and unbeatable value with every use.</p>', '  <ul>\r\n    <li>Hybrid ANC + 6-Mic ENC for crystal-clear audio and calls</li>\r\n    <li>Bluetooth 5.4 with 10m range for seamless connectivity</li>\r\n    <li>Up to 35 hours of playback with charging case</li>\r\n    <li>Fast 1-hour charge, sleek Black or White design</li>\r\n    <li>Price: 5,999 PKR - includes warranty, Type-C cable</li>\r\n  </ul>', 1, 10, 8999, 5999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-04 16:11:33', '2025-08-04 16:32:34', '', NULL, 0),
(239, 'Cruze Pro Earbuds ANC + ENC', 'cruze-pro-anc-enc-earbuds', 13, 76, '  <h1>Cruze Pro Earbuds Price In Pakistan</h1>\r\n  <p>Get ready to elevate your audio experience with the Cruze Pro Earbuds, priced at an affordable 4,999 PKR. These wireless earbuds are packed with advanced features like Active Noise Cancellation (ANC) and Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC), making them perfect for music lovers, commuters, and professionals in Pakistan. Whether you\'re in Karachi, Lahore, Islamabad, or anywhere else, enjoy premium sound quality and fast delivery right to your doorstep. With a sleek design and long-lasting battery, the Cruze Pro Earbuds are your ideal companion for work, workouts, or relaxation.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>Immersive Sound with Advanced Noise Cancellation</h2>\r\n  <p>The Cruze Pro Earbuds feature 13mm dynamic drivers, delivering powerful bass, clear mids, and crisp highs for an outstanding listening experience. Whether you\'re enjoying music, podcasts, or movies, these earbuds bring every sound to life. The ANC technology blocks out background noise like traffic or office chatter, letting you focus on what matters. Meanwhile, the ENC ensures crystal-clear calls by filtering out ambient sounds, making these earbuds a great choice for virtual meetings or catching up with friends. No matter where you are, the Cruze Pro Earbuds keep your audio pure and uninterrupted.</p>\r\n\r\n  <p>Equipped with Bluetooth 5.3, these earbuds offer a stable connection up to 10 meters, so you can move freely without worrying about dropouts. The supported Bluetooth profiles (A2DP, HSP, HFP, AVRCP) ensure compatibility with a wide range of devices, from smartphones to laptops. Whether you\'re streaming music or gaming, the Cruze Pro Earbuds provide seamless, lag-free performance that keeps you connected.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>Long Battery Life and Quick Charging</h2>\r\n  <p>Stay powered up all day with the Cruze Pro Earbuds. A single charge gives you up to 5 hours of playback at 60% volume, while the 300mAh charging case extends that to a total of 25 hours. Whether you\'re on a long commute, studying, or working out, these earbuds have the endurance to keep up. The Type-C charging cable fully charges the earbuds in just 1.5 hours, and the compact case is easy to carry, fitting perfectly in your pocket or bag. Never miss a beat with this reliable, long-lasting battery performance.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>Stylish Design and Comfortable Fit</h2>\r\n  <p>Available in three vibrant colors—Blue, Coffee, and Pink—the Cruze Pro Earbuds combine style with functionality. Their ergonomic design ensures a snug, comfortable fit, even during extended use. With an IPX4 rating, these earbuds are sweat- and splash-resistant, making them ideal for workouts, runs, or outdoor adventures. The package includes extra ear tips in multiple sizes, so you can customize the fit for maximum comfort and noise isolation. Whether you\'re hitting the gym or relaxing at home, these earbuds are designed to stay in place and look good doing it.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>What’s in the Box?</h2>\r\n  <p>For just 4,999 PKR, the Cruze Pro Earbuds come with everything you need: a user manual, a warranty card, extra ear tips, and a Type-C charging cable. This complete package ensures you’re ready to enjoy premium audio from the moment you unbox them. With fast delivery across Pakistan, getting your hands on these earbuds is quick and hassle-free.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2>Why Choose Cruze Pro Earbuds?</h2>\r\n  <p>Priced at 4,999 PKR, the Cruze Pro Earbuds offer unbeatable value in Pakistan’s wireless earbud market. With ANC and ENC, you get distraction-free audio and clear calls, while the 25-hour total battery life keeps you going all day. Bluetooth 5.3 ensures a reliable connection, and the stylish design in three unique colors adds a touch of personality. Perfect for students, professionals, or fitness enthusiasts, these earbuds deliver premium features at a budget-friendly price. Order your Cruze Pro Earbuds today and experience high-quality audio with fast, reliable delivery anywhere in Pakistan.</p>', '  <ul>\r\n    <li>Active Noise Cancellation (ANC) + ENC for clear audio and calls</li>\r\n    <li>Bluetooth 5.3 with 10m+ range for reliable connectivity</li>\r\n    <li>5-hour playback, 25 hours total with charging case</li>\r\n    <li>1.5-hour Type-C charge, available in Blue, Coffee, Pink</li>\r\n    <li>Price: 4,999 PKR - includes extra ear tips, warranty</li>\r\n  </ul>', 1, 10, 6000, 4999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-04 16:41:22', '2025-08-04 16:44:50', '', NULL, 0),
(240, 'FASTER RGBP1 – ENC EARBUDS', 'faster-rgbp-1-earbuds', 13, 76, '  <h2>Faster RGBP1 Bluetooth Earbuds Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n  <p>Step up your audio game with the Faster RGBP1 Bluetooth earbuds, designed to deliver high-quality sound and unbeatable comfort at an affordable price of just 5,899 PKR. These wireless earphones are packed with cutting-edge features, making them the perfect choice for music lovers, gamers, and fitness enthusiasts across Pakistan. Whether you\'re hitting the gym, commuting, or just relaxing at home, the RGBP1 earbuds offer a blend of style, performance, and value that’s hard to beat.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Crystal-Clear Audio with Active Noise Cancellation</h3>\r\n  <p>The Faster RGBP1 earbuds feature advanced active noise cancellation (ANC) to block out distractions, letting you focus on your music or calls. Powered by a 13mm bass driver, these earphones deliver deep, rich bass and crisp highs, creating a balanced sound profile that suits everything from pop to podcasts. Whether you\'re in a noisy café or a crowded bus, the ANC ensures you hear every note clearly, making these Bluetooth earbuds a must-have for immersive listening.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Bluetooth 5.3 for Seamless Connectivity</h3>\r\n  <p>Equipped with the latest Bluetooth 5.3 technology, the RGBP1 earbuds provide a stable, low-latency connection for uninterrupted audio. This dual-ear synchronous transmission chip boosts connection speed, ensuring smooth performance during gaming, video streaming, or calls. No more lag or dropouts—just reliable, high-quality sound wherever you are. Pair these wireless earphones with your smartphone, tablet, or laptop for a hassle-free experience.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Designed for Comfort and Durability</h3>\r\n  <p>The Faster RGBP1 Bluetooth earbuds are crafted with an ergonomic open-ear design that sits comfortably at a 45-degree angle, avoiding pressure on your ear canal. Weighing next to nothing, these earbuds come with a compact charging case that slips easily into your pocket. With an IPX4 water resistance rating, they’re built to withstand sweat and light splashes, making them ideal for workouts, runs, or outdoor adventures. Whether you\'re lifting weights or jogging in the park, these earbuds stay secure and comfortable.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Long-Lasting Battery for All-Day Use</h3>\r\n  <p>Never worry about running out of power with the Faster RGBP1’s impressive battery life. Enjoy up to 6 hours of playtime on a single charge, with the portable charging case extending total playback to 40 hours. Need a quick boost? A 15-minute instant charge gives you enough juice for hours of listening, while a full charge takes just 1 hour via the Type-C port. With 50 hours of standby time, these earbuds are ready whenever you are.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Perfect for Every Lifestyle</h3>\r\n  <p>From students to professionals, the Faster RGBP1 Bluetooth earbuds cater to everyone. Their sleek design and powerful features make them a great fit for music, gaming, or hands-free calls. The compact case is perfect for travel, and the IPX4 rating ensures they can keep up with your active lifestyle. Plus, with fast delivery across Pakistan in just 1-3 working days and a 7-day exchange or replacement policy, shopping for these wireless earphones is risk-free and convenient.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Why Choose Faster RGBP1 Bluetooth Earbuds?</h3>\r\n  <p>At 5,899 PKR, the Faster RGBP1 offers premium features without breaking the bank. Compared to pricier competitors, these earbuds deliver exceptional value with ANC, Bluetooth 5.3, and a long-lasting battery. The 13mm bass driver ensures rich, dynamic sound, while the lightweight, water-resistant design makes them versatile for any activity. Whether you’re a fitness buff or just want reliable wireless earphones for daily use, the RGBP1 has you covered.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Shop Now for Unmatched Audio Value</h3>\r\n  <p>Ready to upgrade your audio experience? The Faster RGBP1 Bluetooth earbuds combine style, performance, and affordability in one sleek package. Order today to enjoy fast 1-3 day delivery across Pakistan, a 7-day exchange policy, and a 24-hour refund window for any complaints. Get your hands on these noise-cancelling, IPX4 water-resistant earbuds for only 5,899 PKR and enjoy premium sound on a budget.</p>', '  <ul>\r\n    <li>Bluetooth 5.3 for seamless, low-latency audio</li>\r\n    <li>Active noise cancellation for immersive sound</li>\r\n    <li>IPX4 water resistance, perfect for workouts</li>\r\n    <li>6-hour playtime with 40-hour charging case</li>\r\n    <li>Ergonomic open-ear design for all-day comfort</li>\r\n    <li>Fast delivery in 1-3 days, 7-day exchange</li>\r\n  </ul>', 1, 10, 9999, 5899, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-05 13:59:30', '2025-08-05 14:42:04', '', NULL, 0),
(241, 'FASTER TG-340 SPORTS NECKBAND ENC+ANC', 'faster-tg-340-sports-neckband-enc-anc', 13, 76, '  <h2>Faster TG-340 Sports Neckband Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n  <p>Looking for a reliable, high-quality audio solution that fits your active lifestyle? The Faster TG-340 Sports Neckband, priced at just 5,499 PKR, delivers exceptional sound, comfort, and durability. Designed for music lovers, fitness enthusiasts, and professionals in Pakistan, these wireless Bluetooth earphones combine advanced features with affordability. With active noise cancellation (ANC), environmental noise cancellation (ENC), and a sleek magnetic neckband design, the TG-340 is your go-to choice for immersive audio on the go.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Superior Sound Quality with 13mm Drivers</h3>\r\n  <p>The Faster TG-340 Sports Neckband is engineered to deliver outstanding stereo sound. Its 13mm drivers produce deep, pulsating bass and crisp highs, ensuring your music, podcasts, or calls sound rich and clear across all genres. Whether you\'re into upbeat pop, soothing classical, or bass-heavy hip-hop, these Bluetooth earphones bring every note to life. The ANC and ENC features work together to block out background noise, making these neckband earphones perfect for noisy environments like gyms, offices, or busy streets. Enjoy crystal-clear calls and music without distractions.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Bluetooth 5.4 for Seamless Performance</h3>\r\n  <p>Powered by the latest Bluetooth 5.4 technology, the TG-340 ensures a fast, stable connection with minimal latency. Whether you\'re streaming videos, gaming, or taking calls, these wireless earphones keep audio in sync with no lag. The 10-meter transmission range lets you move freely without losing connection, making them ideal for workouts or multitasking. Pair the TG-340 with your smartphone, laptop, or tablet for a smooth, hassle-free experience every time.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Comfort and Durability for Active Lifestyles</h3>\r\n  <p>The Faster TG-340 Sports Neckband is built for comfort and durability. Its ergonomic magnetic neckband design rests lightly around your neck, with noise-isolating ear tips that provide a secure, comfortable fit. Weighing just 37g, these earphones are perfect for long wear during workouts, commutes, or work-from-home sessions. With an IPX4 water resistance rating, the TG-340 can handle sweat and light splashes, making it a great companion for running, cycling, or gym sessions. The magnetic earbuds snap together when not in use, preventing tangles and adding convenience.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Impressive Battery Life and Fast Charging</h3>\r\n  <p>Stay powered up with the Faster TG-340’s remarkable battery performance. Enjoy up to 25 hours of playtime on a single charge, with a 300-hour standby time to keep you ready for action. The Type-C fast charging feature means a quick 10-minute charge delivers up to 15 hours of playback—perfect for those on-the-go moments. A full charge takes just 1 hour, so you spend less time waiting and more time enjoying your music or calls. The 300mAh battery ensures long-lasting performance for daily use.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Why the Faster TG-340 Stands Out</h3>\r\n  <p>Priced at 5,499 PKR, the Faster TG-340 Sports Neckband offers premium features at a budget-friendly price. The combination of ANC and ENC ensures a distraction-free experience, while the 13mm drivers deliver high-quality sound. The IPX4 rating and lightweight design make these earphones ideal for active users, and the long battery life keeps you connected all day. Compared to pricier alternatives, the TG-340 provides exceptional value without compromising on performance. Whether you\'re a student, professional, or fitness buff, these neckband earphones fit seamlessly into your lifestyle.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Shop with Confidence</h3>\r\n  <p>Order the Faster TG-340 Sports Neckband today and enjoy fast delivery across Pakistan in just 1-3 working days. We offer a 7-day exchange policy for added peace of mind, and any complaints lodged within 24 hours are eligible for a refund. These wireless Bluetooth earphones are designed to deliver reliable performance, comfort, and style at an unbeatable price. Don’t settle for less—grab the TG-340 now and experience audio the way it’s meant to be.</p>', '  <ul>\r\n    <li>Bluetooth 5.4 for stable, low-latency audio</li>\r\n    <li>ANC & ENC for noise-free calls and music</li>\r\n    <li>25-hour playtime with fast Type-C charging</li>\r\n    <li>13mm drivers for deep bass and clear sound</li>\r\n    <li>IPX4 water resistance for workouts</li>\r\n    <li>Comfortable magnetic neckband design</li>\r\n    <li>Fast delivery in 1-3 days, 7-day exchange</li>\r\n  </ul>', 1, 10, 7999, 5499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-05 14:52:00', '2025-08-05 14:57:59', '', NULL, 0),
(242, 'FASTER Z5 SoundBar Wireless Speaker Born for Music', 'z5-soundbar-wireless-speaker', 4, 76, '  <h2>Faster Z5 SoundBar Wireless Speaker Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n  <p>Transform your audio experience with the Faster Z5 SoundBar Wireless Speaker, priced at an affordable 4,229 PKR. Perfect for music enthusiasts, movie buffs, and anyone who loves quality sound, this Bluetooth soundbar delivers impressive performance in a compact, stylish package. Whether you’re chilling at home, hosting a gathering, or taking the party outdoors, the Faster Z5 offers powerful audio, versatile connectivity, and long-lasting battery life. It’s the ideal portable speaker for Pakistanis who want premium sound without the premium price tag.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Rich, Room-Filling Sound</h3>\r\n  <p>The Faster Z5 Wireless Speaker packs a punch with its dual 6W speakers, delivering a total of 12W output. The 5W*2 external magnetic horn and a signal-to-noise ratio above 80dB ensure deep bass, crisp highs, and balanced audio for all your favorite tracks. Whether you’re streaming a playlist, watching a movie, or gaming, this Bluetooth soundbar creates an immersive experience that rivals pricier models. Its sound quality has earned praise for filling rooms with vibrant, clear audio, making it a top pick for any occasion.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Bluetooth 5.0 for Effortless Connectivity</h3>\r\n  <p>Stay connected with the Faster Z5’s Bluetooth 5.0 technology, offering a reliable 10-meter range for seamless streaming. Pair it with your smartphone, tablet, or laptop and enjoy lag-free audio for music, videos, or calls. The stable connection means no interruptions, whether you’re moving around the house or setting up for an event. Beyond Bluetooth, this portable speaker supports TF/SD cards, AUX, USB, and FM radio, giving you multiple ways to play your media. It’s versatility at its best.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Long Battery Life for All-Day Enjoyment</h3>\r\n  <p>With a 1500mAh battery, the Faster Z5 Wireless Speaker keeps the music going for 4-5 hours on a single charge, perfect for movie marathons or long playlists. Charging is a breeze with the DC 5V input via USB, getting you back to full power in no time. Whether you’re using it at home or on the go, this Bluetooth soundbar ensures you won’t be tethered to a power outlet. Plus, its 1-year warranty adds confidence to your purchase.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Compact and Stylish Design</h3>\r\n  <p>Measuring 420 x 60.5 x 61mm and weighing just 800g, the Faster Z5 SoundBar is easy to carry and fits anywhere. Its modern metal mesh and plastic build not only looks sleek but also feels sturdy, making it a great match for any setting—be it your living room, bedroom, or a friend’s place. The lightweight design makes this portable speaker perfect for travel or outdoor use, delivering big sound in a small package.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Versatile Features for Every Lifestyle</h3>\r\n  <p>The Faster Z5 isn’t just a wireless speaker—it’s a multi-functional audio hub. With support for TF/SD cards, AUX, USB, and FM radio, you can enjoy music from nearly any source. Tune into FM for live radio, plug in via AUX for a movie night, or use a USB drive for your favorite tracks. This versatility makes the Z5 a great choice for students, professionals, or anyone who wants a reliable, all-in-one audio solution at an unbeatable price.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Why the Faster Z5 Stands Out</h3>\r\n  <p>For just 4,229 PKR, the Faster Z5 SoundBar Wireless Speaker offers features that compete with higher-end models. Its 12W output, Bluetooth 5.0, and multiple input options deliver exceptional value. The compact, durable design and long battery life make it perfect for both home and on-the-go use. Whether you’re a casual listener or an audio enthusiast, this portable speaker fits your needs while keeping your budget intact. Fast delivery in 1-3 days across Pakistan and a 7-day exchange policy make your purchase worry-free.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Grab Your Faster Z5 Today</h3>\r\n  <p>Ready to level up your audio game? The Faster Z5 SoundBar Wireless Speaker offers premium sound, sleek design, and incredible value at 4,229 PKR. Perfect for music, movies, and more, this Bluetooth soundbar is a must-have. Order now for fast 1-3 day delivery across Pakistan, a 7-day exchange policy, and a 24-hour refund window for any issues. Get the Faster Z5 and enjoy high-quality audio that fits your lifestyle and budget!</p>', '  <ul>\r\n    <li>Bluetooth 5.0 for seamless 10m wireless range</li>\r\n    <li>12W dual speakers for rich, immersive sound</li>\r\n    <li>1500mAh battery with 4-5 hours playtime</li>\r\n    <li>Supports TF/SD card, AUX, USB, and FM radio</li>\r\n    <li>Compact, stylish metal mesh design</li>\r\n    <li>Fast delivery in 1-3 days, 7-day exchange</li>\r\n  </ul>', 1, 10, 5199, 4229, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-05 15:46:00', '2025-08-06 12:56:07', '', NULL, 0),
(243, 'FASTER Z10 SoundBar Wireless Speaker 20w', 'faster-z10-soundbar-wireless-speaker-20w', 4, 76, '  <h2>FASTER Z10 SoundBar Wireless Speaker 20W Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n  <p>Transform your home entertainment with the FASTER Z10 SoundBar Wireless Speaker, designed to deliver powerful 20W audio that fills your space with clear highs and deep bass. Priced at just 6,299 PKR, this sleek soundbar combines modern design with cutting-edge features, making it the perfect addition to your living room, bedroom, or gaming setup. Whether you\'re streaming music, watching movies, or hosting a party, the Z10 ensures every sound is vibrant and immersive.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Impressive Audio Performance</h3>\r\n  <p>The FASTER Z10 SoundBar boasts dual 10W speakers, delivering a total output of 20W for rich, dynamic sound. With a frequency range of 87.5Hz to 20kHz and a signal-to-noise ratio of over 90dB, this wireless speaker produces crystal-clear audio with minimal distortion. Whether it\'s the subtle notes of your favorite song or the booming effects of an action movie, the Z10 brings every moment to life. Its compact size (460 x 77.7 x 74.5 mm) and lightweight 800g build make it easy to place anywhere without compromising on sound quality.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Seamless Wireless Connectivity</h3>\r\n  <p>With Bluetooth V5.0+EDR, the FASTER Z10 SoundBar offers a reliable 10-meter transmission range, letting you stream music or podcasts from your smartphone, tablet, or TV without cables. The advanced Bluetooth technology ensures stable, high-quality audio streaming, so you can move freely while enjoying your tunes. Plus, the Z10 supports TWS (True Wireless Stereo), allowing you to connect two speakers to your device simultaneously for an even more immersive stereo experience.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Versatile Features for Every Need</h3>\r\n  <p>This soundbar is packed with features to enhance your audio experience. Enjoy multiple connectivity options like USB, TF card, FM radio, and AUX-IN, making it compatible with a wide range of devices. The built-in hands-free call function lets you take calls directly through the speaker, perfect for multitasking. The Z10 also features vibrant LED lights that add a stylish touch to your setup, creating a lively atmosphere for parties or cozy movie nights.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Long-Lasting Battery and Sleek Design</h3>\r\n  <p>Equipped with a 3600mAh battery, the FASTER Z10 SoundBar provides 4-5 hours of continuous playback, so your entertainment never stops. Recharging is simple with a DC 5V/1A input, keeping you ready for your next session. The soundbar’s premium metal mesh and plastic construction not only ensures durability but also adds a modern, sophisticated look to any space. Its patented private design stands out, blending style and functionality effortlessly.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Shop with Confidence</h3>\r\n  <p>At just 6,299 PKR, the FASTER Z10 SoundBar offers unbeatable value for a high-quality wireless speaker. We provide fast delivery within 1-3 working days and a hassle-free 7-day exchange or replacement policy. Have an issue? Contact us within 24 hours for a refund or resolution. This soundbar comes with a 1-year official warranty, ensuring peace of mind with every purchase.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Why Choose the FASTER Z10 SoundBar?</h3>\r\n  <p>The FASTER Z10 SoundBar Wireless Speaker 20W is more than just a speaker—it’s a gateway to better audio experiences. Its powerful sound, versatile connectivity, and sleek design make it ideal for music lovers, movie buffs, and gamers alike. Whether you\'re upgrading your TV audio or creating a party vibe, the Z10 delivers exceptional performance at an affordable price. Don’t settle for flat TV speakers or bulky systems; get the FASTER Z10 SoundBar today and enjoy audio that moves you.</p>', '  <ul>\r\n    <li>Powerful 20W dual speakers for crisp, room-filling sound</li>\r\n    <li>Bluetooth V5.0+EDR for seamless wireless streaming</li>\r\n    <li>4-5 hours of playtime with a 3600mAh battery</li>\r\n    <li>Sleek metal mesh design with vibrant LED lights</li>\r\n    <li>Versatile USB/TF/FM/AUX-IN and hands-free call support</li>\r\n    <li>Fast delivery in 1-3 days, easy 7-day exchange</li>\r\n  </ul>', 1, 10, 7499, 6299, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-05 17:22:26', '2025-08-06 12:55:57', '', NULL, 0),
(244, 'FASTER Z10 PRO SOUNDBAR WIRELESS SPEAKER 20W', 'faster-z10-pro-soundbar-wireless-speaker-20w', 4, 76, '  <h2>FASTER Z10 PRO SoundBar Wireless Speaker 20W Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n  <p>Bring your entertainment to life with the FASTER Z10 PRO SoundBar Wireless Speaker 20W, available at an unbeatable price of 5,599 PKR. This powerful soundbar delivers immersive 20W audio, blending crisp highs and deep bass to enhance your music, movies, and gaming experiences. Whether you\'re setting up for a cozy movie night or hosting a lively gathering, the Z10 PRO is your go-to for high-quality sound in a sleek, modern package. Its versatile features and affordable price make it a must-have for any audio enthusiast in Pakistan.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Powerful Sound That Fills the Room</h3>\r\n  <p>The FASTER Z10 PRO SoundBar is engineered for exceptional audio performance, boasting a 20W output through dual 10W speakers. With a frequency range of 87.5Hz to 20kHz and a signal-to-noise ratio exceeding 90dB, it delivers clear, distortion-free sound that captures every detail. From the subtle strum of a guitar to the explosive effects of an action blockbuster, this wireless speaker ensures a rich, immersive experience. Its compact design makes it perfect for any space, whether placed under your TV or on a shelf.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Seamless Connectivity for Ultimate Convenience</h3>\r\n  <p>Equipped with Bluetooth V5.1+EDR, the Z10 PRO offers a reliable 10-meter wireless range, letting you stream music or podcasts from your smartphone, tablet, or TV without the hassle of cables. The advanced Bluetooth technology ensures stable, high-quality audio, so you can move freely while enjoying your favorite tracks. The soundbar also supports True Wireless Stereo (TWS), allowing you to pair two speakers for a true stereo experience, perfect for larger rooms or outdoor gatherings.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Versatile Features for Every Occasion</h3>\r\n  <p>The FASTER Z10 PRO is packed with features to suit your lifestyle. It supports multiple input options, including USB, TF card, FM radio, and AUX-IN, making it compatible with a wide range of devices. The built-in microphone enables hands-free calling, so you can take calls without interrupting your music. With an IPX5 waterproof rating, this soundbar is durable enough for outdoor use, whether you\'re at a picnic or a poolside party. Plus, the vibrant LED lights add a stylish flair, enhancing the ambiance of any setting.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Long-Lasting Battery and Durable Design</h3>\r\n  <p>Powered by a 3600mAh battery, the Z10 PRO provides 4-5 hours of continuous playback, ensuring your entertainment keeps going. Recharging is quick and easy with a DC 5V/1A input, so you’re always ready for the next session. Crafted with a premium metal mesh and plastic build, this soundbar combines durability with a sleek, modern aesthetic that complements any decor. Its lightweight 800g design makes it easy to move and position wherever you need it.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Hassle-Free Shopping Experience</h3>\r\n  <p>Priced at just 5,599 PKR, the FASTER Z10 PRO SoundBar Wireless Speaker offers incredible value for a feature-packed audio solution. We ensure fast delivery across Pakistan within 1-3 working days, so you can start enjoying your new soundbar in no time. Our 7-day exchange or replacement policy and 24-hour complaint resolution guarantee peace of mind. Plus, the Z10 PRO comes with a 1-year official warranty, making it a reliable choice for your audio needs.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Why Choose the FASTER Z10 PRO?</h3>\r\n  <p>The FASTER Z10 PRO SoundBar Wireless Speaker 20W stands out for its powerful audio, versatile connectivity, and durable, stylish design. It’s perfect for anyone looking to upgrade their home entertainment or enjoy music on the go. With its affordable price and robust feature set, this soundbar offers unmatched value in Pakistan’s audio market. Don’t settle for mediocre sound—grab the FASTER Z10 PRO today and transform the way you listen.</p>', '  <ul>\r\n    <li>Rich 20W audio with deep bass and clear highs</li>\r\n    <li>Bluetooth V5.1 for seamless 10m wireless range</li>\r\n    <li>3600mAh battery for 4-5 hours of playback</li>\r\n    <li>IPX5 waterproof design for versatile use</li>\r\n    <li>Supports USB, TF card, FM, AUX-IN, and TWS</li>\r\n    <li>Fast delivery in 1-3 days, 7-day exchange policy</li>\r\n  </ul>', 1, 10, 8000, 5599, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-06 13:07:20', '2025-08-06 13:17:35', '', NULL, 0),
(245, 'Faster HD Solo Wireless Headphones S4', 'faster-hd-solo-wireless-stereo-headphones-s4', 16, 76, '  <h2>Faster HD Solo Wireless Headphones S4 Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n  <p>Step up your audio game with the Faster HD Solo Wireless Headphones S4, available at an unbeatable price of 5,499 PKR. These stylish headphones deliver crisp, high-fidelity sound with clear bass, perfect for music lovers, gamers, and anyone who values quality audio on the go. Whether you\'re in Karachi, Lahore, Islamabad, or anywhere in Pakistan, the Faster HD Solo S4 offers a comfortable, foldable design and versatile features to elevate your listening experience. With fast delivery and a 1-year warranty, it’s the ideal choice for premium sound at an affordable price.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Superior Sound Quality</h3>\r\n  <p>The Faster HD Solo Wireless Headphones S4 are designed to impress with their clear, transparent bass and balanced mid-to-high frequencies. Whether you’re listening to your favorite playlist, watching a movie, or taking a call, these headphones deliver rich, immersive audio that brings every moment to life. The advanced audio technology ensures minimal distortion, so you can enjoy every note and beat with clarity. Perfect for long commutes, workouts, or relaxing at home, the S4 provides a premium listening experience without breaking the bank.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Seamless Bluetooth 5.0 Connectivity</h3>\r\n  <p>With Bluetooth 5.0, the Faster HD Solo S4 offers super-fast, low-power connectivity, ensuring a stable connection up to 10 meters away. Stream music or podcasts from your smartphone, tablet, or laptop without worrying about lag or dropouts. The headphones are compatible with A2DP-enabled devices like iPhones, Android smartphones, iPads, and PCs, making them a versatile choice for all your gadgets. For those who prefer wired options, the S4 also supports AUX input, giving you flexibility for any situation.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Comfort and Style in One Package</h3>\r\n  <p>The Faster HD Solo S4 combines comfort with a sleek, modern design. The adjustable PU leather headband ensures a perfect fit for any head size, while the foldable structure makes these headphones easy to carry in your bag or pocket. Lightweight and built for long-term wear, they’re ideal for extended listening sessions without discomfort. The stylish design adds a touch of flair, making the S4 a fashionable accessory for work, travel, or casual outings.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Versatile Features for Everyday Use</h3>\r\n  <p>These headphones are packed with features to suit your lifestyle. Control your music directly from the headset with easy-to-use buttons for play, pause, track skipping, and volume adjustment. The built-in microphone supports hands-free calls, so you can switch from music to conversations effortlessly. The S4 also functions as an MP3 player and supports wired communication via AUX, ensuring compatibility with a wide range of devices. With up to 8 hours of battery life on a single 2-hour charge, the 250mAh battery keeps you connected all day.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Shop with Confidence</h3>\r\n  <p>At just 5,499 PKR, the Faster HD Solo Wireless Headphones S4 offer incredible value for a feature-rich audio solution. We provide fast delivery across Pakistan within 1-3 working days, so you can start enjoying your headphones in no time. Our 7-day exchange or replacement policy and 24-hour complaint resolution ensure a worry-free shopping experience. Backed by a 1-year warranty, the S4 is a reliable investment for anyone seeking quality sound at the best price in Pakistan.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Why Choose the Faster HD Solo S4?</h3>\r\n  <p>The Faster HD Solo Wireless Headphones S4 stand out for their blend of high-quality audio, comfort, and versatility. Whether you’re a music enthusiast, a gamer, or someone who needs reliable headphones for calls, the S4 delivers on all fronts. Its foldable design, long battery life, and seamless connectivity make it perfect for busy lifestyles. Don’t settle for average audio—grab the Faster HD Solo S4 today and enjoy premium sound at an affordable price.</p>\r\n\r\n  <p>Order now and get the Faster HD Solo Wireless Headphones S4 delivered to your doorstep anywhere in Pakistan!</p>', '  <ul>\r\n    <li>Bluetooth 5.0 for seamless, low-power connectivity</li>\r\n    <li>Clear bass and high-quality stereo sound</li>\r\n    <li>Foldable design with adjustable PU leather headband</li>\r\n    <li>Up to 8 hours of music and talk time</li>\r\n    <li>Supports AUX, MP3, and hands-free calls</li>\r\n    <li>Fast delivery in 1-3 days, 1-year warranty</li>\r\n  </ul>', 1, 10, 6500, 5499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-06 14:26:01', '2025-08-06 14:40:50', '', NULL, 0),
(246, 'Faster S5 ANC Over-Ear Wireless Headphone', 'faster-s5-anc-over-ear-wireless-headphones', 16, 76, '  <h2>Faster S5 ANC Over-Ear Wireless Headphones Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n  <p>Upgrade your audio experience with the Faster S5 ANC Over-Ear Wireless Headphones, priced at just 5,399 PKR. These headphones combine cutting-edge Active Noise Cancellation (ANC) technology with high-resolution audio to deliver crystal-clear sound and deep bass, perfect for music lovers, commuters, and professionals across Pakistan. Whether you’re in Karachi, Lahore, or Islamabad, enjoy premium sound quality, long-lasting battery life, and a comfortable design that’s built for all-day use. With fast delivery and a 1-year warranty, the Faster S5 ANC is your ticket to a superior listening experience at an affordable price.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Unmatched Audio with Active Noise Cancellation</h3>\r\n  <p>The Faster S5 ANC Over-Ear Wireless Headphones are designed to block out the world and let you focus on your music. With advanced ANC technology, these headphones reduce ambient noise by up to -20 ± 3dB, creating a peaceful listening environment whether you’re on a busy commute or in a noisy office. The Hi-Res audio delivers rich, detailed sound with a frequency range of 20Hz to 20kHz, ensuring every note, from deep bass to crisp highs, is captured perfectly. Whether you’re enjoying your favorite playlist or diving into a podcast, the S5 ANC provides an immersive experience that elevates your audio game.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Seamless Connectivity with Bluetooth V5.3</h3>\r\n  <p>Stay connected without the hassle of wires thanks to Bluetooth V5.3, which offers a robust 20-meter range for uninterrupted streaming. The Faster S5 ANC headphones pair effortlessly with Android and iOS devices, from smartphones to tablets, ensuring compatibility with all your gadgets. The auto-pairing feature makes setup a breeze, so you can start listening in seconds. Whether you’re streaming music, taking calls, or watching videos, the S5 ANC delivers stable, high-quality audio with low power consumption, keeping you connected longer.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Comfort and Durability for All-Day Use</h3>\r\n  <p>Designed with comfort in mind, the Faster S5 ANC Over-Ear Wireless Headphones feature soft, cushioned earcups and an adjustable headband for a perfect fit. The over-ear design ensures all-day comfort, making these headphones ideal for long listening sessions, whether you’re working, traveling, or relaxing at home. The lightweight build means you can wear them for hours without fatigue, while the sleek, modern design adds a touch of style to your everyday look. These headphones are built to last, with durable materials that withstand daily use.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Long-Lasting Battery and Versatile Features</h3>\r\n  <p>With a 500mAh battery, the Faster S5 ANC offers up to 10 hours of playtime on a single 1.5-hour charge via Type-C, so you can enjoy your music all day without interruption. When using Bluetooth and ANC together, you get about 40 hours of usage, while standalone Bluetooth mode extends to 50 hours, and ANC-only mode reaches an impressive 60 hours. The built-in microphone ensures clear hands-free calls, making these headphones perfect for work or casual conversations. Plus, the intuitive controls let you manage tracks, volume, and calls directly from the headset.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Shop with Confidence Across Pakistan</h3>\r\n  <p>At 5,399 PKR, the Faster S5 ANC Over-Ear Wireless Headphones offer incredible value for premium audio features. We provide fast delivery within 1-3 working days across Pakistan, so you can enjoy your new headphones in no time. Our 7-day exchange or replacement policy and 24-hour complaint resolution ensure a hassle-free shopping experience. Backed by a 1-year warranty, these headphones are a reliable choice for anyone seeking quality sound at the best price in Pakistan.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Why Choose the Faster S5 ANC?</h3>\r\n  <p>The Faster S5 ANC Over-Ear Wireless Headphones stand out for their powerful ANC, high-fidelity audio, and long battery life, making them ideal for music, calls, and more. Whether you’re a student, professional, or audiophile, these headphones deliver exceptional performance at an affordable price. Don’t let background noise ruin your focus—grab the Faster S5 ANC today and enjoy a world of clear, immersive sound delivered right to your doorstep.</p>\r\n\r\n  <p>Order now and experience the Faster S5 ANC Over-Ear Wireless Headphones at the lowest price in Pakistan!</p>', '  <ul>\r\n    <li>Active Noise Cancellation for immersive audio</li>\r\n    <li>Bluetooth V5.3 with 20m range for seamless connectivity</li>\r\n    <li>Up to 10 hours of playtime on a 1.5-hour charge</li>\r\n    <li>Comfortable over-ear design with built-in mic</li>\r\n    <li>Compatible with Android and iOS devices</li>\r\n    <li>Fast 1-3 day delivery, 1-year warranty</li>\r\n  </ul>', 1, 10, 5999, 5399, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-06 14:48:27', '2025-08-06 14:54:03', '', NULL, 0);
