(247, 'FASTER S5 ANC Special Edition Headset', 'faster-s5-anc-special-edition', 16, 76, '  <h2>FASTER S5 ANC Special Edition Headset Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n  <p>Immerse yourself in premium sound with the FASTER S5 ANC Special Edition Headset, priced at an affordable 5,999 PKR. These over-ear wireless headphones are designed to deliver high-resolution audio, powerful Active Noise Cancellation (ANC), and an impressive battery life, making them perfect for music lovers, gamers, and professionals across Pakistan. Whether you’re in Karachi, Lahore, or Islamabad, enjoy crystal-clear sound and distraction-free listening with fast delivery and a 1-year warranty. The FASTER S5 ANC Special Edition is your go-to for quality audio at a budget-friendly price.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Block Out Noise, Tune into Sound</h3>\r\n  <p>The FASTER S5 ANC Special Edition Headset features advanced Active Noise Cancellation, reducing ambient noise by up to -20 ± 3dB across a 20-600Hz range. This makes it ideal for blocking out distractions in busy environments like offices, public transport, or bustling streets. The Hi-Res audio delivers rich, detailed sound with deep bass and crisp highs, ensuring every song, podcast, or call comes through with clarity. Whether you’re enjoying your favorite playlist or focusing on a work call, these headphones create a personal audio oasis that keeps you engaged.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Seamless Connectivity with Bluetooth V5.3</h3>\r\n  <p>With Bluetooth V5.3, the FASTER S5 ANC Special Edition offers a stable, low-latency connection up to 10 meters, perfect for streaming music or videos from your smartphone, tablet, or laptop. The working frequency of 2.402GHz to 2.480GHz ensures reliable performance, while compatibility with Android and iOS devices makes pairing effortless. Whether you’re moving around the house or working at a café, these headphones keep you connected without the hassle of wires, delivering high-quality audio with minimal power consumption.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Long-Lasting Battery for All-Day Use</h3>\r\n  <p>Powered by a 3.7V/500mAh battery, the FASTER S5 ANC Special Edition Headset offers exceptional playtime: up to 50 hours with Bluetooth only, 60 hours with ANC only, and 40 hours when using both. A quick 2.5-hour charge via Type-C gets you back to full power, so you can enjoy uninterrupted music, calls, or gaming throughout the day. The efficient charging voltage of 5V/1A ensures your headphones are ready when you are, making them ideal for long commutes, work sessions, or travel.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Comfort and Style for Every Moment</h3>\r\n  <p>Designed for extended wear, the FASTER S5 ANC Special Edition features soft, cushioned earcups and an adjustable headband for a snug, comfortable fit. The lightweight, foldable design makes them easy to carry, whether you’re commuting or traveling. The sleek, modern look adds a touch of style, making these headphones a great accessory for any setting. Built with durable materials, they’re crafted to withstand daily use while keeping you comfortable during long listening sessions.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Versatile Features for Modern Lifestyles</h3>\r\n  <p>The FASTER S5 ANC Special Edition Headset is packed with features to enhance your experience. The built-in microphone ensures clear hands-free calls, perfect for work or staying connected on the go. Intuitive controls let you manage music, adjust volume, and take calls directly from the headset. With auto-pairing and broad device compatibility, these headphones are a versatile choice for anyone seeking convenience and performance. The ANC feature makes them especially suited for noisy environments, ensuring you stay focused or relaxed.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Shop with Confidence Across Pakistan</h3>\r\n  <p>At just 5,999 PKR, the FASTER S5 ANC Special Edition Headset offers premium features at a price that won’t break the bank. We provide fast delivery within 1-3 working days across Pakistan, so you can enjoy your new headphones quickly. Our 7-day exchange or replacement policy and 24-hour complaint resolution ensure a worry-free shopping experience. Plus, with a 1-year warranty, you can trust in the reliability of your purchase. Shop now and experience top-tier audio at the best price in Pakistan.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Why Choose the FASTER S5 ANC Special Edition?</h3>\r\n  <p>The FASTER S5 ANC Special Edition Headset stands out for its powerful ANC, long battery life, and high-fidelity audio, making it perfect for music, work, or gaming. Its sleek design, comfortable fit, and versatile features cater to busy lifestyles, while the affordable price makes premium audio accessible to everyone. Don’t settle for subpar sound—order the FASTER S5 ANC Special Edition today and enjoy immersive audio delivered right to your doorstep anywhere in Pakistan.</p>\r\n\r\n  <p>Shop now and get the FASTER S5 ANC Special Edition Headset at the lowest price in Pakistan!</p>', '  <ul>\r\n    <li>Active Noise Cancellation for focused listening</li>\r\n    <li>Bluetooth V5.3 with 10m range for seamless connectivity</li>\r\n    <li>Up to 40h playtime with ANC and Bluetooth</li>\r\n    <li>2.5h fast charging via Type-C</li>\r\n    <li>Hi-Res audio with deep bass and clear highs</li>\r\n    <li>Fast 1-3 day delivery, 1-year warranty</li>\r\n  </ul>', 1, 10, 9999, 5999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-06 15:00:38', '2025-08-06 15:04:36', '', NULL, 0),
(248, 'FASTER S6-HD Bluetooth HEADPHONES', 'faster-s6-hd-bluetooth-headphones', 16, 76, '  <h2>FASTER S6-HD Bluetooth Headphones Price In Pakistan</h2>\r\n  <p>Get ready to elevate your listening experience with the FASTER S6-HD Bluetooth Headphones, available for just 4,999 PKR in Pakistan. These wireless headphones combine advanced Active Noise Cancellation (ANC), Bluetooth V5.3 technology, and a long-lasting 30-hour battery life to deliver exceptional sound quality for music, gaming, or calls. Whether you’re in Karachi, Lahore, or Islamabad, these headphones offer unmatched value, comfort, and performance. With fast delivery and a 1-year warranty, the FASTER S6-HD is the perfect choice for anyone seeking high-quality audio at an affordable price.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Immersive Sound with Active Noise Cancellation</h3>\r\n  <p>The FASTER S6-HD Bluetooth Headphones are designed to immerse you in your audio with powerful Active Noise Cancellation, reducing ambient noise by up to -20 ± 3dB across a 20-600Hz frequency range. Whether you’re on a crowded bus or working in a noisy café, the ANC ensures you hear only what matters—your music, podcasts, or calls. The headphones deliver Hi-Res audio with deep, rich bass and crystal-clear highs, thanks to advanced 40mm drivers. From your favorite tracks to intense gaming sessions, the S6-HD brings every sound to life with stunning clarity.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Seamless Connectivity with Bluetooth V5.3</h3>\r\n  <p>With Bluetooth V5.3, the FASTER S6-HD offers a stable, low-latency connection up to 10 meters, making it easy to stream music or take calls from your smartphone, tablet, or laptop. Operating within a 2.402GHz to 2.480GHz working frequency, these headphones ensure reliable performance with minimal power consumption. Compatible with Android, iOS, and other Bluetooth-enabled devices, the S6-HD pairs effortlessly, letting you enjoy wireless freedom without sacrificing audio quality. Whether you’re multitasking or relaxing, these headphones keep you connected with ease.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Long-Lasting Battery for Non-Stop Listening</h3>\r\n  <p>Powered by a 3.7V/300mAh battery, the FASTER S6-HD Bluetooth Headphones provide up to 30 hours of playtime on a single 2-hour charge via a 5V/1A Type-C port. Whether you’re on a long commute, traveling, or working through the day, these headphones won’t let you down. The quick-charging feature means you can get back to your music or calls in no time, making the S6-HD ideal for busy lifestyles. With such impressive battery life, you can enjoy uninterrupted audio wherever you go.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Comfort and Portability for Everyday Use</h3>\r\n  <p>The FASTER S6-HD is built for comfort and convenience. The foldable design and adjustable headband ensure a perfect fit for all head sizes, while the soft, cushioned earcups make them ideal for extended wear. Whether you’re gaming, working, or chilling at home, the lightweight construction prevents fatigue, even during long sessions. The sleek, modern design adds a stylish touch, and the foldable structure makes these headphones easy to pack for travel or commuting, so you can take premium sound anywhere.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Versatile Features for Modern Needs</h3>\r\n  <p>These headphones are packed with features to enhance your experience. The built-in microphone delivers clear audio for hands-free calls, perfect for work or staying connected on the go. Intuitive controls let you manage music, adjust volume, and answer calls directly from the headset. The FASTER S6-HD also supports wired connectivity via AUX, offering flexibility for devices without Bluetooth. With its ergonomic design and advanced noise isolation, this headset is a versatile choice for music enthusiasts, gamers, and professionals alike.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Shop with Confidence Across Pakistan</h3>\r\n  <p>Priced at just 4,999 PKR, the FASTER S6-HD Bluetooth Headphones offer premium features at a budget-friendly price. We provide fast delivery within 1-3 working days across Pakistan, ensuring you get your headphones quickly, whether you’re in Karachi, Lahore, or beyond. Our 7-day exchange or replacement policy and 24-hour complaint resolution guarantee a hassle-free shopping experience. Backed by a 1-year warranty, the S6-HD is a reliable investment for top-tier audio at the best price in Pakistan.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h3>Why Choose the FASTER S6-HD?</h3>\r\n  <p>The FASTER S6-HD Bluetooth Headphones stand out for their powerful ANC, long battery life, and high-fidelity audio, making them perfect for music, gaming, or work. Their comfortable, foldable design and versatile features cater to busy lifestyles, while the affordable price makes premium audio accessible to everyone. Don’t settle for average sound—order the FASTER S6-HD today and enjoy immersive audio delivered to your doorstep anywhere in Pakistan. Grab yours now and experience the best headphones in Pakistan at an unbeatable price!</p>', '  <ul>\r\n    <li>Active Noise Cancellation for immersive audio</li>\r\n    <li>Bluetooth V5.3 with 10m range for seamless connectivity</li>\r\n    <li>Up to 30 hours of playtime on a 2-hour charge</li>\r\n    <li>Hi-Res audio with deep bass and clear highs</li>\r\n    <li>Comfortable, foldable design with built-in mic</li>\r\n    <li>Fast 1-3 day delivery, 1-year warranty</li>\r\n  </ul>', 1, 10, 6999, 4999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-08-06 15:11:29', '2025-08-06 15:19:26', '', NULL, 0),
(249, 'TECH NEST TN-EC1 25watt Fast Charger', 'tech-nest-tn-ec1-25w-fast-charger', 14, 77, '<h2>Why Choose the TECH NEST TN-EC1?</h2>\r\n<p>Low battery warnings are the worst, especially when you’re rushing between meetings or chilling with Netflix. The TECH NEST TN-EC1 25W fast charger steps up with dual ports and a smart chip to keep your devices juiced up, safe, and ready to go. Whether you’re in Lahore’s hustle or Islamabad’s calm, this charger’s got the speed and reliability you need to stay powered.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Blazing Fast Charging</h3>\r\n<p>With a max output of 25W, the TN-EC1 delivers serious charging speed. Both USB and Type-C ports support 5V/3.5A, 9V/2.75A, or 12V/2.1A, so you can charge your smartphone to 50% in about 30 minutes or power up a tablet in no time. Got a USB-C laptop? It handles lighter models too, like Chromebooks or ultrabooks. The included 100cm Type-C cable means you’re ready to plug in right out of the box. At 1999 PKR, it’s a cost-effective way to cut down on charging time without breaking the bank.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It’s not just about speed – this charger supports data syncing too, so you can transfer files or back up your phone while it charges. Perfect for students or professionals who need their devices multitasking as hard as they do.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Dual Port Versatility</h3>\r\n<p>The dual port design is a game-changer. With USB and Type-C outputs, you can charge two devices at once – think your iPhone and AirPods, or an Android phone and a smartwatch. No more swapping cables or waiting for one device to finish. This 25W PD charger is super compatible with a wide range of devices, from Samsung and Xiaomi phones to iPads and USB-C accessories. For Pakistan users juggling multiple gadgets, it’s a one-stop power solution.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Smart and Safe Charging</h3>\r\n<p>The built-in smart chip is the brains behind the operation, optimizing power delivery for each device to prevent overcharging or overheating. It adjusts voltage and current on the fly, ensuring safe and reliable performance. Whether you’re charging overnight or during a quick coffee break, the TN-EC1 protects your devices from overcurrent, short circuits, and heat buildup. It’s built to handle Pakistan’s variable power grids, working flawlessly with AC 100-240V inputs for home or travel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Premium Build and Convenience</h3>\r\n<p>The TN-EC1 is designed for durability, with a sturdy casing that resists wear from daily use. Its compact size fits easily on crowded desks or in travel bags, making it ideal for Pakistan’s on-the-go lifestyle. The included 100cm Type-C cable is flexible yet tough, avoiding tangles while giving you enough reach to charge comfortably – whether you’re at a café in Karachi or a hotel in Dubai. The cable’s quality matches the charger, ensuring stable connections without loose plugs.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Why It Stands Out</h3>\r\n<p>Cheap chargers often skimp on safety or power, leading to slow charges or fried batteries. The TN-EC1’s smart chip and 25W dual-port output set it apart, delivering consistent performance even with two devices plugged in. Many budget chargers lack a cable or PD support, but this one includes both, saving you extra purchases. At 1999 PKR, it’s a steal for a dual port charger Pakistan shoppers can trust, rivaling pricier brands without the markup.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Perfect for Every Scenario</h3>\r\n<p>From students powering through assignments to professionals on Zoom calls, this USB C charger fits every lifestyle. Its universal AC 100-240V input makes it travel-ready, working in Pakistan or abroad. Charge your phone and tablet during a commute, or keep your earbuds and smartwatch topped up at home. The dual ports mean no one’s left waiting, making it a hit for families or shared workspaces.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Easy Setup and Maintenance</h3>\r\n<p>Plug it into any standard outlet, connect your devices, and you’re good to go – no apps or setup required. The smart chip handles the rest, ensuring efficient charging every time. To keep it in top shape, wipe down the charger and cable with a soft cloth if dusty, and store neatly to avoid cable stress. Its durable build is made to last, saving you from frequent replacements.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Power Up with Confidence</h3>\r\n<p>For 1999 PKR, the TECH NEST TN-EC1 25W fast charger is a smart investment for anyone who hates waiting on slow charges. With dual ports, a smart chip, and a 100cm cable, it’s built for speed, safety, and convenience. Grab yours today and keep your devices powered through Pakistan’s busiest days.</p>', '<h2>Product Highlights</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>High-Speed 25W Charging</strong>: Supports USB and Type-C with up to 25W (5V/3.5A, 9V/2.75A, 12V/2.1A) for rapid device power-ups.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Dual Port Design</strong>: USB and Type-C ports allow simultaneous charging of phones, tablets, or accessories.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Smart Chip Technology</strong>: Ensures safe, efficient charging with protection against overcurrent and overheating.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Included 100cm Cable</strong>: Provides flexibility for home, office, or travel use without extra purchases.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Universal Input</strong>: Works with AC 100-240V, ideal for Pakistan and global travel.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Affordable Power</strong>: Priced at 1999 PKR, a reliable 25W PD charger for Pakistan users.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 2000, 3499, 1999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-18 14:51:52', '2025-09-19 17:02:08', '', 750.00, 1),
(250, 'TECH NEST TN-CC1 38 watt Fast Car Charger', 'tech-nest-tn-cc1-38w-fast-car-charger', 17, 77, '<h2>Why Choose the TECH NEST TN-CC1?</h2>\r\n<p>Long drives, tight schedules, and a dying phone battery – sound familiar? The TECH NEST TN-CC1 38W fast car charger is your road trip savior, keeping your devices powered up whether you’re navigating Karachi’s traffic or cruising to Lahore. With dual USB and PD ports, it’s like having a charging station right in your car, ready for anything from smartphones to laptops.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>High-Speed Dual Charging</h3>\r\n<p>This charger packs a punch with 38W total output, split across USB and Type-C ports. The USB port pushes 5V/3A, 9V/2A, or 12V/1.5A, while the Type-C delivers 5V/3A, 9V/2.2A, or 12V/1.67A. That means you can fast-charge your iPhone to 50% in about 30 minutes or juice up a USB-C laptop like a MacBook while on the move. Got a passenger with a low battery too? Plug in two devices at once without slowing down. At 1499 PKR, it’s a budget-friendly way to keep everyone powered.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It’s not just about speed – it handles data syncing too, so you can connect your phone to your car’s system for music or navigation without hiccups. Whether it’s Android Auto or a quick file transfer, this 38W car charger gets it done.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Built for the Road</h3>\r\n<p>Designed for DC 12-24V inputs, the TN-CC1 works in everything from compact sedans to heavy trucks, making it a versatile pick for Pakistan’s diverse drivers. Its compact build fits snugly in your car’s power socket, no wobbling or loose connections. The durable casing shrugs off the heat and dust of Pakistan’s roads, from bumpy rural routes to city gridlock, ensuring it lasts through countless trips.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The sleek design doesn’t hog space, leaving room for other dashboard essentials. It’s tough enough to handle the vibrations and jolts of daily driving without losing performance, so you’re not stuck replacing it every few months.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Universal Compatibility</h3>\r\n<p>From iPhones to Samsungs, Pixels to Xiaomis, or even USB-C laptops, this dual port car charger Pakistan staple is super compatible. The USB port covers older devices or accessories like earbuds, while the Type-C PD port handles newer gadgets with power delivery needs. No need to carry multiple chargers or adapters – the TN-CC1 covers your whole tech lineup, making it perfect for families, freelancers, or road warriors juggling devices.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Safe and Stable Charging</h3>\r\n<p>High power doesn’t mean high risk. The TN-CC1 has built-in safeguards against overcurrent, overvoltage, short circuits, and overheating, keeping your devices safe even during long drives. Stable charging ensures consistent power flow, so you won’t see those frustrating dips that leave your phone stuck at 20%. It’s reliable enough for overnight road trips or quick top-ups during a lunch break, handling Pakistan’s hot summers without a sweat.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Why It Stands Out</h3>\r\n<p>Plenty of car chargers promise speed, but many choke on dual-device loads or fry under pressure. The TN-CC1’s 38W output and smart power allocation keep both ports humming, even with demanding devices. Cheaper chargers skimp on safety or compatibility, but this one’s built for longevity and versatility. At 1499 PKR, it’s a steal compared to overpriced brands that don’t match its dual USB/PD prowess. For Pakistan drivers, where reliable tech is a must, this charger delivers without breaking the bank.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Perfect for Every Drive</h3>\r\n<p>Whether you’re a delivery driver, a student commuting to uni, or a family heading out for a weekend getaway, the TN-CC1 fits right in. Plug it into your car’s 12V socket, and it’s ready to charge anything from phones to tablets. The dual ports mean you can power your GPS-running phone while keeping a passenger’s device alive – no arguments over who charges first. Its compact size makes it easy to toss in the glovebox or a travel bag for long hauls across Pakistan.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Easy Setup and Maintenance</h3>\r\n<p>Using it is dead simple: Plug into your car’s socket, connect your devices, and let it rip. No apps, no setup – just instant power. To keep it in top shape, wipe it down if it picks up dust, and avoid yanking cables too hard. The sturdy build resists wear, so it’ll stay reliable through months of daily use.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Drive with Confidence</h3>\r\n<p>For 1499 PKR, the TECH NEST TN-CC1 38W fast car charger is a no-brainer for anyone who lives on the road. It’s fast, safe, and built to handle Pakistan’s toughest drives. Add it to your cart today and keep your devices powered, no matter where the journey takes you.</p>', '<h2>Product Highlights</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Dual Port Power</strong>: USB and PD ports deliver up to 38W for simultaneous charging of phones, tablets, or laptops.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Fast Charging Output</strong>: USB at 5V/3A, 9V/2A, 12V/1.5A; Type-C at 5V/3A, 9V/2.2A, 12V/1.67A for rapid power-ups.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Wide Compatibility</strong>: Works with DC 12-24V inputs, perfect for cars and trucks in Pakistan.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Safe and Reliable</strong>: Built-in protections ensure stable, secure charging without overheating.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Affordable Performance</strong>: Priced at 1499 PKR, a top-tier dual port car charger for Pakistan drivers.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 2000, 2999, 1499, NULL, 30.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-18 15:06:23', '2025-09-19 16:53:58', '', 650.00, 1),
(251, 'TECH NEST TN-D03- 66 watt C to C Cable', 'tech-nest-tn-d03-usb-c-to-c-cable-66w', 18, 77, '<h2>Why Choose the TECH NEST TN-D03?</h2>\r\n<p>When your laptop or phone is running on fumes, you need a cable that doesn’t mess around. The TECH NEST TN-D03 USB C to C cable delivers a blazing 66W of power, wrapped in a sleek, durable package that’s built to keep up with your grind. Whether you’re charging in a bustling Karachi cafe or a quiet Islamabad office, this cable gets your devices back to full, fast, without skipping a beat.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Unmatched Charging Speed</h3>\r\n<p>The TN-D03 is all about power – 66W to be exact. That’s enough juice to charge modern USB-C laptops, tablets, or smartphones at top speed. Got a MacBook Pro or a Samsung Galaxy? This 66W fast charging cable can push them to full in a fraction of the time weaker cables take. It’s perfect for power users who need their gear ready for video editing, gaming, or marathon work sessions. At 999 PKR, it’s a fraction of the cost of big-brand cables with the same specs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Beyond charging, it supports high-speed data transfer, so syncing files between your phone and laptop is quick and painless. No more waiting ages to move photos or backups – plug in and get it done.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Built Tough with Premium Materials</h3>\r\n<p>This isn’t some flimsy plastic cord that’ll split after a week. The TN-D03 uses aluminium alloy connectors paired with a silicone outer layer, giving you a durable USB C cable that’s both tough and flexible. The alloy ends resist corrosion and wear, ensuring a snug fit every time you plug in. The silicone coating is smooth yet grippy, preventing tangles while standing up to bends, pulls, and the chaos of daily life in Pakistan – from dusty markets to humid commutes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The anti-fray design means it won’t crack at the stress points, even if you’re rough with it. I’ve seen cables like this survive being stuffed in bags or yanked by accident, still charging like champs months later. It’s the kind of build that makes you forget what replacing cables feels like.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Just the Right Length</h3>\r\n<p>At 100cm, this cable hits the sweet spot. It’s long enough to let you use your device comfortably – whether you’re sprawled on a couch or working at a cluttered desk – but short enough to avoid a knotted mess. Traveling across Pakistan? It’s compact enough to slip into a pocket or laptop sleeve without adding weight. For anyone juggling work, study, or gaming on the go, this Type C cable in Pakistan keeps things simple.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Safe and Stable Performance</h3>\r\n<p>Charging at 66W sounds intense, but the TN-D03 keeps it safe. Built-in protections guard against overcurrent, short circuits, and overheating, so your devices stay secure even during long sessions. The stable charging tech ensures consistent power flow, avoiding those annoying dips that slow things down. Whether you’re topping up overnight or rushing a quick charge before a meeting, it’s got your back without risking battery damage.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The aluminium alloy and silicone combo also helps dissipate heat, making it reliable in Pakistan’s hot summers or chilly winters. It’s designed to handle the grind, so you don’t have to worry about meltdowns or glitches.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Universal Compatibility</h3>\r\n<p>This USB C to C cable plays nice with a huge range of devices. From the latest USB-C laptops (think MacBook Air, Dell XPS) to phones like Google Pixel or OnePlus, it’s super compatible. Even power-hungry tablets or accessories like wireless earbuds with USB-C ports work seamlessly. No need for multiple cables or adapters – the TN-D03 handles it all, making it a go-to for mixed-device households or busy professionals.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Why It Beats the Competition</h3>\r\n<p>Cheap cables flood the market, but they often cap out at low wattages or break under pressure. The TN-D03’s 66W output and premium build put it leagues ahead. Lesser cables fray at the ends or deliver shaky power; this one’s aluminium alloy and silicone construction ensures longevity and steady performance. For Pakistan shoppers, where quality can vary, 999 PKR gets you a Type C cable in Pakistan that rivals pricier imports without the markup.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The 100cm length is another win – no stretching to reach outlets like with 50cm cables, and no excess coil like with 2m ones. It’s practical, durable, and priced for real-world use.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Effortless Everyday Use</h3>\r\n<p>This cable fits into your life like it was made for it. Plug it into a PD charger, power bank, or car adapter – it delivers 66W without hiccups. For remote workers, students, or gamers, it’s a reliable companion that cuts down on cable clutter. At 999 PKR, grabbing a couple for home and travel makes sense, saving you from the headache of replacements.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Easy Maintenance</h3>\r\n<p>Keeping it clean is a breeze: wipe the silicone with a damp cloth if it gets grimy, and avoid sharp bends. The aluminium alloy ends stay corrosion-free, and the silicone stays flexible, so it won’t crack over time. This durable USB C cable is built to last, giving you months – if not years – of hassle-free charging.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Power Up with Confidence</h3>\r\n<p>For 999 PKR, the TECH NEST TN-D03 USB C to C cable is a no-brainer for anyone who values speed and reliability. It’s fast, tough, and ready for Pakistan’s daily hustle. Add it to your cart now and enjoy charging that keeps pace with your life – no stress, no fuss.</p>', '<h2>Product Highlights</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>High-Power 66W Charging</strong>: Supports up to 66W output for rapid charging of USB-C devices like laptops and phones.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Premium Build</strong>: Aluminium alloy connectors and silicone coating ensure durability and flexibility.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Perfect Length</strong>: 100cm cable provides ample reach for home, office, or travel use.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Safe and Stable</strong>: Delivers consistent power with built-in safety features to protect your devices.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Great Value</strong>: Priced at 999 PKR, a top-tier USB C to C cable for Pakistan users.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 1000, 1299, 999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-18 15:39:23', '2025-09-24 06:25:53', '', 340.00, 1),
(252, 'TECH NEST TN-D05 4 in 1 Cable 65W/27W', 'tech-nest-tn-d05-4-in-1-cable-65w', 18, 77, '<h2>Why Choose the TECH NEST TN-D05?</h2>\r\n<p>Got a drawer full of tangled cables for every gadget? The TECH NEST TN-D05 4 in 1 cable cuts through that mess with one tough, versatile line that handles everything. Whether you\'re juggling an iPhone, Android phone, tablet, or even a laptop, this multi cable Pakistan essential keeps you charged up fast and frustration-free. It\'s the kind of gear that makes you wonder why you ever bothered with singles.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Power That Matches Your Devices</h3>\r\n<p>This isn\'t your average charger – it\'s built for speed with 65W PD output for power-hungry laptops or tablets, dropping to a safe 27W for iPhones to avoid any overload. Plug in the right tip, and it auto-adjusts, delivering fast charging without the guesswork. Imagine topping up your MacBook during a work crunch or your Samsung in the car – all from the same cable. At 999 PKR, it\'s a steal for anyone tired of slow, device-specific cords cluttering their space.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The 4 in 1 setup means USB-C for modern Androids and laptops, Lightning for iPhones and AirPods, Micro-USB for older gadgets, and USB-A for legacy chargers. Super compatible across the board, it syncs data too, so file transfers between phone and PC happen smoothly. No more digging for the \"right\" cable in Pakistan\'s humid heat, where things wear out quick.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Tough Enough for Everyday Chaos</h3>\r\n<p>Life\'s rough on cables – bags, pockets, desks – but the TN-D05 laughs it off with ultra durable construction. Reinforced braiding and strain-relief ends make this durable charging cable a survivor, shrugging off bends and yanks that doom cheaper ones. The anti-bending tech at the connectors prevents those annoying snaps right where the cable meets the plug, extending its life way past the average.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I\'ve seen folks in Lahore markets swear by cables like this for surviving monsoons and dust storms. It\'s flexible for coiling up neat, yet sturdy enough to handle a full load without fraying. Weighing light and compact, it slips into any travel kit without adding bulk – perfect for road trips from Karachi to the northern hills.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Seamless Use Across Scenarios</h3>\r\n<p>Switching tips is a snap: Magnetic or sliding connectors (depending on the build) let you swap ends in seconds, no tools needed. Hook it to a wall adapter, power bank, or car port – it works everywhere, delivering consistent power. For students cramming with multiple devices or pros on the go, this fast charging cable means one less thing to pack. And in Pakistan, where outlets are hit-or-miss, the reliability shines through long sessions without dropouts.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It\'s got your back for everything from overnight phone charges to quick laptop boosts during meetings. The 65W/27W smart switching protects batteries, so you won\'t fry your gear. Pro users love how it handles high-drain tasks like video editing on the move, all while staying cool under pressure.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Safety and Smart Features Built In</h3>\r\n<p>No skimping on protection here – overcurrent, short-circuit, and temperature safeguards keep things safe during fast charges. The materials are heat-resistant, so even in Pakistan\'s scorching summers, it won\'t melt down or pose risks. Anti-bending means fewer exposed wires over time, cutting fire hazards from wear. It\'s certified for peace of mind, letting you charge overnight without worries.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Compared to single-purpose cables, this 4 in 1 saves space and sanity. Bulk packs of disposables? Forget it – one TN-D05 replaces four, at half the hassle and cost.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Why It Outshines the Rest</h3>\r\n<p>Market floods with flimsy multi-cables that bend once and die, but the TN-D05\'s ultra durable, anti-bending armor sets it apart. Cheaper ones lack the wattage smarts, leading to slow charges or device damage; this one adapts perfectly. In Pakistan, where imports vary in quality, 999 PKR gets you a local-ready beast: Super compatible, fast, and tough against daily grind.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Users rave about ditching cable salads for this all-rounder – it\'s not just functional, it\'s liberating. For families with mixed Apple-Android setups or travelers juggling gadgets, it\'s a game-changer without the premium tag.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Easy Care and Longevity</h3>\r\n<p>Maintenance? Wipe it down if dusty, coil loosely to avoid stress, and store tips safely. The anti-bending zones stay supple, so it bends without breaking even after months. This durable charging cable is made for the long haul – think years, not weeks, of reliable service.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In a world of planned obsolescence, the TN-D05 bucks the trend with build quality that rewards smart buys like yours.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Level Up Your Charging Setup</h3>\r\n<p>At 999 PKR, the TECH NEST TN-D05 4 in 1 cable is more than a wire – it\'s freedom from cable clutter. Grab one (or two) today and feel the relief of fast, universal charging that just works. Whether in bustling cities or quiet suburbs, it\'s your ticket to powered-up days without the drama.</p>', '<h2>Product Highlights</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Versatile 4-in-1 Design</strong>: Supports USB-C, Lightning, Micro-USB, and USB-A for all your devices in one cable.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Fast Charging Power</strong>: Up to 65W for PD devices, 27W for iPhones – quick power without multiple cables.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Super Compatibility</strong>: Works with Android, iOS, laptops, and more, no adapters needed.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Ultra Durable Build</strong>: Reinforced materials resist daily wear, pulls, and twists for long life.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Anti-Bending Protection</strong>: Flexible yet tough design prevents kinks and breaks at stress points.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Affordable All-in-One</strong>: Just 999 PKR for a reliable fast charging cable in Pakistan.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 1000, 1299, 999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-18 15:52:20', '2025-09-24 06:25:35', '', 260.00, 1),
(253, 'TECH NEST TN-D02- USB to Type C Cable 2.4A', 'technest-tn-d02-usb-to-type-c-cable2.4a', 3, 77, '<h2>Why Choose the TECH NEST TN-D02?</h2>\r\n<p>Dealing with a dying phone battery and a frayed cable is the last thing you need in a busy day. The TECH NEST TN-D02 USB to Type C cable is here to keep your devices powered up without the hassle. It’s tough, reliable, and gets the job done, whether you’re charging at home in Islamabad or rushing through a day in Karachi.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Fast and Reliable Charging</h3>\r\n<p>The TN-D02 delivers a steady 5V/2.4A output, making it a fast charging Type C cable that powers up your smartphone, tablet, or any Type C device in no time. It’s not the absolute fastest, but for most users, 2.4A is more than enough to get you back to full during a quick break or commute. Plus, it supports data syncing, so transferring photos or files to your laptop is smooth and quick. At just 650 PKR, it’s an affordable way to keep your gadgets ready without spending a fortune.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Built to Last</h3>\r\n<p>What makes this cable stand out is its build. The combination of metal connectors and braided exterior means this durable USB cable can take a beating. Whether it’s getting tossed in a bag with keys or wrapped tightly around a charger, the braiding prevents tangles and fraying, while the metal ends resist wear at the plug points. You know those cables that split at the connector after a month? This one’s designed to outlast them, holding strong through daily use across Pakistan’s dusty streets or humid summers.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Perfect Length and Portability</h3>\r\n<p>At 100cm, the length is just right – long enough to let you use your phone comfortably while it’s plugged in, but short enough to avoid a tangled mess. Whether you’re on the couch, at your desk, or in the car, you’ve got enough reach without excess cord clutter. Weighing only 29g, it’s super light, slipping easily into a pocket, backpack, or even a small wallet. For anyone always on the move, this Type C cable in Pakistan is a no-fuss companion.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Universal Compatibility</h3>\r\n<p>The Type-C port makes this cable versatile, working with a wide range of devices – from Android phones like Samsung or Xiaomi to newer laptops and even some wireless earbuds. No need for adapters or worrying about mismatched ports; it just plugs in and works. If you’re juggling multiple Type C devices, this cable handles them all, making it a must-have for students, professionals, or anyone keeping up with Pakistan’s fast-paced life.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Seamless Everyday Use</h3>\r\n<p>This cable fits into your routine without a hitch. Plug it into a wall charger, power bank, or car adapter – it delivers consistent power every time. For those who travel often or work remotely, the TN-D02 means one less thing to stress about. At 650 PKR, it’s budget-friendly enough to grab a couple – keep one at home, one in the office, or one for your travel bag. Over time, not having to replace flimsy cables adds up to real savings.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Safe and Dependable</h3>\r\n<p>Safety is key with any charging accessory. The TN-D02’s 5V/2.4A output is stable, so you won’t risk overheating your device or dealing with spotty charging. The metal and braided materials are heat-resistant, letting you charge overnight or during long sessions worry-free. It’s built to handle Pakistan’s varied climates, from hot summers to dusty environments, without losing performance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Why This Stands Out</h3>\r\n<p>Compared to other cables, the TN-D02 shines with its durability. Many budget options use cheap plastic that cracks or connectors that loosen, but this one’s metal and braiding combo extends its life. The 100cm length is a sweet spot – no awkward stretching like with shorter cables, and no excess coil like longer ones. For anyone who’s had a cable fail at the worst moment, this durable USB cable feels like a game-changer.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In Pakistan, where finding reliable tech at fair prices matters, the TN-D02 delivers. At 650 PKR, you get a fast charging Type C cable that performs without the premium price tag. It’s compatible with most Type C devices, ensuring you’re covered whether you’re powering up a phone, tablet, or accessory.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Easy Maintenance</h3>\r\n<p>Keeping it in top shape is simple: wipe it down with a cloth if it picks up dust, and avoid extreme pulls. The braided layer stays flexible, bending without breaking, so it holds up over months of use. This USB to Type C cable is all about making charging stress-free – no gimmicks, just solid performance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Upgrade Your Charging Game</h3>\r\n<p>For 650 PKR, the TECH NEST TN-D02 is a smart pick for anyone tired of unreliable cables. It’s fast, tough, and ready for your daily grind. Add it to your cart today and enjoy charging that keeps up with you, wherever you are in Pakistan.</p>', '<h2>Product Highlights</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Fast Charging Support</strong>: Delivers 5V/2.4A output for quick charging of Type C devices.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Durable Build</strong>: Metal and braided design resists fraying, bends, and daily wear.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Ideal Length</strong>: 100cm cable offers flexibility for home, office, or on-the-go use.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Lightweight Design</strong>: Only 29g, easy in pockets or bags without added bulk.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Great Value</strong>: Priced at 650 PKR, a reliable USB to Type C cable for Pakistan users.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 1000, 999, 650, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-18 16:58:15', '2025-09-19 16:13:26', '', 200.00, 1),
(254, 'TECH NEST TN-W01 Wireless Headphones (RGB)', 'technest-tn-w01-wireless-headphones-rgb', 16, 77, '<h2>Why Choose the TECH NEST TN-W01 Wireless Headphones?</h2>\r\n<p>Imagine slipping on a pair of headphones that not only blast your favorite tracks with punchy sound but also light up your desk with cool RGB effects. The TECH NEST TN-W01 wireless headphones do just that – they\'re your go-to for everything from intense gaming sessions to chill music marathons. No more dealing with tangled wires or spotty connections; these bad boys keep you locked in, whether you\'re at home in Lahore or commuting through Karachi traffic.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Superior Sound Quality and Design</h3>\r\n<p>At the heart of these Bluetooth headphones Pakistan style are the 40mm drivers, which pump out audio that\'s surprisingly full for the price. Bass hits hard without muddling the mids, so you feel every beat in your EDM playlist or the rumble in a game\'s soundtrack. The over-ear design cushions your ears comfortably, with soft padding that doesn\'t clamp down after hours of wear. And those RGB lights? They\'re not just flashy – you can cycle through colors to match your mood or setup, making them a standout for gamers who want that extra vibe.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Built tough for daily use, these wireless headphones handle the hustle of life in Pakistan. The adjustable headband fits most head sizes, and the foldable arms make them easy to toss in a backpack for travel. Weighing in light, they won\'t strain your neck during long calls or workouts. Plus, the matte finish resists fingerprints, keeping them looking sharp even after sweaty gym sessions.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Effortless Connectivity and Controls</h3>\r\n<p>With Bluetooth V5.3, pairing is a breeze – it connects faster and holds a stronger signal than older versions. Say goodbye to dropouts mid-song; these maintain a solid link up to 10m away, so you can wander the room or step out for a quick break without pausing your podcast. The built-in controls on the earcup let you skip tracks, adjust volume, or answer calls with a tap – no fumbling for your phone.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The microphone shines too, with -38dB sensitivity that picks up your voice clearly, even in noisy environments like a bustling cafe or during online meetings. It\'s noise-canceling enough to cut background chatter, making it reliable for work-from-home pros or students joining virtual classes. For RGB wireless headphones enthusiasts, the lights sync with your music\'s rhythm in some modes, adding that immersive touch.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Battery Life That Keeps Up</h3>\r\n<p>Nothing kills the vibe like a dead battery halfway through your playlist. The TN-W01\'s 800mAh battery delivers up to 10 hours of nonstop playtime, which is plenty for a full day of commuting, studying, or gaming. And recharging? Just 2.5 hours via the USB input (4.7V-5.2V compatible), so you\'re back in action quick. It even works in temps from -10°C to 55°C, handling Pakistan\'s hot summers or chilly winters without skipping a beat.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Pro tip: Use the included cable for wired mode if you ever run low – versatility like that makes these a smart pick over basic earbuds.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Perfect for Gaming, Music, and Calls</h3>\r\n<p>Gamers, these are for you. The low-latency Bluetooth V5.3 minimizes audio lag, so your shots in PUBG or footsteps in Valorant land on time. The 40mm speakers create a wide soundstage, helping you pinpoint enemy positions. For music lovers, genres from qawwali to hip-hop come alive with balanced EQ that doesn\'t favor one frequency. And on calls? The mic\'s sensitivity ensures colleagues hear you loud and clear, no echoes or muffles.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In Pakistan\'s vibrant scene, where everyone\'s glued to their devices, these wireless headphones with mic stand out. They\'re not overkill for casual use but pack enough punch for pros. At 4499 PKR, you\'re getting features that rival pricier brands, without the markup.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Easy Setup and Everyday Reliability</h3>\r\n<p>Out of the box, it\'s plug-and-play simple: Charge it up, hold the power button, and scan for devices on your phone or laptop. The working range of 10m means you can charge your phone in the kitchen while jamming in the living room. Controls are intuitive – a quick press for play/pause, double for next track – and the RGB adds fun without draining extra battery.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Safety and durability are baked in. The battery won\'t overheat thanks to smart circuitry, and the build withstands drops or bends. Clean them with a soft cloth, store in the case (if included), and they\'ll last seasons. For anyone upgrading from wired cans, this is the smooth transition you\'ve been waiting for.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Why This Beats the Competition</h3>\r\n<p>Lots of wireless headphones skimp on battery or sound, but the TN-W01 balances it all at a fraction of the cost. Cheaper models drop connections or have tinny mics; these hold steady with V5.3 tech and a sensitive pickup. The RGB isn\'t gimmicky – it\'s a mood booster that sets them apart from plain black pairs. And in Pakistan, where prices fluctuate, 4499 PKR locks in value: 10h playtime, 40mm drivers, and 10m range without hunting for imports.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Compared to big names, you save hundreds while getting comparable specs. No bloatware, just pure performance for music, calls, or gaming.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Your Daily Audio Companion</h3>\r\n<p>Whether you\'re a student blasting lectures, a freelancer on back-to-back Zooms, or a weekend warrior queuing up Spotify, the TECH NEST TN-W01 fits seamlessly. The 800mAh battery means fewer charges, the mic handles noisy streets, and RGB lights make solo sessions feel epic. It\'s tough enough for Pakistan\'s dust and heat (-10°C to 55°C range), yet comfy for all-day wear.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Maintenance is minimal: Wipe the pads, avoid extreme moisture, and recharge fully. Over time, you\'ll wonder how you lived without wireless freedom like this.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Grab Yours Today</h3>\r\n<p>At 4499 PKR, the TN-W01 wireless headphones are an investment in better sound and style. Don\'t settle for laggy earbuds or dull cans – level up your audio game now. Add to cart and feel the difference in every beat, call, and glow.</p>', '<h2>Product Highlights</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Advanced Bluetooth V5.3</strong>: Seamless wireless connection with low latency, ideal for gaming and streaming.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Powerful 40mm Drivers</strong>: Delivers rich, balanced audio with deep bass and clear highs for music and calls.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Built-in Microphone</strong>: -38dB sensitivity ensures crystal-clear voice pickup during calls or voice chats.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Long-Lasting Battery</strong>: Up to 10 hours of playtime on a 800mAh battery, with just 2.5 hours to recharge.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Extended Range</strong>: Works up to 10m away, giving you freedom to move without interruptions.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>RGB Lighting</strong>: Customizable lights add a stylish glow, perfect for gaming setups or casual listening.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Affordable Excellence</strong>: At 4499 PKR, these wireless headphones offer premium features for Pakistan users.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 500, 5999, 4499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-18 17:03:20', '2025-09-19 15:49:44', '', 2990.00, 1);
