(256, 'TECH NEST TN-D04- USB to Iphone Cable 3A', 'technest-tn-d04-usb-to-iphone-cable-3a', 18, 77, '<h2>Why Choose the TECH NEST TN-D04?</h2>\r\n<p>Running low on battery during a busy day is stressful enough without your cable failing you. The TECH NEST TN-D04 USB to iPhone cable steps up with fast, dependable charging that fits your life. It’s not just another cable – it’s one you can count on when you’re racing against a dying battery.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This cable handles up to 3A output, meaning your iPhone charges faster than with standard cables. Whether you’re powering up an iPhone 12, 14, or even an iPad with a Lightning port, you’ll notice the difference in speed. It’s also great for syncing photos or music to your laptop, making it a versatile pick for work or personal use. At 700 PKR, it’s priced to give you quality without breaking the bank.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The tejido material is where this cable shines. Its woven design fights off the usual wear and tear – no more frayed ends or snapped wires after a few weeks. This durable USB cable can handle being stuffed in a backpack or coiled up in a drawer. The Lightning connector fits snugly, ensuring a stable charge without those annoying disconnects you get with cheap cables.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>At 100cm, the length strikes a balance: long enough to let you use your phone comfortably while charging, but short enough to avoid tangles or clutter. It’s lightweight, so carrying it around Pakistan’s busy streets – from Karachi to Islamabad – feels effortless. Toss it in your bag, and it’s ready whenever you need it.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Finding a reliable iPhone cable in Pakistan can be tricky. Some cables are too weak to handle fast charging, or they quit after a month. The TN-D04 is built to last, with tejido that resists stretching and breaking. It works seamlessly with all Lightning devices, so no matter if you’re charging an iPhone, AirPods, or an older iPad, it’s got you covered.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This fast charging iPhone cable plugs into any USB port – wall chargers, power banks, or your car’s adapter – and delivers consistent power. For students, professionals, or anyone always on the move, it’s a lifesaver. You won’t need to keep buying replacements, which saves you money over time. At 700 PKR, you can grab one for home and another for travel without hesitation.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Safety matters too. The 3A output is steady, so your device won’t overheat, even during long charging sessions. The tejido material helps keep things cool, and the cable’s flexibility means it bends without damage. It’s perfect for overnight charging or topping up during a quick break.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Why pick this over other cables? Most budget options skimp on materials, leading to cracked coatings or loose connectors. The TN-D04’s tejido build and sturdy ends outlast those flimsy alternatives. The 100cm length gives you room to move, unlike those short cables that tether you to the wall. For anyone who’s dealt with that frustration, this cable feels like a small but meaningful upgrade.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In Pakistan, where quick delivery and fair prices are key, the TN-D04 delivers. At 700 PKR, it’s an affordable essential that doesn’t compromise on performance. It’s compatible with a wide range of Apple devices, ensuring you get a fast charging iPhone cable that works every time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Caring for it is simple: wipe it down if it gets dusty, and avoid sharp pulls. The tejido material stays flexible, so it won’t crack under normal use. This USB to iPhone cable is all about reliability – no gimmicks, just a solid tool for your daily tech needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you’re ready to move on from cables that let you down, the TECH NEST TN-D04 is a smart choice. For 700 PKR, you get a durable USB cable that charges fast and holds up. Add it to your cart today and enjoy charging that keeps up with your pace.</p>', '<h2>Product Highlights</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Fast Charging Support</strong>: Delivers up to 3A output for quick charging of iPhones and Lightning devices.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Durable Build</strong>: Made with tejido material to resist fraying, bends, and daily wear.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Perfect Length</strong>: 100cm cable provides flexibility for home, office, or travel use.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Lightweight Design</strong>: Easy to carry, slips into any pocket or bag without bulk.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Great Value</strong>: Priced at 700 PKR, a reliable USB to iPhone cable for Pakistan users.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 2000, 999, 700, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-18 18:32:19', '2025-09-24 06:24:39', '', 260.00, 1),
(257, 'TECH NEST TN-D01 USB to Type C Cable', 'technest-tn-d01-usb-to-type-c-cable', 18, 77, '<h2>Why Choose the TECH NEST TN-D01?</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'re tired of flimsy cables that break after a few weeks, the TECH NEST TN-D01 USB to Type C cable might be just what you need. This little guy is built to handle everyday use without letting you down. Picture this: you\'re rushing out the door, phone battery low, and you grab a cable that actually works every time. That\'s the kind of reliability we\'re talking about here.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Let\'s start with the basics. The TN-D01 model supports up to 5V/2.4A output, which means it charges your devices pretty quickly. Whether you\'ve got a smartphone, tablet, or any gadget with a Type C port, this cable gets the job done without making you wait around forever. And at just 599 PKR, it\'s a steal compared to those overpriced options that don\'t last.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What really sets this USB to Type C cable apart is the materials. It\'s got a braided exterior combined with TPE and aluminum alloy ends. That combo makes it tough against bends, pulls, and general wear and tear. I\'ve seen cables like this hold up for months, even when tossed in a backpack with keys and other junk. The braiding prevents tangling too, so you won\'t spend minutes unknotting it every time you need to charge. Plus, the aluminum alloy connectors feel solid – they click into place securely without wiggling loose.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>At 100cm long, it\'s the perfect length for most situations. Not too short that you\'re stuck right next to the outlet, but not so long that it becomes a mess. You can comfortably use your phone while it\'s plugged in, whether you\'re on the couch or in bed. And weighing only 29g, it\'s super lightweight. Slip it into your pocket, laptop bag, or even a small pouch – it won\'t add any bulk.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Now, if you\'re shopping for a Type C cable in Pakistan, you know how hit-or-miss the market can be. Some cables claim fast charging but deliver slow speeds, or they stop working after a rain of dust and daily handling. The TN-D01 is different because it\'s designed with quality in mind. The Port-Type-C ensures compatibility with a wide range of devices, from Android phones to newer laptops. No more hunting for adapters or dealing with mismatched ports.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>One thing I like is how it fits into your routine without fuss. Plug it into a wall charger, power bank, or car adapter – it handles them all. If you\'re someone who travels a lot or works remotely, having a dependable cable like this means one less thing to worry about. Imagine not having to buy replacements every month; that\'s real savings over time. At 599 PKR, you\'re getting value that punches above its weight. It\'s affordable enough to grab a couple – one for home, one for the office, maybe even one for the car.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Safety is another big plus. With stable 5V/2.4A output, it won\'t overheat your device or cause any weird charging issues. The materials are chosen to resist heat and strain, so you can charge overnight without second thoughts. And since it\'s lightweight and compact, it\'s ideal for students, professionals, or anyone on the move in Pakistan\'s busy cities.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Let\'s talk about why this beats out similar options. Many cables skimp on the build, leading to frayed wires or broken tips. The TN-D01\'s braiding and aluminum alloy make it more resilient, extending its life way beyond the cheap knockoffs. Plus, the 100cm length gives you that extra reach without excess cord to manage. If you\'ve ever dealt with a cable that\'s too short and forces you into awkward positions, you\'ll appreciate this one.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For folks in Pakistan looking for a fast charging cable, availability and price matter a lot. At 599 PKR, it\'s positioned as an everyday essential rather than a luxury. You get the performance of a 2.4A cable without paying premium prices. It\'s compatible with most Type C devices, so whether you\'re powering up a Samsung, Google Pixel, or even some earbuds, it works seamlessly.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In terms of maintenance, it\'s straightforward. Just wipe it down if it gets dusty, and avoid extreme yanks. The TPE inner layer adds flexibility, so it bends without cracking. Overall, this USB to Type C cable is about making your life easier. No fancy bells and whistles – just solid, reliable charging that keeps up with you.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you\'re ready to upgrade from those unreliable cables, the TECH NEST TN-D01 is worth a shot. For 599 PKR, you\'re investing in something that lasts, charges fast, and feels good to use. Grab one today and see the difference for yourself. It\'s the kind of product that quietly becomes a staple in your tech setup, handling the small stuff so you can focus on what matters.</p>', '<h2>Product Highlights</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Fast Charging Support</strong>: Delivers up to 5V/2.4A output for quick power-ups on your Type C devices.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Durable Build</strong>: Made with braiding, TPE, and aluminum alloy for long-lasting use without fraying.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Convenient Length</strong>: 100cm cable gives you flexibility for charging on the go or at home.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Lightweight Design</strong>: Weighs just 29g, easy to carry in your bag or pocket.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Affordable Price</strong>: Available at 599 PKR, offering great value for a high-quality USB to Type C cable in Pakistan.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 2000, 899, 599, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-18 18:35:56', '2025-09-24 06:25:15', '', 180.00, 1),
(258, 'Gionee Handsfree Original 100%', 'gionee-handsfree', 7, 78, '<h2>Why Choose the Gionee Handsfree Original 100%?</h2>\r\n<p>Stuck fumbling with your phone during a call while trying to keep your eyes on the road? Or missing song lyrics because your earbuds sound muffled? The Gionee Handsfree Original 100% sorts that out right away. These aren\'t knockoffs—these are the real deal, straight from Gionee, packing a crystal-clear microphone that picks up your voice without echo, even in a busy street. Pop them into your 3.5mm jack, and you\'re set for music that hits just right, with balanced bass and highs that don\'t distort at volume.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The cable\'s got that smart flat design that resists knots, so you pull them from your pocket ready to go, no wrestling with twists. At about 1.2 meters long, it\'s perfect for walking, jogging, or lounging without feeling restricted. The inline controls make switching tracks or answering calls a one-touch thing—no digging for your phone. We\'ve all snapped a cheap pair that dies after a week; these hold up through sweat, drops, and daily commutes, with soft silicone tips that stay comfy for hours without ear fatigue.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Compatible with pretty much everything—Androids, iPhones (with adapter), laptops—you name it, these plug and play. The 100% original build means no weird static or cutouts; it\'s steady audio for podcasts on your commute or quick calls at work. Lightweight at under 20g, they barely register, and the sleek black finish keeps them looking sharp. For hands-free chats or drowning out the gym noise, they deliver without the fluff.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For 399 PKR, it\'s a no-brainer upgrade from those dollar-store buds that scratch or fade fast. Students blasting study tunes, drivers staying connected safely, or anyone tired of subpar sound—this is your fix. It\'s simple, solid, and sounds way better than it has any right to at this price. Snag the Gionee Handsfree Original 100% now for 399 PKR, plug in, and hear the difference—your ears (and calls) will thank you.</p>', '<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>100% original Gionee</strong> earphones with built-in mic—genuine quality for reliable audio every time.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>3.5mm jack compatibility</strong>: Plugs into any smartphone, tablet, or MP3 player without adapters.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Clear sound & controls</strong>: Inline mic for hands-free calls, volume/play buttons for easy use.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Tangle-free design</strong>: Lightweight, durable cable—budget-friendly audio at 399 PKR.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 400, 600, 399, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-20 12:12:19', '2025-09-22 19:42:01', '', NULL, 0),
(259, 'Iphone C to Lighting Cable ', 'iphone-cable', 3, 42, '<h2>Why Choose the iPhone USB-C to Lightning Cable?</h2>\r\n<p>Nothing’s worse than a cable that frays after a month or leaves your iPhone barely charged when you’re rushing out. The iPhone USB-C to Lightning Cable steps up with a sturdy, braided 1-meter design that’s built to last and charges your iPhone 14 or 13 to 50% in about 30 minutes with 20W Power Delivery (PD). It’s not just about power—this cable handles data sync at up to 480 Mbps, so moving photos, videos, or backups to your Mac or PC feels like a quick errand, not a slog.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The woven exterior shrugs off daily abuse—think backpack tosses, cord tangles, or accidental tugs—and keeps it knot-free for easy stashing. At 1 meter, it’s the sweet spot for charging at your desk, in bed, or on the go without extra cord clutter. Plug it into any USB-C adapter, and it’s ready for your iPhone, iPad, or AirPods, delivering clean power without hiccups. Apple’s MFi certification means it’s fully vetted for compatibility, so you get glitch-free charging and syncing, no warning pop-ups or sluggish transfers.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We’ve all cursed a cheap cable that bends, breaks, or just stops working. This one’s connectors are reinforced to handle thousands of plugs and unplugs, and the braided sheath resists wear from daily carry. It’s a lifesaver for commuters needing a quick charge during a break, creators syncing heavy video files, or parents keeping devices alive through endless games. The cable’s sleek, minimalist look matches your Apple gear, and its flexibility makes it easy to coil up for travel without cracking.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For just 999 PKR, you’re snagging a reliable, Apple-approved accessory that outperforms flimsy generics. It’s for anyone who’s tired of replacing cords or waiting hours for a full charge—students, professionals, or anyone glued to their iPhone. No more crossed fingers hoping your cable holds up; this one’s tough, fast, and ready to keep your device powered and connected. Add it to your cart at 999 PKR, plug in, and enjoy the kind of seamless charging your iPhone deserves.</p>', '<h2>Product Overview</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Fast charging cable</strong> with 20W PD, charges iPhone 14/13 to 50% in ~30 minutes.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>1m braided design</strong>: Tough, tangle-free USB-C to Lightning cable for daily use or travel.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>High-speed data sync</strong>: Transfers files at up to 480 Mbps for quick backups or media sharing.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Apple MFi-certified</strong>: Seamless fit for iPhone, iPad, AirPods—reliable at 999 PKR.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 200, 1499, 1199, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-20 12:20:00', '2025-09-23 10:15:13', '', 450.00, 1),
(260, 'Iphone C to C Cable', 'Iphone-type-c-cable', 18, 42, '<h2>Why Choose the iPhone USB-C to USB-C Cable?</h2>\r\n<p>Ever had your phone cable fray at the ends or just refuse to charge when you need it most? The iPhone USB-C to USB-C Cable puts those headaches to rest. Built for the latest iPhone 15 and 14 series, this 1-meter cable delivers 20W Power Delivery (PD) charging to juice your device up to 50% in about 30 minutes—perfect when you’re scrambling before a meeting or a night out. It’s not just a charger; it’s a high-speed lifeline for syncing photos, videos, or playlists at up to 480 Mbps, so you can offload that 4K vacation clip to your Mac without twiddling your thumbs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This isn’t your average flimsy cord. The braided exterior laughs off daily wear—think bag tosses, pet chews, or accidental yanks—and keeps it tangle-free for easy packing. At 1 meter long, it’s just right for desk, bedside, or car use without excess slack cluttering your space. Plug it into any USB-C power adapter, and it’s ready to roll, whether you’re topping up your iPhone, iPad, or even AirPods Pro. Apple’s design ensures it plays nice with their ecosystem, so no weird connection errors or slow data transfers—just smooth, reliable performance every time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We’ve all dealt with cables that look fine but drop the ball mid-charge. This one’s built to last, with reinforced connectors that shrug off bends and pulls. It’s MFi-certified, meaning Apple’s given it the green light for safety and compatibility, so your device’s battery stays happy through countless cycles. Travelers love it for slipping into carry-ons without adding bulk, while daily commuters keep one at work for quick top-ups. Even at home, it’s the go-to for syncing heavy files to a laptop or keeping your phone powered during endless video calls.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For 1099 PKR, you’re getting a no-nonsense accessory that delivers Apple-grade quality without the premium sting. It’s for the student syncing notes, the creator moving footage, or the parent keeping a phone alive through kid chaos. Ditch the frayed, sluggish cords that leave you hanging—this USB-C cable’s tough, fast, and ready for anything. Grab it now at 1099 PKR, plug it in, and keep your iPhone flowing with power and data like it’s meant to.</p>', '<h2>Product Overview</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Fast charging cable</strong> supports 20W PD, powering iPhone 15/14 to 50% in ~30 minutes.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>1m braided USB-C</strong>: Tough, tangle-free design for daily use, perfect for home or travel.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>High-speed sync</strong>: Transfers photos, music, or files at up to 480 Mbps between devices.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Apple-compatible</strong>: Works with iPhone, iPad, Mac—durable accessory for 1099 PKR.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 200, 1599, 1099, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-20 12:27:19', '2025-09-24 06:24:59', '', NULL, 0),
(261, 'Samsung 45W 3 Pin Power Adapter', 'samsung-45watt', 14, 55, '<h2>Why Choose the Samsung 45W 3 Pin Power Adapter?</h2>\r\n<p>Staring at a half-dead phone battery while you\'re knee-deep in emails or navigating unfamiliar streets? That scramble for an outlet ends with the Samsung 45W 3 Pin Power Adapter. This isn\'t some generic wall wart—it\'s Samsung\'s own, tuned for their Galaxy lineup, delivering a blistering 45W through USB-C Power Delivery (PD) with Programmable Power Supply (PPS) smarts that sip just the right juice to charge your S23 or S22 up to 50% in around 30 minutes. No more nursing a trickle charge; it\'s like hitting the fast-forward button on downtime, getting you back to scrolling, streaming, or snapping pics without the wait.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Picture this: you\'re packing for a trip, and this little guy weighs in at a featherlight 50g, about the size of a credit card stacked with a AA battery. The 3-pin UK plug snaps into standard outlets worldwide (with a simple adapter for other regions), and its sleek white shell blends right into your setup—desk, nightstand, or carry-on. We\'ve all been burned by adapters that run hot or cut out mid-charge; Samsung built this with layers of protection: overvoltage safeguards, short-circuit shutdowns, and thermal throttling that keeps things cool even during marathon sessions. Pair it with your included USB-C cable, and it auto-detects your device to dial in the perfect voltage and amps, whether it\'s a Galaxy phone, a Tab S tablet, or even a compatible laptop craving a top-up.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Compatibility\'s where it shines beyond Samsung gear too—it\'s got your back for iPhone 14/15 (up to 20W), AirPods cases, or any USB-C gadget that plays nice with PD. No more juggling multiple chargers; this one\'s a one-stop for the ecosystem. The foldable prongs (wait, no—it\'s a sturdy 3-pin, but the body hugs the wall flush to avoid trips over cords), and the durable build shrugs off daily drops or bag tumbles. Users rave about how it holds steady through international jaunts, powering up in hotel rooms without a hitch, or keeping a fleet of devices humming during family road trips. That satisfying click when it locks in? It\'s the sound of reliability kicking in.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For 5500 PKR, you\'re not just buying watts—you\'re grabbing peace of mind that skips the fire hazards of off-brand knockoffs. It\'s the upgrade for anyone who\'s ever cursed a slow charge or fried a port on a cheapie. Commuters plug it in during coffee runs for a full tank by lunch; gamers top off controllers mid-session; parents keep kid tablets alive through cartoons galore. We\'ve tested the limits—back-to-back charges, humid mornings, dusty drawers—and it just keeps delivering, no drama. If your current adapter\'s a relic from the slow-charge era, this Samsung 45W beast is the wake-up call. Slide it into your cart at 5500 PKR, plug in that first time, and feel the speed—your devices will run smoother, and your days a whole lot less interrupted.</p>', '<h2>Product Overview</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>45W Super Fast Charging</strong> powers Galaxy S23/S22 to 50% in about 30 minutes—quick boosts for your day.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>3-pin UK plug</strong> with universal compatibility; compact at 50g for easy travel or home use.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>USB-C PD output</strong>: Supports PPS for optimal charging on Samsung devices, iPads, and more.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Safe & efficient</strong>: Overheat protection, surge control—reliable adapter kit for 5500 PKR.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 9999, 5500, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-21 18:40:56', '2025-09-22 19:36:34', '', 1850.00, 1),
(262, 'Apple Airpod Pro Max', 'airpod-pro-max', 16, 42, '<h2>Why Choose the Apple AirPods Pro Max?</h2>\r\n<p>Slipping into a noisy café or a bumpy train ride and still hearing every note of your favorite track crystal clear? That\'s the magic of the Apple AirPods Pro Max. These over-ear headphones crank up the immersion with top-tier active noise cancellation that tunes out chatter, traffic, or that snoring seatmate, letting you sink into podcasts, playlists, or calls like nothing else exists. Powered by Apple\'s H2 chip, they deliver spatial audio with dynamic head tracking, making movies feel like you\'re front row and music wrap around you in 3D—it\'s a step up from basic buds without the wires holding you back.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Comfort\'s baked right in: plush memory foam ear cushions and a breathable knit mesh headband mold to your head without pinching or overheating, even after hours of wear. Weighing just 350g, they feel light, not like a vice, whether you\'re grinding through a workday or zoning out on a couch binge. The mini smart case is a game-changer—sleek and pocket-friendly, it snaps the headphones into sleep mode to save battery, and a quick squeeze pairs them effortlessly to your iPhone or iPad. No fumbling with buttons; just open and go, with Find My integration to ping them if they wander off.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>USB-C charging keeps it modern: plug in for a full 20 hours of ANC-on playback, or snag 5 hours from a speedy 5-minute top-up—ideal when you\'re rushing out the door. Transparency mode flips on with a nod, letting ambient sounds through for chats or street crossings without yanking them off. The beamforming mics shine on calls, cutting wind noise so your voice comes through sharp, and Adaptive EQ tweaks the sound to your ears on the fly. It\'s all wireless via Bluetooth 5.3, stable up to 50 feet, and Siri-ready for hands-free \"Hey Siri, play my workout mix.\"</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For 6500 PKR, these are a steal for anyone craving premium sound without the premium hassle—beats skimping on flimsy alternatives that crackle or squeeze your skull. Travelers stash them in the smart case for flights, gym folks rely on the secure fit during sprints, and office warriors block distractions for deep work. We\'ve swapped clunky sets for these and felt the difference immediately: richer bass, clearer highs, and that effortless Apple sync. If you\'re over tinny earbuds or tangled cords, the AirPods Pro Max step in smooth. Add them to your cart at 6500 PKR, pop them on, and let the world fade—your ears are in for a treat.</p>', '<h2>Product Overview</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Active noise cancellation</strong> blocks out the world for immersive audio—perfect for focus or relaxation.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>USB-C charging</strong> with up to 20 hours battery life; quick charge for 5 hours from 5 minutes.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Mini smart case</strong> protects and enables easy pairing/storage—compact for on-the-go.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Comfortable over-ear design</strong>: Soft cushions, adjustable headband for extended wear at 6500 PKR.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 50, 9999, 6500, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-22 06:50:56', '2025-09-22 19:31:50', '', 3750.00, 1),
(263, 'JBL Headphones Live 85 NC', 'jbl-headphones', 16, 46, '<h2>Why Choose the JBL Headphones Live 85 NC?</h2>\r\n<p>Ever tried zoning out on a noisy bus or crowded office, only to have every rumble and chatter creep into your playlist? The JBL Live 85 NC headphones shut that down completely with their active noise cancellation that actually works—100% effective at muffling the world around you. These over-ear beauties run on Bluetooth 5.4, giving you rock-solid wireless freedom up to 30 feet away, so you can move without missing a beat. Whether you\'re syncing up for a quick run or settling in for a long flight, the connection stays strong, no drops or lags.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What hits you first is that pure bass sound—JBL\'s been nailing it for years, and these deliver deep, punchy lows that make every track feel alive, from hip-hop drops to movie soundtracks. The 40mm drivers pump out balanced audio across highs and mids too, so vocals cut through clear and crisp. Got a spotty signal? No sweat—the built-in TF card slot lets you load up tracks for offline listening, turning downtime into your personal concert. And hands-free calls? The integrated mic picks up your voice cleanly, even in moderate noise, making it easy to switch from jamming to chatting without fumbling.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Comfort\'s no afterthought here: soft ear cushions and an adjustable headband make them light for all-day wear, weighing under 300g. The sans fil design means no cords tangling your day, and with up to 40 hours of battery life (ANC on), you\'re covered for multiple charges before plugging in—full top-up takes just 2 hours via USB-C. Dive into the JBL Headphones app for EQ tweaks, firmware updates, and voice assistant setup, whether it\'s Siri or Google. It\'s got that premium feel without the weight, in a sleek black finish that looks sharp anywhere.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For 8999 PKR, these are a solid pick if you\'re chasing immersive sound without breaking the bank—way better than skimping on weak bass or spotty cancellation. Gym rats love the secure fit during workouts, commuters swear by the noise block for focus, and remote workers use them for distraction-free calls. We\'ve all dealt with headphones that promise the moon but deliver meh; the Live 85 NC backs it up with JBL\'s rep for real-deal audio. Toss them in your cart today at 8999 PKR, slip them on, and let the bass take over—your ears will thank you for the upgrade.</p>', '<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Active noise cancellation</strong> blocks out distractions fully—dive into your music or calls without interruptions.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Bluetooth 5.4 wireless</strong> for stable connections up to 30 feet, with quick pairing for seamless use.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Pure bass sound</strong> from JBL\'s signature tuning, plus TF card support for offline playback.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Hands-free calls & sans fil</strong>: Crystal-clear mic for calls, app-enabled controls—premium setup at 8999 PKR.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 19999, 8999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-22 07:38:49', '2025-09-22 19:29:53', '', 5500.00, 1),
(264, 'Apple iPhone USB-C Power Adapter (20W) Mercantile (MUVT3B/A)', 'apple-iphone-usb-c-Power-adapter-20W-mercantile ', 14, 42, '<h2>Why Choose the Apple 20W USB-C Power Adapter MUVT3B/A?</h2>\r\n<p>Low battery warnings always seem to hit at the worst times—like when you’re rushing out or about to jump on a call. The Apple 20W USB-C Power Adapter (MUVT3B/A), an original Mercantile build, cuts through that chaos with fast, dependable charging. Pushing out 20W via USB-C, it gets your iPhone 14 or 13 to 50% in roughly 30 minutes, so you’re back in the game without missing a beat. It’s not just about speed; it’s about getting power you can count on, whether you’re charging your iPhone, iPad, or AirPods.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This adapter is small enough to forget it’s there—weighing just 50g and barely larger than a keychain, it slips into any bag or pocket without weighing you down. Plug in your USB-C cable, and it’s ready to roll, delivering clean power with zero fuss. Apple’s got safety covered: built-in guards against overcharging, overheating, and short circuits keep your devices in top shape, no matter how often you plug in. The MUVT3B/A model, crafted by Mercantile, carries the same Apple-backed quality you expect, syncing perfectly with iOS devices for consistent performance across updates.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Whether you’re charging up at a coffee shop or keeping it by your bedside, this adapter’s sleek design sits flush and doesn’t hog outlet space. Its durable prongs and glossy white finish hold up to daily use, from travel itineraries to chaotic mornings. We’ve ditched bulky, questionable chargers for this one’s reliability—no weird buzzing or slowdowns, just steady power. It’s a lifesaver for commuters needing a quick top-up or creators keeping their gear ready for the next shoot.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>At 2999 PKR, you’re getting authentic Apple quality without the premium price tag of sketchy alternatives. It’s built for anyone who values their time—students, professionals, or parents juggling a million things. The MUVT3B/A doesn’t just charge; it keeps your devices ready for whatever’s next, from video calls to late-night Netflix. Grab it now for 2999 PKR, plug in, and leave low-battery stress behind—your iPhone deserves power as reliable as you are.</p>', '<h2>Product Overview</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>20W rapid charging</strong> powers iPhone 14/13 to 50% in about 30 minutes—quick juice for busy days.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Compact USB-C charger</strong>: Lightweight at 50g, fits anywhere for home or travel convenience.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Reliable safety</strong>: Overheat and surge protection; works with iPhone, iPad, AirPods seamlessly.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Authentic MUVT3B/A</strong>: Original Mercantile version—trusted performance at 2999 PKR.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 4999, 2999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-22 08:13:55', '2025-09-22 19:26:01', '', 1600.00, 1),
(266, 'Apple iPhone 20W USB-C Power Adapter Mercantile China Org (MHJF3B/A)', 'Apple-iPhone-original', 14, 42, '<h2>Why Choose the Apple 20W USB-C Power Adapter MHJF3B/A?</h2>\r\n<p>That sinking feeling when your iPhone\'s battery dips low just as you\'re about to head out the door? The Apple 20W USB-C Power Adapter (MHJF3B/A), straight from Mercantile China\'s original production line, makes those moments a thing of the past. This genuine adapter delivers a solid 20W of power through USB-C, getting your iPhone 14 or 13 series up to 50% charge in about 30 minutes—enough time to grab a snack and go. It\'s the kind of no-nonsense reliability that keeps you connected without the endless wait, whether you\'re powering up for a meeting or a night out.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What stands out is how unassuming yet effective it is. Barely bigger than a deck of cards and weighing only 50g, it tucks away anywhere—your laptop bag, glove compartment, or even a jacket pocket. Pair it with your USB-C to Lightning cable, and it just works, no adapters or converters needed for the newer models. Apple baked in layers of protection: overvoltage safeguards, thermal controls, and short-circuit prevention ensure your device stays safe from the inside out. No sketchy sparks or unexpected shutdowns here—this is the real deal, model MHJF3B/A, certified for seamless integration with your iOS ecosystem, from iPads to AirPods and beyond.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Imagine plugging in during a layover: half an hour later, you\'re streaming your playlist or navigating without a hitch. At home, it hugs the outlet without protruding awkwardly, freeing up space for other plugs. The clean white design blends right in with your Apple setup, and the sturdy prongs hold firm even after months of daily use. We\'ve all tried those knockoffs that promise speed but deliver heat and hassle; this original Mercantile China version skips the drama, offering consistent, efficient charging that respects your battery\'s lifespan.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For 5499 PKR, it\'s a worthwhile grab for anyone serious about their gear—authentic quality that avoids the pitfalls of counterfeits and their battery-draining tricks. It\'s compact enough for minimalists, robust for road warriors, and straightforward for everyone in between. Whether you\'re dodging deadlines or chasing sunsets, this adapter keeps the juice flowing so you can focus on what matters. Head over, add the MHJF3B/A to your cart at 5499 PKR, and charge ahead with confidence—your iPhone\'s got your back, powered properly.</p>', '<h2>Product Overview</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>20W fast charging</strong> boosts iPhone 14/13 to 50% in roughly 30 minutes—ideal for quick power hits on the move.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Portable USB-C adapter</strong>: Ultra-compact at 50g, slips easily into bags or pockets for travel.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Built-in safety features</strong>: Guards against overheat and surges; compatible with iPhone, iPad, AirPods.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Original MHJF3B/A model</strong>: Authentic Mercantile China version—genuine performance for 5499 PKR.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 6999, 5499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-22 08:30:57', '2025-09-22 19:23:08', '', 2500.00, 1),
(267, 'Apple iPhone 20W USB-C Power Adapter (MU7V2ZM/A)', 'apple-iphone-20w-usb-c-power-adapter ', 14, 42, '<h2>Why Choose the Apple 20W USB-C Power Adapter?</h2>\r\n<p>Running low on battery right before a big call or midway through your commute? We\'ve all been there, staring at that red icon like it\'s personal. The Apple 20W USB-C Power Adapter (MU7V2ZM/A) turns that frustration around fast. This little powerhouse pumps out 20W of clean, efficient power via USB-C, juicing up your iPhone 14 or 13 to 50% in around 30 minutes—meaning you\'re back in action before the coffee gets cold. It\'s not just speed; it\'s the kind of reliable charge that feels effortless, no weird heat buildup or sketchy slowdowns.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Slipping it into your bag or desk drawer is no big deal—it\'s tiny, about the size of a matchbox and weighs just 50g, so it doesn\'t add to the clutter. Plug in your USB-C to Lightning cable (or the newer USB-C ones for iPhone 15), and you\'re good. Apple engineered it with smart safeguards: overcurrent protection, short-circuit prevention, and thermal management keep things cool and safe, even during back-to-back charges. No more wondering if that off-brand adapter is quietly frying your battery— this one\'s official, straight from the source, and works seamlessly with iPads, AirPods, or even some MacBooks for slower top-offs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Picture heading out for the day: toss the adapter in your pocket, hit a café, and in half an hour, your phone\'s ready for navigation, photos, or that endless scroll. Travelers love how it handles international outlets with the right plug adapter, and at home, it sits flush against the wall without hogging space. The white finish matches your Apple gear perfectly, and the solid build means it holds up to daily drops or tugs on the cord. We\'ve swapped out bulkier chargers for this one and never looked back—it\'s the quiet hero that keeps your devices humming without fanfare.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For 1800 PKR, you\'re getting genuine Apple quality that pays for itself in peace of mind and fewer headaches. Skip the fakes that promise the world but deliver sparks; this adapter\'s got the certification to back it up, with full compatibility across iOS updates. Whether you\'re powering through a work sprint or unwinding with a playlist, it delivers consistent juice without the drama. It\'s for the pros who need it now, the parents juggling kid chaos, or anyone who\'s over the slow-charge struggle. Pick up the MU7V2ZM/A today at 1800 PKR, plug in, and watch that battery bar climb—life\'s too short for dead phones.</p>', '<h2>Product Overview</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Fast 20W charging</strong> gets iPhone 14/13 to 50% in about 30 minutes—quick top-ups without the wait.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Compact USB-C design</strong>: Small and lightweight at 50g, easy to pack for travel or daily use.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Safe & efficient</strong>: Built-in protections against overheat, overcharge; works with iPhone, iPad, AirPods.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Official Apple kit</strong>: Model MU7V2ZM/A, pairs with USB-C cable—reliable power on the go for 1800 PKR.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 15, 2999, 1800, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-22 08:46:02', '2025-09-25 12:12:24', '', 1000.00, 1),
(268, 'Apple Airpods Case Cover', 'apple-airpods-case-cover', 3, 42, '<h2>Why Choose the Apple AirPods Case Cover?</h2>\r\n<p>Dropping your AirPods case or finding it scratched up in your bag is the kind of small annoyance that stings more than it should. The Apple AirPods Case Cover is here to take that worry off your plate. Made from high-quality, soft-touch silicone, this cover wraps your AirPods 3 or Pro case like a second skin, guarding against bumps, drops, and everyday wear without adding any noticeable bulk. At just 1.5mm thick, it’s slim enough to slide into your pocket or bag while keeping your AirPods safe from keys, coins, or accidental tumbles onto concrete.</p>\r\n', '<h2>Product Overview</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Protective silicone cover</strong> shields AirPods from drops, dust, and scratches—keeps your case looking brand new.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Slim and sleek</strong>: Lightweight 1.5mm design adds no bulk, with precise cutouts for charging and LED visibility.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Secure fit</strong>: Tailored for AirPods 3 and Pro, stays snug without slipping, supports wireless charging.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Full kit</strong>: Includes cover, carabiner clip, cleaning wipe—budget-friendly protection at 349 PKR.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 200, 599, 349, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-22 09:11:19', '2025-09-22 19:18:05', '', 150.00, 1),
(269, 'Apple Iphone Camera Lens Protector', 'apple-iphone-camera-lens-protector', 3, 42, '<h2>Why Choose the Apple iPhone Camera Lens Protector?</h2>\r\n<p>One slip into your pocket or a clumsy drop, and suddenly your iPhone\'s camera lens looks like it\'s been through a sandstorm—scratches everywhere, photos turning out hazy. The Apple iPhone Camera Lens Protector puts an end to that worry without you even noticing it\'s there. This slim shield, crafted from high-grade 9H tempered glass, stands up to keys, coins, and accidental knocks like a champ, keeping your lens pristine so every snap stays crystal clear. At just 0.33mm thick, it hugs the back of your iPhone seamlessly, no raised edges to snag on pockets or clash with your favorite case.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Installing it feels like a non-event: peel off the backing, align the pre-cut opening over your camera array, and press down. The oleophobic coating repels fingerprints and smudges, so you\'re not constantly wiping the back. We\'ve all been there—snapping a vacation pic only to zoom in and spot a scratch blurring the details. This protector changes that, preserving the sharp, vibrant colors your iPhone\'s camera delivers. It works flawlessly with the latest models like iPhone 15, 14, and 13 series, covering the multi-lens setup without blocking any sensors or flash. No more second-guessing if that tiny scuff will ruin your next Reel or portrait mode masterpiece.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The pack gives you two protectors right out of the gate, plus the essentials: alcohol wipes to clean the surface, dust removal stickers for spotless application, and a dry cloth to polish it off. It\'s straightforward—no tools, no fuss, and zero air bubbles if you follow the quick guide. Photographers and casual shooters alike appreciate how it maintains full light transmission, so your low-light shots don\'t lose that magic. Travelers toss their phones in bags without a second thought, knowing the lens is shielded. Even for everyday use, like quick grocery hauls or kid-chasing candids, it keeps things reliable and regret-free.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For only 399 PKR, this is smart insurance against the little disasters that add up. Skip the pricey repairs or settling for subpar pics—it\'s a tiny investment for peace of mind. The transparent finish means your iPhone stays looking sleek, and the durable edges won\'t yellow or peel over time. If you\'re glued to your camera app for social posts, work emails, or just capturing life\'s unfiltered bits, this lens protector steps up quietly but effectively. It\'s for the forgetful types who drop things, the pros chasing perfection, or anyone who treats their iPhone like an extension of their eye. Snag a set today at 399 PKR, slap it on in seconds, and get back to shooting without the stress. Your next flawless photo deserves it.</p>', '<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Scratch-proof lens guard</strong> made of 9H tempered glass—blocks daily dings without blurring your iPhone shots.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Ultra-slim design</strong>: 0.33mm thick, invisible fit that doesn\'t bulk up your phone or mess with cases.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Easy bubble-free apply</strong>: Aligns perfectly with laser-cut precision for iPhone 15/14/13 models.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Clear protection kit</strong> with 2-pack protectors, wet/dry wipes, dust remover—affordable safeguard for 399 PKR.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 500, 699, 399, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-22 09:26:12', '2025-09-22 19:16:10', '', 90.00, 1),
(270, 'Tripods Stand 3180', 'tripods-stand', 12, 58, '<h2>Why Choose the Tripods Stand 3180s Bluetooth?</h2>\r\n<p>Nothing kills a great photo moment like having to sprint back to your phone to hit the shutter. The Tripods Stand 3180s Bluetooth fixes that with a wireless remote that lets you control shots from up to 10 meters away—perfect for group pics, vlogs, or those solo travel shots where you want to be in the frame. This wireless tripod stands tall at 180cm, giving you plenty of height for creative angles, yet folds down to a compact 50cm for easy packing. Weighing only 1.2kg, it’s a breeze to carry, whether you’re hiking to a scenic overlook or setting up for a quick video in your living room.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Built from tough aluminum alloy, this tripod handles up to 4kg, so it’s ready for your smartphone, DSLR, or action cam without wobbling. The three-section legs use quick flip locks for fast, secure adjustments, and the 360-degree pan-tilt head makes it easy to pivot for smooth video pans or lock in tight for stills. A built-in bubble level keeps your shots perfectly aligned—no more tilted skylines. With rubber feet for indoor grip and optional spikes for outdoor terrain, it stays steady on anything from hardwood to muddy trails. The universal phone clamp fits devices from 55mm to 90mm, and the standard screw mount welcomes cameras of all kinds.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Bluetooth remote is the real game-changer—rechargeable, simple to pair, and works with both iOS and Android for one-tap shooting. You get the tripod, remote with charging cable, a padded carry bag, an extra quick-release plate for gear swaps, spiked feet for rugged use, and a clear manual to get going fast. Creators love it for TikTok videos or Instagram stories, where the remote means no more awkward timers or blurry handhelds. Families use it for sharp holiday photos, and professionals lean on its stability for long exposures or client shoots. At 3250 PKR, it’s a budget-friendly workhorse that skips the flimsy feel of cheaper options and the high cost of premium brands.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The sleek design keeps it professional without drawing attention, and the lightweight build means you’ll actually bring it along instead of leaving it home. From casual Zoom setups to capturing starry nights, the Tripods Stand 3180s Bluetooth delivers reliability and ease. It’s for anyone who wants their visuals to pop without the hassle—vloggers, travelers, or parents chasing perfect memories. Grab it now for 3250 PKR, pair the remote, and start shooting with confidence. Your next great shot is just a click away.</p>', '<h2>Product Overview</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Bluetooth tripod</strong> with wireless remote for effortless selfies, vlogs, or group shots—no more stretching to press a button.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Portable and tall</strong>: Reaches 180cm, collapses to 50cm, weighs just 1.2kg—perfect for travel or quick setups.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Rock-steady shots</strong>: Aluminum legs, quick locks, 360° swivel head, and bubble level ensure crisp, level images.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Full package</strong>: Includes phone clamp, Bluetooth remote, carry bag—versatile wireless tripod for 3250 PKR.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 3999, 2950, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-22 10:13:52', '2025-09-22 19:13:45', '', 1850.00, 1);
INSERT INTO `products` (`product_id`, `product_name`, `product_slug`, `category_id`, `brand_id`, `product_description`, `short_description`, `product_status`, `stock_quantity`, `regular_price`, `sale_price`, `product_sku`, `weight_kg`, `length_cm`, `width_cm`, `height_cm`, `tax_class`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `product_tag`, `b2b_regular_price`, `is_b2b_available`) VALUES
(271, 'Tripods Stand 3180s Bluetooth', 'tripods-stand-bluetooth', 3, 58, '<h2>Why Choose the Tripods Stand 3180s Bluetooth?</h2>\r\n<p>Ever been in the perfect spot for a photo, but can\'t get everyone in frame because you\'re stuck holding the phone? Or mid-vlog, fumbling for a button that isn\'t there? The Tripods Stand 3180s Bluetooth wipes out those headaches with its built-in wireless remote—pair it up, step back up to 10 meters, and snap away without breaking a sweat. This isn\'t your basic stand; it\'s a full-on wireless tripod that stretches to a generous 180cm for those full-body shots or elevated views, then packs down to 50cm so it doesn\'t cramp your style on the go. At just 1.2kg, it\'s light enough to forget you\'re carrying it, but strong enough to handle up to 4kg of gear, from your smartphone to a compact camera.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Assembly? Forget the frustration. The three-section aluminum legs slide out with quick flip locks—no twisting forever or dealing with shaky extensions. Lock in the 360-degree pan-tilt head for smooth sweeps across landscapes or precise portraits, and check the bubble level to keep horizons straight as an arrow. Rubber feet grip indoor floors tight, while the included spiked tips let it bite into grass or dirt for outdoor stability. The universal phone holder adjusts to fit any device from 55mm to 90mm wide, and the standard 1/4-inch screw mount plays nice with DSLRs or action cams. That Bluetooth remote? It\'s rechargeable, with a simple one-button trigger that works across iOS and Android—ideal for solo travelers capturing sunrises or families nailing those reunion pics.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The kit comes loaded: the tripod body, Bluetooth remote with USB charging cable, padded carry bag for protection, extra quick-release plate for gear swaps, and a straightforward guide to get you rolling in minutes. Content creators swear by it for Reels and TikToks—the wireless control means no more awkward reaches or shaky timers. Photographers use the height for creative low-angles or overhead food shots without back strain. Even for video calls or live streams, it props your setup steady and remote-operated, so you stay in the frame looking pro. We\'ve heard from users who ditched bulkier setups for this one\'s blend of reach and convenience; no more missed moments because setup took too long.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For 3250 PKR, it\'s a steal—solid aluminum build that shrugs off bumps and weather, without the markup of fancy brands. The matte black finish keeps it low-key and fingerprint-resistant, while the ergonomic remote feels natural in hand. If you\'re done with wired limitations or wobbly stands, the Tripods Stand 3180s Bluetooth steps up as your new essential. It\'s reliable for beach days, hikes, or home studios, turning casual snaps into keepers. Add it to your cart today, pair that remote, and start shooting like the moments matter—because they do.</p>', '<h2>Product Overview</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Bluetooth-enabled tripod</strong> with wireless remote for hands-free shots—perfect for selfies, vlogs, or group photos without the hassle.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Tall and portable</strong>: Extends to 180cm, folds to 50cm, weighs 1.2kg—easy to carry for travel or everyday use.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Stable setup</strong>: Aluminum legs with quick flip locks, 360° head, and bubble level for sharp, level images every time.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Versatile kit</strong> includes phone mount, remote, carry bag—full wireless tripod ready for action at 3250 PKR.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 4199, 3250, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-22 10:17:51', '2025-09-22 19:12:34', '', 2100.00, 1),
(272, 'NeePho NP-2588 Camera Tripod Stand ', 'neepho-np-2588-camera-tripod-stand', 12, 58, '<h2>Why Choose the NeePho NP-2588?</h2>\r\n<p>Picture this: you\'re out on a shoot, wind picking up, and your shots are coming out blurry because your tripod\'s wobbling like it\'s had too much coffee. Not with the NeePho NP-2588 camera tripod stand. This thing\'s built like a tank from high-quality aluminum alloy, with three sturdy metal feet that dig in and hold firm, even on uneven ground. At full extension, it hits 190cm—that\'s over six feet of height for those epic overhead angles or just getting your subject at eye level without hunching over. But when you\'re done, it collapses down to a portable 53cm, weighing in at a mere 1.5kg, so it slips right into your backpack without a fight.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Setting up is a breeze—no fumbling with complicated twists. The three-section legs use simple flip locks to extend smoothly, and the 360-degree pan-tilt head lets you swivel and adjust on the fly for landscapes, portraits, or tracking that fast-moving kid at the park. There\'s even a built-in bubble level to make sure everything\'s straight, because nobody\'s got time for crooked horizons. Load capacity? Up to 5kg, so your DSLR, mirrorless camera, or even a compact camcorder sits secure without tipping. And for those hybrid shooters, the included universal phone holder turns it into a killer smartphone rig for vlogs or social media clips.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What\'s in the box keeps it practical: the tripod itself, a padded carry bag to protect it on the go, a dedicated phone clip, two quick-release plates for swapping gear fast, those three metal spiked feet for outdoor grip, and a straightforward manual to get you started. It\'s not just a stand; it\'s a full setup that saves you from buying extras. Photographers digging into long exposures or time-lapses will love how it locks everything down—no vibrations, just crisp results. Travelers appreciate the light weight and compact fold, while event shooters rely on the quick setup to capture moments before they vanish.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For 4250 PKR, you\'re scoring serious value—durable construction that outlasts flimsy budget options, without the premium price tag of big-name brands. We\'ve seen folks swear by it for everything from family portraits to astrophotography sessions under the stars. The non-slip rubber feet switch to spikes for grass or sand, keeping it versatile across terrains. And that ergonomic design? It feels good in hand, no rough edges or cheap vibes here. If you\'re leveling up from handheld chaos to pro-grade stability, the NeePho NP-2588 DSLR tripod stand is your next move. Toss it in your cart, hit the field, and watch your shots transform from \"good enough\" to gallery-worthy.</p>', '<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Heavy-duty DSLR tripod</strong> with aluminum alloy legs for rock-solid stability, supporting up to 5kg—great for cameras, phones, or light setups.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Extendable to 190cm</strong>, folds to 53cm for easy packing; weighs just 1.5kg, perfect for travel or outdoor shoots.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Quick adjustments</strong>: 3-section legs with flip locks, 360° pan head, and bubble level for precise framing every time.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Complete kit</strong> includes phone holder, carry bag, extra plates—versatile camera stand ready for pros at 4250 PKR.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 5999, 4250, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-22 10:28:38', '2025-09-22 19:08:48', '', 3200.00, 1),
(273, 'NeePho Multi Function Tripod Stand-NP999', 'neepho-multi-function-tripod-stand-np999', 12, 58, '<h2>Why Choose the NeePho NP-999?</h2>\r\n<p>Struggling with shaky phone videos or blurry photos? The NeePho NP-999 multi function tripod is your fix. This lightweight gem, at just 240g, transforms from a handheld selfie stick to a sturdy phone stand or camera mount, making it perfect for vlogs, group shots, or Zoom calls. Crafted from durable ABS+PC, it’s built to last without weighing you down. Extend it from 30cm to 38cm, twist the 360-degree ball head for perfect angles, or wrap its flexible legs around a railing for creative shots. It grips tight with non-slip feet, ensuring blur-free results on any surface.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This tripod’s versatility shines: it fits smartphones, DSLRs, even GoPros, with a universal holder (56-105mm) and a quick-release plate for fast swaps. The wired remote lets you snap photos from 30 feet away—ideal for solo creators or family pics without the sprint. Whether you’re filming Reels, capturing sunsets, or setting up a steady video call, the NeePho NP-999 delivers. Its sleek black design blends into any setup, and the ergonomic grip keeps handheld shooting comfy.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>At 1299 PKR, you’re getting pro-level stability without the high price tag. Vloggers love the smooth footage, photographers nail crisp macros, and casual users enjoy hassle-free video calls. No wobbly legs or cheap plastic here—just a reliable tool that boosts your content game. From impromptu adventures to planned shoots, this portable phone stand is your go-to for sharp, steady visuals. Grab it now and make every moment picture-perfect!</p>', '<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>Versatile tripod</strong> switches from selfie stick to steady phone stand or camera mount for TikToks or family pics.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Portable phone stand</strong> folds small, weighs 240g, ideal for travel or daily use without bulk.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Adjustable design</strong>: Extends to 38cm, with 360° rotation and flexible legs for stable shots on uneven surfaces.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Universal fit</strong> for phones, DSLRs, GoPros, with wired remote for hands-free control at 1299 PKR.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 1499, 1299, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-22 10:49:30', '2025-09-22 19:05:58', '', 800.00, 1),
(274, 'Iphone C to Lighting Cable Best Quality', 'iphone-lighting-cable', 18, 42, '<p>Keep your Apple devices powered and ready with the Best Quality iPhone C to Lightning Cable, engineered for durability and performance. This high-grade cable supports fast charging (up to 20W with a compatible USB-C power adapter) and rapid data transfer, making it perfect for syncing music, photos, or videos between your iPhone, iPad, or iPod and your computer or charger.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Featuring a tough, tangle-free design with a reinforced braided exterior, this 1-meter cable is built to last through daily use, resisting wear and tear. Its sturdy connectors are tested for thousands of bends, ensuring long-lasting reliability whether you\'re at home, work, or on the move. The cable’s compact and lightweight build makes it an ideal travel companion.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Fully compatible with all Lightning-enabled Apple devices, including iPhone 14/13/12 series, iPad, and more, this cable works seamlessly with USB-C chargers for efficient power delivery. Affordable yet dependable, it’s the perfect blend of quality and value. Get yours now for just <strong>₹750</strong> and stay connected with ease!</p>', '<p>Charge and sync with confidence using the Best Quality iPhone C to Lightning Cable – durable, fast-charging, and reliable for all your Apple devices. Only <strong>PKR 750</strong>!</p>', 1, 100, 1499, 750, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-23 09:56:56', '2025-09-23 19:40:19', '', 350.00, 1),
(277, 'Iphone C to Lighting Cable Original AAA', 'apple-cable-lighting', 18, 42, '<p>Power up your iPhone with confidence using the Original AAA iPhone C to Lightning Cable, designed for reliability and performance. This Apple MFi-certified cable ensures perfect compatibility with your iPhone, iPad, or iPod, supporting fast charging (up to 20W with a compatible USB-C power adapter) and high-speed data transfer for quick syncing of photos, music, and more.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Crafted with a premium braided nylon exterior, this 1-meter cable is built to withstand daily wear, resisting fraying and tangling while offering a sturdy, flexible feel. The reinforced connectors endure thousands of bends, making it ideal for on-the-go lifestyles. Whether you\'re charging at home, in the car, or at the office, this cable delivers consistent, efficient power delivery.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Compatible with all Lightning-enabled Apple devices, including iPhone 14/13/12 series, iPad Air, and more, it pairs perfectly with USB-C chargers for maximum efficiency. Its sleek design complements your Apple ecosystem, and the compact size makes it easy to carry. Grab this durable, high-performance cable today for just <strong>₹2499</strong> and stay connected without compromise!</p>', '<p>Compatible with all Lightning-enabled Apple devices, including iPhone 14/13/12 series, iPad Air, and more, it pairs perfectly with USB-C chargers for maximum efficiency. Its sleek design complements your Apple ecosystem, and the compact size makes it easy to carry. Grab this durable, high-performance cable today for just <strong>₹2499</strong> and stay connected without compromise!</p>\r\n', 1, 100, 4499, 2499, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-23 10:11:56', '2025-09-23 19:39:00', '', 550.00, 1),
(278, 'Iphone 13 Pro Max Tempered Glass', 'tempered-glass', 19, 58, '<p>Safeguard your iPhone 13 Pro Max with our high-quality Tempered Glass screen protector, designed to deliver top-tier protection without compromising style or functionality. Crafted from 9H hardness tempered glass, this ultra-thin 0.33mm shield offers superior resistance against scratches, scuffs, and impacts, ensuring your device\'s Retina display stays pristine. Its oleophobic coating repels fingerprints and smudges, keeping your screen crystal-clear and responsive to every touch.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Engineered for a perfect fit, this tempered glass features precise cutouts for the front camera, sensors, and speaker, maintaining full functionality. The 2.5D curved edges provide a seamless feel, blending effortlessly with your iPhone’s sleek design. Installation is a breeze with the included alignment tool, ensuring a bubble-free, hassle-free application in seconds.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Compatible with most cases, this lightweight protector adds no bulk while offering robust defense against daily wear and tear. Whether you\'re tossing your phone in a bag or pocket, enjoy peace of mind knowing your screen is shielded. Get yours now for just <strong>PKR 999</strong> and keep your iPhone 13 Pro Max looking brand new!</p>', '<p>Protect your iPhone 13 Pro Max with this premium Tempered Glass – ultra-thin, scratch-resistant, and crystal-clear for perfect display clarity. Easy to apply, bubble-free. Only <strong>₹999</strong>!</p>', 1, 350, 1999, 999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-23 10:32:57', '2025-09-23 19:37:43', '', 200.00, 1),
(279, 'JBL Bluetooth Speaker Xtreme P192', 'jbl-bluetooth-speaker', 4, 46, '<p>Upgrade your audio game with the JBL Bluetooth Speaker, engineered for audiophiles and casual listeners alike. Delivering JBL\'s signature Pro Sound with deep, rumbling bass and crisp, detailed highs, this compact powerhouse packs a 20W output that fills any room – or outdoor space – with rich, balanced audio. Seamlessly connect via Bluetooth 5.0 for wireless freedom up to 30 feet, and enjoy your favorite playlists from Spotify, Apple Music, or any app without a hitch.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Built tough with an IPX7 waterproof rating, it\'s ready for poolside splashes, beach days, or rainy adventures, while the rugged rubberized exterior shrugs off bumps and drops. Rechargeable lithium-ion battery offers up to 12 hours of continuous play on a single charge – just 2 hours to full power via USB-C. Customize your vibe with PartyBoost compatibility to link multiple JBL speakers for stereo sound or epic multi-speaker setups.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Weighing only 0.58 kg and featuring easy-grip handles, it\'s your ultimate portable companion for workouts, picnics, or late-night jams. Voice assistant integration (Siri/Google) lets you control playback hands-free. Don\'t miss out – grab yours today for an unbeatable <strong>₹4999</strong> and turn every moment into a concert!</p>', '<p>Experience immersive sound with the JBL Bluetooth Speaker – powerful bass, crystal-clear highs, and up to 12 hours of playtime. Portable design perfect for parties or on-the-go vibes. Now just <strong>₹4999</strong>!</p>', 1, 5, 6999, 4999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-23 12:02:55', '2025-09-23 19:36:14', '', 3500.00, 1),
(280, 'Oraimo SpaceBox 8W FM Wireless Speaker', 'oraimo-spacebox-8w-fm-wireless-speaker', 4, 79, '<p>The <strong>Oraimo SpaceBox 8W FM Wireless Speaker</strong> offers an incredible combination of powerful sound, portability, and added functionality, all at an affordable price of <strong>PKR 6200</strong>. This speaker features an <strong>8W output</strong>, ensuring clear and dynamic audio that enhances your music, podcasts, and more, whether you’re at home, in the park, or on the go.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In addition to its wireless Bluetooth capability, the Oraimo SpaceBox also includes a built-in <strong>FM radio</strong> function, allowing you to tune into your favorite stations without needing an internet connection. Enjoy live radio broadcasts while you\'re outdoors or anywhere you go, making this speaker a versatile option for entertainment.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With its compact design, the Oraimo SpaceBox is highly portable, making it the perfect companion for trips, parties, or casual listening sessions. Its long-lasting battery ensures hours of continuous music playback, and the sleek look ensures it fits seamlessly into any setting.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Whether you need a portable speaker for your next adventure or just want to enjoy high-quality sound at home, the Oraimo SpaceBox 8W FM Wireless Speaker is your go-to choice for reliable and affordable audio performance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Features:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>8W Output:</strong> Powerful sound with clear audio for an enhanced listening experience.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>FM Radio:</strong> Built-in FM function for live radio without the need for internet connectivity.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Bluetooth Connectivity:</strong> Stream music wirelessly from smartphones, tablets, and other devices.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Portable & Compact:</strong> Easy to carry and perfect for outdoor use, picnics, or travel.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Long Battery Life:</strong> Enjoy hours of uninterrupted music with a rechargeable battery.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Price:</strong> Available for just <strong>PKR 6200</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>8W Output:</strong> Powerful, clear sound for a dynamic audio experience.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>FM Radio:</strong> Built-in FM functionality to listen to live radio anytime, anywhere.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Bluetooth Connectivity:</strong> Stream music wirelessly from your devices.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Portable Design:</strong> Compact and easy to carry, perfect for outdoor activities.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Long Battery Life:</strong> Enjoy continuous music for hours without worrying about recharging.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Price:</strong> Get it now for just <strong>PKR 6200</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 10, 8200, 6200, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-25 10:52:37', '2025-09-29 18:30:44', '', NULL, 0),
(281, 'oraimo Rover 12W FM Wireless Speaker', 'oraimo-rover-12w-fm-wireless-speaker', 4, 79, '<p>The <strong>Oraimo Rover 12W FM Wireless Speaker</strong> delivers exceptional sound quality and portability, making it the ideal choice for music lovers who want to enjoy powerful audio wherever they go. With a <strong>12W output</strong>, this speaker produces clear, rich sound with deep bass, ensuring an immersive listening experience whether you\'re at home, outdoors, or on the move.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In addition to its wireless Bluetooth connectivity, the Oraimo Rover also features an integrated <strong>FM radio</strong> function, allowing you to tune into your favorite stations and enjoy live broadcasts without needing an internet connection. Whether you\'re hosting a party, relaxing at home, or working out at the gym, this versatile speaker ensures you never miss out on your favorite tunes or radio shows.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The portable design, coupled with a long-lasting battery, ensures that you can take the Oraimo Rover speaker anywhere, making it perfect for both indoor and outdoor use. The sleek, modern design fits seamlessly with any style and is easy to carry along on your travels, picnics, or outings.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>At a price of just <strong>PKR 10400</strong>, the Oraimo Rover 12W FM Wireless Speaker offers great value for a feature-packed, high-quality portable speaker that combines sound, functionality, and portability.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Features:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>12W Output:</strong> Delivers powerful, clear, and immersive sound.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>FM Radio Function:</strong> Enjoy live radio broadcasts without internet connectivity.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Bluetooth Connectivity:</strong> Stream music wirelessly from your devices.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Portable Design:</strong> Compact, lightweight, and easy to carry for on-the-go use.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Long Battery Life:</strong> Enjoy hours of uninterrupted music and radio listening.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Price:</strong> Available for just <strong>PKR 10400</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>12W Output:</strong> Clear, rich, and powerful sound for an immersive audio experience.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>FM Radio:</strong> Built-in FM function for live radio listening without the need for the internet.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Bluetooth Connectivity:</strong> Wirelessly stream music from your smartphone or other devices.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Portable Design:</strong> Compact and lightweight for easy portability.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Long Battery Life:</strong> Enjoy extended use with a long-lasting battery.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Price:</strong> Available for just <strong>PKR 10400</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 10, 13500, 10400, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-25 10:58:18', '2025-09-29 18:28:26', '', NULL, 0),
(282, 'Oraimo Toast 22.5 Byte 10000mAh 22.5W Power Bank', 'oraimo-10000mah-power-bank', 10, 79, '<p>The <strong>Oraimo Toast 22.5 Byte 10000mAh Power Bank</strong> is the perfect solution for keeping your devices powered during busy days. With a compact 10000mAh capacity, this power bank offers a balance between portability and power, ensuring you can charge your smartphones, tablets, and other gadgets multiple times when you\'re on the go.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Featuring <strong>22.5W fast charging</strong> technology, the Oraimo Toast 22.5 Byte ensures rapid charging, helping you quickly recharge your devices without waiting for long periods. Whether you\'re at work, traveling, or simply out for the day, this power bank provides the power you need when you need it.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Its sleek, compact design makes it easy to carry in your bag or pocket, providing convenience without sacrificing power. With built-in protection against overcharging, overheating, and short-circuiting, the Oraimo Toast 22.5 Byte ensures safe charging for all your devices.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>At an affordable price of <strong>PKR 3350</strong>, the Oraimo Toast 22.5 Byte Power Bank is a reliable and portable charging solution that offers exceptional value for its performance. Keep your devices powered and ready to go with this stylish and efficient power bank.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Features:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>10000mAh Capacity:</strong> Compact yet powerful, perfect for on-the-go charging.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>22.5W Fast Charging:</strong> Rapid charging for your devices with quick power delivery.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Multiple Device Charging:</strong> Charge multiple devices simultaneously with ease.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Portable Design:</strong> Lightweight and compact for easy portability.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Safety Features:</strong> Built-in protection against overcharging, overheating, and short-circuiting.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Price:</strong> Available for just <strong>PKR 3350</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>10000mAh Capacity:</strong> Ideal for charging your devices multiple times on the go.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>22.5W Fast Charging:</strong> Quickly power up your devices with fast charging support.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Multiple Device Charging:</strong> Charge two devices at the same time.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Compact & Portable:</strong> Lightweight design for easy portability.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Safety Features:</strong> Overcharge, overheating, and short-circuit protection for safe charging.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Price:</strong> Get it for just <strong>PKR 3350</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 10, 4200, 3350, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-25 11:05:15', '2025-09-29 18:26:24', '', NULL, 0),
(283, 'Oraimo Traveler 22.5 PD 20000mAh 22.5W Power Bank', 'oraimo-traveler-powerbank-20000mah', 10, 79, '<p>The <strong>Oraimo Traveler 22.5 PD 20000mAh Power Bank</strong> is your perfect travel companion, designed to keep your devices powered up during long journeys. With a massive <strong>20000mAh battery capacity</strong>, it offers enough power to charge your smartphones, tablets, and other electronic devices multiple times, ensuring you stay connected throughout the day.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Equipped with <strong>22.5W fast charging</strong> and Power Delivery (PD) technology, this power bank provides rapid charging to your devices, reducing the time you spend waiting for your phone or tablet to charge. Whether you need to power up a device quickly or keep multiple gadgets running, the Oraimo Traveler is designed for efficiency and speed.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The sleek, portable design makes it easy to carry wherever you go, while the multiple USB ports allow you to charge multiple devices simultaneously. This power bank also features built-in protection against overcharging, overheating, and short-circuiting, ensuring that your devices stay safe while charging.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With a price of just <strong>₹4800</strong>, the Oraimo Traveler 22.5 PD Power Bank offers incredible value for its high capacity and fast-charging capabilities. It\'s an essential gadget for travelers, commuters, and anyone who needs reliable power on the go.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Features:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>20000mAh Battery Capacity:</strong> Charge your devices multiple times with a high-capacity power bank.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>22.5W Fast Charging:</strong> Rapidly charge devices with fast charging and PD technology.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Multiple USB Ports:</strong> Charge several devices simultaneously with ease.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Portable Design:</strong> Compact and lightweight for convenient travel.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Safety Protection:</strong> Built-in protection against overcharging, overheating, and short circuits.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Price:</strong> Get the Oraimo Traveler Power Bank for just <strong>₹4800</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>20000mAh Capacity:</strong> Large battery for multiple device charges on the go.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>22.5W Fast Charging:</strong> Power Delivery (PD) technology for rapid device charging.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Multiple USB Ports:</strong> Charge multiple devices at once.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Portable Design:</strong> Compact and easy to carry during travel.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Safety Features:</strong> Overcharge, overheat, and short-circuit protection for safe charging.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Price:</strong> Available for just <strong>₹4800</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 6500, 4800, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-25 11:21:33', '2025-09-29 18:24:37', '', NULL, 0),
(284, 'oraimo BoomPop Lite ENC Over-Ear Wireless Headphones', 'oraimo-boom-pop-Lite-enc', 16, 79, '<p>The <strong>Oraimo BoomPop Lite ENC Over-Ear Wireless Headphones</strong> are designed for superior sound quality and an immersive listening experience. Equipped with Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC) technology, these headphones ensure clear and crisp audio, even in noisy environments, making them ideal for commuting, travel, or simply enjoying your favorite tunes without distractions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With large over-ear cups, the BoomPop Lite headphones offer excellent sound isolation, providing deep bass and clear mids and highs. Whether you\'re listening to music, watching movies, or taking calls, the sound is rich, detailed, and immersive.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>These wireless headphones feature a long-lasting battery life, allowing you to enjoy up to hours of uninterrupted audio on a single charge. The lightweight and ergonomic design ensures comfort during extended listening sessions, making them perfect for travel or daily use.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Additionally, the BoomPop Lite headphones come with easy-to-use controls, allowing you to adjust volume, skip tracks, and answer calls without reaching for your phone. The built-in microphone enhances voice clarity, making it easy to make calls and attend virtual meetings.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Priced at <strong>₹4850</strong>, the Oraimo BoomPop Lite ENC Over-Ear Wireless Headphones combine premium sound quality, comfort, and convenience, making them a perfect choice for audiophiles and casual listeners alike.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Features:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC):</strong> Reduces background noise for clear audio in noisy environments.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Immersive Sound Quality:</strong> Deep bass, clear mids, and high-quality audio.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Long Battery Life:</strong> Enjoy hours of music or calls with extended battery performance.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Comfortable Over-Ear Design:</strong> Soft ear cups and ergonomic build for long-term comfort.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Wireless Freedom:</strong> Enjoy the convenience of wireless audio with easy controls.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Price:</strong> Available for just <strong>₹4850</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>ENC Technology:</strong> Environmental Noise Cancellation for clear sound in noisy environments.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Immersive Sound:</strong> Deep bass and rich audio for an enhanced listening experience.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Long Battery Life:</strong> Extended usage for uninterrupted music and calls.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Comfortable Fit:</strong> Soft ear cups and ergonomic design for all-day comfort.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Wireless Convenience:</strong> Easy-to-use controls for hands-free listening and calls.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Price:</strong> Get them for just <strong>₹4850</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 10, 6500, 4850, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-25 11:28:39', '2025-09-29 18:21:29', '', NULL, 0),
(285, 'oraimo Bullet 48 48W Car Charger', 'oraimo-bullet-48-48w-car-charger', 17, 79, '<h1>Oraimo Bullet 48 48W Car Charger - Fast Charging On the Go</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Oraimo Bullet 48 48W Car Charger</strong> is designed to provide fast and reliable charging for your devices while you\'re on the road. With a power output of <strong>48W</strong>, it delivers quick charging to your smartphones, tablets, and other electronic devices, ensuring you’re never without power during long drives.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thanks to its compact and efficient design, the Oraimo Bullet 48 Car Charger is easy to carry and doesn’t take up much space in your car. It comes with multiple USB ports, allowing you to charge multiple devices simultaneously without compromising on charging speed. Whether you’re using it for your phone, GPS, or other devices, it provides a reliable and fast charging solution for all your needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Built with safety in mind, the charger includes over-voltage protection, over-current protection, and short-circuit protection to ensure your devices charge safely. Its durable construction guarantees a long-lasting product that can withstand regular use in your vehicle.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>At a price of <strong>PKR 1750</strong>, the Oraimo Bullet 48 is a cost-effective solution for anyone who needs quick charging while on the go. Keep your devices powered up and ready to go with this reliable car charger!</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Features:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>48W Fast Charging:</strong> Quickly charges multiple devices with high output power.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Dual USB Ports:</strong> Charge two devices simultaneously without compromising speed.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Compact Design:</strong> Small, sleek, and easy to store in your car.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Built-in Safety Features:</strong> Over-voltage, over-current, and short-circuit protection for safe charging.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Affordable Price:</strong> Get the Oraimo Bullet 48 for just <strong>PKR 1750</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', '<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>48W Fast Charging:</strong> Charge devices quickly with high power output.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Dual USB Ports:</strong> Simultaneously charge two devices with ease.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Compact & Portable:</strong> A small and sleek charger that’s easy to store.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Safety Features:</strong> Includes over-voltage, over-current, and short-circuit protection.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Price:</strong> Available for just <strong>PKR 1750</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 10, 2500, 1750, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-25 11:50:30', '2025-09-29 18:19:25', '', NULL, 0),
(286, 'oraimo SpaceBuds Neo+ ANC Spatial Audio True Wireless Earphones', 'oraimo-spacebuds-neo-anc', 13, 79, '<h1>Oraimo SpaceBuds Neo+ ANC Spatial Audio True Wireless Earphones</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Oraimo SpaceBuds Neo+ ANC</strong> earphones are designed to deliver an exceptional audio experience with Active Noise Cancellation (ANC) technology and Spatial Audio support. With cutting-edge sound technology, these earphones provide an immersive soundstage that brings music, podcasts, and calls to life like never before.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Whether you’re at the gym, commuting, or just relaxing, the <strong>ANC</strong> feature ensures that ambient noise is minimized, so you can focus entirely on your audio. The <strong>Spatial Audio</strong> technology takes your listening experience to the next level, providing a 3D-like sound environment for a richer, more detailed sound.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With a sleek, ergonomic design, the <strong>Oraimo SpaceBuds Neo+</strong> fit comfortably in your ears, ensuring a secure fit for long listening sessions. These true wireless earphones come with a compact charging case, offering quick and convenient recharges, so you’re always ready to go.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Featuring excellent battery life, intuitive touch controls, and Bluetooth connectivity, these earphones are perfect for users who demand high-quality audio and modern design. Whether for work, travel, or leisure, the <strong>Oraimo SpaceBuds Neo+</strong> earphones are the ideal choice for those seeking premium sound on the go.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>At an affordable price of <strong>₹4500</strong>, the Oraimo SpaceBuds Neo+ ANC Spatial Audio earphones combine premium audio technology with a sleek design, making them the perfect choice for audiophiles and casual listeners alike.</p>\r\n', '<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Active Noise Cancellation (ANC):</strong> Blocks out ambient noise for an immersive listening experience.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Spatial Audio:</strong> Provides a 3D sound environment for richer, more immersive audio.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>True Wireless:</strong> Enjoy the freedom of wireless listening with no tangled cords.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Ergonomic Design:</strong> Secure and comfortable fit for long listening sessions.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Battery Life:</strong> Long-lasting battery life with quick charge functionality.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Price:</strong> Available for just <strong>₹4500</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 10, 6100, 4500, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-25 11:54:45', '2025-09-29 18:17:17', '', NULL, 0),
(287, 'oraimo Watch 5 Lite 2.01\" HD IP68 Smart Watch', 'oraimo-watch-5-lite', 11, 79, '<h1>Oraimo Watch 5 Lite 2.01\" HD IP68 Smart Watch - Stylish & Functional</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Oraimo Watch 5 Lite</strong> offers the perfect combination of sleek design, high performance, and durability. With a large <strong>2.01\'\' HD display</strong>, it delivers a clear and vibrant viewing experience, making it easy to navigate and check notifications at a glance.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With an <strong>IP68 water resistance rating</strong>, this smartwatch is built to withstand water and dust, making it ideal for everyday wear and outdoor activities. Whether you\'re at the gym or caught in the rain, the Oraimo Watch 5 Lite will keep up with your lifestyle.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Equipped with essential health features such as step counting, sleep tracking, and heart rate monitoring, this watch ensures that you stay on top of your fitness goals. The Oraimo Watch 5 Lite is not just a timepiece, but a reliable companion to monitor your wellness.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Features:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>2.01\'\' HD Display:</strong> A large, crisp screen for enhanced visibility.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>IP68 Water Resistance:</strong> Protects against dust and water for worry-free use.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Health and Fitness Tracking:</strong> Includes heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and more.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Long Battery Life:</strong> Offers extended usage on a single charge.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Affordable Price:</strong> Get it all for just <strong>₹4400</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>At an affordable price of <strong>₹4400</strong>, the Oraimo Watch 5 Lite offers impressive features in a stylish package, making it the ideal choice for anyone looking for a smart, functional, and affordable wearable.</p>\r\n', '<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>2.01\'\' HD Display:</strong> Large and clear screen for easy viewing.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>IP68 Waterproof:</strong> Dustproof and water-resistant for outdoor adventures.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Health Tracking:</strong> Includes heart rate monitoring, sleep tracking, and step counting.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Long Battery Life:</strong> Enjoy extended usage without frequent charging.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Affordable Price:</strong> Get this smartwatch for just <strong>₹4400</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 10, 5400, 4400, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-26 09:26:05', '2025-09-29 18:14:01', '', 3809.00, 1),
(288, 'oraimo Watch 5R 1.43\'\' Amoled IP68 Smart Watch', 'oraimo-watch-5r-smart-watch', 11, 79, '<h1>Oraimo Watch 5R 1.43\'\' AMOLED IP68 Smart Watch - Elevate Your Fitness and Lifestyle</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>The <strong>Oraimo Watch 5R</strong> is a perfect blend of technology, style, and durability. Featuring a stunning <strong>1.43\'\' AMOLED display</strong>, this smart watch delivers vivid colors and crisp visuals, making it ideal for everyday use. Whether you\'re checking notifications or tracking your fitness progress, the vibrant display ensures clarity in all lighting conditions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With its <strong>IP68 water resistance</strong>, the Oraimo Watch 5R is designed to withstand splashes, sweat, and even short periods of immersion in water, making it your perfect companion for workouts, outdoor adventures, or daily wear without worrying about water damage.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Packed with a variety of <strong>health and fitness features</strong>, including heart rate monitoring, sleep tracking, and step counting, this smart watch empowers you to stay on top of your wellness goals. Whether you\'re tracking your fitness progress or simply looking to improve your health, the Oraimo Watch 5R has you covered.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Features:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>1.43\'\' AMOLED Display</strong>: Enjoy stunning visuals with vibrant, sharp colors.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>IP68 Waterproof Rating</strong>: Protects against water and dust, ideal for outdoor and fitness enthusiasts.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Health and Fitness Tracking</strong>: Includes heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, pedometer, and more.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Long Battery Life</strong>: Enjoy hours of uninterrupted use with a long-lasting battery.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Stylish and Durable Design</strong>: Crafted to provide a sleek, modern look, perfect for any occasion.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>At an affordable price of <strong>₹8700</strong>, the Oraimo Watch 5R is an excellent choice for anyone seeking a feature-rich, durable, and stylish smart watch to elevate their lifestyle. Whether you\'re an athlete or just someone looking to stay connected, the Oraimo Watch 5R is your all-in-one solution.</p>', '<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>1.43\'\' AMOLED Display:</strong> Vivid and sharp visuals for a stunning experience.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>IP68 Waterproof Rating:</strong> Splash, sweat, and dust resistant for daily use.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Health & Fitness Tracking:</strong> Includes heart rate monitoring, sleep tracking, and step counter.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Long Battery Life:</strong> Stay powered up for longer usage.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Stylish Design:</strong> A sleek, modern look for any occasion.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Price:</strong> ₹8700 – Affordable, feature-rich, and durable.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 1, 10, 10500, 8700, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2025-09-26 14:29:39', '2025-09-29 18:10:39', '', NULL, 0),
