(291, 'Magna Power Bank L-712 | 10000mAh PD 22.5W | Gold & DarkBlue Color', 'L-712-magna-power-bank-10000mah', 10, 48, ' L-712 Magna Power Bank is a compact and powerful portable charger designed for fast and reliable charging. It features a 10000mAh battery capacity with PD fast charging up to 22.5W and 15W magnetic wireless charging support. The power bank includes Type-C and Lightning input options and multiple output modes, making it ideal for smartphones and other compatible devices. Its slim design and strong magnetic hold make it perfect for daily use, travel, and office needs.', '10000mAh | PD 22.5W Fast Charging | Magnetic Wireless 15W | Available in Gold and DarkBlue Color', 1, 200, 7499, 5499, 'MAG-L712-10K', 0.23, 13.50, 7.00, 1.50, NULL, '2026-01-27 09:11:51', '2026-03-10 17:00:40', 'L-712 Magna Power Bank, 10000mAh Power Bank, PD 22.5W, Wireless Charging, Fast Charging Power Bank, Portable Charger, Magnetic Power Bank', NULL, 0),
(292, 'Power Bank Nomad  L-706 | 15000mAh | 45W Fast Charging | Metal Blue| Login', 'L-706-Nomad-Power-Bank-15000mAh-Metal Blue', 10, 48, 'The L-706 Nomad Power Bank is a high-performance portable charger designed for fast and efficient charging. It features a 15000mAh high-capacity battery with 45W fast charging support, making it suitable for smartphones, tablets, and other USB-powered devices. With advanced safety protection and a durable, compact design, this power bank is ideal for daily use, travel, and office needs. The L-706 Nomad Power Bank delivers reliable power whenever you need it.', '15000mAh | 45W Fast Charging | PD Power Bank | Portable Charger \r\n', 1, 2000, 11999, 8099, 'LOGIN-L706-15K', 0.32, 16.00, 8.00, 2.00, NULL, '2026-01-28 08:03:33', '2026-03-10 16:59:57', 'L-706 Nomad Power Bank, 15000mAh Power Bank, 45W Fast Charging Power Bank, Login Nomad Power Bank, PD Power Bank Pakistan, Portable Charger', NULL, 0),
(293, ' Oblivor Power Bank L-707 | 20000mAh 65W Fast Charging | Black', 'L-707-oblivor-power-bank-20000mah-65W', 10, 48, 'The L-707 Oblivor Power Bank is a high-performance portable charger designed for users who need powerful and fast charging on the go. It features a 20000mAh high-capacity battery with 65W fast charging support, making it suitable for smartphones, tablets, and other compatible devices. With advanced safety protection and a durable build, this power bank ensures safe and reliable charging. Its sleek black design makes it ideal for daily use, travel, and professional needs.', '20000mAh | 65W Fast Charging | PD Power Bank | Black Color\r\n', 1, 1000, 10999, 7499, 'LOGIN-L707-20K-65W-BLK', 0.45, 15.00, 7.50, 3.00, NULL, '2026-01-28 08:31:20', '2026-03-10 16:58:53', 'L-707 Oblivor Power Bank, 20000mAh Power Bank, 65W Fast Charging Power Bank, Oblivor Power Bank, Login Power Bank, Black Power Bank', NULL, 0),
(294, 'Login L-299 Wireless Headphone Hybrid ANC Noise Isolating Mic | Black Color', 'L-299-wireless-headphone-hybrid-ANC', 16, 48, 'The L-299 Wireless Headphone delivers premium sound quality with Hybrid Active Noise Cancellation (ANC) and a noise-isolating microphone for clear calls. Featuring Bluetooth 5.0 connectivity, long battery life, and ergonomic design, these headphones ensure comfort for extended listening sessions. Ideal for music lovers, gamers, and professionals, the L-299 Wireless Headphone combines superior audio performance with modern style.', 'Hybrid ANC | Noise Isolating Mic | Wireless Bluetooth Headphones | Long Battery Life | Black Color\r\n', 1, 200, 11999, 7499, 'LOGIN-L299-WH', 0.25, 18.00, 7.50, 19.00, NULL, '2026-01-28 09:17:40', '2026-03-02 10:49:47', 'L-299 Wireless Headphone, Hybrid ANC Headphones, Noise Isolating Mic, Bluetooth Headphones, Login Headphones, Long Battery Life Headphones', NULL, 0),
(295, ' Smart Watch  Rover  L-106 |  Ultra Retina Display 1000nit | Black & Orange Color | Login', 'L-106-Rover-smart-watch-1000nit', 11, 48, ' L-106 Rover Smart Watch features an Ultra Retina Display with 1000nit brightness, delivering crystal-clear visuals even in bright sunlight. Equipped with health and fitness tracking, heart rate monitoring, sleep tracking, and smart notifications, this smartwatch combines functionality with style. Its sleek design, durable build, and customizable watch faces make it perfect for daily wear, workouts, and professional use. Compatible with both Android and iOS devices, the L-106 Rover Smart Watch is a reliable companion for a smart lifestyle.', 'Ultra Retina Display | 1000nit | Fitness Tracking | Smart Notifications | Black & Orange\r\n', 1, 203, 11999, 7699, 'LOGIN-L106-SW', 0.05, 4.50, 4.50, 1.20, NULL, '2026-01-28 09:41:58', '2026-03-10 16:57:56', 'L-106 Rover Smart Watch, Ultra Retina Smart Watch, 1000nit Display Watch, Fitness Smart Watch, Login Smart Watch, Android iOS Smart Watch', NULL, 0),
(296, 'Enigma Diva Smart Watch L-110 Premium Design AOD | Beige & Gold | Login', 'L-110-enigma-diva-smart-watch-AOD', 11, 48, 'The L-110 Enigma Diva Smart Watch combines premium design with advanced features,including Always-On Display (AOD) for effortless viewing .It Offers fitness tracking ,heart rate monitoring ,sleep tracking and smart notification for calls and apps.With a sleek and stylish design ,long battery life,and compatiblity with both andriod and IOS devices, this smartwatch is perfect for daily wear,workouts,and professional use.Its elegant look makes it ideal for those who want both style and functionality.', 'Premium Design | Always-On Display (AOD) | Fitness & Health Tracking | Smart Notifications | Beige & Gold Color\r\n', 1, 100, 13999, 9849, 'LOGIN-L110-SW', 0.05, 4.50, 4.50, 1.20, NULL, '2026-01-28 10:12:17', '2026-03-10 16:56:39', 'L-110 Enigma Diva Smart Watch, Premium Design Smart Watch, AOD Smart Watch, Fitness & Health Smart Watch, Login Smart Watch, Android iOS Smart Watch', NULL, 0),
(297, ' Fast Charger L-414 | 45W  (PD to PD & PD to iOS) | Login', 'L-414-45W-PD-Fast-Charger', 14, 48, 'The L-414 45W PD Fast Charger is engineered for powerful and efficient charging performance. Featuring advanced Power Delivery (PD) technology, it provides up to 45W output for fast and reliable charging of smartphones, tablets, and other compatible devices.Designed to support PD to PD and PD to iOS connectivity, this charger is suitable for modern Android and Apple devices. Its intelligent power management system ensures stable voltage output while protecting your device from overcharging, overheating, and short circuits.Compact and durable, the L-414 charger is ideal for home, office, and travel use — delivering performance, safety, and convenience in one powerful adapter.', 'The L-414 45W PD Fast Charger delivers powerful and efficient charging with PD to PD and PD to iOS support. Designed for fast, stable, and safe performance, it is compatible with modern Android and iPhone devices.', 1, 500, 3899, 2899, 'L414-45W-pd', 0.15, 8.00, 4.00, 3.00, NULL, '2026-01-30 08:16:51', '2026-03-10 17:02:15', '', NULL, 0);
