(298, ' Glory Smart Watch L-115 (Built-in GPS | AOD Display) | Login', 'l-115-glory-smart-watch-gps-aod', 11, 48, 'The L-115 Glory Smart Watch is designed for users who demand style, performance, and smart functionality in one device. Equipped with Built-in GPS, it allows accurate tracking of outdoor activities without needing your phone.Featuring an advanced Always-On Display (AOD), the watch ensures clear visibility of time and notifications at all times. Its sleek design makes it perfect for daily wear, while smart health and fitness tracking features help you stay active and informed.With reliable connectivity, real-time activity monitoring, and a modern interface, the L-115 Glory Smart Watch is an ideal choice for fitness enthusiasts and everyday users alike.', 'The L-115 Glory Smart Watch features built-in GPS and an Always-On Display (AOD) for real-time tracking and premium visibility. Designed for fitness, connectivity, and everyday performance and  available in black color (chain+Belt).', 0, 50, 16999, 14299, 'L115-GLORY-GPS-AOD', 0.06, 4.50, 3.80, 1.10, NULL, '2026-01-30 09:26:31', '2026-03-10 16:54:56', 'Smart Watch, GPS Watch, AOD Display, Fitness Tracker, L-115, Glory Smart Watch, Wearable, Pakistan', NULL, 0),
(299, ' Gaming Earbuds L-220 (Low Latency | ANC + ENC) | Login', 'l-220-gaming-earbuds-low-latency-anc-enc', 13, 48, 'The L-220 Gaming Earbuds are built for gamers who demand fast, responsive, and high-quality audio. Featuring Low Latency technology, they ensure every sound reaches you instantly, giving you a competitive edge.Equipped with Active Noise Cancellation (ANC) and Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC), these earbuds block unwanted noise while keeping your voice clear during calls or multiplayer gaming sessions.Compact and ergonomic, the L-220 earbuds provide comfortable long-term wear and superior sound performance. Perfect for gaming, music, and calls, these earbuds combine style, technology, and convenience in one package.', 'The L-220 Gaming Earbuds provide ultra-low latency, advanced ANC + ENC noise cancellation, and powerful audio for immersive gaming and music experiences. Designed for gamers and music lovers.', 1, 200, 7999, 3999, 'L220-GAMING-EARBUDS', 0.04, 6.00, 2.00, 2.50, NULL, '2026-01-30 10:41:06', '2026-03-10 17:03:08', 'Gaming Earbuds, Low Latency, ANC, ENC, L-220, True Wireless, Earbuds Pakistan, High Quality Audio', NULL, 0),
(300, ' Neckband (ENC) L-261 | 20 Hrs Playback)', 'l-261-neckband-enc-20hrs-playback', 4, 48, 'The L-261 Neckband is designed for users who want long-lasting audio performance and crystal-clear calls. Equipped with ENC technology, it blocks ambient noise to give you uninterrupted music and call clarity.\r\nWith 20 hours of battery playback, this neckband is ideal for travel, work, or daily workouts. Its ergonomic design ensures comfort during extended use, while high-quality sound delivers deep bass and crisp treble.Whether you are listening to music, taking calls, or watching videos, the L-261 Neckband combines style, comfort, and technology for an unmatched audio experience.', 'The L-261 Neckband features Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC) and 20 hours of playback. Perfect for music lovers and call clarity, combining comfort, style, and long-lasting performance.', 1, 200, 7999, 3199, 'L261-NECKBAND-ENC', 0.05, 17.00, 1.50, 1.20, NULL, '2026-01-30 10:45:54', '2026-03-09 11:47:38', 'Neckband, ENC, 20 Hrs Playback, L-261, Wireless Earphones, Long Battery Earphones, Earphones Pakistan', NULL, 0),
(301, ' Earbuds (ANC & ENC) L-214  | 18 Hrs Standby)', 'l-214-earbuds-anc-enc-18hrs-standby', 13, 48, 'The L-214 Earbuds deliver premium audio quality with ANC and ENC technology, blocking unwanted noise while keeping your voice clear. With 18 hours of standby time, these earbuds are perfect for daily use, travel, or workouts.Designed for comfort and durability, the L-214 earbuds provide crisp sound, deep bass, and seamless wireless connectivity. Stay connected, enjoy immersive music, and experience uninterrupted calls with these high-performance earbuds.', 'The L-214 Earbuds feature Active & Environmental Noise Cancellation (ANC & ENC) with 18 hours standby. Perfect for music, calls, and gaming with comfortable long-term wear.', 1, 200, 11199, 4149, 'PD-L214-TWS', 0.04, 6.00, 2.00, 2.50, NULL, '2026-01-30 10:50:08', '2026-03-09 11:47:02', 'L-214 L-214 earbuds wireless earbuds ENC earbuds Bluetooth earbuds budget earbuds earbuds Pakistan phonesdukan', NULL, 0),
(302, 'Charger GAN  L-415 | Laptop Support 65w | PD to PD', 'L-415-65watt-fast-charge', 14, 48, 'The L-415 65W GaN Fast Charger is designed for powerful and efficient charging of laptops, smartphones, and other USB-C devices. Built with advanced GaN technology, it delivers high-speed charging in a compact and durable design.\r\nThis charger features dual PD ports and one USB port, allowing you to charge multiple devices simultaneously without compromising performance. The PC housing ensures durability, while the flat pin design makes it travel-friendly. A PD to PD cable is included for added convenience.\r\nIdeal for laptops, tablets, and fast-charging smartphones, the L-415 charger is a reliable and modern charging solution for home, office, and travel use.', 'GAN | Laptop Support 65W | PD to PD\r\n\r\n• 65W Fast Charging Output\r\n• Advanced GaN Technology\r\n• Laptop Charging Support\r\n• 2 Power Delivery (PD) Ports\r\n• 1 USB Output Port\r\n• Durable PC Housing\r\n• Flat Pin Design\r\n• PD to PD Cable Included', 1, 100, 6899, 3999, 'L-415-65W-GAN', 0.25, 9.00, 5.00, 3.00, NULL, '2026-01-31 13:37:21', '2026-03-09 11:45:53', '65W Charger, GaN Charger, Laptop Charger, PD Charger, Fast Charger, Dual PD Charger, USB C Charger, L-415 Charger', NULL, 0),
(303, 'Fast Charger L-411 20W GaN  | PD to PD & PD to iOS', 'L-411-Charger', 14, 48, 'L-411 20W GaN Fast Charger is designed to deliver fast, stable, and efficient charging for your smartphones and gadgets. Powered by advanced GaN (Gallium Nitride) technology, it offers higher efficiency, less heat, and a compact size compared to traditional chargers.\r\nThis charger supports Power Delivery (PD) fast charging, making it ideal for PD to PD and PD to iOS devices. Whether you’re charging an iPhone, Android phone, tablet, or other USB-C devices, the L-411 ensures quick and reliable performance.\r\nIts lightweight and travel-friendly design makes it perfect for home, office, or on-the-go use. Built-in safety features protect your device from over-charging, over-heating, and short circuits, ensuring long-term durability and peace of mind.', 'L-411 20W GaN fast charger with Power Delivery support. Compatible with PD to PD and PD to iOS fast charging for iPhone and Android devices. Compact, safe, and efficient.', 1, 300, 2999, 1799, 'L-411-GAN-20W', 0.08, 4.50, 3.00, 2.50, NULL, '2026-02-10 09:39:05', '2026-03-09 11:38:20', 'L-411 Charger, 20W Fast Charger, GaN Charger, PD Charger, PD to PD, PD to iOS, iPhone Fast Charger, USB-C Charger, Android Fast Charger, Fast Charging Adapter, Login Charger, Pakistan Fast Charger', NULL, 0),
(304, 'Ravok Portable Wireless Speaker  L-273 | RGB Glow Beats | Mobile Built-in Holder', 'L-273-Ravok-Portable-Wireless-Speaker', 4, 48, '10W Powerful Sound – Loud, clear & chaos-ready audio.\r\nRGB Glow Beats – Dynamic lights that pulse with your music.\r\nAll-in-One Connectivity – Bluetooth, USB, FM, AUX & Micro SD support.\r\nPlayback Time – Up to 6 hours (2000mAh battery).\r\nStand by time – Upto 42 hours.\r\nFast Recharge – Fully charged in just 2–3 hours.\r\nPortable Carry Design – Lightweight build with a strong handle.\r\nMobile Built-in Holder – Convenient slot to place your phone while streaming or watching videos.\r\nChaos Certified Fun – Perfect for home, parties, gaming & outdoor vibes.', '10W Powerful Sound – Loud, clear & chaos-ready audio.\r\nRGB Glow Beats – Dynamic lights that pulse with your music.\r\nAll-in-One Connectivity – Bluetooth, USB, FM, AUX & Micro SD support.\r\nPlayback Time – Up to 6 hours (2000mAh battery).\r\nStand by time – Upto 42 hours.\r\nFast Recharge – Fully charged in just 2–3 hours.\r\nPortable Carry Design – Lightweight build with a strong handle.\r\nMobile Built-in Holder – Convenient slot to place your phone while streaming or watching videos.\r\nChaos Certified Fun – Perfect for home, parties, gaming & outdoor vibes.', 1, 50, 6499, 2999, NULL, 0.40, 18.00, 8.00, 8.00, NULL, '2026-02-13 13:54:53', '2026-03-09 11:37:21', '', NULL, 0),
(305, 'Wireless Soundbar  L-271 | RGB Lights | 16W ', 'L-271 - Wireless-Soundbar', 4, 48, '16W high-quality sound output\r\nUp to 4 hours of continuous music playback\r\n180 hours of standby time\r\nFully charges in just 1.5 hours\r\n2200mAh built-in battery\r\nWireless range up to 10 meters\r\nBluetooth Version 5.3 + EDR for stable connectivity\r\nSupports MMC card, USB, and AUX input', '16W high-quality sound output\r\nUp to 4 hours of continuous music playback\r\n180 hours of standby time\r\nFully charges in just 1.5 hours\r\n2200mAh built-in battery\r\nWireless range up to 10 meters\r\nBluetooth Version 5.3 + EDR for stable connectivity\r\nSupports MMC card, USB, and AUX input', 1, 50, 8999, 4699, NULL, 0.75, 40.00, 7.00, 7.00, NULL, '2026-02-13 14:27:08', '2026-03-09 11:35:45', '', NULL, 0),
(306, '  Earbuds AiCore L-205 | ANC & ENC', 'L-205-AiCore-Earbuds', 4, 48, 'AiCore Technology – Real-time AI voice translation & smart interaction\r\nBluetooth 5.3 – Stable and fast wireless connection\r\nTouch Operation – Simple controls at your fingertips\r\nANC & ENC – Active and environmental noise cancellation for clear calls\r\nSweat-Proof Design – Ideal for workouts and daily use\r\nLong-Lasting Battery – Up to 4.5 hours playtime per charge\r\nFast Charging – Earbuds: 1 hr | Case: 1 hr\r\nComfortable Fit – Lightweight and ergonomic for all-day wear\r\n10m Wireless Range – Reliable performance within range\r\nSound Equalizer – Balanced and immersive sound experience', 'AiCore Technology – Real-time AI voice translation & smart interaction\r\nBluetooth 5.3 – Stable and fast wireless connection\r\nTouch Operation – Simple controls at your fingertips\r\nANC & ENC – Active and environmental noise cancellation for clear calls\r\nSweat-Proof Design – Ideal for workouts and daily use\r\nLong-Lasting Battery – Up to 4.5 hours playtime per charge\r\nFast Charging – Earbuds: 1 hr | Case: 1 hr\r\nComfortable Fit – Lightweight and ergonomic for all-day wear\r\n10m Wireless Range – Reliable performance within range\r\nSound Equalizer – Balanced and immersive sound experience', 1, 50, 7999, 4499, NULL, 0.00, 6.00, 5.00, 3.00, NULL, '2026-02-13 15:19:08', '2026-03-09 11:33:48', '', NULL, 0),
(307, ' Voltra Pro Power Bank  L-708 | 20,000mAh | 22.5W Fast Charging ', 'L-708-Voltra-Pro-Power-Bank', 10, 48, 'Introducing the VOLTRA PRO L-708 Power Bank, engineered for powerful everyday charging. With a high-capacity 20,000mAh high-density Li-Polymer battery and 22.5W fast charging, it delivers reliable energy for smartphones, tablets, earbuds, and all USB-powered devices. The sleek matte body with a premium textured grip offers a modern, durable feel, while built-in cables, multiple ports, and smart overheat protection ensure safe, efficient, and convenient charging in a compact, pocket-friendly design.', 'Introducing the VOLTRA PRO L-708 Power Bank, engineered for powerful everyday charging. With a high-capacity 20,000mAh high-density Li-Polymer battery and 22.5W fast charging, it delivers reliable energy for smartphones, tablets, earbuds, and all USB-powered devices. The sleek matte body with a premium textured grip offers a modern, durable feel, while built-in cables, multiple ports, and smart overheat protection ensure safe, efficient, and convenient charging in a compact, pocket-friendly design.', 1, 20, 10999, 5499, NULL, 0.45, 15.00, 7.00, 3.00, NULL, '2026-02-13 15:36:26', '2026-03-09 11:29:34', '', NULL, 0),
(308, ' Gaming Headphone | L-285 RGB Multi Colors Light', 'L-285-Gaming-Headphone', 16, 48, 'RGB lighting for a stylish gaming vibe\r\nBuilt-in mic for clear voice chats\r\n1.8-meter wire for easy movement\r\nAUX cable included for more connection options\r\nLow latency for smooth, real-time sound\r\nComfortable design for long gaming sessions\r\nDeep bass and clear sound for better gameplay', 'RGB lighting for a stylish gaming vibe\r\nBuilt-in mic for clear voice chats\r\n1.8-meter wire for easy movement\r\nAUX cable included for more connection options\r\nLow latency for smooth, real-time sound\r\nComfortable design for long gaming sessions\r\nDeep bass and clear sound for better gameplay', 1, 20, 11999, 4899, NULL, 0.35, 18.00, 9.00, 20.00, NULL, '2026-02-13 15:56:07', '2026-03-09 11:32:31', '', NULL, 0),
(309, 'Login L-210 Earbuds ANC | upto 5 hrs Playback', 'Login-L-210-Earbuds', 13, 48, 'L-210 ANC+ENC Earbuds combine a premium matte finish with a comfortable ergonomic fit for everyday use. Powered by Bluetooth 5.3 and 13mm dynamic drivers, they deliver deep bass and clear sound with Active Noise Cancellation to block out all the sound distractions and ENC keep you away from the environmental noise.\r\nEnjoy up to 5 hours of playback, extended by a 300mAh IC protected charging case, with a stable 10 meter range and fast recharge in about 1.5 hours. Compatible with Android, iOS, and all Bluetooth enabled devices.', 'L-210 ANC+ENC Earbuds combine a premium matte finish with a comfortable ergonomic fit for everyday use. Powered by Bluetooth 5.3 and 13mm dynamic drivers, they deliver deep bass and clear sound with Active Noise Cancellation to block out all the sound distractions and ENC keep you away from the environmental noise.\r\nEnjoy up to 5 hours of playback, extended by a 300mAh IC protected charging case, with a stable 10 meter range and fast recharge in about 1.5 hours. Compatible with Android, iOS, and all Bluetooth enabled devices.', 1, 50, 5899, 3899, NULL, 0.08, 6.00, 5.00, 3.00, NULL, '2026-03-17 13:33:25', '2026-03-30 08:28:43', '', NULL, 0),
(310, 'Login L-274 Vybeon Wireless Speaker Carrying Strap | 6hrs playback', 'Login L-274-Vybeon-Wireless-Speaker', 4, 48, 'Experience powerful sound with deep bass and crystal-clear audio, engineered for both indoor and outdoor listening. The VYBEON Bluetooth Speaker delivers immersive surround sound while maintaining a rugged yet stylish design for everyday use.\r\n\r\nBuilt with durable materials and a portable strap, it’s ideal for travel, parties, and outdoor adventures. Featuring multi-mode connectivity including Bluetooth, USB, AUX, and TF card support, it keeps your music playing wherever you go.\r\n\r\nPowered by a long-lasting rechargeable battery and enhanced with dynamic LED lighting, the VYBEON speaker combines performance, portability, and style—so you can truly own the vibe, always', 'Experience powerful sound with deep bass and crystal-clear audio, engineered for both indoor and outdoor listening. The VYBEON Bluetooth Speaker delivers immersive surround sound while maintaining a rugged yet stylish design for everyday use.\r\n\r\nBuilt with durable materials and a portable strap, it’s ideal for travel, parties, and outdoor adventures. Featuring multi-mode connectivity including Bluetooth, USB, AUX, and TF card support, it keeps your music playing wherever you go.\r\n\r\nPowered by a long-lasting rechargeable battery and enhanced with dynamic LED lighting, the VYBEON speaker combines performance, portability, and style—so you can truly own the vibe, always', 1, 30, 19999, 16999, NULL, 0.35, 12.00, 8.00, 8.00, NULL, '2026-03-17 13:39:01', '2026-03-30 08:33:11', '', NULL, 0);
